window.PARTY_SENTIMENT={"properties":[{"pin":"20003 09019","address":"212 W BAY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1290597812377507154","title":"Amazing Loft with Parking and Deck above River St","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1290597812377507154","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00652"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1290597812377507154","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b9d19a01fdcec6070f32f33f17b9c0b73f00fc4deff50f0bd0d60f0a5c967226","chunks":8,"words":637,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.002432044129818678,"party_welcome":0.879906415939331,"social_amenities":0.9710419178009033,"party_restriction":0.9955809712409973,"nearby_nightlife":0.9285169243812561,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The exposed brick that greets you on the staircase continues throughout the main level. The overhead beams, charred in an early 1900s fire and never replaced, give the space a warmth and character that no renovation could manufacture. This is Savannah's past made livable \u2014 and remarkably comfortable. A private parking space directly in front of the home awaits on arrival \u2014 a genuine rarity for a downtown Savannah property this close to the river. Step inside off the street, head up the stairs, and let the views take it from there.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.754172449698672e-05,"social_amenities":0.002432044129818678,"party_restriction":0.00025719054974615574,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008708290988579392}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000217909793718718,"social_amenities":0.0018340887036174536,"party_restriction":0.0004399821918923408,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005850060842931271}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Built in the 1800s, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city. The space There are lofts, and then there is Savannah Riverview. Built in the 1800s as part of a cotton warehouse along the Savannah River, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived a major fire, a turn as a vocational school, and more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.879906415939331,"social_amenities":0.9710419178009033,"party_restriction":0.9467293620109558,"nearby_nightlife":0.01321116741746664}},{"text":"After a long day of exploring Savannah, the jetted tub earns its place at the center of the evening plan. The second bedroom is cozier in scale, with a queen bed, bold original artwork, and a large closet. A second full bath with tub/shower combination and generous counter space is located just adjacent \u2014 ideal for getting ready for a night on the town. When the view calls \u2014 and it will \u2014 head up the extra-wide staircase to the rooftop deck.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008234603446908295,"social_amenities":0.030990416184067726,"party_restriction":0.00039431301411241293,"nearby_nightlife":0.8566238284111023}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Built in the 1800s, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city. The space There are lofts, and then there is Savannah Riverview. Built in the 1800s as part of a cotton warehouse along the Savannah River, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived a major fire, a turn as a vocational school, and more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.879906415939331,"social_amenities":0.9710419178009033,"party_restriction":0.9467293620109558,"nearby_nightlife":0.01321116741746664}},{"text":"After a long day of exploring Savannah, the jetted tub earns its place at the center of the evening plan. The second bedroom is cozier in scale, with a queen bed, bold original artwork, and a large closet. A second full bath with tub/shower combination and generous counter space is located just adjacent \u2014 ideal for getting ready for a night on the town. When the view calls \u2014 and it will \u2014 head up the extra-wide staircase to the rooftop deck.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008234603446908295,"social_amenities":0.030990416184067726,"party_restriction":0.00039431301411241293,"nearby_nightlife":0.8566238284111023}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Sweeping panoramic views of the Savannah River stretch in every direction: First Friday fireworks, 4th of July Celebrations, New Year's festivities on River Street, or a quiet sunset over the water with a glass of wine. There is no better seat in Savannah for any of it. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa Please note, we are unable to host bachelorette/bachelor parties or traveling singles in this home. SVR- 00652 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003297840594314039,"social_amenities":0.0011220114538446069,"party_restriction":0.9955809712409973,"nearby_nightlife":0.9285169243812561}},{"text":"Built in the 1800s, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city. The space There are lofts, and then there is Savannah Riverview. Built in the 1800s as part of a cotton warehouse along the Savannah River, this one-of-a-kind historic loft has survived a major fire, a turn as a vocational school, and more than a century of Savannah history \u2014 all to arrive at its current state as one of the most distinctive luxury short-term rentals in the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.879906415939331,"social_amenities":0.9710419178009033,"party_restriction":0.9467293620109558,"nearby_nightlife":0.01321116741746664}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Sweeping panoramic views of the Savannah River stretch in every direction: First Friday fireworks, 4th of July Celebrations, New Year's festivities on River Street, or a quiet sunset over the water with a glass of wine. There is no better seat in Savannah f