mplete":false},{"pin":"20003 09028","address":"208 W BAY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"50086109","title":"Roof Top Deck With Views of the Savannah River!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50086109","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-01355"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"50086109","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"993915b9785dac03efe4906be33b724abca5d52441d695fc69729f8b7b151cba","chunks":14,"words":1304,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.7801691889762878,"party_welcome":0.9168081879615784,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973996877670288,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":149,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Washer Washer","section":"AMENITIES","line":225,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021550164092332125,"social_amenities":0.03347433730959892,"party_restriction":0.0008699872996658087,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008710743277333677}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"These include the Olympia Caf\u00e9, The Shrimp Factory and Vic\u2019s on the River. They all serve local fare, including fresh seafood. Stop for a nightcap and a view of the city lights at the Topdeck or Rocks on the Roof. Rousakis Plaza, a riverfront venue, features frequent festivals and events, including: Film Festival in March Spring Fling in April Celebrate Women in May Juneteenth on the River Cool-down Summer Music Fest in August Gullah Geechee Weekend in October If your visit coincides with a fun event, be sure to join in to get a true taste of what makes Savannah wonderful.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9168081879615784,"social_amenities":0.005343595519661903,"party_restriction":0.0008466322324238718,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973996877670288}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":149,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":149,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"The grilled windows and glass balcony door frame priceless views of the Savannah River and the brick-paved River Walk below. Just outside, your own private balcony provides a bird\u2019s-eye view of the bustling harbor, the wide, languid river and the kaleidoscope of passersby. You\u2019ll love stepping out into the open air each morning to relax over coffee or enjoy refreshing cocktails as the evening begins. At mealtimes, enjoy the spacious breakfast bar with stools for six, which delineates the gourmet kitchen.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038006893009878695,"social_amenities":0.7533336877822876,"party_restriction":0.0003001226868946105,"nearby_nightlife":0.9165340065956116}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":149,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":165,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035994197241961956,"social_amenities":0.0030924868769943714,"party_restriction":0.002984837628901005,"nearby_nightlife":0.005380669143050909}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"These include the Olympia Caf\u00e9, The Shrimp Factory and Vic\u2019s on the River. They all serve local fare, including fresh seafood. Stop for a nightcap and a view of the city lights at the Topdeck or Rocks on the Roof. Rousakis Plaza, a riverfront venue, features frequent festivals and events, including: Film Festival in March Spring Fling in April Celebrate Women in May Juneteenth on the River Cool-down Summer Music Fest in August Gullah Geechee Weekend in October If your visit coincides with a fun event, be sure to join in to get a true taste of what makes Savannah wonderful.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9168081879615784,"social_amenities":0.005343595519661903,"party_restriction":0.0008466322324238718,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973996877670288}},{"text":"Other amenities you\u2019ll enjoy at Riverview Penthouse include ceiling fans throughout, central heating and air conditioning, and those little essentials, such as an ironing board, that cater to your every need. A Tour of the Savannah Riverfront Riverview Penthouse is ideally located for exploring the city\u2019s history, arts and eclectic cuisine. With several monuments and greenspaces to visit, you\u2019ll be well supplied with photo ops as you stroll along the River Walk. The area also offers more than 75 galleries, shops, studios, restaurants and friendly pubs, so you can divide your days between shopping, dining and sunning poolside with other guests of ours.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014358507469296455,"social_amenities":0.012176983058452606,"party_restriction":0.0011923579731956124,"nearby_nightlife":0.9890894293785095}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 10013","address":"42 E BAY ST #5","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":0,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1376756361241599882","title":"Luxurious Loft Overlooking River w/ Rooftop Deck","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1376756361241599882","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03115"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1376756361241599882","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"ef478706547aaba315482f140be162c2397d0671254bcd216813d73f13836d68","chunks":8,"words":769,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.021817488595843315,"party_welcome":0.005043698474764824,"social_amenities":0.6845887303352356,"party_restriction":0.005264461971819401,"nearby_nightlife":0.9818994998931885,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What Makes High Cotton Unique? - Unrivaled Historic Elegance & Modern Comfort: Housed in a pre-Civil War building constructed with authentic Savannah gray bricks, High Cotton sits alongside the famed Factors\u2019 Walk\u2014once the heart of the city\u2019s cotton trade. With its rich history and carefully preserved architecture, this loft offers an unforgettable glimpse into Savannah\u2019s storied past while providing every modern luxury. - Bright & Airy Open Floor Plan: From the moment you ascend the stairs, you\u2019ll step into an architectural masterpiece designed for entertaining. This sun-drenched loft features a chef\u2019s kitchen with high-end appliances, custom cabinetry, and a formal dining area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005043698474764824,"social_amenities":0.021817488595843315,"party_restriction":0.0006578132160939276,"nearby_nightlife":0.10834337770938873}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment TV with standard cable Bluetooth sound system Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle","section":"AMENITIES","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018367121811024845,"social_amenities":0.00832252949476242,"party_restriction":0.0002035346406046301,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005165482289157808}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"What Makes High Cotton Unique? - Unrivaled Historic Elegance & Modern Comfort: Housed in a pre-Civil War building constructed with authentic Savannah gray bricks, High Cotton sits alongside the famed Factors\u2019 Walk\u2014once the heart of the city\u2019s cotton trade. With its rich history and carefully preserved architecture, this loft offers an unforgettable glimpse into Savannah\u2019s storied past while providing every modern luxury. - Bright & Airy Open Floor Plan: From the moment you ascend the stairs, you\u2019ll step into an architectural masterpiece designed for entertaining. This sun-drenched loft features a chef\u2019s kitchen with high-end appliances, custom cabinetry, and a formal dining area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005043698474764824,"social_amenities":0.021817488595843315,"party_restriction":0.0006578132160939276,"nearby_nightlife":0.10834337770938873}},{"text":"- The Savannah Historic District\u2019s charming cobblestone streets and squares - Ghost tours, carriage rides, and historic house museums Whether you\u2019re visiting for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, or a girls\u2019 weekend, High Cotton offers an unforgettable stay in the heart of Savannah\u2019s history. Experience Southern charm, timeless history, and unmatched luxury at High Cotton! *Please note: This home is a second-story walk-up, requiring guests to use a staircase to reach the main level. Additionally, the second bedroom and rooftop deck are accessible only via a spiral staircase.* Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008194088586606085,"social_amenities":0.004016808234155178,"party_restriction":0.0008885606657713652,"nearby_nightlife":0.10279974341392517}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. The space Welcome to High Cotton, a one-of-a-kind luxury loft in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. Park your car and explore Savannah on foot\u2014you\u2019re just steps away from world-class dining, shopping, and historic landmarks!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004999311058782041,"social_amenities":0.6845887303352356,"party_restriction":0.005264461971819401,"nearby_nightlife":0.8052868843078613}},{"text":"The spacious gathering room is perfect for unwinding after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s historic squares, museums, and waterfront attractions. - Breathtaking River Views & Private Rooftop Deck: A true rarity in Savannah, High Cotton boasts a sprawling rooftop deck, offering unobstructed sunrise and sunset views over the Savannah River. Enjoy your morning coffee while watching cargo ships glide by or sip cocktails under the stars. On the opposite side, you\u2019ll catch glimpses of Bay Street and Savannah\u2019s famous St. Patrick\u2019s Day Parade route! Luxury Accommodations for a Relaxing Stay:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030153142870403826,"social_amenities":0.031400423496961594,"party_restriction":0.0018741139210760593,"nearby_nightlife":0.756019651889801}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. The space Welcome to High Cotton, a one-of-a-kind luxury loft in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. Park your car and explore Savannah on foot\u2014you\u2019re just steps away from world-class dining, shopping, and historic landmarks!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004999311058782041,"social_amenities":0.6845887303352356,"party_restriction":0.005264461971819401,"nearby_nightlife":0.8052868843078613}},{"text":"The spacious gathering room is perfect for unwinding after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s historic squares, museums, and waterfront attractions. - Breathtaking River Views & Private Rooftop Deck: A true rarity in Savannah, High Cotton boasts a sprawling rooftop deck, offering unobstructed sunrise and sunset views over the Savannah River. Enjoy your morning coffee while watching cargo ships glide by or sip cocktails under the stars. On the opposite side, you\u2019ll catch glimpses of Bay Street and Savannah\u2019s famous St. Patrick\u2019s Day Parade route! Luxury Accommodations for a Relaxing Stay:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030153142870403826,"social_amenities":0.031400423496961594,"party_restriction":0.0018741139210760593,"nearby_nightlife":0.756019651889801}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located on the main level, the serene primary suite features a king-size bed, smart TV, generous storage, and a spa-inspired ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower and indulgent soaking tub. The lofted second bedroom is accessed via a charming spiral staircase, this cozy space offers a queen-size bed, a dedicated workspace, and another ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower\u2014perfect for remote work or a peaceful getaway. Experience Savannah Like a Local - With its unbeatable location, High Cotton places you steps away from Savannah\u2019s most beloved attractions, including: - River Street\u2019s vibrant shops, restaurants, and rooftop bars - Bay Street's picturesque Spanish moss-draped oaks","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033659179462119937,"social_amenities":0.0024805772118270397,"party_restriction":0.0011535161174833775,"nearby_nightlife":0.9818994998931885}},{"text":"This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. The space Welcome to High Cotton, a one-of-a-kind luxury loft in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This premier vacation rental offers panoramic views of River Street, a rare rooftop deck, and an abundance of natural light. Nestled in a historic 1859 building, this beautifully restored space seamlessly blends Southern charm with modern elegance. Park your car and explore Savannah on foot\u2014you\u2019re just steps away from world-class dining, shopping, and historic landmarks!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004999311058782041,"social_amenities":0.6845887303352356,"party_restriction":0.005264461971819401,"nearby_nightlife":0.8052868843078613}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 10028","address":"20 E UPPER FACTORS WALK","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1167484100056734676","title":"Riverfront Renovation in 1800s Cotton Warehouse","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1167484100056734676","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02993"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1167484100056734676","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8649b7f137aeeffd96308ff09bb4c50b55d888de41a23bb86623ab2c4126af1c","chunks":9,"words":814,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.05099411681294441,"party_welcome":0.08424153923988342,"social_amenities":0.05099411681294441,"party_restriction":0.025244468823075294,"nearby_nightlife":0.963245689868927,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience historic charm and fresh design in our downtown, riverfront condo! This beautifully designed 3BR/2BA gem features original heart pine floors, a spacious living and dining area, a fully stocked kitchen (with cute bar!), and a cozy reading nook! Enjoy amenities like fast WiFi, in-unit laundry, and TWO PARKING PASSES for a nearby garage. Perfectly located in the heart of everything, this condo offers a blend of history and contemporary comfort for an unforgettable stay. SVR-02993 The space Welcome to our stunning condo, perfectly tucked on Factor's Walk in the heart of historic downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023091192997526377,"social_amenities":0.05099411681294441,"party_restriction":0.001766950124874711,"nearby_nightlife":0.03290478512644768}},{"text":"Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel electric stove Stainless steel single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking garage on premises \u2013 2 spaces Single level home No stairs in home Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029911432648077607,"social_amenities":0.005867841187864542,"party_restriction":0.0004498707130551338,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004883689107373357}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This bright and light-filled space inside a gorgeously revitalized 1857 building, boasts sweeping views of the Savannah River through floor-to-ceiling windows, offering an incredible backdrop for your stay. The modern kitchen is fully stocked with all the conveniences and amenities you could need, including a Keurig coffee maker with complimentary K-cups, creamers, and sugar. Gather around the large dining table that seats eight comfortably, ideal for family meals or entertaining friends. Relax in the spacious living room, featuring comfortable seating and plenty of space for everyone to unwind. Enjoy your favorite shows on the flat-screen TV with streaming capabilities, and stay connected with fast WiFi throughout the condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.08424153923988342,"social_amenities":0.0015279198996722698,"party_restriction":0.00026486412389203906,"nearby_nightlife":0.028750626370310783}},{"text":"Located in the perfect spot, you'll be in the heart of everything that historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the city's rich history, enjoy its vibrant dining scene, or simply relax by the river, our condo is the ideal home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 4pm until check-out at 10am! There are no shared spaces and it is entirely private. Other things to note - The best thing about our condo, in our opinion, is the location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014231421519070864,"social_amenities":0.00429357448592782,"party_restriction":0.025244468823075294,"nearby_nightlife":0.30104488134384155}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Experience historic charm and fresh design in our downtown, riverfront condo! This beautifully designed 3BR/2BA gem features original heart pine floors, a spacious living and dining area, a fully stocked kitchen (with cute bar!), and a cozy reading nook! Enjoy amenities like fast WiFi, in-unit laundry, and TWO PARKING PASSES for a nearby garage. Perfectly located in the heart of everything, this condo offers a blend of history and contemporary comfort for an unforgettable stay. SVR-02993 The space Welcome to our stunning condo, perfectly tucked on Factor's Walk in the heart of historic downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023091192997526377,"social_amenities":0.05099411681294441,"party_restriction":0.001766950124874711,"nearby_nightlife":0.03290478512644768}},{"text":"Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel electric stove Stainless steel single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking garage on premises \u2013 2 spaces Single level home No stairs in home Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029911432648077607,"social_amenities":0.005867841187864542,"party_restriction":0.0004498707130551338,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004883689107373357}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Located in the perfect spot, you'll be in the heart of everything that historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the city's rich history, enjoy its vibrant dining scene, or simply relax by the river, our condo is the ideal home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 4pm until check-out at 10am! There are no shared spaces and it is entirely private. Other things to note - The best thing about our condo, in our opinion, is the location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014231421519070864,"social_amenities":0.00429357448592782,"party_restriction":0.025244468823075294,"nearby_nightlife":0.30104488134384155}},{"text":"We are in the heart of downtown Savannah, overlooking the river, and central to all the amazing places that folks come to the city to visit! HOWEVER, with our incredible location comes noise! Guests should expect noise from the river side tourists, adjoining and nearby businesses, and nearby traffic. Noise should be expected at all hours. If you don't feel as though you would be comfortable with urban, city noise throughout your stay, we do not recommend this space for your Savannah travels. - We include two parking passes for nearby Congress Street iParkit garage. The garage is located three blocks away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000187670870218426,"social_amenities":0.0007894615409895778,"party_restriction":0.02252356894314289,"nearby_nightlife":0.963245689868927}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"We are in the heart of downtown Savannah, overlooking the river, and central to all the amazing places that folks come to the city to visit! HOWEVER, with our incredible location comes noise! Guests should expect noise from the river side tourists, adjoining and nearby businesses, and nearby traffic. Noise should be expected at all hours. If you don't feel as though you would be comfortable with urban, city noise throughout your stay, we do not recommend this space for your Savannah travels. - We include two parking passes for nearby Congress Street iParkit garage. The garage is located three blocks away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000187670870218426,"social_amenities":0.0007894615409895778,"party_restriction":0.02252356894314289,"nearby_nightlife":0.963245689868927}},{"text":"Located in the perfect spot, you'll be in the heart of everything that historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the city's rich history, enjoy its vibrant dining scene, or simply relax by the river, our condo is the ideal home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 4pm until check-out at 10am! There are no shared spaces and it is entirely private. Other things to note - The best thing about our condo, in our opinion, is the location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014231421519070864,"social_amenities":0.00429357448592782,"party_restriction":0.025244468823075294,"nearby_nightlife":0.30104488134384155}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 10029","address":"22 E BAY ST ##A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1168047000309225911","title":"Breathtaking Riverfront Views in 1857 Beauty!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1168047000309225911","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02994"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1168047000309225911","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c7bc7acd7adfe4db62cc01697980fdabaea49b608aa222170c4e34ab427d2178","chunks":9,"words":892,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9403743147850037,"party_welcome":0.00263543170876801,"social_amenities":0.9403743147850037,"party_restriction":0.03229343518614769,"nearby_nightlife":0.9675261974334717,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience comfort and charm in this riverfront condo in a historic, Savannah 1857 architectural jewel! This bright, airy 1BR/1BA retreat mixes original details with modern convenience! Enjoy a fully stocked kitchen with eat-in counter seating for four, spacious living room (with pull-out!) fast WiFi, and in-unit laundry. One parking pass for a nearby garage is included. Meticulously designed with modern amenities, this gem offers an exceptional stay in the heart of historic downtown! SVR-02994 The space Welcome to our exquisite condo in the heart of historic downtown Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001337772118858993,"social_amenities":0.9403743147850037,"party_restriction":0.0032965196296572685,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018616457236930728}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views River view Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have one exterior security camera located outside of the front door to the condo. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002869722666218877,"social_amenities":0.003003663383424282,"party_restriction":0.0003000476863235235,"nearby_nightlife":0.00082218530587852}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"For your convenience, an in-unit washer and dryer are available, making it easy to take care of laundry during your stay. One parking pass for the nearby Congress Street iParkit garage, just a few blocks away, is included with your stay, ensuring you have a hassle-free parking experience. With its perfect location in the heart of everything, our condo offers easy access to all the best attractions, dining, and entertainment that historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the rich history, enjoy the vibrant city life, or simply relax by the river, this condo provides an exceptional home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00263543170876801,"social_amenities":0.015196723863482475,"party_restriction":0.0022767684422433376,"nearby_nightlife":0.9351328015327454}},{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Coffee Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_