7370638","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02995"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1168049911837370638","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e747f899ebb6cb88573aa30ec17a18554d5239f13dc9fd837119958e24af3102","chunks":9,"words":868,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.6744706630706787,"party_welcome":0.00263543170876801,"social_amenities":0.6744706630706787,"party_restriction":0.01552607212215662,"nearby_nightlife":0.9520589113235474,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Enjoy a quintessential Savannah experience at our centrally-located downtown condo! This 1BR/1BA retreat in an 1857 building features floor-to-ceiling windows with sweeping Bay St. views. Enjoy all the comforts of home after exploring everything our Southern city has to offer! The open concept living/kitchen/dining space is freshly renovated and features impeccable design and a comfy king bed! One parking pass for a nearby garage is included. Unbeatable central location! SVR-02995 The space Welcome to our exquisite condo in the heart of historic downtown Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019185304699931294,"social_amenities":0.6744706630706787,"party_restriction":0.002870358759537339,"nearby_nightlife":0.00468765664845705}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have one exterior security camera located outside of the front door to the condo. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028163049137219787,"social_amenities":0.0063907550647854805,"party_restriction":0.0003281669341959059,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005854378105141222}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"For your convenience, an in-unit washer and dryer are available, making it easy to take care of laundry during your stay. One parking pass for the nearby Congress Street iParkit garage, just a few blocks away, is included with your stay, ensuring you have a hassle-free parking experience. With its perfect location in the heart of everything, our condo offers easy access to all the best attractions, dining, and entertainment that historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the rich history, enjoy the vibrant city life, or simply relax by the river, this condo provides an exceptional home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00263543170876801,"social_amenities":0.015196723863482475,"party_restriction":0.0022767684422433376,"nearby_nightlife":0.9351328015327454}},{"text":"The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 3pm until check-out at 10am! The condo is completely private. To access the condo, you will enter the building, passing through a small common foyer and hallway. Your coded entry is right off the foyer area. At the end of the hallway there is a second coded entry, which belongs to the neighboring condo. Other things to note - The best thing about our condo, in our opinion, is the location! We are in the heart of downtown Savannah, overlooking the river, and central to all the amazing places that folks come to the city to visit!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011053396156057715,"social_amenities":0.0008296291343867779,"party_restriction":0.0063823857344686985,"nearby_nightlife":0.8970859050750732}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Enjoy a quintessential Savanna