life":0.018531953915953636}},{"text":"If you don't feel as though you would be comfortable with urban, city noise throughout your stay, we do not recommend this space for your Savannah travels. - We include one parking pass for the nearby Congress Street iParkit garage. The garage is located three blocks away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002891211770474911,"social_amenities":0.001383093185722828,"party_restriction":0.004488923586905003,"nearby_nightlife":0.07310964167118073}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"At the top of the staircase, there is a small landing with two coded entries -- one for your condo and another for the neighboring condo. Other things to note - The best thing about our condo, in our opinion, is the location! We are in the heart of downtown Savannah, overlooking the river, and central to all the amazing places that folks come to the city to visit! HOWEVER, with our incredible location comes noise! Guests should expect noise from the river side tourists, adjoining and nearby businesses, and nearby traffic. Noise should be expected at all hours.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002760407514870167,"social_amenities":0.000679476244840771,"party_restriction":0.0019816046115010977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9158592820167542}},{"text":"This condo\u2019s incredible central location puts you in the heart of everything historic Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here to explore the city's rich history, enjoy its vibrant dining scene, or simply relax by the river, our condo is the perfect home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 3pm until check-out at 10am! The condo is completely private. To access the condo, you must climb an interior staircase that is shared with one neighboring condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00043236714554950595,"social_amenities":0.0008601045119576156,"party_restri