em...built in 1857!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019121222430840135,"social_amenities":0.4821566045284271,"party_restriction":0.005086972843855619,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008437627693638206}},{"text":"The garage is located three blocks away. Unfortunately, Airbnb does not provide the option to check off \"off-site, free parking\" in the amenities list, so we like to clarify that we do provide one pass for this nearby garage, however it is three blocks away from the condo and not \"on-site.\" You can, however, pull up to the condo to unload your luggage while idling your vehicle, then proceed to the parking garage, to avoid having to tote your belongings. - This condo is located up one tall flight of interior stairs. There is not an elevator or alternative means to access the space. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026836793404072523,"social_amenities":0.03404597193002701,"party_restriction":0.0025041396729648113,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012500975281000137}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Original features, including beautiful heart pine floors and the incredible architecture blended with modern upgrades, add character and comfort to this exceptional space. For your convenience, an in-unit washer and dryer are available, making it easy to take care of laundry during your stay. One parking pass for the nearby Congress Street iParkit garage, located just a few blocks away, is included with your stay, ensuring you have a hassle-free parking experience. With its perfect location in the heart of everything, our condo offers easy access to all the best attractions, dining, and entertainment that historic Savannah has to offer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001995280385017395,"social_amenities":0.007890199311077595,"party_restriction":0.0016012440901249647,"nearby_nightlife":0.9472911357879639}},{"text":"Whether you're here to explore the city's rich history, enjoy its vibrant dining scene, or simply relax and take in the views, this whimsical hideaway provides an exceptional home base for your Savannah adventure. Guest access The entire condo is all yours from check-in at 3pm until check-out at 10am! The condo is completely private. To access the condo, you must climb an interior staircase that is shared with one neighboring condo. At the top of the staircase, there is a small landing with two coded entries -- one for your condo and another for the neighboring condo. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005467181908898056,"social_amenities":0.0029934935737401247,"party_restriction":0.0019297088729217649,"nearby_nightlife":0.0052122571505606174}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to our whimsical top-floor condo overlooking Bay St! This spacious 1BR/1BA retreat in an 1857 building that feels like you've been pulled from the pages of a fairytale! Enjoy the romantic views of the massive live oaks below sprinkled with Spanish moss, a fully equipped kitchen, and a comfy and fresh living room (with pull-out sofa for an extra guest!). The huge bedroom features a luxurious king bed. This space will be your home base for a most memorable trip to Savannah! SVR-02997 The space Welcome to our enchanting condo, a whimsical top-floor hideaway located in the heart of downtown historic Savannah in an architectural gem...built in 1857!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019121222430840135,"social_amenities":0.4821566045284271,"party_restriction":0.005086972843855619,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008437627693638206}},{"text":"The garage is located three blocks away. Unfortunately, Airbnb does not provide the option to check off \"off-site, free parking\" in the amenities list, so we like to clarify that we do provide one pass for this nearby garage, however it is three blocks away from the condo and not \"on-site.\" You can, however, pull up 