re extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003713480837177485,"social_amenities":0.011624258011579514,"party_restriction":0.0006063596229068935,"nearby_nightlife":0.000678677053656429}},{"text":"Experience luxury living in this Historic Downtown Bay Street condo featuring two primary king suites \u2013 where comfort meets elegance, and space meets sophistication. Enjoy style and comfort as you unwind in the living space as wall-to-wall windows pour in light. Have coffee on your balcony as you listen to Savannah come alive. The building is located on Bay Street, which is just across the street from the historic steps leading to River Street. SVR-02467 The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027978705475106835,"social_amenities":0.006181215401738882,"party_restriction":0.0006138806929811835,"nearby_nightlife":0.0036954800598323345}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"If you use our nice linens to wipe off makeup or excessive dirt, you will be subject to a fee of $25 per occurrence. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004808254016097635,"social_amenities":0.0009162416681647301,"party_restriction":0.00047705534962005913,"nearby_nightlife":0.01003486942499876}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Indoor fireplace: gas Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property There are cameras on the outside of the building and inside the hallways managed by the condo association. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003713480837177485,"social_amenities":0.011624258011579514,"party_restriction":0.0006063596229068935,"nearby_nightlife":0.000678677053656429}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Indoor fireplace: gas Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property There are cameras on the outside of the building and inside the hallways managed by the condo association. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003713480837177485,"social_amenities":0.011624258011579514,"party_restriction":0.0006063596229068935,"nearby_nightlife":0.000678677053656429}},{"text":"Experience luxury living in this Historic Downtown Bay Street condo featuring two primary king suites \u2013 where comfort meets elegance, and space meets sophistication. Enjoy style and comfort as you unwind in the living space as wall-to-wall windows pour in light. Have coffee on your balcony as you listen to Savannah come alive. The building is located on Bay Street, which is just across the street from the historic steps leading to River Street. SVR-02467 The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027978705475106835,"social_amenities":0.006181215401738882,"party_restriction":0.0006138806929811835,"nearby_nightlife":0.0036954800598323345}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Directly below the condo on the ground floor is a Starbucks and one of our favorite local restaurants, Treylor Park's Double Wide Diner! Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the condominium with respect, as if it was your own property. \"Quiet Hours\" are 10pm - 8am.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.402551611652598e-05,"social_amenities":0.0017950995825231075,"party_restriction":0.9987136125564575,"nearby_nightlife":0.9898012280464172}},{"text":"The loft is also perfect for your longer stay, with an in-unit washer and dryer, iron, and ironing board, along with providing dressers and closet space for all your needs. Bringing your own vehicle? We provide one parking space in the Whitaker Garage near the loft. Guest access You may access the entire condo unit and our garage parking space 24/7. We ask that you please be courteous to your neighbors and keep noise levels to a minimum from the hours of 10pm - 8am. We live in a very residential condo building so we just ask that you help us maintain the relationships we have with our friendly neighbors.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002124355814885348,"social_amenities":0.0022366661578416824,"party_restriction":0.9555208086967468,"nearby_nightlife":0.0289171040058136}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Directly below the condo on the ground floor is a Starbucks and one of our favorite local restaurants, Treylor Park's Double Wide Diner! Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the condominium with respect, as if it was your own property. \"Quiet Hours\" are 10pm - 8am.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.402551611652598e-05,"social_amenities":0.0017950995825231075,"party_restriction":0.9987136125564575,"nearby_nightlife":0.9898012280464172}},{"text":"Flowing directly into the well-appointed kitchen, find a large island with room for four, a gas range, and an island sink that looks out onto the balcony. Enjoy all the essential kitchen items you need to cook a delicious meal including utensils, pots, pans, coffee maker, and blender. Ready for that Georgia breeze? Step out onto the loft\u2019s balcony overlooking the small courtyard below. Tucked on the side of the building, you are shielded from the noise of Bay Street yet inspired by watching the hustle and bustle of people come and go from the Starbucks below. Just off the living space, find a half bathroom for convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002309011179022491,"social_amenities":0.0016854665009304881,"party_restriction":0.00038801395567134023,"nearby_nightlife":0.07887383550405502}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 13049","address":"165 W BAY ST #402W","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_i