98477,"party_welcome":0.0033057478722184896,"social_amenities":0.25752493739128113,"party_restriction":0.9679434299468994,"nearby_nightlife":0.9766125679016113,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A convenient half bath off the kitchen adds extra ease for entertaining and day-to-day living. The bathrooms are stocked with shampoo, conditioner and body wash. \u2606\u2606 KITCHEN\u2606\u2606 The bright and airy kitchen is fully equipped with all the appliances, utensils and cookware you need to feel at home. \u2606\u2606 OUTSIDE SPACE \u2606\u2606 The exterior space is all about the view. Step out onto the private double balcony and take in breathtaking vistas of the Savannah River and the iconic gold-domed City Hall.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0033057478722184896,"social_amenities":0.02236364036798477,"party_restriction":0.0003769042086787522,"nearby_nightlife":0.02095952443778515}},{"text":"Other things to note Bay Street Bliss boasts a range of features designed to ensure a luxurious and comfortable stay. This 2-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom condo has been recently renovated to blend historic charm with modern amenities. Each bedroom is luxuriously appointed with high-end bedding, extra pillows, cozy throws, and coordinating accent pillows, providing guests with a restful and indulgent experience. The condo's large windows allow natural light to flood the space, highlighting the tall ceilings and historic details that add to its charm. Modern conveniences include TV, fast Wi-Fi, and a well-equipped coffee bar. The private porch offers a serene spot for morning coffee or evening tea.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":126,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.662508819019422e-05,"social_amenities":0.008798849768936634,"party_restriction":0.0005025153513997793,"nearby_nightlife":0.025259720161557198}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"A convenient half bath off the kitchen adds extra ease for entertaining and day-to-day living. The bathrooms are stocked with shampoo, conditioner and body wash. \u2606\u2606 KITCHEN\u2606\u2606 The bright and airy kitchen is fully equipped with all the appliances, utensils and cookware you need to feel at home. \u2606\u2606 OUTSIDE SPACE \u2606\u2606 The exterior space is all about the view. Step out onto the private double balcony and take in breathtaking vistas of the Savannah River and the iconic gold-domed City Hall.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0033057478722184896,"social_amenities":0.02236364036798477,"party_restriction":0.0003769042086787522,"nearby_nightlife":0.02095952443778515}},{"text":"Welcome to Bay Street Bliss! This elegant 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath condo is perfect for couples, small families, or friends seeking a luxurious Savannah getaway. Located in the heart of the Landmark Historic District, our sixth-floor condo offers unmatched views of the Savannah River and the iconic gold-domed City Hall. With stylish interiors, a private balcony, and room for up to 4 guests, this is the perfect home base for your Lowcountry escape. No pets or smoking on premises per HOA. The space KEY FEATURES: \u2600 Prime Location + Views: Stunning sixth-floor river and City Hall views from your private double balcony","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004894947051070631,"social_amenities":0.25752493739128113,"party_restriction":0.9679434299468994,"nearby_nightlife":0.005267728585749865}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to Bay Street Bliss! This elegant 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath condo is perfect for couples, small families, or friends seeking a luxurious Savannah getaway. Located in the heart of the Landmark Historic District, our sixth-floor condo offers unmatched views of the Savannah River and the iconic gold-domed City Hall. With stylish interiors, a private balcony, and room for up to 4 guests, this is the perfect home base for your Lowcountry escape. No pets or smoking on premises per HOA.