ash bags, paper towels and toilet paper for your convenience. Max guest count is 4 per HOA regulations. No pets permitted per HOA. Guest count includes infants and children. No more than 4 of any age allowed. Primary renter must be 25 years old to rent and signer of agreement must stay on premises for entire booking. No smoking or vaping on premises. This includes the outdoor balcony. SVR-02530 Guest access The home is fitted with a smart door lock. Guests will receive a key code prior to arrival to enter the home. This keycode is changed after every guest for your safety.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.95769553608261e-05,"social_amenities":0.0032150796614587307,"party_restriction":0.023334801197052002,"nearby_nightlife":0.00044245037133805454}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Perched on the sixth floor, this covered terrace is the perfect place to sip your morning coffee, enjoy a sunset cocktail, or snap stunning photos of the city below. Located just one block from River Street, Bay Street Bliss places you in the heart of Savannah's vibrant downtown. You'll be within walking distance of the city's best cafes, bars, and restaurants, making it easy to explore the local culinary scene. Whether you're here for a quick getaway or an extended stay, Bay Street Bliss provides a perfect blend of comfort, style, and prime location, making it an ideal choice for families, couples, and solo travelers alike.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037973318831063807,"social_amenities":0.00408753240481019,"party_restriction":0.0007828533998690546,"nearby_nightlife":0.9766125679016113}},{"text":"An in-condo laundry room adds to the convenience, making it easy for guests to keep their clothes fresh during their stay. Located just one block from River Street, Bay Street Bliss provides easy access to Savannah's top attractions, cafes, bars, and restaurants. The condo is situated in a safe environment with security ca