/ nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"19979086","title":"Habersham 2 | Walk to River Street, Free Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/19979086","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02371"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"19979086","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"062c38332e19c34b27f4b3fa9ebd3f8fd8cfdcb7e7215cc0f9f132680cb77e39","chunks":9,"words":843,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.13160033524036407,"party_welcome":0.9713771343231201,"social_amenities":0.13160033524036407,"party_restriction":0.009704746305942535,"nearby_nightlife":0.9950939416885376,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Resort view Bathroom Hair dryer Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Cameras are located in the common areas. This may include community pools, game rooms, grill areas, fitness centers, etc. Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002602419990580529,"social_amenities":0.13160033524036407,"party_restriction":0.0003017690032720566,"nearby_nightlife":0.003561553079634905}},{"text":"On the upper floor, there is a spacious living room with plenty of comfortable seating and a 55\" Smart HDTV. The kitchen is equipped with an apartment-sized refrigerator and freezer (no ice maker in the freezer) a stove and oven, a microwave oven, and a dishwasher. There is a combination coffee maker, so coffee lovers will enjoy having the choice of regular drip coffee or Keurig single cup coffee. There is an eat-in kitchen bar top table that has seating for 4 with additional seating for 2 at a cafe table on the attached porch. There is also a half bath powder room on this level.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023569380573462695,"social_amenities":0.015742598101496696,"party_restriction":0.0003550202236510813,"nearby_nightlife":0.014535805210471153}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The house is situated in a great central location from which to explore the world-famous Historic District of Savannah, and many local attractions, pubs, and restaurants are just a short walk away. Every First Friday of the month stroll down to River Street for Fireworks and enjoy live music, the arts, and other events. There is always plenty of food, fun, and culture in Savannah! You will be located a short 20-minute drive from Tybee Island, Savannah's beach. Come out for a day trip to enjoy the beach, fishing, visiting Ft. Pulaski, or climbing Georgia's oldest tallest lighthouse. Want to experience the best of both worlds?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9713771343231201,"social_amenities":0.008263461291790009,"party_restriction":0.0013280520215630531,"nearby_nightlife":0.9950939416885376}},{"text":"About the Paul Hamilton Williams House: The Paul Hamilton Williams House, built in 1791, is conveniently located just off the corner of Habersham and Bay Street. It is just a short walk from Historic River Street, Emmet Park, Warren Square, Factor's Walk, and many other points of interest in the historic district. The home is located right beside the popular bistro B. Matthews Eatery at the corner of Bay Street and Habersham on the Eastern end of the historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003857877163682133,"social_amenities":0.01073343027383089,"party_restriction":0.0025949899572879076,"nearby_nightlife":0.9455627202987671}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Resort view Bathroom Hair dryer Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Cameras are located in the common areas. This may include community pools, game rooms, grill areas, fitness centers, etc. Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002602419990580529,"social_amenities":0.13160033524036407,"party_restriction":0.0003017690032720566,"nearby_nightlife":0.003561553079634905}},{"text":"On the upper floor, there is a spacious living room with plenty of comfortable seating and a 55\" Smart HDTV. The kitchen is equipped with an apartment-sized refrigerator and freezer (no ice maker in the freezer) a stove and oven, a microwave oven, and a dishwasher. There is a combination coffee maker, so coffee lovers will enjoy having the choice of regular drip coffee or Keurig single cup coffee. There is an eat-in kitchen bar top table that has seating for 4 with additional seating for 2 at a cafe table on the attached porch. There is also a half bath powder room on this level.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023569380573462695,"social_amenities":0.015742598101496696,"party_restriction":0.0003550202236510813,"nearby_nightlife":0.014535805210471153}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"A utility closet with stacked washer and dryer is also located on this level off of the King bedroom. The main entrance to the apartment is located on the second floor, and there is a second entrance on the ground level. Wireless Internet/WIFI is available for guest use. There are raised inflatable queen and twin beds available at the home for extra sleeping. 1 car off-street parking only. This rental is not pet-friendly. Note: Fireplaces are sealed and non-working, but they add to the ambiance! Also, the interior spiral staircase is very narrow and also not recommended for people with mobility issues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011175491090398282,"social_amenities":0.0016806008061394095,"party_restriction":0.009704746305942535,"nearby_nightlife":0.0038917416241019964}},{"text":"About the Paul Hamilton Williams House: The Paul Hamilton Williams House, built in 1791, is conveniently located just off the corner of Habersham and Bay Street. It is just a short walk from Historic River Street, Emmet Park, Warren Square, Factor's Walk, and many other points of interest in the historic district. The home is located right beside the popular bistro B. Matthews Eatery at the corner of Bay Street and Habersham on the Eastern end of the historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003857877163682133,"social_amenities":0.01073343027383089,"party_restriction":0.0025949899572879076,"nearby_nightlife":0.9455627202987671}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The house is situated in a great central location from which to explore the world-famous Historic District of Savannah, and many local attractions, pubs, and restaurants are just a short walk away. Every First Friday of the month stroll down to River Street for Fireworks and enjoy live music, the arts, and other events. There is always plenty of food, fun, and culture in Savannah! You will be located a short 20-minute drive from Tybee Island, Savannah's beach. Come out for a day trip to enjoy the beach, fishing, visiting Ft. Pulaski, or climbing Georgia's oldest tallest lighthouse. Want to experience the best of both worlds?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9713771343231201,"social_amenities":0.008263461291790009,"party_restriction":0.0013280520215630531,"nearby_nightlife":0.9950939416885376}},{"text":"About the Paul Hamilton Williams House: The Paul Hamilton Williams House, built in 1791, is conveniently located just off the corner of Habersham and Bay Street. It is just a short walk from Historic River Street, Emmet Park, Warren Square, Factor's Walk, and many other points of interest in the historic district. The home is located right beside the popular bistro B. Matthews Eatery at the corner of Bay Street and Habersham on the Eastern end of the historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003857877163682133,"social_amenities":0.01073343027383089,"party_restriction":0.0025949899572879076,"nearby_nightlife":0.9455627202987671}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 19001","address":"425 E BAY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1}},"calls":[{"number":"24070073005","date":"2024-03-10","type":"50V ANIMAL LOCKED IN VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"425 E Bay St","recorded_pin":"20004 19001","side":"direct"},{"number":"24123130094","date":"2024-05-02","type":"VEHICLE FI