ny Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":171,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005537821562029421,"social_amenities":0.5942595601081848,"party_restriction":0.001889612409286201,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013781263260170817}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Spanish Moss Inn features a beautiful glassed-in sunroom that is fully furnished with a dining table, hutch and extra seating. This portion of the home leads directly to your private courtyard that is peppered with umbrella-topped patio tables. Plan a little cookout any day of the week using your private outdoor grill. The bedrooms of Spanish Moss Inn are easily the most impressive \"suites\" found in any Savannah vacation rentals. Every single bedroom in this home features a king-sized bed with access to its own private full-sized bathroom! Every aspect of the home's bedrooms and bathrooms will delight you with the quality and attention to detail you're observing!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00427456758916378,"social_amenities":0.20730873942375183,"party_restriction":0.00036259787157177925,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019454816356301308}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Touches like keypad entry, ample outdoor lighting and off-street parking for two vehicles make entering and exiting this rental property a breeze for guests. Prior to your arrival, the home will be thoroughly cleaned and disinfected in anticipation of your stay. Finally, Spanish Moss Inn comes with free access to a resort-style heated pool located on the south end of Tybee Island. Located just 30 minutes away by car, Tybee offers an amazing spot to visit if you'd like to swap city views for beach views for the afternoon! Things to Do When Staying at Spanish Moss Inn in Savannah","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004082879167981446,"social_amenities":0.9852692484855652,"party_restriction":0.00047150059253908694,"nearby_nightlife":0.5834206938743591}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":171,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005537821562029421,"social_amenities":0.5942595601081848,"party_restriction":0.001889612409286201,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013781263260170817}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":98,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011871934839291498,"social_amenities":0.0016505701933056116,"party_restriction":0.0043047890067100525,"nearby_nightlife":0.00293412571772933}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The amazing location of Spanish Moss Inn makes this home one of the vacation rentals Savannah GA visitors who want to feel connected to the city from their own front porch should not miss! During your stay, be sure to put spots like Forsyth Park, the Mercer-Williams House Museum, the Savannah Historic District, River Street, City Market and the Coastal Georgia Botanical Gardens on your list of places to visit! Savannah is filled with amazing restaurants, shopping, live music and exhibits. It is also known for its city ghost tours, haunted cemetery walks and fun pub crawls.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016013873973861337,"social_amenities":0.003422768786549568,"party_restriction":0.0016661881236359477,"nearby_nightlife":0.9818894863128662}},{"text":"Of course, keeping a loose itinerary allows Savannah tourists to enjoy the simple pleasures of admiring ornate front porches, chasing down magical water fountains or following floating jazz notes to little clubs by the river. Spanish Moss is one of the vacation rentals Savannah GA visitors looking to soak in a truly historic experience will love! Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000320393213769421,"social_amenities":0.03620706498622894,"party_restriction":0.0008182115852832794,"nearby_nightlife":0.9763503670692444}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 36317","address":"104 W BROUGHTON ST #A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"52952422","title":"\"Bee\" on Broughton - Bright Apartment-Downtown SAV","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52952422","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01971"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"52952422","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"eb020488978bea3637c96990f5ef1c62e8e2daa536aea3f90751e50b132c8943","chunks":8,"words":751,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.06842612475156784,"party_welcome":0.0011891780886799097,"social_amenities":0.06842612475156784,"party_restriction":0.9990259408950806,"nearby_nightlife":0.9942388534545898,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"You can also find parking at Whitaker Street Parking Garage, which is only two blocks away. The garage's daily rate is $16. Lastly, you can also purchase a visitor parking pass, which is good for 24 ($15) or 48 hours ($24). For more information, please visit this link: savannah. com/parking-in-savannah/ Guest access Guests will have access to the apartment and all of its amenities using the provided codes. The building and apartment codes are sent at 3pm on your arrival day. Guests are not allowed to enter the premises prior to the approved check-in time. Internal doors with electronic locks lead to storage closets; please do not attempt to open.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010895362356677651,"social_amenities":0.06842612475156784,"party_restriction":0.1104009747505188,"nearby_nightlife":0.01458167377859354}},{"text":"Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property For your security, there is a Ring camera doorbell at the apartment entrance. It points away from the apartment at the common hallway. The camera is non-intrusive and was installed with your privacy in mind. Smoke alarm Located in every bedroom Carbon monoxide alarm Located in the living room area Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 78 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a private space with a desk Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals GE refrigerator Microwave","section":"AMENITIES","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033688245457597077,"social_amenities":0.002448506187647581,"party_restriction":0.0004870177945122123,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005574628012254834}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Conveniently located above the Savannah Bee Company and Coffee Fox, you\u2019ll enjoy close proximity to everything downtown Savannah has to offer. Walk to popular area shops, restaurants, museums, art galleries, and entertainment venues - including Jepson Center for the Arts, Lafayette Square, and City Market. Parking is typically found on the street at the rate of $2 an hour. Street parking is free between the hours of 8pm and 8am (Mon-Sat and all day Sunday) North of Liberty St. South of liberty St., parking is free between 8pm and 8am (Mon-Fri) and all day on Sundays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011891780886799097,"social_amenities":0.009626422077417374,"party_restriction":0.0050605772994458675,"nearby_nightlife":0.9423525929450989}},{"text":"SVR-01971 Located in the very heart of Historic Downtown Savannah, this stylish 2BR apartment puts you within walking distance of the most popular and trendy area shops, restaurants, coffee shops, galleries, and entertainment venues. Comfortably sleep four guests. The space is best suited for travelers who want to experience Savannah like a local - right in the heart of the nightlife and entertainment Savannah is best known for. The space This gorgeous two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment is on the 2nd-floor of an 1860 historic building on Broughton Street. The spacious 1,272-square-foot unit features original hardwood flooring throughout and original exposed brick in the bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048701060586608946,"social_amenities":0.0011916924268007278,"party_restriction":0.0006451734225265682,"nearby_nightlife":0.9861759543418884}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"You can also find parking at Whitaker Street Parking Garage, which is only two blocks away. The garage's daily rate is $16. Lastly, you can also purchase a visitor parking pass, which is good for 24 ($15) or 48 hours ($24). For more information, please visit this link: savannah. com/parking-in-savannah/ Guest access Guests will have access to the apartment and all of its amenities using the provided codes. The building and apartment codes are sent at 3pm on your arrival day. Guests are not allowed to enter the premises prior to the approved check-in time. Internal doors with electronic locks lead to storage closets; please do not attempt to open.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010895362356677651,"social_amenities":0.06842612475156784,"party_restriction":0.1104009747505188,"nearby_nightlife":0.01458167377859354}},{"text":"Conveniently located above the Savannah Bee Company and Coffee Fox, you\u2019ll enjoy close proximity to everything downtown Savannah has to offer. Walk to popular area shops, restaurants, museums, art galleries, and entertainment venues - including Jepson Center for the Arts, Lafayette Square, and City Market. Parking is typically found on the street at the rate of $2 an hour. Street parking is free between the hours of 8pm and 8am (Mon-Sat and all day Sunday) North of Liberty St. South of liberty St., parking is free between 8pm and 8am (Mon-Fri) and all day on Sundays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011891780886799097,"social_amenities":0.009626422077417374,"party_restriction":0.0050605772994458675,"nearby_nightlife":0.9423525929450989}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Other things to note The Home was built in 1860 and is located in a very vibrant part of downtown. Nearby cafes, restaurants, and bars are at your fingertips, but this does mean there is some city noise. To make your stay as comfortable as possible, we have installed brand new, custom-built windows with additional CitiQuiet panels to dampen the noise. We also include noise-dampening curtains, sound machines, and earplugs for our light-sleeping guests. The best of city living! This is a 2nd-floor apartment, so please be mindful of the 25 steps to the apartment entrance. Parties, pets, and smoking are absolutely prohibited. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022275507217273116,"social_amenities":0.001073541585355997,"party_restriction":0.9990259408950806,"nearby_nightlife":0.9942388534545898}},{"text":"You can also find parking at Whitaker Street Parking Garage, which is only two blocks away. The garage's daily rate is $16. Lastly, you can also purchase a visitor parking pass, which is good for 24 ($15) or 48 hours ($24). For more information, please visit this link: savannah. com/parking-in-savannah/ Guest access Guests will have access to the apartment and all of its amenities using the provided codes. The building and apartment codes are sent at 3pm on your arrival day. Guests are not allowed to enter the premises prior to the approved check-in time. Internal doors with electronic locks lead to storage closets; please do not attempt to open.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010895362356677651,"social_amenities":0.06842612475156784,"party_restriction":0.1104009747505188,"nearby_nightlife":0.01458167377859354}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Other things to note The Home was built in 1860 and is located in a very vibrant part of downtown. Nearby cafes, restaurants, and bars are at your fingertips, but this does mean there is some city noise. To make your stay as comfortable as possible, we have installed brand new, custom-built windows with additional CitiQuiet panels to dampen the noise. We also include noise-dampening curtains, sound machines, and earplugs for our light-sleeping guests. The best of city living! This is a 2nd-floor apartment, so please be mindful of the 25 steps to the apartment entrance. Parties, pets, and smoking are absolutely prohibited. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022275507217273116,"social_amenities":0.001073541585355997,"party_restriction":0.9990259408950806,"nearby_nightlife":0.9942388534545898}},{"text":"SVR-01971 Located in the very heart of Historic Downtown Savannah, this stylish 2BR apartment puts you within walking distance of the most popular and trendy area shops, restaurants, coffee shops, galleries, and entertainment venues. Comfortably sleep four guests. The space is best suited for travelers who want to experience Savannah like a local - right in the heart of the nightlife and entertainment Savannah is best known for. The space This gorgeous two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment is on the 2nd-floor of an 1860 historic building on Broughton Street. The spacious 1,272-square-foot unit features original hardwood flooring throughout and original exposed brick in the bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048701060586608946,"social_amenities":0.0011916924268007278,"party_restriction":0.0006451734225265682,"nearby_nightlife":0.9861759543418884}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 36318","address":"104 W BROUGHTON ST #B","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud 