to River Street, where you can take in breathtaking sunsets and watch majestic ships cruise by. Just behind the estate, explore the vibrant shops and restaurants along East Broughton Street. Plus, you\u2019ll be nestled between two of Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, Warren and Washington. Exceptional Outdoor Space: Relax in the courtyard or take a dip in the saltwater plunge pool. Whether you\u2019re basking in the summer sun or enjoying a cozy fall evening, the outdoor area is designed for ultimate relaxation. Luxurious Interiors: The home\u2019s interior, designed by a renowned local designer, leaves no detail overlooked.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002796534390654415,"social_amenities":0.004686753731220961,"party_restriction":0.0003626753168646246,"nearby_nightlife":0.483387291431427}},{"text":"This luxurious estate offers two private parking spaces and a refreshing plunge saltwater pool, making it an unparalleled retreat in one of the city\u2019s most sought-after locations. The space Welcome to Southern Roots Estate, a hidden gem in the heart of Savannah's historic district. Just steps from River Street and half a block from Broughton Street, this luxurious estate offers two private parking spaces and a refreshing saltwater plunge pool, making it an unparalleled retreat in one of the city\u2019s most sought-after locations. What Makes Southern Roots Estate Special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017306767404079437,"social_amenities":0.9698250889778137,"party_restriction":0.16852349042892456,"nearby_nightlife":0.020232541486620903}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1278955170773804240","title":"Luxury Living Downtown w/ Private Pool + Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1278955170773804240","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03056"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1278955170773804240","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e2b25fba84dd2516dc438e