ou may also park in a nearby garage, or purchase a parking pass at the Visitor Information Center located on MLK Jr., Blvd. This information and more is provided for our guests in our confirmation email upon booking. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.131888509728014e-05,"social_amenities":0.001078402274288237,"party_restriction":0.0007555072079412639,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013952134177088737}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Pets allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002304970403201878,"social_amenities":0.0009955656714737415,"party_restriction":0.0002812322636600584,"nearby_nightlife":0.000472733227070421}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"White washed cabinets and appliances lend an airy feel to the space, while offsetting the stunning honey-stained hardwood floors. You\u2019ll be hard pressed to leave the comforts of this home-away-from-home, including the queen-sized bedroom with its soothing, neutral palette and whimsical artwork. The beautiful wood floors continue into the en suite bath, which has a shower/tub combo and vanity. Get your day started at Java Burrito, an affair of brunch, coffee and tex-mex cuisine. After venturing out for lunch, take in the shopping on nearby Broughton or enjoy the cafes and local music venues on River Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015798753593116999,"social_amenities":0.005863951053470373,"party_restriction":0.0009774845093488693,"nearby_nightlife":0.9865942001342773}},{"text":"You'll be less than a 15 minute walk from every destination you wish to reach in the Historic district! Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - Central air conditioning, a washer and dryer and private parking spot add to the conveniences of this live like a local vacation experience. - Savannah\u2019s bustling riverfront is just steps away. - A short walk from Trustees Theatre, this is prime spot for attendees of the Savannah Film Festival. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Parking: Private Parking This unit includes a small private parking space located at the rear of the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006854358362033963,"social_amenities":0.0022315788082778454,"party_restriction":0.0006265377742238343,"nearby_nightlife":0.9219634532928467}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"White washed cabinets and appliances lend an airy feel to the space, while offsetting the stunning honey-stained hardwood floors. You\u2019ll be hard pressed to leave the comforts of this home-away-from-home, including the queen-sized bedroom with its soothing, neutral palette and whimsical artwork. The beautiful wood floors continue into the en suite bath, which has a shower/tub combo and vanity. Get your day started at Java Burrito, an affair of brunch, coffee and tex-mex cuisine. After venturing out for lunch, take in the shopping on nearby Broughton or enjoy the cafes and local music venues on River Street.","sec