come":0.0006399030680768192,"social_amenities":0.49833714962005615,"party_restriction":0.002819082234054804,"nearby_nightlife":0.972345232963562,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Two-story Victorian on Warren Square The space The bright exterior of our two-bedroom, two-bath Harper House cheerfully welcomes you to this unique vacation property. Located directly across from Warren Square on the first floor of a historic, two-story Victorian home, Harper House can comfortably accommodate up to six Lucky guests for a true \u201clive like a local\u201d Savannah experience. The understated elegance of the living area comes from the high ceilings, original, decorative hearth and tasteful furnishings. A wall-mounted, flat-screen TV and queen sleeper-sofa modernize the living space. Original pocket doors, a classic feature in Victorian homes, separates the living area from the Premium bedroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006399030680768192,"social_amenities":0.49833714962005615,"party_restriction":0.002819082234054804,"nearby_nightlife":0.007649220991879702}},{"text":"The original hardwood floors extend into the Premium bedroom, where you\u2019ll find another decorative hearth, mirrored armoire and a carved wooden headboard above the king-size bed. Spacious, warm and bright, the completely renovated, eat-in kitchen is fully equipped with stainless steel appliances and everything you\u2019ll need to prepare meals at home. Just off the kitchen is the second bedroom, which has a queen bed and fully renovated, en suite bath with a large vanity. Step outside to the cozy, private courtyard where a bistro set waits for you to enjoy your morning coffee, and a gas grill is available for bbq-ing on a sunny Savannah afternoon.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033919521956704557,"social_amenities":0.08215274661779404,"party_restriction":0.0005263019702397287,"nearby_nightlife":0.0052207419648766