ctorian homes, separates the living area from the Premium bedroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006399030680768192,"social_amenities":0.49833714962005615,"party_restriction":0.002819082234054804,"nearby_nightlife":0.007649220991879702}}]}}},{"listing_id":"46334213","title":"Perched on Warren Square by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46334213","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01161"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"46334213","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"50037c5665eecef538fc622d98276ed8341daba8c862e90b21320bc30e78a4c5","chunks":7,"words":568,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006684151478111744,"party_welcome":0.9932119846343994,"social_amenities":0.008173900656402111,"party_restriction":0.0013633097987622023,"nearby_nightlife":0.7711220383644104,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Second floor charming apartment, perched upon Warren Square, overlooking the Spanish Moss tree lined streets. Located off of the beaten path, only one block from the hustle and bustle, this property is fit for your next getaway! The space The bright exterior of our two-bedroom, Queen Anne Style Victorian Home, cheerfully welcomes you to this unique charming property. Perched upon Warren Square on the second story, Harper House Too can comfortably accommodate up to Four Lucky guests for a true \u201clive like a local\u201d Savannah experience. The space gleams with natural light, and boast with high ceilings, original, decorative hearth and tasteful furnishings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016738445265218616,"social_amenities":0.006684151478111744,"party_restriction":0.000895755598321557,"nearby_nightlife":0.015870284289121628}},{"text":"The living space comfortably seats your entire party, also fitted with A flat-screen TV, oriental rug, original fire place that is now decorative. Stepping into to the spacious kitchen, you'll find original wood work and flooring throughout the home, a classic feature in Victorian homes. The kitchen has been tastefully upgraded with stainless steel appliances, open shelving to modernize the space, and a large butcher block island perfect for preparing home meals. Tucked away, you'll find the solid wood dining table that can seat up-to Four Lucky Guests. Just off the kitchen, the large bathroom features a serene setting with marble countertops, and a large subway tile soaking tub/shower combination.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9932119846343994,"social_amenities":0.0010856806766241789,"party_restriction":0.00025717189419083297,"nearby_nightlife":0.009815432131290436}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The living space comfortably seats your entire party, also fitted with A flat-screen TV, oriental rug, original fire place that is now decorative. Stepping into to the spacious kitchen, you'll find original wood work and flooring throughout the home, a classic feature in Victorian homes. The kitchen has been tastefully upgraded with stainless steel appliances, open shelving to modernize the space, and a large butcher block island perfect for preparing home meals. Tucked away, you'll find the solid wood dining table that can seat up-to Four Lucky Guests. Just off the kitchen, the large bathroom features a serene setting with marble countertops, and a large subway tile soaking tub/shower combination.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9932119846343994,"social_amenities":0.0010856806766241789,"party_restriction":0.00025717189419083297,"nearby_nightlife":0.009815432131290436}},{"text":"Second floor charming apartment, perched upon Warren Square, overlooking the Spanish Moss tree lined streets. Located off of the beaten path, only one block from the hustle and bustle, this property is fit for your next getaway! The space The bright exterior of our two-bedroom, Queen Anne Style Victori