ork, and a comfortable King size bed. You\u2019ll be just minutes from the excitement of River Street and Broughton Street, with Savannah\u2019s best shopping, dining and historic attractions all within walking distance. What is parking like for this home? Guests have access to one designated/reserved parking space in the lot behind the home. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: Twin Size Bunk Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002737858740147203,"social_amenities":0.008173900656402111,"party_restriction":0.0013633097987622023,"nearby_nightlife":0.7711220383644104}},{"text":"Second floor charming apartment, perched upon Warren Square, overlooking the Spanish Moss tree lined streets. Located off of the beaten path, only one block from the hustle and bustle, this property is fit for your next getaway! The space The bright exterior of our two-bedroom, Queen Anne Style Victorian Home, cheerfully welcomes you to this unique charming property. Perched upon Warren Square on the second story, Harper House Too can comfortably accommodate up to Four Lucky guests for a true \u201clive like a local\u201d Savannah experience. The space gleams with natural light, and boast with high ceilings, original, decorative hearth and tasteful furnishings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016738445265218616,"social_amenities":0.006684151478111744,"party_restriction":0.000895755598321557,"nearby_nightlife":0.015870284289121628}}]}}},{"listing_id":"46483436","title":"Victorian on Warren Square by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/46483436","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00207","SVR-01161"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"46483436","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8ff8cb2716c55dfd24834c5956f236666fbb9f4528c294ddff1738b9fa5bf065","chunks":8,"words":727,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0012115384452044964,"party_welcome":0.9663096070289612,"social_amenities":0.03377243131399155,"party_restriction":0.0014555825619027019,"nearby_nightlife":0.9589436650276184,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Q: Are there two kitchens? A: Yes\u2014both kitchens are fully updated with stainless steel appliances and plenty of prep space. Q: Does the home have historic features? A: Tons! Pocket doors, original fireplaces, soaring ceilings, hardwood floors, and classic Victorian details throughout. Sleeping Configuration: Upstairs Bedroom 1: King Bed Upstairs Bedroom 2: Twin Bunk Bed Downstairs Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Downstairs Bedroom 4: King Bed Downstairs Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa We welcome your dog companions at this pet-friendly home, but kindly request that you make alternative arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014768869732506573,"social_amenities":0.0012115384452044964,"party_restriction":0.0009639284107834101,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013297069817781448}},{"text":"Both living spaces offer comfortable seating for your entire group, each featuring a flat-screen TV and an original (now decorative) fireplace. The kitchens\u2014yes, two\u2014have been thoughtfully updated with stainless steel appliances and plenty of counter space to cook meals together. Just off each kitchen, you\u2019ll find cozy dining areas that seat up to four. On the first floor, original pocket doors separate the main living area from the primary bedroom, an iconic detail of Victorian homes. The hardwood floors continue into the bedroom, where you\u2019ll find a decorative hearth, mirrored armoire, carved wooden headboard, and a plush king-size bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006953938282094896,"social_amenities":0.00111361313611269,"party_restriction":0.00022763641027268022,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007473668083548546}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"What is the parking situation at The Harper Abode? Guests enjoy two designated parking spaces located directly behind the home\u2014easy, convenient, and rare in downtown Savannah! Q: How close is the home to Savannah\u2019s top attractions? A: You\u2019re a short stroll to River Street, the Historic District, local restaurants, boutiques, and some of Savannah\u2019s most beautiful squares. Q: Is this home good for families or groups? A: Yes\u2014The Harper Abode sleeps up to eight guests, with two king bedrooms, a queen room, and a bunk room perfect for kids or singles. Q: Is there outdoor space? A: Absolutely! Enjoy a private courtyard with seating and a gas grill.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9663096070289612,"social_amenities":0.03377243131399155,"party_restriction":0.0014555825619027019,"nearby_nightlife":0.9589436650276184}},{"text":"Welcome to The Harper Abode\u2014a cheerful, historic Victorian home on Warren Square with room for eight, two kitchens, beautiful original details, and a cozy courtyard. Walk to River Street, shopping, dining, and Savannah\u2019s best sights. The space Welcome to The Harper Abode, a cheerful four-bedroom Queen Anne\u2013style Victorian overlooking historic Warren Square in downtown Savannah. With room for up to eight Lucky guests, this bright and beautifully preserved home blends Victorian charm with modern comfort\u2014perfect for families, couples, and groups looking to stay steps from everything. This sun-filled home features soaring ceilings, original decorative hearths, and tasteful furnishings throughout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002589838346466422,"social_amenities":0.0298127643764019,"party_restriction":0.0013199892127886415,"nearby_nightlife":0.9176281690597534}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What is the parking situation at The Harper Abode? Guests enjoy two designated parking spaces located directly behind the home\u2014easy, convenient, and rare in downtown Savannah! Q: