AST FRAUD/FORGERY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"417 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20004 42009","side":"direct"},{"number":"26073072733","date":"2026-03-14","type":"41 PAST VEHICLE THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"417 E CONGRESS ST","recorded_pin":"20004 42009","side":"direct"},{"number":"26073073055","date":"2026-03-14","type":"22 OTHER","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"417 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20004 42009","side":"direct"},{"number":"24306320427","date":"2024-11-01","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"419 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20004 42010","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"19029903","title":"Historic c.1820, Parking by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/19029903","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00871"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"19029903","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8a9547bf0e809dc94f0942d078add592aae111432fea50896d567d019a9200dc","chunks":8,"words":707,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004458853509277105,"party_welcome":0.7282522320747375,"social_amenities":0.00691648805513978,"party_restriction":0.004813618492335081,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736731648445129,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Built in 1820, this beautifully restored cottage is a true piece of Savannah history. Enjoy original architectural features with the modern amenities (and private parking!) you expect on vacation. The space If you\u2019re looking for a house with history, look no further! Located downtown in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historical District, this charming Savannah vacation rental comfortably accommodates up to four people and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014770687266718596,"social_amenities":0.004458853509277105,"party_restriction":0.0021087524946779013,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003989212855231017}},{"text":"Built in 1820 by John Ballon, a free man of color, the history of Freeman\u2019s Cottage is detailed in the book \"Savannah\u2019s Little Crooked Houses: If These Walls Could Talk,\" by Susan B Johnson and published by the History Press, 2007. Located downtown in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historical District, this charming Savannah vacation rental comfortably accommodates up to four people and features on-premise parking and a secluded garden patio. The beautiful wood used in the living area makes the space warm and inviting. Open to the kitchen, you\u2019ll never miss a beat of the conversation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002100394485751167,"social_amenities":0.0035194929223507643,"party_restriction":0.0015138681046664715,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012131065595895052}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"With the picturesque garden patio, the Cottage is ideal for those celebrating an anniversary or special occasion. Sleeping Configuration: Bed 1: Queen Bed 2: Queen Sleeper Sofa Parking: Private Parking We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation. Some homes may allow larger dogs, please inquire for more information. SVR-00871 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7282522320747375,"social_amenities":0.0013347802450880408,"party_restriction":0.004813618492335081,"nearby_nightlife":0.004120351281017065}},{"text":"Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005153772071935236,"social_amenities":0.0006483701872639358,"party_restriction":0.0007043368532322347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007966597331687808}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Enjoy a home cooked meal or leftovers from one of Savannah\u2019s many fine dining establishments in the sunroom, where you\u2019ll enjoy a view of the secluded garden patio. The full bath has a walk-in shower and large, wooden vanity. The bedroom is located upstairs, and has a queen sized bed you can relax into after a busy day of exploring. Enjoy the modern amenities of home while experiencing historic Savannah, including a washer/dryer, high-speed wifi, and free, on-site parking. Nestled between Warren and Washington Squares, Freeman\u2019s Cottage is conveniently located within walking distance to shops, restaurants, theaters and other points of interest.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046010944060981274,"social_amenities":0.00691648805513978,"party_restriction":0.00212775357067585,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736731648445129}},{"text":"Built in 1820, this beautifully restored cottage is a true piece of Savannah history. Enjoy original architectural features with the modern amenities (and private parking!) you expect on vacation. The space If you\u2019re looking for a house with history, look no further! Located downtown in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historical District, this charming Savannah vacation rental comfortably accommodates up to four people and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014770687266718596,"social_amenities":0.004458853509277105,"party_restriction":0.0021087524946779013,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003989212855231017}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"With the picturesque garden patio, the Cottage is ideal for those celebrating an anniversary or special occasion. Sleeping Configuration: Bed 1: Queen Bed 2: Queen Sleeper Sofa Parking: Private Parking We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation. Some homes may allow larger dogs, please inquire for more information. SVR-00871 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7282522320747375,"social_amenities":0.0013347802450880408,"party_restriction":0.004813618492335081,"nearby_nightlife":0.004120351281017065}},{"text":"Enjoy a home cooked meal or leftovers from one of Savannah\u2019s many fine dining establishments in the sunroom, where you\u2019ll enjoy a view of the secluded garden patio. The full bath has a walk-in shower and large, wooden vanity. The bedroom is located upstairs, and has a queen sized bed you can relax into after a busy day of exploring. Enjoy the modern amenities of home while experiencing historic Savannah, including a washer/dryer, high-speed wifi, and free, on-site parking. Nestled between Warren and Washington Squares, Freeman\u2019s Cottage is conveniently located within walking distance to shops, restaurants, theaters and other points of interest.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046010944060981274,"social_amenities":0.00691648805513978,"party_restriction":0.00212775357067585,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736731648445129}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy a home cooked meal or leftovers from one of Savannah\u2019s many fine dining establishments in the sunroom, where you\u2019ll enjoy a view of the secluded garden patio. The full bath has a walk-in shower and large, wooden vanity. The bedroom is located upstairs, and has a queen sized bed you can relax into after a busy day of exploring. Enjoy the modern amenities of home while experiencing historic Savannah, including a washer/dryer, high-speed wifi, and free, on-site parking. Nestled between Warren and Washington Squares, Freeman\u2019s Cottage is conveniently located within walking distance to shops, restaurants, theaters and other points of interest.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046010944060981274,"social_amenities":0.00691648805513978,"party_restriction":0.00212775357067585,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736731648445129}},{"text":"- Concierge Services including pre-arrival grocery shopping, discounted trolley and walking tour tickets, and many other visitor items. Need help with something more unique (private picnic in the park, dinner reservations, coastal boat excursion)? We're local, we know people...we can make it happen. Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent. If a guest is found to have falsified their reservation in any way we reserve the right to evict the guest, cancel their reservation and retain ALL DEPOSITS PAID TO THAT POINT. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014550598280038685,"social_amenities":0.00172434002161026,"party_restriction":0.00110922462772578,"nearby_nightlife":0.01842959225177765}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43016","address":"110 BARNARD ST #210","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"21005555","title":"Sky High Savannah in the Heart of Downtown","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/21005555","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03157"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"21005555","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76