Beach Bum Parade in May \u2022 SCAD Sand Arts Festival on Tybee in May \u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Seafood Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July on the River in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Shalom Y'all Jewish Food Festival in October \u2022 Taste of Savannah in November \u2022 Telfair Art Fair in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December \u2022 Tybee Island Christmas Parade in December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9499384164810181,"social_amenities":0.011499208398163319,"party_restriction":0.0017215401167050004,"nearby_nightlife":0.9608718156814575}},{"text":"If you're looking for something special to experience near our Savannah Georgia vacation rentals, then you might check Savannah's calendar of events. There are a number of special events going on during the year and the following are just a few examples: \u2022 Martin Luther King Parade in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 Savannah Tour of Homes and Gardens in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Savannah Garden Expo in April","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.4589005708694458,"social_amenities":0.00406413059681654,"party_restriction":0.0037213412579149008,"nearby_nightlife":0.9011803269386292}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":135,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Paid parking off premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":227,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047274623648263514,"social_amenities":0.018352139741182327,"party_restriction":0.001594239380210638,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004140612145420164}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":135,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":155,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011871934839291498,"social_amenities":0.0016505701933056116,"party_restriction":0.0043047890067100525,"nearby_nightlife":0.00293412571772933}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 Liberty Mutual Legends of Golf, PGA Champions Tour in April \u2022 Tybee Island Beach Bum Parade in May \u2022 SCAD Sand Arts Festival on Tybee in May \u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Seafood Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July on the River in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Shalom Y'all Jewish Food Festival in October \u2022 Taste of Savannah in November \u2022 Telfair Art Fair in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December \u2022 Tybee Island Christmas Parade in December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9499384164810181,"social_amenities":0.011499208398163319,"party_restriction":0.0017215401167050004,"nearby_nightlife":0.9608718156814575}},{"text":"If a walking tour sounds too tiring, then you can also opt for a trolley ride in the Old Savannah Tour or Old Town Trolley Tour. Any extra time on your stay and you might consider taking the short drive out to Tybee Island. This oceanfront paradise is only 30 minutes outside downtown Savannah. There you'll have your choice of sandy beaches, secluded beaches and riverfront beaches. You can simply relax or stroll through the neighborhood shops, or check out some water activities with available charters and watercraft rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014725291111972183,"social_amenities":0.004901015665382147,"party_restriction":0.0019031488336622715,"nearby_nightlife":0.9148710370063782}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43019","address":"110 BARNARD ST #213","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"25164262","title":"Spacious Downtown Loft by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/25164262","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-03307"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"25164262","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b77762c4ece1aef49aa5d72fe90167c3750ca5a69cb6cfb49731a8e8334c534c","chunks":7,"words":607,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006152464542537928,"party_welcome":0.0018294210312888026,"social_amenities":0.20057614147663116,"party_restriction":0.024145642295479774,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933428764343262,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Elevator","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002001790562644601,"social_amenities":0.006152464542537928,"party_restriction":0.00035088291042484343,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005672727129422128}},{"text":"Or, make use of the brand new kitchen and formal dining room for a cozy night in. A primary bedroom with King size bed, writing desk, and en suite bath is located just off the main living space. The second bedroom is two steps up from the living area and boasts a Queen size bed and the perfect nook to enjoy your morning coffee. Up to four guests can spaciously accommodate the middle bedroom with two Queen beds and a walk-in closet. Another two guests can occupy the back bedroom with Full bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014968561299610883,"social_amenities":0.0011795558966696262,"party_restriction":0.00036699706106446683,"nearby_nightlife":0.052084773778915405}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"After learning of Savannah's rich history, cap the night with dinner at Chive Sea Bar & Lounge and drinks on the roof at Rocks on the Roof / Bohemian Hotel. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Size Bed Bedroom 3: Two Queen Size Beds Bedroom 4: Full Size Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294210312888026,"social_amenities":0.20057614147663116,"party_restriction":0.024145642295479774,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933428764343262}},{"text":"Spread out in this impressive four-bedroom loft right in the heart of downtown! The city's best shopping and dining are only steps away, with City Market and River Street within walking distance. The space Experience the city like a local in your very own downtown loft. Up to ten Lucky guests will call this spacious condo home, only steps away from Savannah's prime shopping and dining attractions. Newly renovated with lofty ceilings and exposed brick, Telfair Loft is the ideal downtown headquarters. Catch up with old friends in the open living area before going out on the town for dinner and drinks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017103039426729083,"social_amenities":0.0018379006069153547,"party_restriction":0.0003496973367873579,"nearby_nightlife":0.9726247191429138}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"After learning of Savannah's rich history, cap the night with dinner at Chive Sea Bar & Lounge and drinks on the roof at Rocks on the Roof / Bohemian Hotel. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Size Bed Bedroom 3: Two Queen Size Beds Bedroom 4: Full Size Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294210312888026,"social_amenities":0.20057614147663116,"party_restriction":0.024145642295479774,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933428764343262}},{"text":"Between the newly renovated kitchen, stacking washer/dryer, and flat screen smartTVs in every room, Telfair Loft truly leaves no amenity aside for your most comfortable vacation yet. Start your day with a local brew from The Coffee Fox and make your way down to The Paris Market Brocante & Cafe for some retail therapy, recently voted \"The South's Best Shop\" by Southern Living. Head towards City Market and grab lunch in Little Duck Diner before starting a walking tour with Genteel and Bard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008231636602431536,"social_amenities":0.008300581946969032,"party_restriction":0.0006549671525135636,"nearby_nightlife":0.9501292109489441}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"After learning of Savannah's rich history, cap the night with dinner at Chive Sea Bar & Lounge and drinks on the roof at Rocks on the Roof / Bohemian Hotel. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Size Bed Bedroom 3: Two Queen Size Beds Bedroom 4: Full Size Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294210312888026,"social_amenities":0.20057614147663116,"party_restriction":0.024145642295479774,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933428764343262}},{"text":"Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-03307 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent. If a guest is found to have falsified their reservation in any way we reserve the right to evict the guest, cancel their reservation and retain ALL DEPOSITS PAID TO THAT POINT. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":7.669280603295192e-05,"social_amenities":0.0005351339350454509,"party_restriction":0.0009099330054596