nce / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1485451121466151234","title":"Pet Friendly, Walkable Loft in Heart of Downtown","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1485451121466151234","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02804"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1485451121466151234","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"0f6357bef7123a476a13bc1db85325726b73a7c95672c64ca24ac1b00f8b8b7e","chunks":6,"words":537,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.14432165026664734,"party_welcome":0.005511291790753603,"social_amenities":0.9676475524902344,"party_restriction":0.8488216996192932,"nearby_nightlife":0.9908595681190491,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The bedroom is tucked away from the bustle of Broughton Street, the serene bedroom ensures a quiet night\u2019s sleep. Enjoy a plush Queen-size bed, ample closet space, and a private ensuite bath. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: 1 Queen bed Living Room: Sleeper Sofa What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002776188193820417,"social_amenities":0.14432165026664734,"party_restriction":0.05172579735517502,"nearby_nightlife":0.15163420140743256}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00041495784535072744,"social_amenities":0.00404050387442112,"party_restriction":0.00040115031879395247,"nearby_nightlife":0.000834372011013329}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Charming, Light-Filled Living Space: The open-concept layout features a cozy living and dining area with sweeping views of the city. Exposed brick walls, hardwood floors, and natural light pouring through tall windows create an inviting atmosphere, perfect for relaxing after a day exploring downtown. The Perfect Location: Start your morning with a craft coffee from The Coffee Fox, wander over to the award-winning Paris Market for a little shopping, and grab brunch at Little Duck Diner in nearby City Market. Ready for a night out on the town? You're only two blocks away from some of the best rooftop bars, nightlight and everything our city has to offer!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005511291790753603,"social_amenities":0.005253306590020657,"party_restriction":0.0009403228759765625,"nearby_nightlife":0.9908595681190491}},{"text":"Bright and beautifully preserved one-bedroom apartment tucked just off Telfair Square, in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. The space Welcome to Timeless Telfair, a bright and beautifully preserved one-bedroom apartment tucked just off Telfair Square, in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. L