_welcome":0.0018977924482896924,"social_amenities":0.015115275047719479,"party_restriction":0.002825494622811675,"nearby_nightlife":0.006564790848642588}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We love those little (and not so little) furry bundles of joy. Sadly, our home is not suitable to accommodate them. \u2605 NO SMOKING INSIDE \u2605 Please refrain from smoking inside the home! Any smoking evidence will result in a fee for odor removal and furniture cleaning. \u2605 NO PARTIES/EVENTS \u2605 We kindly ask you to treat our home as your own to preserve its pristine condition for future guests and your return visits. Gatherings with more than the maximum allowed occupancy are strictly forbidden and may result in immediate eviction without a refund. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":156,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011642980825854465,"social_amenities":0.0006308516603894532,"party_restriction":0.9966741800308228,"nearby_nightlife":0.028121178969740868}},{"text":"Experience the best of Savannah from the Broughton Penthouse, where timeless charm meets modern ease. This beautifully designed 2BR/2BA condo features exposed brick, elegant furnishings, and sweeping views of the Historic District skyline. Located just steps from River Street, City Market, and top dining spots, it offers the perfect downtown escape. After exploring the cobblestone streets and vibrant culture, relax in comfort and enjoy the convenience of one nearby reserved parking space. The space Escape to Southern Elegance in the Heart of Historic Savannah Welcome to our top-floor condo on Broughton Street, where Savannah\u2019s storied charm meets modern living.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019131106091663241,"social_amenities":0.985822856426239,"party_restriction":0.01737351529300213,"nearby_nightlife":0.2286738008260727}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2714 Shampoo, conditioner, body wash \u2714 Antibacterial soap & extra towels \u2714 Toilet paper & hair dryer Your Savannah Story Starts Here Whether you're exploring nearby landmarks, indulging in local cuisine, or simply enjoying the rare convenience of reserved downtown parking, our Broughton Street condo is your perfect base for discovering the magic of Savannah. From its rich history to its modern comforts, every corner is crafted to elevate your stay. We Provide The Following Complementary Supplies: \u2192 3 packs of ground coffee and filters (each packet yields approx. 64oz of prepared coffee). \u2192 Small container full of single serving creamers. \u2192 1 roll of paper towel \u2192 Dishwasher pods","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004543640243355185,"social_amenities":0.003194184275344014,"party_restriction":0.0005987746408209205,"nearby_nightlife":0.27386096119880676}},{"text":"Experience the best of Savannah from the Broughton Penthouse, where timeless charm meets modern ease. This beautifully designed 2BR/2BA condo features exposed brick, elegant furnishings, and sweeping views of the Historic District skyline. Located just steps from River Street, City Market, and top dining spots, it offers the perfect downtown escape. After exploring the cobblestone streets and vibrant culture, relax in comfort and enjoy the convenience of one nearby reserved parking space. The space Escape to Southern Elegance in the Heart of Historic Savannah Welcome to our top-floor condo on Broughton Street, where Savannah\u2019s storied charm meets modern living.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019131106091663241,"social_amenities":0.985822856426239,"party_restriction":0.01737351529300213,"nearby_nightlife":0.2286738008260727}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43029","address":"110 BARNARD ST #501","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"8114396","title":"Hidden Speakeasy Style Penthouse on Broughton","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/8114396","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00843"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20004 43035","address":"105 WHITAKER ST #202","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"39190671","title":"Broughton Retreat in the Heart of Downtown!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39190671","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03040"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"39190671","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2ca9b4204c3c1f1b729d62fd4ce156676130e597d6ed5a4472e55b780d2bf13e","chunks":14,"words":1399,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.11788909137248993,"party_welcome":0.10664395242929459,"social_amenities":0.11788909137248993,"party_restriction":0.004931244999170303,"nearby_nightlife":0.9968949556350708,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Air Mattress with linens provided for extra sleeping space Large Flat Screen TV in Living Room Gourmet kitchen with granite coutertops and sleek stainless steel appliances Dining table Washer/Dryer Dishwasher Central Heat/Air Conditioning Walk Everywhere Free Wi-Fi Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":92,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046362378634512424,"social_amenities":0.11788909137248993,"party_restriction":0.004931244999170303,"nearby_nightlife":0.011939316056668758}},{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 Savannah Music Festival in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the River in July \u2022 Savannah Film Festival in September \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Guest access Loft style apartment with huge windows overlooking Broughton St, soaring ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors and brick accent walls Elevator in building 2 Queen bedrooms with flatscreen TVs, closet space, and full length mirrors Shared full bathroom with tiled walk in shower","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.10664395242929459,"social_amenities":0.002613088581711054,"party_restriction":0.0004623501154128462,"nearby_nightlife":0.96426922082901}},{"text":"In terms of what else to visit while you're in the city, some of the popular neighborhoods include River Street, City Market and Forsyth Park. River Street, in particular, can be a day's worth of adventure. The former cotton warehouses that used to line the river have been converted to a bevy of shops, galleries and eateries. Not only that, but you can book a riverboat tour here and spend a few hours out on the water. City Market is known for its variety of nightlife and is a great place to find jazz bars and open-air cafes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010541792027652264,"social_amenities":0.007001776248216629,"party_restriction":0.0018510029185563326,"nearby_nightlife":0.9968949556350708}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Air Mattress with linens provided for extra sleeping space Large Flat Screen TV in Living Room Gourmet kitchen with granite coutertops and sleek stainless steel appliances Dining table Washer/Dryer Dishwasher Central Heat/Air Conditioning Walk Everywhere Free Wi-Fi Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":92,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046362378634512424,"social_amenities":0.11788909137248993,"party_restriction":0.004931244999170303,"nearby_nightlife":0.011939316056668758}},{"text":"This fun little barrier island has its own complement of shops, waterfront restaurants and possible activities. The Tybee Lighthouse on the north end is probably its biggest claim to fame. Another engaging spot is the Tybee Marine Science Center, which features a number of ecological tours and displays. It's a great place to take children or anyone who loves learning about ecological diversity. If you're looking for special events to attend while staying in vacation rentals Savannah GA, then you may have a few options depending on when you come. The following is a sampling of events that take place during the year: \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.008688819594681263,"social_amenities":0.022884482517838478,"party_restriction":0.00197717547416687,"nearby_nightlife":0.9293259382247925}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Air Mattress with linens provided for extra sleeping space Large Flat Screen TV in Living Room Gourmet kitchen with granite coutertops and sleek stainless steel appliances Dining table Washer/Dryer Dishwasher Central Heat/Air Conditioning Walk Everywhere Free Wi-Fi Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":92,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046362378634512424,"social_amenities":0.11788909137248993,"party_restriction":0.004931244999170303,"nearby_nightlife":0.011939316056668758}},{"text":"May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Long-Term Stays For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bOccupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":139,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467279311735183,"social_amenities":0.0058708516880869865,"party_restriction":0.004697469528764486,"nearby_nightlife":0.0020174577366560698}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"In terms of what else to visit while you're in the city, some of the popular neighborhoods include River Street, City Market and Forsyth Park. River Street, in particular, can be a day's worth of adventure. The former cotton warehouses that used to line the river have been converted to a bevy of shops, galleries and eateries. Not only that, but you can book a riverboat tour here and spend a few hours out on the water. City Market is known for its variety of nightlife and is a great place to find jazz bars and open-air cafes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010541792027652264,"social_amenities":0.007001776248216629,"party_restriction":0.0018510029185563326,"nearby_nightlife":0.9968949556350708}},{"text":"Simply walk outside your door to be immediately immersed in Savannah culture. Savannah vacation rentals located near or on Broughton are popular choices with visitors who love to shop. Right nearby this property is a variety of popular stores, including The Gap, Banana Republic, Paris Market, James Gunn and more. Nearby eateries include the SubZero Bar, World of Beer, Alleycat Lounge and Barrelhouse South. Broughton is an intriguing mix of national retailers and local boutiques. This property is also located almost precisely between four squares. These squares are Telfair Square, Ellis Square, Wright Square and Johnson Square. Savannah's historic squares are some of the most storied attractions in the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001991280441870913,"social_amenities":0.009539843536913395,"party_restriction":0.002791360951960087,"nearby_nightlife":0.9910701513290405}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43036","address":"105 WHITAKER ST #203","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"19924822","title":"Contemporary on Broughton St. by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/19924822","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01100"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"19924822","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f3ab8f409b5805b9ea6dc1ffb2fc3960c500f900e069d97acb1145f1a7c70a21","chunks":7,"words":606,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.003199411556124687,"party_welcome":0.00231307209469378,"social_amenities":0.023420818150043488,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9632547497749329,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Need help with something more unique (private picnic in the park, dinner reservations, coastal boat excursion)? We're local, we know people...we can make it happen. Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent. If a guest is found to have falsified their reservation in any way we reserve the right to evict the guest, cancel their reservation and retain ALL DEPOSITS PAID TO THAT POINT. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002086619206238538,"social_amenities":0.003199411556124687,"party_restriction":0.0015568918315693736,"nearby_nightlife":0.023555032908916473}},{"text":"- Lucky Savannah Guest app with everything you need to know about your home (door code, wifi, TV channel lineup, etc. - 24/7 access to our team by phone, email, text, or messaging through App - Secure self check-in using our electronic keyless locks - Professionally laundered linens: you're bed linens are pressed just like a hotel (in fact we use the same linen service as 2 leading hotels) - Ample guest linens and guest consumables to get you through your stay without doing laundry or making a trip to the store - Concierge Services including pre-arrival grocery shopping, discounted trolley and walking tour tickets, and many other visitor items.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000365368090569973,"social_amenities":0.0014195889234542847,"party_restriction":0.0009368137689307332,"nearby_nightlife":0.00026837585028260946}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"From the prime location to the contemporary decor, Broughton Central is perfect for a couples' getaway or girls' weekend. Experience the city's animated nightlife and rich food (and drink) culture only seconds away from your perfect Savannah HQ. Sleeping configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Parking: Rental of this unit includes a parking pass for the nearby Whitaker Street parking garage. SVR-01100 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00231307209469378,"social_amenities":0.004665160086005926,"party_restriction":0.002654814161360264,"nearby_nightlife":0.9632547497749329}},{"text":"- Lucky Savannah Guest app with everything you need to know about your home (door code, wifi, TV channel lineup, etc. - 24/7 access to our team by phone, email, text, or messaging through App - Secure self check-in using our electronic keyless locks - Professionally laundered linens: you're bed linens are pressed just like a hotel (in fact we use the same linen service as 2 leading hotels) - Ample guest linens and guest consumables to get you through your stay without doing laundry or making a trip to the store - Concierge Services including pre-arrival grocery shopping, discounted trolley and walking tour tickets, and many other visitor items.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000365368090569973,"social_amenities":0.0014195889234542847,"party_restriction":0.0009368137689307332,"nearby_nightlife":0.00026837585028260946}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Experience Savannah's bustling downtown with this two-bedroom condo. Soaring 15-foot ceilings and a full kitchen provide the perfect crash pad for a busy getaway. The space Experience the heart of Savannah's historic downtown in this contemporary two-bedroom condo. Located at the corner of Broughton and Whitaker Street, you're only steps away from the city's most sought-after attractions, restaurants, and shopping. The soaring fifteen foot ceilings greet you at the entry, leading you into the open kitchen and living area. Feel at home with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, stocked with every essential you'd need for a quick bite before exploring the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023977416276466101,"social_amenities":0.023420818150043488,"party_restriction":0.000677805277518928,"nearby_nightlife":0.7842130661010742}},{"text":"From the prime location to the contemporary decor, Broughton Central is perfect for a couples' getaway or girls' weekend. Experience the city's animated nightlife and rich food (and drink) culture only seconds away from your perfect Savannah HQ. Sleeping configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Parking: Rental of this unit includes a parking pass for the nearby Whitaker Street parking garage. SVR-01100 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00231307209469378,"social_amenities":0.004665160086005926,"party_restriction":0.002654814161360264,"nearby_nightlife":0.9632547497749329}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}},{"text":"From the prime location to the contemporary decor, Broughton Central is perfect for a couples' getaway or girls' weekend. Experience the city's animated nightlife and rich food (and drink) culture only seconds away from your perfect Savannah HQ. Sleeping configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Parking: Rental of this unit includes a parking pass for the nearby Whitaker Street parking garage. SVR-01100 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00231307209469378,"social_amenities":0.004665160086005926,"party_restriction":0.002654814161360264,"nearby_nightlife":0.9632547497749329}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"From the prime location to the contemporary decor, Broughton Central is perfect for a couples' getaway or girls' weekend. Experience the city's animated nightlife and rich food (and drink) culture only seconds away from your perfect Savannah HQ. Sleeping configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Parking: Rental of this unit includes a parking pass for the nearby Whitaker Street parking garage. SVR-01100 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00231307209469378,"social_amenities":0.004665160086005926,"party_restriction":0.002654814161360264,"nearby_nightlife":0.9632547497749329}},{"text":"Experience Savannah's bustling downtown with this two-bedroom condo. Soaring 15-foot ceilings and a full kitchen provide the perfect crash pad for a busy getaway. The space Experience the heart of Savannah's historic downtown in this contemporary two-bedroom condo. Located at the corner of Broughton and Whitaker Street, you're only steps away from the city's most sought-after attractions, restaurants, and shopping. The soaring fifteen foot ceilings greet you at the entry, leading you into the open kitchen and living area. Feel at home with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, stocked with every essential you'd need for a quick bite before exploring the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023977416276466101,"social_amenities":0.023420818150043488,"party_restriction":0.000677805277518928,"nearby_nightlife":0.7842130661010742}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43037","address":"105 WHITAKER ST #204","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1116177100506504470","title":"The Whitaker Wonder, Near City Market | Shopping","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1116177100506504470","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02911"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1116177100506504470","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"04fcd6d9d1fae23708ac8bc1b965e90f6ce976a7eaa6842939c884de2b7fa25b","chunks":6,"words":538,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.00450548343360424,"party_welcome":0.0010833621490746737,"social_amenities":0.016257651150226593,"party_restriction":0.9983037710189819,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740921854972839,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026853277813643217,"social_amenities":0.00450548343360424,"party_restriction":0.0003372935170773417,"nearby_nightlife":0.000747917452827096}},{"text":"Unwind in the luxurious queen mattress adorned with crisp linens and ample custom-built storage. A washer and dryer are located behind the frosted glass closet doors just outside the primary suite. The single bathroom boasts an oversized single vanity with double faucets, a storage cabinet, and a custom-built low-entry shower. Essentials such as towels, toiletries, and a hair dryer are provided for your convenience. Experience urban luxury and convenience at its finest in this meticulously appointed Savannah retreat. Guest access The entire condo is setup for your use! You have a murphy bed in the living room that pulls down to be a full bed (please pull slowly/carefully).","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001489875721745193,"social_amenities":0.004042744170874357,"party_restriction":0.0006135037401691079,"nearby_nightlife":0.005693973507732153}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This second-floor unit boasts a spacious open concept, seamlessly blending kitchen, dining, and living areas. Cooking is a breeze in the large custom kitchen, complete with a full appliance package, including a wine cooler. A high-top peninsula island offers seating for three, perfect for casual dining or socializing. Relax in the spacious living room, featuring a comfortable sofa, reading chair, and large smart TV for entertainment. A built-in Murphy bed provides additional sleeping options, while large windows bathe the space in natural light. A dedicated workspace and built-in shelves offer functionality for remote work, supported by our reliable Wi-Fi. The primary suite awaits to the right of the living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010833621490746737,"social_amenities":0.0004471798602025956,"party_restriction":0.0004204265133012086,"nearby_nightlife":0.009553325362503529}},{"text":"Welcome to Whitaker Wonder, an immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom, second-floor apartment in the heart of Savannah, just minutes from the City Market. With custom finishes throughout, original hardwood floors, and exposed brick, the apartment blends modern design with classic Savannah charm that makes for a beautiful stay. This apartment is perfect for up to four guests, featuring one queen bed and a Murphy bed. Enjoy easy access to dining, pubs, attractions, and shopping. SVR-02911 The space Step into this freshly updated urban haven, where high ceilings, oversized windows, and exposed brick welcome you to a chic loft atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032480101799592376,"social_amenities":0.016257651150226593,"party_restriction":0.0016974563477560878,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740921854972839}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to Whitaker Wonder, an immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom, second-floor apartment in the heart of Savannah, just minutes from the City Market. With custom finishes throughout, original hardwood floors, and exposed brick, the apartment blends modern design with classic Savannah charm that makes for a beautiful stay. This apartment is perfect for up to four guests, featuring one queen bed and a Murphy bed. Enjoy easy access to dining, pubs, attractions, and shopping. SVR-02911 The space Step into this freshly updated urban haven, where high ceilings, oversized windows, and exposed brick welcome you to a chic loft atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032480101799592376,"social_amenities":0.016257651150226593,"party_restriction":0.0016974563477560878,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740921854972839}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026853277813643217,"social_amenities":0.00450548343360424,"party_restriction":0.0003372935170773417,"nearby_nightlife":0.000747917452827096}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Other things to note No parties. This is a condo building where many of the residents live there full-time. Please be respectful of noise levels particularly after 10pm. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the studio with respect as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":4.5918790419818833e-05,"social_amenities":0.0004815496504306793,"party_restriction":0.9983037710189819,"nearby_nightlife":0.28525546193122864}},{"text":"Welcome to Whitaker Wonder, an immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom, second-floor apartment in the heart of Savannah, just minutes from the City Market. With custom finishes throughout, original hardwood floors, and exposed brick, the apartment blends modern design with classic Savannah charm that makes for a beautiful stay. This apartment is perfect for up to four guests, featuring one queen bed and a Murphy bed. Enjoy easy access to dining, pubs, attractions, and shopping. SVR-02911 The space Step into this freshly updated urban haven, where high ceilings, oversized windows, and exposed brick welcome you to a chic loft atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032480101799592376,"social_amenities":0.016257651150226593,"party_restriction":0.0016974563477560878,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740921854972839}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to Whitaker Wonder, an immaculate one-bedroom, one-bathroom, second-floor apartment in the heart of Savannah, just minutes from the City Market. With custom finishes throughout, original hardwood floors, and exposed brick, the apartment blends modern design with classic Savannah charm that makes for a beautiful stay. This apartment is perfect for up to four guests, featuring one queen bed and a Murphy bed. Enjoy easy access to dining, pubs, attractions, and shopping. SVR-02911 The space Step into this freshly updated urban haven, where high ceilings, oversized windows, and exposed brick welcome you to a chic loft atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032480101799592376,"social_amenities":0.016257651150226593,"party_restriction":0.0016974563477560878,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740921854972839}},{"text":"Other things to note No parties. This is a condo building where many of the residents live there full-time. Please be respectful of noise levels particularly after 10pm. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the studio with respect as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":4.5918790419818833e-05,"social_amenities":0.0004815496504306793,"party_restriction":0.9983037710189819,"nearby_nightlife":0.28525546193122864}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 43038","address":"105 WHITAKER ST #301","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"43379531","title":"Chic and Bright in Downtown by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43379531","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02775"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"43379531","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4ff1f80b22b6e9680c94db46293d45bcc5bc84636bf57edc4270fd23bf6aa6ff","chunks":8,"words":698,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.02509123459458351,"party_welcome":0.911221444606781,"social_amenities":0.02509123459458351,"party_restriction":0.001470975810661912,"nearby_nightlife":0.9838520884513855,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"It is easy to escape into the Spanish Moss trees that line any of 22 historic squares. After exploring the city, slip back to your hideaway, kick off your shoes, and curl up on the comfortable sofa with a glass of wine. Foodies can whip up a gourmet meal in the fully stocked kitchen with all the gear. A washer and dryer are also available within the condo. Soaring ceilings and bright southern exposure allows the natural light to flood in through the tall windows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042500629206188023,"social_amenities":0.02509123459458351,"party_restriction":0.00032768864184617996,"nearby_nightlife":0.102460578083992}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033919521956704557,"social_amenities":0.007865357212722301,"party_restriction":0.0005180605221539736,"nearby_nightlife":0.000874013698194176}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"There are plenty of options to choose your favorite entertainment programing with three big-screen smart TV's, one in each bedroom plus another in the living room. Sink into a comfortable, eco friendly new mattress with quality boutique bedding. This space is comfortable, functional, beautifully colorful, and rave worthy. If you need to attend to some work, there is a desk, large dining room table, fast WIFI, and a printer for your convenience. FedEx is one block away. Whether you are on a road trip down the east coast, meeting family for a special occasion, or connecting with the girls for a getaway, enjoy the charm of Chic Savannah Hideaway.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.911221444606781,"social_amenities":0.019482890143990517,"party_restriction":0.0004932249430567026,"nearby_nightlife":0.8729187846183777}},{"text":"You will be swept away and transported to a slower, kinder time. Fall in love with the culture and intrigue of the South, this is what Savannah is known for. Located on the corner of Broughton and Whitaker, it is a quick 20-minute drive or Uber from the airport. The nickname \u201cHostess City\u201d fits the bill. Savannah is a warm, friendly blend of funky, scenic, romantic, and artistic vibes. Take a formal walking tour, historical tour, or food tour through this fascinating city. Go for a carriage ride down the cobblestone streets past the historic mansions. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005876588984392583,"social_amenities":0.001837381161749363,"party_restriction":0.001470975810661912,"nearby_nightlife":0.8834503293037415}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"It is easy to escape into the Spanish Moss trees that line any of 22 historic squares. After exploring the city, slip back to your hideaway, kick off your shoes, and curl up on the comfortable sofa with a glass of wine. Foodies can whip up a gourmet meal in the fully stocked kitchen with all the gear. A washer and dryer are also available within the condo. Soaring ceilings and bright southern exposure allows the natural light to flood in through the tall windows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042500629206188023,"social_amenities":0.02509123459458351,"party_restriction":0.00032768864184617996,"nearby_nightlife":0.102460578083992}},{"text":"There are plenty of options to choose your favorite entertainment programing with three big-screen smart TV's, one in each bedroom plus another in the living room. Sink into a comfortable, eco friendly new mattress with quality boutique bedding. This space is comfortable, functional, beautifully colorful, and rave worthy. If you need to attend to some work, there is a desk, large dining room table, fast WIFI, and a printer for your convenience. FedEx is one block away. Whether you are on a road trip down the east coast, meeting family for a special occasion, or connecting with the girls for a getaway, enjoy the charm of Chic Savannah Hideaway.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.911221444606781,"social_amenities":0.019482890143990517,"party_restriction":0.0004932249430567026,"nearby_nightlife":0.8729187846183777}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"You will be swept away and transported to a slower, kinder time. Fall in love with the culture and intrigue of the South, this is what Savannah is known for. Located on the corner of Broughton and Whitaker, it is a quick 20-minute drive or Uber from the airport. The nickname \u201cHostess City\u201d fits the bill. Savannah is a warm, friendly blend of funky, scenic, romantic, and artistic vibes. Take a formal walking tour, historical tour, or food tour through this fascinating city. Go for a carriage ride down the cobblestone streets past the historic mansions. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005876588984392583,"social_amenities":0.001837381161749363,"party_restriction":0.001470975810661912,"nearby_nightlife":0.8834503293037415}},{"text":"Chic Savannah Hideaway is a bright and charming, newly remodeled top-floor corner apartment in the heart of the elegant, beautiful Historic District. The space Welcome to Chic Savannah Hideaway, a two bedroom, two bathroom, coastal chic condo located directly in the heart of the Downtown Historic District. Featuring two king beds, spacious bathrooms, incredible natural light, elevated decor and an unbeatable location - you'll never want to leave! Savannah is a walker's paradise, a perfect geometric grid. Enchanting coffee shops, seriously amazing restaurants, bars, architecture, art, culture, and shopping are all located within 10 to 15 minutes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046677913633175194,"social_amenities":0.003369530662894249,"party_restriction":0.0012224826496094465,"nearby_nightlife":0.9838520884513855}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Chic Savannah Hideaway is a bright and charming, newly remodeled top-floor corner apartment in the heart of the elegant, beautiful Historic District. The space Welcome to Chic Savannah Hideaway, a two bedroom, two bathroom, coastal chic condo located directly in the heart of the Downtown Historic District. Featuring two king beds, spacious bathrooms, incredible natural light, elevated decor and an unbeatable location - you'll never want to leave! Savannah is a walker's paradise, a perfect geometric grid. Enchanting coffee shops, seriously amazing restaurants, bars, architecture, art, culture, and shopping are all located within 10 to 15 minutes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046677913633175194,"social_amenities":0.003369530662894249,"party_restriction":0.0012224826496094465,"nearby_nightlife":0.9838520884513855}},{"text":"You will be swept away and transported to a slower, kinder time. Fall in love with the culture and intrigue of the South, this is what Savannah is known for. Located on the corner of Broughton and Whitaker, it is a quick 20-minute drive or Uber from the airport. The nickname \u201cHostess City\u201d fits the bill. Savannah is a warm, friendly blend of funky, scenic, romantic, and artistic vibes. Take a formal walking tour, historical tour, or food tour through this fascinating city. Go for a carriage ride down the cobblestone streets past the historic mansions. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005876588984392583,"social_amenities":0.001837381161749363,"party_restriction":0.001470975810661912,"nearby_nightlife":0.8834503293037415}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47001C","address":"216 E STATE ST #1C","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":null,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"21432868","title":"","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/21432868","guests":null,"permits":["SVR-00903"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"21432868","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bad22fbe0f48eff1fd503fe4f410281f24