a tall wardrobe that can be utilized for all of your belongings. Situated directly across from Oglethorpe Square, guests are just a few steps away from Savannah attractions such as Owens-Thomas House, Telfair Museum, and the string of local shops and cafes along Broughton Street, Savannah's \"Main Street\". Walk through the squares with an ice cold beverage from one of the several bars found in City Market, heading towards River Street to see the massive cargo ships sail by at sunset. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007901370408944786,"social_amenities":0.007830219343304634,"party_restriction":0.0018828347092494369,"nearby_nightlife":0.9931535720825195}},{"text":"Off of this space, you'll find the large bathroom with plenty of space to store your belongings, and a shower/tub combination, perfect for soaking the long day away. Head to the back of the apartment to find the renovated kitchen, that is equipped with all of the modern conveniences one could wish for. From the elevated white granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and fully stocked kitchen, you'll want to prepare home-cooked meals every night! The quaint and charming bistro table can be served as a dining space, workspace, or place to gather for a game of cards! Tucked away off of the living room, the cozy bedroom awaits!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.007809860166162252,"social_amenities":0.005366097670048475,"party_restriction":0.0006018939311616123,"nearby_nightlife":0.01764092780649662}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47003C","address":"216 E STATE ST #3C","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":2,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":2,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24078082485","date":"2024-03-18","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24202213573","date":"2024-07-20","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24235247225","date":"2024-08-22","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"29303022","title":"Downtown Digs for Four by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29303022","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02242"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"29303022","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8d2e45b9250c9191e4a9a29bef58a0af3a342e5a569cf55bc5e1c6f545a7773a","chunks":7,"words":587,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0021067748311907053,"party_welcome":0.001433163066394627,"social_amenities":0.26869314908981323,"party_restriction":0.05241592973470688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9957854151725769,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"You can't beat the incredible location of this clean and modern one-bedroom apartment. Only two blocks away from City Market and River Street! The space Stay in the heart of the National Landmark Historic District and never use your car to see Savannah. This is a third-floor, one-bedroom apartment located in a charming brownstone overlooking Oglethorpe Square. Walk up to your luxe apartment and look for the number eleven. A double keyless entry from the street keeps this apartment safe and secure. Four Lucky guests will have every essential they'd need to have a clean and comfortable stay in the heart of it all.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010781038145069033,"social_amenities":0.0021067748311907053,"party_restriction":0.004221627488732338,"nearby_nightlife":0.012993823736906052}},{"text":"Enter into living space, boasting tall ceilings and plenty of natural daylight. A flat screen TV is opposite the sofa for late-night shows or early morning news. Take your time each morning and brew a pot of coffee in the spacious full size kitchen. The primary bedroom is just off the living space, with Queen size bed and a full size closet. A full bath with marble tile and a standalone vanity can be found attached to the living area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021057462436147034,"social_amenities":0.0019719041883945465,"party_restriction":0.0003928373334929347,"nearby_nightlife":0.006553092040121555}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Situated directly across from Oglethorpe Square, guests are just a few steps away from Savannah attractions such as Owens-Thomas House, Telfair Museum, and the string of local shops and cafes along Broughton Street, Savannah's \"Main Street\". Walk through the squares with an ice cold beverage from one of the several bars found in City Market, heading towards River Street to see the massive cargo ships sail by at sunset. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001433163066394627,"social_amenities":0.26869314908981323,"party_restriction":0.05241592973470688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9957854151725769}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air 