nce / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":2,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":2,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24078082485","date":"2024-03-18","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24202213573","date":"2024-07-20","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24235247225","date":"2024-08-22","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"220 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 47060","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1598723820806100860","title":"Sweet Retreat Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1598723820806100860","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02338"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1598723820806100860","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"5e2227caf06c076cc91eb6576bae148bf83a38ca1a07cca978e371faf92c71ea","chunks":9,"words":861,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.055259376764297485,"party_welcome":0.9689345359802246,"social_amenities":0.055259376764297485,"party_restriction":0.002535090781748295,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795829653739929,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Bidet Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Baking sheet Trash compactor Dining table Coffee Location features","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004065742832608521,"social_amenities":0.055259376764297485,"party_restriction":0.0003772784548345953,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014469416346400976}},{"text":"Most street parking is metered, and payment is due Monday-Saturday from 8 am-8 pm. Sundays and holidays are free. When parking overnight, please pay attention to the signs advising of the day and time for weekly street sweeping. During those hours parked cars will be ticketed. If you see a \u201cNo Parking or You Will Be Towed\u201d sign anywhere in Savannah\u2013believe it! Do not leave anything of value visible in your car. Housekeeping During Longer Stays For reservations exceeding eight (8) days, we require a weekly professional cleaning for the duration of the reservation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.287595457863063e-05,"social_amenities":0.005476770456880331,"party_restriction":0.0017530707409605384,"nearby_nightlife":0.0038531406316906214}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This condo is just steps away from Broughton Street and just a short walk to City Market, River Street and Forsyth Park. You've been warned--so pack your walking shoes! The apartment is located on the third floor of the building and is reached by stairs. Unfortunately, an elevator is not available. On the third floor, though, you will find a shared balcony featuring the best views from the building! From there, start your morning with a cup of coffee or end the day watching the sun set with a cocktail in hand. If you're lucky enough to visit on St. Patrick's Day, you're in luck!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9689345359802246,"social_amenities":0.006628284230828285,"party_restriction":0.0017834879690781236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795829653739929}},{"text":"Oglethorpe Square is on the parade route so take advantage of your front row seat to the show! The apartment features a bright living room with comfortable seating, a fully equipped kitchen for home-cooked meals and a private bedroom with a plush queen bed outfitted with quality linens to ensure a restful night\u2019s sleep. Additionally, a pull-out sleeper sofa in the living room accommodates two more guests. The bathroom is clean, cool, modern and stocked with fresh towels and a starter set of essential toiletries. Guest access This apartment is a private space and the balcony is shared with other residents of the building. Other things to note Children","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013359084259718657,"social_amenities":0.0014285584911704063,"party_restriction":0.0009255578042939305,"nearby_nightlife":0.12517549097537994}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Bidet Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Baking sheet Trash compactor Dining table Coffee Location features","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004065742832608521,"social_amenities":0.055259376764297485,"party_restriction":0.0003772784548345953,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014469416346400976}},{"text":"This condo is just steps away from Broughton Street and just a short walk to City Market, River Street and Forsyth Park. You've been warned--so pack your walking shoes! The apartment is located on the third floor of the building and is reached by stairs. Unfortunately, an elevator is not available. On the third floor, though, you will find a shared balcony featuring the best views from the building! From there, start your morning with a cup of coffee or end the day watching the sun set with a cocktail in hand. If you're lucky enough to visit on St. Patrick's Day, you're in luck!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9689345359802246,"social_amenities":0.006628284230828285,"party_restriction":0.0017834879690781236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795829653739929}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The dates and times will be coordinated after your reservation is made and payment will be requested through Airbnb's Resolution Center. By confirming your booking you acknowledge and agree to this requirement. Cancellation Policy Before booking, please acknowledge that (1) any reservation cancelled at least 30 days before check-in will receive a full refund, (2) any reservation cancelled 7-30 days before check-in will receive a partial refund, and (3) any reservation cancelled 7 days or less of check-in will forfeit their payment. Travel Insurance Travel Insurance is strongly recommended to help you recover your loss if your trip must be cancelled. Hurricane/Storm policy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022325495956465602,"social_amenities":0.003842343110591173,"party_restriction":0.002535090781748295,"nearby_nightlife":0.001192282885313034}},{"text":"This condo is just steps away from Broughton Street and just a short walk to City Market, River Street and Forsyth Park. You've been warned--so pack your walking shoes! The apartment is located on the third floor of the building and is reached by stairs. Unfortunately, an elevator is not available. On the third floor, though, you will find a shared balcony featuring the best views from the building! From there, start your morning with a cup of coffee or end the day watching the sun set with a cocktail in hand. If you're lucky enough to visit on St. Patrick's Day, you're in luck!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9689345359802246,"social_amenities":0.006628284230828285,"party_restriction":0.0017834879690781236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795829653739929}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"This condo is just steps away from Broughton Street and just a short walk to City Market, River Street and Forsyth Park. You've been warned--so pack your walking shoes! The apartment is located on the third floor of the building and is reached by stairs. Unfortunately, an elevator is not available. On the third floor, though, you will find a shared balcony featuring the best views from the building! From there, start your morning with a cup of coffee or end the day watching the sun set with a cocktail in hand. If you're lucky enough to visit on St. Patrick's Day, you're in luck!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9689345359802246,"social_amenities":0.006628284230828285,"party_restriction":0.0017834879690781236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795829653739929}},{"text":"Welcome to Sweet Retreat Savannah! This charming, comfortable one-bedroom apartment is thoughtfully designed for travelers seeking convenience, relaxation, and a great location. Whether you\u2019re visiting for work or leisure, you\u2019ll find everything you need for a seamless stay. This condo is conveniently located on Oglethorpe Square, near shops, restaurants and local attractions. You\u2019ll have easy access to everything Savannah has to offer while still enjoying a peaceful place to unwind. SVR-02338 The space Charming, comfortable and stylish, Sweet Retreat Savannah, is located in the heart of the Historic District on Oglethorpe Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015692877059336752,"social_amenities":0.0030438906978815794,"party_restriction":0.001221706042997539,"nearby_nightlife":0.15980444848537445}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47010","address":"210 E STATE ST #2","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1679694303911956284","title":"First Level Historic District Apt Walk Everywhere!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1679694303911956284","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03247"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1679694303911956284","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3afeaa681df7aef689ecdf09623d98ba654f83d1d6d9a6780f0bee5323d93ca2","chunks":15,"words":1363,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.009717448614537716,"party_welcome":0.6080448031425476,"social_amenities":0.011527284979820251,"party_restriction":0.99847012758255,"nearby_nightlife":0.993994414806366,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This beautifully curated one-bedroom condo is nestled inside the iconic Graham Building, built in 1924 and overlooking one of Savannah's most beloved squares, Oglethorpe Square. The moment you step inside, you'll feel the warmth of nearly a century of Southern history blended seamlessly with thoughtful modern updates designed for today's traveler. This mid-century modern retreat offers the ideal balance of vintage character and contemporary comfort. Original architectural details have been lovingly preserved throughout, while fresh updates ensure you enjoy every modern convenience during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.756619354244322e-05,"social_amenities":0.009717448614537716,"party_restriction":0.0004167544248048216,"nearby_nightlife":0.004405951127409935}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Hair & Body shampoo Hair & Body conditioner Hair & Body body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In building Free dryer \u2013 In building Hangers Bed linens Cotton California Design linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Heating and cooling Window AC unit Portable heater Home safety Exterior security cameras on property This apartment is located in a condominium that has cameras on the access points and in the hallways.","section":"AMENITIES","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022842781618237495,"social_amenities":0.0029220448341220617,"party_restriction":0.0009669584105722606,"nearby_nightlife":0.003360496833920479}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"A hair dryer and iron are provided so you're always ready for dinner reservations or a night out on the town. Located directly on Oglethorpe Square, you are steps away from Savannah's finest dining, shopping, and nightlife. The famous Owens-Thomas House & Slave Quarters museum is right across the square. Walk two blocks to the Olde Pink House, stroll to Leopold's Ice Cream in under a minute, or explore Broughton Street's boutiques and galleries. River Street, Forsyth Park, City Market, and dozens of historic squares are all within an easy walk from your front door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6080448031425476,"social_amenities":0.0019351027440279722,"party_restriction":0.00157880166079849,"nearby_nightlife":0.993994414806366}},{"text":"Step into Southern charm at this beautifully curated 1924 condo on Oglethorpe Square, in the heart of Savannah's Historic District! Walk to River Street, Broughton St. shops & Forsyth Park. Highlights: - City living at its finest - Metered street parking - Comfy King bed - Fully equipped kitchen - Smart TV - Self check-in via smart lock - Steps to amazing restaurants & lively nightlife - Sound machine, earplugs, and eye masks for restful sleep - Pack 'n Play available Stay Here! The space SVR-03247 Welcome to your perfect Savannah getaway!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003210984286852181,"social_amenities":0.004087856039404869,"party_restriction":0.002063403371721506,"nearby_nightlife":0.9413154721260071}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Check-in is contactless via smart lock, with your unique code delivered through the app's messaging interface on the day of your arrival, around 3 pm. A digital guidebook packed with our favorite restaurant recommendations, activity suggestions, and local tips is provided to help you make the most of your Savannah experience. You can find the digital guidebook in the Guest App. The link to the Guest App is sent shortly after booking via the booking platform's messaging interface. *Note: The apartment is in a building with local residents and other short-term travelers. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023608245828654617,"social_amenities":0.011527284979820251,"party_restriction":0.4669336974620819,"nearby_nightlife":0.9819375276565552}},{"text":"Check-in is contactless via smart lock, with your unique code delivered through the app's messaging interface on the day of your arrival, around 3 pm. A digital guidebook packed with our favorite restaurant recommendations, activity suggestions, and local tips is provided to help you make the most of your Savannah experience. You can find the digital guidebook in the Guest App. The link to the Guest App is sent shortly after booking via the booking platform's messaging interface. *Note: The apartment is in a building with local residents and other short-term travelers. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":98,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023608245828654617,"social_amenities":0.011527284979820251,"party_restriction":0.4669336974620819,"nearby_nightlife":0.9819375276565552}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Whether you're planning a romantic escape, a solo adventure, a girls' trip, or a relaxing business stay, this historic condo delivers the location, character, and comfort to make your Savannah visit truly unforgettable. Professionally managed by Stay Here Property Management for a seamless, five-star experience from booking to checkout. *Note: The apartment is in a building with local residents and other short-term travelers. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance. Parties and events are strictly prohibited. The original windows, combined with a busy city allow light and sound throughout the day.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":76,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013888899411540478,"social_amenities":0.0011090312618762255,"party_restriction":0.99847012758255,"nearby_nightlife":0.9750013947486877}},{"text":"Parties and events are strictly prohibited. The original windows, combined with a busy city allow light and sound throughout the day. We provide earplugs, face masks, and a sound machine to make up for this, but light sleepers might consider making adjustments to their sleep routine to adjust for these typical city-living conditions. Other things to note Guests enter the building through a shared entrance and have full, exclusive access to the entire condo (apt 2) during their stay. The unit is on the first floor of the building, so besides the three short steps to the front entrance, there are no stairs to navigate to reach the apartment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002490346669219434,"social_amenities":0.0005813168245367706,"party_restriction":0.9971433281898499,"nearby_nightlife":0.979732871055603}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"A hair dryer and iron are provided so you're always ready for dinner reservations or a night out on the town. Located directly on Oglethorpe Square, you are steps away from Savannah's finest dining, shopping, and nightlife. The famous Owens-Thomas House & Slave Quarters museum is right across the square. Walk two blocks to the Olde Pink House, stroll to Leopold's Ice Cream in under a minute, or explore Broughton Street's boutiques and galleries. River Street, Forsyth Park, City Market, and dozens of historic squares are all within an easy walk from your front door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6080448031425476,"social_amenities":0.0019351027440279722,"party_restriction":0.00157880166079849,"nearby_nightlife":0.993994414806366}},{"text":"Check-in is contactless via smart lock, with your unique code delivered through the app's messaging interface on the day of your arrival, around 3 pm. A digital guidebook packed with our favorite restaurant recommendations, activity suggestions, and local tips is provided to help you make the most of your Savannah experience. You can find the digital guidebook in the Guest App. The link to the Guest App is sent shortly after booking via the booking platform's messaging interface. *Note: The apartment is in a building with local residents and other short-term travelers. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023608245828654617,"social_amenities":0.011527284979820251,"party_restriction":0.4669336974620819,"nearby_nightlife":0.9819375276565552}}]}}}],"comp