an be used to hand wash dishes. There is not laundry in the studio, however there is coin laundry available in the building basement if needed. Parking is not included, but there is a city parking garage across the street, as well as city metered street parking. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002799984358716756,"social_amenities":0.0012260724324733019,"party_restriction":0.0015977800358086824,"nearby_nightlife":0.00961171742528677}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Laundromat nearby Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023716583382338285,"social_amenities":0.0037181179504841566,"party_restriction":0.00027685018721967936,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024347896687686443}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Laundromat nearby Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023716583382338285,"social_amenities":0.0037181179504841566,"party_restriction":0.00027685018721967936,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024347896687686443}},{"text":"Paid parking off premises Single level home No stairs in home Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property Unavailable: Washer Washer Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property. Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010400583414593711,"social_amenities":0.0019951416179537773,"party_restriction":0.0008433524053543806,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004252924700267613}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"You\u2019ll also enjoy complimentary Wi-Fi and a 40\u201d smart TV for relaxing nights in. We can\u2019t wait to welcome you! SVR-03134 Other things to note Please note that the studio does not have a full size kitchen, just a kitchenette. There is not a dishwasher, but a second pedestal sink between the kitchenette and bathroom that can be used to hand wash dishes. There is not laundry in the studio, however there is coin laundry available in the building basement if needed. Parking is not included, but there is a city parking garage across the street, as well as city metered street parking. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002799984358716756,"social_amenities":0.0012260724324733019,"party_restriction":0.0015977800358086824,"nearby_nightlife":0.00961171742528677}},{"text":"Welcome to Savannah! We are thrilled to host you in this updated studio apartment nestled inside the iconic 1920s Graham Building, right on picturesque Oglethorpe Square. With original exterior brick details, hardwood floors, a queen-size bed, and well stocked kitchenette, the space blends historic charm with modern comfort. Just steps from shops, caf\u00e9s, museums, and the iconic riverfront, this studio is perfect for solo travelers or couples looking to stay in the heart of the Historic District. The space Stay in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District in this beautifully updated first-floor studio.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013427805970422924,"social_amenities":0.0017828310374170542,"party_restriction":0.0010102157248184085,"nearby_nightlife":0.3040356934070587}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to Savannah! We are thrilled to host you in this updated studio apartment nestled inside the iconic 1920s Graham Building, right on picturesque Oglethorpe Square. With original exterior brick details, hardwood floors, a queen-size bed, and well stocked kitchenette, the space blends historic charm with modern comfort. Just steps from shops, caf\u00e9s, museums, and the iconic riverfront, this studio is perfect for solo travelers or couples looking to stay in the heart of the Historic District. The space Stay in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District in this beautifully updated first-floor studio.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013427805970422924,"social_amenities":0.0017828310374170542,"party_restriction":0.0010102157248184085,"nearby_nightlife":0.3040356934070587}},{"text":"Tucked into one of downtown\u2019s most picturesque neighborhoods, this charming retreat blends historic character with thoughtful modern touches. Unwind on the plush queen memory foam mattress and enjoy fresh bed linens and soft towels provided for your stay. A Pack \u2019n Play is available upon request for guests traveling with little ones. Best suited for solo travelers or couples, this cozy space offers a peaceful place to recharge. The recently renovated bathroom features a spacious walk-in tiled shower and is filled with natural light. The retro-style kitchenette is well-stocked with essentials including a mini fridge, microwave, blender, coffee maker, and dishes\u2014perfect for preparing light meals or your morning brew.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.997520490083843e-05,"social_amenities":0.0015843805158510804,"party_restriction":0.000977974385023117,"nearby_nightlife":0.011095546185970306}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47019","address":"210 E STATE ST #10","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1252245861453155896","title":"Historic Downtown Studio| Prime Location| Walkable","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1252245861453155896","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03037"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1252245861453155896","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"5ac54a9ec92fc432c3fd568ef8e08e566f02d3a37049d81b54cd2b4e72f46b69","chunks":6,"words":579,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.013897497206926346,"party_welcome":0.005937316920608282,"social_amenities":0.013897497206926346,"party_restriction":0.0015492538223043084,"nearby_nightlife":0.8031859993934631,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The updated bathroom adds extra luxury to your stay, complete with Public Goods brand toiletries and fluffy fresh towels. Relax and unwind in the cozy living area, complete with a TV and high-speed Wi-Fi, ideal for catching up on your favorite shows or planning your next outing. The pub-style table and chairs create a perfect spot for enjoying meals or setting up a temporary work station. Whether you are traveling through town on business or pleasure, we know you will love the convenience and comfort of this condo! We cant wait to host you! SVR-03037 Guest access Guest will have access to the entire studio condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005937316920608282,"social_amenities":0.013897497206926346,"party_restriction":0.0015492538223043084,"nearby_nightlife":0.026050975546240807}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Public Goods shampoo Public Goods conditioner Public Goods body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Air conditioning Portable fans Heating Home safety Smoke alarm First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer","section":"AMENITIES","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030340004013851285,"social_amenities":0.012687420472502708,"party_restriction":0.00022666138829663396,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009190916316583753}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The updated bathroom adds extra luxury to your stay, complete with Public Goods brand toiletries and fluffy fresh towels. Relax and unwind in the cozy living area, complete with a TV and high-speed Wi-Fi, ideal for catching up on your favorite shows or planning your next outing. The pub-style table and chairs create a perfect spot for enjoying meals or setting up a temporary 