ah\u2019s Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017783786461222917,"social_amenities":0.001472482574172318,"party_restriction":0.002998561365529895,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012171146227046847}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy a renovated bathroom stocked with essentials. One of the studio\u2019s standout features is the private balcony, offering a perfect spot to sip coffee or a glass of wine while soaking in the Savannah breeze and the sounds of the city. Whether you're traveling solo or as a couple, the layout is ideal for relaxing after a day of wandering the city\u2019s cobblestone streets. Located just off Oglethorpe Square, this studio places you within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s most iconic landmarks\u2014River Street, Broughton Street, Colonial Park Cemetery, and dozens of caf\u00e9s, shops, and squares are just steps from your door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005281677003949881,"social_amenities":0.0024334327317774296,"party_restriction":0.0004958870122209191,"nearby_nightlife":0.9754766821861267}},{"text":"The neighborhood is quiet yet central, offering the best of both worlds for travelers looking to explore with ease. This is the perfect home base for a Savannah visit! We can't wait to host you! SVR-02110 Guest access Paid street parking and nearby city garages are easily available. You\u2019ll have keyless entry for easy self check-in. Please note that the apartment is on the second floor. There is not an elevator, just stair access. Other things to note The apartment is on the smaller side and truly best for 1-2 travelers. There is not a dishwasher in the kitchen Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001986374700209126,"social_amenities":0.000518507556989789,"party_restriction":0.02484007552266121,"nearby_nightlife":0.37528327107429504}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47039","address":"210 E STATE ST #30",