great restaurant, shop, or historic building to explore. The condo comfortably sleeps 2 couples or is perfect for a family.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018856266979128122,"social_amenities":0.0023358669131994247,"party_restriction":0.0011727074161171913,"nearby_nightlife":0.9733186364173889}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Extra pillows and blankets Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Stove Oven Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Paid parking off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022180665109772235,"social_amenities":0.01739845797419548,"party_restriction":0.0008701837505213916,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005642357282340527}},{"text":"Located in the heart of the Historic Center of Savannah between Oglethorpe Square and Broughton Street. Walking distance to all of the best shops, restaurants, museums, and tourist attractions including River Street, Bay Street, City Market, SCAD, and Forsyth Park! We are located in The Graham building - a truly unbeatable location! STVR Certificate # SVR-02883 The space Perfect location and a cozy space when you need a break from the hustle, bustle, and night life Savannah has to offer. Walk in any direction and you\u2019ll find a great restaurant, shop, or historic building to explore. The condo comfortably sleeps 2 couples or is perfect for a family.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018856266979128122,"social_amenities":0.0023358669131994247,"party_restriction":0.0011727074161171913,"nearby_nightlife":0.9733186364173889}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Smoking is forbidden, even outdoors around this property. Smokers will need to cross the street to smoke on public property but Oglethorpe Square is right across the street. The couch in the living room is a queen-sized pull out bed. This lovely and historical building will hopefully enhance the quality of your stay. As such, heating comes from natural gas and cooling comes from a window AC unit which work quite well within the space. This is a historic building and there is no elevator. We are on the third floor","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012153376883361489,"social_amenities":0.0007268773624673486,"party_restriction":0.002784720156341791,"nearby_nightlife":0.010175919160246849}},{"text":"We have two new window units so it stays cool or warm year round! Guest access All living areas are private and only accessible by you. There is a shared pay laundry room on the lower level of the building. Other things to note There is no need for a vehicle at this location but if you have one you can park at meters for 24-48 hours by purchasing a \u201cvisitor parking pass\u201d from the nearby parking service office. The day pass voters any meter downtown as well as any city-owned parking decks. Parking is available on the street or in the public garage across from the building.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001679437846178189,"social_amenities":0.00048791244626045227,"party_restriction":0.002241389825940132,"nearby_nightlife":0.003741766093298793}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located in the heart of the Historic Center of Savannah between Oglethorpe Square and Broughton Street. Walking distance to all of the best shops, restaurants, museums, and tourist attractions including River Street, Bay Street, City Market, SCAD, and Forsyth 