ection and you\u2019ll find a great restaurant, shop, or historic building to explore. The condo comfortably sleeps 2 guests. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004951013252139091,"social_amenities":0.04015442356467247,"party_restriction":0.01283215545117855,"nearby_nightlife":0.9698717594146729}},{"text":"Smokers will need to cross the street to smoke on public property but Oglethorpe Square is right across the street. This lovely and historical building will hopefully enhance the quality of your stay. As such, heating comes from natural gas and cooling comes from two window AC units which work quite well within the space. ***Please note we require all guests to submit a valid form of ID through our check in form prior to check in. If you do not submit the ID we will not be able to send you check in instructions.*** Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001368181692669168,"social_amenities":0.0013714476954191923,"party_restriction":0.0026317855808883905,"nearby_nightlife":0.018329842016100883}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 47044","address":"210 E STATE ST #35","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1620416454978585958","title":"Oglethorpe Square Historic Apt |Central & Walkable","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1620416454978585958","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03233"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1620416454978585958","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"75eab2bac5589a8b5f5844086bcf7e97d14fa352b1e06606d520a6039c8273c7","chunks":7,"words":603,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006425024010241032,"party_welcome":0.00028673154884018004,"social_amenities":0.006425024010241032,"party_restriction":0.005767031107097864,"nearby_nightlife":0.9660557508468628,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The home features a cozy yet spacious bedroom with a comfortable queen bed and ample closet space, a bright living area with large windows and plush sofa, an updated bathroom with modern fixtures and a shower/tub combo, and a fully updated kitchen equipped for meals at home. Guests can enjoy a smart TV in the living room, and free high-speed WiFi. Every detail has been designed to create a peaceful, elevated retreat after days spent exploring the Historic District. Please note the condo is located on the third floor of a historic building with no elevator, and a Pack \u2019n Play is available upon request. SVR-03233 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016534238238818944,"social_amenities":0.006425024010241032,"party_restriction":0.002406294923275709,"nearby_nightlife":0.005433255340903997}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Portable fans Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Stove Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Laundromat nearby","section":"AMENITIES","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002349603601032868,"social_amenities":0.0023980799596756697,"party_restriction":0.00029906752752140164,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016283566365018487}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Welcome to your Savannah retreat inside the historic Graham Building on enchanting Oglethorpe Square in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This cozy one-bedroom, one-bath condo blends preserved historic charm with modern updates in an unbeatable walkable location. Steps from parks, restaurants, and shopping. This condo is perfect for romantic getaways, girls\u2019 trips, or a relaxing Savannah escape. The space We are so excited to have you visit this thoughtfully curated apartment and hope you will instantly feel at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028673154884018004,"social_amenities":0.0012349467724561691,"party_restriction":0.0013041773345321417,"nearby_nightlife":0.2952308654785156}},{"text":"As with most historic urban areas, you may occasionally hear city sounds (ie city garbage trucks, construction, sirens, ship horns, etc). We do provide a sound machine to help drown out any noises. We do try to make guests aware that Fridays and Saturdays can be loud due to our close proximity to Savannah's night life. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002850072050932795,"social_amenities":0.001513884519226849,"party_restriction":0.0014459326630458236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9660557508468628}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The home features a cozy yet spacious bedroom with a comfortable queen bed and ample closet space, a bright living area with large windows and plush sofa, an updated bathroom with modern fixtures and a shower/tub combo, and a fully updated kitchen equipped for meals at home. Guests can enjoy a smart TV in the living room, and free high-speed WiFi. Every detail has been designed to create a peaceful, elevated retreat after days spent exploring the Historic District. Please note the condo is located on the third floor of a historic building with no elevator, and a Pack \u2019n Play is available upon request. SVR-03233 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016534238238818944,"social_amenities":0.006425024010241032,"party_restriction":0.002406294923275709,"nearby_nightlife":0.005433255340903997}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Portable fans Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Stove Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Laundromat nearby","section":"AMENITIES","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002349603601032868,"social_amenities":0.0023980799596756697,"party_restriction":0.00029906752752140164,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016283566365018487}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"However there is a city parking garage right next door at 100 E State Street, Savannah GA 31041. There is also metered city street parking close by. You can download the Park Savannah app prior to arrival to pay via an app. There is not a dishwasher, but all other kitchen necessities are provided and available for guest use. Please note the smart TV offers apps to streaming services. We do not offer cable or local channels. Wifi is provided and included in the stay. Oglethorpe Square offers a quieter, more serene side of downtown Savannah while still being incredibly central and walkable.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018047589401248842,"social_amenities":0.0006470727967098355,"party_restriction":0.005767031107097864,"nearby_nightlife":0.8020113706588745}},{"text":"The home features a cozy yet spacious bedroom with a comfortable queen bed and ample closet space, a bright living area with large windows and plush sofa, an updated bathroom with modern fixtures and a shower/tub combo, and a fully updated kitchen equipped for meals at home. Guests can enjoy a smart TV in the living room, and free high-speed WiFi. Every detail has been designed to create a peaceful, elevated retreat after days spent exploring the Historic District. Please note the condo is located on the third floor of a historic building with no elevator, and a Pack \u2019n Play is available upon request. SVR-03233 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016534238238818944,"social_amenities":0.006425024010241032,"party_restriction":0.002406294923275709,"nearby_nightlife":0.005433255340903997}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"As with most historic urban areas, you may occasionally hear city sounds (ie city garbage trucks, construction, sirens, ship horns, etc). We do provide a sound machine to help drown out any noises. We do try to make guests aware that Fridays and Saturdays can be loud due to our close proximity to Savannah's night life. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002850072050932795,"social_amenities":0.001513884519226849,"party_restriction":0.0014459326630458236,"nearby_nightlife":0.9660557508468628}},{"text":"However there is a city parking garage right next door at 100 E State Street, Savannah GA 31041. There is also metered city street parking close by. You can download the Park Savannah app prior to arrival to pay via an app. There is not a dishwasher, but all other kitchen necessities are provided and available for guest use. Please note the sm