"social_amenities":0.25229060649871826,"party_restriction":0.06107421591877937,"nearby_nightlife":0.9938486218452454}},{"text":"This home is ideally located within a short walk to many of Savannah\u2019s historic points-of-interest and incredible selection of dining options. Around the corner from the cutest gift shops - Salacia Salts' gift shop with Savannah-artist made gifts owned by Savannah's entrepreneur of the year (2019), Cup2Cup Coffee for a cup of joe, and Savannah's best thai restaurant (PJ's Thai). You\u2019ll be well situated to explore Savannah\u2019s rich history with the Owens Thomas House and the Davenport House Museum both just a block away. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003237017954234034,"social_amenities":0.005638538394123316,"party_restriction":0.000846901792101562,"nearby_nightlife":0.8865098357200623}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 49002","address":"424 E STATE ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24005004637","date":"2024-01-05","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"422 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 49011","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24098103137","date":"2024-04-07","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"422 E State St","recorded_pin":"20004 49011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1427192348286732408","title":"Historic District Hideaway | Renovated Garden Apt","url":"https://w