th fresh linens, extra pillows and plenty of space to unpack. You\u2019ll also find hangers, an iron, steamer and extra bedding tucked away in the closet. Traveling with a little one? We also provide a Pack \u2019n Play.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006595596205443144,"social_amenities":0.004892381373792887,"party_restriction":0.0005030283355154097,"nearby_nightlife":0.017885571345686913}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The bright, updated kitchen is fully stocked with stainless steel appliances, cookware, dishes, glassware + the everyday essentials you\u2019ll need during your stay. We also stock na small coffee bar with a Keurig and coffee essentials for your mornings. Whether you\u2019re actually planning to cook or just need somewhere to keep the leftovers from all the Savannah restaurants you\u2019re going to try, you\u2019ll have everything you need. Enjoy a comfortable queen bed with fresh linens, extra pillows and plenty of space to unpack. You\u2019ll also find hangers, an iron, steamer and extra bedding tucked away in the closet. Traveling with a little one? We also provide a Pack \u2019n Play.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006595596205443144,"social_amenities":0.004892381373792887,"party_restriction":0.0005030283355154097,"nearby_nightlife":0.017885571345686913}},{"text":"The newly renovated bathroom is bright, fresh and thoughtfully updated with a spacious vanity, beautiful lighting and a stunning tiled walk-in shower. We also provide fluffy towels and basic toiletries so you can pack a little lighter. You\u2019re right in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, surrounded by the beautiful architecture, moss-draped live oaks, historic squares + cobblestone streets that probably made you want to visit Savannah in the first place. River Street is about a five-minute walk away, and you can easily walk to Broughton Street, restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, museums, bars and so many of Savannah\u2019s most-loved spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005830655572935939,"social_amenities":0.00167077814694494,"party_restriction":0.002169962041079998,"nearby_nightlife":0.9868244528770447}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Outlet covers Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021765065321233124,"social_amenities":0.0073400535620749,"party_restriction":0.00019482187053654343,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008355614845640957}},{"text":"The bright, updated kitchen is fully stocked with stainless steel appliances, cookware, dishes, glassware + the everyday essentials you\u2019ll need during your stay. We also stock na small coffee bar with a Keurig and coffee essentials for your mornings. Whether you\u2019re actually planning to cook or just need somewhere to keep the leftovers from all the Savannah restaurants you\u2019re going to try, you\u2019ll have everything you need. Enjoy a comfortable queen bed with fresh linens, extra pillows and plenty of space to unpack. You\u2019ll also find hangers, an iron, steamer and extra bedding tucked away in the closet. Traveling with a little one? We also provide a Pack \u2019n Play.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006595596205443144,"social_amenities":0.004892381373792887,"party_restriction":0.0005030283355154097,"nearby_nightlife":0.017885571345686913}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"And when you are ready to call it a night, you get to leave some of the busier tourist areas behind and come home to a quieter little corner of the Historic District. A FEW OF OUR FAVORITE DETAILS \u2022 Walkable Historic District location \u2022 Approximately 5 minutes to River Street \u2022 Quiet residential street \u2022 Private ground-level entrance \u2022 Keyless self check-in \u2022 Comfortable queen bedroom \u2022 Fully stocked kitchen \u2022 Keurig + stocked coffee bar \u2022 Fluffy towels + fresh linens \u2022 High-speed WiFi \u2022 Dedicated workspace \u2022 Smart TV \u2022 Beautifully renovated bathroom \u2022 Historic brick floors PARKING","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026570967747829854,"social_amenities":0.002082248218357563,"party_restriction":0.0023119805846363306,"nearby_nightlife":0.10196022689342499}},{"text":"The newly renovated bathroom is bright, fresh and thoughtfully updated with a spacious vanity, beautiful lighting and a stunning tiled walk-in shower. We also provide fluffy towels and basic toiletries so you can pack a little lighter. You\u2019re right in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, surrounded by the beautiful architecture, moss-draped live oaks, historic squares + cobblestone streets that probably made you want to visit Savannah in the first place. River Street is about a five-minute walk away, and you can easily walk to Broughton Street, restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, museums, bars and so many of Savannah\u2019s most-loved spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005830655572935939,"social_amenities":0.00167077814694494,"party_restriction":0.002169962041079998,"nearby_nightlife":0.9868244528770447}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The newly renovated bathroom is bright, fresh and thoughtfully updated with a spacious vanity, beautiful lighting and a stunning tiled walk-in shower. We also provide fluffy towels and basic toiletries so you can pack a little lighter. You\u2019re right in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, surrounded by the beautiful architecture, moss-draped live oaks, historic squares + cobblestone streets that probably made you want to visit Savannah in the first place. River Street is about a five-minute walk away, and you can easily walk to Broughton Street, restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, museums, bars and so many of Savannah\u2019s most-loved spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005830655572935939,"social_amenities":0.00167077814694494,"party_restriction":0.002169962041079998,"nearby_nightlife":0.9868244528770447}},{"text":"If you\u2019re looking for a Savannah getaway where you can walk out the door and immediately feel like you\u2019re in the middle of everything you came here to experience, this is it! Tucked away on a quieter street in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, this beautifully renovated one-bedroom apartment is just a short walk from River Street, Broughton Street, Savannah\u2019s historic squares, coffee shops, restaurants, shopping + so much more. It really gives you the best of both worlds. You can spend your days exploring Savannah on foot, then come home to a quiet, comfortable space to slow down and relax at the end of the day.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013191965990699828,"social_amenities":0.0035803092177957296,"party_restriction":0.0008046646835282445,"nearby_nightlife":0.5721997022628784}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20004 57003","address":"302 E PRESIDENT ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26262271889","date":"2026-09-19","type":"GAS LEAK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"302 E President St","recorded_pin":"20004 57003","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"565311972787013292","title":"Heated Pool Access, Exquisite Historic Home","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/565311972787013292","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02393"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"565311972787013292","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"15069d59e97b3bc85720f5e5c7feb9fc52c5ea176cc2dbc5fddc91060f9fc0c4","chunks":15,"words":1438,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.8893377184867859,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9519941806793213,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":255,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005331269348971546,"social_amenities":0.030625179409980774,"party_restriction":0.0021666812244802713,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006108754314482212}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"As one of our best vacation rentals Savannah GA, we decked out the Douglass House's living room with a large flatscreen TV and enough high-end furniture to comfortably seat your whole party. Offering views of outdoors thanks to a pair of windows \u2014 making the living room a perfect place to relax and get away from the summer heat and humidity. Kitchen The kitchen is decked out with stainless steel appliances, including a double-door fridge with a water dispenser, gas range and stove, range hood, microwave, toaster oven, and dishwasher.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8893377184867859,"social_amenities":0.002431029686704278,"party_restriction":0.000210108351893723,"nearby_nightlife":0.04277002066373825}},{"text":"Lounge area with dry bar, perfect for evening cocktails Full kitchen with stainless steel appliances Dining area with seating for 6, coffee bar, and flatscreen TV Bedroom 1: King bed, flatscreen TV, en suite full bathroom with glass enclosed tile shower Bedroom 2: King bed, flatscreen TV, en suite jack and jill style bathroom Bedroom 3: Queen bed, en suite jack and jill style bathroom Bathroom 2: Double vanity, glass enclosed tile shower Half bathroom downstairs Washer/Dryer Iron/Steamer First-Aid Kit Picnic Basket Bluetooth Radio Speaker White Noise Machines in Bedrooms with USB Port Magnified Mirrors in Bathrooms xFi Pod Wifi Extender","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0022125113755464554,"social_amenities":0.003931582439690828,"party_restriction":0.00031448237132281065,"nearby_nightlife":0.9006717205047607}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"The Douglass House kitchen includes many tasteful accents, such as the gold cabinet pulls, which beautifully complement this Savannah vacation rentals' tasteful blue and white color scheme. There is also a dining area off the kitchen for those big family meals. Featuring a large wraparound bench, it seats at least 6 comfortably. And don't miss a beat of the game with the TV conveniently located there. Lounge Area The Douglass House features a cozy yet sizable lounge area complete with a dry bar. A pass-through window from the kitchen allows your bartender to be within plain view.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008704275824129581,"social_amenities":0.04112663120031357,"party_restriction":0.0004288771888241172,"nearby_nightlife":0.7174286246299744}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Douglass House's backyard also comes with a new deck, which leads to rustic red brick flooring. The backyard's boundaries are fenced in with a similarly rustic, dark green fence, which features a double-door gate that's wide enough to fit most vehicles. Nearby Locations Thanks to its convenient location on the northern side of Savannah's Historic District, Douglass House is right next to countless nationally renowned attractions that are absolutely rich with cultural and historical value. Oglethorpe Square Oglethorpe Square is found on the second row of the five rows of squares in Savannah \u2014 namely, on the intersection of Abercorn Street and East President Street, where you'll be staying.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007753688842058182,"social_amenities":0.005625210702419281,"party_restriction":0.0034873264376074076,"nearby_nightlife":0.9519941806793213}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Douglass House's backyard also comes with a new deck, which leads to rustic red brick flooring. The backyard's boundaries are fenced in with a similarly rustic, dark green fence, which features a double-door gate that's wide enough to fit most vehicles. Nearby Locations Thanks to its convenient location on the northern side of Savannah's Historic District, Douglass House is right next to countless nationally renowned attractions that are absolutely rich with cultural and historical value. Oglethorpe Square Oglethorpe Square is found on the second row of the five rows of squares in Savannah \u2014 namely, on the intersection of Abercorn Street and East President Street, where you'll be staying.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007753688842058182,"social_amenities":0.005625210702419281,"party_restriction":0.0034873264376074076,"nearby_nightlife":0.9519941806793213}},{"text":"Lounge area with dry bar, perfect for evening cocktails Full kitchen with stainless steel appliances Dining area with seating for 6, coffee bar, and flatscreen TV Bedroom 1: King bed, flatscreen TV, en suite full bathroom with glass enclosed tile shower Bedroom 2: King bed, flatscreen TV, en suite jack and jill style bathroom Bedroom 3: Queen bed, en suite jack and jill style bathroom Bathroom 2: Double vanity, glass enclosed tile shower Half bathroom downstairs Washer/Dryer Iron/Steamer First-Aid Kit Picnic Basket Bluetooth Radio Speaker White Noise Machines in Bedrooms with USB Port Magnified Mirrors in Bathrooms xFi Pod Wifi Extender","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0022125113755464554,"social_amenities":0.003931582439690828,"party_restriction":0.00031448237132281065,"nearby_nightlife":0.9006717205047607}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 04006A","address":"510 E BRYAN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1}},"calls":[{"number":"26073072739","date":"2026-03-14","type":"SHOTSPOTTER CALL","outcome":"Other","recorded_add