r utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Stainless steel single oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021606433438137174,"social_amenities":0.014639602974057198,"party_restriction":0.00024105091870296746,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010934246238321066}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Please remember that sound carries very well throughout Savannah, most especially in courtyards, porches, patios, and verandas. Guests must not exceed the listed occupancy of our property - 4. Guests must not exceed the maximum parking allotted to each property. Guests must park only in designated parking places. Please be mindful of street sweeping z.ones and parking meters throughout the city. Savannah does have leash laws and leashes are required for any pet taken off property. Pet waste must be cleaned up immediately. While \"to-go\" cups are legal in parts of the city, public intoxication is unlawful and may result in heavy fines and/or incarceration.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013806055358145386,"social_amenities":0.0019916261080652475,"party_restriction":0.9902659058570862,"nearby_nightlife":0.9244623184204102}},{"text":"In addition, we work closely with our neighbors to ensure the quality of life that residents and visitors both expect. Enclosed is information regarding neighborhood policies and local laws and regulations. Please keep in mind that violations of any of these rules can lead to fines or even eviction without refund. We know that you'll do your part to be a great neighbor in Savannah! Please be mindful of the City of Savannah Noise Ordinance. As you are staying in a residential area, we would like to remind you to observe neighborhood quiet times between the hours of 9pm - 8am.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002604522742331028,"social_amenities":0.0014372996520251036,"party_restriction":0.9886528849601746,"nearby_nightlife":0.3815914988517761}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2728 Savannah - Walk Everywhere + Free Parking! Welcome to your perfect Savannah getaway, ideally located on East Congress Street in the vibrant Historic District. Whether you're here for a romantic weekend, a girls\u2019 trip, or exploring the city\u2019s rich history, this charming townhome puts you just steps from everything that makes Savannah unforgettable. \ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Walk to it all: Stroll to River Street, Broughton Street shopping, Forsyth Park, top restaurants, and nightlife\u2014all just minutes away. The space \ud83c\udfe1The Space This thoughtfully designed 2-bedroom townhouse offers comfort, convenience, and a touch of Southern charm: \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Bedroom 1: King bed for a restful night\u2019s sleep, with ensuite bath","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012179020559415221,"social_amenities":0.0026912738103419542,"party_restriction":0.0013366331113502383,"nearby_nightlife":0.9672628045082092}},{"text":"Please remember that sound carries very well throughout Savannah, most especially in courtyards, porches, patios, and verandas. Guests must not exceed the listed occupancy of our property - 4. Guests must not exceed the maximum parking allotted to each property. Guests must park only in designated parking places. Please be mindful of street sweeping z.ones and parking meters throughout the city. Savannah does have leash laws and leashes are required for any pet taken off property. Pet waste must be cleaned up immediately. While \"to-go\" cups are legal in parts of the city, public intoxication is unlawful and may result in heavy fines and/or incarceration.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013806055358145386,"social_amenities":0.0019916261080652475,"party_restriction":0.9902659058570862,"nearby_nightlife":0.9244623184204102}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 13005A","address":"28 HOUSTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","