building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"Tastefully decorated with a neutral pallet, the living space has two couches, including a sleeper sofa, and a large flat screen TV. Just outside of the adjacent kitchen is a large wooden table with seating for six, perfect for dining in. The fully renovated kitchen has all the modern conveniences you could need, including stainless steel appliances. A full bathroom with a shower/tub combo is conveniently located on the first floor. At the top of the stairs you\u2019ll find the second full bathroom with a full vanity, tiled shower, and washer and dryer for added convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016784804756753147,"social_amenities":0.0017489667516201735,"party_restriction":0.0003614754241425544,"nearby_nightlife":0.003131926991045475}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The first bedroom offers a king bed, while the second bedroom offers a queen sized bed. The third bedroom has a unique built-in twin bed, a hideaway perfect for a child. This home around the corner from the world famous Pirate\u2019s House, which first opened in 1753 as an inn for seafarers. You\u2019ll be a short walk away from River Street, where you can shop and dine in renovated cotton warehouses as you watch ships make their way down the Savannah River. Just down the street is Cha Bella, a farm to table restaurant and popular location for wedding receptions. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04083879292011261,"social_amenities":0.7666004300117493,"party_restriction":0.0012315553613007069,"nearby_nightlife":0.8838891386985779}},{"text":"Self check-in Smar