ps, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005652735126204789,"social_amenities":0.016628306359052658,"party_restriction":0.0004841791233047843,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012214500457048416}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Thoughtful design elements\u2014like a decorative fireplace and curated furnishings\u2014honor the home\u2019s history while offering all the modern conveniences needed for a comfortable stay. The home includes two large bedrooms, each with generous closet space. The primary bedroom features an ensuite bath, while the second bedroom also offers a private bathroom, making this layout ideal for couples, families, or friends traveling together. A cozy living room, formal dining area, and fully equipped kitchen with a gas stove make relaxing or dining in effortless. An in-unit washer and dryer add extra convenience for longer stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008456796640530229,"social_amenities":0.0011798598570749164,"party_restriction":0.00024767383001744747,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016650421312078834}},{"text":"Southern charm continues outdoors with a wide front porch overlooking Broughton Street, perfect for morning coffee or evening people-watching as the city buzzes below. Located directly on Savannah\u2019s most vibrant street, you\u2019re steps from shopping, dining, galleries, and nightlife, with City Market and River Str