rn style home is packed with charm. With a wrap around porch, and six beds spread out amongst three-stories, Blue Manor is the ideal home base for your girls weekend or family reunion trips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6333727836608887,"social_amenities":0.9515519738197327,"party_restriction":0.016384262591600418,"nearby_nightlife":0.00689051253721118}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Guests will feel at ease with the warm furnishings and decor, making space for good conversation and some well-deserved R&R. Walk up a short set of stairs from the sidewalk to enter the main home. The main level features a bright and inviting living room, well-equipped kitchen with high-end stainless steel appliances, marble countertops, and a formal dining area. Cook a meal together as a way to catch up, or let a private chef do all the hard work! The open floor plan creates a convivial atmosphere, allowing you to keep your guests entertained. A powder room is tucked to the side, adjacent to the entrance to the back porch.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013168988516554236,"social_amenities":0.004689566325396299,"party_restriction":0.00022523738152813166,"nearby_nightlife":0.036417245864868164}},{"text":"Stepping out onto the back porch, you can find a bistro set, perfect for a morning cup of joe. Heading back toward the front entrance, you will find a wooden staircase that leads to the upper levels. The bedrooms on the second floor offer access to a second story wrap around porch, with views of the tree-lined historic district. The first bedroom, deemed the primary suite, is just off of the hallway at top of the stairs. This grand bedroom offers a king size bed, with crisp white linens and cozy accents.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014943575661163777,"social_amenities":0.0026672016829252243,"party_restriction":0.00036752139567397535,"nearby_nightlife":0.014146754518151283}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 14022","address":"507 CONGRESS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":9,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24195206565","date":"2024-07-13","type":"43 RESIDENTIAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"507 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14022","side":"direct"},{"number":"24019019146","date":"2024-01-19","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14023","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24041042283","date":"2024-02-10","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14023","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24053055130","date":"2024-02-22","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14023","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24109114805","date":"2024-04-18","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14023","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24118124645","date":"2024-04-27","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Congress St","recorded_pin":"20005 14023","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26068067122","d