nd serve meals to both travel companions and new friends. Flatscreen televisions are featured throughout the home for your viewing enjoyment. Central heat and air will ensure that you always feel comfortable during your stay. This home features updated appliances, including a washer and dryer set. Of course, the home\u2019s exterior offers just as much beauty as its interior. Step outside to enjoy the fresh air and lush greenery of the city. The home features cozy balcony areas that are ideal for sipping sweet tea in a plush chair.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.201555073261261,"social_amenities":0.3406582474708557,"party_restriction":0.0002949925547000021,"nearby_nightlife":0.01659534126520157}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"It offers plenty of room to try out some Southern recipes and serve meals to both travel companions and new friends. Flatscreen televisions are featured throughout the home for your viewing enjoyment. Central heat and air will ensure that you always feel comfortable during your stay. This home features updated appliances, including a washer and dryer set. Of course, the home\u2019s exterior offers just as much beauty as its interior. Step outside to enjoy the fresh air and lush greenery of the city. The home features cozy balcony areas that are ideal for sipping sweet tea in a plush chair.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.201555073261261,"social_amenities":0.3406582474708557,"party_restriction":0.0002949925547000021,"nearby_nightlife":0.01659534126520157}},{"text":"Roam the bright, elegant halls of this gorgeous home when you arrive back from a day of sightseeing at historic estates or listening to live music on River Street. This estate is one of the most beautiful Savannah vacation rentals available because of how airy and open it is. You\u2019ll truly feel like a Southern socialite welcoming guests into your parlor with warmth and hospitality every time you throw open the doors to this home to greet visitors. This stunning retreat features four large bedrooms and three full baths. The large, inviting kitchen is the centerpiece of the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0024437960237264633,"social_amenities":0.0031423040200024843,"party_restriction":0.00031271777697838843,"nearby_nightlife":0.07443686574697495}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"It offers plenty of room to try out some Southern recipes and serve meals to both travel companions and new friends. Flatscreen televisions are featured throughout the home for your viewing enjoyment. Central heat and air will ensure that you always feel comfortable during your stay. This home features updated appliances, including a washer and dryer set. Of course, the home\u2019s exterior offers just as much beauty as its interior. Step outside to enjoy the fresh air and lush greenery of the city. The home features cozy balcony areas that are ideal for sipping sweet tea in a plush chair.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.201555073261261,"social_amenities":0.3406582474708557,"party_restriction":0.0002949925547000021,"nearby_n