 is a great idea because this wonderful neighborhood places guests within walking distance to many of the city's best spots. The space Stay in One of the Top Savannah Vacation Rentals Available The Congress Street Retreat is an ideal place to stay for couples, families and solo travelers.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005934105720371008,"social_amenities":0.033106714487075806,"party_restriction":0.0012123661581426859,"nearby_nightlife":0.8880543112754822}},{"text":"Roam the bright, elegant halls of this gorgeous home when you arrive back from a day of sightseeing at historic estates or listening to live music on River Street. This estate is one of the most beautiful Savannah vacation rentals available because of how airy and open it is. You\u2019ll truly feel like a Southern socialite welcoming guests into your parlor with warmth and hospitality every time you throw open the doors to this home to greet visitors. This stunning retreat features four large bedrooms and three full baths. The large, inviting kitchen is the centerpiece of the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0024437960237264633,"social_amenities":0.0031423040200024843,"party_restriction":0.00031271777697838843,"nearby_nightlife":0.07443686574697495}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 14023","address":"509 CONGRESS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":11,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24019019146","date":"2024-01-19","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","o