ww.airbnb.com/rooms/13097551","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02201"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"13097551","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"aa483648545c0bba98cd47947f350c89043c22e46fcd916e323ad001855bcc30","chunks":9,"words":854,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.13932998478412628,"party_welcome":0.9217894077301025,"social_amenities":0.13932998478412628,"party_restriction":0.0033537752460688353,"nearby_nightlife":0.9843215942382812,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Flatscreen TVs Set of Washer/Dryers 1 Full Kitchens Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking Balconies 2 Queen Aero Beds 1 ottoman pull out single bed Regular drip coffee maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037012749817222357,"social_amenities":0.13932998478412628,"party_restriction":0.0033537752460688353,"nearby_nightlife":0.0069734277203679085}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000664651277475059,"social_amenities":0.05372897535562515,"party_restriction":0.0018599426839500666,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004525571712292731}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Upstairs you will find a loft style room with a king-size and twin-size bed perfect for the little ones in your party. Finally a queen bed rounds out the properties sleeping quarters with it's easy access to the outstanding upstairs bathroom. You won't have to head too far south of your vacation homes Savannah to find the huge Colonial Park/Cemetery. This cemetery is about six acres in size and is the oldest municipal cemetery in the city. It has been closed since 1853 to interments, but was the main cemetery between 1750 and the time it closed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9217894077301025,"social_amenities":0.0011788454139605165,"party_restriction":0.0005947769386693835,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033377474173903465}},{"text":"One of the best things about Savannah is all the celebrations that take place throughout the year. Check with local information to see if any of these festivals might be during your stay. \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Tybee Island Beach Bum Parade in May \u2022 Savannah Asian Festival of June \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Oktoberfest in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Guest access 3 large bedrooms and an additional queen bed 3.5 full baths","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8131784200668335,"social_amenities":0.003059190697968006,"party_restriction":0.0013899283949285746,"nearby_nightlife":0.9843215942382812}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Flatscreen TVs Set of Washer/Dryers 1 Full Kitchens Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking Balconies 2 Queen Aero Beds 1 ottoman pull out single bed Regular drip coffee maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037012749817222357,"social_amenities":0.13932998478412628,"party_restriction":0.0033537752460688353,"nearby_nightlife":0.0069734277203679085}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000664651277475059,"social_amenities":0.05372897535562515,"party_restriction":0.0018599426839500666,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004525571712292731}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Flatscreen TVs Set of Washer/Dryers 1 Full Kitchens Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking Balconies 2 Queen Aero Beds 1 ottoman pull out single bed Regular drip coffee maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037012749817222357,"social_amenities":0.13932998478412628,"party_restriction":0.0033537752460688353,"nearby_nightlife":0.0069734277203679085}},{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"One of the best things about Savannah is all the celebrations that take place throughout the year. Check with local information to see if any of these festivals might be during your stay. \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Tybee Island Beach Bum Parade in May \u2022 Savannah Asian Festival of June \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Oktoberfest in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Guest access 3 large bedrooms and an additional queen bed 3.5 full baths","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8131784200668335,"social_amenities":0.003059190697968006,"party_restriction":0.0013899283949285746,"nearby_nightlife":0.9843215942382812}},{"text":"Savannah is well-known for its parks, and probably the most famous of these is Forsyth Park. Prominently featured in the \"Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil\" book and movie, this park is a popular place for both tourists and locals. You can wander the trails or have a picnic on the grounds. River Street is another big draw, with its rows of old cotton warehouses transformed into artist lofts, boutiques and gourmet restaurants. Of course, no trip to Savannah would be complete without taking one of the famous tours. You can choose from a spooky ghost tour, a horse drawn carriage tour or even a pub crawl.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016696680104359984,"social_amenities":0.003004603087902069,"party_restriction":0.00027866786695085466,"nearby_nightlife":0.9598131775856018}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 15006","address":"532 E BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25075073659","date":"2025-03-16","type":"24-4 TRESPASSING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"532 E Broughton St","recorded_pin":"20005 15006","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"30935412","title":"Bright on Broughton w/ Parking by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/30935412","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-01019"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"30935412","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"54bdd5a291608f8c3c2cb915bdc7679190cf0fd8e0eeff318dd436cf43183ff1","chunks":6,"words":532,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.005149302072823048,"party_welcome":0.0005348697304725647,"social_amenities":0.09796319901943207,"party_restriction":0.021042384207248688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9750036001205444,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stay within short walking distance to Savannah's most notable historic downtown attractions! This two-story clapboard house built in 1862 can host up to six Lucky guests and has ample parking for three cars! The space Guests looking for a truly local experience will fall in love with Blue on Broughton's historic charm. Nestled in the up-and-coming, East end of Broughton Street, this two-bedroom house built in 1862 is adorned with cast iron details and blue-painted clapboard siding. Inside, a beautifully appointed vacation rental with all the modern amenities expected to make your stay comfortable. The first floor boasts a converted parlor room with Queen bed, and an adjacent living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005348697304725647,"social_amenities":0.005149302072823048,"party_restriction":0.0016029304824769497,"nearby_nightlife":0.17180994153022766}},{"text":"These guests can use the nearby half bath, making getting ready a breeze. A full kitchen, equipped with every essential you'd need for a home-cooked meal, is just around the corner and has ample storage space for extended stays. A washer/dryer are also inside the home - great for young families! Upstairs, find two bedrooms with two full baths. The first bedroom features a King size bed, with the second bedroom furnished with a Queen. Both bedrooms have their own dressers, flat screen TVs, and en suite baths. Park your car in the private lot behind the home and explore Savannah by foot for the remainder of your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016353641694877297,"social_amenities":0.0029576243832707405,"party_restriction":0.0004231529892422259,"nearby_nightlife":0.05188131704926491}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Stay within short walking distance to Savannah's most notable historic downtown attractions! This two-story clapboard house built in 1862 can host up to six Lucky guests and has ample parking for three cars! The space Guests looking for a truly local experience will fall in love with Blue on Broughton's historic charm. Nestled in the up-and-coming, East end of Broughton Street, this two-bedroom house built in 1862 is adorned with cast iron details and blue-painted clapboard siding. Inside, a beautifully appointed vacation rental with all the modern amenities expected to make your stay comfortable. The first floor boasts a converted parlor room with Queen bed, and an adjacent living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005348697304725647,"social_amenities":0.005149302072823048,"party_restriction":0.0016029304824769497,"nearby_nightlife":0.17180994153022766}},{"text":"Blue on Broughton is located on the East end of Broughton Street: Savannah's \"main\" street scattered with some of the best shopping and dining in town. Most notably, guests are encouraged to stop by local favorites: Capital Bee Co., Hygge Savannah, East End Provisions, and Leopold's Ice Cream. What is parking like for this home? Guests receive private parking for 3 vehicles located behind the home, off-street and secure. Additional vehicles can find nearby metered parking on Broughton Street, which is enforced by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday from 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048450424219481647,"social_amenities":0.09796319901943207,"party_restriction":0.021042384207248688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9750036001205444}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Blue on Broughton is located on the East end of Broughton Street: Savannah's \"main\" street scattered with some of the best shopping and dining in town. Most notably, guests are encouraged to stop by local favorites: Capital Bee Co., Hygge Savannah, East End Provisions, and Leopold's Ice Cream. What is parking like for this home? Guests receive private parking for 3 vehicles located behind the home, off-street and secure. Additional vehicles can find nearby metered parking on Broughton Street, which is enforced by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday from 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048450424219481647,"social_amenities":0.09796319901943207,"party_restriction":0.021042384207248688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9750036001205444}},{"text":"Stay within short walking distance to Savannah's most notable historic downtown attractions! This two-story clapboard house built in 1862 can host up to six Lucky guests and has ample parking for three cars! The space Guests looking for a truly local experience will fall in love with Blue on Broughton's historic charm. Nestled in the up-and-coming, East end of Broughton Street, this two-bedroom house built in 1862 is adorned with cast iron details and blue-painted clapboard siding. Inside, a beautifully appointed vacation rental with all the modern amenities expected to make your stay comfortable. The first floor boasts a converted parlor room with Queen bed, and an adjacent living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005348697304725647,"social_amenities":0.005149302072823048,"party_restriction":0.0016029304824769497,"nearby_nightlife":0.17180994153022766}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Blue on Broughton is located on the East end of Broughton Street: Savannah's \"main\" street scattered with some of the best shopping and dining in town. Most notably, guests are encouraged to stop by local favorites: Capital Bee Co., Hygge Savannah, East End Provisions, and Leopold's Ice Cream. What is parking like for this home? Guests receive private parking for 3 vehicles located behind the home, off-street and secure. Additional vehicles can find nearby metered parking on Broughton Street, which is enforced by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday from 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048450424219481647,"social_amenities":0.09796319901943207,"party_restriction":0.021042384207248688,"nearby_nightlife":0.9750036001205444}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 