true},{"pin":"20005 15007","address":"530 E BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":13.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25075073659","date":"2025-03-16","type":"24-4 TRESPASSING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"532 E Broughton St","recorded_pin":"20005 15006","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"29510207","title":"Quaint Studio w/ Courtyard by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29510207","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01018"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"29510207","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1612b39adaf94c09a46bfc17e8b00c3a42298be44badb1620f4d00007a95bed1","chunks":7,"words":536,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007010945584625006,"party_welcome":0.0007353776600211859,"social_amenities":0.029250968247652054,"party_restriction":0.10389041155576706,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885348677635193,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"Walk into the cozy bedroom, decorated with Southern touches all while keeping your comfort a priority. The Queen size bed is dressed in hotel grade linens, professionally pressed between each visit. With two large closets and a standing chest of drawers, you're encouraged to unpack your suitcase and even consider extending your stay. The full kitchen is stocked with every essential you'd need to prepare a home cooked meal. Just beyond is the full bath with walk in shower. East Broughton Street is swiftly becoming a bustling part of the city, with new restaurant East End Provisions joining the locally-cherished Cha Bella. Be sure to stop into Capital Bee Co.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007353776600211859,"social_amenities":0.0017640726873651147,"party_restriction":0.0013225601287558675,"nearby_nightlife":0.016548728570342064}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Walk into the cozy bedroom, decorated with Southern touches all while keeping your comfort a priority. The Queen size bed is dressed in hotel grade linens, professionally pressed between each visit. With two large closets and a standing chest of drawers, you're encouraged to unpack your suitcase and even consider extending your stay. The full kitchen is stocked with every essential you'd need to prepare a home cooked meal. Just beyond is the full bath with walk in shower. East Broughton Street is swiftly becoming a bustling part of the city, with new restaurant East End Provisions joining the locally-cherished Cha Bella. Be sure to stop into Capital Bee Co.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007353776600211859,"social_amenities":0.0017640726873651147,"party_restriction":0.0013225601287558675,"nearby_nightlife":0.016548728570342064}},{"text":"for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopping and dining options. On our list for must-sees: The Paris Market, Halfmoon Outfitters, Leopold's Ice Cream, and The Prohibition Museum. Catch a trolley (or count those steps) and head South along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares, ending at the Fountain of Forsyth Park, one of Savannah's most famous attractions. Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005795297329314053,"social_amenities":0.029250968247652054,"party_restriction":0.10389041155576706,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885348677635193}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopping and dining options. On our list for must-sees: The Paris Market, Halfmoon Outfitters, Leopold's Ice Cream, and The Prohibition Museum. Catch a trolley (or count those steps) and head South along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares, ending at the Fountain of Forsyth Park, one of Savannah's most famous attractions. Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005795297329314053,"social_amenities":0.029250968247652054,"party_restriction":0.10389041155576706,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885348677635193}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopping and dining options. On our list for must-sees: The Paris Market, Halfmoon Outfitters, Leopold's Ice Cream, and The Prohibition Museum. Catch a trolley (or count those steps) and head South along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares, ending at the Fountain of Forsyth Park, one of Savannah's most famous attractions. Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005795297329314053,"social_amenities":0.029250968247652054,"party_restriction":0.10389041155576706,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885348677635193}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopping and dining options. On our list for must-sees: The Paris Market, Halfmoon Outfitters, Leopold's Ice Cream, and The Prohibition Museum. Catch a trolley (or count those steps) and head South along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares, ending at the Fountain of Forsyth Park, one of Savannah's most famous attractions. Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005795297329314053,"social_amenities":0.029250968247652054,"party_restriction":0.10389041155576706,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885348677635193}},{"text":"Enjoy the privacy of this upper-level studio apartment with full kitchen and balcony. Located at East Broughton and Houston, guests are a short walk away from the center of historic downtown Savannah. The space Walk past the main home and through the expansive courtyard to access this private, upper-level studio apartment - once a carriage house as part of this historic Savannah estate. Guests are within close distance to River Street, City Market, and Savannah's best shopping and dining along Broughton Street. A flight of stairs takes you from the courtyard to your second story carriage house entrance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.117552351905033e-05,"social_amenities":0.0009617716423235834,"party_restriction":0.0003730819735210389,"nearby_nightlife":0.04450789839029312}}]}}},{"listing_id":"29703566","title":"Easy-Access Broughton Studio by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29703566","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01018"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"29703566","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"ae793925a0fd5d2df64ab87989f85d69348b2265f0c24b01dda1989536e2db5f","chunks":7,"words":541,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007010945584625006,"party_welcome":0.0009333622874692082,"social_amenities":0.02814294770359993,"party_restriction":0.149393692612648,"nearby_nightlife":0.986820638179779,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"The cozy bedroom is around the corner, decorated with Southern touches all while keeping your comfort a priority. The Queen size bed is dressed in hotel grade linens, professionally pressed between each visit. With two large closets and a standing chest of drawers, you're encouraged to unpack your suitcase and even consider extending your stay. A washer and dryer can be found hidden behind closet doors. A full bath with walk in shower is attached to the kitchen. Towels and soap are complimentary to your stay. East Broughton Street is swiftly becoming a bustling part of the city, with new restaurant East End Provisions joining the locally-cherished Cha Bella.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009333622874692082,"social_amenities":0.0021522033493965864,"party_restriction":0.0020916296634823084,"nearby_nightlife":0.18601581454277039}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The cozy bedroom is around the corner, decorated with Southern touches all while keeping your comfort a priority. The Queen size bed is dressed in hotel grade linens, professionally pressed between each visit. With two large closets and a standing chest of drawers, you're encouraged to unpack your suitcase and even consider extending your stay. A washer and dryer can be found hidden behind closet doors. A full bath with walk in shower is attached to the kitchen. Towels and soap are complimentary to your stay. East Broughton Street is swiftly becoming a bustling part of the city, with new restaurant East End Provisions joining the locally-cherished Cha Bella.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009333622874692082,"social_amenities":0.0021522033493965864,"party_restriction":0.0020916296634823084,"nearby_nightlife":0.18601581454277039}},{"text":"Be sure to stop into Capital Bee Co. for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopping and dining options. On our list for must-sees: The Paris Market, Halfmoon Outfitters, Leopold's Ice Cream, and The Prohibition Museum. Catch a trolley (or count those steps) and head South along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares, ending at the Fountain of Forsyth Park, one of Savannah's most famous attractions. Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008407291606999934,"social_amenities":0.02814294770359993,"party_restriction":0.149393692612648,"nearby_nightlife":0.986820638179779}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Be sure to stop into Capital Bee Co. for a brick of local honey comb. Head due West towards the center of downtown and be greeted with Savannah's best shopp