and dryer can be found hidden behind closet doors. A full bath with walk in shower is attached to the kitchen. Towels and soap are complimentary to your stay. East Broughton Street is swiftly becoming a bustling part of the city, with new restaurant East End Provisions joining the locally-cherished Cha Bella.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009333622874692082,"social_amenities":0.0021522033493965864,"party_restriction":0.0020916296634823084,"nearby_nightlife":0.18601581454277039}}]}}},{"listing_id":"31981486","title":"Sprawling Downtown Estate by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/31981486","guests":13.0,"permits":["SVR-01018"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"31981486","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3ea146d94308184101675572a7fd476794d0c10da6e9ce3b1f4af8cbc40ad06d","chunks":8,"words":650,"party_signal":0.003175655147060752,"social_signal":0.003568675834685564,"party_welcome":0.6835934519767761,"social_amenities":0.27565550804138184,"party_restriction":0.006550934631377459,"nearby_nightlife":0.9637463092803955,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"An architectural gem dating back to 1860, Broughton Estate showcases original historic details including intricate ironwork, soaring ceilings, grand parlors, and meticulously maintained interiors that blend timeless elegance with modern comfort. Enter the home on the ground level, where you\u2019ll find a fully stocked kitchen designed for extended stays, a cozy breakfast nook, and a large, inviting bedroom featuring a King bed. On the second floor, impeccable crown moldings frame the bright and grand parlors, creating an ideal space for gathering and entertaining. A formal dining room with seating for six opens seamlessly to the tastefully decorated living room, offering both comfort and flow for group stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.003175655147060752,"social_amenities":0.0015922520542517304,"party_restriction":0.00013552310701925308,"nearby_nightlife":0.006479987874627113},"affirmative_event_evidence":"On the second floor, impeccable crown moldings frame the bright and grand parlors, creating an ideal space for gathering and entertaining."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The upper-level studio and ground-level studio apartments each feature a full bathroom and fully stocked kitchen, offering additional privacy and flexibility for larger groups, multi-family travel, or wedding guest accommodations. Decorated with classic Southern touches while prioritizing guest comfort, each Queen-size bed is dressed in hotel-grade linens, professionally pressed between visits. Two large closets and a standing chest of drawers encourage guests to unpack and feel at home. A washer and dryer can be found in each Carriage House apartment for added convenience. What's parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6835934519767761,"social_amenities":0.003568675834685564,"party_restriction":0.0014688301598653197,"nearby_nightlife":0.005221834871917963}},{"text":"Located on the third floor are two spacious bedrooms \u2014 one with a Queen bed and Twin sleeper chair, and a primary suite with a King bed. Guests will enjoy luxurious beds dressed in hotel-grade linens, professionally prepared for each stay, along with generous closet space for unpacking and settling in. The primary suite includes an en suite bath with double vanity, standing shower, and a large soaking tub for relaxing after a day exploring Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Walk past the main home and through the expansive private courtyard to access the Carriage House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013048964319750667,"social_amenities":0.0030369830783456564,"party_restriction":0.0006406954489648342,"nearby_nightlife":0.050664715468883514}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The upper-level studio and ground-