 within short walking distance to most of downtown's best shopping, dining, and attractions. An architectural gem, this home offers the original historic details dating back to 1860, including intricate iron work and meticulously maintained interiors. The home's large parlors are perfect for your guests, for short or extended stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006753180641680956,"social_amenities":0.23648330569267273,"party_restriction":0.0014387996634468436,"nearby_nightlife":0.6154822111129761}},{"text":"With ample room for up to six Lucky guests, you truly feel like a local. Share a home-cooked (or catered) meal with friends and family at the formal dining room. Or, sip a few glasses of wine in the string light-lit courtyard before heading out for a night on the town. Enter this home on the ground level, where you will locate the fully stocked kitchen, a cozy breakfast nook, and a large inviting bedroom with King bed. On the second floor, you will be amazed by the impeccable crown-moldings throughout the bright and grand parlors.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9814675450325012,"social_amenities":0.010592120699584484,"party_restriction":0.0002661439939402044,"nearby_nightlife":0.9731306433677673}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}},{"text":"Located on Savannah's most famed street, enjoy all the modern amenities this home has to offer while staying true to the build date of 1860. The space Enjoy a grand visit at Broughton Estate with all the modern amenities you learn to love while on vacation. This three-bedroom home on Broughton Street - Savannah's \"Main Street\" - is within short walking distance to most of downtown's best shoppin