off premises Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":140,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017673637194093317,"social_amenities":0.7511105537414551,"party_restriction":0.00043424664181657135,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010480846976861358}},{"text":"So it is not wheel chair accessible but it may be suitable for some folks with mobility issues, as there is a full bedroom and bathroom on the first floor. The full size, gourmet kitchen features top of the line electric appliances and island seating for three. The connecting dining room and sun room feature the original fireplaces and wood millwork. Guests can lounge in the sun room and appreciate the courtyard views. The formal living room has comfortable seating and a large smart TV for family gatherings with historically preserved details like the original fireplace - no, we don't allow fires any longer!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8881821036338806,"social_amenities":0.010636421851813793,"party_restriction":0.002937310840934515,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031415591947734356}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"So it is not wheel chair accessible but it may be suitable for some folks with mobility issues, as there is a full bedroom and bathroom on the first floor. The full size, gourmet kitchen features top of the line electric appliances and island seating for three. The connecting dining room and sun room feature the original fireplaces and wood millwork. Guests can lounge in the sun room and appreciate the courtyard views. The formal living room has comfortable seating and a large smart TV for family gatherings with historically preserved details like the original fireplace - no, we don't allow fires any longer!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8881821036338806,"social_amenities":0.010636421851813793,"party_restriction":0.002937310840934515,"