nd is spacious and beautifully curated in a genteel Savannah style with all modern amenities making it a generous and comfortable apartment for up to four guests. There are two bedrooms each with a king bed and there are 2.5 bathrooms. A shareable Level II EV charger is available on the property. (SVR-00099) The space The Downtown Historic District location makes this apartment accessible to all of Savannah's sites, restaurants, and shopping. It is 3 blocks from the waterfront, a 10-minute walk from The City Market, and overlooks Washington Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047068780986592174,"social_amenities":0.0017943085404112935,"party_restriction":0.0017250936944037676,"nearby_nightlife":0.9013881087303162}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Gas stove Oven Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":104,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010254010703647509,"social_amenities":0.00580838555470109,"party_restriction":0.00047859619371593,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007310754735954106}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views Park view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment HDTV with Chromecast Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003364448493812233,"social_amenities":0.004518312402069569,"party_restriction":0.00029162963619455695,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003456622362136841}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There is WiFi, washer & dryer, dishwasher, stove, microwave, refrigerator, Keurig coffee machine with a starter set of K-Cups, and shared courtyard. 2 HD TVs are available with a Chromcast. There is no cable TV. Guest access The entire apartment is a dedicated vacation rental with a keyless lock system allowing for self check-in. We generate a new code for each guest. Guests do share a vestibule at the front entrance with Begonia Apartment. One parking space is provided in a garage behind Azalea on East Congress Lane. Other things to note Jasmine Quarters is only 20 minutes from both the Savannah/Hilton Head Airport and Tybee Island Beach.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013188921730034053,"social_amenities":0.0011331154964864254,"party_restriction":0.0030837201047688723,"nearby_nightlife":0.06544110178947449}},{"text":"Azalea Apartment at Jasmine Quarters overlooks Washington Square and is spacious and beautifully curated in a genteel Savannah style with all modern amenities making it a generous and comfortable apartment for up to four guests. There are two bedrooms each with a king bed and there are 2.5 bathrooms. A shareable Level II EV charger is available on the property. (SVR-00099) The space The Downtown Historic District location makes this apartment accessible to all of Savannah's sites, restaurants, and shopping. It is 3 blocks from the waterfront, a 10-minute walk from The City Market, and overlooks Washington Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047068780986592174,"social_amenities":0.0017943085404112935,"party_restriction":0.0017250936944037676,"nearby_nightlife":0.9013881087303162}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Savannah is known for music, film and book festivals as well as home and garden tours, various museums and beautiful architecture. Definitely make your restaurant reservations before you come to town! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004498370923101902,"social_amenities":0.0010032252175733447,"party_restriction":0.0004473205772228539,"nearby_nightlife":0.9284302592277527}},{"text":"Azalea Apartment at Jasmine Quarters overlooks Washington Square and is spacious and beautifully curated in a genteel Savannah style with all modern amenities making it a generous and comfortable apartment for up to four guests. There are two bedrooms each with a king bed and there are 2.5 bathrooms. A shareable Level II EV charger is available on the property. (SVR-00099) The space The Downtown Historic District location makes this apartment accessible to all of Savannah's sites, restaurants, and shopping. It is 3 blocks from the waterfront, a 10-minute walk from The City Market, and overlooks Washington Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047068780986592174,"social_amenities":0.0017943085404112935,"party_restriction":0.0017250936944037676,"nearby_nightlife":0.9013881087303162}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 16005","address":"507 E BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-p