ee dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016844511264935136,"social_amenities":0.007926526479423046,"party_restriction":0.00022248568711802363,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005337518523447216}},{"text":"Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010186676809098572,"social_amenities":0.005316238384693861,"party_restriction":0.00047263046144507825,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010639183456078172}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You are steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, and the city\u2019s best bars and dining. Better yet, the home sits directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate luxury city experience. SVR-03198 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.024949820712208748,"social_amenities":0.010327991098165512,"party_restriction":0.0016435305587947369,"nearby_nightlife":0.9763094782829285}},{"text":"This spectacular two-story row house, originally commissioned in 1883 by Alderman Daniel O'Connor, is an architectural masterpiece that perfectly blends Savannah's history with the conveniences of modern, high-end living. The main level of this luxury 3 bedroom residence is designed for seamless entertaining. The open flow showcases the home's historic pedigree with hardwood floors and authentic exposed brickwork that serve as the backdrop for stunning, insta-worthy modern design. The living and dining areas are complemented by a convenient guest bath downstairs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.02249041385948658,"social_amenities":0.0019206592114642262,"party_restriction":0.0002340639621252194,"nearby_nightlife":0.13179849088191986}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"\"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on Broughton St. is your 5-star Gilded Age haven and Savannah flex. This spectacular 3BR, 2-story row house built in 1883 is an architectural masterpiece, blending original exposed brick & hardwood floors with stunning modern design. Enjoy private off street parking and a chic, enclosed courtyard. Live where the action is: we\u2019re steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, the city's best bars, and directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate experience. The space Step right into the opulence of a Gilded Age inspired retreat at the \"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on historic Broughton Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001941203372552991,"social_amenities":0.9641650319099426,"party_restriction":0.01347413845360279,"nearby_nightlife":0.9715228080749512}},{"text":"You are steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, and the city\u2019s best bars and dining. Better yet, the home sits directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate luxury city experience. SVR-03198 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.024949820712208748,"social_amenities":0.010327991098165512,"party_restriction":0.0016435305587947369,"nearby_nightlife":0.9763094782829285}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"\"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on Broughton St. is your 5-star Gilded Age haven and Savannah flex. This spectacular 3BR, 2-story row house built in 1883 is an architectural masterpiece, blending original exposed brick & hardwood floors with stunning modern design. Enjoy private off street parking and a chic, enclosed courtyard. Live where the action is: we\u2019re steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, the city's best bars, and directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate experience. The space Step right into the opulence of a Gilded Age inspired retreat at the \"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on historic Broughton Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001941203372552991,"social_amenities":0.9641650319099426,"party_restriction":0.01347413845360279,"nearby_nightlife":0.9715228080749512}},{"text":"The second bedroom delivers dramatic historic character with its preserved exposed brick wall, a decorative fireplace, and a skylight that provides both natural light by day and celestial sights at night. The charming third bedroom overlooks the courtyard through its large picture windows, providing a quiet retreat with views of the surrounding trees and excellent natural light. The upper floor also includes two full bathrooms, ensuring comfort and privacy for all guests. Forget the stress of parking\u2014you have two guaranteed private off-street parking spaces, a priceless convenience in the Historic District. The property\u2019s location is your Savannah flex.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023814334417693317,"social_amenities":0.0012917608255520463,"party_restriction":0.0063672494143247604,"nearby_nightlife":0.011284584179520607}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You are steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, and the city\u2019s best bars and dining. Better yet, the home sits directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate luxury city experience. SVR-03198 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.024949820712208748,"social_amenities":0.010327991098165512,"party_restriction":0.0016435305587947369,"nearby_nightlife":0.9763094782829285}},{"text":"\"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on Broughton St. is your 5-star Gilded Age haven and Savannah flex. This spectacular 3BR, 2-story row house built in 1883 is an architectural masterpiece, blending original exposed brick & hardwood floors with stunning modern design. Enjoy private off street parking and a chic, enclosed courtyard. Live where the action is: we\u2019re steps from River Street, Forsyth Park, the city's best bars, and directly on the iconic St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route. Book the ultimate experience. The space Step right into the opulence of a Gilded Age inspired retreat at the \"Gilded Iron & Oak\" on historic Broughton Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001941203372552991,"social_amenities":0.9641650319099426,"party_restriction":0.01347413845360279,"nearby_nightlife":0.9715228080749512}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 16009","address":"511 E BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26181187089","date":"2026-06-30","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 E BROUGHTON ST","recorded_pin":"20005 16010","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"48400317","title":"Lovely Carriage House In the Middle of Downtown!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48400317","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02297"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48400317","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1ba7d40196295bcccd54645e4e5a78313b3d983d1afd1254b166dd266e383f0b","chunks":13,"words":1166,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9832643866539001,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":201,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012539708986878395,"social_amenities":0.09169002622365952,"party_restriction":0.002624489599838853,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011470809113234282}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions! Guests may bring 1 dog, with a weight limit of 50 lbs.\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b Pets must be added to your reservation at the time of booking, and a non refundable $130 pet fee will apply. Long-Term Stays","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014630884397774935,"social_amenities":0.03857947140932083,"party_restriction":0.0028785779140889645,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030123062897473574}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":201,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012539708986878395,"social_amenities":0.09169002622365952,"party_restriction":0.002624489599838853,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011470809113234282}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"The property includes heating and air conditioning, and you also enjoy access to a heated, resort-style swimming pool on Tybee Island. Points of Interest By booking a stay at Broughton Street Carriage House, you\u2019ll be within easy walking distance of a number of exciting local attractions. Others are just a short drive away. Top attractions to enjoy when visiting Savannah include the following: Coastal Islands \u2013 Tybee Island and other coastal islands are just a short drive away from Savannah, making Broughton Street Carriage House the perfect jumping-off point for many exciting day trips around the area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003465772606432438,"social_amenities":0.016815010458230972,"party_restriction":0.0074648004956543446,"nearby_nightlife":0.29515063762664795}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Several scenes from the movie, which is based in Savannah, were filmed on location in this scenic park, which is lined by quaint homes and studded with towering oaks draped with gorgeous Spanish moss. Bonaventure Cemetery \u2013 Also featured in the aforementioned book and movie, this cemetery epitomizes the Southern Gothic style. Located on the site of a former plantation, it features the graves of many prominent Savannah residents. River Street \u2013 Head over to this cobblestone-lined street, which runs along the south bank of the Savannah River, for some of the best dining and entertainment in the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005662922631017864,"social_amenities":0.0011713593266904354,"party_restriction":0.0009449778008274734,"nearby_nightlife":0.9832643866539001}},{"text":"Art \u2013 Take time to explore Savannah\u2019s many art galleries, which feature works from local artists. The city is also home to many prominent art museums, include the Telfair Museums and the SCAD art museum. Make the Most of Your Savannah Getaway If you\u2019re ready to discover why Savannah attracts millions of visitors per year, book a stay at Broughton Street Carriage House in the city\u2019s sprawling Historic District. Its prime location makes it the perfect place to immerse yourself in the amazing history and culture of this charming Southern city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003260314406361431,"social_amenities":0.006829981226474047,"party_restriction":0.0048597161658108234,"nearby_nightlife":0.5655331015586853}}]}}},{"listing_id":"48400318","title":"Stunning Historic Home on Broughton St","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48400318","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02296"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48400318","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bd731054c98b790f44df6eeebead65e1da29f237c505d71187b2fe134eb33b04","chunks":12,"words":1159,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9252550005912781,"party_welcome":0.9399160742759705,"social_amenities":0.9252550005912781,"party_restriction":0.004109092056751251,"nearby_nightlife":0.9478554725646973,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re coming to Savannah to enjoy an event like the Savannah Jazz Festival or to explore sites made famous by the novel and subsequent movie, Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil, this luxury vacation home has you covered. Guests of this property also enjoy access to our heated, resort-style swimming pool on Tybee Island. From March 1st through October 31st, the swimming pool is open from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. seven days per week. From November 1st through February 28th, the pool is open on Fridays and Saturdays online from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. When to Visit","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5419523119926453,"social_amenities":0.9252550005912781,"party_restriction":0.0011904349084943533,"nearby_nightlife":0.05279706418514252}},{"text":"Outdoor Courtyard with Seating Garage Parking- with a JuiceBox Level 2 electric car charging station Luxurious Details Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007349657244049013,"social_amenities":0.09985293447971344,"party_restriction":0.0026002428494393826,"nearby_nightlife":0.014072642661631107}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Broughton Street Main House is available throughout the year, and there\u2019s never a bad time to come to Savannah. As you will see below, the city hosts events throughout the year. If you\u2019re coming to enjoy one of them, book a stay at this property to make the most of your visit. This vacation home includes air conditioning and a heater, so you can stay comfortable no matter when you visit. Book Broughton Street Main House for Your Savannah Getaway","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399160742759705,"social_amenities":0.7961972951889038,"party_restriction":0.001292675849981606,"nearby_nightlife":0.9396277070045471}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re coming to Savannah to enjoy an event like the Savannah Jazz Festival or to explore sites made famous by the novel and subsequent movie, Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil, this luxury vacation home has you covered. Guests of this property also enjoy access to our heated, resort-style swimming pool on Tybee Island. From March 1st through October 31st, the swimming pool is open from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. seven days per week. From November 1st through February 28th, the pool is open on Fridays and Saturdays online from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. When to Visit","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5419523119926453,"social_amenities":0.9252550005912781,"party_restriction":0.0011904349084943533,"nearby_nightlife":0.05279706418514252}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re coming to Savannah to enjoy an event like the Savannah Jazz Festival or to explore sites made famous by the novel and subsequent movie, Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil, this luxury vacation home has you covered. Guests of this property also enjoy access to our heated, resort-style swimming pool on Tybee Island. From March 1st through October 31st, the swimming pool is open from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. seven days per week. From November 1st through February 28th, the pool is open on Fridays and Saturdays online from 10 a.m. until 5 p.m. When to Visit","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5419523119926453,"social_amenities":0.9252550005912781,"party_restriction":0.0011904349084943533,"nearby_nightlife":0.05279706418514252}},{"text":"The Broughton Street Main House is available throughout the year, and there\u2019s never a bad time to come to Savannah. As you will see below, the city hosts events throughout the year. If you\u2019re coming to enjoy one of them, book a stay at this property to make the most of your visit. This vacation home includes air conditioning and a heater, so you can stay comfortable no matter when you visit. Book Broughton Street Main House for Your Savannah Getaway","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399160742759705,"social_amenities":0.7961972951889038,"party_restriction":0.001292675849981606,"nearby_nightlife":0.9396277070045471}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. Southern Belle Occupancy Policy: This home accommodates up to 6 adults and up to 2 children, with the total number of guests not exceeding the home\u2019s maximum approved occupancy of 8 guests. SVR-02296 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":7.549431029474363e-05,"social_amenities":0.007152995094656944,"party_restriction":0.004109092056751251,"nearby_nightlife":0.0022274928633123636}},{"text":"Located on Broughton Street just east of Price Street, the property is within easy walking distance of many of the city\u2019s best attractions, including the popular River Street dining and shopping district. You can easily walk to the river from this property and to many of the city\u2019s most popular public squares. With a garage parking space included onsite, this property is a great jumping-off point for all kinds of Savannah-area adventures. Amenities Broughton Street Main House has everything you need to enjoy an unforgettable visit to the Hostess City of the South.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009303745464421809,"social_amenities":0.012924658134579659,"party_restriction":0.0035305123310536146,"nearby_nightlife":0.7605924606323242}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Visiting Savannah is like being whisked away to a simpler, bygone era, and the best way to immerse yourself in the city\u2019s unique history and culture is by booking a stay at Broughton Street Main House. With accommodations in the Historic District, you\u2019ll be close to the best attractions and events, allowing you to make the most of this pedestrian-friendly city. Book your stay today to lay the groundwork for a special visit to the Hostess City of the South. Guest access Heated Pool Access on Tybee Island Free Wifi Essentials Full kitchen Formal Dining 2 King Bedrooms 1 Queen Bedroom 2 Full Baths, 1 Half Bath Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027434612275101244,"social_amenities":0.004284261725842953,"party_restriction":0.0009937509894371033,"nearby_nightlife":0.9478554725646973}},{"text":"The Broughton Street Main House is available throughout the year, and there\u2019s never a bad time to come to Savannah. As you will see below, the city hosts events throughout the year. If you\u2019re coming to enjoy one of them, book a stay at this property to make the most of your visit. This vacation home includes air conditioning and a heater, so you can stay comfortable no matter when you visit. Book Broughton Street Main House for Your Savannah Getaway","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399160742759705,"social_amenities":0.7961972951889038,"party_restriction":0.001292675849981606,"nearby_nightlife":0.9396277070045471}}]}}},{"listing_id":"48400319","title":"Exquisite Estate on Broughton Street!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48400319","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-02296","SVR-02297"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48400319","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"ba18f54acada2812c45d2a9b3e52b79a44fc4fbafb553c9d26c8ea9ca1c8bffb","chunks":17,"words":1574,"party_signal":0.9916958212852478,"social_signal":0.9914600849151611,"party_welcome":0.9942196607589722,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.991828203201294,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location. As an added bonus, guests also enjoy complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated resort-style swimming pool at 19 Silver Avenue on Tybee Island, giving you the opportunity to experience both downtown Savannah and the coast during your stay. A Historic Home with Room for Everyone One of the things that makes Broughton Street House Estate so special is the space it provides for larger groups.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9916958212852478,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.030321134254336357},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location."},{"text":"Please note that because Broughton Street House Estate is located on historic Broughton Street, guests may occasionally experience the sounds and activity that naturally come with staying in the heart of a lively downtown neighborhood, a location many visitors consider part of the authentic Savannah experience. Your Historic Savannah Getaway Awaits Whether you're gathering with family for the holidays, celebrating a birthday or anniversary, attending a wedding, or planning a weekend with friends, Broughton Street House Estate provides the perfect setting for making lasting memories.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9869437217712402,"social_amenities":0.007529746275395155,"party_restriction":0.0003111451806034893,"nearby_nightlife":0.1440221220254898},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Your Historic Savannah Getaway Awaits Whether you're gathering with family for the holidays, celebrating a birthday or anniversary, attending a wedding, or planning a weekend with friends, Broughton Street House Estate provides the perfect setting for making lasting memories."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location. As an added bonus, guests also enjoy complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated resort-style swimming pool at 19 Silver Avenue on Tybee Island, giving you the opportunity to experience both downtown Savannah and the coast during your stay. A Historic Home with Room for Everyone One of the things that makes Broughton Street House Estate so special is the space it provides for larger groups.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9916958212852478,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.030321134254336357}},{"text":"Bring everyone together at Broughton Street House Estate, a beautifully restored Historic District retreat featuring both a spacious main house and private carriage house. Sleeping up to 10 guests, this unique property offers a private courtyard, garage parking, fully equipped kitchens, and complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated pool on Tybee Island. Walk to River Street, local dining, shopping, and Savannah's iconic historic squares. The space Welcome to Broughton Street House Estate Experience the timeless charm of Savannah from Broughton Street House Estate, a beautifully restored Historic District retreat that brings together a spacious main residence and a private carriage house to create one unforgettable getaway.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014629302313551307,"social_amenities":0.46195876598358154,"party_restriction":0.0007262093713507056,"nearby_nightlife":0.055441826581954956}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Designed for families, friends, wedding parties, and group vacations, this unique property comfortably accommodates up to 10 guests while offering the privacy and flexibility of two separate living spaces. Located on the eastern end of Broughton Street just a few blocks from River Street, you'll be perfectly positioned to experience everything that makes Savannah one of the South's most beloved destinations. Spend your days strolling beneath moss-draped oaks, exploring historic squares, shopping local boutiques, dining at award-winning restaurants, or discovering museums and galleries\u2014all within easy walking distance of your front door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9942196607589722,"social_amenities":0.002184563782066107,"party_restriction":0.0003812713548541069,"nearby_nightlife":0.8998671174049377}},{"text":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location. As an added bonus, guests also enjoy complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated resort-style swimming pool at 19 Silver Avenue on Tybee Island, giving you the opportunity to experience both downtown Savannah and the coast during your stay. A Historic Home with Room for Everyone One of the things that makes Broughton Street House Estate so special is the space it provides for larger groups.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9916958212852478,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.030321134254336357}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location. As an added bonus, guests also enjoy complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated resort-style swimming pool at 19 Silver Avenue on Tybee Island, giving you the opportunity to experience both downtown Savannah and the coast during your stay. A Historic Home with Room for Everyone One of the things that makes Broughton Street House Estate so special is the space it provides for larger groups.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9916958212852478,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.030321134254336357}},{"text":"Bring everyone together at Broughton Street House Estate, a beautifully restored Historic District retreat featuring both a spacious main house and private carriage house. Sleeping up to 10 guests, this unique property offers a private courtyard, garage parking, fully equipped kitchens, and complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated pool on Tybee Island. Walk to River Street, local dining, shopping, and Savannah's iconic historic squares. The space Welcome to Broughton Street House Estate Experience the timeless charm of Savannah from Broughton Street House Estate, a beautifully restored Historic District retreat that brings together a spacious main residence and a private carriage house to create one unforgettable getaway.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014629302313551307,"social_amenities":0.46195876598358154,"party_restriction":0.0007262093713507056,"nearby_nightlife":0.055441826581954956}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Whether you're planning a long weekend, celebrating a milestone, or gathering loved ones for a memorable vacation, Broughton Street House Estate offers the perfect blend of historic character, modern comfort, and an unbeatable location. As an added bonus, guests also enjoy complimentary access to Southern Belle's heated resort-style swimming pool at 19 Silver Avenue on Tybee Island, giving you the opportunity to experience both downtown Savannah and the coast during your stay. A Historic Home with Room for Everyone One of the things that makes Broughton Street House Estate so special is the space it provides for larger groups.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9916958212852478,"social_amenities":0.9914600849151611,"party_restriction":0.006265224888920784,"nearby_nightlife":0.030321134254336357}},{"text":"March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.0422353520989418,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0047673750668764114}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Just a few blocks away, River Street offers historic cobblestone walkways, waterfront restaurants, candy shops, live entertainment, and scenic views of the Savannah River. Take time to explore Savannah's twenty-two historic squares, visit the iconic Forsyth Park, or discover nearby museums, galleries, and beautifully preserved historic landmarks. From Southern favorites and fresh seafood to rooftop dining, bakeries, coffee shops, and craft cocktail bars, you'll find no shortage of incredible local dining options nearby.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005949912592768669,"social_amenities":0.0008524676086381078,"party_restriction":0.0011790896533057094,"nearby_nightlife":0.991828203201294}},{"text":"The garage is accessed from the rear alleyway, and because the entrance requires a fairly tight turn, mid-size cars and smaller SUVs are recommended for the easiest access. Discover the Best of Savannah One of the greatest advantages of staying at Broughton Street House Estate is its exceptional location. Situated in Savannah's Historic District, the property places you within walking distance of many of the city's most iconic attractions. Start your day with coffee from a neighborhood caf\u00e9 before browsing the locally owned boutiques and specialty shops along Broughton Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002987649058923125,"social_amenities":0.012146169319748878,"party_restriction":0.0025490859989076853,"nearby_nightlife":0.9725697040557861}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 16019","address":"523 E BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26122125646","date":"2026-05-02","type":"22 NON-URGENT request","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"521 E BROUGHTON ST","recorded_pin":"20005 16018","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1704433462585328143","title":"Epic Broughton St Townhouse|Private Patio+Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1704433462585328143","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02294"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1704433462585328143","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2d73135069b9692cf40eb8ba5abfaa98c768baf3d0502c5abad91b420fea36cb","chunks":8,"words":673,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.014856871217489243,"party_welcome":0.0023120411206036806,"social_amenities":0.05134167894721031,"party_restriction":0.0006419986020773649,"nearby_nightlife":0.9724892973899841,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The living room offers lots of seating for lounging or movie nights, as we ll as a fold out sofa bed. Large windows fill the home with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Enjoy a spacious dining room to eat in or play games at. A fully equipped kitchen is stocked with basic essentials for dining in. A convenient main floor half bathroom adds ease for guests while spending time in the living spaces. The true highlight of this property is the stunning private courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0023120411206036806,"social_amenities":0.014856871217489243,"party_restriction":0.000553940306417644,"nearby_nightlife":0.032745763659477234}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Paid parking off premises","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022322557924780995,"social_amenities":0.005280026234686375,"party_restriction":0.0003731378528755158,"nearby_nightlife":0.002161939162760973}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The living room offers lots of seating for lounging or movie nights, as we ll as a fold out sofa bed. Large windows fill the home with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Enjoy a spacious dining room to eat in or play games at. A fully equipped kitchen is stocked with basic essentials for dining in. A convenient main floor half bathroom adds ease for guests while spending time in the living spaces. The true highlight of this property is the stunning private courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0023120411206036806,"social_amenities":0.014856871217489243,"party_restriction":0.000553940306417644,"nearby_nightlife":0.032745763659477234}},{"text":"Tucked along the residential eastern end of Broughton Street, this spacious two-bedroom, two and a half bath townhouse places you in the heart of Savannah's Historic District while offering a peaceful retreat to return to after a day of exploring. Step outside your front door for a short stroll to River Street, City Market, Savannah's iconic squares, local coffee shops, boutiques, and some of the city's best restaurants. The location truly puts Savannah at your fingertips. Inside, you'll find generous living spaces designed for gathering and relaxing. The open-concept layout offers plenty of room to spread out, whether you're visiting with family, friends, or enjoying an extended stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038593498175032437,"social_amenities":0.0042658052407205105,"party_restriction":0.0005365025717765093,"nearby_nightlife":0.6909754276275635}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A rare find in downtown Savannah, surrounded by lush landscaping, this outdoor oasis is perfect for morning coffee, afternoon cocktails, or unwinding under the glow of string lights after a day spent exploring the city. Enjoy an extra fun tiki outdoor tiki bar. On the second level of the home you will find two bedroom suites with to full size bathrooms. The master suite offers a king bed and double sink on suite bathroom with walk in shower. The second bedroom has a queen size bed and sleeper sofa with a a full size hall bathroom with shower tub/combo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019893600256182253,"social_amenities":0.05134167894721031,"party_restriction":0.00019143805548083037,"nearby_nightlife":0.9724892973899841}},{"text":"The living room offers lots of seating for lounging or movie nights, as we ll as a fold out sofa bed. Large windows fill the home with natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout. Enjoy a spacious dining room to eat in or play games at. A fully equipped kitchen is stocked with basic essentials for dining in. A convenient main floor half bathroom adds ease for guests while spending time in the living spaces. The true highligh