,"party_welcome":0.9643606543540955,"social_amenities":0.8852537870407104,"party_restriction":0.03309496492147446,"nearby_nightlife":0.984035313129425,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Set in the heart of Savannah's Historic & Shopping District, Villa on Broughton Main + Carriage pairs historic charm with modern comfort. Sleeping up to 10, it's ideal for bridal parties, reunions, or big group getaways right in the center of it all. The space Located in the heart of Savannah's Historic & Shopping District, Villa on Broughton Main + Carriage combines historic charm with modern comfort and style. This unique home includes both a main house and a private carriage house, accommodating up to 10 guests \u2014 making it an excellent choice for bridal party retreats, family reunions, or large group getaways in downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9643606543540955,"social_amenities":0.5913189053535461,"party_restriction":0.01781575195491314,"nearby_nightlife":0.020572206005454063},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Sleeping up to 10, it's ideal for bridal parties, reunions, or big group getaways right in the center of it all."},{"text":"The main floor welcomes you into a spacious living room, the perfect gathering space for guests. Beyond it, an open-concept dining area flows into a fully equipped kitchen featuring stunning countertops and new stainless steel appliances, ideal for preparing meals for a large group. Step outside to the private courtyard, furnished for relaxing evenings. The main house sleeps up to 8 guests across two bedrooms and two sleeper sofas. One sleeper sofa sits in a lofted room above the primary bedroom, a great option for parents wanting to keep kids close by. The primary bedroom opens through sliding doors onto a small private balcony overlooking the courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7798101902008057,"social_amenities":0.0045011695474386215,"party_restriction":0.00035933955223299563,"nearby_nightlife":0.009499059990048409},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The main floor welcomes you into a spacious living room, the perfect gathering space for guests."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Set in the heart of Savannah's Historic & Shopping District, Villa on Broughton Main + Carriage pairs historic charm with modern comfort. Sleeping up to 10, it's ideal for bridal parties, reunions, or big group getaways right in the center of it all. The space Located in the heart of Savannah's Historic & Shopping District, Villa on Broughton Main + Carriage combines historic charm with modern comfort and style. This unique home includes both a main house and a private carriage house, accommodating up to 10 guests \u2014 making it an excellent choice for bridal party retreats, family reunions, or large group getaways in downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9643606543540955,"social_amenities":0.5913189053535461,"party_restriction":0.01781575195491314,"nearby_nightlife":0.020572206005454063}},{"text":"Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Lofted Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa Bedroom 2: Queen Size Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa Carriage House: Queen Size Bed Whats parking like for this home? Guests will have access to one small private garage space (small to midsize vehicles only). All other parking can be found on-street, metered, Monday-Saturday 8AM-8PM. We encourage guests to pay close attention to street signs, as they state when the street cleaner comes. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010926001414190978,"social_amenities":0.006122047081589699,"party_restriction":0.00223524053581059,"nearby_nightlife":0.004627011716365814}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Set in the heart of 