e home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":193,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006773775676265359,"social_amenities":0.1621883511543274,"party_restriction":0.0015509016811847687,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006281401147134602}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Flatscreen TV in living room and bedroom Brick courtyard with caf\u00e9 lights and gas grill Located on Greene Square in downtown Savannah Free wifi Drip coffee maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005191914970055223,"social_amenities":0.6037254333496094,"party_restriction":0.004272477701306343,"nearby_nightlife":0.017270417883992195}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free street parking Pool Paid parking off premises Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":193,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006773775676265359,"social_amenities":0.1621883511543274,"party_restriction":0.0015509016811847687,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006281401147134602}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Flatscreen TV in living room and bedroom Brick courtyard with caf\u00e9 lights and gas grill Located on Greene Square in downtown Savannah Free wifi Drip coffee maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005191914970055223,"social_amenities":0.6037254333496094,"party_restriction":0.004272477701306343,"nearby_nightlife":0.017270417883992195}},{"text":"Once you've unpacked your bags and settled into our Savannah vacation rentals, it's time to explore downtown. Along with Greene Square, this property is also not far from Columbia Square, Crawford Square and Washington Square. It's only a short distance north of Colonial Park Cemetery as well, which covers about six acres and is the oldest municipal cemetery in the city that is still fully intact. It contains over 9,000 graves that include some of Savannah's most famous residents. Savannah Georgia Vacation Rentals not only make an excellent base to explore the Historic District, but they're also only a quick drive from Tybee Island, which is Savannah's premier beach destination.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002420873788651079,"social_amenities":0.015511300414800644,"party_restriction":0.0025106214452534914,"nearby_nightlife":0.03425995633006096}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The drive only takes about 30 minutes by car, and then you're ready to spend the day exploring the Atlantic and Savannah River beaches as well as checking out the prominent landmarks. Tybee Island is especially known for the light station on the north end of the island, which is available for tours. Another fun place to visit is the Marine Science Center on the southeast part of the island. If you're feeling extra adventurous, you can rent watercraft equipment or charter a boat to go out onto the ocean for fishing or sightseeing. Make your stay a memorable one with Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042429324821569026,"social_amenities":0.0070996275171637535,"party_restriction":0.002159418538212776,"nearby_nightlife":0.06292642652988434}},{"text":"Once you've unpacked your bags and settled into our Savannah vacation rentals, it's time to explore downtown. Along with Greene Square, this property is also not far from Columbia Square, Crawford Square and Washington Square. It's only a short distance north of Colonial Park Cemetery as well, which covers about six acres and is the oldest municipal cemetery in the city that is still fully intact. It contains over 9,000 graves that include some of Savannah's most famous residents. Savannah Georgia Vacation Rentals not only make an excellent base to explore the Historic District, but they're also only a quick drive from Tybee Island, which is Savannah's premier beach destination.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002420873788651079,"social_amenities":0.015511300414800644,"party_restriction":0.0025106214452534914,"nearby_nightlife":0.03425995633006096}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 17018","address":"532 E STATE ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":7,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24081085459","date":"2024-03-21","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"532 E State St","recorded_pin":"20005 17018","side