within Savannah's historic district, Greene Square Bliss offers a haven of tranquility and charm. Situated beside the captivating Greene Square, where ancient oak trees draped in Spanish Moss sway gently in the breeze, this two-bedroom, two-bathroom retreat embodies the essence of Savannah living. Why we love Greene Square Bliss: - Bright and Spacious: The open floor plan floods the space with natural light, creating an inviting atmosphere perfect for entertaining.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.011037369258701801,"social_amenities":0.3915039896965027,"party_restriction":0.0007715388783253729,"nearby_nightlife":0.08866562694311142}},{"text":"The first floor features a luxurious bathroom with a walk-in shower and a full-size washer and dryer for added convenience. Ascend to the second floor to find two serene guest rooms awaiting you. The primary suite boasts an ensuite bathroom identical to the one downstairs, offering a luxurious feel and a spacious walk-in shower. Across the hall, the second bedroom beckons with a king bed and picturesque views overlooking the captivating Greene Square. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000369331450201571,"social_amenities":0.00848864484578371,"party_restriction":0.012532404623925686,"nearby_nightlife":0.04891129955649376}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Nestled within Savannah's historic district, Greene Square Bliss offers a haven of tranquility and charm. Situated beside the captivating Greene Square, where ancient oak trees draped in Spanish Moss sway gently in the breeze. The space Nestled within Savannah's historic district, Greene Square Bliss offers a haven of tranquility and charm. Situated beside the captivating Greene Square, where ancient oak trees draped in Spanish Moss sway gently