our stay, you will have access to the entire house and courtyard! Please make yourself at home. BEFORE YOU BOOK: Please note that this property requires a separate short-term rental agreement to be signed by the primary guest prior to check-in. This is a standard agreement covering house rules and property use. By booking this listing, you acknowledge and agree to sign the rental agreement when requested.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003858923155348748,"social_amenities":0.005399991292506456,"party_restriction":0.00511742290109396,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015352789778262377}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"OR Visitor Parking Passes are available for 24hours/$15.00 and 48hours/$24.00. Passes can be purchased at the City of Savannah Parking Services Office at 100 East Bryan Street. (Each parking spot is numbered.) Paid parking runs Monday-Saturday 8 AM - 8 PM. MAXIMUM OCCUPANCY is 4 people at any/all times, including children/infants. * The bedrooms and full bathrooms are on the second floor. * We are in a residential neighborhood, convenient to the hustle and bustle of Savannah's popular tourist areas, but there will likely be some city noises. In addition, horse carriages and tour groups come past the house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004073966760188341,"social_amenities":0.0031229702290147543,"party_restriction":0.9048029184341431,"nearby_nightlife":0.9714071750640869}},{"text":"* While we are child friendly, please note that our house is not child-proof. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013521339278668165,"social_amenities":0.0024109375663101673,"party_restriction":0.007180450018495321,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013596571516245604}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed shee