edroom is a stylish loft space that overlooks the living room below. * Fully equipped kitchen, high-speed Wi-Fi, smart TV. * Free On-Site Parking \u200b The space Open living space with floor-to-ceiling windows looking out into the courtyard. The dining room has seating for six, and is just off of the galley-style kitchen with all the amenities of home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002572719531599432,"social_amenities":0.0012712290044873953,"party_restriction":0.0005053767818026245,"nearby_nightlife":0.7317058444023132}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 26006","address":"125 E BROAD ST #1B","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"50936676","title":"Charming Retreat Off Greene Sq by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50936676","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02362"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"50936676","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d893908c43945bf24dc299efe805ba027097af2ffdd27ea5ff8f6a9c48dbc898","chunks":7,"words":586,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.00394380884245038,"party_welcome":0.9868482947349548,"social_amenities":0.004606568720191717,"party_restriction":0.0029937580693513155,"nearby_nightlife":0.9741122126579285,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stepping into the living space, guests have an ample amount of plush seating, where they can gather together at the end of the day and catch up on their favorite shows. The open floor plan of this property flows from the combined living space with breakfast bar, into the fully equipped kitchen. The elevated, and spacious kitchen features all of the modern conveniences one could wish for. Everything has been tastefully selected to make this an exceptionally convenient spot to call home\u2026 even just for a few days! Tucked away, and boasting with natural light, the Queen-sized bedroom features a soothing, neutral palette and with a ensuite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004069760034326464,"social_amenities":0.00394380884245038,"party_restriction":0.0003299746022094041,"nearby_nightlife":0.01704328879714012}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004661506100092083,"social_amenities":0.0016421698965132236,"party_restriction":0.0003937281435355544,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007007081876508892}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Your Savannah escape awaits! This charming apartment is just off of Greene Square, tucked away on State Street. Perfect for those looking to be within walking distance to Savannah's best restaurants, shops, and museums. The space Looking for the perfect location, but don't desire to be in 