6.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24280294025","date":"2024-10-06","type":"45 Property DAMAGE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"514 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20005 30005D","side":"direct"},{"number":"26214221421","date":"2026-08-02","type":"29 OTHER NOISE COMPLAINT","outcome":"Noise complaints","recorded_address":"514 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20005 30005D","side":"direct"},{"number":"25283287204","date":"2025-10-10","type":"52 PAST FRAUD/FORGERY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"510 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20005 30005","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"29918916","title":"1890 Victorian w/ Heated Pool by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29918916","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-03158"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"29918916","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6a2cdc28ad3c04e5da914bd996784ceab9ecf22439704327dedf12c95452f613","chunks":7,"words":622,"party_signal":0.0003215763426851481,"social_signal":0.025394856929779053,"party_welcome":0.0009912715759128332,"social_amenities":0.025394856929779053,"party_restriction":0.012973721139132977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9893471002578735,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Best of all, you can walk to everything, no car needed. Set along the picturesque, tree-lined Oglethorpe Avenue, this home captures the essence of Historic Savannah, where moss-draped live oaks, brick pathways, and iconic squares surround you. The property also welcomes one furry friend 35 lbs and under, making it the perfect option for a pet-friendly Savannah getaway. Inside, the first floor features two inviting living spaces, a spacious fully equipped kitchen, and a formal dining room ideal for gathering. Just beyond, your private courtyard oasis awaits, complete with a heated spa/plunge pool\u2014perfect for relaxing after a day exploring downtown Savannah. Upstairs, you\u2019ll find three beautifully appointed bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003215763426851481,"social_amenities":0.0009634951129555702,"party_restriction":0.0003589035477489233,"nearby_nightlife":0.011465192772448063},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Inside, the first floor features two inviting living spaces, a spacious fully equipped kitchen, and a formal dining room ideal for gathering."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000978262978605926,"social_amenities":0.025394856929779053,"party_restriction":0.0007761332090012729,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016869313549250364}},{"text":"Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, parking kiosks, or meters directly. Nearby public parking garages and pre-paid visitor parking passes through the Parking and Mobility Services office are also available. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signage when parking. Sleeping Configurations Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: King Size Bed Bedroom 3: King Size Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":7.308235944947228e-05,"social_amenities":0.0013699033297598362,"party_restriction":0.0006317544030025601,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013051752466708422}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The primary suite offers a King bed and en suite bath, while the two additional bedrooms each feature King beds and share a large Jack-and-Jill bathroom. An upper-level balcony with a charming round dining set provides a peaceful spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails. Located just a short walk from Colonial Park Cemetery, Broughton Street, and City Market, this home places you in the center of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after attractions, dining, shopping, and entertainment. What is parking like for this home? Parking is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009912715759128332,"social_amenities":0.014911996200680733,"party_restriction":0.012973721139132977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9855378866195679}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space wher