actions, dining, shopping, and entertainment. What is parking like for this home? Parking is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009912715759128332,"social_amenities":0.014911996200680733,"party_restriction":0.012973721139132977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9855378866195679}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The primary suite offers a King bed and en suite bath, while the two additional bedrooms each feature King beds and share a large Jack-and-Jill bathroom. An upper-level balcony with a charming round dining set provides a peaceful spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails. Located just a short walk from Colonial Park Cemetery, Broughton Street, and City Market, this home places you in the center of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after attractions, dining, shopping, and entertainment. What is parking like for this home? Parking is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009912715759128332,"social_amenities":0.014911996200680733,"party_restriction":0.012973721139132977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9855378866195679}},{"text":"Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044390937546268106,"social_amenities":0.0011345375096425414,"party_restriction":0.001519378973171115,"nearby_nightlife":0.001283228979445994}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Experience Savannah like never before with this completed renovated, two-level Savannah manor, which includes a private backyard with heated plunge pool. The space Lucky Savannah proudly presents our circa 1890 \u201cThree Sisters House,\u201d a completely renovated historic home in the heart of the Landmark Historic District of Savannah, Georgia. This luxury 3-bedroom, 3-bath residence blends timeless charm with modern design, featuring all-new furnishings, premium mattresses, and plush pillows to ensure a comfortable and elevated stay. Guests will love the unbeatable downtown location, just steps from Savannah\u2019s best rooftop bars, vibrant nightlife, and next door to Marbled & Fin, one of the city\u2019s premier fine dining destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007570877205580473,"social_amenities":0.0015217592008411884,"party_restriction":0.0006555894506163895,"nearby_nightlife":0.9893471002578735}},{"text":"The primary suite offers a King bed and en suite bath, while the two additional bedrooms each feature King beds and share a large Jack-and-Jill bathroom. An upper-level balcony with a charming round dining set provides a peaceful spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails. Located just a short walk from Colonial Park Cemetery, Broughton Street, and City Market, this home places you in the center of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after attractions, dining, shopping, and entertainment. What is parking like for this home? Parking is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009912715759128332,"social_amenities":0.014911996200680733,"party_restriction":0.012973721139132977,"nearby_nightlife":0.9855378866195679}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20005 30015","address":"503 E YORK ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / n