cial_amenities":0.16337308287620544,"party_restriction":0.00032890113652683794,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013135974295437336}},{"text":"There is a gas grill & gas firepit for guests while enjoying the neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the river during holidays. Located between Columbia & Greene Squares, Shain Manor is on the corner of York & Price Streets. We are a 5-minute walk to River Street; 4 blocks to the retail mecca of Broughton Street & walkable to all the must-see sights! NOTES: Once you reserve this home, you will receive emails including your CHECK IN LETTER from Luxury Living Savannah. Please check your spam/junk folders for these emails.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8757454752922058,"social_amenities":0.05958273634314537,"party_restriction":0.001367816119454801,"nearby_nightlife":0.012089628726243973}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"There is a gas grill & gas firepit for guests while enjoying the neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the river during holidays. Located between Columbia & Greene Squares, Shain Manor is on the corner of York & Price Streets. We are a 5-minute walk to River Street; 4 blocks to the retail mecca of Broughton Street & walkable to all the must-see sights! NOTES: Once you reserve this home, you will receive emails including your CHECK IN LETTER from Luxury Living Savannah. Please check your spam/junk folders for these emails.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8757454752922058,"social_amenities":0.05958273634314537,"party_restriction":0.001367816119454801,"nearby_nightlife":0.012089628726243973}},{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot wate