will receive emails including your CHECK IN LETTER from Luxury Living Savannah. Please check your spam/junk folders for these emails.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8757454752922058,"social_amenities":0.05958273634314537,"party_restriction":0.001367816119454801,"nearby_nightlife":0.012089628726243973}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"OCCUPANCY: Maximum of 6 people at all times, including infants & children. MINIMUM age to reserve is 25 years old. NO PETS. NO SMOKING/VAPING. PARKING: The neighborhood uses metered street parking. Download the app \"ParkSavannah\" to pay meters from your phone OR Contact the City of Savannah Parking Services for parking passes. NOISE: This property is NOT PARTY friendly. We do not allow loud noise, loud music, public drunkenness, or parties of any sort. NO BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR GROUPS! The City of Savannah Noise Ordinance requires strict observance of QUIET TIME between 10 pm and 8 am. The City of Savannah Police and neighborhood strictly enforce this. SVR-02897 SVR-02898 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002642257895786315,"social_amenities":0.0011589780915528536,"party_restriction":0.9991832375526428,"nearby_nightlife":0.9716199636459351}},{"text":"There is a gas grill & gas firepit for guests while enjoying the neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the river during holidays. Located between Columbia & Greene Squares, Shain Manor is on the corner of York & Price Streets. We are a 5-minute walk to River Street; 4 blocks to the retail mecca of Broughton Street & walkable to all the must-see sights! NOTES: Once you reserve this home, you will receive emails including your CHECK IN LETTER from Luxury Living Savannah. Please check your spam/junk folders for these emails.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8757454752922058,"social_amenities":0.05958273634314537,"party_restriction":0.001367816119454801,"nearby_nightlife":0.012089628726243973}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"OCCUPANCY: Maximum of 6 people at all times, including infants & children. MINIMUM age to reserve is 25 years old. NO PETS. NO SMOKING/VAPING. PARKING: The neighborhood uses metered street parking. Download the app \"ParkSavannah\" to pay meters from your phone OR Contact the City of Savannah Parking Services for parking passes. NOISE: This property is NOT PARTY friendly. We do not allow loud noise, loud music, public drunkenness, or parties of any sort. NO BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR GROUPS! The City of Savannah Noise Ordinance requires strict observance of QUIET TIME between 10 pm and 8 am. The City of Savannah Police and neighborhood strictly enforce this. SVR-02897 SVR-02898 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002642257895786315,"social_amenities":0.0011589780915528536,"party_restriction":0.9991832375526428,"nearby_nightlife":0.9716199636459351}},{"text":"Offering many places for hanging out and relaxing, watching movies, playing games or just having some quiet time. The ground level has an open floor plan, with a living room, new kitchen, dining area, and a bedroom with a queen-sized bed, with a new mattress and luxury cotton linens. Additionally, there is a full en-suite bathroom, with a tub/shower combo & laundry closet with a full-size washer/dryer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001877251052064821,"social_amenities":0.002836219733580947,"party_restriction":0.0004272685619071126,"nearby_nightlife":0.1880938857793808}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1153588781140865088","title":"The Shain Manor Parlor Suite: elegance for 4!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1153588781140865088","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02897"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1153588781140865088","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8fae2d37ac725cedaf9fe61219e6ae7f55ad579a914a9f048ee783c821ea858c","chunks":9,"words":839,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.46249422430992126,"party_welcome":0.0017420814838260412,"social_amenities":0.46249422430992126,"party_restriction":0.9992578625679016,"nearby_nightlife":0.9909570217132568,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture BBQ grill: gas Parking and facilities Paid street parking off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042625050991773605,"social_amenities":0.46249422430992126,"party_restriction":0.0009358896058984101,"nearby_nightlife":0.002300449414178729}},{"text":"Off the kitchen is a large outdoor terrace, equipped with a 32\u201d professional Turbo gas grill and a gas fire pit. There is plenty of comfy seating to relax and enjoy the continual Southern breeze, neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the bay during the holiday seasons! The elegant dining room seats six comfortably and is connected to a spacious and comfortable living room with books, games and a Roku TV. There is also a powder bath next to the kitchen, designed with intricate Carrara marble tile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017420814838260412,"social_amenities":0.1665094941854477,"party_restriction":0.0002103079459629953,"nearby_nightlife":0.49386072158813477}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Off the kitchen is a large outdoor terrace, equipped with a 32\u201d professional Turbo gas grill and a gas fire pit. There is plenty of comfy seating to relax and enjoy the continual Southern breeze, neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the bay during the holiday seasons! The elegant dining room seats six comfortably and is connected to a spacious and comfortable living room with books, games and a Roku TV. There is also a powder bath next to the kitchen, designed with intricate Carrara marble tile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017420814838260412,"social_amenities":0.1665094941854477,"party_restriction":0.0002103079459629953,"nearby_nightlife":0.49386072158813477}},{"text":"The historic hardwood floors, original molding and architectural details have been preserved beautifully. The d\u00e9cor has been artfully curated by the owner, accented by natural aesthetics. Sisal rugs, an abundance of plants, antique and modern touches add elegance and sophistication. The chef\u2019s kitchen offers a full array of Thermador appliances which include a professional 36\u201d gas stove with griddle & oven, 30\u201d refrigerator/freezer, Scotsman gourmet clear ice machine, wine fridge, beverage fridge, microwave drawer, a countertop Breville toaster oven & toaster, and a Cuisinart pod-coffee maker. The sink has a reverse-osmosis room temperature and boiling water filtration system. The kitchen is completely equipped for all your dining needs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005894084461033344,"social_amenities":0.008704033680260181,"party_restriction":0.0011580388527363539,"nearby_nightlife":0.00204287376254797}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture BBQ grill: gas Parking and facilities Paid street parking off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042625050991773605,"social_amenities":0.46249422430992126,"party_restriction":0.0009358896058984101,"nearby_nightlife":0.002300449414178729}},{"text":"Off the kitchen is a large outdoor terrace, equipped with a 32\u201d professional Turbo gas grill and a gas fire pit. There is plenty of comfy seating to relax and enjoy the continual Southern breeze, neighborhood sounds of church bells, horses clomping, ships\u2019 horns and views of fireworks from the bay during the holiday seasons! The elegant dining room seats six comfortably and is connected to a spacious and comfortable living room with books, games and a Roku TV. There is also a powder bath next to the kitchen, designed with intricate Carrara marble tile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017420814838260412,"social_amenities":0.1665094941854477,"party_restriction":0.0002103079459629953,"nearby_nightlife":0.49386072158813477}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The retail mecca of Broughton Street is only 4 blocks; we are centrally located and walkable to all the hot spots! NOTES: OCCUPANCY: Maximum of 4 people at all times, including infants & children. MINIMUM age to reserve is 25 years old. NO PETS. NO SMOKING/VAPING. PARKING: Savannah has metered street parking. Download the app \"ParkSavannah\" to pay meters from your phone OR Contact the City of Savannah Parking Services daily parking passes. There is limited, but free parking available on Price Street. NOISE: This property is NOT PARTY