id":"697142273009747870","title":"Houston Street Retreat | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697142273009747870","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-00981"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"697142273009747870","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"508d5c07b30a1e9f31ca7f516d143245554b93fdda441cfb90388c376f909c18","chunks":13,"words":1273,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0570562481880188,"party_welcome":0.9636242389678955,"social_amenities":0.0570562481880188,"party_restriction":0.01194523461163044,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973382353782654,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Dog friendly! Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":88,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017677042342256755,"social_amenities":0.0570562481880188,"party_restriction":0.00042528394260443747,"nearby_nightlife":0.001403098925948143}},{"text":"If beautiful surroundings make you feel right at home, you\u2019re sure to love Houston Street Retreat. A cozy Savannah vacation rental by Crawford Square Savannah, Houston Street Retreat offers the perfect accommodations for a couple's getaway. From the welcoming entryway to the convenient location in Historic Savannah, this wonderful option as a vacation rental in Savannah GA is set to exceed your expectations. The space Houston Street Retreat proves that a small vacation home can be truly grand. The home peppers in many antique touches that give it a rare feel of authenticity.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013048769906163216,"social_amenities":0.031160958111286163,"party_restriction":0.01194523461163044,"nearby_nightlife":0.001062986208125949}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Another fun thing to do in Savannah is to book a spot on a guided tour. Savannah offers a wide range of different tours to satisfy different interests. Guests can choose from trolley tours, carriage rides, guided walking tours, after-dark cemetery tours, and guided pub crawls. Finally, Savannah's amazing festivals and cultural events attract countless visitors each year. While new events are constantly being added to the city's roster, the list of ongoing favorites includes the Savannah Jazz Festival, the Savannah Greek Festival, the Great Ogeechee Seafood Festival, the Savannah Film Festival, Christmas on the River, and Savannah\u2019s Waterfront New Year\u2019s Celebration.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9636242389678955,"social_amenities":0.004273204132914543,"party_restriction":0.008481625467538834,"nearby_nightlife":0.9643120169639587}},{"text":"There are many ways to create a totally personalized experience in Savannah. For those looking for an incredible day of shopping and dining, City Market offers a pedestrian-only zone full of shops and restaurants. Savannah visitors should also find time to play by the water on Savannah's famed River Street. Full of bars and restaurants, River Street is an incredible place for a night out in Savannah for those who enjoy live music, bustling crowds, and river views. The River Street area is also the place to pick up a ferry to get to Hutchinson Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01139025017619133,"social_amenities":0.001033268985338509,"party_restriction":0.0009895014809444547,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973382353782654}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Dog friendly! Other things to note Heat