nvenience, a washer and dryer are available in the unit, and metered parking can be found directly in front of the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033511233050376177,"social_amenities":0.002911231480538845,"party_restriction":0.0012837504036724567,"nearby_nightlife":0.03950371965765953}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Pets, parties, and events are strictly prohibited, and failure to observe these and all other house rules risks the termination of the reservation without the possibility of a refund. Other things to note We ask that the space, other guests, and our neighbors be treated with dignity and respect. Please respect the home and its rules. This will help us maintain peace and ensure that all of our guests have a wonderful Savannah Stay! Metered street parking is available on the front and back of the property on East McDonough Street. This area is shared with other residents, and it is on a first-come, first-served basis with no assigned spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023130368208512664,"social_amenities":0.001229657675139606,"party_restriction":0.9943901896476746,"nearby_nightlife":0.7773730158805847}},{"text":"Guests will have access to the garden-level apartment (ground floor), the shared courtyard, and the street parking in front and behind the building on East McDonough Street. Please refer to the check-in guide on the Guest App for more details. *Note: This apartment is in a property that houses other guests, so we ask that the space and neighboring property are treated with dignity and respect at all times. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013930279237683862,"social_amenities":0.0011849513975903392,"party_restriction":0.8819829821586609,"nearby_nightlife":0.9756010174751282}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Guests will have access to the garden-level apartment (ground floor), the shared courtyard, and the street parking in front and behind the building on East McDonough Street. Please refer to the check-in guide on the Guest App for more details. *Note: This apartment is in a property that houses other guests, so we ask that the space and neighboring property are treated with dignity and respect at all times. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013930279237683862,"social_amenities":0.0011849513975903392,"party_restriction":0.8819829821586609,"nearby_nightlife":0.9756010174751282}},{"text":"This beautifully updated garden-level apartment offers just that \u2014 a serene retreat tucked in the heart of the Historic District. Situated beside picturesque Crawford Square, this one-bedroom, one-bath unit is ideal for couples or solo travelers who want to relax in style while staying steps away from Savannah\u2019s best dining, shopping, and historic landmarks. You\u2019re just a short walk from River Street and all the charm that downtown has to offer. Inside, the living area feels bright and inviting, featuring a comfortable sofa, a charming bistro table, and a dedicated workspace \u2014 perfect for those who like to mix a little business with leisure.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.139084431808442e-05,"social_amenities":0.0004917973419651389,"party_restriction":0.0014299429021775723,"nearby_nightlife":0.8804688453674316}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 08005","address":"227 HOUSTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1}},"calls":[{"number":"24127133755","date":"2024-05-06","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Mcdonough St","recorded_pin":"20014 08001","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24345359329","date":"2024-12-10","type":"27 VERBAL DISTURB.","outcome":"Disturbance / nuisance","recorded_address":"229 Houston St","recorded_pin":"20014 08006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24347361603","date":"2024-12-12","type":"28-4 DOMESTIC DISTURB VERBAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"229 Houston St","recorded_pin":"20014 08006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25157159184","date":"2025-06-06","type":"41 PAST VEHICLE THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"229 Houston St","recorded_pin":"20014 08006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26004003505","date":"2026-01-04","type":"14-4 STALKING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"509 E Mcdonough St","recorded_pin":"20014 08001","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"731767479731401828","title":"Renovated Garden on Crawford Sq by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/731767479731401828","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02283"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"731767479731401828","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"a1df5ea72e33da9d2a70afbf06365a915b1ca83661748d67828196645ffab3c4","chunks":7,"words":610,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007010945584625006,"party_welcome":0.0012940771412104368,"social_amenities":0.013178112916648388,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.9903901815414429,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"Located on charming, quiet, Crawford Square, this renovated garden apartment sits beneath beautiful oak trees and is just a short stroll away from amazing restaurants, museums, and everything Savannah has to offer! The space Arrive to the clicking of horse drawn carriages and tree-lined sidewalks, right outside of where you'll enter into the shared entrance of this charming garden level apartment. After using your unique door code on the keyless entry, you'll find the beautiful open living space, fitted with elevated yet comfortable furnishings, an original (now decorative) fireplace, and plenty of space to spread out.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012240711657796055,"social_amenities":0.0037753775250166655,"party_restriction":0.0009450647048652172,"nearby_nightlife":0.12195314466953278}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Outside, you can relax and unwind, in the manicured shared courtyard. This space is truly an oasis in the heart of the city, as you'll have a large table to spread out surrounded by lush greenery and potted plants. You\u2019ll be in a prime location to walk to everything Savannah has to offer, but off the path of late-night revelry. In the morning, we recommend stepping over to Crawford Square then heading down to Urban Deli for a latte or refreshing iced coffee. For lunch, pop over to J.Christophers or Collins Quarters and explore their unique menus.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012940771412104368,"social_amenities":0.013178112916648388,"party_restriction":0.002106437925249338,"nearby_nightlife":0.9903901815414429}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Outside, you can relax and unwind, in the manicured shared courtyard. This space is truly an oasis in the heart of the city, as you'll have a large table to spread out surrounded by lush greenery and potted plants. You\u2019ll be in a prime location to walk to everything Savannah has to offer, but off the path of late-night revelry. In the morning, we recommend stepping over to Crawford Square then heading down to Urban Deli for a latte or refreshing iced coffee. For lunch, pop over to J.Christophers or Collins Quarters and explore their unique menus.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012940771412104368,"social_amenities":0.013178112916648388,"party_restriction":0.002106437925249338,"nearby_nightlife":0.9903901815414429}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coff