he beaten path, it offers a quiet, relaxing stay while remaining within easy walking distance of Savannah's top attractions. Traveler's Escape combines comfort and convenience in the Hostess City of the South. Inside, the living room features a queen trundle bed, comfortable seating, a flat-screen smart TV, and a breakfast table. The modern galley kitchen is fully equipped with everything you need to prepare meals at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.160892321029678e-05,"social_amenities":0.005099782254546881,"party_restriction":0.0011739335022866726,"nearby_nightlife":0.23819692432880402}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046241949894465506,"social_amenities":0.0015390949556604028,"party_restriction":0.0003949602833017707,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006926235510036349}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Step outside to the tropical courtyard-perfect for enjoying a book, a meal, or your morning coffee. At day's end, unwind in the king-sized bed with a plush pillow-top mattress. Please note that smoking is not permitted in the apartment or courtyard. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Living Room: Queen Trundle Bed What is parkin