,"signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"db145afea910b207e01d50c79377623a9602d153ee4ef9e0dc401d186b94a009","chunks":16,"words":1544,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.6926320195198059,"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.6926320195198059,"party_restriction":0.006324293091893196,"nearby_nightlife":0.9934700727462769,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Conveniently located near Crawford Square, one of the Historic District\u2019s original greenspaces, this prime example of Savannah vacation homes is close to everything too. You\u2019ll feel like royalty when the free shuttle bus stops right outside your door to whisk you away to dining, shopping and sightseeing destinations, all within minutes of your lovely home base. You can even venture farther afield to enjoy our heated swimming pool, reserved exclusively for Savannah vacation rentals guests. Whether your ideal vacation includes shooting a few hoops, strolling our unique Southern gardens or enjoying the city\u2019s cultural events, it\u2019s all here waiting for you in and around your Crawford Chic accommodations. What\u2019s Inside","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010281908325850964,"social_amenities":0.6926320195198059,"party_restriction":0.0022290819324553013,"nearby_nightlife":0.36900097131729126}},{"text":"Spend a little time wrapped in the luxury and beauty of Crawford Chic. Standing out among Savannah vacation rentals for its sprawling layout, Crawford Chic sleeps six overnight guests comfortably. The home pampers guests with a large kitchen, bright & airy atmosphere, 2.5 bathrooms, generous bedrooms, gated parking and serene porch made of the stuff of Southern-style dreams! Take a look inside one of the Savannah vacation homes perfect for making life in the city feel like a dream! The space Light, airy and carefree: Crawford Chic meets all your fondest vacation expectations and then some.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.20627246866934e-05,"social_amenities":0.5339053273200989,"party_restriction":0.0011750198900699615,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007709629717282951}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.0422353520989418,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0047673750668764114}},{"text":"Conveniently located near Crawford Square, one of the Historic District\u2019s original greenspaces, this prime example of Savannah vacation homes is close to everything too. You\u2019ll feel like royalty when the free shuttle bus stops right outside your door to whisk you away to dining, shopping and sightseeing destinations, all within minutes of your lovely home base. You can even venture farther afield to enjoy our heated swimming pool, reserved exclusively for Savannah vacation rentals guests. Whether your ideal vacation includes shooting a few hoops, strolling our unique Southern gardens or enjoying the city\u2019s cultural events, it\u2019s all here waiting for you in and around your Crawford Chic accommodations. What\u2019s Inside","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010281908325850964,"social_amenities":0.6926320195198059,"party_restriction":0.0022290819324553013,"nearby_nightlife":0.36900097131729126}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Conveniently located near Crawford Square, one of the Historic District\u2019s original greenspaces, this prime example of Savannah vacation homes is close to everything too. You\u2019ll feel like royalty when the free shuttle bus stops right outside your door to whisk you away to dining, shopping and sightseeing destinations, all within minutes of your lovely home base. You can even venture farther afield to enjoy our heated swimming pool, reserved exclusively for Savannah vacation rentals guests. Whether your ideal vacation includes shooting a few hoops, strolling our unique Southern gardens or enjoying the city\u2019s cultural events, it\u2019s all here waiting for you in and around your Crawford Chic accommodations. What\u2019s Inside","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010281908325850964,"social_amenities":0.6926320195198059,"party_restriction":0.0022290819324553013,"nearby_nightlife":0.36900097131729126}},{"text":"Spend a little time wrapped in the luxury and beauty of Crawford Chic. Standing out among Savannah vacation rentals for its sprawling layout, Crawford Chic sleeps six overnight guests comfortably. The home pampers guests with a large kitchen, bright & airy atmosphere, 2.5 bathrooms, generous bedrooms, gated parking and serene porch made of the stuff of Southern-style dreams! Take a look inside one of the Savannah vacation homes perfect for making life in the city feel like a dream! The space Light, airy and carefree: Crawford Chic meets all your fondest vacation expectations and then some.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.20627246866934e-05,"social_amenities":0.5339053273200989,"party_restriction":0.0011750198900699615,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007709629717282951}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"It also includes private, gated parking for up to two vehicles, heating and air conditioning, keypad entry and outdoor lighting. Don\u2019t forget your exclusive access to our Tybee Island pool. It\u2019s a great place to cool off and meet guests from other Savannah vacation rentals. Day Trip to Wormsloe Plantation If you brought your car to Savannah, take a short but scenic drive to the Isle of Hope, just 11 miles from downtown. This 2 by 4-mile peninsula is the site of the Wormsloe historic site. Built in the 18th century by one of Savannah\u2019s founders, Noble Jones, the 822-acre estate features a long avenue shaded by live oaks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006112109986133873,"social_amenities":0.011967761442065239,"party_restriction":0.006324293091893196,"nearby_nightlife":0.08845970034599304}},{"text":"March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.0422353520989418,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0047673750668764114}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"If you visit Wormsloe, make a day of it with a stop at the nearby Shops at Sandfly just a couple of minutes down the road. Depending on the time of day, you can stop by Cutter\u2019s Point Coffee shop for a quick pick-me-up or dine on fresh seafood at the Driftaway Caf\u00e9. Both are within a short drive of the Wormsloe historic site. There are plenty of great activities, venues and eateries nearby Crawford Chic too. Take a walking tour of the area\u2019s town squares. Each one has its own attractions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005090817576274276,"social_amenities":0.001600342569872737,"party_restriction":0.003932393155992031,"nearby_nightlife":0.9934700727462769}},{"text":"Nearby Chippewa Square boasts a theater and a museum while Lafayette Square stands in the shadow of the ornate St. John the Baptist Cathedral. This edifice is a must-see for many of our vacation rentals Savannah GA guests. Guest access Occupancy: 6 Beautiful Savannah vacation home next to Crawford Square Spacious and open living area with seating and flatscreen TV Full kitchen equipped with cooking essentials Dining table with seating for 4 Kitchen island has seating for 2 Outdoor space: Sunny porch with seating accessed from kitchen area Bedroom 1: King bed, smart TV, en suite full bathroom with double vanities and glass enclosed shower","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031709979521110654,"social_amenities":0.002796742832288146,"party_restriction":0.0008260348695330322,"nearby_nightlife":0.4617813229560852}}]}}},{"listing_id":"925325757640839665","title":"Near Crawford Historic Square, Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/925325757640839665","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02621"],"analysis":null},{"listing_id":"925325777921307500","title":"Gorgeous Home by Crawford Square w Private Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/925325777921307500","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02621","SVR-02622"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20014 09014","address":"230 HOUSTON ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All cal