 on your bucket list, eschew the large hotels in favor of more intimate lodgings provided by Savannah vacation rentals. These properties offer more privacy yet their central location make it possible for guests to enjoy Savannah\u2019s many secrets without straying too far from your chosen vacation homes Savannah. The space Discovering Savannah Vacation Rentals: Coach\u2019s Corner Vacation rentals are targeted to guests who are seeking a home-like atmosphere. Coach's Corner is a 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath property located near Orleans Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003658384084701538,"social_amenities":0.021691016852855682,"party_restriction":0.03445267677307129,"nearby_nightlife":0.003430120414122939}},{"text":"If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013668551109731197,"social_amenities":0.0024918660055845976,"party_restriction":0.0030489638447761536,"nearby_nightlife":0.0029183130245655775}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Other points of interest include the Savannah Civic Center, which plays host to various events throughout the year, and the campus of the Savannah College of Art and Design. Finding Savannah Vacation Rentals In the tradition of gracious southern hospitality, vacation homes in Savannah provide many opportunities for couples, families or groups of friends to enjoy their Georgia vacations. Consider contacting real estate professionals who specialize in this area to find the most suitable accommodations for your budget and preferences. Finding the right vacation home ensures that you get to have a stress-free, relaxing and memorable Savannah experience. Guest access 2 Bedrooms 1.5 Baths 2 Queen Beds Newly Renovated","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004904454108327627,"social_amenities":0.0014924585120752454,"party_restriction":0.001871555927209556,"nearby_nightlife":0.04693075269460678}},{"text":"When it comes to Georgia vacations, proximity to local attractions and amenities is a big draw. Vacation homes Savannah visitors favor typically meet this requirement if you choose your lodgings carefully. Coach's Corner is strategically located to Savannah's historic district. It is a short distance from several of the city's famous squares, which are meticulously designed formal gardens with fountains, monuments and even playgrounds. The nearest parks to Coach's Corner are Crawford, Troup and Lafayette Squares. However, if you are into historical and cultural monuments, head over to the sprawling Colonial Park Cemetery where some headstones date back to the late 1700's when the cemetery was first opened.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.157753811450675e-05,"social_amenities":0.0051344954408705235,"party_restriction":0.0013119063805788755,"nearby_nightlife":0.020487522706389427}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 10012","address":"507 E PERRY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,