 on Perry truly is your window on the world that is Savannah. This is an ideal property for anyone looking for a cozy home that can comfortably fit up to four guests. Features like a private courtyard, off-street parking, Wi-Fi, an in-house laundry setup and a new kitchen make it easy to feel like you've found a place to call home while exploring stunning Savannah for any length of time! SVR-02166 Guest access Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8423391580581665,"social_amenities":0.024733804166316986,"party_restriction":0.0010619983077049255,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736565351486206}},{"text":"Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022319531068205833,"social_amenities":0.011430354788899422,"party_restriction":0.0011089398758485913,"nearby_nightlife":0.00928357895463705}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":203,"scores":{"party_