uring your stay. The home can comfortably accommodate four overnight guests throughout its two bedrooms. The space Lavender on Perry Offers a Window on Savannah When arriving at Lavender on Perry, the first thing you'll notice is the home's cheerful violet exterior. There is also a small covered landing with rails leading to the door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034469555248506367,"social_amenities":0.016960620880126953,"party_restriction":0.0056964629329741,"nearby_nightlife":0.0076790968887507915}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"That means that occupants of the property can walk to many lush parks, historic monuments, shopping districts and cultural attractions. Of course, the home's cheery, bright exterior gives it a signature Savannah look that borrows from the famed painted porches of the Savannah Historic District. A polished, complete Savannah itinerary should include key points like Forsyth Park, Bonaventure Cemetery, the Sorrel Weed House, the Mercer Williams House Museum and the American Prohibition Museum. Savannah's River Street is always a highlight for anyone looking for lively pubs, live music and fun crowds.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005634966655634344,"social_amenities":0.0058884224854409695,"party_restriction":0.0013675445225089788,"nearby_nightlife":0.9948797225952148}},{"text":"Savannah comes alive when events like the Savannah Music Festival, the Savannah Food and Wine Festival, the Savannah Film Festival, the Savannah Speed Classic and the Boat Parade of Lights roll into town. Lavender on Perry truly is your window on the world that is Savannah. This is an ideal property for anyone looking for a cozy home that can comfortably fit up to four guests. Features like a private courtyard, off-street parking, Wi-Fi, an in-house laundry setup and a new kitchen make it easy to feel like you've found a place to call home while exploring stunning Savannah for any length of time! SVR-02166 Guest access Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8423391580581665,"social_amenities":0.024733804166316986,"party_restriction":0.0010619983077049255,"nearby_nightlife":0.9736565351486206}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 11012","address":"543 E PERRY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":5,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":4,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":5,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":4,"Disturbance / nuisance":1}},"calls":[{"number":"24145153833","date":"2024-05-24","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"542 E Perry Ln","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"},{"number":"24202214183","date":"2024-07-20","type":"71 NUISANCE","outcome":"Disturbance / nuisance","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"},{"number":"25199202529","date":"2025-07-18","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"},{"number":"25199202556","date":"2025-07-18","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"},{"number":"25200202585","date":"2025-07-19","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"},{"number":"26075076072","date":"2026-03-16","type":"22 NON-URGENT request","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"19469150","title":"Intimate Studio Hideaway by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/19469150","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-00883"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"19469150","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4fdfa87c15008925596b8554cc0a52b68a05f56684689c21f7c96159ea352483","chunks":7,"words":610,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.008289872668683529,"party_welcome":0.000365368090569973,"social_amenities":0.008289872668683529,"party_restriction":0.0019648922607302666,"nearby_nightlife":0.9830803871154785,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003403778828214854,"social_amenities":0.008289872668683529,"party_restriction":0.0006660881917923689,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007185973227024078}},{"text":"Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed SVR-00883 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017685943748801947,"social_amenities":0.003490207251161337,"party_restriction":0.0019648922607302666,"nearby_nightlife":0.09355511516332626}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"- Lucky Savannah Guest app with everything you need to know about your home (door code, wifi, TV channel lineup, etc. - 24/7 access to our team by phone, email, text, or messaging through App - Secure self check-in using our electronic keyless locks - Professionally laundered linens: you're bed linens are pressed just like a hotel (in fact we use the same linen service as 2 leading hotels) - Ample guest linens and guest consumables to get you through your stay without doing laundry or making a trip to the store - Concierge Services including pre-arrival grocery shopping, discounted trolley and walking tour tickets, and many other visitor items.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000365368090569973,"social_amenities":0.0014195889234542847,"party_restriction":0.0009368137689307332,"nearby_nightlife":0.00026837585028260946}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003403778828214854,"social_amenities":0.008289872668683529,"party_restriction":0.0006660881917923689,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007185973227024078}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003403778828214854,"social_amenities":0.008289872668683529,"party_restriction":0.0006660881917923689,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007185973227024078}},{"text":"Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed SVR-00883 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017685943748801947,"social_amenities":0.003490207251161337,"party_restriction":0.0019648922607302666,"nearby_nightlife":0.09355511516332626}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed SVR-00883 Guest access You will have private and uninterrupted access to the entire apartment. You'll also have full access to Lucky Savannah's market leading guest services, including:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017685943748801947,"social_amenities":0.003490207251161337,"party_restriction":0.0019648922607302666,"nearby_nightlife":0.09355511516332626}},{"text":"Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Washer Washer","section":"AMENITIES","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002551562211010605,"social_amenities":0.0027214898727834225,"party_restriction":0.0017640035366639495,"nearby_nightlife":0.007252697367221117}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Relax on the sofa or plan your day at the breakfast nook, located just outside the kitchen. Spacious for a studio apartment, the kitchen has all the modern amenities you need for a comfortable stay. The full bath features a pedestal sink and clawfoot tub, perfect for a relaxing bath after a day of sightseeing. You\u2019ll have the best of Savannah\u2019s dining and entertainment at your fingertips. Enjoy breakfast at nearby J. Christopher\u2019s before heading to Colonial Park Cemetery, where you can meander through tombstones for a bit of spooky history. Parking: Metered Parking","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033916966640390456,"social_amenities":0.0005372576997615397,"party_restriction":0.0011019480880349874,"nearby_nightlife":0.9830803871154785}},{"text":"Retreat after a long day of sightseeing in this charming studio apartment with fully-equipped kitchen, full bath with clawfoot tub, and a luxurious Queen size bed. The space Experience all Savannah has offer in this stylish studio apartment. Just steps off of Crawford Square, Perry Lane Carriage House is perfect for travelers looking to find the heartbeat of the city without compromising a good night's rest. Your private entrance is located in Perry Lane. Two sets of French doors fill the living space with light, and lead to a small balcony where you can breath in the jasmine scented air each morning.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.598628821549937e-05,"social_amenities":0.003243093378841877,"party_restriction":0.000869554583914578,"nearby_nightlife":0.10021606087684631}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 11013","address":"545 E PERRY ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":5,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":4,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":5,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":4,"Disturbance / nuisance":1}},"calls":[{"number":"24145153833","date":"2024-05-24","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"542 E Perry Ln","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24202214183","date":"2024-07-20","type":"71 NUISANCE","outcome":"Disturbance / nuisance","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25199202529","date":"2025-07-18","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25199202556","date":"2025-07-18","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25200202585","date":"2025-07-19","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26075076072","date":"2026-03-16","type":"22 NON-URGENT request","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"543 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20014 11012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"573988479004796279","title":"Charming Carriage House, Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/573988479004796279","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01911"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"573988479004796279","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"571d2c350478ec1c78e26b7a2bee4f90b939995d921064f26df9951053e8ffc4","chunks":14,"words":1392,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9398309588432312,"party_welcome":0.20300078392028809,"social_amenities":0.9398309588432312,"party_restriction":0.013769167475402355,"nearby_nightlife":0.9905996918678284,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"When you want a private retreat, Thrive on Perry is a great option. This home is just the right size for two people. You can explore Savannah on your own or bring a friend or loved one with you. The sleeping space has a queen size bed with two nightstands and reading lamps. When you aren't sleeping, you can enjoy a meal together at the high-top dining table or relax on the extra-wide loveseat in the living room. Get All the Comforts of Home on Your Vacation One of the great things about our vacation rentals Savannah GA is that they provide just about everything you would have at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005523306899704039,"social_amenities":0.9398309588432312,"party_restriction":0.008476373739540577,"nearby_nightlife":0.02685980126261711}},{"text":"With its stunning architecture, interesting past, and rich culture, Savannah is a great spot for a vacation. If you plan on staying in town for a bit, check out Thrive on Perry. This beautiful vacation home is the perfect space to stay in while you explore the city. The space Enjoy a Cozy Getaway at Thrive on Perry Thrive on Perry is one of our most charming Savannah vacation homes for couples and singles. The roomy apartment is situated inside a lovely brick building. When you walk in, you immediately step into a welcoming living space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019884309731423855,"social_amenities":0.22346244752407074,"party_restriction":0.011903160251677036,"nearby_nightlife":0.006587642710655928}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Depending on the time of year you stay at our Savannah vacation rentals, you can catch a concert, shop at the farmer's market, or participate in a holiday parade. Centrally located carriage house perfect for couple's getaway! Occupancy: 2 Spacious studio-style apartment with high ceilings and double french doors opening to balconies Love seat provides area to lounge while watching the flatscreen TV Full kitchen is great for prepping a meal at home Hightop dining table has 2 barstools Sleeping space features queen size bed and night stands with reading lamps Full bath features a charming pedestal sink and clawfoot tub/shower combination Location: Just around the corner from Crawford Square!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.20300078392028809,"social_amenities":0.001465841312892735,"party_restriction":0.0003242292732466012,"nearby_nightlife":0.9799251556396484}},{"text":"With its stunning architecture, interesting past, and rich culture, Savannah is a great spot for a vacation. If you plan on staying in town for a bit, check out Thrive on Perry. This beautiful vacation home is the perfect space to stay in while you explore the city. The space Enjoy a Cozy Getaway at Thrive on Perry Thrive on Perry is one of our most charming Savannah vacation homes for couples and singles. The roomy apartment is situated inside a lovely brick building. When you walk in, you immediately step into a welcoming living space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019884309731423855,"social_amenities":0.22346244752407074,"party_restriction":0.011903160251677036,"nearby_nightlife":0.006587642710655928}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"When you want a private retreat, Thrive on Perry is a great option. This home is just the right size for two people. You can explore Savannah on your own or bring a friend or loved one with you. The sleeping space has a queen size bed with two nightstands and reading lamps. When you aren't sleeping, you can enjoy a meal together at the high-top dining table or relax on the extra-wide loveseat in the living room. Get All the Comforts of Home on Your Vacation One of the great things about our vacation rentals Savannah GA is that they provide just about everything you would have at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005523306899704039,"social_amenities":0.9398309588432312,"party_restriction":0.008476373739540577,"nearby_nightlife":0.02685980126261711}},{"text":"Walk to great restaurants, coffee shops, shopping, and more! Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001971957244677469,"social_amenities":0.3182911276817322,"party_restriction":0.0008356370963156223,"nearby_nightlife":0.9606941938400269}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Situated on lovely Tybee Island, this pool is heated in the winter and surrounded by cozy lounge chairs and pavilions. Explore Savannah's Attractions From a Conveniently Central Location Thrive on Perry is situated in a quiet neighborhood within the charming Northern Historic District of Savannah. Like many other historic Savannah homes, it is next to a peaceful town square. In Crawford Square, you can explore a romantic setting with a pergola and stunning live oak trees. In addition to providing you with access to nature, the neighborhood around Thrive on Perry also contains a few charming shops and restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001601873809704557,"social_amenities":0.012831478379666805,"party_restriction":0.013769167475402355,"nearby_nightlife":0.9546108245849609}},{"text":"With its stunning architecture, interesting past, and rich culture, Savannah is a great spot for a vacation. If you plan on staying in town for a bit, check out Thrive on Perry. This beautiful vacation home is the perfect space to stay in while you explore the city. The space Enjoy a Cozy Getaway at Thrive on Perry Thrive on Perry is one of our most charming Savannah vacation homes for couples and singles. The roomy apartment is situated inside a lovely brick building. When you walk in, you immediately step into a welcoming living space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019884309731423855,"social_amenities":0.22346244752407074,"party_restriction":0.011903160251677036,"nearby_nightlife":0.006587642710655928}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You can grab a bite at Ta Ca Asian Fusion or get a souvenir from the Melted Grape candle store. The location of our Savannah vacation homes makes it easy to see all the other wonders of Savannah. It is close to the waterfront, so you can visit popular spots like The Olde Pink House, Little Duck Diner, or Leopold's Ice Cream. This part of town also includes a lot of fascinating history, like the Maritime Museum, and interesting culture like the SCAD Museum of Art. You can also hop on a free trolley to visit the Victorian District and see more incredible architecture.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00039091712096706033,"social_amenities":0.0037249508313834667,"party_restriction":0.0015355914365500212,"nearby_nightlife":0.9905996918678284}},{"text":"Depending on the time of year you stay at our Savannah vacation rentals, you can catch a concert, shop at the farmer's market, or participate in a holiday parade. Centrally located carriage house perfect for couple's getaway! Occupancy: 2 Spacious studio-style apartment with high ceilings and double french doors opening to balconies Love seat provides area to lounge while watching the flatscreen TV Full kitchen is great for prepping a meal at home Hightop dining table has 2 barstools Sleeping space features queen size bed and night stands with reading lamps Full bath features a charming pedestal sink and clawfoot tub/shower combination Location: Just around the corner from Crawford Square!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.20300078392028809,"social_amenities":0.001465841312892735,"party_restriction":0.0003242292732466012,"nearby_nightlife":0.9799251556396484}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 11015","address":"531 E PERRY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complain