ervices office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Queen Size Bed We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.749916742090136e-05,"social_amenities":0.001448789844289422,"party_restriction":0.0013823655899614096,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010984808905050159}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy the convenience of location at this modern, all brick carriage house in Savannah's Landmark Historic District. Picturesque Crawford Square is located just across the street, which was laid out in the 1840's and is steeped in history. The space Nestled on the corner of Perry lane and tree-lined Houston Street, Located in Savannah's Landmark Historic District, this carriage house is located off of Crawford Square. The location of this property is one you cannot beat - Within walking distance to the River front, Savannah's Shopping District on Broughton Street, and many more venues!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003200976934749633,"social_amenities":0.005755600519478321,"party_restriction":0.0005753929144702852,"nearby_nightlife":0.1227601021528244}},{"text":"Also located in the main living space you will find a small table for two, that can also be used as a workspace. Semi-private to the living space, there is a divide between rooms that transition into the bedroom, where you can rest easy in a queen size bed. A full-size bathroom, with a large vanity, walk-in shower, and a stackable washer + dryer, is located just off of the bedroom! What is Parking Like For This Home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm.","s