ol is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":142,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003682506794575602,"social_amenities":0.07177987694740295,"party_restriction":0.0022682652343064547,"nearby_nightlife":0.00446041626855731}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":234,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007289668428711593,"social_amenities":0.06431236863136292,"party_restriction":0.002311564749106765,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004177993687335402}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Savannah Scottish Games in May \u2022 Savannah Seafood Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Asian Festival in June \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 St. Paul\u2019s Greek Festival in October \u2022 Oktoberfest in October \u2022 Southern Lights Holiday Celebration in November \u2022 Taste of Savannah in November \u2022 Christmas on the River and Lighted Parade in December \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December Guest access 1 Queen-Sized Bed 1 Queen Sleeper Sofa Washer/Dryer Gourmet Kitchen Classic Drip coffee maker Patio Private parking space Wifi & Cable Package","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9779272079467773,"social_amenities":0.019477954134345055,"party_restriction":0.0011497620726004243,"nearby_nightlife":0.9923689365386963}},{"text":"Here, you'll have the option of simply beach combing, visiting the old lighthouse, checking out the Tybee Island Marine Science Center, booking a dolphin tour or taking a meal at one of the many great restaurants. When you book your vacation homes for rent Savannah with us, make sure to ask about any special events going on during your stay. Savannah is always full of action and the following is a list of possibilities: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February \u2022 Saint Patrick\u2019s Day in Savannah in March","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5867385268211365,"social_amenities":0.003150354605168104,"party_restriction":0.000774189131334424,"nearby_nightlife":0.9285379648208618}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":142,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003682506794575602,"social_amenities":0.07177987694740295,"party_restriction":0.0022682652343064547,"nearby_nightlife":0.00446041626855731}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":234,"scores":{"party_welco