es":0.019477954134345055,"party_restriction":0.0011497620726004243,"nearby_nightlife":0.9923689365386963}},{"text":"The best part of this house might be the big, enclosed patio complete with wicker furnishing and places to set drinks. Framed by plants and set against a brick facade, it's like a miniature tropical getaway. You generally won't have to go far to find things to do near your Savannah GA vacation homes, and this one is no exception. You'll be just east of Forsyth Park and just south of Calhoun Square. The Massie Heritage Center is also nearby, as is the St. John Baptist Church. Go a bit further east and you'll run into the Mother Mathilda Beasley Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002447935112286359,"social_amenities":0.005273643881082535,"party_restriction":0.00040528239333070815,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802906513214111}}]}}},{"listing_id":"22203094","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22203094","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00806"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22203094","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e64f17750c7fa57a106d6577ab7a41cf34a1ac65c35caca13e4c03868500ba40","chunks":16,"words":1549,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.12043245881795883,"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.12043245881795883,"party_restriction":0.004697464872151613,"nearby_nightlife":0.9679412841796875,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":234,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006522994372062385,"social_amenities":0.12043245881795883,"party_restriction":0.0015571943949908018,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006724915583617985}},{"text":"Do you need ample sleeping space, luxurious amenities and a location unlike any other? If so, then contact us today and book your stay at Crawford Main House. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":131,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033942455775104463,"social_amenities":0.03217703476548195,"party_restriction":0.002616660436615348,"nearby_nightlife":0.006703933235257864}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":142,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}},{"text":"Separating the entryway and staircase from this common area is a long couch, which offers the perfect setting for morning chats with friend, a rousing game of cards on the coffee table or a peaceful cuddle session while watching the HD flatscreen TV. Other seating options include a quirky armchair and wicker loveseat nestled between two end tables and highlighted by dual windows. At the far end of the living room is the open dining room. This completely separate room boasts an elegant dining table with seating for six. High-end amenities and design elements are sprinkled throughout home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0024773203767836094,"social_amenities":0.0035692641977220774,"party_restriction":0.00045487965689972043,"nearby_nightlife":0.052424728870391846}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":234,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006522994372062385,"social_amenities":0.12043245881795883,"party_restriction":0.0015571943949908018,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006724915583617985}},{"text":"Do you need ample sleeping space, luxurious amenities and a location unlike any other? If so, then contact us today and book your stay at Crawford Main House. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":131,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033942455775104463,"social_amenities":0.03217703476548195,"party_restriction":0.002616660436615348,"nearby_nightlife":0.006703933235257864}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Long-Term Stays For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":162,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467279311735183,"social_amenities":0.005870857276022434,"party_restriction":0.004697464872151613,"nearby_nightlife":0.0020174665842205286}},{"text":"Do you need ample sleeping space, luxurious amenities and a location unlike any other? If so, then contact us today and book your stay at Crawford Main House. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":131,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033942455775104463,"social_amenities":0.03217703476548195,"party_restriction":0.002616660436615348,"nearby_nightlife":0.006703933235257864}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located several blocks south of the famed riverfront entertainment district, you\u2019re within a few minutes walk to some of the greatest attractions, restaurants and points of interest Savannah has to offer. Walk north along Houston Street and stroll through beautiful Crawford Square. Continue walking north and you\u2019ll encounter countless restaurants and within a few short minutes, you\u2019ll be at the eastern tip of the riverfront walk district. From here, you\u2019ll have a choice between fine dining establishments or hilarious themed restaurants. There are very few vacation homes Savannah capable of positioning you so perfectly in the city. Savanah Vacation Rentals To Inspire, Invigorate and Intrigue","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028327287873253226,"social_amenities":0.015162837691605091,"party_restriction":0.002307805698364973,"nearby_nightlife":0.9679412841796875}},{"text":"Experience sights and sounds of Savannah while enjoying a sunset cocktail or embracing your loved ones while the warm Savannah air embraces you. Try finding this with almost any other vacation homes Savannah. The Taste of Home Whenever You Want - Kitchen Of course, what would vacation rentals Savannah GA be without a well-equipped kitchen? Crawford House spared no expense when renovating this room. With two access points, one from the dining room and one from the main entryway, you\u2019ll never want to be too far from this inspiring space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005210864474065602,"social_amenities":0.000787240918725729,"party_restriction":0.00026527000591158867,"nearby_nightlife":0.4692140817642212}}]}}},{"listing_id":"38019017","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/38019017","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-00805"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"38019017","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"61aeb65cc7bc2b4dd5490c466280b3d81ede4dafd97aee067db78e614156745b","chunks":13,"words":1230,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.16959713399410248,"party_welcome":0.9868017435073853,"social_amenities":0.16959713399410248,"party_restriction":0.005069612059742212,"nearby_nightlife":0.9892604351043701,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":211,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045338753261603415,"social_amenities":0.16959713399410248,"party_restriction":0.001846406375989318,"nearby_nightlife":0.001019560731947422}},{"text":"Walk in closet and dresser Free wifi Central heat/air Washer/dryer Next to Crawford Square Walk everywhere! Shared courtyard Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006403453298844397,"social_amenities":0.03506281226873398,"party_restriction":0.0027881930582225323,"nearby_nightlife":0.015218041837215424}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You can find the latter on the north end of the island and the former on the southeast side. Tybee is easy to walk around, or you can rent a bike and see the island that way. The options are endless. Do a little something extra when you stay in Vacation Rentals Savannah GA by attending one of the many festivals and events that happen regularly in Savannah and Tybee. Check out this short list for some examples: \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Mardi Gras Tybee in February \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9868017435073853,"social_amenities":0.0011726012453436852,"party_restriction":0.0005067173042334616,"nearby_nightlife":0.9892604351043701}},{"text":"\u2022 Savannah Tour of Homes and Gardens in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Tybee Island Beach Bum Parade in May \u2022 Savannah Seafood Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Telfair Art Fair in November \u2022 Tybee Island Christmas Parade in December Guest access Full kitchen with Dishwasher Breakfast bar with seating French press coffee maker Flatscreen TV and DVD player Bluetooth Speaker Queen size bed Desk/workspace Full length mirror Iron/Ironing Board Beautiful bathroom with walk in shower","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.11298929154872894,"social_amenities":0.002329204697161913,"party_restriction":0.0004520910733845085,"nearby_nightlife":0.9149457812309265}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":211,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045338753261603415,"social_amenities":0.16959713399410248,"party_restriction":0.001846406375989318,"nearby_nightlife":0.001019560731947422}},{"text":"Walk in closet and dresser Free wifi Central heat/air Washer/dryer Next to Crawford Square Walk everywhere! Shared courtyard Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006403453298844397,"social_amenities":0.03506281226873398,"party_restriction":0.0027881930582225323,"nearby_nightlife":0.015218041837215424}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"To the south of this property, you'll find the amazing gothic architecture of the Cathedral of Saint John the Baptist, as well as the Andrew Low House Museum and a few more historic squares. Although you can definitely walk to places further away, you may wish to enlist the Old Town Trolley Tour or Chatham Area Transit to get to River Street on the north end of the Historic District and Forsyth Park at the south end. If you have some extra time staying in our Savannah vacation homes, then you might want to take the 30-minute trip out to Tybee Island for some fun in the sand and surf.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005591729423031211,"social_amenities":0.003910235594958067,"party_restriction":0.005069612059742212,"nearby_nightlife":0.9287974834442139}},{"text":"It now has the appearance of a stately park with Spanish moss dripping from the old oaks. Not surprisingly, it's also a hot spot on many of the ghost tours in Savannah. If you're really brave, at least one tour will take you through at night! If you head to the north of this property, you'll find more historic squares in the form of Oglethorpe Square, Columbia Square and Greene Square. The Owens-Thomas House and the Gutstein Gallery by the Savannah College of Art and Design are also in this area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034191543818451464,"social_amenities":0.005992715712636709,"party_restriction":0.003519541583955288,"nearby_nightlife":0.9177240133285522}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You can find the latter on the north end of the island and the former on the southeast side. Tybee is easy to walk around, or you can rent a bike and see the island that way. The options are endless. Do a little something extra when you stay in Vacation Rentals Savannah GA by attending one of the many festivals and events that happen regularly in Savannah and Tybee. Check out this short list for some examples: \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Mardi Gras Tybee in February \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9868017435073853,"social_amenities":0.0011726012453436852,"party_restriction":0.0005067173042334616,"nearby_nightlife":0.9892604351043701}},{"text":"Tybee Island is an amazing and idyllic spot that is small on land but big on adventure. Relax on the Atlantic beaches, then take in some cute beach shops and then explore a few of the waterfront restaurants. Tybee is an easy day trip if you just want to soak in rays and saltwater. However, you can also make it just as adventurous as your Savannah excursions. Tybee offers a bevy of things to do, from ecology marsh walks, watercraft rentals, fishing and much more. Whatever you do, you won't want to miss the two main attractions in the Marine Science Center and Tybee Lighthouse.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031654644408263266,"social_amenities":0.003805838990956545,"party_restriction":0.0009039953583851457,"nearby_nightlife":0.9319003224372864}}]}}},{"listing_id":"38873563","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/38873563","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-00805","SVR-00806"],"analysis":{"listing_i