farmer's market. You can find fresh produce, artisan baked goods, music and plenty of other visitors from vacation rentals Savannah GA. While there, stroll over to the fabulous Forsyth fountain, the park's centerpiece. You'll likely happen upon a wedding ceremony taking place in front of the spectacular backdrop. If you have children in your group, they'll love the two playgrounds designed specifically for the very young and the school-aged sets. Jump back on the shuttle bus and ride down to the Savannah River waterfront, a great place to watch the big cargo ships come and go.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9886608123779297,"social_amenities":0.0067802793346345425,"party_restriction":0.0005572118097916245,"nearby_nightlife":0.949768602848053}},{"text":"You will also find plenty of unique gift shops, mouth-watering restaurants and open-air seating areas. At the eastern end of River Street, stop by the famous Waving Girl Statue and Olympic Monument. Check with our staff when reserving Savannah vacation rentals to find out about local festivals and events that coincide with your stay. As a city that celebrates the entire year round, Savannah is always hosting great events, from the SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April to the Savannah Craft Brew Fest in September. You'll likely find one that appeals to you. SVR-00805 & SVR-00806* Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9765321016311646,"social_amenities":0.020485149696469307,"party_restriction":0.01316211186349392,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927880167961121}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Central heat/air Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":178,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014738269965164363,"social_amenities":0.5545629262924194,"party_restriction":0.0007330875378102064,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011927231680601835}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":266,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005629212828353047,"social_amenities":0.05020328611135483,"party_restriction":0.0016248951433226466,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005957068060524762}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"You will also find plenty of unique gift shops, mouth-watering restaurants and open-air seating areas. At the eastern end of River Street, stop by the famous Waving Girl Statue and Olympic Monument. Check with our staff when reserving Savannah vacation rentals to find out about local festivals and events that coincide with your stay. As a city that celebrates the entire year round, Savannah is always hosting great events, from the SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April to the Savannah Craft Brew Fest in September. You'll likely find one that appeals to you. SVR-00805 & SVR-00806* Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9765321016311646,"social_amenities":0.020485149696469307,"party_restriction":0.01316211186349392,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927880167961121}},{"text":"The full kitchen includes a handy breakfast bar, a range, refrigerator, French press coffee maker and a microwave. Of course, like all Savannah vacation rentals, the Carriage House kitchen is fully stocked with a full complement of culinary tools. The boudoir area provides you with a queen bed, a nightstand and lamp, and a rocking chair. The bathroom opens off this space and features a contemporary glass-doored shower. Sights and Activities near Vacation Rentals Savannah GA When you stay at the Crawford Estate, you are only a few steps from one of the Savannah Historic District's town squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011517461389303207,"social_amenities":0.021214688196778297,"party_restriction":0.004260281100869179,"nearby_nightlife":0.9158191680908203}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You will also find plenty of unique gift shops, mouth-watering restaurants and open-air seating areas. At the eastern end of River Street, stop by the famous Waving Girl Statue and Olympic Monument. Check with our staff when reserving Savannah vacation rentals to find out about local festivals and events that coincide with your stay. As a city that celebrates the entire year round, Savannah is always hosting great events, from the SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April to the Savannah Craft Brew Fest in September. You'll likely find one that appeals to you. SVR-00805 & SVR-00806* Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9765321016311646,"social_amenities":0.020485149696469307,"party_restriction":0.01316211186349392,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927880167961121}},{"text":"If your visit includes a Saturday, be sure to head to Forsyth Park's weekly farmer's market. You can find fresh produce, artisan baked goods, music and plenty of other visitors from vacation rentals Savannah GA. While there, stroll over to the fabulous Forsyth fountain, the park's centerpiece. You'll likely happen upon a wedding ceremony taking place in front of the spectacular backdrop. If you have children in your group, they'll love the two playgrounds designed specifically for the very young and the school-aged sets. Jump back on the shuttle bus and ride down to the Savannah River waterfront, a great place to watch the big cargo ships come and go.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9886608123779297,"social_amenities":0.0067802793346345425,"party_restriction":0.0005572118097916245,"nearby_nightlife":0.949768602848053}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 11021","address":"241 E BROAD ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25325331372","date":"2025-11-21","type":"SHOTSPOTTER CALL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"243 E Broad St","recorded_pin":"20014 11020","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26188195374","date":"2026-07-07","type":"45 Property DAMAGE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"243 E Broad St","recorded_pin":"20014 11020","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"729600065257860169","title":"Stunning Home In Prime Location by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/729600065257860169","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02391"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"729600065257860169","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f0dbfe278b23e8c9f694e96b6cfb12b9d3819b5af21907f3e73a069217a7a8aa","chunks":9,"words":740,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9630947113037109,"party_welcome":0.9951500296592712,"social_amenities":0.9630947113037109,"party_restriction":0.05236152186989784,"nearby_nightlife":0.8660419583320618,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! The space This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! Stepping into your beautiful digs, you'll immediately be greeted by the essence of this charming Historic home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014752838760614395,"social_amenities":0.9630947113037109,"party_restriction":0.05236152186989784,"nearby_nightlife":0.003966114483773708}},{"text":"The second suite is fitted with a King, while the third offers a Queen. Both rooms have smart televisions, and a generous amount of storage space - ideal for extended stays. The full bath with tub/shower combo and large vanity is off of the hall, making it convenient for all! Just out back your private oasis awaits! The charming courtyard is the best place to relax and unwind, or start your day. Whether your enjoying a glass of wine, or a morning cup of coffee, you'll never want to leave.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023731782857794315,"social_amenities":0.004758861847221851,"party_restriction":0.0005802693194709718,"nearby_nightlife":0.026847247034311295}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The open floor plan boasts with tall ceilings, and large windows that fills each room with natural light. Truly an entertainers dream, as the open floor plan allows guests to never feel separated. The gathering room sits just off of the entrance, where everyone in your party can gather together for a movie or game night, which also features original stone hearth fireplaces dating back to 1872. Just beyond, you'll be able to host intimate dinners with friends and family in the formal dining room with seating for 8 guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9951500296592712,"social_amenities":0.0072961547411978245,"party_restriction":0.00020409961871337146,"nearby_nightlife":0.8660419583320618}},{"text":"As the host of the party you'll find that serving your guests will be seamless, as the transition from the kitchen to the dining room is easily accessible. The renovated kitchen offers everything needed to prepare your famous home cooked meals, or craft your favorite cocktails and lattes. At the back of the home, the first guest suite is perfect for traveling singles, seniors or young children, as this room features two plush twin size beds and an ensuite bathroom with walk-in shower. Upstairs, the two additional guest suites can be found, which are equipped with comfortable, plush beds, to ensure a sound nights sleep.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994170606136322,"social_amenities":0.000982050085440278,"party_restriction":0.000264944217633456,"nearby_nightlife":0.022802764549851418}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! The space This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! Stepping into your beautiful digs, you'll immediately be greeted by the essence of this charming Historic home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014752838760614395,"social_amenities":0.9630947113037109,"party_restriction":0.05236152186989784,"nearby_nightlife":0.003966114483773708}},{"text":"The heavily shaded courtyard is a rarity here in the Historic District, and you will have ample amount of space for your activity of choice. What Is Parking Like For This Home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Size Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0027283087838441133,"social_amenities":0.01767054945230484,"party_restriction":0.01207683328539133,"nearby_nightlife":0.8503201603889465}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! The space This hidden gem in the beautiful Historic District, rests beneath majestic oak trees, in a prime location within walking distance to River Street, City Market, beautiful Squares, and so much more. Beytagh 1872 is your ultimate Savannah retreat! Stepping into your beautiful digs, you'll immediately be greeted by the essence of this charming Historic home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014752838760614395,"social_amenities":0.9630947113037109,"party_restriction":0.05236152186989784,"nearby_nightlife":0.003966114483773708}},{"text":"The heavily shaded courtyard is a rarity here in the Historic District, and you will have ample amount of space for your activity of choice. What Is Parking Like For This Home? Parkin