by_nightlife":0.4682968258857727}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Portable fans Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003580169577617198,"social_amenities":0.007876296527683735,"party_restriction":0.0002723295474424958,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005098656401969492}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Step into the warm and inviting open-plan living area, where a comfortable green sofa invites you to relax after a day of sightseeing. The living space flows seamlessly into a modern kitchen, complete with a breakfast bar for casual meals. The serene bedroom features a unique botanical accent wall and offers direct access through a glass door to your own private brick patio\u2014a perfect spot for morning coffee or an evening drink. To enhance your stay, we provide a luxury experience with thoughtful touches: * A well-stocked coffee bar to start your day right * A full-size luxury air mattress can be provided for parties of up to four guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9726976752281189,"social_amenities":0.036957915872335434,"party_restriction":0.0004157295043114573,"nearby_nightlife":0.804049015045166}},{"text":"Guest access You will have private and exclusive access to the entire one-bedroom apartment, including the charming brick patio. For your convenience and security, entry is managed with a smart lock. We will provide your unique access code prior to your arrival for a seamless self-check-in experience. Other things to note * This is a one-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment. For parties of up to four guests, a full-size luxury air mattress can be provided. * City of Savannah SVR-02416 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.4698609411716461,"social_amenities":0.0025942863430827856,"party_restriction":0.003693185979500413,"nearby_nightlife":0.06705991178750992}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Discover Savannah from the Corner Store Retreat, a stylish and peaceful 1-bedroom apartment in the heart of the historic district. Comfortably sleeps up to 4. Features a private brick patio, a fully equipped kitchen, and luxury touches. Perfectly located for exploring the city's best landmarks, dining, and shops on foot. Your ideal urban home base for an unforgettable trip. The space Welcome to the Corner Store Retreat, an elegant and peaceful residence in the heart of Savannah's vibrant urban landscape. This stylish apartment is your perfect home base for exploring the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001829729153541848,"social_amenities":0.9942588806152344,"party_restriction":0.0583311952650547,"nearby_nightlife":0.4682968258857727}},{"text":"Step into the warm and inviting open-plan living area, where a comfortable green sofa invites you to relax after a day of sightseeing. The living space flows seamlessly into a modern kitchen, complete with a breakfast bar for casual meals. The serene bedroom features a unique botanical accent wall and offers direct access through a glass door to your own private brick patio\u2014a perfect spot for morning coffee or an evening drink. To enhance your stay, we provide a luxury experience with thoughtful touches: * A well-stocked coffee bar to start your day right * A full-size luxury air mattress c