 (3-Story): Main Level: A sophisticated living area with a large Smart TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005302131175994873,"social_amenities":0.7526795268058777,"party_restriction":0.0013191370526328683,"nearby_nightlife":0.13400432467460632}},{"text":"The fully equipped kitchen boasts a large island with seating for four, a wet bar, and a wine refrigerator. This level opens directly to the private courtyard. Second Level: Accessible by stairs or a private, wood-paneled elevator, this floor is a dedicated master suite. It features a King bed, a massive walk-in closet, and a luxurious full bathroom with double sinks and a huge walk-in shower. Third Level: Two more elegant bedrooms reside here\u2014one with a King bed and one with a Queen bed. Each has its own private full bathroom and a full-size closet. A laundry room with a washer and dryer is also conveniently located on this floor.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002029637253144756,"social_amenities":0.0010298873530700803,"party_restriction":0.0003598134790081531,"nearby_nightlife":0.005482375156134367}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 12016","address":"316 E HARRIS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24362376278","date":"2024-12-27","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"316 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20014 12016","side":"direct"},{"number":"24077081302","date":"2024-03-17","type":"69 ABANDONED VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"316 Habersham St","recorded_pin":"20014 12007","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25290295314","date":"2025-10-17","type":"53 SHOTS FIRED(heard only)","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"318 Habersham St","recorded_pin":"20014 12006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26115118425","date":"2026-04-25","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"318 Habersham St","recorded_pin":"20014 12006","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1061824254594787543","title":"Historic 5 Star\u2022Troup Sq\u20222 King\u20222 Parking\u2022Courtyd","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061824254594787543","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02930"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1061824254594787543","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"61e896b17197c32bf8737dc818f65bd46a6bab768c66eb54242f93d90b3ee018","chunks":11,"words":992,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006434562150388956,"party_welcome":0.9958831071853638,"social_amenities":0.006434562150388956,"party_restriction":0.011102546937763691,"nearby_nightlife":0.9526370167732239,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views Courtyard view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Sheets provided, room-darkening shades Standalone high chair - available upon request With padding and food tray Children\u2019s dinnerware Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023160404816735536,"social_amenities":0.006434562150388956,"party_restriction":0.0005516253877431154,"nearby_nightlife":0.0076109240762889385}},{"text":"We do like to offer our guests specialty vacation experiences at their request. We feel our homes provide a \u201clive like a local\u201d feel and strive for a personal touch that extends to the services we recommend below. All of these professionals come to you to make your vacation as relaxed as possible. Chef Our chefs specialize in preparing personalized dinners or meals tailored to your preferences. Baker Our baker specializes in cakes, cookies, meringues, cupcakes and amazing sweet treats of all kinds. I frequently send her a photo of something I\u2019d like for a party or small gathering and she can make it!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9958831071853638,"social_amenities":0.005224054213613272,"party_restriction":0.0002044357534032315,"nearby_nightlife":0.022753842175006866}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"We do like to offer our guests specialty vacation experiences at their request. We feel our homes provide a \u201clive like a local\u201d feel and strive for a personal touch that extends to the services we recommend below. All of these professionals come to you to make your vacation as relaxed as possible. Chef Our chefs specialize in preparing personalized dinners or meals tailored to your preferences. Baker Our baker specializes in cakes, cookies, meringues, cupcakes and amazing sweet treats of all kinds. I frequently send her a photo of something I\u2019d like for a party or small gathering and she can make it!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9958831071853638,"social_amenities":0.005224054213613272,"party_restriction":0.0002044357534032315,"nearby_nightlife":0.022753842175006866}},{"text":"Most recently, she made my mothers 80th birthday cake and there wasn\u2019t one morsel left over:) Tour Guides Our guides specialize in history tours of Savannah\u2019s Landmark Historic District. They can tailor your tour to your preferences\u2026history, architecture, ghost or pub tour. Certified Yoga Instructors Our instructors specialize in providing a class for your group\u2019s specific needs either on the back porch or dock at the River House of if you are staying at Parker House or Harris St townhouse, she can do them in the Square by the house. They will bring everything your group needs for the class. Charters","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037514721043407917,"social_amenities":0.0014097635867074132,"party_restriction":0.0013699150877073407,"nearby_nightlife":0.3822454810142517}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views Courtyard view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Sheets provided, room-darkening shades Standalone high chair - available upon request With padding and food tray Children\u2019s dinnerware Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023160404816735536,"social_amenities":0.006434562150388956,"party_restriction":0.0005516253877431154,"nearby_nightlife":0.0076109240762889385}},{"text":"We do like to offer our guests specialty vacation experiences at their request. We feel our homes provide a \u201clive like a local\u201d feel and strive for a personal touch that extends to the services we recommend below. All of these professionals come to you to make your vacation as relaxed as possible. Chef Our chefs specialize in preparing personalized dinners or meals tailored to your preferences. Baker Our baker specializes in cakes, cookies, meringues, cupcakes and amazing sweet treats of all kinds. I frequently send her a photo of something I\u2019d like for a party or small gathering and she can make it!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9958831071853638,"social_amenities":0.005224054213613272,"party_restriction":0.0002044357534032315,"nearby_nightlife":0.022753842175006866}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Our family townhouse is a true Southern haven\u2014tucked away on a quiet residential street, hidden from the crowds, yet just steps from Savannah\u2019s most beloved sights and experiences. This downtown gem offers two off-street parking spaces (a rare and valuable treat in Savannah), making it easy to explore the city on foot and return home effortlessly. Step outside and you\u2019re immediately immersed in the rhythm of historic Savannah\u2014tree-lined streets, classic townhomes, and the gentle hush of a true residential neighborhood. If you love strolling beneath moss-draped oaks, admiring 18th- and 19th-century architecture, or lingering at an outdoor caf\u00e9, you\u2019re right where you should be.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011352575529599562,"social_amenities":0.00179133634082973,"party_restriction":0.011102546937763691,"nearby_nightlife":0.08781115710735321}},{"text":"Unwind in our 1890 Historic District townhouse steeped in Southern charm. Enter the lantern-lit courtyard & step into soaring 13\u2019 ceilings, crown molding, antique furnishings, luxe kitchen & two welcoming king bedrooms with 2.5 baths. Enjoy free parking in front & only steps from Troup Square, the Cathedral & favorite local eateries. Sip morning coffee or evening wine in the serene courtyard, then stroll cobblestone streets & savor Savannah\u2019s best Southern flavors\u2014all from charming Harris Haven. The space Please take a moment to add our Haven on Harris townhouse to your wishlist by clicking the \u2764 in the upper-right corner so you can easily find us again.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003182670334354043,"social_amenities":0.0027133487164974213,"party_restriction":0.0022324975579977036,"nearby_nightlife":0.2470162957906723}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Just around the corner, stop by Urban Deli for fresh bites, gourmet sandwiches, and excellent lattes\u2014perfect fuel before a day of exploring. Along the way, enjoy a peaceful walk through Troup Square, home to the elegant Armillary Sphere, a favorite photo stop and one of the city\u2019s most charming squares. Wander a few blocks to famed Jones Street, often called the most beautiful street in America, then stop in at Clary\u2019s Caf\u00e9, a beloved Southern institution featured in Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018998116138391197,"social_amenities":0.001937880297191441,"party_restriction":0.000709103886038065,"nearby_nightlife":0.9526370167732239}},{"text":"From there, continue south to Forsyth Park, where you\u2019ll find the iconic white fountain, shaded walking paths, and the lively Saturday farmers market filled with local vendors, flowers, and fresh coastal flavors. History lovers will appreciate the short walk to the breathtaking Cathedral Basilica of St. John the Baptist, one of Savannah\u2019s most awe-inspiring landmarks. Nearby Broughton Street invites you to shop, dine, and explore\u2014home to boutiques, art galleries, restaurants, and classic Savannah squares that reveal something new with every visit. From this location, Savannah unfolds at an easy, unhurried pace.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002835249761119485,"social_amenities":0.000935495481826365,"party_restriction":0.0010160397505387664,"nearby_nightlife":0.9366112351417542}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 13013","address":"516 E HARRIS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24052053698","date":"2024-02-21","type":"52 PAST FRAUD/FORGERY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 E Liberty Ln","recorded_pin":"20014 13013","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"10431337","title":"Beautiful 1880s Carriage House w/Working Fireplace","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/10431337","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00032"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"10431337","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"01ea2c0740459596643484e3f9d22f38edb84aeba7607e52cbcdb044c72dbd73","chunks":8,"words":752,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0318506583571434,"party_welcome":0.0004453088331501931,"social_amenities":0.4853890538215637,"party_restriction":0.14676880836486816,"nearby_nightlife":0.9722146391868591,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel gas stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully 