with historic charm and thoughtful design. \u2022 Antique 1920s oak dining table (seats up to 6) \u2022 Working fireplace \u2022 Queen Rowe Furniture sleeper sofa with luxury air mattress \u2022 Flat-screen TVs in living room, bedroom, and kitchen \ud83d\udecf Bedroom & Bathroom Designed for rest and comfort. \u2022 Queen bedroom with classic furnishings \u2022 Full bathroom with tub/shower combo","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003229416615795344,"social_amenities":0.0017941974801942706,"party_restriction":0.000504370080307126,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014802304795011878}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Jingle Bells Square Cottage is a charming 1885 carriage house tucked behind the main home in Savannah\u2019s Historic District, just steps from Troup Square. Thoughtfully renovated to preserve its historic character, this cozy retreat features a working fireplace and a peaceful setting, all within easy walking distance to top restaurants, shops, historic squares, and iconic Savannah attractions. City of Savannah Registered | SVR-00032 | Minimum rental age: 25 The space \ud83c\udfe1 Historic 1885 Carriage House | Private Deck | Walk to Troup Square Stay in a beautifully restored 1885 Savannah carriage house just steps from Troup Square in the heart of the Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.987373050535098e-05,"social_amenities":0.4853890538215637,"party_restriction":0.14676880836486816,"nearby_nightlife":0.7511025071144104}},{"text":"Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel gas stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021593582641799003,"social_amenities":0.0318506583571434,"party_restriction":0.00038578311796300113,"nearby_nightlife":0.00047512524179182947}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Jingle Bells Square Cottage is a charming 1885 carriage house tucked behind the main home in Savannah\u2019s Historic District, just steps from Troup Square. Thoughtfully renovated to preserve its historic character, this cozy retreat features a working fireplace and a peaceful setting, all within easy walking distance to top restaurants, shops, historic squares, and iconic Savannah attractions. City of Savannah Registered | SVR-00032 | Minimum rental age: 25 The space \ud83c\udfe1 Historic 1885 Carriage House | Private Deck | Walk to Troup Square Stay in a beautifully restored 1885 Savannah carriage house just steps from Troup Square in the heart of the Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.987373050535098e-05,"social_amenities":0.4853890538215637,"party_restriction":0.14676880836486816,"nearby_nightlife":0.7511025071144104}},{"text":"\u2714 Working fireplace for cozy evenings \u2714 Walk to restaurants, caf\u00e9s, museums & shops \u2728 A rare opportunity to stay in an authentic Savannah carriage house with private outdoor space, historic charm, and an unbeatable walkable location. Guest access Entire Private Cottage Enjoy full privacy during your stay \u2014 the entire home is yours to relax, unwind, and make yourself at home. Your unique entry code will be shared with you at 3:00 PM on the day of arrival. Other things to note Minimum Age Limit for Renters (Principal Tenant must be 25 or older) ,non smoking only, pets not allowed, wheelchair inaccessible Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010971156734740362,"social_amenities":0.003357680980116129,"party_restriction":0.08865595608949661,"nearby_nightlife":0.9722146391868591}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2714 Working fireplace for cozy evenings \u2714 Walk to restaurants, caf\u00e9s, museums & shops \u2728 A rare opportunity to stay in an authentic Savannah carriage house with private outdoor space, historic charm, and an unbeatable walkable location. Guest access Entire Private Cottage Enjoy full privacy during your stay \u2014 the entire home is yours to relax, unwind, and make yourself at home. Your unique entry code will be shared with you at 3:00 PM on the day of arrival. Other things to note Minimum Age Limit for Renters (Principal Tenant must be 25 or older) ,non smoking only, pets not allowed, wheelchair inaccessible Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010971156734740362,"social_amenities":0.003357680980116129,"party_restriction":0.08865595608949661,"nearby_nightlife":0.9722146391868591}},{"text":"This private guest house blends authentic Southern charm with modern comforts, offering a peaceful retreat while still being walkable to Savannah\u2019s best restaurants, caf\u00e9s, historic squares, and attractions. Perfect for couples, solo travelers, digital nomads, and extended stays looking for a quiet and character-filled home base. \ud83c\udf3f Private Outdoor Deck (Rare Downtown Feature) Relax in your own private outdoor space after a day exploring Savannah. \u2022 Caf\u00e9 table and chairs for morning coffee \u2022 15-foot built-in bench for dining or relaxing \u2022 Quiet and secluded setting Outdoor space like this is extremely rare in the Historic District. \ud83c\udf73 Fully Equipped Kitchen","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011333894508425146,"social_amenities":0.002707687672227621,"party_restriction":0.00