analysis":{"listing_id":"35148789","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f5b1e9b3556cc7993336ee134f75a1fadb11c06b67080b0b1db42e57405dcfec","chunks":16,"words":1526,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9554064273834229,"party_welcome":0.9758412837982178,"social_amenities":0.9554064273834229,"party_restriction":0.3546451926231384,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927241206169128,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Perhaps it\u2019s the cultural history and overall atmosphere of a destination that transforms a bland visit into an epic getaway. No matter what you demand in a vacation, all of us require one essential element: bliss. Whether you\u2019re looking for a quick weekend excursion with your loved one or an extended adventure with friends and family, there\u2019s a historic coastal city guaranteed to delight. Savannah, GA., may sound familiar, but until you experience the eclectic atmosphere, delicious cuisines and historic charm of this well-preserved port city, it\u2019s impossible to grasp the unique qualities of Savannah. Savannah isn\u2019t your standard historic city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008638045401312411,"social_amenities":0.9554064273834229,"party_restriction":0.3546451926231384,"nearby_nightlife":0.007957031950354576}},{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Enjoy an intimate conversation on the plush sofa or watch your favorite movie on the mounted HDTV. Constructed as an open floor plan, the living room and kitchen flow into each other. This celebrated design style ensures even if you\u2019re stuck preparing a meal, you can socialize with your loved ones in the living room. The dark hardwood floors highlighted by brightly colored walls create an airy environment, while the numerous windows flood the interior spaces with natural light. Should you choose to make a homemade meal instead of walking to one of the many acclaimed restaurants in the neighborhood, you\u2019ll enjoy a chef-inspired kitchen.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9758412837982178,"social_amenities":0.0022123304661363363,"party_restriction":0.0002395442861597985,"nearby_nightlife":0.032835230231285095}},{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Perhaps it\u2019s the cultural history and overall atmosphere of a destination that transforms a bland visit into an epic getaway. No matter what you demand in a vacation, all of us require one essential element: bliss. Whether you\u2019re looking for a quick weekend excursion with your loved one or an extended adventure with friends and family, there\u2019s a historic coastal city guaranteed to delight. Savannah, GA., may sound familiar, but until you experience the eclectic atmosphere, delicious cuisines and historic charm of this well-preserved port city, it\u2019s impossible to grasp the unique qualities of Savannah. Savannah isn\u2019t your standard historic city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008638045401312411,"social_amenities":0.9554064273834229,"party_restriction":0.3546451926231384,"nearby_nightlife":0.007957031950354576}},{"text":"Full bathroom: 1 Stackable washer and dryer Wi-Fi Convenient Historic District East location Walking distance to Savannah\u2019s historic attractions, restaurants, bars, shopping, and nightlife Several blocks from River Street and Savannah\u2019s popular attractions Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001294497400522232,"social_amenities":0.050154902040958405,"party_restriction":0.0028826212510466576,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927241206169128}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Perhaps it\u2019s the cultural history and overall atmosphere of a destination that transforms a bland visit into an epic getaway. No matter what you demand in a vacation, all of us require one essential element: bliss. Whether you\u2019re looking for a quick weekend excursion with your loved one or an extended adventure with friends and family, there\u2019s a historic coastal city guaranteed to delight. Savannah, GA., may sound familiar, but until you experience the eclectic atmosphere, delicious cuisines and historic charm of this well-preserved port city, it\u2019s impossible to grasp the unique qualities of Savannah. Savannah isn\u2019t your standard historic city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008638045401312411,"social_amenities":0.9554064273834229,"party_restriction":0.3546451926231384,"nearby_nightlife":0.007957031950354576}},{"text":"May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Long-Term Stays For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467279311735183,"social_amenities":0.005870857276022434,"party_restriction":0.004697464872151613,"nearby_nightlife":0.0020174665842205286}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Full bathroom: 1 Stackable washer and dryer Wi-Fi Convenient Historic District East location Walking distance to Savannah\u2019s historic attractions, restaurants, bars, shopping, and nightlife Several blocks from River Street and Savannah\u2019s popular attractions Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001294497400522232,"social_amenities":0.050154902040958405,"party_restriction":0.0028826212510466576,"nearby_nightlife":0.9927241206169128}},{"text":"Whether you wish to take a stroll and enjoy the historic architecture of a bygone era or dive into one of the many bars and restaurants, 515 Liberty Carriage holds the key to a vacation that\u2019s uniquely you. As you navigate the masterfully planned streets in the nation\u2019s largest historic downtown area, you\u2019ll feel the air around you change. With every passing block, the worries and stress of the daily grind fade into the background. After parking the car and stepping out into the vibrant Historic District East neighborhood, you\u2019re greeted by a newly constructed building that promises an unforgettable adventure. The next step is the greatest.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007409871323034167,"social_amenities":0.003290379187092185,"party_restriction":0.0010392357362434268,"nearby_nightlife":0.988373339176178}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 13029","address":"519 E LIBERTY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":14.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24223235572","date":"2024-08-10","type":"1-4 PHYSICAL DISTURB. EMS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 E LIBERTY ST","recorded_pin":"20014 13028","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25236239330","date":"2025-08-24","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"517 E LIBERTY ST","recorded_pin":"20014 13028","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"39216359","title":"Liberty Lane Carriage House With Garage Spot!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39216359","guests":3.0,"permits":["SVR-02031"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"39216359","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"908cc89a9ff2db28ab70f4f3022130f6fce17c0bb38c4a86782688fe11013c0d","chunks":11,"words":993,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.3901849389076233,"party_welcome":0.0006703287363052368,"social_amenities":0.3901849389076233,"party_restriction":0.8110717535018921,"nearby_nightlife":0.8163321018218994,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What to bring with you: A typical grocery run prior to arriving at your vacation home would include coffee, beer/wine, milk, eggs, butter, bread and any other basic groceries you would need for the meals you eat in the home. The home has a K-cup coffee maker. The owners like to provide coffee, laundry detergent, and dryer sheets so if you see them there please feel free to use them. You should bring or buy your own napkins and your own beach towels and beach gear, and your own cooler if you need one. What we provide:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001446276146452874,"social_amenities":0.3901849389076233,"party_restriction":0.0002626376517582685,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014824430691078305}},{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025275841471739113,"social_amenities":0.029291387647390366,"party_restriction":0.0013396631693467498,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002702752535697073}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The required 13% taxes are already included in my airbnb rates (6% to the city and 7% to the state). Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006703287363052368,"social_amenities":0.0009226271067745984,"party_restriction":0.16971822082996368,"nearby_nightlife":0.1303890347480774}},{"text":"We provide toilet paper (2 extras per bathroom), liquid hand washing dish soap, bathroom soap, sheets on each bed, and at least one bath towel for each guest. We do not permit our towels to be taken out of the house which is why you must bring your own towels if you visit the beach. If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002710424305405468,"social_amenities":0.006361900828778744,"party_restriction":0.0012592629063874483,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015904078027233481}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What to bring with you: A typical grocery run prior to arriving at your vacation home would include coffee, beer/wine, milk, eggs, butter, bread and any other basic groceries you would need for the meals you eat in the home. The home has a K-cup coffee maker. The owners like to provide coffee, laundry detergent, and dryer sheets so if you see them there please feel free to use them. You should bring or buy your own napkins and your own beach towels and beach gear, and your own cooler if you need one. What we provide:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001446276146452874,"social_amenities":0.3901849389076233,"party_restriction":0.0002626376517582685,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014824430691078305}},{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025275841471739113,"social_amenities":0.029291387647390366,"party_restriction":0.0013396631693467498,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002702752535697073}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Once you go up the stairs to your private unit door you have an entire complete dwelling space that is not shared with anyone. Your unit has a washer/dryer, full bathroom, kitchen (no dishwasher), King bedroom with TV, Living room with TV and pullout single bed. You will have access to the shared courtyard. It is shared with the other 2 rentals in this private compound, and it is completely walled in and secure. We ask all guests to limit use to the hours of 8am to 9pm to avoid noise complaints from any neighbor and to observe the City of Savannah licensed vacation rental ordinance rules.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.861080277711153e-05,"social_amenities":0.0002390047739027068,"party_restriction":0.8110717535018921,"nearby_nightlife":0.015178040601313114}},{"text":"The required 13% taxes are already included in my airbnb rates (6% to the city and 7% to the state). Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006703287363052368,"social_amenities":0.0009226271067745984,"party_restriction":0.16971822082996368,"nearby_nightlife":0.1303890347480774}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Awesome location in Savannah's Historic District! This carriage house apartment has a compact designer kitchen and ultra stylish furnishings. Private garage parking for 1 small car below the rental is an added luxury! Steps from dining, shopping and tourist landmarks. King size bed + single cot pullout chair for person #3 if needed in living room. Garage bay fits a small or medium size car. If your vehicle is large the street parking is free to the public on this block. SVR- 02031 The space Ultra light, modern and spacious one bedroom apartment. Professionally decorated and newly constructed. High end linens and finishes throughout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000264052243437618,"social_amenities":0.0011257705045863986,"party_restriction":0.0023074294440448284,"nearby_nightlife":0.8163321018218994}},{"text":"The required 13% taxes are already included in my airbnb rates (6% to the city and 7% to the state). Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006703287363052368,"social_amenities":0.0009226271067745984,"party_restriction":0.16971822082996368,"nearby_nightlife":0.1303890347480774}}]}}},{"listing_id":"39230330","title":"Luxury Town House on Liberty in Downtown Savannah!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39230330","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02032"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"39230330","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"cce4829fcf8902ef1f63ce78ffca42106bc28a5b5867bf560429866cde56671c","chunks":11,"words":1022,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.021146157756447792,"party_welcome":0.9681328535079956,"social_amenities":0.021146157756447792,"party_restriction":0.9989293217658997,"nearby_nightlife":0.9818618297576904,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"2nd bedroom has two Twin beds and third bedroom also has two Twin beds. All bedrooms are upstairs. Living room sofa downstairs pulls out if needed (you will need to slide it back to pullout). Gourmet kitchen and beautiful spacious dining area. Private laundry. 2.5 updated bathrooms are in the house, two upstairs and the powder room half bathroom downstairs. All furnishings and linens are brand new and high end designer items. Guest access The home is a private rental. All of the rooms described are 100% private for your party inside the house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9681328535079956,"social_amenities":0.021146157756447792,"party_restriction":0.0018801642581820488,"nearby_nightlife":0.002162087243050337}},{"text":"Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":132,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020295077410992235,"social_amenities":0.00945943221449852,"party_restriction":0.0011102167190983891,"nearby_nightlife":0.00038969708839431405}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"2nd bedroom has two Twin beds and third bedroom also has two Twin beds. All bedrooms are upstairs. Living room sofa downstairs pulls out if needed (you will need to slide it back to pullout). Gourmet kitchen and beautiful spacious dining area. Private laundry. 2.5 updated bathrooms are in the house, two upstairs and the powder room half bathroom downstairs. All furnishings and linens are brand new and high end designer items. Guest access The home is a private rental. All of the rooms described are 100% private for your party inside the house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9681328535079956,"social_amenities":0.021146157756447792,"party_restriction":0.0018801642581820488,"nearby_nightlife":0.002162087243050337}},{"text":"Gorgeous new brick row house with soaring ceilings, gourmet kitchen, designer bathrooms and all the comforts of a fabulous hotel. A private back porch and shared patio make for an outdoor oasis in the courtyard area. Savannah's fine dining, night life and shopping destinations are all just a short stroll away from this convenient spot on Liberty Street. Parking is free on the street on this block. The home accommodates 6 adults and up to 2 extra kids or teens NO TAPE ALLOWED ON WALLS SVR 02032 The space This is a 1950sf new construction luxury home. The master bedroom has a King size bed with en suite bedroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013473685830831528,"social_amenities":0.005445660557597876,"party_restriction":0.023191090673208237,"nearby_nightlife":0.9818618297576904}}],"social_amenities":[{"tex