terrace. Looking for a fun way to end the night? Enjoy hand crafted cocktails with your party at The Lost Square Rooftop Bar, over looking River Street. What is Parking Like For This Home? This unit has non-metered on-street parking. Parking is not available in the lane. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Sleeping Configuration: Living Room: Queen Size Sleeper Sofa Bedroom: Queen Bed SVR-02063 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01611168496310711,"social_amenities":0.003796492936089635,"party_restriction":0.0024837730452418327,"nearby_nightlife":0.995733916759491}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Heading into the evening, step over to The Public and enjoy dinner on their rooftop terrace. Looking for a fun way to end the night? Enjoy hand crafted cocktails with your party at The Lost Square Rooftop Bar, over looking River Street. What is Parking Like For This Home? This unit has non-metered on-street parking. Parking is not available in the lane. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Sleeping Configuration: Living Room: Queen Size Sleeper Sofa Bedroom: Queen Bed SVR-02063 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01611168496310711,"social_amenities":0.003796492936089635,"party_restriction":0.0024837730452418327,"nearby_nightlife":0.995733916759491}},{"text":"The en suite bathroom boasts with natural light and wallpaper, tying this quaint space together. Guests will appreciate having plenty of counter space to get ready for a day out on the town! Looking to start your day off with brunch? Head South West toward Oglethorpe Avenue to Collin's Quarters. While on your way, take a short detour and stroll through Colonial Park Cemetery. Pop over to some of Savannah's most famed shops just over on Broughton Street, such as The Paris Market, a boutique offering an eclectic range of antiques, housewares, gifts & jewelry.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002991168585140258,"social_amenities":0.0019476921297609806,"party_restriction":0.0011622172314673662,"nearby_nightlife":0.9551293849945068}}]}}},{"listing_id":"40865697","title":"Upscale Home with Plunge Pool by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/40865697","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02064","SVR-02065"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"40865697","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"76dcc8aba1ef0da4d530abfc43e6b7f2dbd0d4922720cfe5394fb4e484593ae3","chunks":7,"words":579,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.008226732723414898,"party_welcome":0.001598210772499442,"social_amenities":0.008226732723414898,"party_restriction":0.0009516829159110785,"nearby_nightlife":0.020440565422177315,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Located in the Downtown Historic District, this well-appointed, three-story home overlooks tree lined Liberty Street - No detail has been spared! Up to ten guests are welcomed at Lady Liberty Main. The space This newly built three-story home offers high end amenities, and upscale furnishings. Just off of Liberty Street, you will feel like a local in the Downtown Historic District. Just a few short steps up to the main level, guests will enter into their new home away from home. The main level offers an inviting living space where guests are welcomed to join together, chefs kitchen, and a formal dining area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001598210772499442,"social_amenities":0.008226732723414898,"party_restriction":0.0006256909691728652,"nearby_nightlife":0.011824047192931175}},{"text":"An additional guest can be accommodated with the twin memory foam sleeper ottoman in the living room. Conveniently placed, your guests can use the half bath on the main floor. Off the dining room, step out onto your back porch for a morning cup of joe with views of your private plunge pool, and the cathedral in the distance. After sending your luggage up via elevator, the third floor consists of two primary suites, each fitted with an en suite bathroom, and sophisticated decor. Both bedrooms are fitted with a television, and large walk-in closets perfect for storing belongings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028734130319207907,"social_amenities":0.004485161975026131,"party_restriction":0.0002917447709478438,"nearby_nightlife":0.020440565422177315}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Located in the Downtown Historic District, this well-appointed, three-story home overlooks tree lined Liberty Street - No detail has been spared! Up to ten guests are welcomed at Lady Liberty Main. The space This newly built three-story home offers high end amenities, and upscale furnishings. Just off of Liberty Street, you will feel like a local in the Downtown Historic District. Just a few short steps up to the main level, guests will enter into their new home away from home. The main level offers an inviting living space where guests are welcomed to join together, chefs kitchen, and a formal dining area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001598210772499442,"social_amenities":0.008226732723414898,"party_restriction":0.0006256909691728652,"nearby_nightlife":0.011824047192931175}},{"text":"The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040698007796891034,"social_amenities":0.0009207991533912718,"party_restriction":0.0008974659722298384,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006328349118120968}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"L