 convenience of a private garage spot suitable for a mid-size or smaller vehicle, or take advantage of free street parking on the block. With Savannah\u2019s top attractions, restaurants, and shops just a short stroll away, you may not even want a car. \ud83c\udf33 Historic & Peaceful Location Tucked away on a quiet block of a tree-lined street in the historic district, Magnolia Carriage offers a peaceful haven after a day of exploring. Guests also have access to a shared courtyard\u2014perfect for sipping sweet tea and soaking in the Southern charm. Every corner of Savannah tells a story\u2014immerse yourself in its rich history, vibrant arts scene, and unforgettable hospitality.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010365218622609973,"social_amenities":0.0033569326624274254,"party_restriction":0.004014134407043457,"nearby_nightlife":0.8217189311981201}},{"text":"Welcome to Magnolia Carriage\u2014your serene retreat nestled in vibrant downtown Savannah. Just steps from iconic River Street and the city\u2019s famed cobblestone lanes, this beautifully appointed guesthouse offers the perfect blend of charm, comfort, and convenience. The space \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Relax in Comfort Unwind in style with plush memory foam mattresses, cozy linens, and thoughtfully curated decor. Whether you're here for a romantic getaway or a solo escape, restful nights await. \ud83c\udf73 Fully Equipped Kitchen Cook up your favorite meals in the well-stocked kitchen, complete with cookware, utensils, seasonings, and cooking oil\u2014everything you need for a night in. \ud83d\ude97 Easy Parking & Walkability","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018372466729488224,"social_amenities":0.002656379947438836,"party_restriction":0.0013232127530500293,"nearby_nightlife":0.012947997078299522}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy the convenience of a private garage spot suitable for a mid-size or smaller vehicle, or take advantage of free street parking on the block. With Savannah\u2019s top attractions, restaurants, and shops just a short stroll away, you may not even want a car. \ud83c\udf33 Historic & Peaceful Location Tucked away on a quiet block of a tree-lined street in the historic district, Magnolia Carriage offers a peaceful haven after a day of exploring. Guests also have access to a shared courtyard\u2014perfect for sipping sweet tea and soaking in the Southern charm. Every corner of Savannah tells a story\u2014immerse yourself in its rich history, vibrant arts scene, and unforgettable hospitality.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010365218622609973,"social_amenities":0.0033569326624274254,"party_restriction":0.004014134407043457,"nearby_nightlife":0.8217189311981201}},{"text":"Welcome to Magnolia Carriage\u2014your serene retreat nestled in vibrant downtown Savannah. Just steps from iconic River Street and the city\u2019s famed cobblestone lanes, this beautifully appointed guesthouse offers the perfect blend of charm, comfort, and convenience. The space \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Relax in Comfort Unwind in style with plush memory foam mattresses, cozy linens, and thoughtfully curated decor. Whether you're here for a romantic getaway or a solo escape, restful nights await. \ud83c\udf73 Fully Equipped Kitchen Cook up your favorite meals in the well-stocked kitchen, complete with cookware, utensils, seasonings, and cooking oil\u2014everything you need for a night in. \ud83d\ude97 Easy Parking & Walkability","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018372466729488224,"social_amenities":0.002656379947438836,"party_restriction":0.0013232127530500293,"nearby_nightlife":0.012947997078299522}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1149169299169045858","title":"Magnolia Estate - 3 Separate Units, Courtyard","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1149169299169045858","guests":16.0,"permits":["SVR-01419","SVR-01420","SVR-01421"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1149169299169045858","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d2f50abbe6fdbb3f8d2caf2cd05967f83f8985e082a561e8666fc1b5c4851dea","chunks":5,"words":465,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.008684906177222729,"party_welcome":0.0011243391782045364,"social_amenities":0.008684906177222729,"party_restriction":0.0010257101384922862,"nearby_nightlife":0.8989414572715759,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Entertainment TV with Roku Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Board games Baby safety gates Heating and cooling Air conditioning Indoor fireplace: gas Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024355495406780392,"social_amenities":0.008684906177222729,"party_restriction":0.0002890723990276456,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005395768093876541}},{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Baking sheet Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":136,"score