ores":{"party_welcome":0.0011243391782045364,"social_amenities":0.001629000180400908,"party_restriction":0.0006173183210194111,"nearby_nightlife":0.8989414572715759}},{"text":"Two garage parking spaces for mid-size or smaller vehicles and free street parking make it easy to explore beyond downtown. \u2728 What Guests Love Most \u2022 Three separate living quarters with private entrances \u2022 Multiple living and cooking areas for ultimate flexibility \u2022 Elegant interiors with a warm, welcoming ambiance \u2022 Prime location near Savannah\u2019s top attractions STVR Certificate: SVR-01419 STVR Certificate: SVR-01420 STVR Certificate: SVR-01421 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003116588050033897,"social_amenities":0.0019969865679740906,"party_restriction":0.0007018102332949638,"nearby_nightlife":0.01218988373875618}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 18012","address":"517 E HARRIS ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24201212822","date":"2024-07-19","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20014 18012","side":"direct"},{"number":"25123124234","date":"2025-05-03","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 E HARRIS ST","recorded_pin":"20014 18012","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1009469686678735726","title":"Prime Location w/ Private Parking + Courtyard","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1009469686678735726","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02810"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1009469686678735726","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"461064d3b20b2ee109f2484e7084da158441dc1cf7ec735864e368e9031017aa","chunks":8,"words":667,"party_signal":0.9947707056999207,"social_signal":0.7818747758865356,"party_welcome":0.9947707056999207,"social_amenities":0.7818747758865356,"party_restriction":0.02706276625394821,"nearby_nightlife":0.06714016199111938,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Harris House offers an open and airy ambiance, thoughtfully adorned with mid-century furnishings that radiate warmth and invite you to relax. Upon entering, you'll be greeted by an open living room, perfect for hosting gatherings with friends and family. It\u2019s an ideal space to unwind, catch up on your favorite shows after a day of exploring the town, engage in a lively game night with your fellow travelers, or curl up by the decorative fireplace with a selection from the reading library.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9947707056999207,"social_amenities":0.000992240966297686,"party_restriction":8.689581591170281e-05,"nearby_nightlife":0.06714016199111938},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Upon entering, you'll be greeted by an open living room, perfect for hosting gatherings with friends and family."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Welcome to Harris House, a charming home nestled in the heart of the Historic District, where tree-lined streets and the convenience of downtown living await. The space Welcome to Harris House, a charming home nestled in the heart of the Historic District, where tree-lined streets and the convenience of downtown await. Within walking distance to everything downtown has to offer, this three-story freestanding home exudes a timeless appeal with a touch of history. With three full bedrooms, all featuring ensuite bathrooms, this delightful home is perfect for couples or families.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018670648569241166,"social_amenities":0.7818747758865356,"party_restriction":0.02706276625394821,"nearby_nightlife":0.00687604583799839}},{"text":"Out back, you'll find a large, brick courtyard with privacy fence that provides a delightful escape. Equipped with a gas grill and ample seating, it's the perfect setting for intimate outdoor meals or a relaxing evening glass of wine. Harris House is not just a vacation rental; it's a retreat that combines modern comforts with old-world charm. Make this your home away from home as you explore the vibrant surroundings of the Historic District and enjoy the rich tapestry of experiences that await you in beautiful Savannah. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: King Bed What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005844710394740105,"social_amenities":0.008608528412878513,"party_restriction":0.0016743260202929378,"nearby_nightlife":0.016180381178855896}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Harris House offers an open and airy ambiance, thoughtfully adorned with mid-century furnishings that radiate warmth and invite you to relax. Upon entering, you'll be greeted by an open living room, perfect for hosting gatherings with friends and family. It\u2019s an ideal space to unwind, catch up on your favorite shows after a day of exploring the town, engage in a lively game night with your fellow travelers, or curl up by the decorative fireplace with a selection from the reading library.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9947707056999207,"social_amenities":0.000992240966297686,"party_restriction":8.689581591170281e-05,"nearby_nightlife":0.06714016199111938}},{"text":"Welcome to Harris House, a charming home nestled in the heart of the Historic District, where tree-lined streets and the convenience of downtown living await. The space Welcome to Harris House