_amenities":0.000992240966297686,"party_restriction":8.689581591170281e-05,"nearby_nightlife":0.06714016199111938}},{"text":"Adjacent to the living room is a formal dining room, conveniently situated next to a well-appointed wet bar, making it an excellent spot for intimate dinners or even a productive workspace. The fully equipped kitchen features stainless steel appliances and ensures you have all you need to prepare delicious home-cooked meals. A convenient powder room and year-round sunroom complete the first floor. Venture up to the second floor, where the primary suite awaits with a king-sized bed, decorative fireplace, ceiling fan, plenty of storage for your belongings, a smart television, and a spacious ensuite bathroom complete with double vanity.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003347710007801652,"social_amenities":0.004598492756485939,"party_restriction":0.00035655670217238367,"nearby_nightlife":0.05667790398001671}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 18017","address":"516 E MACON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":18.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24011010657","date":"2024-01-11","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"520 E MACON ST","recorded_pin":"20014 18017","side":"direct"},{"number":"24143150523","date":"2024-05-22","type":"1-4 ASSAULT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"518 E Macon St","recorded_pin":"20014 18017","side":"direct"},{"number":"24260271758","date":"2024-09-16","type":"22 OTHER","ou