ding entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006440375582315028,"social_amenities":0.1803918033838272,"party_restriction":0.0012067161733284593,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009180502383969724}},{"text":"This thoughtfully renovated space features a private courtyard that feels like an outdoor room--one where you can dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, check your email and sip sweet tea or wine in the afternoon. With a nod toward mid-century modern design, Courtyard Cottage is eclectically furnished and decorated with modern and local art. Open the door and step into the kitchen with original heart pine floors and a table with seating for four. You\u2019ll find it is well-appointed with the tools you need to cook a great meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005386248813010752,"social_amenities":0.007638182025402784,"party_restriction":0.00026486566639505327,"nearby_nightlife":0.0656568855047226}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer GE electric stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006440375582315028,"social_amenities":0.1803918033838272,"party_restriction":0.0012067161733284593,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009180502383969724}},{"text":"This thoughtfully renovated space features a private courtyard that feels like an outdoor room--one where you can dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, check your email and sip sweet tea or wine in the afternoon. With a nod toward mid-century modern design, Courtyard Cottage is eclectically furnished and decorated with modern and local art. Open the door and step into the kitchen with original heart pine floors and a table with seating for four. You\u2019ll find it is well-appointed with the tools you need to cook a great meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005386248813010752,"social_amenities":0.007638182025402784,"party_restriction":0.00026486566639505327,"nearby_nightlife":0.0656568855047226}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer GE electric stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006440375582315028,"social_amenities":0.1803918033838272,"party_restriction":0.0012067161733284593,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009180502383969724}},{"text":"This thoughtfully renovated space features a private courtyard that feels like an outdoor room--one where you can dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, check your email and sip sweet tea or wine in the afternoon. With a nod toward mid-century modern design, Courtyard Cottage is eclectically furnished and decorated with modern and local art. Open the door and step into the kitchen with original heart pine floors and a table with seating for four. You\u2019ll find it is well-appointed with the tools you need to cook a great meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005386248813010752,"social_amenities":0.007638182025402784,"party_restriction":0.00026486566639505327,"nearby_nightlife":0.0656568855047226}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Tucked in a quiet neighborhood of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, Courtyard Cottage is a thoughtfully renovated, peaceful retreat. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen and a private courtyard\u2014perfect for morning coffee or afternoon wine. City Market is just a 10-minute walk, so a car isn\u2019t needed. If you bring one, free street parking is available on the cottage side of the street, with paid parking across the way. Savannah STVR Certificate #SVR-00629. The space Courtyard Cottage is your relaxing getaway in beautiful Historic Savannah located a block and a half from Troup Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.360519132111222e-05,"social_amenities":0.0018802840495482087,"party_restriction":0.003976898267865181,"nearby_nightlife":0.019580433145165443}},{"text":"For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":140,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004643480642698705,"social_amenities":0.0018540580058470368,"party_restriction":0.0013867405941709876,"nearby_nightlife":0.00042558525456115603}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You will also find a hair dryer, iron and ironing board. For your entertainment, enjoy wifi and cable TV. Bring your codes for Netflix, etc., through the smart TV. Savannah is best experienced on foot. Park your car in front of the cottage and explore the moss-draped streets, hidden gardens and beautiful architecture of our charming city. Everything you need is in walking distance\u2014historic sites, restaurants, pubs and groceries. We designed our charming Courtyard Cottage with your comfort in mind. Come enjoy Savannah like a local. Guest access This 525 sq. ft. private cottage is at your complete disposal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003376925888005644,"social_amenities":0.00156864442396909,"party_restriction":0.0005535283708013594,"nearby_nightlife":0.9892709255218506}},{"text":"This thoughtfully renovated space features a private courtyard that feels like an outdoor room--one where you can dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, check your email and sip sweet tea or wine in the afternoon. With a nod toward mid-century modern design, Courtyard Cottage is eclectically furnished and decorated with modern and local art. Open the door and step into the kitchen with original heart pine floors and a table with seating for four. You\u2019ll find it is well-appointed with the tools you need to cook a great meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005386248813010752,"social_amenities":0.007638182025402784,"party_restriction":0.00026486566639505327,"nearby_nightlife":0.0656568855047226}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 18037","address":"536 E CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaint