 Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030616571893915534,"social_amenities":0.0033578278962522745,"party_restriction":0.0003274075861554593,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010358336148783565}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Travel/Vacation Insurance \u2013 No one wants to cancel or cut short their travel plans, especially if they end up paying for a vacation they didn\u2019t get to use. Travel Insurance can protect your vacation investment. I do not offer nor endorse any particular company or plan, I just want to inform and remind you that such coverage exists. To purchase, contact your insurance provider or do an Internet search. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021698011551052332,"social_amenities":0.0017712091794237494,"party_restriction":0.002093238988891244,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005976110114715993}},{"text":"Sunlit and cheerful, Shipwreck Cottage is tucked in a quiet neighborhood in Savannah\u2019s Historic District where you\u2019ll sleep soundly away from the raucous party that is City Market and Ellis Square, but your feet will take you there in just 10 minutes. Named for the original photographs of local shipwrecks that decorate the space, you\u2019ll enjoy your morning coffee and evening cocktail in the private courtyard. City of Savannah Cert: SVR-02408 The space Shipwreck Cottage is your relaxing getaway in beautiful Historic Savannah located a block and a half from Troup Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016806328494567424,"social_amenities":0.000882732099853456,"party_restriction":0.0009782485431060195,"nearby_nightlife":0.968241274356842}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Park your car in front of the cottage in one of the free spaces, or across the street in a paid space, and explore the moss-draped streets, hidden gardens and beautiful architecture of our charming city. Everything you need is in walking distance\u2014historic sites, restaurants, pubs and groceries. We designed our charming Shipwreck Cottage with your comfort in mind. Come enjoy Savannah like a local. Guest access This 525 sq. ft. private cottage is at your complete disposal. There is room in the closets, drawers and bathroom shelves for you to unpack and feel at home. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023070152383297682,"social_amenities":0.002086730906739831,"party_restriction":0.0007455897866748273,"nearby_nightlife":0.9892036318778992}},{"text":"Sunlit and cheerful, Shipwreck Cottage is tucked in a quiet neighborhood in Savannah\u2019s Historic District where you\u2019ll sleep soundly away from the raucous party that is City Market and Ellis Square, but your feet will take you there in just 10 minutes. Named for the original photographs of local shipwrecks that decorate the space, you\u2019ll enjoy your morning coffee and evening cocktail in the private courtyard. City of Savannah Cert: SVR-02408 The space Shipwreck Cottage is your relaxing getaway in beautiful Historic Savannah located a block and a half from Troup Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016806328494567424,"social_amenities":0.000882732099853456,"party_restriction":0.0009782485431060195,"nearby_nightlife":0.968241274356842}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 18042","address":"549 E MACON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":