 situated to explore Savannah\u2019s historic district. This fully renovated cottage has everything you\u2019ll need to enjoy your getaway. The Honey Bee Cottage is in an excellent location-a short walk to Troup Square, the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist and historic Jones Street, voted one of the prettiest streets in the United States! A short drive or walk puts you on either Broughton Street or River Street where shopping and dining abound-it truly is the ideal location from which to explore Savannah. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040640393854118884,"social_amenities":0.00653432309627533,"party_restriction":0.002428262960165739,"nearby_nightlife":0.04644244536757469}},{"text":"The living room offers a plush sofa, arm chair and flat screen television, perfect for those who have their own Netflix or Hulu accounts! Adjacent to the living room, a dedicated dining space to enjoy home-cooked meals, or catch up on work while away. Down the hall, guests will find the spacious and open kitchen that offers granite countertops, plenty of prep space and a full size washer/dryer thats tucked away. At the back of the home just outside of the bedroom, a roomy bathroom with vanity and shower/tub combination. The bedroom offers a comfortable king size bed, hotel grade linens and a television atop of the dresser.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022634826018474996,"social_amenities":0.003173949895426631,"party_restriction":0.0004984356346540153,"nearby_nightlife":0.022516489028930664}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 18055","address":"549 E HARRIS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,