strict and large comfy beds.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004528072604443878,"social_amenities":0.8916597366333008,"party_restriction":0.23167464137077332,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011824504472315311}},{"text":"It has a Great Backyard with an Unheated Private Pool, to cool down from the Savannah heat! Enjoy sipping a beverage in the backyard or a dip in the pool. Each side has a completely private, separate entrance and backyard. The apartment is a historic cottage originally built in 1871! There are 2 bedrooms, each with a King Size Bed, 1-bath and it is 1/2 of a duplex. A small living room is suitable for planning your next day's adventures. Grab a bite to eat in the functional kitchen that's great for ready-to-eat or on-the-go meals, not for creating complex signature dishes although it is well stocked with kitchenware.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00079632323468104,"social_amenities":0.06587379425764084,"party_restriction":0.00044390326365828514,"nearby_nightlife":0.03996165469288826}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"It has a Great Backyard with an Unheated Private Pool, to cool down from the Savannah heat! Enjoy sipping a beverage in the backyard or a dip in the pool. Each side has a completely private, separate entrance and backyard. The apartment is a historic cottage originally built in 1871! There are 2 bedrooms, each with a King Size Bed, 1-bath and it is 1/2 of a duplex. A small living room is suitable for planning your next day's adventures. Grab a bite to eat in the functional kitchen that's great for ready-to-eat or on-the-go meals, not for creating complex signature dishes although it is well stocked with kitchenware.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00079632323468104,"social_amenities":0.06587379425764084,"party_restriction":0.00044390326365828514,"nearby_nightlife":0.03996165469288826}},{"text":"Century old cottage located steps from 