aces available and it is free on the one side of E. Harris and the one side of E. Charlton. The metered parking spaces are free after 5 PM until 8 AM and Sunday all day. Certificate #'s SVR-02425 and 02426 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016300009156111628,"social_amenities":0.0017968195024877787,"party_restriction":0.0015807292656973004,"nearby_nightlife":0.0054269637912511826}},{"text":"Enjoy all of the charm of old world Savannah in our downtown cottage, while still having all of modern comforts and amenities! PERFECT for two families traveling together or a larger group! This listing is for BOTH sides of the duplex, so you will have TWO 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom condos, each with their own kitchen and living space! Each side has it's own unheated pool and courtyard! And, best of all, you will be just steps from all the amazing sites our Southern city has to offer! Guest access Keyless Entry Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004005709779448807,"social_amenities":0.0026495163328945637,"party_restriction":0.0007783693145029247,"nearby_nightlife":0.001107886084355414}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You may either park your vehicle right on the street out front or on the nearby side streets if you prefer (E Harris or E Charlton). There are typically plenty of spaces available and it is free on the one side of E. Harris and the one side of E. Charlton. The metered parking spaces are free after 5 PM until 8 AM and Sunday all day. Certificate #'s SVR-02425 and 02426 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016300009156111628,"social_amenities":0.0017968195024877787,"party_restriction":0.0015807292656973004,"nearby_nightlife":0.0054269637912511826}},{"text":"Enjoy all of the charm of old world Savannah in our downtown cottage, while still having all of modern comforts and amenities! PERFECT for two families traveling together or a lar