135136437","date":"2025-05-15","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E CHARLTON LN","recorded_pin":"20014 19013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25211214477","date":"2025-07-30","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E CHARLTON LN","recorded_pin":"20014 19013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25218220757","date":"2025-08-06","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E CHARLTON LN","recorded_pin":"20014 19013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25246250061","date":"2025-09-03","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E CHARLTON LN","recorded_pin":"20014 19013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25246250076","date":"2025-09-03","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E CHARLTON LN","recorded_pin":"20014 19013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25332337989","date":"2025-11-28","type":"UNCONSCIOUS-LIFE STATSUS UNK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"520 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20014 19014","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25355360238","date":"2025-12-21","type":"42-4 THEFT FROM VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"524 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20014 19011","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26013011756","date":"2026-01-13","type":"UNCONSCIOUS-LIFE STATSUS UNK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"520 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20014 19014","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26140144474","date":"2026-05-20","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"524 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20014 19011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1682134897361551099","title":"Downtown Retreat in Jones St Cottage","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1682134897361551099","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03179"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1682134897361551099","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"abd48ad559576a5885dcf4873b5d35fc8243eeec9beae3f8cad1469ee557fff1","chunks":8,"words":675,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.1362971067428589,"party_welcome":0.9963233470916748,"social_amenities":0.1362971067428589,"party_restriction":0.002281097462400794,"nearby_nightlife":0.988980770111084,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Electric stove Single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Shared BBQ grill: gas Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home","section":"AMENITIES","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005693244747817516,"social_amenities":0.1362971067428589,"party_restriction":0.0005891102482564747,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014140730490908027}},{"text":"Experience Savannah charm on famous Jones Street in this historic mariner cottage. Our cozy, first-floor condo features 2 bedrooms (king + queen), 1 bath, full kitchen, laundry, fast WiFi, TVs in both bedrooms, and a pullout sofa for that extra guest. Relax in the lovely, shared courtyard with seating, picnic table, and grill or unwind in the comfortable living room with plenty of board games and a little library after exploring downtown Savannah from our perfect, walkable location! SVR 03179 The space Welcome to your authentic Savannah getaway on iconic Jones Street, in Savannah's Landmark Historic District \u2014 often considered one of the most beautiful streets in America!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019528312259353697,"social_amenities":0.01546149980276823,"party_restriction":0.0016225391300395131,"nearby_nightlife":0.012213022448122501}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Once you enter the front door, guests will find their private entrance for condo A. Up the stairs is the separate, private entrance for the other condo in the duplex. The courtyard is a shared space with guests who may be staying in the unit above. Other things to note This mariner cottage row home has two units - ask about booking both for larger parties! Check our profile for pictures of the other listing. Please note! We tried to maintain many of the original architectural features, including the two fireplace hearths.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9963233470916748,"social_amenities":0.0026965495198965073,"party_restriction":0.00032751751132309437,"nearby_nightlife":0.16026481986045837}},{"text":"In the living room, you\u2019ll find a cozy little library, board games, and inviting spaces to unwind and enjoy the slower pace of Savannah life. Step outside to the lovely, shared courtyard, complete with seating areas, a picnic table, and a grill \u2014 perfect for morning coffee, afternoon cocktails, or winding down after a full day exploring the city! Located in the heart of historic downtown Savannah, you\u2019ll be within walking distance of beautiful squares, restaurants, shops, parks, and riverfront attractions while enjoying the authentic character and old-world charm that make Savannah so unforgettable. Guest access The entire first floor condo of this duplex is yours!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013470696285367012,"social_amenities":0.004523788578808308,"party_restriction":0.0007653112406842411,"nearby_nightlife":0.988980770111084}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Electric stove Single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Shared BBQ grill: gas Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home","section":"AMENITIES","line":106,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005693244747817516,"social_amenities":0.1362971067428589,"party_restriction":0.0005891102482564747,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014140730490908027}},{"text":"Experience Savannah charm on famous Jones Street in this historic mariner cottage. Our cozy, first-floor condo features 2 bedrooms (king + queen), 1 bath, full kitchen, laundry, fast WiFi, TVs in both bedrooms, and a pullout sofa for that extra guest. Relax in the lovely, shared courtyard with seating, picnic table, and grill or unwind in the comfortable living room with plenty of board games and a little library after exploring downtown Savannah from our perfect, walkable location! SVR 03179 The space Welcome to your authentic Savannah getaway on iconic Jones Street, in Savannah's Landmark Historic District \u2014 often considered one of the most beautiful streets in America!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019528312259353697,"social_amenities":0.01546149980276823,"party_restriction":0.0016225391300395131,"nearby_nightlife":0.012213022448122501}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"No stairs in home Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005602356395684183,"social_amenities":0.004430562723428011,"party_restriction":0.0022810