the separate, private entrance for the other condo in the duplex. The courtyard is a shared space with guests who may be staying in the unit above. Other things to note This mariner cottage row home has two units - ask about booking both for larger parties! Check our profile for pictures of the other listing. Please note! We tried to maintain many of the original architectural features, including the two fireplace hearths.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9963233470916748,"social_amenities":0.0026965495198965073,"party_restriction":0.00032751751132309437,"nearby_nightlife":0.16026481986045837}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1682773432167544677","title":"Jones St Retreat Full of Whimsy and Charm","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1682773432167544677","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-03180"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1682773432167544677","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e09ced2b7b9de3300ccfd968e85b4046e8f036c7adcf3a8ae7a74a34aed042df","chunks":9,"words":757,"party_signal":0.010088476352393627,"social_signal":0.3115173280239105,"party_welcome":0.9889642000198364,"social_amenities":0.6454612612724304,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.8672621846199036,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"The second floor features a spacious primary bedroom with a king bed (and TV), a full bathroom, washer/dryer laundry facilities, a fully stocked kitchen, cozy den (with pull-out sofa, perfect for that extra guest), and a beautiful large dining room with an oversized table perfect for gathering with family and friends, sharing meals, or working remotely. Just off the kitchen, guests can enjoy a private balcony \u2014 an ideal spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails beneath the Spanish moss. Upstairs on the third floor, the loft-style bedroom includes two twin beds tucked beneath the historic roofline, creating a charming and cozy hideaway full of personality.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010088476352393627,"social_amenities":0.0028989382553845644,"party_restriction":0.0003703086986206472,"nearby_nightlife":0.39058154821395874},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The second floor features a spacious primary bedroom with a king bed (and TV), a full bathroom, washer/dryer laundry facilities, a fully stocked kitchen, cozy den (with pull-out sofa, perfect for that extra guest), and a beautiful large dining room with an oversized table perfect for gathering with family and friends, sharing meals, or working remotely."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This unique and character-filled condo occupies the entire second and third floors of a historic mariner cottage duplex, offering guests an authentic Savannah experience surrounded by timeless architectural charm. Accessed through your private entrance at the top of the interior stairs, the condo combines historic details with comfortable modern living in one of Savannah\u2019s most desirable downtown locations. Original architectural elements and old-world character have been thoughtfully preserved throughout the home, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere that feels distinctly Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.894494385458529e-05,"social_amenities":0.3115173280239105,"party_restriction":0.00021506052871700376,"nearby_nightlife":0.002724525285884738}},{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Self check-in Keypad","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005405672127380967,"social_amenities":0.026084018871188164,"party_restriction":0.0006059957668185234,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015448727644979954}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The entire second floor condo (and third floor loft) of this duplex is yours! Once you enter the front door, guests will find their private entrance for condo B immediately up the interior stairs. The courtyard is a shared space with guests who may be staying in the unit below. Other things to note This mariner cottage row home has two units - ask about booking both for larger parties! Check our profile for pictures of the other listing. You are staying in the second floor condo of this historic duplex. As such, we always ask guests to be mindful and respectful of those staying in the first floor.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9889642000198364,"social_amenities":0.006153281312435865,"party_restriction":0.0010946306865662336,"nearby_nightlife":0.8672621846199036}},{"text":"The second floor features a spacious primary bedroom with a king bed (and TV), a full bathroom, washer/dryer laundry facilities, a fully stocked kitchen, cozy den (with pull-out sofa, perfect for that extra guest), and a beautiful large dining room with an oversized table perfect for gathering with family and friends, sharing meals, or working remotely. Just off the kitchen, guests can enjoy a private balcony \u2014 an ideal spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails beneath the Spanish moss. Upstairs on the third floor, the loft-style bedroom includes two twin beds tucked beneath the historic roofline, creating a charming and cozy hideaway full of personality.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010088476352393627,"social_amenities":0.0028989382553845644,"party_restriction":0.0003703086986206472,"nearby_nightlife":0.39058154821395874}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This spacious room also has a small reading nook area to get away from it all, as well as a TV, just in case the kids want to watch their own thing! Descend the outdoor spiral staircase and you'll find the shared courtyard patio featuring seating areas, a picnic table, and grill \u2014 a lovely outdoor space to unwind and enjoy Savannah\u2019s relaxed pace. Located in the heart of downtown Savannah, you\u2019ll be just steps from historic squares, restaurants, shops, parks, and the riverfront while staying on one of the city\u2019s most famous and picturesque streets. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007667471654713154,"social_amenities":0.6454612612724304,"party_restriction":0.004008769989013672,"nearby_nightlife":0.8572648763656616}},{"text":"This unique and character-filled condo occupies the entire second and third floors of a historic mariner cottage duplex, offering guests an authentic Savannah experience surrounded by timeless architectural charm. Accessed through your private entrance at the top of the interior stairs, the condo combines historic details with comfortable modern living in one of Savannah\u2019s most desirable downtown locations. Original architectural elements and old-world character have been thoughtfully preserved throughout the home, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere that feels distinctly Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.894494385458529e-05,"social_amenities":0.3115173280239105,"party_restriction":0.00021506052871700376,"nearby_nightlife":0.002724525285884738}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002910627517849207,"social_amenities":0.0016527262050658464,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.0