2}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":152,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013811845565214753,"social_amenities":0.003351452061906457,"party_restriction":0.009256304241716862,"nearby_nightlife":0.010664386674761772}},{"text":"Located in Savannah\u2019s Landmark Historic District, you\u2019ll be steps away from beautiful squares, restaurants, shops, parks, and riverfront attractions while staying on one of the city\u2019s most famous and picturesque streets. Guest access The entire duplex is yours! There are no shared spaces when you book this listing, as you are reserving the entire building, including all outdoor spaces, for yourself! Other things to note Please note! We tried to maintain many of the original architectural features, including the four fireplace hearths. However, these are NON-OPERATIONAL (thus, not listed as a fireplace amenity), and are just for aesthetic appeal and a bit of old-world charm! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002518911496736109,"social_amenities":0.010274138301610947,"party_restriction":0.0035076644271612167,"nearby_nightlife":0.13512499630451202}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located in Savannah\u2019s Landmark Historic District, you\u2019ll be steps away from beautiful squares, restaurants, shops, parks, and riverfront attractions while staying on one of the city\u2019s most famous and picturesque streets. Guest access The entire duplex is yours! There are no shared spaces when you book this listing, as you are reserving the entire building, including all outdoor spaces, for yourself! Other things to note Please note! We tried to maintain many of the original architectural features, including the four fireplace hearths. However, these are NON-OPERATIONAL (thus, not listed as a fireplace amenity), and are just for aesthetic appeal and a bit of old-world charm! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002518911496736109,"social_amenities":0.010274138301610947,"party_restriction":0.0035076644271612167,"nearby_nightlife":0.13512499630451202}},{"text":"Upstairs, the second condo spans the second and third floors and includes a bedroom with king bed, a loft-style bedroom (two twin beds) up on the third-floor, spacious dining room, full kitchen, cozy den, bathroom, and balcony (with spiral staircase to make getting to all of the outdoor spaces below a breeze)! Historic architectural details and old Savannah charm have been thoughtfully preserved throughout both condos, creating a warm and authentic atmosphere full of character. Guests most enjoy the courtyard with seating, picnic table, and grill \u2014 perfect for relaxing after a day exploring downtown.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001713116216706112,"social_amenities":0.010095988400280476,"party_restriction":0.000418354757130146,"nearby_nightlife":0.043986979871988297}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 19029","address":"513 E CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24160169866","date":"2024-06-08","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"516 E Charlton Ln","recorded_pin":"20014 19032","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24272285329","date":"2024-09-28","type":"31 CHECK-THE-WELFARE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"521 E Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20014 19033","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24350364041","date":"2024-12-15","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"511 E Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20014 19028","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1450332730516799550","title":"Charming 3 BR Cottage in the Historic District","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1450332730516799550","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03139"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1450332730516799550","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4b486e5777f7d12488dda75634d963fa2ed438119e9404ace8d1954fd6a58989","chunks":6,"words":536,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.11076341569423676,"party_welcome":0.0003526273067109287,"social_amenities":0.11076341569423676,"party_restriction":0.00400388753041625,"nearby_nightlife":0.3580281138420105,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Dining table Coffee Outdoor Private patio or balcony","section":"AMENITIES","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003526273067109287,"social_amenities":0.11076341569423676,"party_restriction":0.00038576507358811796,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008935563382692635}},{"text":"Stroll among the beautiful homes and gardens of downtown Savannah and soak in its rich history. Historic Sage Cottage (c. 1900) offers a peaceful three-bedroom haven in the heart of the Landmark Historic District. The space If Sage Cottage happens to be booked for your dates, our neighboring Geranium Cottage offers the same layout and amenities and may still be available. You\u2019ll find a link to that listing further down in this description. Sage Cottage is perfectly situated in Savannah's Historic District, just steps from River Street, City Market, Forsyth Park, dining, shopping, museums, and the trolley stop at Troup Square, only one block away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012740673264488578,"social_amenities":0.006335870362818241,"party_restriction":0.00400388753041625,"nearby_nightlife":0.3580281138420105}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Dining table Coffee Outdoor Private patio or balcony","section":"AMENITIES","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003526273067109287,"social_amenities":0.11076341569423676,"party_restriction":0.00038576507358811796,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008935563382692635}},{"text":"We offer special pricing when both cottages are reserved together, so please feel free to reach out if you are interested. You can view the Geranium Cottage listing here: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1446674568272779492?guests=1&adults=1&s=67&unique_share_id=7433ba74-ef17-43e2-899b-d04527f80c23 SVR Certificate # SVR-03139 Guest access Keyless entry for 3 bedroom cottage and private courtyard - the entry code will be the last four digits of the phone number provided during booking. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003170901327393949,"social_amenities":0.0017188508063554764,"party_restriction":0.0011185138719156384,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004774103872478008}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Dining table Coffee Outdoor Private patio or balcony","section":"AMENITIES","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003526273067109287,"social_amenities":0.11076341569423676,"party_restriction":0.00038576507358811796,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008935563382692635}},{"text":"Stroll among the beautiful homes and gardens of downtown Savannah and soak in its rich history. Historic Sage Cottage (c. 1900) offers a peaceful three-bedroom haven in the heart of the Landmark Historic District. The space If Sage Cottage happens to be booked for your dates, our neighboring Geranium Cottage offers the same layout and amenities and may still be available. You\u2019ll find a link to that listing further down in this description. Sage Cottage is perfectly situated in Savannah's Historic District, just steps from River Street, City Market, Forsyth Park, dining, shopping, museums, and the trolley stop at Troup Square, only one block away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012740673264488578,"social_amenities":0.006335870362818241,"party_restriction":0.00400388753041625,"nearby_nightlife":0.3580281138420105}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Stroll among the beautiful homes and gardens of downtown Savannah and soak in its rich history. Historic Sage Cottage (c. 1900) offers a peaceful three-bedroom haven in the heart of the Landmark Historic District. The space If Sage Cottage happens to be booked for your dates, our neighboring Geranium Cottage offers the same layout and amenities and may still be available. You\u2019ll find a link to that listing further down in this description. Sage Cottage is perfectly situated in Savannah's Historic District, just steps from River Street, City Market, Forsyth Park, dining, shopping, museums, and the trolley stop at Troup Square, only one block away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012740673264488578,"social_amenities":0.006335870362818241,"party_restriction":0.00400388753041625,"nearby_nightlife":0.3580281138420105}},{"text":"Enjoy your morning coffee, afternoon drinks, or an al fresco meal in the private courtyard surrounded by tropical flowers and bamboo, with seating for four. Special Note: Sage Cottage is attached to Geranium Cottage, which may also be available if you are traveling with a larger group. Each cottage has three bedrooms, allowing for a total of six bedrooms (2 kings, 2 queens, and 4 twins) when both are reserved. While the cottages are separate units, the privacy fence between the courtyards includes a locked gate that we can open to combine the two private courtyards into one shared space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028764939634129405,"social_amenities":0.002339905360713601,"party_restriction":0.0033910449128597975,"nearby_nightlife":0.008586418814957142}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Stroll among the beautiful homes and gardens of downtown Savannah and soak in its rich history. Historic Sage Cottage 