ife":0.0008779382915236056}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":185,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006674352334812284,"social_amenities":0.21824009716510773,"party_restriction":0.0021725790575146675,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008779382915236056}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":185,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006674352334812284,"social_amenities":0.21824009716510773,"party_restriction":0.0021725790575146675,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008779382915236056}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Unprecedented in downtown Savannah, the Craftsmith Cottage boasts two private parking spots behind the cottage. But, you\u2019ll probably find yourself walking everywhere. You\u2019re just a few blocks away from author Flannery O\u2019Connor\u2019s childhood home, Colonial Cemetery, and the historic St. John the Baptist cathedral. A leisurely stroll through the leafy squares of Savannah will bring you to a bountiful array of coffee shops, restaurants, and boutiques. Return home to the CraftSmith Cottage for elegant comfort and artful style. Walking time to local landmarks (per Mapquest): 13 minutes to Forsyth Park 21 minutes to City Market 11 minutes to nearby Kroger 10 minutes to Mrs. Wilkes Dining room","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015093771799001843,"social_amenities":0.001159696839749813,"party_restriction":0.0005289644468575716,"nearby_nightlife":0.9496996998786926}},{"text":"Twin beds in the guest room and a queen bed in the primary suite offer brand new pillowtop comfort. Beautiful wood floors gleam throughout the home, and sunlight streams through three sides of historic windows in the living room. Vaulted ceilings help the 820-square foot gem \u201clive large.\u201d A modern galley kitchen includes granite countertops and stainless steel appliances. A front-loading washer and dryer are in the spacious dressing area between the primary bedroom and light-filled master bath. The hall bathroom lies across from the guest bedroom and features a pedestal sink and full bath/shower. Close to everything","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002757516340352595,"social_amenities":0.0038666347973048687,"party_restriction":0.0003161043277941644,"nearby_nightlife":0.04100586846470833}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 19055","address":"537 E CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":5,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26250259618","date":"2026-09-07","type":"50 BARKING DOG","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"537 E Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20014 19055","side":"direct"},{"number":"24147155566","date":"2024-05-26","type":"22 FOUND PROPERTY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"539 E CHARLTON ST","recorded_pin":"20014 19054","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25158159886","date":"2025-06-07","type":"28 PAST DOMESTIC DISTURB.","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"535 E Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20014 19040","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"24033428","title":"Historic Dist Gem + 3 King Beds by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/24033428","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-01009"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"24033428","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f7912b9a64ad6a02c6fa13f8a73c0e55c98ab31dfe79b7ddf717ee46a23b042b","chunks":7,"words":598,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.20798055827617645,"party_welcome":0.3971504271030426,"social_amenities":0.20798055827617645,"party_restriction":0.0020277067087590694,"nearby_nightlife":0.08249201625585556,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The kitchen is ideal for entertaining, as it's fully equipped with every culinary necessity and is open to both the living room and dining room. Kick your feet up and watch the game in the living room, filled with ample daylight from the outside. A door to the private courtyard is just right and is the perfect spot to barbecue and enjoy the sounds of the city. Upstairs you'll find the remaining two bedrooms, one as the primary and the other a guest room with en suite bath. The primary has a King size bed, two full closets, and balcony access off of the bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3971504271030426,"social_amenities":0.20798055827617645,"party_restriction":0.0002059964172076434,"nearby_nightlife":0.08249201625585556}},{"text":"Enjoy soaking in the jetted tub after a long day of exploring the city. A flat screen TV can be found in the armoire. The guest room is opposite the primary suite and also has a King size bed and flat screen TV. The bath has a tub/shower combo and beautiful views of historic downtown. Prospective guests should be aware of a neighboring beehive. The honeybees keep to themselves on the neighbor's second floor rooftop and are harmless, however guests with bee allergies should be cautious. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Bedroom 3: King bed Parking: Non-metered Parking","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022245495347306132,"social_amenities":0.021743664517998695,"party_restriction":0.0020277067087590694,"nearby_nightlife":0.00638746190816164}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The kitchen is ideal for entertaining, as it's fully equipped with every culinary necessity and is open to both the living room and dining room. Kick your feet up and watch the game in the living room, filled with ample daylight from the outside. A door to the private courtyard is just right and is the perfect spot to barbecue and enjoy the sounds of the city. Upstairs you'll find the remaining two bedrooms, one as the primary and the other a guest room with en suite bath. The primary has a King size bed, two full closets, and balcony access off of the bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3971504271030426,"social_amenities":0.20798055827617645,"party_restriction":0.0002059964172076434,"nearby_nightlife":0.08249201625585556}},{"text":"Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005153772071935236,"social_amenities":0.0006483701872639358,"party_restriction":0.0007043368532322347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007966597331687808}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The kitchen is ideal for entertaining, as it's fully equipped with every culinary necessity and is open to both the living room and dining room. Kick your feet up and watch the game in the living room, filled with ample daylight from the outside. A door to the private courtyard is just right and is the perfect spot to barbecue and enjoy the sounds of the city. Upstairs you'll find the remaining two bedrooms, one as the primary and the other a guest room with en suite bath. The primary has a King size bed, two full closets, and balcony access off of the bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3971504271030426,"social_amenities":0.20798055827617645,"party_restriction":0.0002059964172076434,"nearby_nightlife":0.08249201625585556}},{"text":"Enjoy soaking in the jetted tub after a long day of exploring the city. A flat screen TV can be found in the armoire. The guest room is opposite the primary suite and also has a King size bed and flat screen TV. The bath has a tub/shower combo and beautiful views of historic downtown. Prospective guests should be aware of a neighboring beehive. The honeybees keep to themselves on the neighbor's second floor rooftop and are harmless, however guests with bee allergies should be cautious. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Bedroom 3: King bed Parking: Non-metered Parking","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022245495347306132,"social_amenities":0.021743664517998695,"party_restriction":0.0020277067087590694,"nearby_nightlife":0.00638746190816164}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Enjoy soaking in the jetted tub after a long day of exploring the city. A flat screen TV can be found in the armoire. The guest room is opposite the primary suite and also has a King size bed and flat screen TV. The bath has a tub/shower combo and beautiful views of historic downtown. Prospective guests should be aware of a neighboring beehive. The honeybees keep to themselves on the neighbor's second floor rooftop and are harmless, however guests with bee allergies should be cautious. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: King bed Bedroom 3: King bed Parking: Non-metered Parking","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022245495347306132,"social_amenities":0.021743664517998695,"party_restriction":0.0020277067087590694,"nearby_nightlife":0.00638746190816164}},{"text":"Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005153772071935236,"social_amenities":0.0006483701872639358,"party_restriction":0.0007043368532322347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007966597331687808}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The kitchen is ideal for entertaining, as it's fully equipped with every culinary necessity and is open to both the living room and dining room. Kick your feet up and watch the game in the living room, filled with ample daylight from the outside. A door to the private courtyard is just right and is the perfect spot to barbecue and enjoy the sounds of the city. Upstairs you'll find the remaining two bedrooms, one as the primary and the other a guest room with en suite bath. The primary has a King size bed, two full closets, and balcony access off of the bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3971504271030426,"social_amenities":0.20798055827617645,"party_restriction":0.0002059964172076434,"nearby_nightlife":0.08249201625585556}},{"text":"There's room for the whole family in this recently updated, 2-story townhome. Located on charming Charlton Street, you're only blocks away from Savannah's most sought-after attractions. The space Feel like a true Savannah native when you pull up to this clapboard home. The foyer with main staircase greets you as you wander throughout the first floor. A first guest bedroom with King bed is just to your left - perfect as a mother-in-law or teen suite. Just down the hall, guests will find a full-size bathroom, with a walk-in shower. Continue on, you'll find the dining room that seats six.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021938973804935813,"social_amenities":0.003916185349225998,"party_restriction":0.0004599107487592846,"nearby_nightlife":0.04645978659391403}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20014 19059","address":"347 E BROAD ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":15,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":14,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":16,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parkin