Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Laundromat nearby Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023333933495450765,"social_amenities":0.0017600517021492124,"party_restriction":0.0010770817752927542,"nearby_nightlife":0.005696489941328764}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"*Nevertheless, we ensure that all of our guests are here to relax and have a great time, so the shared spaces should create great opportunities to meet and mingle with similarly-minded people - which is what the Hostess City is all about! Guest access Guests will have access to the apartment, the private porch, the shared courtyard, the shared laundry room, and the metered street parking across the building. Please refer to the check-in guide on the app for more details.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.4757348895072937,"social_amenities":0.023507408797740936,"party_restriction":0.0016365413321182132,"nearby_nightlife":0.9723718166351318}},{"text":"You will not need a car when you stay here - River St is only a 10-minute walk and Forsyth Park is only about 15 minutes away. You can get to both places and all the sights, squares, and food in between with little effort. The entire building - including this apartment - has gone through a thorough renovation, sparing no expense to turn this 1800s building into one of the most beautiful and welcoming spaces in the Hostess City. The grounds are pristine and full of the Southern charm Savannah is known for.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032685650512576103,"social_amenities":0.0010736938565969467,"party_restriction":0.00041484987013973296,"nearby_nightlife":0.3483453094959259}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"*Nevertheless, we ensure that all of our guests are here to relax and have a great time, so the shared spaces should create great opportunities to meet and mingle with similarly-minded people - which is what the Hostess City is all abo