DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004406617081258446,"social_amenities":0.009005832485854626,"party_restriction":0.0009387491154484451,"nearby_nightlife":0.4378986358642578}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 06006","address":"221 E YORK ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":16.0,"neighbor_count":5,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24300314767","date":"2024-10-26","type":"UNCONSCIOUS-LIFE STATSUS UNK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"221 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06006","side":"direct"},{"number":"25051047407","date":"2025-02-20","type":"OPEN DOOR","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"221 E YORK ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06006","side":"direct"},{"number":"24039040460","date":"2024-02-08","type":"42-4 THEFT FROM VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"141 LINCOLN ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06007","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25339344084","date":"2025-12-05","type":"22 Found/Surrendered WEAPON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"219 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06019","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26038035860","date":"2026-02-07","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"135 LINCOLN ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06020A","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26094095373","date":"2026-04-04","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"135 LINCOLN ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06020A","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1440673208792533240","title":"Bosch Huis Ros\u00e9: Ros\u00e9 Suite \u2022 Historic \u2022 Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1440673208792533240","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03137"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1440673208792533240","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6a189582160e301ef3e74493a7abab0432458a83b5d20c1451cdbb9577cd2abb","chunks":15,"words":1358,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.7915956377983093,"party_welcome":0.9958094358444214,"social_amenities":0.7915956377983093,"party_restriction":0.9977647066116333,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917959570884705,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Nespresso Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Rice maker Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Shared beach access Guests can enjoy a nearby beach Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor dining area Outdoor kitchen BBQ grill Beach essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":166,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005187364295125008,"social_amenities":0.7915956377983093,"party_restriction":0.0004985465784557164,"nearby_nightlife":0.01778695359826088}},{"text":"The ground floor, front of the house: one bedroom with a king bed, plush mattress, and premium linens, cozy the way an 1856 home does best. A bathroom with a walk-in shower and single vanity, fresh towels already waiting. The square starts at your window. Carriages in the morning, gas-lit evenings a block in any direction, and the front door puts you into Savannah before other guests have found their shoes. Out back, the sauna and cold plunge wait for your return. A Nespresso machine, mini-fridge, microwave, and 55-inch smart TV with every streaming service mean the suite runs on its own schedule. MAIN LEVEL","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007600598037242889,"social_amenities":0.012780961580574512,"party_restriction":0.0005234263371676207,"nearby_nightlife":0.013200342655181885}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Traveling as a group? Take every key. PRICING One rate covers two. Each additional guest, up to four, adds $50 per night, covering the extra cleaning and wear, plainly. That's the whole story. Pets stay for one flat fee per booking; a whole pack costs a little more. Weekdays run gentler, longer stays earn a discount. Military and teachers booking ahead: say so, and the rate says thank you. CELEBRATIONS Proposals, anniversaries, birthdays with a zero in them, a bachelorette claiming the whole house. We arrange what the moment needs: flowers waiting, a table no one can get, a photographer who knows the light on the square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9958094358444214,"social_amenities":0.005460795015096664,"party_restriction":0.0008242296171374619,"nearby_nightlife":0.06690356880426407}},{"text":"Tap the heart and come back when it's time. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":120,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004219604656100273,"social_amenities":0.003073454136028886,"party_restriction":0.0017123862635344267,"nearby_nightlife":0.006876938510686159}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Nespresso Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Rice maker Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Shared beach access Guests can enjoy a nearby beach Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor dining area Outdoor kitchen BBQ grill Beach essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":166,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005187364295125008,"social_amenities":0.7915956377983093,"party_restriction":0.0004985465784557164,"nearby_nightlife":0.01778695359826088}},{"text":"Oglethorpe Square, Savannah, 1856. Horse carriages still pass daily. The Ros\u00e9 Suite, ground floor: first to hear the hooves, first out into Savannah, front row on the square. Skip the car: River Street one way, Broughton Street shops the other, Michelin-worthy tables between. Out back: a sauna, a cold plunge, and the best part of your morning. Loved like a home, because it is one. Bosch Huis began as a dream. Guests like you make it real. Tap the heart, see my Host Profile, or book it. The space THE ROS\u00c9 SUITE","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013078581541776657,"social_amenities":0.5859143733978271,"party_restriction":0.0011757609900087118,"nearby_nightlife":0.8832428455352783}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Write to us before booking for anything beyond a quiet stay \u2014 larger gatherings are approved in advance through Airbnb, with their own guidelines. THE HOUSE This home has stood on Oglethorpe Square since 1856, and it acts its age in the best ways: heart-pine floors that announce your footsteps, stairs that have carried 170 years of guests, walls that hold stories and, occasionally, sound. It's not a hotel built last year, and that's the point. THE ASSURANCES Smoke detectors throughout. First aid stocked. Cameras outside only \u2014 never inside. The same small cleaning team, every stay. If maintenance ever touches your dates, you'll hear it from us first.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009649544372223318,"social_amenities":0.002041309140622616,"party_restriction":0.9977647066116333,"nearby_nightlife":0.0025574045721441507}},{"text":"ALWAYS IMPROVING Nearly every dollar this home generates is reinvested \u2014 into the property, our team, and the local community. We're passionate about historic houses, love Savannah wholeheartedly, and it shows in what keeps getting better. A SAVANNAH NOTE This is the South, in a walking city that's been alive since 1733. Church bells ring, carriages clatter, and on weekend nights downtown hums. A professional pest team treats the property regularly, but nature predates the service contract. That's the habitat, not the housekeeping. OUR STANDARD If it's reasonable and we have notice, we'll find a way. FOLLOW ALONG @BoschHuisRose for the story between stays. Not ready to book?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012655690079554915,"social_amenities":0.002182391472160816,"party_restriction":0.0038154181092977524,"nearby_nightlife":0.006272907368838787}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"SISTER PROPERTY \u00b7 Bosch Huis Sea, 10 minutes away, directly on the water. Marsh, river, ocean, and Tybee views. \"A 5-star sanctuary,\" guests say. See my Host Profile. WALK \u00b7 Broughton Street 1 min \u00b7 squares, bars, galleries, museums 1 min \u00b7 Leopold's Ice Cream 2 min (we apologize in advance) \u00b7 Riverfront 5 min \u00b7 Forsyth Park 10 min \u00b7 Whole Foods + Target 10 min by car CARE \u00b7 an owner who truly cares. Need a hand with luggage or a private airport ride? Say the word. Guest access Your suite is entirely yours.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004099579062312841,"social_amenities":0.0014679869636893272,"party_restriction":0.0005417631473392248,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917959570884705}},{"text":"All of Savannah, one minute at a time: Broughton Street's shops in one, the squares, galleries, and bars in the same, the Riverfront in five, Forsyth Park in ten. THE ESSENTIALS SLEEPS \u00b7 king bed \u00b7 additional configurations on request \u00b7 premium linens \u00b7 ground-floor suite, no stairs \u00b7 cool, quiet, and dim by design, the best sleep in the house \u00b7 fully private, ensuite bath with walk-in shower COMFORT \u00b7 air conditioning throughout, and the ground floor stays coolest \u00b7 extra fan in every room \u00b7 HEPA air purifiers \u00b7 laundry on-site","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011285256914561614,"social_amenities":0.00045410505845211446,"party_restriction":0.0003191987634636462,"nearby_nightlife":0.9242601990699768}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1455301064350559560","title":"Bosch Huis Ros\u00e9: Garden Suite - Historic - Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1455301064350559560","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-03137"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1455301064350559560","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d89d2837f69accd6ef91200c0d0b864cea86a68acf40c7d8b34a943a83545d95","chunks":15,"words":1469,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.06511480361223221,"party_welcome":0.9921894073486328,"social_amenities":0.06511480361223221,"party_restriction":0.9767197966575623,"nearby_nightlife":0.9936661124229431,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Free dryer \u2013 In building Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Sound system Exercise equipment: free weights, stationary bike, yoga mat Books and reading material Movie theater Theme room A room or multiple spaces that are designed to follow the same theme Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Children\u2019s books and toys Children\u2019s dinnerware Board games Babysitter recommendations Outdoor playground","section":"AMENITIES",