 ring, carriages clatter, and on weekend nights downtown hums. A professional pest team treats the property regularly, but nature predates the service contract. That's the habitat, not the housekeeping. OUR STANDARD","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015761351096443832,"social_amenities":0.001336216228082776,"party_restriction":0.2125127911567688,"nearby_nightlife":0.004862006288021803}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"KITCHEN \u00b7 All-Clad \u00b7 Vitamix \u00b7 KitchenAid \u00b7 gas range \u00b7 shared but rarely used \u00b7 private slots on request SISTER PROPERTY \u00b7 Bosch Huis Sea, 10 minutes away, directly on the water. Marsh, river, ocean, and Tybee views. \"A 5-star sanctuary,\" guests say. See my Host Profile. WALK \u00b7 Broughton Street 1 min \u00b7 squares, bars, galleries, museums 1 min \u00b7 Leopold's Ice Cream 2 min (we apologize in advance) \u00b7 Riverfront 5 min \u00b7 Forsyth Park 10 min \u00b7 Whole Foods + Target 10 min by car CARE \u00b7 an owner who truly cares. Need a hand with luggage or a private airport ride? Say the word.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00802228506654501,"social_amenities":0.002899778075516224,"party_restriction":0.0005478658713400364,"nearby_nightlife":0.9936661124229431}},{"text":"It's shared, but every suite has its own essentials, so barely one in a hundred guests use it. Private slots on request. Guests call it \"beautiful\" and \"private.\" OUT FRONT All of Savannah, one minute at a time: Broughton Street's shops in one, the squares, galleries, and bars in the same, the Riverfront in five, Forsyth Park in ten. THE ESSENTIALS SLEEPS \u00b7 queen beds \u00b7 additional configurations on request \u00b7 premium linens \u00b7 ground-floor suite, no stairs \u00b7 cool, quiet, and dim by design, the best sleep in the house \u00b7 fully private, ensuite bath with walk-in shower","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014