nnah wholeheartedly, and it shows in what keeps getting better. A SAVANNAH NOTE This is the South, in a walking city that's been alive since 1733. Church bells ring, carriages clatter, and on weekend nights downtown hums. A professional pest team treats the property regularly, but nature predates the service contract. That's the habitat, not the housekeeping. OUR STANDARD If it's reasonable and we have notice, we'll find a way. FOLLOW ALONG @BoschHuisRose for the story between stays. Not ready to book?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012655690079554915,"social_amenities":0.002182391472160816,"party_restriction":0.0038154181092977524,"nearby_nightlife":0.006272907368838787}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"KITCHEN \u00b7 All-Clad \u00b7 Vitamix \u00b7 KitchenAid \u00b7 gas range \u00b7 shared but rarely used \u00b7 private slots on request SISTER PROPERTY \u00b7 Bosch Huis Sea, 10 minutes away, directly on the water \u2014 marsh, river, ocean, and Tybee views. \"A 5-star sanctuary,\" guests say. See my Host Profile. WALK \u00b7 Broughton Street 1 min \u00b7 squares, bars, galleries, museums 1 min \u00b7 Leopold's Ice Cream 2 min (we apologize in advance) \u00b7 Riverfront 5 min \u00b7 Forsyth Park 10 min \u00b7 Whole Foods + Target 10 min by car CARE \u00b7 an owner who truly cares. Need a hand with luggage or a private airport ride? Say the word.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009928719140589237,"social_amenities":0.002864501439034939,"party_restriction":0.0005543845472857356,"nearby_nightlife":0.993644118309021}},{"text":"All of Savannah, one minute at a time: Broughton Street's shops in one, the squares, galleries, and bars in the same, the Riverfront in five, Forsyth Park in ten. THE ESSENTIALS SLEEPS \u00b7 king bed \u00b7 queen sleeper in living room (when you book the Kiwi Suite only) \u00b7 additional configurations on request \u00b7 premium linens \u00b7 top-floor suite, reached by stai