 Forsyth Park 10 min \u00b7 Whole Foods + Target 10 min by car CARE \u00b7 an owner who truly cares. Need a hand with luggage or a private airport ride? Say the word. Guest access Your suite is entirely yours. A fully isolated unit with its own lock, which is why it's listed as an entire home. Private, immaculate, and turned over like we're expecting someone important. We are. Self-check-in by smart lock. Your code arrives 24 hours before you do.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002650335431098938,"social_amenities":0.002260597888380289,"party_restriction":0.006029088981449604,"nearby_nightlife":0.9894689321517944}},{"text":"Add yourselves. The kitchen is chef-grade: gas range, All-Clad, Vitamix, KitchenAid, a Samsung refrigerator with filtered water and ice. It's shared, but every suite has its own essentials, so barely one in a hundred guests use it. Private slots on request. Guests call it \"beautiful\" and \"private.\" OUT FRONT All of Savannah, one minute at a time: Broughton Street's shops in one, the squares, galleries, and bars in the same, the Riverfront in five, Forsyth Park in ten. THE ESSENTIALS","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001956147374585271,"social_amenities":0.002765348646789789,"party_restriction":0.001219851546920836,"nearby_nightlife":0.9820924997329712}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 06008","address":"230 E OGLETHORPE AVE","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":14.0,"advertised_guests":14.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24011011361","date":"2024-01-11","type":"HEMORRHAGE/LACERATIONS B","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"230 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20015 06008","side":"direct"},{"number":"24216228080","date":"2024-08-03","type":"45 PAST VANDALISM","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"230 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20015 06008","side":"direct"},{"number":"26126129978","date":"2026-05-06","type":"REPOSESSION","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"230 E Oglethorpe Ave","recorded_pin":"20015 06008","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22996069","title":"Grand Savannah Estate in the Historic District","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22996069","guests":14.0,"permits":["SVR-00464","SVR-02281"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22996069","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"753a59a682603b388127adc462cbec7b46b324a59d8549fa5f323ef664146307","chunks":18,"words":1797,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9823920130729675,"party_welcome":0.7508221864700317,"social_amenities":0.9823920130729675,"party_restriction":0.0036292506847530603,"nearby_nightlife":0.9626297950744629,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This additional living area can be especially helpful for multigenerational families or groups with different schedules, allowing some guests to relax downstairs while others gather in the main house. In-home laundry is also located on the garden level, making it convenient to refresh clothing and travel essentials during longer stays. Private Courtyard & Off-Street Parking Outside, the courtyard provides another place to enjoy the property and Savannah\u2019s mild weather. Outdoor seating creates a comfortable setting for morning coffee, conversation, or winding down after a day spent exploring the Historic District. A grill is also available for guests who would like to prepare a casual meal outdoors.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004957406781613827,"social_amenities":0.9823920130729675,"party_restriction":0.0004554003244265914,"nearby_nightlife":0.03189723193645477}},{"text":"Guest access 2 Kings 6 Queens Flatscreen TVs Washer and Dryer in Garden Level 2 Full Kitchen Back Porch and Courtyard Free Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking for 2 to 3 Vehicles Walk everywhere Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":95,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029953697230666876,"social_amenities":0.15434938669204712,"party_restriction":0.0024400323163717985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0078864935785532}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Accommodating up to 14 guests, the estate combines a spacious main house with a separate garden-level unit, offering plenty of room for larger groups to gather and unwind. Located beside Colonial Park Cemetery, the property is within easy reach of Savannah\u2019s restaurants, shops, squares, museums, and historic attractions. Recently Refurnished Living & Dining Spaces Oglethorpe Estate has been thoughtfully refreshed with new furniture, d\u00e9cor, and updated design elements selected to complement the character of the historic home. The interiors balance traditional details with a polished, elevated style, creating comfortable spaces for gathering while allowing the home\u2019s original architecture to remain part of the experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7508221864700317,"social_amenities":0.026541784405708313,"party_restriction":0.00047367168008349836,"nearby_nightlife":0.5862582325935364}},{"text":"Nearby, the formal dining room provides a dedicated space for shared meals, morning coffee, takeout from a favorite Savannah restaurant, or an evening spent at home. The dining area continues the home\u2019s elevated design with classic furnishings and d\u00e9cor that feel appropriate to the historic setting. The main house also includes a full kitchen equipped with full-size appliances, generous cabinetry, and counter space for preparing meals, storing groceries, and keeping drinks and snacks organized throughout your stay. Whether your group is preparing breakfast before heading out for the day or gathering around for dinner in the evening, having a fully equipped kitchen makes it easy to settle into the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006736044306308031,"social_amenities":0.0011918502859771252,"party_restriction":0.00019421408069320023,"nearby_nightlife":0.0769692212343216}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This additional living area can be especially helpful for multigenerational families or groups with different schedules, allowing some guests to relax downstairs while others gather in the main house. In-home laundry is also located on the garden level, making it convenient to refresh clothing and travel essentials during longer stays. Private Courtyard & Off-Street Parking Outside, the courtyard provides another place to enjoy the property and Savannah\u2019s mild weather. Outdoor seating creates a comfortable setting for morning coffee, conversation, or winding down after a day spent exploring the Historic District. A grill is also available for guests who would like to prepare a casual meal outdoors.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004957406781613827,"social_amenities":0.9823920130729675,"party_restriction":0.0004554003244265914,"nearby_nightlife":0.03189723193645477}},{"text":"Guest access 2 Kings 6 Queens Flatscreen TVs Washer and Dryer in Garden Level 2 Full Kitchen Back Porch and Courtyard Free Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking for 2 to 3 Vehicles Walk everywhere Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":95,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029953697230666876,"social_amenities":0.15434938669204712,"party_restriction":0.0024400323163717985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0078864935785532}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Stay together in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District at Oglethorpe Estate, a recently refurnished historic retreat for up to 14 guests. Combining a spacious main house with a separate garden-level unit, the estate offers two kitchens, multiple living areas, in-home laundry, a private courtyard with a grill, and parking for two vehicles. Located beside Colonial Park Cemetery, the home is within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s squares, dining, shopping, museums, and River Street. The space Experience Savannah from the heart of the Historic District at Oglethorpe Estate, a recently refurnished historic home along East Oglethorpe Avenue.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006109238602221012,"social_amenities":0.024994174018502235,"party_restriction":0.0036292506847530603,"nearby_nightlife":0.06773167103528976}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":207,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010038404725492,"social_amenities":0.08529988676309586,"party_restriction":0.002902794862166047,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013645996805280447}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"From the home, guests can explore nearby Oglethorpe Square and Columbia Square, visit the Owens-Thomas House & Slave Quarters, or continue toward Broughton Street for shopping, coffee, and dining. City Market, Bay Street, and River Street are also within convenient reach, offering additional restaurants, galleries, entertainment, and views along the Savannah River. Savannah is a city best experienced on foot, and staying in the Historic District allows you to enjoy the details along the way. Moss-draped live oaks, brick sidewalks, landscaped squares, historic architecture, and centuries-old streets become part of the experience as you move between destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027034746017307043,"social_amenities":0.0012496833223849535,"party_restriction":0.0008396535413339734,"nearby_nightlife":0.9626297950744629}},{"text":"Oglethorpe Estate also includes private off-street parking for up to two vehicles, a particularly useful convenience when staying in downtown Savannah. Street parking throughout the Historic District may be metered or limited depending on the area, so having designated parking at the property allows guests to leave their vehicles behind and explore much of the surrounding neighborhood on foot. Stay in the Heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District Oglethorpe Estate places you within easy reach of many of Savannah\u2019s most recognizable historic sites and downtown destinations. Colonial Park Cemetery sits beside the property, while several of the city\u2019s famous squares, historic homes, museums, restaurants, and shops are located within walking distance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001239949488081038,"social_amenities":0.005545397289097309,"party_restriction":0.0006549586541950703,"nearby_nightlife":0.7209453582763672}}]}}},{"listing_id":"25720510","title":"Your Private Retreat in Historic Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/25720510","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-00464"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"25720510","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4ccea0be8422a5ea7b4a81b440ab7851bf3e2ea24464a5b6b5ce5cb424f160d4","chunks":19,"words":1858,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.9170905351638794,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9703070521354675,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Stay in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District at Oglethorpe Estate Main House, a recently refurnished four-bedroom retreat for up to 10 guests. Enjoy spacious living and dining areas, a full kitchen, multiple sitting spaces, a shared courtyard with outdoor seating and a grill, and off-street parking for two vehicles. Located beside Colonial Park Cemetery, the home is within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s famous squares, restaurants, shops, museums, River Street, and more. The space Oglethorpe Estate Main House: A Spacious Savannah Historic District Retreat Experience Savannah from the heart of the Historic District at Oglethorpe Estate Main House, a spacious historic residence located along East Oglethorpe Avenue.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000440719275502488,"social_amenities":0.2573780417442322,"party_restriction":0.004773105960339308,"nearby_nightlife":0.004846759140491486}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you are planning a family vacation, reunion, wedding weekend, or getaway with friends, the home provides plenty of room for everyone to stay together. Its spacious layout also offers separate areas where guests can read, relax, work remotely, or enjoy a quiet moment away from the group. After a full day of sightseeing, return to a comfortable home base where your group can gather, prepare a meal, and settle into the relaxed pace of Savannah. Recently Refurnished Living and Dining Spaces Oglethorpe Estate Main House has been recently refurnished with updated pieces and thoughtfully selected d\u00e9cor that complement the character of the historic residence.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9170905351638794,"social_amenities":0.04045134782791138,"party_restriction":0.0009208438568748534,"nearby_nightlife":0.008577696979045868}},{"text":"Whether you are visiting for a family vacation, reunion, wedding weekend, celebration, or getaway with friends, the home provides the space and convenience needed for a memorable stay. SVR-00464* Guest access Occupancy: 10 Bedroom 1: 2 queen beds Bedroom 2: King bed Bedroom 3: 2 queen beds Bedroom 4: King bed Shared courtyard with outdoor seating and grill \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bWasher/Dryer Off-street parking for up to 2 vehicles Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is locat