s, museums, shops, and historic landmarks. Stay in the Heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District Oglethorpe Estate Main House places guests within convenient reach of Savannah\u2019s most recognizable historic sites and downtown destinations. Colonial Park Cemetery is beside the property, while Oglethorpe Square, Columbia Square, and the Owens-Thomas House & Slave Quarters are all nearby. Continue toward Broughton Street for shopping, coffee, dining, and local boutiques.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010701698192860931,"social_amenities":0.005765864159911871,"party_restriction":0.0007175974315032363,"nearby_nightlife":0.9703070521354675}},{"text":"Recently refurnished with thoughtfully selected d\u00e9cor and updated furnishings, the home offers a welcoming atmosphere that complements its original character. Accommodating up to 10 guests, the main house features generous living and dining areas, a full kitchen, multiple sitting spaces, access to a shared courtyard, and off-street parking for up to two vehicles. Located beside Colonial Park Cemetery and surrounded by the architecture, landscaped squares, and tree-lined streets that define downtown Savannah, Oglethorpe Estate Main House places guests in an ideal location for experiencing the city on foot. Restaurants, shops, museums, historic landmarks, and many of Savannah\u2019s best-known attractions are all within convenient reach.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005887072766199708,"social_amenities":0.0031629286240786314,"party_restriction":0.000690759567078203,"nearby_nightlife":0.9222944974899292}}]}}},{"listing_id":"48028828","title":"Experience Savannah from the Heart of Downtown","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48028828","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02281"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48028828","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"af7cb773f57393e3b5ee3181381d056dd340c071b