ing everyone close to the rest of the Oglethorpe Estate property. This arrangement can be especially helpful for family trips, wedding weekends, reunions, or groups that appreciate having multiple living spaces. Shared Courtyard and Outdoor Space Guests staying on the garden level also have access to the property\u2019s courtyard, which is shared with the main house. Outdoor seating provides a pleasant place to enjoy morning coffee, spend time in the fresh air, or relax between outings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9804686307907104,"social_amenities":0.18782857060432434,"party_restriction":0.0008406678098253906,"nearby_nightlife":0.07002053409814835}},{"text":"Whether you are planning a weekend getaway, wedding trip, family visit, or a few days spent sightseeing, this centrally located retreat gives you a convenient place to begin and end each day. Start the morning with breakfast at home, spend the afternoon exploring Savannah\u2019s squares and museums, and return to the garden level to recharge before heading out for dinner. Recently Refurnished Garden-Level Living The garden level offers a fresh and comfortable atmosphere within the historic property. Thoughtfully selected d\u00e9cor and updated furnishings give the residence an inviting feel while complementing its location in one of Savannah\u2019s most historic neighborhoods.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.042120713740587234,"social_amenities":0.017561204731464386,"party_restriction":0.000319072772981599,"nearby_nightlife":0.019140321761369705}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a