and two additional bathrooms. The first bathroom is located just atop of the stairs, and offers a large vanity, with plenty of space to get ready for a day on the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008559682755731046,"social_amenities":0.0030235929880291224,"party_restriction":0.0003291752946097404,"nearby_nightlife":0.035811230540275574}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Around the corner, the primary suite, that floods with natural light and rich decor. The large dressing room off of the primary bedroom is perfect for a bride-to-be on her big day. Also connected, a spa-like ensuite bathroom fitted with a jetted tub, walk-in shower and double vanity. Head down the hall to find the second bedroom, that overlooks tree lined York Street. Off of the kitchen, guests can find the private courtyard space that is deal for family meals, an evening glass of wine, or a morning cup of joe! Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen bed Bedroom 2: Queen bed What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0036621459294110537,"social_amenities":0.002858927007764578,"party_restriction":0.0008518971735611558,"nearby_nightlife":0.014930147677659988}},{"text":"Entering into the foyer, you'll immediately take notice of a multitude of rich architectural details, including original hardwood floors, high ceilings, and large decorative fireplaces. On the first floor, you'll find a designated sitting room and a chef's kitchen fitted with a gas stove. Adjacent to the kitchen is dining room with seating for four Lucky guests. Down the hall, a full-size bathroom with a walk-in shower. Head upstairs where you'll find the spacious bedrooms, and two additional bathrooms. The first bathroom is located just atop of the stairs, and offers a large vanity, with plenty of space to get ready for a day on the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008559682755731046,"social_amenities":0.0030235929880291224,"party_restriction":0.0003291752946097404,"nearby_nightlife":0.035811230540275574}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This two-story townhome sits on the corner of Lincoln and York Street, just across from Savannah's famed President's Quarters. Step outside of your front door and live like a local by venturing out to many nearby restaurants, events and venues. The space Located on the corner of Lincoln and York Street, this Historic Luxurious Townhome is in the heart of it all. Live like a local and enjoy being within walking distance to many nearby venues, restaurants, and attractions. The home boasts with high ceilings, fine furnishings, and a private courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008436369826085865,"social_amenities":0.03475593030452728,"party_restriction":0.0009909552754834294,"nearby_nightlife":0.9655703902244568}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":108,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004739577416330576,"social_amenities":0.000831205805297941,"party_restriction":0.004250042140483856,"nearby_nightlife":0.006933192722499371}},{"text":"Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 8pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-00880 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.762590343598276e-05,"social_amenities":0.00042794705950655043,"party_restriction":0.0016742240404710174,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031210482120513916}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"This two-story townhome sits on the corner of Lincoln and York Street, just across from Savannah's famed President's Quarters. Step outside of your front door and live like a local by venturing out to many nearby restaurants, events and venues. The space Located on the corner of Lincoln and York Street, this Historic Luxurious Townhome is in the heart of it all. Live like a local and enjoy being within walking distance to many nearby venues, restaurants, and attractions. The home boasts with high ceilings, fine furnishings, and a private courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008436369826085865,"social_amenities":0.03475593030452728,"party_restriction":0.0009909552754834294,"nearby_nightlife":0.9655703902244568}},{"text":"Entering into the foyer, you'll immediately take notice of a multitude of rich architectural details, including original hardwood floors, high ceilings, and large decorative fireplaces. On the first floor, you'll find a designated sitting room and a chef's kitchen fitted with a gas stove. Adjacent to the kitchen is dining room with seating for four Lucky guests. Down the hall, a full-size bathroom with a walk-in shower. Head upstairs where you'll find the spacious bedrooms, and two additional bathrooms. The first bathroom is located just atop of the stairs, and offers a large vanity, with plenty of space to get ready for a day on the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008559682755731046,"social_amenities":0.0030235929880291224,"party_restriction":0.0003291752946097404,"nearby_nightlife":0.035811230540275574}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 06021","address":"139 LINCOLN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24039040460","date":"2024-02-08","type":"42-4 THEFT FROM VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"141 LINCOLN ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06007","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24300314767","date":"2024-10-26","type":"UNCONSCIOUS-LIFE STATSUS UNK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"221 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25051047407","date":"2025-02-20","type":"OPEN DOOR","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"221 E YORK ST","recorded_pin":"20015 06006","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"42381602","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42381602","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00260"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"42381602","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"27cd4677e9e143582c311d380b31d166954901d6c48f1ab8aa9cd624a053f5e3","chunks":15,"words":1416,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5505620837211609,"party_welcome":0.09448471665382385,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.9874029159545898,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"There's no denying that this is one of the most classic Savannah vacation rentals available. It is also a highly practical choice for those looking for room for up to six guests. Luxury on Lincoln wows from the street with help from its stately brick fa\u00e7ade and classic shutters. Of course, the Southern stateliness continues once you step through the front door of one of the loveliest vacation rentals Savannah GA guests can choose. The space Luxury on Lincoln boasts 1,932 square feet of space. Six guests will find ample space for living and relaxation within the beautifully decorated walls of this estate.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001466173998778686,"social_amenities":0.05164441466331482,"party_restriction":0.0016064110677689314,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024501278530806303}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The list of the city's top festivals and events includes the Savannah Music Festival, the Savannah Craft Brew Fest, the Savannah Food Day Festival, the Telfair Art Fair, the Fine Arts on the River Festival, the River Street Fourth of July Celebration, the Annual Savannah Tour of Homes and Gardens, the Savannah Seafood Festival, Oktoberfest on the River, the Holiday Tour of Homes and Christmas on the River. Guest access Beautifully renovated Historic townhouse built in 1886 Private courtyard with outdoor seating and gas grill Fully equipped kitchen Dining room with seating for 6 Wet bar and wine cooler Free Wifi Flat screen TV's throughout the home","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.09448471665382385,"social_amenities":0.06798557937145233,"party_restriction":0.0007477372419089079,"nearby_nightlife":0.9874029159545898}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"This private space ensures that any night spent in Savannah can turn into something magical. Guests can drag mint juleps from the home's wet bar out to the courtyard to sip in a fully private and fenced-in area. The home's brick courtyard features seating, an umbrella, a gas grill, a decorative fountain and other garden-like touches that create a very relaxing space for both morning coffee and pre-bed cocktails. The sleeping situation inside Luxury on Lincoln boasts one king bedroom, one queen bedroom and one sleeper sofa. The home's king bedroom is truly a space of prestige.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023880772641859949,"social_amenities":0.0911950021982193,"party_restriction":0.0010470837587490678,"nearby_nightlife":0.5127830505371094}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. SVR-00260 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":123,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011663516488624737,"social_amenities":0.0015453259693458676,"party_restriction":0.002009246964007616,"nearby_nightlife":0.002595950150862336}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The list of the city's top festivals and events includes the Savannah Music Festival, the Savannah Craft Brew Fest, the Savannah Food Day Festival, the Telfair Art Fair, the Fine Arts on the River Festival, the River Street Fourth of July Celebration, the Annual Savannah Tour of Homes and Gardens, the Savannah Seafood Festival, Oktoberfest on the River, the Holiday Tour of Homes and Christmas on the River. Guest access Beautifully renovated Historic townhouse built in 1886 Private courtyard with outdoor seating and gas grill Fully equipped kitchen Dining room with seating for 6 Wet bar and wine cooler Free Wifi Flat screen TV's throughout the home","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.09448471665382385,"social_amenities":0.06798557937145233,"party_restriction":0.0007477372419089079,"nearby_nightlife":0.9874029159545898}},{"text":"Days in Savannah can also be spent enjoying the lively vibes at spots like City Market, River Street and Riverfront Plaza. Fun excursions to spots like Old Fort Jackson and Skidway Island State Park are also in the mix. Of course, hours can be spent absorbing the beautiful architecture and painstaking upkeep behind the properties of the famed Savannah Historic District. Savannah is known for its very unique tours. In fact, few visit the city without partaking in a guided \"ghost\" tour, cemetery tour, distillery tour or after-dark carriage tour.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014944203430786729,"social_amenities":0.0019071873975917697,"party_restriction":0.0013050789711996913,"nearby_nightlife":0.951151430606842}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 06028","address":"201 E YORK ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":20.0,"advertised_guests":16.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24196207185","date":"2024-07-14","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"201 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06028","side":"direct"},{"number":"25319325304","date":"2025-11-15","type":"29 OTHER NOISE COMPLAINT","outcome":"Noise complaints","recorded_address":"201 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06028","side":"direct"},{"number":"24350364166","date":"2024-12-15","type":"22 FOUND PROPERTY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"203 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06002","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26026023761","date":"2026-01-26","type":"1-J ASSAULT EMS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"203 E York St","recorded_pin":"20015 06002","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1339092513793436035","title":"Walk to River Street| Bars| Shopping| Sleeps 16+","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1339092513793436035","guests":16.0,"permits":["SVR-03092","SVR-03093","SVR-03094","SVR-03095","SVR-03096"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1339092513793436035","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4dcd01181c234d33beba9539963bf362247fdc2a13529e886c4d400369c3e742","chunks":7,"words":660,"party_signal":0.9944234490394592,"social_signal":0.1981002390384674,"party_welcome":0.9944234490394592,"social_amenities":0.1981002390384674,"party_restriction":0.001333638676442206,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784931540489197,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Add to that a rooftop balcony, luxury bedding and incredibly well maintained historic home and you've got a vacation to remember. This home is 5 separate apartments, rented all together for large groups. All king bedrooms are ensuite. This beautifully restored property offers 11 bedrooms and 9 full and 2 half bathrooms, making it the perfect destination for large groups, family reunions, or small retreats. With accommodations for up to 26 guests, this home provides a unique and unforgettable setting for your gathering. Located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, no car is needed to explore the city\u2019s charm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9944234490394592,"social_amenities":0.002502577379345894,"party_restriction":0.0006509505328722298,"nearby_nightlife":0.020825911313295364},"affirmative_event_evidence":"This beautifully restored property offers 11 bedrooms and 9 full and 2 half bathrooms, making it the perfect destination for large groups, family reunions, or small retreats."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Welcome to The Captain\u2019s House, a historic gem built in 1853 by Captain Henry James Dickerson, a prominent figure in Savannah\u2019s maritime history. The space Welcome to The Captain\u2019s House, a historic gem built in 1853 by Captain Henry James Dickerson, a prominent figure in Savannah\u2019s maritime history. Eleven bedrooms and eleven bathrooms, perfect for large groups. 7 king beds and 4 queen beds plus two queen pullout couches so that you and your crew can have privacy while enjoying Savannah as a group. Five kitchens await your every need. You won't find a better location in Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014588055200874805,"social_amenities":0.1981002390384674,"party_restriction":0.0007811982650309801,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009225246612913907}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection 43 inch HDTV with Amazon Prime Video, Apple TV, Chromecast, Disney+, Fire TV, HBO Max, Hulu, Netflix, premium cable Movie theater Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Standalone high chair - always at the listing With padding, straps/harness, and food tray Board games Heating and cooling","section":"AMENITIES","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035412830766290426,"social_amenities":0.00825426820665598,"party_restriction":0.00045543420128524303,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019308616174384952}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Add to that a rooftop balcony, luxury bedding and incredibly well maintained historic home and you've got a vacation to remember. This home is 5 separate apartments, rented all together for large groups. All king bedrooms are ensuite. This beautifully restored property offers 11 bedrooms and 9 full and 2 half bathrooms, making it the perfect destination for large groups, family reunions, or small retreats. With accommodations for up to 26 guests, this home provides a unique and unforgettable setting for your gathering. Located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, no car is needed to explore the city\u2019s charm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9944234490394592,"social_amenities":0.002502577379345894,"party_restriction":0.0006509505328722298,"nearby_nightlife":0.020825911313295364}},{"text":"Simply Uber from the airport and enjoy walking to iconic landmarks, squares, shops, and restaurants. Situated directly on the St. Patrick\u2019s Day parade route, The Captain\u2019s House offers unparalleled access to one of Savannah\u2019s most celebrated events. Inside, you\u2019ll find exposed brick, spacious interiors, and breathtaking views of Savannah. Whether you\u2019re planning a festive celebration or a peaceful retreat, The Captain\u2019s House is the ultimate blend of history, luxury, and convenience. Paid street parking is available. There is a parking garage available at the far side of Oglethorpe Square, a short walk away. You will not need a car while staying at the Captain's House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9790952205657959,"social_amenities":0.0021043922752141953,"party_restriction":0.001333638676442206,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784931540489197}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to The Captain\u2019s House, a historic gem built in 1853 by Captain Henry James Dickerson, a prominent figure in Savannah\u2019s maritime history. The space Welcome to The Captain\u2019s House, a historic gem built in 1853 by Captain Henry James Dickerson, a prominent figure in Savannah\u2019s maritime history. Eleven bedrooms and eleven bathrooms, perfect for large groups. 7 king beds and 4 queen beds plus two queen pullout couches so that you and your crew can have privacy while enjoying Savannah as a group. Five kitchens await your every need. You won't find a better location in Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014588055200874805,"social_amenities":0.1981002390384674,"party_restriction":0.0007811982650309801,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009225246612913907}},{"text":"What this place offers Bat