ck\u2019s Day parade route and other festival paths.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9965305924415588,"social_amenities":0.003546717343851924,"party_restriction":0.00046342628775164485,"nearby_nightlife":0.9724079966545105}},{"text":"7 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms in a completely walkable location in Savannah's Historic District. 3 king beds, all ensuite and 4 queen beds await you here! Spacious living and dining areas and luxury linens. This unit is made up of the combination of two lower apartments in this ginormous, historic home. Book today! The space A Historic Retreat in Savannah's Historic District Step back in time and experience the charm of Savannah\u2019s Historic District in this spacious 7-bedroom, 5-bathroom home, once owned by a 19th-century sea captain. With a prime, walkable location near Oglethorpe Square, this historic gem offers the perfect blend of modern luxury and vintage character.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023160161799751222,"social_amenities":0.005179182626307011,"party_restriction":0.0015297878999263048,"nearby_nightlife":0.005543659441173077}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1339959949012710847","title":"No Car Needed+King Bed+Balcony - Abercorn and York","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1339959949012710847","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03093"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1339959949012710847","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c6ee5fb82681e1904cb05c1b4794cb546b736939eba46462afce7d905f9da726","chunks":7,"words":653,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9901694655418396,"party_welcome":0.0017528330208733678,"social_amenities":0.9901694655418396,"party_restriction":0.14933452010154724,"nearby_nightlife":0.024028491228818893,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Enjoy this gorgeous apartment, no need for a car! Walk the beautiful streets of Savannah and sleep in comfort. Abercorn and York has one king bedroom and t