fe, and cultural landmarks\u2014no car required. Inside, you\u2019ll find two spacious king bedrooms, each with a private en-suite bathroom, ensuring comfort and privacy. The open-concept living, dining, and kitchen area is perfect for relaxing or entertaining, with a convenient half bath nearby. Luxury bedding, thoughtfully curated furnishings, and a private outdoor patio overlooking historic Abercorn Street enhance your stay, offering a tranquil retreat in the heart of the city. Please note: Guests will need to be able to climb stairs to access the property. Stay where history meets hospitality and make unforgettable memories at the Dickerson House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0060699800960719585,"social_amenities":0.0012591879349201918,"party_restriction":0.004010508302599192,"nearby_nightlife":0.965339720249176}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1339971380284343828","title":"Jacuzzi Tub! Walk to River Street | King Bed |","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1339971380284343828","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03096"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1339971380284343828","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7fe41549110fa28b627ba0ebd592bf34c39a17d710a468889cd5832700c15d85","chunks":7,"words":598,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.009169093333184719,"party_welcome":0.0016546533443033695,"social_amenities":0.9115308523178101,"party_restriction":0.027923772111535072,"nearby_nightlife":0.9924512505531311,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses","section":"AMENITIES","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001720707368804142,"social_amenities":0.009169093333184719,"party_restriction":0.00019917497411370277,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008772409055382013}},{"text":"Discover Carriage for the Captain, a hidden gem in Savannah. Once the carriage house of Captain James Dickerson, it features a king bed and ensuite bathroom on the main floor. Upstairs, enjoy an open kitchen, cozy living area, and a half bath. Perfect for a romantic escape or a family stay, this charming retreat offers comfort and history in one unique space! The space Step back in time and immerse yourself in Savannah\u2019s rich history with a stay at Carriage for the Captain, the former carriage house of Captain Henry James Dickerson.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.288169970503077e-05,"social_amenities":0.005428930278867483,"party_restriction":0.0009656933252699673,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002920288825407624}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"A legendary figure in Savannah\u2019s maritime history, Captain Dickerson arrived in Savannah as a young sailor and rose to prominence as a ship owner, harbor master, and influential community leader. His legacy lives on in this beautifully restored retreat, located just steps from Oglethorpe Square in the heart of the Historic District. This charming two-story carriage house combines historical character with modern comforts, offering the perfect escape for couples, families, or friends. The main floor features a serene king bedroom with luxurious bedding and an en-suite bathroom, creating a private sanctuary for restful nights. Upstairs, you\u2019ll find a welcoming open-plan kitch