ate entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free residential garage on premises \u2013 2 spaces Paid parking off premises Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015765288844704628,"social_amenities":0.3560243248939514,"party_restriction":0.00020282076729927212,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002791784645523876}},{"text":"All potential guests must be aware of this and be willing to respect other guests on the property. Adhering to the house rules includes taking off shoes, respecting the city noise ordinance, etc. The home is styled in era appropriate furniture and antiques, and much of the original character has been preserved while modernizing everything up to today's comforts and efficiency. The kitchen is stocked with a complete set of Green Pan's highest grade cookware, full bar set, hand mixer, blender, American Standard bakeware, and all the odds and ends. Perfect place to have a family vacation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004172472981736064,"social_amenities":0.0053845858201384544,"party_restriction":0.008688700385391712,"nearby_nightlife":0.004165994934737682}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"All potential guests must be aware of this and be willing to respect other guests on the property. Adhering to the house rules includes taking off shoes, respecting the city noise ordinance, etc. The home is styled in era appropriate furniture and antiques, and much of the original character has been preserved while modernizing everything up to today's comforts and efficiency. The kitchen is stocked with a complete set of Green Pan's highest grade cookware, full bar set, hand mixer, blender, American Standard bakeware, and all the odds and ends. Perfect place to have a family vacation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004172472981736064,"social_amenities":0.0053845858201384544,"party_restriction":0.008688700385391712,"nearby_nightlife":0.004165994934737682}},{"text":"Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044390937546268106,"social_amenities":0.0011345375096425414,"party_restriction":0.001519378973171115,"nearby_nightlife":0.001283228979445994}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The historic Hamilton Estate was built 1868 and has been preserved in its beautiful antiquity, but with all the modern amenities. There are 5 Bedrooms with memory foam mattresses, 3.5 bathrooms, ample living space, a large courtyard with plunge pool and outdoor dining space, garage parking for 2 cars, and all bathrooms have Public Goods products and soft Turkish towels. The space The home features 4 main bedrooms with king beds and a bonus bedroom with two twin beds. The bonus bedroom is through the master bedroom for a total of 6 beds. This home is part of an estate which includes garden suites below and carriage houses behind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015330901078414172,"social_amenities":0.0012920770095661283,"party_restriction":0.00031400119769386947,"nearby_nightlife":0.007576975505799055}},{"text":"All potential guests must be aware of this and be willing to respect other guests on the property. Adhering to the house rules includes taking off shoes, respecting the city noise ordinance, etc. The home is styled in era appropriate furniture and antiques, and much of the original character has been preserved while modernizing everything up to today's comforts and efficiency. The kitchen is stocked with a complete set of Green Pan's highest grade cookware, full bar set, hand mixer, blender, American Standard bakeware, and all the odds and ends. Perfect place to have a family vacation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004172472981736064,"social_amenities":0.0053845858201384544,"party_restriction":0.008688700385391712,"nearby_nightlife":0.004165994934737682}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1283499371934518799","title":"Hamilton Carriage A - Amazing Location, Courtyard","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1283499371934518799","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03243"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1283499371934518799","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"64c443aaa8c6eb29d1993169342bf4beb016a895df45387d548e8232b8d9eecb","chunks":5,"words":405,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.786666214466095,"party_welcome":0.00040681095561012626,"social_amenities":0.786666214466095,"party_restriction":0.01642458140850067,"nearby_nightlife":0.5454450845718384,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"*Please note that there are currently main house and courtyard renovations taking place that affect use of the courtyard space. These renovations are scheduled to be completed by September 4, 2026.* A large carriage house located in the perfect center of Downtown Savannah. Walking distance to everything, but quiet enough for a solid night of sleep on the king size bed. With access to a courtyard oasis. The space The carriage house opens into a common courtyard lounge chairs on a bricked patio. There is a 10 person dining table to accommodate any family meal. The courtyard features a propane grill and a plunge pool.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040681095561012626,"social_amenities":0.786666214466095,"party_restriction":0.0026245585177093744,"nearby_nightlife":0.1195598766207695}},{"text":"Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor fur