by Parking and facilities Paid parking lot off premises Services Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025443790946155787,"social_amenities":0.07874663174152374,"party_restriction":0.0006296596257016063,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030776984058320522}},{"text":"Enjoy epitome of luxury living in Savannah's historic district \u2013 book your stay at this exquisite one-bedroom loft today and elevate your travel experience to new heights. We can't wait for you to create lasting memories in one of the most sought-after locations in Savannah! We can't wait to host you! SVR-02940 Guest access To access the building guests will receive two codes. One to the shared building entrance and one to the condo door. Please note there is not an elevator in the building. There is a shared entry with a steep stair case to the second floor lofts. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0037182660307735205,"social_amenities":0.05733369663357735,"party_restriction":0.0065657044760882854,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015442579751834273}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Enjoy epitome of luxury living in Savannah's historic district \u2013 book your stay at this exquisite one-bedroom loft today and elevate your travel experience to new heights. We can't wait for you to create lasting memories in one of the most sought-after locations in Savannah! We can't wait to host you! SVR-02940 Guest access To access the building guests will receive two codes. One to the shared building entrance and one to the condo door. Please note there is not an elevator in the building. There is a shared entry with a steep stair case to the second floor lofts. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0037182660307735205,"social_amenities":0.05733369663357735,"party_restriction":0.0065657044760882854,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015442579751834273}},{"text":"Dine in at the sleek dining table or enjoy the ease of dining out at all the amazing local restaurants in walking distance that Savannah has to offer. After a day of exploring Savannah's rich history and vibrant culture, pamper yourself with a rejuvenating refresh in the spacious walk-in shower. Enjoy a double bathroom vanity and spacious bathroom that has been updated to perfection! Plush towels, a hair dryer, clothing steamer and hotel size toiletries are all provided. Extra pillows and sleeper sofa bedding is provided. A pac n play travel crib is available upon request. As a guest you can enjoy access to high-speed internet and family games.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015920193400233984,"social_amenities":0.007799709215760231,"party_restriction":0.0007240283885039389,"nearby_nightlife":0.964346706867218}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher LG stainless steel electric stove Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Trash compactor Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Parking and facilities Paid parking lot off premises Services Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025443790946155787,"social_amenities":0.07874663174152374,"party_restriction":0.0006296596257016063,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030776984058320522}},{"text":"Enjoy epitome of luxury living in Savannah's historic district \u2013 book your stay at this exquisite one-bedroom loft today and elevate your travel experience to new heights. We can't wait for you to create lasting memories in one of the most sought-after locations in Savannah! We can't wait to host you! SVR-02940 Guest access To access the building guests will receive two codes. One to the shared building entrance and one to the condo door. Please note there is not an elevator in the building. There is a shared entry with a steep stair case to the second floor lofts. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0037182660307735205,"social_amenities":0.05733369663357735,"party_restriction":0.0065657044760882854,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015442579751834273}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Enjoy epitome of luxury living in Savannah's historic district \u2013 book your stay at this exquisite one-bedroom loft today and elevate your travel experience to new heights. We can't wait for you to create lasting memories in one of the most sought-after locations in Savannah! We can't wait to host you! SVR-02940 Guest access To access the building guests will receive two codes. One to the shared building entrance and one to the condo door. Please note there is not an elevator in the building. There is a shared entry with a steep stair case to the second floor lofts. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0037182660307735205,"social_amenities":0.05733369663357735,"party_restriction":0.0065657044760882854,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015442579751834273}},{"text":"Please note that this condo is in the heart of downtown living. While the location is fabulous it does come with some city noises that you may not be accustomed to from trains, sirens, trash vehicles, delivery trucks, and church bells. We do offer a sound machine and room darkening/sound dampening shades in the bedroom. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001582639233674854,"social_amenities":0.0014518393436446786,"party_restriction":0.003889446845278144,"nearby_nightlife":0.026466967537999153}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Dine in at the sleek dining table or enjoy the ease of dining out at all the amazing local restaurants in walking distance that Savannah has to offer. After a day of exploring Savannah's rich history and vibrant culture, pamper yourself with a rejuvenating refresh in the spacious walk-in shower. Enjoy a double bathroom vanity and spacious bathroom that has been updated to perfection! Plush towels, a hair dryer, clothing steamer and hotel size toiletries are all provided. Extra pillows and sleeper sofa bedding is provided. A pac n play travel crib is available upon request. As a guest you can enjoy access to high-speed internet and family games.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015920193400233984,"social_amenities":0.007799709215760231,"party_restriction":0.0007240283885039389,"nearby_nightlife":0.964346706867218}},{"text":"Welcome to this luxury retreat in the heart of Savannah's historic district! This stunning one-bedroom loft is nestled on Wright Square, it offers a perfect blend of charm and modern touches with a central and walkable location for your visit! The loft sleeps up to four guests and boasts a spacious king bedroom suite. You will be on the St. Patrick's Day parade route and close to all the shops, restaurants and historical destinations of Savannah! We cannot wait to host you! The space Step into a world of refined elegance as you enter this beautifully appointed space. Tall ceilings, skylights and designer furnishings create an ambiance of timeless luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047561191604472697,"social_amenities":0.007127942051738501,"party_restriction":0.0008570823702029884,"nearby_nightlife":0.5898799300193787}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 09013","address":"1 W YORK ST #A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":null,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-p