8ab06d043a92485efdd3ae644c33","chunks":6,"words":538,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.928902804851532,"party_welcome":0.04586552456021309,"social_amenities":0.928902804851532,"party_restriction":0.09676945954561234,"nearby_nightlife":0.8621512055397034,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"You have 24/7 access to the entire condo, make yourself at home! being on the first floor, you can walk up the front steps and access your unit with ease. The balcony is totally private to you and your group. It is actually the only balcony in the condo building that is occupied. You have access to the rear courtyard which is shared with the condo building. There is a charcoal BBQ grill and plenty of outdoor seating back there. This is the only place you may smoke.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.023896627128124237,"social_amenities":0.928902804851532,"party_restriction":0.0009512993856333196,"nearby_nightlife":0.012888912111520767}},{"text":"We have a fully-equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, laundry closet for washing/drying your clothes and plenty of seating space. We have a full table set in case you want to show off your culinary skills and have a formal sit-down meal. The cozy living room gets tons of light from the huge windows and French doors, so you can have a sunny morning breakfast to start the day off right! The twin room is a nice additional space for those with a child or maybe just a third-wheeler :) Easy to \"work from home\" with the high-speed Wi-Fi and plenty of table space to set up at. SVR-02488 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04586552456021309,"social_amenities":0.014277356676757336,"party_restriction":0.0027255539316684008,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017456572968512774}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"We have a fully-equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, laundry closet for washing/drying your clothes and plenty of seating space. We have a full table set in case