96,"nearby_nightlife":0.012888912111520767}},{"text":"We have a fully-equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, laundry closet for washing/drying your clothes and plenty of seating space. We have a full table set in case you want to show off your culinary skills and have a formal sit-down meal. The cozy living room gets tons of light from the huge windows and French doors, so you can have a sunny morning breakfast to start the day off right! The twin room is a nice additional space for those with a child or maybe just a third-wheeler :) Easy to \"work from home\" with the high-speed Wi-Fi and plenty of table space to set up at. SVR-02488 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04586552456021309,"social_amenities":0.014277356676757336,"party_restriction":0.0027255539316684008,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017456572968512774}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There is a storage space in the lobby where folks keep their bikes should you want to bring yours, or leave your luggage while you go explore if you're waiting on a later flight out. Other things to note The condo building is mostly long-term residents so please respect your neighbors and keep your inside voices on. \"Quiet hours\" are from 10pm-8am. Please be a courteous guest and help us show the City of Savannah how important you all are to us! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036185936187393963,"social_amenities":0.0015524507034569979,"party_restriction":0.09676945954561234,"nearby_nightlife":0.11787822097539902}},{"text":"We have a fully-equipped kitchen with a dishwasher, laundry closet for washing/drying your clothes and plenty of seating space. We have a full table set in case you want to show off your culinary skills and have a formal sit-down meal. The cozy living room gets tons of light from the huge windows and French doors, so you can have a sunny morning breakfast to start the day off right! The twin room is a nice additional space for those with a child or maybe just a third-wheeler :) Easy to \"work from home\" with the high-speed Wi-Fi and plenty of table space to set up at. SVR-02488 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04586552456021309,"social_amenities":0.014277356676757336,"party_restriction":0.0027255539316684008,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017456572968512774}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Experience classic Southern charm at The Grand Porch Oasis! Sip sweet tea or a mojito from the private balcony overlooking historic Oglethorpe Ave. With a 97 Walk Score, you\u2019re steps from Savannah favorites like Collins Quarter, Husk, Flying Monk, and more. This light-filled, renovated historic condo features fast WiFi, Smart TV, Keurig, full kitchen, original hardwood floors, and modern comforts in the heart of downtown Savannah. SVR-02488 The space Gorgeous original maple flooring, extremely high ceilings, pronounced trim and other historic features take you back in time where sipping sweet tea over good conversation was a common routine.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010441625636303797,"social_amenities":0.0024880936834961176,"party_restriction":0.0002983399317599833,"nearby_nightlife":0.8621512055397034}},{"text":"There is a storage space in the lobby where folks keep their bikes should you want to bring yours, or leave your luggage while you go explore if you're waiting on a later flight out. Other things to note The condo building is mostly long-term residents so please respect your neighbors and keep your inside voices on. \"Quiet hours\" are from 10pm-8am. Please be a courteous guest and help us show the City of Savannah how important you all are to us! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036185936187393963,"social_amenities":0.0015524507034569979,"party_restriction":0.09676945954561234,"nearby_nightlife":0.11787822097539902}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015