sturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1625621926534024248","title":"Charming Downtown Apartment | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1625621926534024248","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00026"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1625621926534024248","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1603ae921541936d4fbbd9cd96313b1d1e1bccb4d489c4d170476bc9a7204c31","chunks":9,"words":860,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8917259573936462,"party_welcome":0.0031162570230662823,"social_amenities":0.8917259573936462,"party_restriction":0.4470226764678955,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802589416503906,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Haint & Porcelain is a one-bedroom retreat across from Colonial Park Cemetery in downtown Savannah. Soft blue tones, porcelain accents, antiques, and a queen canopy bed create an intimate, old-world atmosphere. Sleeps 4 with a sofa bed, full kitchen with island, walk-in shower, in-unit washer/dryer, and shared courtyard. Steps to Broughton Street. The space Haint & Porcelain A Romantic Retreat Across from Colonial Park Cemetery Haint & Porcelain is a romantic, ground-level retreat set directly across from Colonial Park Cemetery, where Savannah\u2019s earliest stories rest just beyond your doorstep.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003102784394286573,"social_amenities":0.8917259573936462,"party_restriction":0.4470226764678955,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024077079724520445}},{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Step outside and you are immediately immersed in one of Savannah\u2019s most atmospheric blocks. Evening ghost tours pass along the cemetery gates, Spanish moss drapes overhead, and history feels present in a way that is subtle and authentic. Just two short blocks away, the shops, dining, galleries, and energy of Broughton Street await. From morning pastries to late-night cocktails, everything you love about downtown Savannah is within easy walking distance. This is a place for romantics, history lovers, and those drawn to beauty with depth, a space where the past lingers softly and the present is meant to be savored. Parking Information","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0031162570230662823,"social_amenities":0.004535937216132879,"party_restriction":0.003771672025322914,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802589416503906}},{"text":"Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":197,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000489778642076999,"social_amenities":0.18863089382648468,"party_restriction":0.003652894636616111,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006954458076506853}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Haint & Porcelain is a one-bedroom retreat across from Colonial Park Cemetery in downtown Savannah. Soft blue tones, porcelain accents, antiques, and a queen canopy bed create an intimate, old-wor