322914,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802589416503906}},{"text":"On-street metered parking is available directly outside the home and throughout the neighborhood, enforced by the City of Savannah Monday\u2013Saturday, 8am\u20138pm. Guests may pay via the ParkSavannah app, parking kiosks, or meters. Public garages and visitor parking passes are also available nearby. Please observe posted sweep-zone signage when parking. Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living room with seating and smart TV Full kitchen Kitchen island with seating for 4 Bedroom: Queen bed Additional sleeping space: Queen sofa bed in living room Full bathroom with tiled stand-up shower Washer/Dryer Secure keyless building entry Shared courtyard outdoor space Metered street parking nearby Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017057242803275585,"social_amenities":0.006560888607054949,"party_restriction":0.0005547174951061606,"nearby_nightlife":0.20221196115016937}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 18010","address":"234 HABERSHAM ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24139147079","date":"2024-05-18","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"234 Habersham St","recorded_pin":"20015 18010","side":"direct"},{"number":"26042039912","date":"2026-02-11","type":"31 CHECK-THE-WELFARE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"405 E Perry St","recorded_pin":"20015 18028","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"13167983","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/13167983","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00574"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"13167983","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3d3e2fc7c9bfa29a90aa7252d267b0787d08af32055dd0b99c8a2ea4bc338063","chunks":9,"words":840,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.06508103758096695,"party_welcome":0.9281021952629089,"social_amenities":0.06508103758096695,"party_restriction":0.002812901744619012,"nearby_nightlife":0.9943194389343262,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Fantastic Location! One Queen Bedroom Ensuite Bathroom One Queen Bedroom One King Bedroom One Pull-Out Sofa Elevator 2.5 Baths Garage Parking for 1 Car Gourmet Kitchen Recently Remodeled Drip Coffee Maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000431180524174124,"social_amenities":0.06508103758096695,"party_restriction":0.0021850212942808867,"nearby_nightlife":0.00611039437353611}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":177,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005244578351266682,"social_amenities":0.03371190279722214,"party_restriction":0.0013902791542932391,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005730816628783941}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You can choose from horse-drawn carriages, pedal-cabs and guided walking tours among others. Savannah is always full of things to do and various festivals and celebrations happen all year round. The following is a short list of events that might be available: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Savannah Music Festival in March \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December SVR-00574 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9281021952629089,"social_amenities":0.004210244864225388,"party_restriction":0.0010956069454550743,"nearby_nightlife":0.9708420038223267}},{"text":"Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004243694711476564,"social_amenities":0.021695459261536598,"party_restriction":0.001978736137971282,"nearby_nightlife":0.002593768062070012}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Fantastic Location! One Queen Bedroom Ensuite Bathroom One Queen Bedroom One King Bedroom One Pull-Out Sofa Elevator 2.5 Baths Garage Parking for 1 Car Gourmet Kitchen Recently Remodeled Drip Coffee Maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000431180524174124,"social_amenities":0.06508103758096695,"party_restriction":0.0021850212942808867,"nearby_nightlife":0.00611039437353611}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":177,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005244578351266682,"social_amenities":0.03371190279722214,"party_restriction":0.0013902791542932391,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005730816628783941}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"One of our Savannah vacation rentals to consider on your Georgia vacations is the Habersham House. This is a nearly 2,500 square foot property with three bedrooms and two and a half baths. It's a fantastic location for vacation homes Savannah between East Perry Street and East Perry Lane, which puts it near the Colonial Park Cemetery and a variety of good restaurants like the Bier Haus and Screamin' Mimis. The space Finding things to do near your vacation homes Savannah won't be hard when you're in walking distance of many historic sites.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020922694238834083,"social_amenities":0.009861582890152931,"party_restriction":0.002812901744619012,"nearby_nightlife":0.8300949335098267}},{"text":"Fantastic Location! One Queen Bedroom Ensuite Bathroom One Queen Bedroom One King Bedroom One Pull-Out Sofa Elevator 2.5 Baths Garage Parking for 1 Car Gourmet Kitchen Recently Remodeled Drip Coffee Maker Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000431180524174124,"social_amenities":0.06508103758096695,"party_restriction":0.0021850212942808867,"nearby_nightlife":0.00611039437353611}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Right nearby the Habersham House is the Colonial Park Cemetery, which covers about six acres and is now more of a park, since it has been closed to new burials since the mid-1800s. Deep in the historic district is four renovated blocks that is now known as the City Market. This is one of the top visited places in downtown Savannah and features jazz clubs, restaurants, many open-air cafes, boutiques and gift shops. Another top attraction in Savannah is the 26 acres that constitutes Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000999301322735846,"social_amenities":0.0018036762485280633,"party_restriction":0.0008368850685656071,"nearby_nightlife":0.9943194389343262}},{"text":"You can choose from horse-drawn carriages, pedal-cabs and guided walking tours among others. Savannah is always full of things to do and various festivals and celebrations happen all year round. The following is a short list of events that might be available: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Savannah Music Festival in March \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December SVR-00574 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9281021952629089,"social_amenities":0.004210244864225388,"party_restriction":0.0010956069454550743,"nearby_nightlife":0.9708420038223267}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 19003","address":"208 E LIBERTY ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24294308231","date":"2024-10-20","type":"24-4 UNWANTED person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"204 E Liberty St","recorded_pin":"20015 19002","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"645616782077682801","title":"Liberty House, Historic Home | Centrally Located","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/645616782077682801","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02574"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"645616782077682801","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4572b24365661398a6df0206142533dfc1f10bc39e86ef629a5fef8df8338a71","chunks