or fireplace Heating Home safety Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003812243230640888,"social_amenities":0.014395021833479404,"party_restriction":0.00038101087557151914,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008802006486803293}},{"text":"Find everything you need to cook delicious meals including cooking utensils, pots, pans, and dishware. A microwave and a coffee maker are provided. Directly off the kitchen is the den presenting a comfortable sofa, chairs, and smart TV perfect for all your streaming needs. Step out on the back terrace and follow the staircase down to the shared garden patio. The ample room allows you to spread out and enjoy beautiful Savannah mornings and evenings under the shade of live oak trees, cathedral spires, and high privacy walls. On the third level of the building find the two private bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002649411908350885,"social_amenities":0.008576878346502781,"party_restriction":0.0004337565624155104,"nearby_nightlife":0.020746799185872078}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Family Children\u2019s dinnerware Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Indoor fireplace Heating Home safety Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meal