 marked with high-class features that are truly authentic in Savannah. SVR-02574 The space Original in 1868, the Liberty House was the second home on East Liberty Street built for John Hernandez. Listed in Savannah\u2019s city directories as a confectioner from St. Augustine, Florida, Mr.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015621782222297043,"social_amenities":0.0025469360407441854,"party_restriction":0.0014657116262242198,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005314395530149341}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The outdoor courtyard is the only shared space between you and the ground floor unit. The green dining set below the staircase is for the downstairs unit, and the larger black table and fire pit is for your use. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Clean up all smoke butts. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.263513205340132e-05,"social_amenities":0.007514502853155136,"party_restriction":0.9963478446006775,"nearby_nightlife":0.9318675398826599}},{"text":"Find everything you need to cook delicious meals including cooking utensils, pots, pans, and dishware. A microwave and a coffee maker are provided. Directly off the kitchen is the den presenting a comfortable sofa, chairs, and smart TV perfect for all your streaming needs. Step out on the back terrace and follow the staircase down to the shared garden patio. The ample room allows you to spread out and enjoy beautiful Savannah mornings and evenings under the shade of live oak trees, cathedral spires, and high privacy walls. On the third level of the building find the two private bedrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002649411908350885,"social_amenities":0.008576878346502781,"party_restriction":0.0004337565624155104,"nearby_nightlife":0.020746799185872078}}]}}},{"listing_id":"658644911194583191","title":"Liberty Garden, Historic | Cozy | Free Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658644911194583191","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02575"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"658644911194583191","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f80c33522f24d648c786dc7af17b771e7a69a98839f54e96fce9eb5f75ee27d3","chunks":7,"words":653,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.21748006343841553,"party_welcome":0.000284438458038494,"social_amenities":0.21748006343841553,"party_restriction":0.9969015121459961,"nearby_nightlife":0.43457335233688354,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Directly off the kitchen, you have access to the fully enclosed garden patio. Featuring beautiful natural foliage, washed brick planters, and high walls, this private patio space is perfect for enjoying Savannah nights. Although a shared space with the unit above, this large patio provides ample room to spread out and enjoy the fresh air. From the patio, a rear exit door provides access to off-street parking and a Tesla charging station. SVR-02575 Guest access You may access the entire garden (ground) level apartment and the outdoor courtyard space underneath the stairs. The outdoor courtyard is the only shared space between you and the upper floor unit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000284438458038494,"social_amenities":0.21748006343841553,"party_restriction":0.0007509244605898857,"nearby_nightlife":0.07605788856744766}},{"text":"Underscoring Savannah\u2019s rich history, Liberty Garden is your traditional Savannah garden apartment. Featuring 1 bedroom with a king bed, and 1 bathroom, this first-floor apartment provides all the elegant touches that will transport you into Savannah\u2019s colonial past. Boasting a shared garden patio with seating and a firepit you will experience Savannah like a long-time local, taking in all the sights, sounds, and smells of the vibrant downtown filled with stories of the past. The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001277432165807113,"social_amenities":0.005062805488705635,"party_restriction":0.0008376134210266173,"nearby_nightlife":0.0056474595330655575}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Directly off the kitchen, you have access to the fully enclosed garden patio. Featuring beautiful natural foliage, washed brick planters, and high walls, this private patio space is perfect for enjoying Savannah nights. Although a shared space with the unit above, this large patio provides ample room to spread out and enjoy the fresh air. From the patio, a rear exit door provides access to off-street parking and a Tesla charging station. SVR-02575 Guest access You may access the entire garden (ground) level apartment and the outdoor courtyard space underneath the stairs. The outdoor courtyard is the only shared space between you and the upper floor unit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000284438458038494,"social_amenities":0.21748006343841553,"party_restriction":0.0007509244605898857,"nearby_nightlife":0.07605788856744766}},{"text":"Tucked in the lower level of a historic townhome built in 1868 for John Hernandez, the garden apartment features its own private entrance and all the amenities you need for a comfortable and tasteful stay in Savannah. Enter below the main townhome staircase and step into the small, yet spacious apartment. Walk through the foyer to a comfortable living space featuring an original masonry fireplace, custom built-ins, and original hardwood floors. We have a new pull-out couch for 2 as well. Just off the living space, find a small den with a designated workspace, along with high-speed Wi-Fi this apartment is perfect for the remote worker.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020563689759001136,"social_amenities":0.0009687822894193232,"party_restriction":0.00042319652857258916,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028373957611620426}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Directly off the kitchen, you have access to the fully enclosed garden patio. Featuring beautiful natural foliage, washed brick planters, and high walls, this private patio space is perfect for enjoying Savannah nights. Although a shared space with the unit above, this large patio provides ample room to spread out and enjoy the fresh air. From the patio, a rear exit door provides access to off-street parking and a Tesla charging station. SVR-02575 Guest access You may access the entire garden (ground) level apartment and the outdoor courtyard space underneath the stairs. The outdoor courtyard is the only shared space between you and the upper floor unit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000284438458038494,"social_amenities":0.21748006343841553,"party_restriction":0.0007509244605898857,"nearby_nightlife":0.07605788856744766}},{"text":"Underscoring Savannah\u2019s rich history, Liberty Garden is your traditional Savannah garden apartment. Featuring 1 bedroom with a king bed, and 1 bathroom, this first-floor apartment provides all the elegant touches that will transport you into Savannah\u2019s colonial past. Boasting a shared garden patio with seating and a firepit you will experience Savannah like a long-time local, taking in all the sights, sounds, and smells of the vibrant downtown filled with stories of the past. The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001277432165807113,"social_amenities":0.005062805488705635,"party_restriction":0.0008376134210266173,"nearby_nightlife":0.0056474595330655575}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The green dining set below the staircase is for your use - the larger black set is for the upstairs. Other things to note Absolutely no parties.