ebruary","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000489391852170229,"social_amenities":0.0016940523637458682,"party_restriction":0.0007080875802785158,"nearby_nightlife":0.07824082672595978}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 19017D","address":"312 E LIBERTY ST #A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"40034209","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/40034209","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00513"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"40034209","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"a6f476484c0c7225bc7d6c16cc042e0a85722c5354648e2d4bd26d3a3b0d6e03","chunks":11,"words":1056,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.16426211595535278,"party_welcome":0.988303005695343,"social_amenities":0.16426211595535278,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.9939290285110474,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"When you step outside our vacation rentals Savannah GA, you can generally just start walking to begin exploring the city. Going south from this property on Habersham will bring you to Troup Square. If you continue east and then south, you will come across the Beach Institute African-American Cultural Center, which is a great place to explore African-American history in Savannah. If you head west, you can find a few more squares like Lafayette and Madison, as well as the Andrew Low House. The space Nothing in Savannah is too far away when you stay in our Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014428861322812736,"social_amenities":0.16426211595535278,"party_restriction":0.0023737428709864616,"nearby_nightlife":0.043989308178424835}},{"text":"One bedroom, queen sized bed and Large Flatscreen TV with streaming capability One bath with soft comfy towels Flatscreen TV with cable in Living Room Free Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Walk everywhere Beautiful shared courtyard Drip coffee maker Toaster Oven Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00039254629518836737,"social_amenities":0.046199362725019455,"party_restriction":0.0011123811127617955,"nearby_nightlife":0.003597541945055127}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the River in July \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Make your Savannah vacation more exciting by booking one of our gorgeous vacation rentals Savannah GA. We have an incredible selection that is sure to fit your party and put you in the location you want. Find your favorite Savannah vacation rentals online or give us a call for more information. SVR-00513 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.988303005695343,"social_amenities":0.020583346486091614,"party_restriction":0.0027618270833045244,"nearby_nightlife":0.8307437896728516}},{"text":"The must-visit spot on Tybee Island, aside from the beautiful beaches, is the Tybee Lighthouse on the very north end. The lighthouse overlooks the port from the ocean to the Savannah River. If you're looking for extra things to do during your stay, consider coming around a holiday to take advantage of the many special events occurring in and around Savannah. Some examples are: \u2022 Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8077204823493958,"social_amenities":0.0038697400595992804,"party_restriction":0.0011279666796326637,"nearby_nightlife":0.9721077084541321}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"When you step outside our vacation rentals Savannah GA, you can generally just start walking to begin exploring the city. Going south from this property on Habersham will bring you to Troup Square. If you continue east and then south, you will come across the Beach Institute African-American Cultural Center, which is a great place to explore African-American history in Savannah. If you head west, you can find a few more squares like Lafayette and Madison, as well as the Andrew Low House. The space Nothing in Savannah is too far away when you stay in our Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014428861322812736,"social_amenities":0.16426211595535278,"party_restriction":0.0023737428709864616,"nearby_nightlife":0.043989308178424835}},{"text":"One bedroom, queen sized bed and Large Flatscreen TV with streaming capability One bath with soft comfy towels Flatscreen TV with cable in Living Room Free Wi-fi Central Heat & Air Walk everywhere Beautiful shared courtyard Drip coffee maker Toaster Oven Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00039254629518836737,"social_amenities":0.046199362725019455,"party_restriction":0.0011123811127617955,"nearby_nightlife":0.003597541945055127}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.0422353520989418,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0047673750668764114}},{"text":"\u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the River in July \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Make your Savannah vacation more exciting by booking one of our gorgeous vacation rentals Savannah GA. We have an incredible selection that is sure to fit your party and put you in the location you want. Find your favorite Savannah vacation rentals online or give us a call for more information. SVR-00513 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.988303005695343,"social_amenities":0.020583346486091614,"party_restriction":0.0027618270833045244,"nearby_nightlife":0.8307437896728516}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"At the north end of the historic district you'll find the River Street promenade along the Savannah River. Back in the late 1800s it was a major trade hub with cotton warehouses lining the street. In the present day, those warehouses have been replaced with a number of restaurants, shops and attractions. You'll find Emmet Park here, as well as the starting points for dolphin watching charters and riverboat tours. Go to the very heart of the historic district and you'll find the four blocks of City Market waiting for you with jazz clubs and open-air restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005024150479584932,"social_amenities":0.0009482051245868206,"party_restriction":0.0013530240394175053,"nearby_nightlife":0.9939290285110474}},{"text":"This market has a nostalgic air that captures the feel of Savannah's old open markets. City Market is also known as one of the best spots in the historic district for nightlife. Another option when you stay in Savannah vacation homes is to take a short drive east to visit Tybee Island. Everything slows down to island time when you're on this charming and picturesque island. You'll have the opportunity to lounge on Atlantic beaches, try some local seafood, or get active by biking around the island or renting watercraft equipment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010385796194896102,"social_amenities":0.0026123495772480965,"party_restriction":0.001316678710281849,"nearby_nightlife":0.9913073182106018}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 19017E","address":"312 E LIBERTY ST #H","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24020020706","date":"2024-01-20","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"310 E LIBERTY ST","recorded_pin":"20015 19016","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24351365731","date":"2024-12-16","type":"41-4 VEHICLE THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"310 E Liberty St","recorded_pin":"20015 19016","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"731768827034040943","title":"Bright Digs in Heart of City by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/731768827034040943","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00584"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"731768827034040943","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6986ac78294726a292cb34907ed8da787d31d082bbd0fa1b6a36218bd000196c","chunks":9,"words":762,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.19958536326885223,"party_welcome":0.020574262365698814,"social_amenities":0.19958536326885223,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9942904710769653,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Located on East Liberty Street, and shaded by beautiful, majestic Oak Trees, this 3 story brick residence was built in 1870 for Thomas Ballentyne. The space boasts with tall ceilings, amazing natural light, and an open floor plan - an entertainers dream! The space Located on East Liberty Street, and shaded by beautiful, majestic Oak Trees, this 3 story brick residence was built in 1870 for Thomas Ballentyne. Enriched in history, this building hosts some of the oldest apartments in the Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006073147989809513,"social_amenities":0.19958536326885223,"party_restriction":0.0019317017868161201,"nearby_nightlife":0.031992651522159576}},{"text":"Each room is fitted with a plush queen size bed, with crisp white linens, wireless chargers and an ample amount of storage for your belongings. The primary suite has its own private ensuite bathroom, that feature spa like amenities where you can soak or steam as long as you desire after a long day of adventure. The second full bathroom gleams with natural light and is located just off of the hall, easy for guests to access. Downstairs, the communal courtyard is a serene oasis where you can escape from your party, start your morning off with a cup of joe, or enjoy an afternoon read.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0055272202007472515,"social_amenities":0.004242290277034044,"party_restriction":0.00038492309977300465,"nearby_nightlife":0.3557353913784027}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Old America has been tastefully renovated to capture the essence of the historic architectural details, such as the original hardwood flooring, brick work, windows and so much more. Heading up to your airy digs, you'll find that the space boasts with tall ceilings, amazing natural light, and an open floor plan - an entertainers dream! Majority of the furnishings and decor pieces are vintage, dating as far back as the early 1800's, which is extremely fitting for this historic home. The gathering room boasts a 50\" Smart TV with netflix, surround sound and ability to play your favorite tunes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020574262365698814,"social_amenities":0.003848641412332654,"party_restriction":0.00013125137775205076,"nearby_nightlife":0.008281034417450428}},{"text":"Located on East Liberty Street, and shaded by beautiful, majestic Oak Trees, this 3 story brick residence was built in 1870 for Thomas Ballentyne. The space boasts with tall ceilings, amazing natural light, and an open floor plan - an entertainers dream! T