reet or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003615749010350555,"social_amenities":0.0046592410653829575,"party_restriction":0.00046303702401928604,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032123984419740736}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Modern + cozy ground-floor condo located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Perfect for guests with mobility concerns, this charming unit provides the ultimate blend of comfort, convenience, and Southern charm! The space Discover The Heidiway Hip Pad, a modern and cozy ground-floor apartment ideally located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Perfect for guests with mobility concerns or anyone who prefers to avoid stairs, this charming unit provides the ultimate blend of comfort, convenience, and Southern charm. Whether you're in town for a quick getaway or an extended stay, you\u2019ll love the unbeatable access to Savannah\u2019s most famous attractions, dining, and entertainment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.003630733583122492,"social_amenities":0.18508288264274597,"party_restriction":0.012986023910343647,"nearby_nightlife":0.9355922341346741}},{"text":"What Makes The Heidiway Hip Pad Special? - Unbeatable Walkable Location: Located just steps away from trolley tour stops, the DOT free shuttle bus, and some of the best dining and historic landmarks in Savannah, The Heidiway Hip Pad is your perfect home base. With everything from art galleries to scenic squares just minutes away, you'll be able to explore the city on foot, making it an ideal choice for tourists visiting the Savannah Historic District. - Comfortable and Modern Furnishings: Thoughtfully designed for travelers, this unit is equipped with everything you need for