downtown city district, this impressive two-bedroom apartment has everything you need for your Savannah vacation. Upon entering you'll immediately be greeted by original hardwood flooring, warm accents and tones, fitted with comfortable, rich furnishings. Seize the day away while relaxing on the plush white sofa, while you catch up on your favorite shows in the sun-filled living room, with beautiful views of the treelined street. The open floor plan creates an inviting environment, and makes entertaining a breeze.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.007250472437590361,"social_amenities":0.0019734154921025038,"party_restriction":0.0002088671608362347,"nearby_nightlife":0.4004742503166199}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"From the soaring high ceilings, floor to ceiling windows, rich textiles and fixtures, you'll never want to leave! Just a short stroll to Forsyth Park, and the bustling downtown city district, this impressive two-bedroom apartment has everything you need. The space If you're looking for the perfect getaway, Luxe on Liberty is an enchanting retreat for your party. Located on the second floor of a Historic townhome built in 1870, this bright and charmingly appointed apartment can accommodate up to four Lucky guests in Savannah\u2019s Historic District. From the soaring high ceilings, floor to ceiling windows, rich textiles and fixtures, you'll never want to leave!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9815334677696228,"social_amenities":0.0063134911470115185,"party_restriction":0.001141238957643509,"nearby_nightlife":0.14570605754852295}},{"text":"Just a short stroll to Forsyth Park, and the bustling downtown city district, this impressive two-bedroom apartment has everything you need for your Savannah vacation. Upon entering you'll immediately be greeted by original hardwood flooring, warm accents and tones, fitted with comfortable, rich furnishings. Seize the day away while relaxing 