it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004817861190531403,"social_amenities":0.0008471757755614817,"party_restriction":0.0009844767628237605,"nearby_nightlife":0.0344746969640255}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 27025","address":"116 W LIBERTY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"35464053","title":"Private Parking on Liberty St by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/35464053","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00705"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"35464053","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7b8737cddeb6e2b279fa28a86a026c237a8de454fade3c03a7a0f81e0c62bee9","chunks":7,"words":551,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.00326172704808414,"party_welcome":0.9694515466690063,"social_amenities":0.00326172704808414,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9914604425430298,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Located in the heart of Savannah's Downtown Historic District, you are an even distance from Forsyth Park and Broughton Street shopping. Take advantage of private parking, great location, and tons of Southern Charm at Liberty Blue! The space Located up the stairs on the fourth floor of this multiple unit town-home, Liberty Blue boasts with natural light, tree-lined views, and crisp furnishings. Up-to four Lucky guests can stay here without having to compromise location. Enter into your private foyer - a perfect place to stow your shoes, and umbrellas before heading upstairs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022474140860140324,"social_amenities":0.00326172704808414,"party_restriction":0.0005502336425706744,"nearby_nightlife":0.05653345212340355}},{"text":"Just a top of the stairs you will find that the space is filled with plenty of natural light, and offers a split living floor plan. The dining room table seats up to four guests, open to the living space and kitchen, which is great for entertaining. The kitchen has received a recent revamp, and boasts with crisp white cabinets. All of the modern conveniences one could wish for are included, which is ideal for short-term or extended stays! Also just off of the kitchen, you will find the charming bathroom with a walk-in shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9694515466690063,"social_amenities":0.0014093610225245357,"party_restriction":0.00015355537470895797,"nearby_nightlife":0.009840020909905434}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Just a top of the stairs you will find that the space is filled with plenty of natural light, and offers a split living floor plan. The dining room table seats up to four guests, open to the living space and kitchen, which is great for entertaining. The kitchen has received a recent revamp, and boasts with crisp white cabinets. All of the modern conveniences one could wish for are included, which is ideal for short-term or extended stays! Also just off of the kitchen, you will find the charming bathroom with a walk-in shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9694515466690063,"social_amenities":0.0014093610225245357,"party_restriction":0.00015355537470895797,"nearby_nightlife":0.009840020909905434}},{"text":"You\u2019ll be staying right next to many popular brunch spots! After breakfast, spend some time wandering around Colonial Park Cemetery, the final resting place of many of Savannah\u2019s earliest residents. City Market and River Street, hubs of Savannah\u2019s nightlife and entertainment, are both within an easy walking distance from this property. What is parking like for this home? Liberty Blue includes two tandem private parking spaces just behind the property. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Size Bed Bedroom 2: King Size Bed SVR-00705 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006426073960028589,"social_amenities":0.0010159686207771301,"party_restriction":0.0020483911503106356,"nearby_nightlife":0.9914604425430298}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Located in the heart of Savannah's Downtown Historic District, you are an even distance from Forsyth Park and Broughton Street shopping. Take advantage of private parking, great location, and tons of Southern Charm at Liberty Blue! The space Located up the stairs on the fourth floor of this multiple unit town-home, Liberty Blue boasts with natural light, tree-lined views, and crisp furnishings. Up-to four Lucky guests can stay here without having to compromise location. Enter into your private foyer - a perfect place to stow your shoes, and umbrellas before heading upstairs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022474140860140324,"social_amenities":0.00326172704808414,"party_restriction":0.0005502336425706744,"nearby_nightlife":0.05653345212340355}},{"text":"Just a top of the stairs you will find that the space is filled with plenty of natural light, and offers a split living floor plan. The dining room table seats up to four guests, open to the living space and kitchen, which is great for entertaining. The kitchen has received a recent revamp, and boasts with crisp white cabinets. All of the modern conveniences one could wish for are included, which is ideal for short-term or ext