922209084033966,"nearby_nightlife":0.9246739745140076,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time. Please also note that in Savannah, sugar ants can smell cookies, spilled sugar or syrup, or an open sugar container from a mile away and will find a way in through a windowsill or door frame. It can be somewhat like a cartoon picnic where they march in a line to find the food.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040189307765103877,"social_amenities":0.005158375017344952,"party_restriction":0.0003183135122526437,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023144567385315895}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010109493450727314,"social_amenities":0.00275963032618165,"party_restriction":0.0007063369848765433,"nearby_nightlife":0.001469682203605771}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Meters are best handled by downloading the ParkSavannah App to pay for numbered spaces by credit card. This is a truly historic building. Expect notable differences between modern properties and this apartment. This is about half of the hotel price within a block of the home. Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006605348899029195,"social_amenities":0.0017853020690381527,"party_restriction":0.014922209084033966,"nearby_nightlife":0.9246739745140076}},{"text":"If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time. Please also note that in Savannah, sugar ants can smell cookies, spilled sugar or syrup, or an open sugar container from a mile away and will find a way in through a windowsill or door frame. It can be somewhat like a cartoon picnic where they march in a line to find the food.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040189307765103877,"social_amenities":0.005158375017344952,"party_restriction":0.0003183135122526437,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023144567385315895}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time. Please also note that in Savannah, sugar ants can smell cookies, spilled sugar or syrup, or an open sugar container from a mile away and will find a way in through a windowsill or door frame. It can be somewhat like a cartoon picnic where they march in a line to find the food.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040189307765103877,"social_amenities":0.005158375017344952,"party_restriction":0.0003183135122526437,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023144567385315895}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010109493450727314,"social_amenities":0.00275963032618165,"party_restriction":0.0007063369848765433,"nearby_nightlife":0.001469682203605771}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Meters are best handled by downloading the ParkSavannah App to pay for numbered spaces by credit card. This is a truly historic building. Expect notable differences between modern properties and this apartment. This is about half of the hotel price within a block of the home. Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006605348899029195,"social_amenities":0.0017853020690381527,"party_restriction":0.014922209084033966,"nearby_nightlife":0.9246739745140076}},{"text":"We do not typically provide coffee but if you find coffee in the apartment please feel free to use it. You should bring or buy your own napkins, laundry detergent, your own beach towels and beach gear, and your own cooler if you need one. What we provide: We provide toilet paper (2 extras per bathroom), liquid hand washing dish soap, bathroom soap, sheets on each bed, and at least one bath towel for each guest. We do not permit our towels to be taken out of the house which is why you must bring your own towels if you visit the beach.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034445073106326163,"social_amenities":0.0019649690948426723,"party_restriction":0.0027388921007514,"nearby_nightlife":0.0025884208735078573}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Meters are best handled by downloading the ParkSavannah App to pay for numbered spaces by credit card. This is a truly historic building. Expect notable differences between modern properties and this apartment. This is about half of the hotel price within a block of the home. Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006605348899029195,"social_amenities":0.0017853020690381527,"party_restriction":0.014922209084033966,"nearby_nightlife":0.9246739745140076}},{"text":"This parlor level (2nd floor) apartment is in the center of Savannah's Landmark Historic District, on Abercorn just north of Liberty. This is right next to Colonial Park Cemetery which is a famous downtown landmark. One private parking spot in back! City of Savannah SVR-02455 The space This apartment is centrally located in the heart of the busy downtown Savannah historic district. The King bedroom windows face Colonial Park Cemetery. The living room has a pullout sofa. The bathroom is off the living room. There is a small equipped kitchen and a stacker washer and dryer. Guest access You get the entire apartment to yourself (kitchen, bathroom, living room, bedroom).","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010207865852862597,"social_amenities":0.00024014044902287424,"party_restriction":0.0003224386309739202,"nearby_nightlife":0.0055034407414495945}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 30015","address":"102 E LIBERTY ST #403","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1453075316037110634","title":"Luxury Downtown Retreat | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1453075316037110634","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03124"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1453075316037110634","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"017e34bb9abd495387316b0995e9cdeb5b762fad50648812e343b8937ac477fc","chunks":15,"words":1427,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9111654162406921,"party_welcome":0.00504015339538455,"social_amenities":0.9111654162406921,"party_restriction":0.11707460135221481,"nearby_nightlife":0.9953699707984924,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"With sleek cabinetry, modern appliances, and essential cookware, this kitchen is as functional as it is stylish. The adjacent dining table seats four, offering the ideal setting for a casual meal, a bottle of wine, or even a game night. The natural materials and warm tones of the space reflect the mid-century aesthetic while keeping the atmosphere relaxed and welcoming. Tranquil Bedroom with King Bed When it\u2019s time to rest and recharge, retreat to the serene bedroom at Liberty Mid-Century. A comfortable king-size bed takes center stage, featuring a high-quality mattress that promises a restful night\u2019s sleep.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018181398627348244,"social_amenities":0.9111654162406921,"party_restriction":0.11707460135221481,"nearby_nightlife":0.0045436955988407135}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Begin your day with a meticulously brewed latte from a local artisan caf\u00e9, meander through cobblestone streets framed by majestic live oaks draped in Spanish moss, and return each evening to the refined comfort of Liberty Mid-Century. Whether unwinding in style or venturing out to experience Savannah\u2019s vibrant nightlife and live music, every moment here exudes timeless Southern sophistication. Perfect for a romantic escape, a cultural retreat, or an elegant sojourn, Liberty Mid-Century offers a seamless fusion of mid-century modern design, luxurious amenities, and an unrivaled address in the heart of Savannah\u2019s captivating charm. Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living room with ample seating and a flatscreen TV","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00504015339538455,"social_amenities":0.00485990708693862,"party_restriction":0.0019266356248408556,"nearby_nightlife":0.9729819893836975}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"With sleek cabinetry, modern appliances, and essential cookware, this kitchen is as functional as it is stylish. The adjacent dining table seats four, offering the ideal setting for a casual meal, a bottle of wine, or even a game night. The natural materials and warm tones of the space reflect the mid-century aesthetic while keeping the atmosphere relaxed and welcoming. Tranquil Bedroom with King Bed When it\u2019s time to rest and recharge, retreat to the serene bedroom at Liberty Mid-Century. A comfortable king-size bed takes center stage, featuring a high-quality mattress that promises a restful night\u2019s sleep.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018181398627348244,"social_amenities":0.9111654162406921,"party_restriction":0.11707460135221481,"nearby_nightlife":0.0045436955988407135}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"With sleek cabinetry, modern appliances, and essential cookware, this kitchen is as functional as it is stylish. The adjacent dining table seats four, offering the ideal setting for a casual meal, a bottle of wine, or even a game night. The natural materials and warm tones of the space reflect the mid-century aesthetic while keeping the atmosphere relaxed and welcoming. Tranquil Bedroom with King Bed When it\u2019s time to rest and recharge, retreat to the serene bedroom at Liberty Mid-Century. A comfortable king-size bed takes center stage, featuring a high-quality mattress that promises a restful night\u2019s sleep.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018181398627348244,"social_amenities":0.9111654162406921,"party_restriction":0.11707460135221481,"nearby_nightlife":0.0045436955988407135}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"At ground level, indulge in a rejuvenating yoga and Pilates studio, savor exquisite craft cocktails and sophisticated late-night fare at Savoy Society, and explore a curated collection of boutique shops \u2014 all just steps from your door. Beyond the building, Savannah\u2019s most iconic treasures await. Stroll gracefully through the enchanting Forsyth Park, discover the elegance of historic squares, and immerse yourself in the city\u2019s rich heritage with nearby tours of stately homes and museums. The city\u2019s renowned arts scene, upscale shopping, and acclaimed dining establishments are all effortlessly accessible on foot.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017451189924031496,"social_amenities":0.012712995521724224,"party_restriction":0.0019102832302451134,"nearby_nightlife":0.9953699707984924}},{"text":"Begin your day with a meticulously brewed latte from a local artisan caf\u00e9, meander through cobblestone streets framed by majestic live oaks draped in Spanish moss, and return each evening to the refined comfort of Liberty Mid-Century. Whether unwinding in style or venturing out to experience Savannah\u2019s vibrant nightlife and live music, every moment here exudes timeless Southern sophistication. Perfect for a romantic escape, a cultural retreat, or an elegant sojourn, Liberty Mid-Century offers a seamless fusion of mid-century modern design, luxurious amenities, and an unrivaled address in the heart of Savannah\u2019s captivating charm. Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living room with ample seating and a flatscreen TV","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00504015339538455,"social_amenities":0.00485990708693862,"party_restriction":0.0019266356248408556,"nearby_nightlife":0.9729819893836975}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 30047","address":"102 E LIBERTY ST #502","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":6,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"47532302","title":"Heated Pool Access | Brand New Home!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47532302","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02248"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"47532302","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"fc31062fede332236ce4a9a27e8f7ad4e879effaffca9ccf654d1448cf28ede2","chunks":14,"words":1348,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5505620837211609,"party_welcome":0.07553710043430328,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.99146968126297,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Posh and memorable, Drayton Escape represents metropolitan living in the heart of Savannah. This is a sophisticated urban residence that pulls out all the stops for glamorous Southern living. It can comfortably accommodate up to four overnight guests within its 1,044 square feet of space. Guests enjoy a large bedroom and 1.5 bathrooms. This home is also perfect for a single occupant or couple. The unit can be reached by elevator. The space Drayton Escape A Polished Savannah Vacation Rental With a Great Location Step into a roomy, open-concept layout with a boho-chic living room made for relaxation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002576214901637286,"social_amenities":0.032815221697092056,"party_restriction":0.0016249307664111257,"nearby_nightlife":0.007399952504783869}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Guests planning longer stays at a Savannah vacation home rental can plan for excursions to Skidaway Island State Park, Old Fort Jackson and the Wormsloe Historic Site. Savannah is famed for its roadways lined in Southern oaks, ornate porches, stone fountains and charming trolleys. Weaving in and out of carefully manicured parks that abut Savannah neighborhoods to get from place to place is one of the best ways to enjoy the city. The Excitement Never Ends: Events to Attend While Staying at a Savannah Vacation Home Many visitors are drawn to Savannah throughout the year for its epic festivals and cultural events.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.07553710043430328,"social_amenities":0.005540164653211832,"party_restriction":0.0004312850069254637,"nearby_nightlife":0.5923280715942383}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Posh and memorable, Drayton Escape represents metropolitan living in the heart of Savannah. This is a sophisticated urban residence that pulls out all the stops for glamorous Southern living. It can comfortably accommodate up to four overnight guests within its 1,044 square feet of space. Guests enjoy a large bedroom and 1.5 bathrooms. This home is also perfect for a single occupant or couple. The unit can be reached by elevator. The space Drayton Escape A Polished Savannah Vacation Rental With a Great Location Step into a roomy, open-concept layout with a boho-chic living room made for relaxation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002576214901637286,"social_amenities":0.032815221697092056,"party_restriction":0.0016249307664111257,"nearby_nightlife":0.007399952504783869}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Topping the list of big draws are the Savannah Food and Wine Festival, the Savannah Jazz Festival, the Savannah Tour of Homes and Gardens, the Sidewalk Arts Festival, the River Street Fourth of July Celebration and the Savannah Film Festival. When you book Drayton Escape for an upcoming Savannah vacation, you're retreating to a beautiful apartment offering a touch of modern comfort in the heart of historic Savannah. This is a beautiful choice for anyone looking for a one-bedroom Savannah vacation rental with a contemporary, clean-slate aesthetic. With a full list of amenities, this home provides everything needed for a stay of any length. SVR-02248 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011168470373377204,"social_amenities":0.0035907418932765722,"party_restriction":0.002847992815077305,"nearby_nightlife":0.08632908016443253}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"It comes equipped with Wi-Fi, air conditioning, laundry and satellite/cable television. Guests booked at Drayton Escape enjoy access to our resort-style pool on Tybee Island. Beyond the Walls of Drayton Escape: Exploring Savannah This home's central location within Savannah opens up endless possibilities for exploration. Savannah is a city known for its walking tours. For visitors seeking adventure, that covers everything from after-dark pub crawls to haunted cemetery tours. Trolley tours that will take you to the best spots for shopping and dining also offer pleasant options for touring Savannah. A riverboat cruise is another option that opens up a new side of Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001926565309986472,"social_amenities":0.004736061207950115,"party_restriction":0.000867689901497215,"nearby_nightlife":0.99146968126297}},{"text":"First on any itinerary should be the Savannah Historic District. Peppered with historic homes and buildings, this is the best area for admiring the architecture. A complete tour of Savannah is never finished without stops at Bonaventure Cemetery, Forsyth Park, the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, Chippewa Square, Colonial Park Cemetery, the American Prohibition Museum, the Ships of the Sea Maritime Museum and the Mercer Williams House. When looking for the best pedestrian spot in Savannah, find your way to City Market to shop and dine among cobbled walkways full of artsy, urban energy. For live music and dining with river views, River Street is the place!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008007308351807296,"social_amenities":0.0009257587953470647,"party_restriction":0.0008385793189518154,"nearby_nightlife":0.9767320156097412}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 30049","address":"102 E LIBERTY ST #504","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":6,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1356736142933832517","title":"Modern Loft w/ Soaring Views of City + Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1356736142933832517","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03082"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1356736142933832517","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3e44a53c72fdd5c6e41d25bae3d5308d18247558586d5acabce8e218afc4e058","chunks":8,"words":825,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.01915733888745308,"party_welcome":0.0042624445632100105,"social_amenities":0.023354370146989822,"party_restriction":0.0028405520133674145,"nearby_nightlife":0.9965601563453674,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"In the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests a The space Located in an historic high-rise in the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a newly renovated, stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests and includes secure Wi-Fi, heat/AC, a washer/dryer, and cable TV. What Makes The Lollygag Special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010899095796048641,"social_amenities":0.01915733888745308,"party_restriction":0.0028405520133674145,"nearby_nightlife":0.0172581784427166}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV with standard cable Exercise equipment Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021840691624674946,"social_amenities":0.003900660201907158,"party_restriction":0.0002750831190496683,"nearby_nightlife":0.00045309108099900186}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Immerse yourself in Savannah\u2019s rich history by joining a walking, pub, food, ghost, or historical tour\u2014each offering a unique perspective on the city\u2019s past and culture. We highly recommend starting with a historic district tour to gain a deeper appreciation of how Savannah became one of the South\u2019s most beautiful and unforgettable cities. *This vibrant downtown location offers an authentic urban experience, where guests may hear typical city sounds such as early morning trash collection or the buzz of nightlife. To ensure a restful stay, earplugs and eye masks are thoughtfully provided in the bedroom.* Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Adjustable Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0042624445632100105,"social_amenities":0.0010812397813424468,"party_restriction":0.0011945877922698855,"nearby_nightlife":0.9965601563453674}},{"text":"In the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests a The space Located in an historic high-rise in the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a newly renovated, stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests and includes secure Wi-Fi, heat/AC, a washer/dryer, and cable TV. What Makes The Lollygag Special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010899095796048641,"social_amenities":0.01915733888745308,"party_restriction":0.0028405520133674145,"nearby_nightlife":0.0172581784427166}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For cocktail enthusiasts, the dining area includes a drinks cupboard with barware and a Vita-Mix blender to craft the perfect drink. Coffee lovers will appreciate the Cuisinart coffee maker with local Savannah Roasters coffee provided. The bedroom offers a Queen adjustable bed, blackout shades, smart TV, bedside charging stations, oversized walk-in closet with a hotel safe, luggage racks, iron, steamer & drying rack. Professionally cleaned linens provided. The ensuite bathroom offers a luxurious experience with a large shower room featuring a Victorian clawfoot tub, a teak shower seat, and a double vanity with LED-lit mirrors. Natural light filters in through high-set windows, creating a relaxing atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002579820284154266,"social_amenities":0.023354370146989822,"party_restriction":0.0009646523394621909,"nearby_nightlife":0.9257820844650269}},{"text":"In the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests a The space Located in an historic high-rise in the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a newly renovated, stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests and includes secure Wi-Fi, heat/AC, a washer/dryer, and cable TV. What Makes The Lollygag Special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010899095796048641,"social_amenities":0.01915733888745308,"party_restriction":0.0028405520133674145,"nearby_nightlife":0.0172581784427166}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"In the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests a The space Located in an historic high-rise in the heart of Savannah, The Lollygag is a newly renovated, stunning 1,250 sq. ft. corner loft designed for modern comfort and convenience. With oversized windows offering panoramic city views, this bright and airy retreat accommodates 2-4 guests and includes secure Wi-Fi, heat/AC, a washer/dryer, and cable TV. What Makes The Lollygag Special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010899095796048641,"social_amenities":0.01915733888745308,"party_restriction":0.0028405520133674145,"nearby_nightlife":0.0172581784427166}},{"text":"- Prime Location \u2013 Step outside to Savannah\u2019s top restaurants, cocktail bars, and nightlife. The FREE dot express shuttle and Savannah Trolley Tours stop just around the corner! - Exclusive Parking \u2013 A rare find! Guests receive a reserved underground parking space with 24-hour access, just steps from the building. - Modern Luxury & Security \u2013 Enjoy elevator access and secure entry via key fob for a stress-free stay. The chef\u2019s galley kitchen is fully equipped with an oven, microwave, refrigerator, dishwasher, Cuisinart cookware, and a Brita water filter. Guests can enjoy meals at the marble-topped dining table for four, perfectly positioned to take in Savannah\u2019s stunning sunsets.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","