vannah's beauty. Located in the heart of everything, enjoy spacious living, convenient parking in a nearby garage, and easy walks to the city's attractions! Your ideal retreat awaits, where history meets contemporary luxury! SVR 02732 The space This one-bedroom, one-and-a-half-bathroom condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002828408614732325,"social_amenities":0.9930102229118347,"party_restriction":0.005788574460893869,"nearby_nightlife":0.004746975377202034}},{"text":"Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012715364573523402,"social_amenities":0.007253425195813179,"party_restriction":0.0035238987766206264,"nearby_nightlife":0.018700845539569855}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Retreat to a spacious bedroom featuring a king-sized bed made up with fresh, crisp white linens. The living room is the perfect space to sit back, relax, and gather! Have an extra guest with you? No problem! The queen-sized pull-out sofa, ensures that everyone will have a comfy space to unwind at the end of the day! Stay connected with fast WiFi and enjoy entertainment on flat-screen Smart TVs in both the living room and bedroom. The kitchen is fully stocked with all the amenities and is meticulously renovated, to ensure you have all the modern conveniences of home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006175903603434563,"social_amenities":0.0024105189368128777,"party_restriction":0.0004983140388503671,"nearby_nightlife":0.010664437897503376}},{"text":"Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat! Or take a stroll down Liberty St, the live-oak lined avenue that oozes Southern ambiance and gives you the perfect jumping off spot to enjoy the city! Situated on the second floor, our condo offers a shared laundry room in the downstairs foyer for your convenience. A parking space in a nearby garage is included, making your stay hassle-free.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018761801766231656,"social_amenities":0.004203038290143013,"party_restriction":0.0022157770581543446,"nearby_nightlife":0.9783762693405151}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Experience the charm of historic Savannah from this stylish 1BR, 1.5BA condo in the heart of downtown! Modern interior, a full kitchen with dining, and a cozy pull-out sofa ensure comfort. The condo overlooks a picturesque live oak-lined street, immersing you in Savannah's beauty. Located in the heart of everything, enjoy spacious living, convenient parking in a nearby garage, and easy walks to the city's attractions! Your ideal retreat awaits, where history meets contemporary luxury! SVR 02732 The space This one-bedroom, one-and-a-half-bathroom condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002828408614732325,"social_amenities":0.9930102229118347,"party_restriction":0.005788574460893869,"nearby_nightlife":0.004746975377202034}},{"text":"Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012715364573523402,"social_amenities":0.007253425195813179,"party_restriction":0.0035238987766206264,"nearby_nightlife":0.018700845539569855}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Experience the charm of historic Savannah from this stylish 1BR, 1.5BA condo in the heart of downtown! Modern interior, a full kitchen with dining, and a cozy pull-out sofa ensure comfort. The condo overlooks a picturesque live oak-lined street, immersing you in Savannah's beauty. Located in the heart of everything, enjoy spacious living, convenient parking in a nearby garage, and easy walks to the city's attractions! Your ideal retreat awaits, where history meets contemporary luxury! SVR 02732 The space This one-bedroom, one-and-a-half-bathroom condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002828408614732325,"social_amenities":0.9930102229118347,"party_restriction":0.005788574460893869,"nearby_nightlife":0.004746975377202034}},{"text":"Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012715364573523402,"social_amenities":0.007253425195813179,"party_restriction":0.0035238987766206264,"nearby_nightlife":0.018700845539569855}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat! Or take a stroll down Liberty St, the live-oak lined avenue that oozes Southern ambiance and gives you the perfect jumping off spot to enjoy the city! Situated on the second floor, our condo offers a shared laundry room in the downstairs foyer for your convenience. A parking space in a nearby garage is included, making your stay hassle-free.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018761801766231656,"social_amenities":0.004203038290143013,"party_restriction":0.0022157770581543446,"nearby_nightlife":0.9783762693405151}},{"text":"Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012715364573523402,"social_amenities":0.007253425195813179,"party_restriction":0.0035238987766206264,"nearby_nightlife":0.018700845539569855}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1074018054839976789","title":"Historic District Perch with Cathedral Views!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1074018054839976789","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02733"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1074018054839976789","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"127430c4af6b49cd30c9454bb2955c6fff71a3612a894fee1191f4bcb635a687","chunks":7,"words":667,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.4893729090690613,"party_welcome":0.0032086921855807304,"social_amenities":0.4893729090690613,"party_restriction":0.0029644800815731287,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872649908065796,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"History meets comfort in our 2BR, 1BA Historic District condo! This corner unit is in the heart of downtown with a stunning view of St. John the Baptist Cathedral. Our designer was meticulous in preserving historic details like the heart pine floors and brick walls while updating the space for today's travelers. You'll be torn between relaxing in style and diving into everything the city has to offer right outside the door. Coveted garage parking space is free with the space too! SVR 02733 The space This two-bedroom, one bath condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025621350505389273,"social_amenities":0.4893729090690613,"party_restriction":0.0029644800815731287,"nearby_nightlife":0.015489310026168823}},{"text":"Retreat to the spacious bedrooms featuring a king-sized bed made up with fresh, crisp white linens. The living room is the perfect space to sit back, relax, and gather! Stay connected with fast WiFi and enjoy entertainment on flat-screen Smart TVs. The kitchen is fully stocked with all the amenities and is meticulously renovated, to ensure you have all the modern conveniences of home. Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0032086921855807304,"social_amenities":0.01714593544602394,"party_restriction":0.0008959075785242021,"nearby_nightlife":0.07194653153419495}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Retreat to the spacious bedrooms featuring a king-sized bed made up with fresh, crisp white linens. The living room is the perfect space to sit back, relax, and gather! Stay connected with fast WiFi and enjoy entertainment on flat-screen Smart TVs. The kitchen is fully stocked with all the amenities and is meticulously renovated, to ensure you have all the modern conveniences of home. Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0032086921855807304,"social_amenities":0.01714593544602394,"party_restriction":0.0008959075785242021,"nearby_nightlife":0.07194653153419495}},{"text":"This is not just accommodation; it's an invitation to experience the perfect blend of comfort, charm, and spacious living in a city steeped in history. Guest access The entire third floor condo is all yours! While this condo is entirely separate from the second floor condo (there are no shared spaces, except the laundry room, which is located on the first floor, in the foyer area) we do always like to make guests aware that other guests will likely be staying in the unit below you as well. Please be a considerate upstairs neighbor! Other things to note Parking Garage clearance is 6' 9\"! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015605207299813628,"social_amenities":0.0016560591757297516,"party_restriction":0.0016699351835995913,"nearby_nightlife":0.002683794591575861}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"History meets comfort in our 2BR, 1BA Historic District condo! This corner unit is in the heart of downtown with a stunning view of St. John the Baptist Cathedral. Our designer was meticulous in preserving historic details like the heart pine floors and brick walls while updating the space for today's travelers. You'll be torn between relaxing in style and diving into everything the city has to offer right outside the door. Coveted garage parking space is free with the space too! SVR 02733 The space This two-bedroom, one bath condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025621350505389273,"social_amenities":0.4893729090690613,"party_restriction":0.0029644800815731287,"nearby_nightlife":0.015489310026168823}},{"text":"Retreat to the spacious bedrooms featuring a king-sized bed made up with fresh, crisp white linens. The living room is the perfect space to sit back, relax, and gather! Stay connected with fast WiFi and enjoy entertainment on flat-screen Smart TVs. The kitchen is fully stocked with all the amenities and is meticulously renovated, to ensure you have all the modern conveniences of home. Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0032086921855807304,"social_amenities":0.01714593544602394,"party_restriction":0.0008959075785242021,"nearby_nightlife":0.07194653153419495}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"History meets comfort in our 2BR, 1BA Historic District condo! This corner unit is in the heart of downtown with a stunning view of St. John the Baptist Cathedral. Our designer was meticulous in preserving historic details like the heart pine floors and brick walls while updating the space for today's travelers. You'll be torn between relaxing in style and diving into everything the city has to offer right outside the door. Coveted garage parking space is free with the space too! SVR 02733 The space This two-bedroom, one bath condo in the heart of downtown truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where historic, Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025621350505389273,"social_amenities":0.4893729090690613,"party_restriction":0.0029644800815731287,"nearby_nightlife":0.015489310026168823}},{"text":"Or take a stroll down Liberty St, the live-oak lined avenue that oozes Southern ambiance and gives you the perfect jumping off spot to enjoy the city! Situated on the third floor, our condo offers a shared laundry room in the downstairs foyer for your convenience. A parking space in a nearby garage is included, making your stay hassle-free. We are perched right above Belem de la Cruz, the most delicious empanada spot, and in the same building as Littles on Liberty, the oh-so-famous (and incredibly adorable!) children's boutique! Revel in the unbeatable location, surrounded by the vibrant energy of downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011567655019462109,"social_amenities":0.005324595607817173,"party_restriction":0.0026696091517806053,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872649908065796}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Or take a stroll down Liberty St, the live-oak lined avenue that oozes Southern ambiance and gives you the perfect jumping off spot to enjoy the city! Situated on the third floor, our condo offers a shared laundry room in the downstairs foyer for your convenience. A parking space in a nearby garage is included, making your stay hassle-free. We are perched right above Belem de la Cruz, the most delicious empanada spot, and in the same building as Littles on Liberty, the oh-so-famous (and incredibly adorable!) children's boutique! Revel in the unbeatable location, surrounded by the vibrant energy of downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011567655019462109,"social_amenities":0.005324595607817173,"party_restriction":0.0026696091517806053,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872649908065796}},{"text":"Retreat to the spacious bedrooms featuring a king-sized bed made up with fresh, crisp white linens. The living room is the perfect space to sit back, relax, and gather! Stay connected with fast WiFi and enjoy entertainment on flat-screen Smart TVs. The kitchen is fully stocked with all the amenities and is meticulously renovated, to ensure you have all the modern conveniences of home. Brew up a fresh cup of coffee (or pour yourself a glass of wine after a long day of exploring) and step out to the small balcony, overlooking the most gorgeous view of the famous Cathedral of St. John the Baptist...an architectural treat!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0032086921855807304,"social_amenities":0.01714593544602394,"party_restriction":0.0008959075785242021,"nearby_nightlife":0.07194653153419495}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 33010C","address":"110 E HARRIS ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":10,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":15,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24084088877","date":"2024-03-24","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"110 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010C","side":"direct"},{"number":"24127133879","date":"2024-05-06","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"110 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010C","side":"direct"},{"number":"26122125615","date":"2026-05-02","type":"24 PAST TRESPASSING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"110 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010C","side":"direct"},{"number":"26126130487","date":"2026-05-06","type":"OPEN DOOR","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"110 E HARRIS ST","recorded_pin":"20015 33010C","side":"direct"},{"number":"26171176970","date":"2026-06-20","type":"29 OTHER NOISE COMPLAINT","outcome":"Noise complaints","recorded_address":"110 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010C","side":"direct"},{"number":"24127133923","date":"2024-05-06","type":"1-4 ASSAULT WPN","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"108 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010B","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24321335694","date":"2024-11-16","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"108 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010B","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25341346308","date":"2025-12-07","type":"31 URGENT CHECK-THE-WELFARE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26022020571","date":"2026-01-22","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26022020599","date":"2026-01-22","type":"911 Hang Up","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E HARRIS ST","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26022020622","date":"2026-01-22","type":"911 Hang Up","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26125129256","date":"2026-05-05","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26125129273","date":"2026-05-05","type":"70 CHECK BUILDING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E HARRIS ST","recorded_pin":"20015 33010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26225234493","date":"2026-08-13","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"106 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33011","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26269279355","date":"2026-09-26","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"106 E Harris St","recorded_pin":"20015 33011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1650888127472018991","title":"Luxury Savannah Retreat | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1650888127472018991","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-03166"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1650888127472018991","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bda6bbdc35acc6e63534bed2d1aaa85fc95a864cf924b106024618ae98507ae9","chunks":20,"words":1885,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.900754451751709,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9978522062301636,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"With a comfortable lounge area and a grill for preparing meals, this outdoor sanctuary is designed for connection, relaxation, and memorable evenings that feel worlds away from downtown, yet you\u2019re right in the middle of it. Inside, the home continues to impress with a seamless flow and beautifully curated interiors that honor its historic roots while embracing a sophisticated, modern aesthetic. The main living space is designed for both comfort and conversation, effortlessly connecting the dining area, living room, and additional sitting spaces. The dining area offers seating for four, perfect for shared meals or a casual breakfast before heading out to explore the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025435033603571355,"social_amenities":0.34249061346054077,"party_restriction":0.0003233464667573571,"nearby_nightlife":0.025761816650629044}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Sorrel Weed House and Savannah Theatre are also just moments away, offering a glimpse into the city\u2019s rich history and vibrant culture. When it comes to dining and nightlife, you\u2019ll be spoiled for choice. Enjoy a relaxed brunch at J. Christopher\u2019s, savor elevated cuisine at The Public or Emporium, or grab a quick and flavorful bite from Zunzi\u2019s. In the evenings, head to Peregrin for rooftop cocktails with sweeping views, experience the refined ambiance of Artillery Bar, or enjoy a laid-back night at local favorites like Pinkie Masters or McDonough\u2019s Lounge.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.900754451751709,"social_amenities":0.002530519152060151,"party_restriction":0.0029297044966369867,"nearby_nightlife":0.9978522062301636}},{"text":"For coffee and lighter fare, nearby caf\u00e9s like Mirabelle, Gryphon Tea Room, and Gallery Espresso provide charming spots to start your day or take a midday break. Whether you\u2019re visiting Savannah for a weekend getaway, a special celebration, or an extended stay, The Stables offers an experience that is truly unmatched. It\u2019s a place where history and luxury coexist effortlessly, where every detail has been thoughtfully considered, and where the beauty of the surroundings invites you to slow down and savor each moment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.019677791744470596,"social_amenities":0.004548766650259495,"party_restriction":0.0009256529156118631,"nearby_nightlife":0.9822896122932434}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Step into The Stables, a beautifully reimagined historic retreat in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Blending old-world charm with modern comfort, this thoughtfully designed home features inviting living spaces, a private outdoor courtyard with a firepit and fountain, and garage parking. Walk to top landmarks, dining, and shops, then unwind in a peaceful, refined setting. The space Welcome to The Stables, a truly one-of-a-kind luxury retreat tucked away in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Once home to working stables, this thoughtfully transformed residence blends rich history with refined design, offering a timeless escape just steps from Lafayette Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014891941100358963,"social_amenities":0.3711986541748047,"party_restriction":0.0019544519018381834,"nearby_nightlife":0.8232131600379944}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-03166 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.529392653144896e-05,"social_amenities":0.0033580719027668238,"party_restriction":0.0031675202772021294,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011193878017365932}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The Sorrel Weed House and Savannah Theatre are also just moments away, offering a glimpse into the city\u2019s rich history and vibrant culture. When it comes to dining and nightlife, you\u2019ll be spoiled for choice. Enjoy a relaxed brunch at J. Christopher\u2019s, savor elevated cuisine at The Public or Emporium, or grab a quick and flavorful bite from Zunzi\u2019s. In the evenings, head to Peregrin for rooftop cocktails with sweeping views, experience the refined ambiance of Artillery Bar, or enjoy a laid-back night at local favorites like Pinkie Masters or McDonough\u2019s Lounge.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.900754451751709,"social_amenities":0.002530519152060151,"party_restriction":0.0029297044966369867,"nearby_nightlife":0.9978522062301636}},{"text":"For coffee and lighter fare, nearby caf\u00e9s like Mirabelle, Gryphon Tea Room, and Gallery Espresso provide charming spots to start your day or take a midday break. Whether you\u2019re visiting Savannah for a weekend getaway, a special celebration, or an extended stay, The Stables offers an experience that is truly unmatched. It\u2019s a place where history and luxury coexist effortlessly, where every detail has been thoughtfully considered, and where the beauty of the surroundings invites you to slow down and savor each moment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.019677791744470596,"social_amenities":0.004548766650259495,"party_restriction":0.0009256529156118631,"nearby_nightlife":0.9822896122932434}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 35006","address":"12 W HARRIS ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":20.0,"advertised_guests":16.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud par