ouse offers an unforgettable stay in one of the city's most desirable locations. From its historic setting overlooking Madison Square to its inviting interiors and walkable location, this private carriage house provides the perfect home base for experiencing the very best of Savannah. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019933118019253016,"social_amenities":0.003729290561750531,"party_restriction":0.0034664070699363947,"nearby_nightlife":0.08165295422077179}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Elsewhere on Madison Square Carriage House is a private and beautifully restored Savannah retreat overlooking historic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. The space Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Carriage House, a private and beautifully restored Savannah retreat overlooking historic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. Perfect for couples, small families, wedding guests, business travelers, or extended stays, this charming carriage house offers the ideal blend of historic character, modern comfort, and one of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after locations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005992047488689423,"social_amenities":0.9011035561561584,"party_restriction":0.04243491217494011,"nearby_nightlife":0.0027487261686474085}},{"text":"Just steps from Forsyth Park, award-winning restaurants, boutique shopping, museums, and Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, you'll enjoy the convenience of being able to explore much of the city on foot while returning home to your own peaceful retreat. Inside, a relaxed and welcoming atmosphere unfolds across two thoughtfully designed levels. Warm lighting, comfortable furnishings, and timeless details create a space that feels both inviting and serene. Historic charm pairs beautifully with modern amenities, offering guests the perfect place to unwind after a day spent discovering Savannah. A vintage-style interior staircase leads to the upper level, where the main living area serves as the heart of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.514734119875357e-05,"social_amenities":0.010529751889407635,"party_restriction":0.0010185684077441692,"nearby_nightlife":0.9019879698753357}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Elsewhere on Madison Square Carriage House is a private and beautifully restored Savannah retreat overlooking historic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. The space Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Carriage House, a private and beautifully restored Savannah retreat overlooking historic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. Perfect for couples, small families, wedding guests, business travelers, or extended stays, this charming carriage house offers the ideal blend of historic character, modern comfort, and one of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after locations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005992047488689423,"social_amenities":0.9011035561561584,"party_restriction":0.04243491217494011,"nearby_nightlife":0.0027487261686474085}},{"text":"Whether you're visiting for a romantic getaway, wedding weekend, anniversary celebration, remote work stay, or simply to experience Savannah's historic charm, Elsewhere on Madison Square Carriage House offers an unforgettable stay in one of the city's most desirable locations. From its historic setting overlooking Madison Square to its inviting interiors and walkable location, this private carriage house provides the perfect home base for experiencing the very best of Savannah. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019933118019253016,"social_amenities":0.003729290561750531,"party_restriction":0.0034664070699363947,"nearby_nightlife":0.08165295422077179}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Just steps from Forsyth Park, award-winning restaurants, boutique shopping, museums, and Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, you'll enjoy the convenience of being able to explore much of the city on foot while returning home to your own peaceful retreat. Inside, a relaxed and welcoming atmosphere unfolds across two thoughtfully designed levels. Warm lighting, comfortable furnishings, and timeless details create a space that feels both inviting and serene. Historic charm pairs beautifully with modern amenities, offering guests the perfect place to unwind after a day spent discovering Savannah. A vintage-style interior staircase leads to the upper level, where the main living area serves as the heart of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.514734119875357e-05,"social_amenities":0.010529751889407635,"party_restriction":0.0010185684077441692,"nearby_nightlife":0.9019879698753357}},{"text":"Please note that the staircase is steep and narrow and may not be suitable for all guests. Upstairs, modern luxury touches blend seamlessly with classic Savannah character. A comfortable living room, thoughtfully selected furnishings, and abundant natural light create an ideal space for relaxing, reconnecting, or planning the next day's adventures. The carriage house also features a fully equipped kitchen, making it easy to prepare everything from a quick breakfast before exploring the Historic District to a quiet dinner at home after an evening out in Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005455529317259789,"social_amenities":0.0025298884138464928,"party_restriction":0.0008298603934235871,"nearby_nightlife":0.08379379659891129}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1706123289137812888","title":"Grand Savannah Estate on Madison Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1706123289137812888","guests":16.0,"permits":["SVR-00813","SVR-00814","SVR-00874"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1706123289137812888","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e78fb89218fec0d1c0aa1338392e51717419ad89ffc17c06cc40e249db5cb55d","chunks":6,"words":571,"party_signal":0.9852744340896606,"social_signal":0.9101108312606812,"party_welcome":0.9955236911773682,"social_amenities":0.9101108312606812,"party_restriction":0.010865460149943829,"nearby_nightlife":0.22979450225830078,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Perfect for groups of up to 16 guests, Elsewhere on Madison Estate offers exclusive access to the main residence, garden apartment, and private carriage house \u2014 providing multiple gathering spaces and private retreats ideal for bridal parties, reunion weekends, and multi-family vacations. Inside the beautifully preserved main home, guests are welcomed by soaring ceilings, hardwood floors, ornate fireplaces, elegant chandeliers, and timeless historic details throughout. The spacious layout includes four full bedrooms, one partial bedroom, four full bathrooms, a large chef\u2019s kitchen with modern appliances, and an additional third-floor suite complete with its own living space, dining area, and secondary kitchen for added convenience and flexibility.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9852744340896606,"social_amenities":0.0031446947250515223,"party_restriction":0.00026140184490941465,"nearby_nightlife":0.02314465306699276},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Perfect for groups of up to 16 guests, Elsewhere on Madison Estate offers exclusive access to the main residence, garden apartment, and private carriage house \u2014 providing multiple gathering spaces and private retreats ideal for bridal parties, reunion weekends, and multi-family vacations."},{"text":"The private garden apartment comfortably sleeps four guests and includes a queen bedroom, two full bathrooms, and a partial bedroom with a Murphy bed \u2014 ideal for guests seeking additional privacy while remaining connected to the group. Outside, enjoy Savannah living at its finest in the secluded brick courtyard featuring a built-in grilling station and outdoor dining area perfect for evening gatherings, celebratory dinners, or relaxing after a day exploring the Historic District. The estate also includes a charming private carriage house with a full kitchen and two stories of inviting living space. Warm lighting, earthy tones, and comfortable furnishings create a relaxed atmosphere perfect for unwinding.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8838778734207153,"social_amenities":0.3843134641647339,"party_restriction":0.00025980916689150035,"nearby_nightlife":0.06438054144382477},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Outside, enjoy Savannah living at its finest in the secluded brick courtyard featuring a built-in grilling station and outdoor dining area perfect for evening gatherings, celebratory dinners, or relaxing after a day exploring the Historic District."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience timeless Southern elegance at Elsewhere on Madison Estate, a luxury Savannah vacation rental designed for wedding parties, family gatherings, corporate retreats, and large group getaways. The space Experience timeless Southern elegance at Elsewhere on Madison Estate, a luxury Savannah vacation rental designed for wedding parties, family gatherings, corporate retreats, and large group getaways in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Just steps from the city\u2019s iconic squares, celebrated restaurants, boutique shopping, and historic attractions, this expansive estate blends classic Savannah charm with upscale modern comfort for an unforgettable stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores