 location, comfort, and historic Southern charm. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Flex Room: Queen Murphy Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.017259102314710617,"social_amenities":0.01176616083830595,"party_restriction":0.007550095207989216,"nearby_nightlife":0.2709539830684662}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Nestled beneath the grand main residence, this private Savannah hideaway places you steps from Madison Square, Forsyth Park, renowned restaurants, boutique shopping, museums, and the city's most iconic attractions. Whether you're visiting for a romantic getaway, wedding weekend, or an immersive Savannah experience, you'll find yourself in the center of it all. Inside, guests are welcomed by warm interiors, elegant furnishings, and thoughtful touches that create a relaxed yet refined atmosphere. Historic charm blends seamlessly with modern conveniences, offering a comfortable space to unwind after a day exploring Savannah's cobblestone streets and picturesque squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012543125776574016,"social_amenities":0.003059682436287403,"party_restriction":0.0003145704686176032,"nearby_nightlife":0.8676378130912781}},{"text":"Madison Square sits just beyond your doorstep, offering scenic green spaces, historic monuments, and easy access to the city's most celebrated landmarks. Whether you're attending a wedding, celebrating a special occasion, working remotely, or simply escaping for a few days in Savannah, Elsewhere on Madison Square Garden offers the perfect combination of location, comfort, and historic Southern charm. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Flex Room: Queen Murphy Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.017259102314710617,"social_amenities":0.01176616083830595,"party_restriction":0.007550095207989216,"nearby_nightlife":0.2709539830684662}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1706127560619267984","title":"Elegant Historic Mansion Overlooking Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1706127560619267984","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-00814"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1706127560619267984","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"9ce37a99746cab279ce50b41709cd96ba5445d22d27b37fe106c76d597d6b412","chunks":7,"words":595,"party_signal":0.9852582812309265,"social_signal":0.15583205223083496,"party_welcome":0.9965301156044006,"social_amenities":0.9481162428855896,"party_restriction":0.0028959407936781645,"nearby_nightlife":0.954439640045166,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Complete with a built-in grilling station and outdoor dining area, this secluded outdoor space is ideal for evening gatherings, celebratory dinners, or simply unwinding beneath the glow of Savannah\u2019s historic ambiance. Whether you\u2019re planning a Savannah wedding weekend, bachelorette celebration, holiday gathering, or luxury Historic District getaway, Elsewhere on Madison Square Main offers an unforgettable stay filled with elegance, comfort, and unbeatable location. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Flex Room: 2 Twin Day Beds What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9852582812309265,"social_amenities":0.003591591725125909,"party_restriction":0.0009612221620045602,"nearby_nightlife":0.025028115138411522},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Complete with a built-in grilling station and outdoor dining area, this secluded outdoor space is ideal for evening gatherings, celebratory dinners, or simply unwinding beneath the glow of Savannah\u2019s historic ambiance."},{"text":"Perfect for groups of up to 10 guests, this expansive three-story residence offers elegant gathering spaces, multiple living areas, and thoughtfully designed accommodations ideal for spending quality time together while still enjoying privacy and room to spread out. Inside, guests are welcomed by soaring ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors, ornate fireplaces, elegant chandeliers, and historic architectural details that capture the essence of old Savannah. Rich textures, classic furnishings, and abundant natural light create an atmosphere that feels both sophisticated and inviting. The home features four full bedrooms, one partial bedroom, and four full bathrooms spread across multiple levels.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.2503446936607361,"social_amenities":0.15583205223083496,"party_restriction":0.00031986707472242415,"nearby_nightlife":0.004732816014438868},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Perfect for groups of up to 10 guests, this expansive three-story residence offers elegant gathering spaces, multiple living areas, and thoughtfully designed accommodations ideal for spending quality time together while still enjoying privacy and room to spread out."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Perfect for groups of up to 10 guests, this expansive three-story residence offers elegant gathering spaces, multiple living areas, and thoughtfully designed accommodations ideal for spending quality time together while still enjoying privacy and room to spread out. Inside, guests are welcomed by soaring ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors, ornate fireplaces, elegant chandeliers, and historic architectural details that capture the essence of old Savannah. Rich textures, classic furnishings, and abundant natural light create an atmosphere that feels both sophisticated and inviting. The home features four full bedrooms, one partial bedroom, and four full bathrooms spread across multiple levels.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.2503446936607361,"social_amenities":0.15583205223083496,"party_restriction":0.00031986707472242415,"nearby_nightlife":0.004732816014438868}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004492557200137526,"social_amenities":0.00399814872071147,"party_restriction":0.0014962051063776016,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010682090651243925}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Main, a grand historic Savannah retreat overlooking iconic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. The space Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Main, a grand historic Savannah retreat overlooking iconic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. Designed for wedding parties, family gatherings, executive retreats, and upscale group getaways, this beautifully restored luxury home combines timeless Southern charm with spacious modern comfort \u2014 all within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s best restaurants, shops, nightlife, museums, and historic landmarks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9965301156044006,"social_amenities":0.9481162428855896,"party_restriction":0.0028959407936781645,"nearby_nightlife":0.954439640045166}},{"text":"Complete with a built-in grilling station an