eparate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004492557200137526,"social_amenities":0.00399814872071147,"party_restriction":0.0014962051063776016,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010682090651243925}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Main, a grand historic Savannah retreat overlooking iconic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. The space Welcome to Elsewhere on Madison Square Main, a grand historic Savannah retreat overlooking iconic Madison Square in the heart of the Historic District. Designed for wedding parties, family gatherings, executive retreats, and upscale group getaways, this beautifully restored luxury home combines timeless Southern charm with spacious modern comfort \u2014 all within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s best restaurants, shops, nightlife, museums, and historic landmarks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9965301156044006,"social_amenities":0.9481162428855896,"party_restriction":0.0028959407936781645,"nearby_nightlife":0.954439640045166}},{"text":"The main floor includes a beautifully appointed queen suite with a private en-suite bathroom, ideal for guests seeking first-floor accommodations. Upstairs, the third-floor suite offers additional flexibility with its own living area, dining space, and secondary kitchen \u2014 perfect for wedding prep, extended families, or guests wanting additional privacy during their stay. At the heart of the home, the spacious chef\u2019s kitchen is fully equipped with modern appliances, generous prep space, and everything needed for group meals, cocktails before dinner, or slow mornings enjoying coffee together before exploring Savannah. Step outside into the private brick courtyard, one of the home\u2019s most charming features.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9759861826896667,"social_amenities":0.007913376204669476,"party_restriction":0.00038157516974024475,"nearby_nightlife":0.5413834452629089}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1706129196883291478","title":"Luxury Historic Mansion On Madison Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1706129196883291478","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-00813","SVR-00814"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1706129196883291478","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1a5d33869f524e297576ad5d902e7ba7a8faf91f265896d86c91b324aaf937ba","chunks":8,"words":775,"party_signal":0.9779914021492004,"social_signal":0.9404663443565369,"party_welcome":0.9929190278053284,"social_amenities":0.9404663443565369,"party_restriction":0.05014706403017044,"nearby_nightlife":0.9330780506134033,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Ideal for groups of up to 12 guests, Elsewhere on Madison Manor offers an expansive layout with multiple living spaces, elegant entertaining areas, and private accommodations that allow everyone to spread out comfortably. By reserving the entire estate, guests enjoy exclusive access to both the main residence and the private garden-level apartment, creating the perfect setup for bridal parties, multi-family vacations, reunion weekends, or executive stays in downtown Savannah. Inside the main house, guests are welcomed by soaring ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors, ornate fireplaces, sparkling chandeliers, and curated historic details that capture the grandeur of old Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9779914021492004,"social_amenities":0.0035274268593639135,"party_restriction":0.00016156796482391655,"nearby_nightlife":0.013677475042641163},"affirmative_event_evidence":"By reserving the entire estate, guests enjoy exclusive access to both the main residence and the private garden-level apartment, creating the perfect setup for bridal parties, multi-family vacations, reunion weekends, or executive stays in downtown Savannah."},{"text":"The spacious formal living room evokes the feel of a classic Southern parlor, while thoughtfully updated interiors provide the convenience and luxury today\u2019s travelers expect. The main residence features four full bedrooms, one additional partial bedroom, and four full bathrooms across three spacious levels. The main floor includes a beautifully appointed queen suite with a private en-suite bathroom, making it ideal for guests seeking first-floor accommodations. Upstairs, the third-floor suite functions almost like a private retreat of its own, complete with an additional living area, dining space, and a secondary kitchen \u2014 perfect for wedding prep, extended family stays, or guests wanting additional privacy.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00969923846423626,"social_amenities":0.002034259494394064,"party_restriction":0.0004190554318483919,"nearby_nightlife":0.007269887253642082},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Upstairs, the third-floor suite functions almost like a private retreat of its own, complete with an additional living area, dining space, and a secondary kitchen \u2014 perfect for wedding prep, extended family stays, or guests wanting additional privacy."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Steps from iconic squares, renowned restaurants, charming boutiques, and historic landmarks, this beautifully restored three-story estate blends classic architecture with upscale modern comfort for an unforgettable stay in the Hostess City of the South The space Experience timeless Southern elegance at Elsewhere on Madison Manor, a grand luxury vacation rental in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District designed for wedding parties, family gatherings, corporate retreats, and large group getaways. Perfectly positioned just steps from Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, renowned restaurants, charming boutiques, and historic landmarks, this beautifully restored three-story estate blends classic architecture with upscale modern comfort for an unforgettable stay in the Hostess City of the South.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9892498254776001,"social_amenities":0.9404663443565369,"party_restriction":0.05014706403017044,"nearby_nightlife":0.025871802121400833}},{"text":"Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Flex Room: Two Twin Day Beds Garden Apartment: Bedroom 5: Queen Bed Flex Room: Queen Murphy Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-00814 SVR-00813 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042259166366420686,"social_amenities":0.27433720231056213,"party_restriction":0.01789156347513199,"nearby_nightlife":0.02296147681772709}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Surrounded by classic Savannah architecture and lush greenery, this peaceful outdoor space is perfect for morning coffee, evening wine gatherings, or intimate al fresco dinners. A built-in brick grilling station and outdoor dining area make entertaining effortless after a day exploring Savannah\u2019s historic streets. Whether you\u2019re visiting for a Savannah wedding weekend, bachelorette celebration, family reunion, holiday gathering, or luxury group vacation, Elsewhere on Madison Manor offers the perfect combination of historic charm, upscale comfort, and unbeatable downtown location. From the elegant interiors to the private outdoor spaces, every detail has been designed to create an authentic and memorable Savannah experience. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9929190278053284,"social_ame