,{"text":"Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Flex Room: Two Twin Day Beds Garden Apartment: Bedroom 5: Queen Bed Flex Room: Queen Murphy Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-00814 SVR-00813 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042259166366420686,"social_amenities":0.27433720231056213,"party_restriction":0.01789156347513199,"nearby_nightlife":0.02296147681772709}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The fully equipped chef\u2019s kitchen on the main floor serves as the heart of the home, offering modern appliances, ample prep space, and room for gathering over meals and cocktails before a night out in Savannah\u2019s Historic District. The private garden apartment adds exceptional flexibility for larger groups. Sleeping up to four guests, this separate lower-level retreat includes a queen bedroom, two full bathrooms, and an additional partial bedroom with a Murphy bed \u2014 ideal for couples, grandparents, or members of the wedding party who appreciate added privacy while remaining connected to the group. Outside, guests can unwind in the secluded brick courtyard, one of the home\u2019s most charming features.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9864875674247742,"social_amenities":0.01293790154159069,"party_restriction":0.0005091060302220285,"nearby_nightlife":0.9330780506134033}},{"text":"Surrounded by classic Savannah architecture and lush greenery, this peaceful outdoor space is perfect for morning coffee, evening wine gatherings, or intimate al fresco dinners. A built-in brick grilling station and outdoor dining area make entertaining effortless after a day exploring Savannah\u2019s historic streets. Whether you\u2019re visiting for a Savannah wedding weekend, bachelorette celebration, family reunion, holiday gathering, or luxury group vacation, Elsewhere on Madison Manor offers the perfect combination of historic charm, upscale comfort, and unbeatable downtown location. From the elegant interiors to the private outdoor spaces, every detail has been designed to create an authentic and memorable Savannah experience. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9929190278053284,"social_amenities":0.13777144253253937,"party_restriction":0.001009900588542223,"nearby_nightlife":0.8766502737998962}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 36015","address":"100 W LIBERTY LN","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24088093045","date":"2024-03-28","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W LIBERTY ST","recorded_pin":"20015 36004A","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24246258537","date":"2024-09-02","type":"26 HAZARDOUS VEHICLE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W Liberty St","recorded_pin":"20015 36004A","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25044040802","date":"2025-02-13","type":"57 MISSING (RISK)SPECIAL LOC","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W Liberty St","recorded_pin":"20015 36004A","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26021019768","date":"2026-01-21","type":"71 PAST SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Othe