ces Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Smoking allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001848030515247956,"social_amenities":0.0024037708062678576,"party_restriction":0.0006516376743093133,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012131979456171393}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Q & A Will I have the BEST time ever? YES! Will I see the LARGEST bunk beds in my life? YES! Are there 2 FREE parking spots? YES! Can I walk to all the Favorite top spots? YES! Are restaurants/coffee shops within walking distance? YES! Do you really have six kids? HAHA YES! Can I walk to River St? YES! Is Forsyth Park a few blocks behind the home? YES! Can I walk to Plant River District? YES! Do you have Upscale Amenities? YES! Was the house really built in 1887? SVR02514 The space The old world meets the new world.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6774744391441345,"social_amenities":0.039657674729824066,"party_restriction":0.00720051396638155,"nearby_nightlife":0.9579380750656128}},{"text":"You also may be asked to leave our property without a refund. Inside Smoking Fee: $250 Lost Key Fee: $150 Party Fee: $300 Just so you know, there will be a damage hold of $300. Once the reservation is completed, your card will be refunded within 48 hours. You will receive a $300 request through the ABB message board. Please respond as soon as possible to avoid any check-in delays. Please refrain from allowing your furry babies on the furniture. A $100 pet fee will be charged at the time of booking. The fee may increase for certain breeds known for excessive shedding. Thank you for your understanding. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006786909885704517,"social_amenities":0.0009735865169204772,"party_restriction":0