ress":"326 Bull St","recorded_pin":"20015 41001","side":"direct"},{"number":"25128129862","date":"2025-05-08","type":"42-J THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"326 Bull St","recorded_pin":"20015 41001","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1410857174924367769","title":"Above the Tea Room in the Heart of Downtown","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1410857174924367769","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00703"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1410857174924367769","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"35a22ec5410f1c542caa56253bfcd80ae473299983fa99a01fb596b4ab22e7a7","chunks":17,"words":1679,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5505620837211609,"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.5136079788208008,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Above the Tea Room captures that essence perfectly. Unlike standard hotels, Savannah vacation homes like this one provide a more intimate, personal experience. Here, you're not just visiting\u2014you\u2019re living like a local, immersed in the beauty, culture, and rhythm of daily life in one of the South\u2019s most beloved cities. Book Your Stay at Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square Whether it\u2019s your first time in Savannah or your tenth, Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square offers the perfect blend of location, comfort, and historic charm. As one of the most delightful vacation rentals Savannah GA has to offer, it provides everything you need for an unforgettable stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015361086116172373,"social_amenities":0.0978279784321785,"party_restriction":0.0020241914317011833,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024117976427078247}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re celebrating a special occasion, enjoying a weekend away with your partner, or exploring the city with a close friend or two, Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square offers everything you need for a memorable stay. As one of the most charming and unique Savannah vacation rentals, it\u2019s a place where guests can relax, connect, and soak up the city's historic charm in style. Discover Why Savannah Vacation Homes Are So Special There\u2019s something undeniably magical about staying in a historic home in Savannah. From the cobblestone streets and moss-draped oaks to the rich architectural heritage, this city has a way of wrapping you in its charm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004390714690089226,"social_amenities":0.03681163489818573,"party_restriction":0.0016790415393188596,"nearby_nightlife":0.004253556951880455}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Above the Tea Room captures that essence perfectly. Unlike standard hotels, Savannah vacation homes like this one provide a more intimate, personal experience. Here, you're not just visiting\u2014you\u2019re living like a local, immersed in the beauty, culture, and rhythm of daily life in one of the South\u2019s most beloved cities. Book Your Stay at Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square Whether it\u2019s your first time in Savannah or your tenth, Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square offers the perfect blend of location, comfort, and historic charm. As one of the most delightful vacation rentals Savannah GA has to offer, it provides everything you need for an unforgettable stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015361086116172373,"social_amenities":0.0978279784321785,"party_restriction":0.0020241914317011833,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024117976427078247}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"The condo\u2019s modern bathroom features a sleek walk-in shower, contemporary fixtures, and plush towels to enhance your comfort. Whether you're preparing for a night out or rinsing off the day's adventures, this spa-like space is designed to meet your needs with both function and style. Location, Location, Location \u2013 Right by Madison Square What makes Above the Tea Room Off Madison Square one of the most desirable vacation rentals Savannah GA offers is its unbeatable location. Nestled in the very heart of the Historic District, the condo is just steps from the iconic Madison Square\u2014one of the city's most beloved and picturesque parks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011249964591115713,"social_amenities":0.06196528673171997,"party_restriction":0.002898290753364563,"nearby_nightlife":0.2852981686592102}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"A Cozy Kitchen with all the Essentials Savannah\u2019s food scene is a must-experience, but when you\u2019re in the mood for a quiet meal in, you\u2019ll appreciate the condo\u2019s compact yet well-equipped kitchen. While the space is cozy, it includes everything you need for the basics\u2014a stove, oven, microwave, fridge, coffee maker, and all the essential cookware and utensils. It\u2019s perfect for preparing a light breakfast before heading out for the day, or heating up leftovers from one of the city\u2019s incredible restaurants. The nearby dining table for two creates a charming little nook for casual meals, coffee breaks, or late-night snacks. Restful Nights in the Queen Bedroom","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016815720300655812,"social_amenities":0.0009937207214534283,"party_restriction":0.002239890629425645,"nearby_nightlife":0.5136079788208008}},{"text":"Extra sleeping space: Queen-size convertible sofa \u2013 the sofa cushions unfold to create a floor-level sleeping surface. Please note, this is not a traditional elevated pull-out sofa bed. Special amenities: Amazing location near of the historic Madison Square, beautiful semi-private courtyard with covered outdoor dining and additional seating, walk to restaurants, boutiques, museums Parking: Metered street parking Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":160,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020373058214318007,"social_amenities":0.04276949167251587,"party_restriction":0.0007293927483260632,"nearby_nightlife":0.4653472602367401}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 45009","address":"106 W JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":3.0,"neighbor_count":6,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complain