, Chromecast, Disney+, Fire TV, Hulu, Netflix, Roku Books and reading material Family Crib Standard (52 inches long x 28 inches wide) Children\u2019s books and toys Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher","section":"AMENITIES","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013010734983254224,"social_amenities":0.005728592164814472,"party_restriction":0.00032577483216300607,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012594490544870496}},{"text":"Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":120,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001256781251868233,"social_amenities":0.00262517505325377,"party_restriction":0.0009704525582492352,"nearby_nightlife":0.00090905895922333}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Electric stove Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Parking and facilities Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025410528178326786,"social_amenities":0.0011251651449128985,"party_restriction":0.0006781461415812373,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006492810207419097}},{"text":"The most perfect location on iconic Jones Street. A historic home built in 1851. Close to restaurants, stylish shops, free downtown shuttle at the corner, across the street from the famous Mrs. Wilkes and a quick stroll to Forsyth Park. Stylishly designed by its owner a local interior designer. Great \"work from home\" location. Host is always reachable directly. No crazy check out requirements, no added fees (just cleaning and taxes). NO PETS. For parking pls see \"parking info\" SVR-02191 The space Entry is at ground level. No stairs just a small step up at entry. Spacious bedroom with a queen bed. Bathroom has a walk in shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014531852502841502,"social_amenities":0.0008621973684057593,"party_restriction":0.059017423540353775,"nearby_nightlife":0.8150742650032043}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Dove shampoo Dove conditioner Dove body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Entertainment 65 inch HDTV with Amazon Prime Video, Apple TV, Chromecast, Disney+, Fire TV, Hulu, Netflix, Roku Books and reading material Family Crib Standard (52 inches long x 28 inches wide) Children\u2019s books and toys Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher","section":"AMENITIES","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013010734983254224,"social_amenities":0.005728592164814472,"party_restriction":0.00032577483216300607,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012594490544870496}},{"text":"Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":120,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001256781251868233,"social_amenities":0.00262517505325377,"party_restriction":0.0009704525582492352,"nearby_nightlife":0.00090905895922333}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The most perfect location on iconic Jones Street. A historic home built in 1851. Close to restaurants, stylish shops, free downtown shuttle at the corner, across the street from the famous Mrs. Wilkes and a quick stroll to Forsyth Park. Stylishly designed by its owner a local interior designer. Great \"work from home\" location. Host is always reachable directly. No crazy check out requirements, no added fees (just cleaning and taxes). NO PETS. For parking pls see \"parking info\" SVR-02191 The space Entry is at ground level. No stairs just a small step up at entry. Spacious bedroom with a queen bed. Bathroom has a walk in shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014531852502841502,"social_amenities":0.0008621973684057593,"party_restriction":0.059017423540353775,"nearby_nightlife":0.8150742650032043}},{"text":"There is a 3 guests maximum, $25fee applies per guest (after 2) per night. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010489087435416877,"social_amenities":0.0011051190085709095,"party_restriction":0.0013290212955325842,"nearby_nightlife":0.006980083882808685}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The most perfect location on iconic Jones Street. A historic home built in 1851. Close to restaurants, stylish shops, free downtown shuttle at the corner, across the street from the famous Mrs. Wilkes and a quick stroll to Forsyth Park. Stylishly designed by its owner a local interior designer. Great \"work from home\" location. Host is always reachable directly. No crazy check out requirements, no added fees (just cleaning and taxes). NO PETS. For parking pls see \"parking info\" SVR-02191 The space Entry is at ground level. No stairs just a small step up at entry. Spacious bedroom with a queen bed. Bathroom has a walk in shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014531852502841502,"social_amenities":0.0008621973684057593,"party_restriction":0.059017423540353775,"nearby_nightlife":0.8150742650032043}},{"text":"Ample living room with a dedicated work space (desk). Large screen smart TV. Kitchen is fully equipped, electric stove, refrigerator, freezer, microwave, blender, etc. Central heat and AC with Nest Thermostat. Laundry room with a washer/ Dryer, ironing board and iron. Other things to note There is a pullout sofa. If there are only 2 guests on the reservation and the pullout is used a one time $25 linen fee will be charged upon check out. If there is a third guest staying in the apartment (even if partially) it must be disclosed in the reservation request.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.641395445214584e-05,"social_amenities":0.001080722315236926,"party_restriction":0.0005976420943625271,"nearby_nightlife":0.0071375491097569466}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 45015","address":"122 W JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":36.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":6,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24140147473","date":"2024-05-19","type":"1-J ASSAULT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"direct"},{"number":"24140148213","date":"2024-05-19","type":"1 PAST ASSAULT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W JONES ST","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"direct"},{"number":"24141149204","date":"2024-05-20","type":"4 SUPPLEMENTAL Additional Info","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"direct"},{"number":"25353357695","date":"2025-12-19","type":"41-4 VEHICLE THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"direct"}],"