ack lane of the historic home. Guest access Guests can access the entire apartment and shared back courtyard. Other things to note Parking info: Parking is on street. Usually pretty easy to find a spot around the airbnb on the same block. Meters are in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm. It's free anyday after 5pm, and free to park overnight. You can feed the meter remotely from a mobile phone using the Park Savannah App.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001212348070112057,"social_amenities":0.046837370842695236,"party_restriction":0.003980301320552826,"nearby_nightlife":0.005900534335523844}},{"text":"Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free street parking Paid parking off premises Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure","section":"AMENITIES","line":98,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008301301277242601,"social_amenities":0.022726979106664658,"party_restriction":0.0006819484988227487,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015773524064570665}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Historic carriage house from 1850 renovated by its owner, a local interior designer. Original hardwood floors and decorative fireplaces, new marble bathroom and chic decor items. Beautiful natural light. You cannot beat this location in Savannah's historic downtown district. Walk everywhere, close to everytquiet and peaceful. Enjoy the charming courtyard garden for a glass of wine or your morning coffee. Washer/ dryer available. No private parking. See parking for options. No pets. SVR-02206 The space Cozy and very quiet, stylish space with separate bedroom and living area. 2nd floor of a carriage house in a Historic Home built in 1850. One flight of stairs up.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001427219685865566,"social_amenities":0.0048513771034777164,"party_restriction":0.9668743014335632,"nearby_nightlife":0.051285456866025925}},{"text":"Enjoy a beautiful a peaceful outdoor courtyard. Original wood floors, brand new carpeting in bedroom, all marble bathroom, all new fixtures. Kitchen is fully equipped, clean bedding, plushy towels. Entry and exit through the back lane of the historic home. Guest access Guests can access the entire apartment and shared back courtyard. Other things to note Parking info: Parking is on street. Usually pretty easy to find a spot around the airbnb on the same block. Meters are in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm. It's free anyday after 5pm, and free to park overnight. You can feed the meter remotely from a mobile phone using the Park Savannah App.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001212348070112057,"social_amenities":0.046837370842695236,"party_restriction":0.003980301320552826,"nearby_nightlife":0.005900534335523844}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Historic carriage house from 1850 renovated by its owner, a local interior designer. Original hardwood floors and decorative fireplaces, new marble bathroom and chic decor items. Beautiful natural light. You cannot beat this location in Savannah's historic downtown district. Walk everywhere, close to everytquiet and peaceful. Enjoy the charming courtyard garden for a glass of wine or your morning coffee. Washer/ dryer available. No private parking. See parking for options. No pets. SVR-02206 The space Cozy and very quiet, stylish space with separate bedroom and living area. 2nd floor of a carriage house in a Historic Home built in 1850. One flight of stairs up.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001427219685865566,"social_amenities":0.0048513771034777164,"party_restriction":0.9668743014335632,"nearby_nightlife":0.051285456866025925}},{"text":"Enjoy a beautiful a peaceful outdoor courtyard. Original wood floors, brand new carpeting in bedroom, all marble bathroom, all new fixtures. Kitchen is fully equipped, clean bedding, plushy towels. Entry and exit through the back lane of the historic home. Guest access Guests can access the entire apartment and shared back courtyard. Other things to note Parking info: Parking is on street. Usually pretty easy to find a spot around the airbnb on the same block. Meters are in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm. It's free anyday after 5pm, and free to park overnight. You can feed the meter remotely from a mobile phone using the Park Savannah App.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001212348070112057,"social_amenities":0.046837370842695236,"party_restriction":0.003980301320552826,"nearby_nightlife":0.005900534335523844}}]}}},{"listing_id":"34360152","title":"Jones Street Apartment Circa 1850","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/34360152","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02204"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"34360152","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b555df2208d41ffb1a693df515bf7c27d39f17b48a6ebc2000e46ae410bc293c","chunks":10,"words":873,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.04025602340698242,"party_welcome":0.00048781250370666385,"social_amenities":0.04025602340698242,"party_restriction":0.0054803816601634026,"nearby_nightlife":0.04526778683066368,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Other things to note *****PARKING INFO******** Parking is on street. Meters in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm. Free after 5pm, free all weekend, free overnight any night. Parking on the same block as the apartment should be easy, you should have no problem fin