 Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048781250370666385,"social_amenities":0.03597325086593628,"party_restriction":0.0011201879242435098,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008578307460993528}},{"text":"The kitchen is fully equipped with everything you need: including dishes, pots and pans, mugs, glassware, coffeemaker, toaster, etc. and a dining table with two chairs. There is a drip coffee maker. Filters, ground coffee, tea, sugar and creamer are all available and complimentary. Additional entry/ exit through the back of the apartment opens up to a beautiful back courtyard. There's also a side door that leads out to a beautiful separate side courtyard that faces Jones Street. Bathroom undergoing a complete renovation in November! All brand new everything, welcoming reservations again December 1st. Guest access Full access the the entire apartment and access to two beautiful and peaceful courtyards.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047751894453540444,"social_amenities":0.00250038574449718,"party_restriction":0.0018446643371134996,"nearby_nightlife":0.006502862088382244}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Other things to note *****PARKING INFO******** Parking is on street. Meters in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm. Free after 5pm, free all weekend, free overnight any night. Parking on the same block as the apartment should be easy, you should have no problem finding a spot right outside the door on W Jones St. Here are your options: If you are coming just for the weekend: Parking in any spot around the apartment is FREE after 5pm on Friday and all weekend. It's ok and free to park overnight. If you are parking during the week:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001331091916654259,"social_amenities":0.04025602340