 the apartment itself. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass","section":"AMENITIES","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007676781970076263,"social_amenities":0.07927028089761734,"party_restriction":0.0030147386714816093,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013950093416497111}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"RH leather sofa, large flat screen smart tv with cable in the living room. Bedroom has a very comfortable KING bed (new Aug 2022) a tv. Ensuite bathroom has a doorway to the bedroom and to the living room. Laundry room with a washer, dryer and utility sink. Spacious front parlor (2nd living room) with a desk overlooking Jones Street. Ample formal dining room. Access to a back porch, a backyard garden, and a beautiful front courtyard with views onto Jones Street. Located in the Design District where all the most stylish home stores and chic boutiques are. Absolute best location you can get downtown.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006936361314728856,"social_amenities":0.0026497202925384045,"party_restriction":0.0020144102163612843,"nearby_nightlife":0.03438424691557884}},{"text":"A GREAT \u201cWORK FROM HOME\u201d place, reliable fast wifi internet, front parlor has pockets doors that can be closed for work privacy, comfortable desk. Guest access You have access to two courtyards, a back porch, and a laundry room. Inside the apartment you can access all areas that are in the photos. Front balcony not to be accessed or used. To access the front courtyard garden guests must go out the front door, down the stairs in through the courtyard gates off the front of the property. Other things to note *****PARKING INFO******** Parking is on street. For the area around the apartment: Meters in effect Mon-Fri 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013320098514668643,"social_amenities":0.0014831922017037868,"party_restriction":0.0014602015726268291,"nearby_nightlife":0.01924338936805725}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 45022","address":"339 WHITAKER ST #1","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24017016822","date":"2024-01-17","type":"STRUCTURE FIRE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"109 W Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20015 45005","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"19470036","title":"Beautiful Design District Apt by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/19470036","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00526"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"19470036","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b69645f5235d172d6416cc40103b9ff224d693c658f5cfddc6d07937d41caacb","chunks":8,"words":692,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.14429239928722382,"party_welcome":0.0035176018718630075,"social_amenities":0.14429239928722382,"party_restriction":0.005177251063287258,"nearby_nightlife":0.2256731539964676,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This two bedroom, two bath apartment is centrally located on Whitaker Street, a perfect starting point to explore everything Savannah has to offer. The space This two bedroom, two bath apartment is centrally located on Whitaker Street. No matter which direction you set out in the morning, you\u2019ll be just blocks away from all that Savannah has to offer. When you open the front door, you're immediately greeted by a large and comfortable living area. You shouldn\u2019t need a vacation from your vacation, so don\u2019t feel bad about spending an evening in, curled up on this comfortable couch watching a show (or two!).","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00042652571573853493,"social_amenities":0.14429239928722382,"party_restriction":0.003284340724349022,"nearby_nightlife":0.0176569651812315}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re enjoying coffee and breakfast at the kitchen counter breakfast bar, or dinner at the cozy dining table, the Eleanor has plenty of room for quality family time. At the end of the hall you\u2019ll find a full bath and a Queen bed in the first bedroom. The Primary Suite has a king bed and renovated full bath. When you\u2019re ready to start your day, just cross the street to tour St. John\u2019s Episcopal Church, known for its melodious chimes and magnificent stained glass windows. In 1942, St. John\u2019s the Green-Meldrim House, one of Savannah\u2019s finest examples of Gothic Revival architecture.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0035176018718630075,"social_amenities":0.001796380034647882,"party_restriction":0.0006344025605358183,"nearby_nightlife":0.1006241887807846}},{"text":"During the Civil War, General Sherman occupied the Green-Meldrim House and penned his famous telegram to President Lincoln, presenting the city of Savannah as a Christmas present. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - Each bedroom in this beautiful home has it\u2019s own bathroom, so everyone will have space to get ready to explore Savannah! - Only half block from Mrs. Wilkes Restaurant, close enough to beat the long lines that form at this popular lunch spot What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001075488398782909,"social_amenities":0.0036732505541294813,"party_restriction":0.005177251063287258,"nearby_nightlife":0.2256731539964676}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This two bedroom, two bath apartment is centrally located on Whitaker Street, a perfect starting point to explore everything Savannah has to offer. The space This two bedroom, two bath apartment is centrally located on Whitaker Street. No matter which direction you set out in the morning, you\u2019ll be just blocks away from all that Savannah has to offer. When you open 