dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022753834491595626,"social_amenities":0.0061003598384559155,"party_restriction":0.00028936631861142814,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014148717746138573}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Great for sunny lunches and evening cocktails. In the courtyard is a small shed with a washer and dryer that are for your use but also shared with guests in the next door cottage. Nearby attractions include The Sorrel-Weed House, Green-Meldrim House, Mercer Williams House Museum, and the Fountain at Forsyth Park. Head North just a short walk towards the National Landmark Historic District center, with Broughton Street being the go-to for shopping and dining. Both City Market and River Street are a 15-minute walk from this home. NOTES: Minimum age to reserve is 25 years old, no exceptions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.003618228482082486,"social_amenities":0.0007806846988387406,"party_restriction":0.00047244736924767494,"nearby_nightlife":0.9952115416526794}},{"text":"OCCUPANCY: We NEVER allow more than 2 people, including infants/children, at the property at ANY/ALL times. NO PARTIES ALLOWED! NO BACHELORETTE/BACHOLOR GROUPS! No pets or smoking allowed. PARKING INFO: There is no parking at the home. This is located on a LANE/alley so the closet street parking is one block in any direction. 1. Luxury Living Savannah has 4 privately reserved parking spaces (a few blocks away) that are available to our guests for rent. We charge $20 per night, per space and this can be added to your reservation charges. Please arrange for this at time of booking and provide vehicle tag number & state.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000343762425472959