ks":16,"words":1543,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8056227564811707,"party_welcome":0.026810940355062485,"social_amenities":0.8056227564811707,"party_restriction":0.011183978989720345,"nearby_nightlife":0.8668790459632874,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Settle into the Serena & Lily swing chairs while church bells drift through the air. Pour something lovely as the skyline turns golden at sunset, then switch on the Edison lights and linger beneath the stars. Prefer to stay in? Fire up the electric grill and enjoy dinner with a view. Your rooftop includes: \u2022 Serena & Lily swing chairs \u2022 Adirondack seating \u2022 Sweeping Savannah skyline views \u2022 Edison lights \u2022 Yoga mats \u2022 Electric grill And best of all ~ the rooftop is PRIVATE and exclusively yours during your stay. \ud83d\udda4 \u201cJones St. is truly beautiful, the views and the rooftop deck are fantastic!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.014802295714616776,"social_amenities":0.8056227564811707,"party_restriction":0.011183978989720345,"nearby_nightlife":0.10797598958015442}},{"text":"Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Outdoor kitchen Private BBQ grill: electric Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Bikes Sun loungers Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Paid street parking off premises Paid parking on premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":322,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004213591164443642,"social_amenities":0.10115238279104233,"party_restriction":0.0008583834278397262,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008037802763283253}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Savannah Peach Penthouse is tucked inside the historic William Remshart Row House, built circa 1853 and part of Savannah\u2019s celebrated Historic District. William Remshart lived here with his family ~ including an astonishing 17 children. I sometimes wonder about all the lives these walls have witnessed over the past 170+ years. For a few days, you get to become a little part of the story. \u2e3b Savannah Peach Penthouse is made for anniversaries, honeymoons, romantic escapes, birthday trips, girls\u2019 getaways, solo adventures ~ and anyone who wants to experience Savannah from somewhere that actually feels like Savannah. I would be honored to host your Savannah escape.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":172,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.026810940355062485,"social_amenities":0.0011716060107573867,"party_restriction":0.0005461843102239072,"nearby_nightlife":0.0026746243238449097}},{"text":"Settle into the Serena & Lily swing chairs while church bells drift through the air. Pour something lovely as the skyline turns golden at sunset, then switch on the Edison lights and linger beneath the stars. Prefer to stay in? Fire up the electric grill and enjoy dinner with a view. Your rooftop includes: \u2022 Serena & Lily swing chairs \u2022 Adirondack seating \u2022 Sweeping Savannah skyline views \u2022 Edison lights \u2022 Yoga mats \u2022 Electric grill And best of all ~ the rooftop is PRIVATE and exclusively yours during your stay. \ud83d\udda4 \u201cJones St. is truly beautiful, the views and the rooftop deck are fantastic!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.014802295714616776,"social_amenities":0.8056227564811707,"party_restriction":0.011183978989720345,"nearby_nightlife":0.10797598958015442}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Settle into the Serena & Lily swing chairs while church bells drift through the air. Pour something lovely as the skyline turns golden at sunset, then switch on the Edison lights and linger beneath the stars. Prefer to stay in? Fire up the electric grill and enjoy dinner with a view. Your rooftop includes: \u2022 Serena & Lily swing chairs \u2022 Adirondack seating \u2022 Sweeping Savannah skyline views \u2022 Edison lights \u2022 Yoga mats \u2022 Electric grill And best of all ~ the rooftop is PRIVATE and exclusively yours during your stay. \ud83d\udda4 \u201cJones St. is truly beautiful, the views and the rooftop deck are fantastic!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.014802295714616776,"social_amenities":0.8056227564811707,"party_restriction":0.011183978989720345,"nearby_nightlife":0.10797598958015442}},{"text":"Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Outdoor kitchen Private BBQ grill: electric Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Bikes Sun loungers Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Paid street parking off premises Paid parking on premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":322,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004213591164443642,"social_amenities":0.10115238279104233,"party_restriction":0.0008583834278397262,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008037802763283253}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Settle into the Serena & Lily swing chairs while church bells drift through the air. Pour something lovely as the skyline turns golden at sunset, then switch on the Edison lights and linger beneath the stars. Prefer to stay in? Fire up the electric grill and enjoy dinner with a view. Your rooftop includes: \u2022 Serena & Lily swing chairs \u2022 Adirondack seating \u2022 Sweeping Savannah skyline views \u2022 Edison lights \u2022 Yoga mats \u2022 Electric grill And best of all ~ the rooftop is PRIVATE and exclusively yours during your stay. \ud83d\udda4 \u201cJones St. is truly beautiful, the views and the rooftop deck are fantastic!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.014802295714616776,"social_amenities":0.8056227564811707,"party_restriction":0.011183978989720345,"nearby_nightlife":0.10797598958015442}},{"text":"Savannah wasn\u2019t built with elevators ~ and that\u2019s part of her charm. Your stay begins with the classic Jones Street stoop, continues up the interior staircase, and finishes with one last climb to your private penthouse sanctuary. At the top? Your own rooftop retreat, Savannah skyline views, church steeples, sunshine and a little bit of magic. PLEASE NOTE: This historic home is a walk-up with multiple flights of stairs and NO elevator. I want you to know before booking so there are no surprises ~ except the good kind. \u2e3b \u272d A LITTLE HISTORY","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":158,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014263225020840764,"social_amenities":0.03713265806436539,"party_restriction":0.0064179301261901855,"nearby_nightlife":0.0026583776343613863}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"There\u2019s also a Smart TV, dedicated workspace, charging stations, lighted makeup mirror, closet space and thoughtful storage. \ud83d\udda4 \u201cThe bed was heavenly, the Roman shades & blackout drapes made for very restful sleep.\u201d ~ Allie, \u201924 \u2e3b \u272d A KITCHEN MADE FOR STAYING IN Savannah has incredible restaurants ~ but some evenings you may not want to leave the rooftop. The kitchen is fully appointed with a full-size refrigerator, wine cooler, oven + stove, dishwasher, Calphalon cookware and Cuisinart bakeware. And because the little things matter: Waterford wine glasses. Because even takeout tastes better in Waterford. \ud83e\udd42 \u2e3b \u272d YOUR TYBEE ISLAND ADVENTURE Savannah getaway + beach day? Yes, please.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010983000509440899,"social_amenities":0.0028056753799319267,"party_restriction":0.0006272074533626437,"nearby_nightlife":0.8668790459632874}},{"text":"Tybee Island is about a breezy 25-minute drive away, where you\u2019ll have access to my electric Club Car golf cart to cruise the island in true vacation style. Your complimentary Tybee perk includes: \u2022 Electric Club Car golf cart + parking decal \u2022 Bicycles, if you prefer two wheels \u2022 Beach chairs + umbrella \u2022 Cooler + beach towels \u2022 Complimentary parking for your car Pack your swimsuit ~ I\u2019ve got the rest. \u2600\ufe0f \ud83d\udda4 \u201cWe really enjoyed Tybee Island for an afternoon ~ beautiful beaches, fun to drive around the golf cart, and great, chill restaurants.\u201d ~ Greg, \u201924 \u2e3b \u272d THE VIEW IS WORTH THE CLIMB \ud83c\udf51","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":140,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010729368077591062,"social_amenities":0.003095816820859909,"party_restriction":0.0005663693882524967,"nearby_nightlife":0.5116855502128601}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 45036","address":"120 W JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24140147473","date":"2024-05-19","type":"1-J ASSAULT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24140148213","date":"2024-05-19","type":"1 PAST ASSAULT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W JONES ST","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24141149204","date":"2024-05-20","type":"4 SUPPLEMENTAL Additional Info","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25353357695","date":"2025-12-19","type":"41-4 VEHICLE THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Jones St","recorded_pin":"20015 45015","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"39052746","title":"120 West Jones #2 - The Salon -Elite Property","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39052746","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01495"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"39052746","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"ef064253889a95dfc422528dc75c4b44a8198655ac66f2184533cfaba57dc030","chunks":8,"words":674,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004000576213002205,"party_welcome":0.10528194904327393,"social_amenities":0.004000576213002205,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.041966512799263,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Molton Brown shampoo Molton Brown conditioner Molton Brown body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton Organic Parachute Bedding linens Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet Entertainment 50 inch HDTV with premium cable, standard cable Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property All public areas are monitored by CCTV. No recording devices whatsoever are installed in private units. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen","section":"AMENITIES","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012320997484494,"social_amenities":0.004000576213002205,"party_restriction":0.0006389219197444618,"nearby_nightlife":0.001317796646617353}},{"text":"French doors open off the bath onto a private outside balcony where guests can share an evening\u2019s glass of wine or a bright morning\u2019s coffee or tea. SAFETY: Prior to your arrival, all surfaces have been wiped and sanitized. As an extra precaution, we fog every suite to eliminate a number of airborne bacteria and viruses. For your review the efficacy rate of this additional fogging step is listed below. 92.7% formaldehyde removal 99.9% disinfecting rate 95.6% odor removal Once your suite has been thoroughly sanitized, it is sealed to assure you that no-one has entered or contaminated the space prior to you checking in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026168933254666626,"social_amenities":0.0039926497265696526,"party_restriction":0.0003707573632709682,"nearby_nightlife":0.0022673490457236767}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The kitchen has been completely renovated and includes state-of-the-art appliances such as Bosch convection wall oven, Bosch built-in microwave, Bosch dishwasher, Bosch built-in refrigerator and Jenn Air cooktop with downdraft. Coffee/tea and condiments for such are provided. There is a charming dining area for those perfect dine-in occasions adorned with antique French copper. The enormous bath has also been completely renovated and boasts a large glassed-in shower with multi-jets. Elegant mirrors, a chandelier and sconces provide old-world charm in a modern atmosphere. The owners have left nothing unconsidered as there is an in-suite washer/dryer set by ASCO to ensure longer-staying guests have all the comforts of home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.10528194904327393,"social_amenities":0.0011399275390431285,"party_restriction":0.000270483287749812,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005227226065471768}},{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Paid parking off premises Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00041608314495533705,"social_amenities":0.002356936689466238,"party_restriction":0.0004275802930351347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004531196318566799}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Molton Brown shampoo Molton Brown conditioner Molton Brown body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton Organic Parachute Bedding linens Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet Entertainment 50 inch HDTV with premium cable, standard cable Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property All public areas are monitored by CCTV. No recording devices whatsoever are installed in private units. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen","section":"AMENITIES","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012320997484494,"social_amenities":0.004000576213002205,"party_restriction":0.0006389219197444618,"nearby_nightlife":0.001317796646617353}},{"text":"French doors open off the bath onto a private outside balcony where guests can share an evening\u2019s glass of wine or a bright morning\u2019s coffee or tea. SAFETY: Prior to your arrival, all surfaces have been wiped and sanitized. As an extra precaution, we fog every suite to eliminate a number of airborne bacteria and viruses. For your review the efficacy rate of this additional fogging step is listed below. 92.7% formaldehyde removal 99.9% disinfecting rate 95.6% odor removal Once your suite has been thoroughly sanitized, it is sealed to assure you that no-one has entered or contaminated the space prior to you checking in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026168933254666626,"social_amenities":0.0039926497265696526,"party_restriction":0.0003707573632709682,"nearby_nightlife":0.0022673490457236767}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":144,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002910627517849207,"social_amenities":0.0016527262050658464,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009365808218717575}},{"text":"The Salon is a large and gracious residence overlooking famous Jones Street in the heart of the historic district. At an impressive 1,400 square feet, this beautiful offering is the largest of all 4 lodgings at 120 West Jones Street, encompassing the entire 3rd floor of the house. The Salon has retained its historic character, including original heart-pine floors and elegant molding, while being tastefully updated with modern conveniences. SVR-01495 For concierge service visit 120WestJones.com The space The Space - Please note, this is a 170+ year old home. Please be respectful of guests above and below you.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016433550626970828,"social_amenities":0.00239276303909719,"party_restriction":0.0027893774677067995,"nearby_nightlife":0.0070517417043447495}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The owners offer the Salon as a 2-bedroom suite to provide 4 guests an exceptional experience in spacious and gracious accommodations. The Master bedrooms\u2019 long Italianate windows overlook \u201cAmerica\u2019s prettiest street\u201d (Food and Wine Magazine and Southern Living) paved with red bricks and lined with ancient live oak trees. Both bedrooms have comfortable beds, furnished with Parachute linens, as well as their own private sitting areas. The living room contains chic bespoke sofas for lounging, lighting by Ralph Lauren, and a 50\u201d SmartTV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011267064837738872,"social_amenities":0.0009568353416398168,"party_restriction":0.00021987411309964955,"nearby_nightlife":0.041966512799263}},{"text":"The Salon is a large and gracious residence overlooking famous Jones Street in the heart of the historic district. At an impressive 1,400 square feet, this beautiful offering is the largest of all 4 lodgings at 120 West Jones Street, encompassing the entire 3rd floor of the house. The Salon has retained its historic character, including original heart-pine floors and elegant molding, while being tastefully updated with modern conveniences. SVR-01495 For concierge service visit 120WestJones.com The space The Space - Please note, this is a 170+ year old home. Please be respectful of guests above and below you.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016433550626970828,"social_amenities":0.00239276303909719,"party_restriction":0.0027893774677067995,"nearby_nightlife":0.0070517417043447495}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20015 45039","address":"120 W JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},