r are installed in private units. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.914450492942706e-05,"social_amenities":0.003018332412466407,"party_restriction":0.0007654600776731968,"nearby_nightlife":0.0037509051617234945}},{"text":"The original wooden staircase leads guests to the master suite, complete with a comfortable queen size bed, furnished with Parachute linens, in-suite bath, generous closets, in-suite washer and dryer, and a private sitting area. The owners have gone to great lengths to provide furnishings that create an understated sophisticated, warm and inviting space to appeal to today\u2019s discriminating luxury traveler. SAFETY: Prior to your arrival, all surfaces have been wiped and sanitized. As an extra precaution, we fog every suite to eliminate a number of airborne bacteria and viruses. For your review the efficacy rate of this additional fogging step is listed below. 92.7% formaldehyde removal 99.9% disinfecting rate","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.284577052108943e-05,"social_amenities":0.002081864746287465,"party_restriction":0.00036026843008585274,"nearby_nightlife":0.001249108579941094}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Built in 1852, this 2nd-story Carriage House suite, is ever-so charming. With windows overlooking Charlton Lane and onto the beautiful courtyard, this property is very popular with guests. Originally built to house staff and horses, today, our carriage house has been renovated to provide a warm, cozy and sophisticated lodging, complete with modern amenities which are sure to please the most discriminating luxury traveler. SVR-01498 For concierge services visit 120WestJones.com The space The interior has the original exposed beams, hardwood floors and brick walls.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038830257835797966,"social_amenities":0.0011595395626500249,"party_restriction":0.000