In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet and closet Entertainment 50 inch HDTV with Amazon Prime Video, Hulu, Netflix, standard cable Books and reading material Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen","section":"AMENITIES","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028651353204622865,"social_amenities":0.003800300182774663,"party_restriction":0.00044985717977397144,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006185073289088905}},{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Parking and facilities Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Paid parking off premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":98,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036517097032628953,"social_amenities":0.002021167194470763,"party_restriction":0.0004458416369743645,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005970954662188888}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The en suite bathroom features a Jacuzzi tub. Pamper yourself with high thread count organic cotton sheets and quilts and quality Turkish towels. Ample walk-in closets will take care of your party wardrobe. High-speed Wi-Fi for business and everything else. Washer/dryer for laundry. White noise machine to temper the noise of late-night revelers. Park at Whitaker Street Garage, a 3-minute walk from your front door. (Parking not included.) **Please Note: You will hear street noise, which may be loud--especially on weekends. We provide two white noise machines and ear plugs.** Guest access This 750 sq. ft. private apartment is at your complete disposal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7101258635520935,"social_amenities":0.001361135276965797,"party_restriction":0.006529947277158499,"nearby_nightlife":0.9764061570167542}},{"text":"Historic hardwood floors and exposed original brick walls recall Savannah\u2019s trading past. A beautiful fully equipped kitchen opens onto a dining area, living and entertaining space. This flows into the bedroom area and bathroom. Exquisitely furnished, City Market Central is the perfect spot for up to 4 people to enjoy one of America\u2019s most fun-living cities. Entertain in style from the fully stocked kitchen and bar cart or kick back and enjoy the 50\" LED TV with internet access for Netflix (bring your own code), YouTube, etc., and local channels. The apartment offers a romantic king-sized bed, and a custom made leather queen sleeper sofa.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020291656255722046,"social_amenities":0.00214182585477829,"party_restriction":0.0005122095462866127,"nearby_nightlife":0.9605891704559326}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Fall for the charm of this loft-style flat with gleaming wood floors, brick walls, & a view of historic Savannah. With an elevator, king bed & pull-out sofa, this high-ceilinged, 100-year-old warehouse space sports tall windows that stream with sunlight. If you love the elegance, fun & buzz of downtown Savannah, Ellis Square Place is for you. Please note that because of its central location you will hear people having fun on the streets--especially weekends. Parking not included. SVR-00661 The space Inside the well-appointed apartment building equipped with an elevator, sunlight streams through tall windows, into a high-ceilinged 100 year old warehouse space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006903556641191244,"social_amenities":0.9936331510543823,"party_restriction":0.9442384839057922,"nearby_nightlife":0.030607815831899643}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet and closet Entertainment 50 inch HDTV with Amazon Prime Video, Hulu, Netflix, standard cable Books and reading material Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen","section":"AMENITIES","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028651353204622865,"social_amenities":0.003800300182774663,"party_restriction":0.00044985717977397144,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006185073289088905}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Fall for the charm of this loft-style flat with gleaming wood floors, brick walls, & a view of historic Savannah. With an elevator, king bed & pull-out sofa, this high-ceilinged, 100-year-old warehouse space sports tall windows that stream with sunlight. If you love the elegance, fun & buzz of downtown Savannah, Ellis Square Place is for you. Please note that because of its central location you will hear people having fun on the streets--especially weekends. Parking not included. SVR-00661 The space Inside the well-appointed apartment building equipped with an elevator, sunlight streams through tall windows, into a high-ceilinged 100 year old warehouse space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006903556641191244,"social