Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"47329439","title":"Broughton+Barnard Loft: Parking Pass and Views!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/47329439","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02046"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"47329439","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1454d54e09609ca3cc4e9ff2b05e33f9bca60e4017cc4bd1ebec07bf72c92ece","chunks":8,"words":765,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004260449204593897,"party_welcome":0.000565366237424314,"social_amenities":0.004260449204593897,"party_restriction":0.005157602019608021,"nearby_nightlife":0.9706502556800842,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet and dresser Entertainment TV with Roku Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013973331078886986,"social_amenities":0.004260449204593897,"party_restriction":0.00019068349502049387,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008755616145208478}},{"text":"We know that parking in downtown Savannah can be challenging, and that is why we provide a parking pass for you for a secure parking deck very close to the apartment. We want to make things as easy as possible for you during your stay. **The pass gives you 24 hour access to the Robinson Parking Garage, but there is not an assigned or guaranteed spot. All parking is based on availability. You will need the pass to enter and to exit the deck.** Please note that this condo gives you great access to the heart of downtown.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019497983157634735,"social_amenities":0.003860450815409422,"party_restriction":0.003184004221111536,"nearby_nightlife":0.008860117755830288}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Because of its central location, there is city noise that will filter up from the street. You will find this in any residence that is in the downtown area. We provide a white noise machine to help drown out the city sounds if you're a light sleeper. If you think you might be bothered by this during your stay, the downtown area may not be the spot for you. However, if what you are looking for is an exciting place to hang your hat while you see and do all you can on your weekend away, this is a great home for you during your visit to Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000565366237424314,"social_amenities":0.0029330432880669832,"party_restriction":0.005157602019608021,"nearby_nightlife":0.4366898834705353}},{"text":"Welcome to the Broughton+Barnard Loft! This is as centrally located as you can get in Savannah. Steps from Ellis Square and the City Market, and with views down Broughton Street, Savannah's main drag for shopping and night life, Broughton + Barnard Loft puts you in the best possible spot to take advantage of downtown living in Savannah, Georgia. **We provide a parking pass for a parking deck one block from the condo to make your stay a little easier. This is good for one vehicle.** SVR02046 The space Cool, clean, and comfortable, Broughton + Barnard Loft is a one bedroom condo that provides you unparalleled access to Historic Downtown Savannah.","sect