temarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015339351375587285,"social_amenities":0.5526423454284668,"party_restriction":0.0006935842684470117,"nearby_nightlife":0.001360154477879405}},{"text":"Which of our Savannah vacation rentals will be the one you return to for every Savannah vacation? This property comes with 1 parking pass to park at the Whitaker Street Parking Garage, located at 7 Whitaker St. The garage entrance clearance on the first floor is 7 feet. Guest access This property comes with 1 parking pass to park at the Whitaker Street Parking Garage, located at 7 Whitaker St. The garage entrance clearance on the first floor is 7 feet. 2 Bedrooms 1 King-Sized Bedroom 1 Queen Bed 2 Full Bathrooms Large Flat Screen TV Standing Showers Foosball Table Breakfast Bar Washer/Dryer Dishwasher Central Heat/Air Conditioning Walk Everywhere Wi-Fi","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005542300641536713,"social_amenities":0.03165808320045471,"party_restriction":0.02105603739619255,"nearby_nightlife":0.05240263789892197}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Which of our Savannah vacation rentals will be the one you return to for every Savannah vacation? This property comes with 1 parking pass to park at the Whitaker Street Parking Garage, located at 7 Whitaker St. The garage entrance clearance on the first floor is 7 feet. Guest access This property comes with 1 parking pass to park at the Whitaker Street Parking Garage, located at 7 Whitaker St. The garage entrance clearance on the first floor is 7 feet. 2 Bedrooms 1 King-Sized Bedroom 1 Queen Bed 2 Full Bathrooms Large Flat Screen TV Standing Showers Foosball Table Breakfast Bar Washer/Dryer Dishwasher Central Heat/Air Conditioning Walk Everywhere Wi-Fi","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005542300641536713,"social_amenities":0.03165808320045471,"party_restriction":0.02105603739619255,"nearby_nightlife":0.05240263789892197}},{"text":"Another option is to use the free Chatham Area Transit through the Historic District. If you prefer more organized sight seeing, there are a number of tours available, from general carriage tours, or the trolley tour, or more specific tours such as Civil War, Ghost or Architecture Tours. Do you want to feel right at home during your stay in Savannah? Then call Southern Belle today to reserve one of our beautiful Savannah vacation homes. With vacation rentals Savannah GA, you have more privacy and more room than you would at a hotel, but also with all of the amenities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024029002815950662,"social_amenities":0.0070432196371257305,"party_restriction":0.0032284168992191553,"nearby_nightlife":0.03289198875427246}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The bedrooms continue the brick and wood theme and the beds are comfortably made with soft linens. One of the bathrooms features a standing shower, and double sinks. This historic home seamlessly blends both Old World style with many contemporary touches, giving guests a unique experience even among our wide variety of vacation rentals Savannah GA. The great location of this property is another one of its perks. Sitting right on Bernard Street, you're only a short walk away from Ellis Square and all the popular attractions of Broughton Street. There are several restaurants nearby, including the Jazz'd Tapas Bar, Alligator Soul, The Jinx and Alleycat Lounge.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018767408619169146,"social_amenities":0.0017833190504461527,"party_restriction":0.001107027754187584,"nearby_nightlife":0.9740420579910278}},{"text":"The City Market, American Prohibition Museum, several art galleries and even more restaurants are located slightly to the west and north. If you head east, you'll find the Paula Deen store and her well-known restaurant, the Lady and Sons. To the south is Broughton Street, Telfair Square, the Jepson Center for the Arts and the Telfair Museums. The many squares and parks in Savannah are popular tourist spots and part of this city's historic charm. The two squares near Broughton Corner Loft were laid out in 1733. Ellis Square was named after the second royal governor of the then-Georgia colony.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007469808333553374,"social_amenities":0.0008661435567773879,"party_restriction":0.0010990975424647331,"nearby_nightlife":0.9694830179214478}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 14303","address":"202 W BROUGHTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"12699019","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/12699019","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01821"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"12699019","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"68b6cc89df558b060e91858fe4a3cf36c549f984df6071f5969643da3d82afe7","chunks":11,"words":1077,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.0032058446668088436,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.003203724278137088,"n