ix, the Loft makes a wonderful place to entertain, relax or just sit and contemplate your life, your present and your future. When you\u2019re tired of doing that, sit in the oversized comfy sofa or arm chair and watch a great show on the large flat screen TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0032058446668088436,"social_amenities":0.0012495951959863305,"party_restriction":0.00020377580949570984,"nearby_nightlife":0.020151931792497635}},{"text":"Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":207,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004290117067284882,"social_amenities":0.011192608624696732,"party_restriction":0.001280955970287323,"nearby_nightlife":0.00042070267954841256}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":207,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004290117067284882,"social_amenities":0.011192608624696732,"party_restriction":0.001280955970287323,"nearby_nightlife":0.00042070267954841256}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-01821 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.594711835030466e-05,"social_amenities":0.003823447972536087,"party_restriction":0.003203724278137088,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011299456236883998}},{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"But if none of the dining options on Barnard seem appetizing, not to worry, your home away from home is just 3 blocks away from the famed River Street, the hub of the savannah downtown area. The Ellis Square Loft has wonderful views and offers a parking pass for the nearby parking garage on Whitaker St for any guest staying in the home. This is one of the Savannah GA vacation rentals that puts you right in the middle of things.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022068776888772845,"social_amenities":0.004700422286987305,"party_restriction":0.00166280847042799,"nearby_nightlife":0.7130125164985657}},{"text":"Equipped with a luxurious and inviting queen-size bed and don\u2019t worry about entertainment, as the guest bedroom in this savannah downtown 3rd floor apartment also has its own flat screen TV. Even though the bathroom is not adjoining in this bedroom, it is just across the hall. Other modern amenities include a dishwasher, washer and dryer, a bike rack and a building elevator to your floor. But the feature that gives other savannah vacation rental companies envy the most is probably its wonderful location.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031347176991403103,"social_amenities":0.0017719562165439129,"party_restriction":0.0005599657306447625,"nearby_nightlife":0.14190709590911865}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 15017","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #2002","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"ad