a leisurely meal. There is a Keurig coffee pot and K-Cups provided.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0025722745340317488,"social_amenities":0.002868675161153078,"party_restriction":0.00045061143464408815,"nearby_nightlife":0.9581145644187927}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to The Suite Peach on Broughton Street, a luxury boho styled vacation rental waiting for you to enjoy a memorable and cozy home base during your trip. This condo is located on the 2nd floor of a restored 1891 building in the heart of Savannah's downtown Historic District. You'll find original features such as exposed brick walls, beautifully restored hardwood floors, and an unbeatable location that is steps away from high end shopping, Savannah's food scene, and lively nightlife! The space Welcome to The Suite Peach on Broughton Street, a boho styled vacation rental waiting for you to enjoy a memorable and cozy home base during your trip!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029051961610093713,"social_amenities":0.21511901915073395,"party_restriction":0.006230833474546671,"nearby_nightlife":0.6184582114219666}},{"text":"Board games and a record player are provided for extra fun! Don't miss the opportunity to experience Savannah in style and comfort. We can't wait for you to stroll around the Historic District in our stylish bike cruisers. Bike locks are provided, but not helmets. Book your stay in our historic luxury condo today and create lasting memories in this enchanting city and discover the magic of Savannah from the comfort of our luxurious condo. We look forward to hosting you and ensuring your stay is nothing short of extraordinary! SVR 02364 Guest access Guests will enjoy exclusive access to the entire private condo for the duration of their stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001959495944902301,"social_amenities":0.018449246883392334,"party_restriction":0.0018266558181494474