tle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster","section":"AMENITIES","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016956459148786962,"social_amenities":0.008069751784205437,"party_restriction":0.0001749223592923954,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011623866157606244}},{"text":"An open-concept layout seamlessly blends the kitchen, dining, and living areas, all anchored by striking dark-washed brick walls. The kitchen boasts floor-to-ceiling cabinets, a full suite of premium appliances, and everything you need to prepare gourmet meals, brew a perfect cup of coffee, or mix a craft cocktail. The living space offers an oversized pull-out sofa and a luxurious high-end massage chair\u2014ideal for unwinding after exploring the vibrant streets of Savannah. Between modern slatted walls, you'll find a large smart TV, perfect for streaming your favorite shows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004241782007738948,"social_amenities":0.0018197012832388282,"party_restriction":0.0002986851613968611,"nearby_nightlife":0.1429779976606369}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Located on iconic Broughton St. in the heart of Savannah, The Broughton Noir blends modern elegance with historic charm. Perfect for up to four guests, it features a plush queen bed and a comfortable pull-out sofa. Recently updated, the loft boasts high-end amenities in a sleek, moody design. Immerse yourself in Savannah\u2019s vibrant downtown, with dining, shopping, and top attractions just steps away. Experience the perfect mix of style, comfort, and convenience in this exceptional space. The space SVR-03048 Step into this beautifully renovated loft, where modern sophistication meets historic charm. The sleek, moody ambiance invites you to relax in style.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005531217902898788,"social_amenities":0.15841834247112274,"party_restriction":0.0009767231531441212,"nearby_nightlife":0.9661597013473511}},{"text":"An open-concept layout seamlessly blends the kitchen, dining, and living areas, all anchored by striking dark-washed brick walls. The kitchen boasts floor-to-ceiling cabinets, a full suite of premium appliances, and everything you need to prepare gourmet meals, brew a perfect cup of coffee, or mix a craft cocktail. The living space offers an oversized pull-out sofa and a luxurious high-end massage chair\u2014ideal for unwinding after exploring the vibrant streets of Savannah. Between modern slatted walls, you'll find a large smart TV, perfect for streaming your favorite shows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004241782007738948,"social_amenities":0.0018197012832388282,"party_restriction":0.0002986851613968611,"nearby_nightlife":0.1429779976606369}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Located on iconic Broughton St. in the heart of Savannah, The Broughton Noir blends modern elegance with historic charm. Perfect for up to four guests, it features a plush queen bed and a comfortable pull-out sofa. Recently updated, the loft boasts high-end amenities in a sleek, moody design. Immerse yourself in Savannah\u2019s vibrant downtown, with dining, shopping, and top attractions just steps away. Experience the perfect mix of style, comfort, and convenience in this exceptional space. The space SVR-03048 Step into this beautifully renovated loft, where modern sophistication meets historic charm. The sleek, moody ambiance invites you to relax in style.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005531217902898788,"social_amenities":0.15841834247112274,"party_restriction":0.0009767231531441212,"nearby_nightlife":0.9661597013473511}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster","section":"AMENITIES","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016956459148786962,"social_amenities":0.008069751784205437,"party_restriction":0.0001749223592923954,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011623866157606244}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"In the cozy ensuite bedroom, a plush queen mattress with fresh linens and soft pillows ensures restful nights, while the dark-washed brick and tasteful d\u00e9cor add a calming, refined touch. The bathroom features a low-entry shower, chic vanity, and all essentials, including towels, shampoo, body wash, and a hair dryer\u2014everything you need for a truly indulgent stay. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. NO PETS. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation are permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke in the property. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012642814544960856,"social_amenities":0.0010827708756551147,"party_restriction":0.9982737302780151,"nearby_nightlife":0.5665712952613831}},{"text":"Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the studio with respect, as if it was your own property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011319302575429901,"social_amenities":0.0009169495897367597,"party_restriction":0.0014147802721709013,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002712598361540586}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located on iconic Broughton St. in the heart of Savannah, The Broughton Noir blends mod