ed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Shampoo Shampoo","section":"AMENITIES","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003299582749605179,"social_amenities":0.0046081081964075565,"party_restriction":0.0017667834181338549,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032576516969129443}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This updated, modern 1BR/1BA loft is located in the most beautiful area of Savannah, Georgia. The space is conveniently located steps away from Savannah's most popular shops and is about a 5 minute walk to River Street and Plant Riverside. With hardwood floors, granite counter tops, exposed brick and new renovations, it is a luxurious home away from home. *We also have two other units next to this one to accommodate larger groups!* STVR Certificate # SVR-02888 The space Highlights include an ensuite master bedroom, an open floor plan, stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, exposed brick walls, ample storage and much more. We also have an en-suite washer and dryer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00234246370382607,"social_amenities":0.002199293579906225,"party_restriction":0.0010036453604698181,"nearby_nightlife":0.005540971178561449}},{"text":"The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Paid parking off premises Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Shampoo Shampoo","section":"AMENITIES","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003299582749605179,"social_amenities":0.0046081081964075565,"party_restriction":0.0017667834181338549,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032576516969129443}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditi