avannah in this amazing space and location! STVR Certificate # SVR- 02884 The space You will have access to the entire loft. It is not a shared space. Other things to note There is no on-site parking.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034159127972088754,"social_amenities":0.0005749574047513306,"party_restriction":0.0006134329596534371,"nearby_nightlife":0.16321353614330292}},{"text":"All parking is paid offsite. I would recommend parking at The Robinson Parking Garage. It is only .10 of a mile from the building entrance and very affordable. ***Please note we require all guests to submit a valid form of ID through our check in form prior to check in. If you do not submit the ID we will not be able to send you check in instructions.*** Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014419110084418207,"social_amenities":0.0005014913622289896,"party_restriction":0.0015492875827476382,"nearby_nightlife":0.030333084985613823}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 15039","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #3009","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"45994163","title":"Epic Location Broughton Street Condo Walkable","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45994163","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02190"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"45994163","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d9e4631a89785001fc127a3baa881ad9e05c8e759ba57ec089b6f29f8b9a4310","chunks