ess steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Parking and facilities Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Paid parking lot off premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":133,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028075784211978316,"social_amenities":0.006357967853546143,"party_restriction":0.0014823151286691427,"nearby_nightlife":0.002427828498184681}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Restaurants, bars, and nightlife are just outside your door, particularly on Friday and Saturday evenings, so some city noise should be expected. To help ensure a restful night's sleep, we've provided a sound machine for your comfort. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016714325174689293,"social_amenities":0.0026577154640108347,"party_restriction":0.002061098115518689,"nearby_nightlife":0.9953091740608215}},{"text":"Guests will enjoy exclusive access to the entire condo throughout their stay. Upon arrival, you'll enter through the secure entrance of the historic building before taking the elevator to the top floor. From there, it's just a short walk down the hallway to your private condo entrance. Please note there are two small set of seven to ten stairs in the hallway. Parking is not included with the reservation. Other things to note Because you're staying in the heart of downtown Savannah, you'll experience the vibrant energy that makes this neighborhood so special.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014895702770445496,"social_amenities":0.00020782105275429785,"party_restriction":0.00038475965266115963,"nearby_nightlife":0.254966139793396}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 15040","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #3010","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"12605764","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/12605764","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00482"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"12605764","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d6da56a31d3aee0acaf64d83a98360ed2224bfc2e5b1b12e9a3dad5520247e15","chunks":13,"words":1269,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.09275706112384796,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.006341733504086733,"nearby_nightlife":0.9772737622261047,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":135,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00769770797342062,"social_amenities":0.10421620309352875,"party_restriction":0.000532624137122184,"nearby_nightlife":0.0109676169231534}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The eat-in kitchen is full-size and is fully equipped for whipping up meals for you or a small party should you have the energy for it. Otherwise, a cozy living area is part of the great room furnished with a leather couch, TV and a reading chair by the voluminous windows. Sit and relax as you watch the world go by in your perfect vacation homes Savannah. The bedroom picks up the warm and laid-back aesthetic with wood floors and exposed brick walls. Luxury bedding in cheerful colors give the room a welcoming feel. This room is set off behind heavy drapes, adding to the romantic yet casual atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.09275706112384796,"social_amenities":0.001437954604625702,"party_restriction":0.00021291618759278208,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033778047654777765}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":135,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00769770797342062,"social_amenities":0.10421620309352875,"party_restriction":0.000532624137122184,"nearby_nightlife":0.0109676169231534}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":135,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00769770797342062,"social_amenities":0.10421620309352875,"party_restriction":0.000532624137122184,"nearby_nightlife":0.0109676169231534}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The truth is, finding the right vacation homes Savannah will make a world of difference in enjoying your visit. Accommodations located within walking distance to interesting museums or live performances make it convenient to become part of the city, and live like the locals for a few days. The best approach would be to find Savannah vacation rentals that provide every level of comfort. You can set up housekeeping and turn the place into your new home away from home. The Soho Suite on Broughton Street is one such place. This newly renovated rental is a one-bedroom unit with one full bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006444050814025104,"social_amenities":0.010560579597949982,"party_restriction":0.006341733504086733,"nearby_nightlife":0.8363413214683533}},{"text":"Prominent residents who made Savannah famous are buried in Colonial Park Cemetery established during English Colonial times and the Bonaventure Cemetery. Savannah is synonymous with grand mansions, some of which have been lovingly maintained as public spaces. These homes include the Davenport House Museum, Judith Gordon Low's home and the Mercer William's House made famous by the movie \"Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil,\" based on a John Berendt novel. After all that, be part of modern Savannah by exploring the art installations or watching cultural performances at the Savannah College of Art and Design.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046898011351004243,"social_amenities":0.001117210485972464,"party_restriction":0.00483305100351572,"nearby_nightlife":0.04019007086753845}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The Savannah Civic Center and the Jepson Center for the Arts are within a few blocks from Savannah vacation rentals on Broughton Street. This charming city is best discovered in parts. Plan on staying at vacation homes Savannah where accommodations are homey and relaxed. SVR-00482 Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living Room: Comfortable seating, large flatscreen TV, open floor plan Kitchen: Gourmet modern kitchen, drip coffee maker Bedroom: Queen bed, flatscreen TV Additional sleeping space: Queen-size air mattress Building Amenities: Elevator access Views: Windows overlooking bustling Broughton Street Location: Located in the heart of downtown Savannah near shopping, dining, and nightlife Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002014739002333954,"social_amenities":0.0027465038001537323,"party_restriction":0.000590484996791929,"nearby_nightlife":0.9772737622261047}},{"text":"Experience the charm of downtown Savannah at Soho Suite, a stylish retreat located right on Broughton Street in the heart of the Historic District. This cozy getaway features exposed brick walls, warm wood floors, a full kitchen, spacious living area, and large windows overlooking the city. Walk to Savannah\u2019s famous squares, restaurants, shops, museums, and nightlife, then return home to relax in comfort with modern amenities including a washer and dryer. The space Memorable Georgia Vacations at the Soho Suite Many travelers treat their vacation accommodations as a place to stow their luggage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026793740107677877,"social_amenities":0.002044575521722436,"party_restriction":0.0007783818291500211,"nearby_nightlife":0.8937690258026123}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 15042","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #3012","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"579844218879712032","title":"Old Towne Lo