rtificate # SVR-02889 The space Located on the third floor of the New Broughton Condominiums Building. The building has 2 elevators and staircases. Please note: There are a few sets of small steps in the hallway leading to the unit. 3 Bedrooms Featuring: 1 King Bed 2 Queen Beds 1 Sleeper Sofa (in living room) Amenties: Bluetooth Speaker","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9888843297958374,"social_amenities":0.001553037785924971,"party_restriction":0.00041891224100254476,"nearby_nightlife":0.9690693020820618}},{"text":"In Unit Laundry Keurig Coffee Maker Blow Dryer Full Length Mirror Guest access You will have private access to the unit. Other things to note Parking is paid off - site. The best place to park is The Robinson Garage. It is close by (0.10 of a mile). The fees vary upon ongoing events but can be found on their website. If you are staying for an extended period of time, The City of Savannah offers a visitor pass that allows you to park in any public street spot or city owned garage for a flat fee. Please inquire with the City of Savannah's Visitor Center for more details.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015113588888198137,"social_amenities":0.0012387301540002227,"party_restriction":0.0055742715485394,"nearby_nightlife":0.19391825795173645}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Carbon monoxide alarm Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Parking and facilities Elevator","section":"AMENIT