15045","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #3015A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22770344","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22770344","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01482"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22770344","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e52fb15679da00780761a0ac03495de242004256c296f0d211506cbd7f22ecb5","chunks":16,"words":1617,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9118344783782959,"party_welcome":0.02464994043111801,"social_amenities":0.9468860030174255,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9852226376533508,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This property comes equipped with many features that help to make it an ideal place to stay when visiting Savannah. The home has two queen beds. Flat-screen televisions are located in the bedrooms and bathroom. Guests can enjoy WiFi when staying here. Of course, the home's gourmet kitchen, open floor plan and location right in the heart of downtown move it right to the top of the list of the best places to stay in Savannah. How to Spend Your Time While Staying at Broughton Hideaway Broughton Hideaway is a loft-style beauty that truly puts the best that Savannah has to offer right at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002687321975827217,"social_amenities":0.9118344783782959,"party_restriction":0.03494126349687576,"nearby_nightlife":0.026931479573249817}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Broughton Hideaway is definitely a spot to consider whether you're coming to admire Savannah's splendid architecture and lush, fountain-filled parks or you're planning to experience Bacon Fest, the Savannah Craft Brew Festival, the Pin Point Seafood Festival, the Savannah Film Festival or the Telfair Art Fair. Guest access 2 Queen Beds Bedroom Flatscreen TV Livingroom Flatscreen TV Gourmet, Modern Kitchen Open Floor Plan In the Middle of the Downtown Action Wifi Washer/Dryer in Unit Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.02464994043111801,"social_amenities":0.005484042223542929,"party_restriction":0.0002941405400633812,"nearby_nightlife":0.7447220683097839}},{"text":"Visiting River Street is essential if you really want to tap into the heart of Savannah and participate in some of the best festivals and cultural events hosted by the city throughout the year. River Street is also home to some of the best pubs, nightclubs and boutiques that you'll find in Savannah. Find Your Little Piece of Savannah in Broughton Hideaway Staying in a great place like Broughton Hideaway offers a fun and convenient way to put Savannah at your fingertips. Spending time relaxing inside this updated loft-style property is almost as fun as going out and enjoying all of the magic of this Southern city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01512390747666359,"social_amenities":0.04421709105372429,"party_restriction":0.0015111471293494105,"nearby_nightlife":0.9852226376533508}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"You'll find everything from vintage clothing shops to high-end furniture stores. There are also tons of high-end markets and boutiques to enjoy. Of course, you wouldn't want to spend an afternoon shopping along Broughton Street without stopping at a place like Leopold's Ice Cream to enjoy its marble soda fountain and traditional-style ice cream. Broughton Street isn't just an amazing place to stay because of all the great attractions it offers. It's also a great place to stay because it offers such easy access to the rest of the top attractions that are peppered throughout Savannah's iconic streets. Making Your Way Around Savannah When Staying at a Vacation Rental House","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006178852054290473,"social_amenities":0.9468860030174255,"party_restriction":0.004918903112411499,"nearby_nightlife":0.9764388799667358}},{"text":"This property comes equipped with many features that help to make it an ideal place to stay when visiting Savannah. The home has two queen beds. Flat-screen televisions are located in the bedrooms and bathroom. Guests can enjoy WiFi when staying here. Of course, the home's gourmet kitchen, open floor plan and location right in the heart of downtown move it right to the top of the list of the best places to stay in Savannah. How to Spend Your Time While Staying at Broughton Hideaway Broughton Hideaway is a loft-style beauty that truly puts the best that Savannah has to offer right at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002687321975827217,"social_amenities":0.9118344783782959,"party_restriction":0.03494126349687576,"nearby_nightlife":0.026931479573249817}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"This property comes equipped with many features that help to make it an ideal place to stay when visiting Savannah. The home has two queen beds. Flat-screen televisions are located in the bedrooms and bathroom. Guests can enjoy WiFi when staying here. Of course, the home's gourmet kitchen, open floor plan and location right in the heart of downtown move it right to the top of the list of the best places to stay in Savannah. How to Spend Your Time While Staying at Broughton Hideaway Broughton Hideaway is a loft-style beauty that truly puts the best that Savannah has to offer right at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002687321975827217,"social_amenities":0.9118344783782959,"party_restriction":0.03494126349687576,"nearby_nightlife":0.026931479573249817}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Visiting River Street is essential if you really want to tap into the heart of Savannah and participate in some of the best festivals and cultural events hosted by the city throughout the year. River Street is also home to some of the best pubs, nightclubs and boutiques that you'll find in Savannah. Find Your Little Piece of Savannah in Broughton Hideaway Staying in a great place like Broughton Hideaway offers a fun and convenient way to put Savannah at your fingertips. Spending time relaxing inside this updated loft-style property is almost as fun as going out and enjoying all of the magic of this Southern city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01512390747666359,"social_amenities":0.04421709105372429,"party_restriction":0.0015111471293494105,"nearby_nightlife":0.9852226376533508}},{"text":"You'll find everything from vintage clothing shops to high-end furniture stores. There are also tons of high-end markets and boutiques to enjoy. Of course, you wouldn't want to spend an afternoon shopping along Broughton Street without stopping at a place like Leopold's Ice Cream to enjoy its marble soda fountain and traditional-style ice cream. Broughton Street isn't just an amazing place to stay because of all the great attractions it offers. It's also a great place to stay because it offers such easy access to the rest of the top attractions that are peppered throughout Savannah's iconic streets. Making Your Way Around Savannah When Staying at a Vacation Rental House","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006178852054290473,"social_amenities":0.9468860030174255,"party_restriction":0.004918903112411499,"nearby_nightlife":0.9764388799667358}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 15046","address":"310 W BROUGHTON ST #3015B","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"25514450","title":"Heated Pool, Broughton Street Rental","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/25514450","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02249"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"25514450","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7f3179b7af07eac7bdbc521a82e2a96d02a9cb10dc5de5efab99c21b57b72e0c","chunks":14,"words":1380,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5505620837211609,"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.9883290529251099,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":199,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007295075338333845,"social_amenities":0.015424602665007114,"party_restriction":0.0017080552643164992,"nearby_nightlife":0.000668875640258193}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Immediately adjacent is the gourmet kitchen, which is outfitted with fully modern appliances, including a stove, microwave and coffee maker. A stylish bar is included in this open floorplan, and it has a sink and four stools. The main bedroom has a comfy king-size bed, and the property also includes laundry machines to make extended stays more convenient. This property also includes an air mattress for that additional sleeping room. One of the best things about our Savannah vacation homes is how you can simply walk outside your door and immediately be a part of the downtown action.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008878708467818797,"social_amenities":0.00671784533187747,"party_restriction":0.0012787934392690659,"nearby_nightlife":0.870129406452179}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Pool Elevator The home or building has an elevator that\u2019s at least 52 inches deep and a doorway at least 32 inches wide Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":199,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007295075338333845,"social_amenities":0.015424602665007114,"party_restriction":0.0017080552643164992,"nearby_nightlife":0.000668875640258193}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-02249 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":139,"scores":{"party_welcome":7.06862992956303e-05,"social_amenities":0.0022113800514489412,"party_restriction":0.005063559859991074,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009696707129478455}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Even though the modern kitchens in our rentals give you the flexibility of cooking in, there are always nearby restaurants as well. This property is close to VinnieVanGoGo's casual pizza joint and beer, Bella Napoli Italian Bistro, The Olde Pink House and the Grey. The latter two restaurants are famous spots in Savannah serving delicious Southern fare. Walking the streets of Savannah is typically the best way to get around, but you can also enlist the services of the Chatham Area Transit in the downtown area, or you can hop on a tour.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020684744231402874,"social_amenities":0.0016578953946009278,"party_restriction":0.002595693338662386,"nearby_nightlife":0.9883290529251099}},{"text":"Tybee Island is a popular destination for our Savannah guests, and it's easy to see why. Spend a day lounging on the beach, or visit the lighthouse at the north end of the island, or book a charter to explore the waters, watch dolphins, or catch fish. The activities on Tybee Island are almost as endless as Savannah itself. Atlantic beaches are located on the east side of the island, and the river beaches are located on the west side. SVR-02249 Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living room with plush sofa, area rug, wood floors, and large flatscreen TV Air mattress available for 2 additional guests","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006803318974561989,"social_amenities":0.003487606067210436,"party_restriction":0.0014321096241474152,"nearby_nightlife":0.9612764716148376}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20016 25015","address":"227 W BROUGHTON ST #4","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"18404797","title":"City Market Central--Parking Pass included!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/18404797","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00317"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"18404797","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"5da5c4ceb7047c653e31e9e492ecf9b29218e9266bceaa651de2088c941bf657","chunks":6,"words":556,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004546521697193384,"party_welcome":0.0007145219133235514,"social_amenities":0.004546521697193384,"party_restriction":0.005177075043320656,"nearby_nightlife":0.9376434087753296,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015364499995484948,"social_amenities":0.004546521697193384,"party_restriction":0.00020239230070728809,"nearby_nightlife":0.00047030209680087864}},{"text":"And we know that parking in downtown Savannah can be challenging, and that is why we provide a parking pass for you for a secure parking deck very close to the apartment. We want to make things as easy as possible for you during your stay. **The pass gives you 24 hour access to the Robinson Parking Garage, but there is not an assigned or guaranteed spot. All parking is based on availability. **You will need the pass to enter and to exit the deck.** Guest access The apartment is private and at your complete disposal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012053591490257531,"social_amenities":0.0030149349477142096,"party_restriction":0.0019938754849135876,"nearby_nightlife":0.0057261292822659016}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Full kitchen with appointments, wine fridge, spacious bedrooms with storage, and beautiful afternoon light from the west facing windows to relax in while kicking your feet up before the evening begins. Downtown Savannah is a vibrant, exciting town, and there is action all the time. Our place gives you direct and immediate access to all that the downtown has to offer. The apartment is on the second floor, accessible by staircase. You can wander, pop in for a break, and head back out without ever thinking about getting in a car.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007145219133235514,"social_amenities":0.0010746292537078261,"party_restriction":0.0009324112324975431,"nearby_nightlife":0.5329720377922058}},{"text":"City Market Central is your access to the heart of downtown Savannah, right in the center of the shopping, the nightlife, the restaurants, the history and the hustle. Throw your car keys away, you're not going to need them. City Market Central is ready to be your landing pad in the First City. **We provide a parking pass for a parking deck one block from the condo to make your stay a little easier. This is good for one vehicle.** SVR-00317 The space We have everything you need to make yourself at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004928278503939509,"social_amenities":0.0028925444930791855,"party_restriction":0.0039762090891599655,"nearby_nightlife":0.9376434087753296}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015364499995484948,"social_amenities":0.004546521697193384,"party_restriction":0.00020239230070728809,"nearby_nightlife":0.00047030209680087864}},{"text":"And we know that parking in downtown Savannah can be challenging, and that is why we provide a parking pass for you for a secure parking deck very close to the apartment. We want to make things as easy as possible for you during your stay. **The pass gives you 24 hour access to the Robinson Parking Garage, but there is not an assigned or guaranteed spot. All parking is based on availability. **You will need the pass to enter and to exit the deck.** Guest access The apartment is private and at your complete disposal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012053591490257531,"social_amenities":0.0030149349477142096,"party_restriction":0.0019938754849135876,"nearby_nightlife":0.0057261292822659016}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There is room in the closets, drawers, and bathroom shelves for you to unpack and spread out. Other things to note The apartment is in the heart of downtown. If you are not used to city sounds during the night, it can be noticeable. We provide white noise machines for those who would like them, but please understand, there can be street noise at times. We hope that you will enjoy the immediate and untrammeled access to all that the downtown has to offer. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044339423766359687,"social_amenities":0.0024556561838835478,"party_restriction":0.005177075043320656,"nearby_nightlife":0.24014529585838318}},{"text":"City Market Central is your access to the heart of downtown Savannah, right in the center of the shopping, the nightlife, the restaurants, the history and the hustle. Throw your car keys away, you're not going to need them. City Market Central is ready to be your landing pad in th