{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007950038998387754,"social_amenities":0.03550466522574425,"party_restriction":0.001776609686203301,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003768122405745089}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Enjoy elevated Southern cuisine at The Public Kitchen, experience a true Savannah institution at Mrs. Wilkes' Dining Room, or grab a casual meal and local beer at Crystal Beer Parlor. For evening cocktails, nearby favorites include Artillery Bar, Peregrin Rooftop, and McDonough's, each offering its own distinct Savannah atmosphere. No matter the season, Savannah offers something special for visitors. Spring brings blooming azaleas, the world-famous St. Patrick's Day celebration, and the Savannah Music Festival. Summer invites guests to enjoy evening walks beneath moss-covered oaks, waterfront dining, and Fourth of July festivities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8914097547531128,"social_amenities":0.008450743742287159,"party_restriction":0.005086580291390419,"nearby_nightlife":0.9978475570678711}},{"text":"Fall brings cooler temperatures and beloved annual events such as the Savannah Jazz Festival, SCAD Film Festival, and Savannah Book Festival. During the winter months, visitors can experience the charm of Savannah Holly Days, the Lighted Boat Parade, and the festive River Street Christmas Market. Whether your ideal Savannah getaway includes historic tours, ghost walks, museum visits, shopping excursions, architecture tours, fine dining, or simply slowing down and enjoying the beauty of the city, Bird Baldwin Magnolia provides the perfect home base.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01050539594143629,"social_amenities":0.009530890733003616,"party_restriction":0.0014519540127366781,"nearby_nightlife":0.262732595205307}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining t