nnah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":163,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"9.Stop at the Mercer Williams House Museum, which was the featured house in the \"Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil\" book. 10.Browse the Telfair Museum of Art to see 4,500 pieces of art from the 19th and 20th centuries. Even though you'll find plenty to do on a regular day in Savannah, the city also hosts a range of special events and celebrations throughout the year. Just ask us for a current schedule. Here's a sample list: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.2578592300415039,"social_amenities":0.001644643722102046,"party_restriction":0.0037171037402004004,"nearby_nightlife":0.9075639247894287}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Stroll through the 30 acres of greenery, visit the Forsyth Fountain and take a look at the three century old Candler Oak Tree. 2.Take a history tour. Savannah is known for its living history and you can explore it through a guided tour like Old Town Trolley tours or Old Savannah Tours. If you're after something spookier, try Blue Orb Savannah Ghost Tours. 3.Visit the City Market. Walk through four blocks of restaurants, boutiques, galleries and places to catch some nightlife. 4.Visit the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist. You'll find it overlooking Lafayette Square with its Gothic architecture. 5.Tour Bonaventure Cemetery.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015589598333463073,"social_amenities":0.0018992696423083544,"party_restriction":0.0010728288907557726,"nearby_nightlife":0.989048957824707}},{"text":"\u2022 Saint Patrick\u2019s Day in Savannah in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 NOGS Tour of Homes and Gardens in April \u2022 Liberty Mutual Legends of Golf, PGA Champions Tour in April \u2022 Savannah Scottish Games in May \u2022 Savannah Shakespeare Festival in May \u2022 Blues, Jazz & BBQ in June \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Fourth of July on the River in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Oktoberfest in October \u2022 Savannah Film Festival in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.853263258934021,"social_amenities":0.0024280145298689604,"party_restriction":0.0014813471352681518,"nearby_nightlife":0.9801687002182007}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20031 16018","address":"201 W LIBERTY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"12588001","title":"Historic Charm, Private Parking, Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/12588001","guests":2