7a8c21af8ce8da4850","chunks":13,"words":1221,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.7801691889762878,"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.4615388512611389,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":171,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006036320119164884,"social_amenities":0.3965202569961548,"party_restriction":0.002380471210926771,"nearby_nightlife":0.000909301161300391}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"This bright, open kitchen has white cabinetry and glowing marble counters. You\u2019ll love staring out a large window as you stand at the kitchen\u2019s farmhouse sink to rinse dishes. A horseshoe-shaped layout ensures that you can keep a conversation with guests at the dining table as you whip up a Southern meal to remember. In addition, seated counters offer plenty of room for friends or family to gather around as you tend to business in the kitchen. Stunning wood floors throughout the home add a touch of country that will make you feel cozy.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014752544229850173,"social_amenities":0.0011888064909726381,"party_restriction":0.00012973013508599252,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019679160322993994}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":171,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006036320119164884,"social_amenities":0.3965202569961548,"party_restriction":0.002380471210926771,"nearby_nightlife":0.000909301161300391}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"In addition, the second floor features a large bathroom with a tub and shower. The home features two full bathrooms and one half bathroom in total. If you\u2019re looking for a sweet Southern getaway, make the Peach State feel like you're home away from home by staying in one of the vacation homes Savannah visitors can truly feel cozy in. The Wonders of the Historic District It doesn\u2019t get much better than the Historic District when you\u2019re looking for incredible places to stay while visiting Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036969766370020807,"social_amenities":0.008676674216985703,"party_restriction":0.0058688088320195675,"nearby_nightlife":0.012757510878145695}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"All the special landmarks and amazing parks that make Georgia vacations so memorable will be right at your fingertips when you make this neighborhood your home for a few nights. Some of the popular landmarks that are just a few steps away from the home include the Green-Meldrim Home, Chippewa Square, Forsyth Park and the Juliette Gordon Low Birthplace. Any savvy traveler will tell you that Georgia vacations just aren't complete if they don't include Savannah. The city is home to 22 historic squares that rival anything you'll find in Europe's iconic cities. The city's rich history also speaks through its historic cemeteries.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001928373530972749,"social_amenities":0.003000698983669281,"party_restriction":0.00088690867414698,"nearby_nightlife":0.4615388512611389}},{"text":"The graves at well-known attractions like Colonial Park Cemetery, Bonaventure Cemetery and Laurel Grove Cemetery serve as the final resting places for English settlers, Confederate soldiers and African American slaves. In addition to popular landmarks right near the Historic District, you'll be able to easily get to Wormsloe Plantation and the Telfair Museum of Art. Of course, Abercorn Common, Oglethorpe Mall and Abercorn Walk are the best shopping centers in the city. Of all the vacation homes Savannah tourists have to choose from, none can set the mood for history, relaxation and adventure quite like this home can. Plan a Trip Unlike Other Georgia Vacations","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001926958211697638,"social_amenities":0.019108613952994347,"party_restriction":0.0014620876172557473,"nearby_nightlife":0.020310603082180023}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20031 21005","address":"224 W CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":5.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24318332443","date":"2024-11-13","type":"42-J THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"333 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20031 21004","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26122126244","date":"2026-05-02","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"331 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20031 21003","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"49604295","title":"Exquisite Designer Estate by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49604295","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-02299"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"49604295","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"926ee75f070c3e7c0d7ddc138477b101fcb53ed4f05c63d25dffa7c68b395af3","chunks":7,"words":531,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9612694382667542,"party_welcome":0.05643657222390175,"social_amenities":0.9612694382667542,"party_restriction":0.0354788675904274,"nearby_nightlife":0.8743436932563782,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Built in 1890, located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughout. The space Located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughout. This exceptional 1890 property, which originally housed a pharmacy and confectionary, includes exquisite period details, including five original fireplaces, crown moldings, original hardwood floors, high ceilings and two covered verandas overlooking Charlton Street. Nestled on a prized corner lot, this home offers incredible natural light, with south and west exposures and designer lighting throughout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00233090715482831,"social_amenities":0.9612694382667542,"party_restriction":0.0354788675904274,"nearby_nightlife":0.009264803491532803}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The main house greets visitors with a spectacular foyer sporting black-and-white checkerboard-patterned marble flooring and grasscloth wallpaper. The parlor level includes a sleek, magnificent open kitchen design with an oversized Carrara marble island, Frigidaire Professional Series stainless steel appliances, custom cabinets, ice maker, private bar area with stainless steel wine chiller and spacious dining room with decorative fireplace. The living room offers a gracious space for relaxing or entertaining and has French doors providing easy access to the covered veranda, with a grand piano for entertaining guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05643657222390175,"social_amenities":0.0037020505405962467,"party_restriction":0.00026518251979723573,"nearby_nightlife":0.5526845455169678}},{"text":"Built in 1890, located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughout. The space Located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughout. This exceptional 1890 property, which originally housed a pharmacy and confectionary, includes exquisite period details, including five original fireplaces, crown moldings, original hardwood floors, high ceilings and two covered verandas overlooking Charlton Street. Nestled on a prized corner lot, this home offers incredible natural light, with south and west exposures and designer lighting throughout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00233090715482831,"social_amenities":0.9612694382667542,"party_restriction":0.0354788675904274,"nearby_nightlife":0.009264803491532803}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Built in 1890, located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughout. The space Located on a quiet street in Savannah\u2019s National Landmark Historic District, this stunning residence was completely renovated and includes designer touches throughou