 property, which originally housed a pharmacy and confectionary, includes exquisite period details, including five original fireplaces, crown moldings, original hardwood floors, high ceilings and two covered verandas overlooking Charlton Street. Nestled on a prized corner lot, this home offers incredible natural light, with south and west exposures and designer lighting throughout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00233090715482831,"social_amenities":0.9612694382667542,"party_restriction":0.0354788675904274,"nearby_nightlife":0.009264803491532803}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"On the second level, a primary suite offers the ultimate in luxury with an oversized bath including a soaking tub, double Carrara marble vanity and tile-and-glass shower. The primary bedroom also includes a decorative fireplace, walk-in closet with built-in storage and French doors that open to a covered terrace. A second en suite bedroom and laundry room with Samsung washer and dryer complete the second floor layout. Located just two short blocks from Savannah's famed Forsyth Park, and just steps away from some of Savannah\u2019s best dining, shopping and activities. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed + Twin Bed What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004665513406507671,"social_amenities":0.0023261960595846176,"party_restriction":0.0012967890361323953,"nearby_nightlife":0.8743436932563782}},{"text":"The main house greets visitors with a spectacular foyer sporting black-and-white checkerboard-patterned marble flooring and grasscloth wallpaper. The parlor level includes a sleek, magnificent open kitchen design with an oversized Carrara marble island, Frigidaire Professional Series stainless steel appliances, custom cabinets, ice maker, private bar area with stainless steel wine chiller and spacious dining room with decorative fireplace. The living room offers a gracious space for relaxing or entertaining and has French doors providing easy access to the covered veranda, with a grand piano for entertaining guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05643657222390175,"social_amenities":0.0037020505405962467,"party_restriction":0.00026518251979723573,"nearby_nightlife":0.5526845455169678}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20031 27003","address":"349 TATTNALL ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25360364921","date":"2025-12-26","type":"53 SHOTS FIRED(heard only)","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"349 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20031 27003","side":"direct"},{"number":"26129133612","date":"2026-05-09","type":"22 Found/Surrendered WEAPON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"349 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20031 27003","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1269877076951783120","title":"Downtown Chic Retreat| Historic Apt at Jones St","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1269877076951783120","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03054"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1269877076951783120","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4567cde5d5da17c7b5abb776b94ea2e114d341bff1e7e6a76d50932575ad3b2d","chunks":9,"words":815,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.012415947392582893,"party_welcome":0.0028127278201282024,"social_amenities":0.012415947392582893,"party_restriction":0.00808335468173027,"nearby_nightlife":0.8165373206138611,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Book a quintessential Savannah getaway at this meticulously preserved garden apartment. Originally built in 1844 for harbormaster John Low, you will be immersed in Savannah's rich history. Located on the corner of Jones St and Tattnall St, you will be just steps away from Pulaski & Chatham Square, & .4 miles to Forsyth Park. You can stroll down the iconic Jones St with a cup of coffee and you will be in walking distance to all the luxuries of the Historic District. We can't wait to host you! The space Prepare for the most charming stay in Savannah!!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014602373994421214,"social_amenities":0.012415947392582893,"party_restriction":0.0016396967694163322,"nearby_nightlife":0.036965303122997284}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Window guards Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Portable fans Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003247431304771453,"social_amenities":0.009999267756938934,"party_restriction":0.0002682548656594008,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007623763522133231}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"There is a laundry closet with a washer, dryer, iron, and clothing steamer. Located just steps away from Savannah's most iconic squares, parks, and attractions, this home puts you within walking distance of the city\u2019s best dining, shopping, and historic sights. Located just three blocks from the Savannah Civic Center, convenient to the new Enmarket Arena. Whether you're strolling through Forsyth Park, exploring local art galleries, or indulging in Southern cuisine, everything is just moments away. We can't wait to host you! SVR - 03054 Guest access Guests will have full access to the lower apartment on the ground floor of the house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0028127278201282024,"social_amenities":0.003010943066328764,"party_restriction":0.00037034560227766633,"nearby_nightlife":0.8165373206138611}},{"text":"The apartment has one full bathroom that has been recently updated with stunning marble tiles through out. Plush bath towels are provided for guest use. The living room sofa does open into a full size sleeper sofa. Sheets, pillows and blankets are provided. There is a 40in TV with Roku and wifi included. Cable is provided through the Xfinity streaming app. There is a designated work area as well. The apartment is best suited for 3 guests, but can hold up to a max of 4. Please note that there is not a door closing off the bedroom to the main living areas.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006143703358247876,"social_amenities":0.00942143239080906,"party_restriction":0.001970650628209114,"nearby_nightlife":0.002923178719356656}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Book a quintessential Savannah getaway at this meticulously preserved garden apartment. Originally built in 1844 for harbormaster John Low, you will be immersed in Savannah's rich history. Located on the corner of Jones St and Tattnall St, you will be just steps away from Pulaski & Chatham Square, & .4 miles to Forsyth Park. You can stroll down the iconic Jones St with a cup of coffee and you will be in walking distance to all the luxuries of the Historic District. We can't wait to host you! The space Prepare for the most charming stay in Savannah!!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014602373994421214,"social_amenities":0.012415947392582893,"party_restriction":0.0016396967694163322,"nearby_nightlife":0.036965303122997284}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Window guards Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Portable fans Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003247431304771453,"social_amenities":0.009999267756938934,"party_restriction":0.0002682548656594008,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007623763522133231}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"If you are super sensitive to noise this may not be the best rental option for you. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003545407671481371,"social_amenities":0.004947011359035969,"party_restriction":0.00808335468173027,"nearby_nightlife":0.006444926373660564}},{"text":"There are some city noises such as trash trucks, ship horns, sirens, trains and vehicle traffic that you may not be accustomed to. We do provide a sound machine for you just in case. Guests should also know that rental is just the lower level of the house. There are 