em. The property has fast WiFi throughout. Cable will no longer be available as of 1/1/26. SVR-00968 Guest access There is rear access to the courtyard that is a shared space with the upstairs neighbors. There is metered street parking available surrounding the apartment and also a city garage just a short walk (a couple blocks) away. Street parking can be paid through the ParkSavannah app and is free 5pm - 8am and free on Saturdays and Sundays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002764186938293278,"social_amenities":0.0016935395542532206,"party_restriction":0.0013559147482737899,"nearby_nightlife":0.06640971451997757}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The parlor has a flat-screen TV withApple TV, streaming services and stereo sound system. The property has fast WiFi throughout. Cable will no longer be available as of 1/1/26. SVR-00968 Guest access There is rear access to the courtyard that is a shared space with the upstairs neighbors. There is metered street parking available surrounding the apartment and also a city garage just a short walk (a couple blocks) away. Street parking can be paid through the ParkSavannah app and is free 5pm - 8am and free on Saturdays and Sundays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002764186938293278,"social_amenities":0.0016935395542532206,"party_restriction":0.0013559147482737899,"nearby_nightlife":0.06640971451997757}},{"text":"Street sweepers do come through at night and you will want to check the street signs to see when to avoid any tickets. Other things to note The rental is located in the heart of downtown, yet on a more residential street. There are some city noises such as trash trucks, ship horns, sirens, trains and vehicle traffic that you may not be accustomed to. Guests should also know that lower level apartment of the house is also a rental. The courtyard is shared with the guests in the garden apartment below. As this is an old house, you might hear the neighbors from time to time.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010089606803376228,"social_amenities":0.0010456343879923224,"party_restriction":0.0016067965188995004,"nearby_nightlife":0.018344152718782425}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20031 28001","address":"201 W CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":18.0,"advertised_guests":16.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24313326945","date":"2024-11-08","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"201 W Charlton St","recorded_pin":"20031 28001","side":"direct"},{"number":"26278289100","date":"2026-10-05","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"203 W CHARLTON ST","recorded_pin":"20031 28011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1087832468175602645","title":"Impeccable Luxury Mansion on Pulaski Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1087832468175602645","guests":16.0,"permits":["SVR-02495"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1087832468175602645","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3a4507eecf12d51bec74682270954240405fa15d79c5dbbf1bc7254513cbca91","chunks":10,"words":841,"party_signal":0.9860600233078003,"social_signal":0.9596522450447083,"party_welcome":0.9860600233078003,"social_amenities":0.9596522450447083,"party_restriction":0.021362556144595146,"nearby_nightlife":0.20739734172821045,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Across the enticing courtyard, you'll find a two-story carriage house where the eighth bedroom is located. The space features an inviting living room, where there is a lovely kitchen island with seating for two and a fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances and granite countertops. Right up the staircase you'll find a large bedroom, that is fitted with a plush king bed, custom built-in shelves, and a spacious closet for all of your belongings. Adjacent to the bedroom, you'll find a full-size bathroom with a walk-in shower. Whether you're here for a formal event, or family reunion, Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is the perfect home for your party.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9860600233078003,"social_amenities":0.0038363251369446516,"party_restriction":0.0004203313437756151,"nearby_nightlife":0.02860090509057045},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Whether you're here for a formal event, or family reunion, Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is the perfect home for your party."},{"text":"The grand exterior staircase leads up to the second level entrance, which is deemed the parlor level here in the south. You'll find that the open floor plan on this level is an entertainers dream! The open gathering room and dining room create an inviting and intimate space, perfect for entertaining while enjoying mesmerizing views of Pulaski Square where you'll be transported through time. The kitchen is situated just at the back of the home, with high-end finished and appliances, such as marble countertops, a gas-range, and everything you need to prepare meals. Seven of the bedrooms are spread out amongst the four ravishing levels of the main home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0057158926501870155,"social_amenities":0.0031691198237240314,"party_restriction":0.0002765525714494288,"nearby_nightlife":0.04336327686905861},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The open gathering room and dining room create an inviting and intimate space, perfect for entertaining while enjoying mesmerizing views of Pulaski Square where you'll be transported through time."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is your own private slice of Savannah\u2019s National Historic Landmark District. Built in 1854, this impeccably restored mansion is nestled on quiet Pulaski Square. The space The Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is your own private slice of heaven in Savannah\u2019s National Historic Landmark District. Built in 1854, this impeccably restored mansion is nestled on quiet Pulaski Square. Featuring floor to ceiling windows that boast with natural light, impressive 14-foot ceilings, original moldings and wood floors, you will appreciate the lovingly restored interiors that blend historic charm with modern luxury appointments.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023669957590755075,"social_amenities":0.9596522450447083,"party_restriction":0.021362556144595146,"nearby_nightlife":0.0068343752063810825}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Across the enticing courtyard, you'll find a two-story carriage house where the eighth bedroom is located. The space features an inviting living room, where there is a lovely kitchen island with seating for two and a fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances and granite countertops. Right up the staircase you'll find a large bedroom, that is fitted with a plush king bed, custom built-in shelves, and a spacious closet for all of your belongings. Adjacent to the bedroom, you'll find a full-size bathroom with a walk-in shower. Whether you're here for a formal event, or family reunion, Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is the perfect home for your party.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9860600233078003,"social_amenities":0.0038363251369446516,"party_restriction":0.0004203313437756151,"nearby_nightlife":0.02860090509057045}},{"text":"The grand exterior staircase leads up to the second level entrance, which is deemed the parlor level here in the south. You'll find that the open floor plan on this level is an entertainers dream! The open gathering room and dining room create an inviting and intimate space, perfect for entertaining while enjoying mesmerizing views of Pulaski Square where you'll be transported through time. The kitchen is situated just at the back of the home, with high-end finished and appliances, such as marble countertops, a gas-range, and everything you need to prepare meals. Seven of the bedrooms are spread out amongst the four ravishing levels of the main home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0057158926501870155,"social_amenities":0.0031691198237240314,"party_restriction":0.0002765525714494288,"nearby_nightlife":0.04336327686905861}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is your own private slice of Savannah\u2019s National Historic Landmark District. Built in 1854, this impeccably restored mansion is nestled on quiet Pulaski Square. The space The Bell Mansion on Pulaski Square is your own private slice 