t Pulaski Square. Featuring floor to ceiling windows that boast with natural light, impressive 14-foot ceilings, original moldings and wood floors, you will appreciate the lovingly restored interiors that blend historic charm with modern luxury appointments.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023669957590755075,"social_amenities":0.9596522450447083,"party_restriction":0.021362556144595146,"nearby_nightlife":0.0068343752063810825}},{"text":"Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":124,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004739577416330576,"social_amenities":0.000831205805297941,"party_restriction":0.004250042140483856,"nearby_nightlife":0.006933192722499371}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Start your day of exploration through the squares as you venture down Barnard Street, that leads all the way to the river front. You\u2019ll be a short walk from the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, Forsyth Park, and so many other well known monuments and venues in Savannah. Sleeping Configuration: 3rd Level: Bedroom 1 (Primary Suite): King Bed w/ Ensuite Bedroom 2: King Bed w/ Ensuite 4th Level: Bedroom 3: 2 Twin Beds Bedroom 4: King Bed Bedroom 5: King Bed Bedroom 6: Queen Bed Garden Apartment: Bedroom 7: Queen Bed Carriage House: Bedroom 8: King Bed Parking:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001714121171971783,"social_amenities":0.0025364127941429615,"party_restriction":0.0010107075795531273,"nearby_nightlife":0.20739734172821045}},{"text":"The third floor has two King bedrooms, with luxurious ensuite bathrooms, an ample amount of closet space, and tasteful furnishings. The primary suite faces charming Pulaski Square, with a plush king size bed. Also on this floor, you'll find a small sitting room with a flat screen television and a wet bar with a wine cooler - a great space to hangout! Heading up to the fourth floor four additional bedrooms can be found, where guests will enjoying soaring views of the treelined streets, and two shared full bathrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029356617596931756,"social_amenities":0.00162051513325423,"party_restriction":0.00020345684606581926,"nearby_nightlife":0.1336921751499176}}]}}},{"listing_id":"54273451","title":"Restored Carriage on Pulaski Sq by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54273451","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02494"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"54273451","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f62d8662a363f3910561c0eeb8a258bf2bb1aa107cdf1730f64c716872d03669","chunks":6,"words":459,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007679925765842199,"party_welcome":0.0004739577416330576,"social_amenities":0.556952953338623,"party_restriction":0.009998474270105362,"nearby_nightlife":0.7289814949035645,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"John the Baptist, Forsyth Park, and so many other well known monuments in Savannah. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: King Size Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-02494 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002432572073303163,"social_amenities":0.007679925765842199,"party_restriction":0.007488242816179991,"nearby_nightlife":0.00769480224698782}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with sta