rance, which is deemed the parlor level here in the south. You'll find that the open floor plan on this level is an entertainers dream! The open gathering room and dining room create an inviting and intimate space, perfect for entertaining while enjoying mesmerizing views of Pulaski Square where you'll be transported through time. The kitchen is situated just at the back of the home, with high-end finished and appliances, such as marble countertops, a gas-range, and everything you need to prepare meals. Seven of the bedrooms are spread out amongst the four ravishing levels of the main home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0057158926501870155,"social_amenities":0.0031691198237240314,"party_restriction":0.0002765525714494288,"nearby_nightlife":0.04336327686905861},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The open gathering room and dining room create an inviting and intimate space, perfect for entertaining while enjoying mesmerizing views of Pulaski Square where you'll be transported through time."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This impeccable Mansion is your own private slice of heaven in Savannah\u2019s National Historic Landmark District. Built in 1854, this lovingly restored home is nestled on quiet Pulaski Square. The space Bell Mansion Main + Garden on Pulaski Square is your own private slice of heaven in Savannah\u2019s National Historic Landmark District. Built in 1854, this impeccably restored mansion is nestled on quiet Pulaski Square. Featuring floor to ceiling windows that boast with natural light, impressive 14-foot ceilings, original moldings and wood floors, you will appreciate the lovingly restored interiors that blend historic charm with modern luxury appointments.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020699560991488397,"social_amenities":0.4220212996006012,"party_restriction":0.006907637231051922,"nearby_nightlife":0.003472486976534128}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Sham