 on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa SVR-00942 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002499073452781886,"social_amenities":0.05523045361042023,"party_restriction":0.017783870920538902,"nearby_nightlife":0.0063345590606331825}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You\u2019ll be a short walk from the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, which underwent a major restoration to preserve their beautiful stained glass windows and architectural integrity. A few blocks away at the corner of Bull Street and Liberty, you\u2019ll find local shops featuring everything from handmade handbags and leather goods at Satchel, to Celtic crosses at Saints & Shamrocks. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - This apartment can be rented with the main house to sleep up to 12 Lucky guests. - The exposed beams and brick fireplace in the bedroom add true Savannah style - The bathroom has a convenient pocket door to separate the shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006504596676677465,"social_amenities":0.0009813233045861125,"party_restriction":0.0005116125685162842,"nearby_nightlife":0.467957079410553}},{"text":"Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004739577416330576,"social_amenities":0.000831205805297941,"party_restriction":0.004250042140483856,"nearby_nightlife":0.006933192722499371}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa SVR-00942 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002499073452781886,"social_amenities":0.05523045361042023,"party_restriction":0.017783870920538902,"nearby_nightlife":0.0063345590606331825}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Car