local shops featuring everything from handmade handbags and leather goods at Satchel, to Celtic crosses at Saints & Shamrocks. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - This apartment can be rented with the main house to sleep up to 12 Lucky guests. - The exposed beams and brick fireplace in the bedroom add true Savannah style - The bathroom has a convenient pocket door to separate the shower.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006504596676677465,"social_amenities":0.0009813233045861125,"party_restriction":0.0005116125685162842,"nearby_nightlife":0.467957079410553}},{"text":"A large island countertop that doubles as a breakfast bar, opens and connects the living room into the galley style kitchen. When it\u2019s time to get some shut-eye, get cozy in the comfortable Queen sized bed. The bedroom has plenty of storage space for longer stays, so unpack and relax on your private, enclosed porch. A second living room includes a Queen sleeper sofa, and can be closed to allow for 2 private sleeping rooms each separate from the Living Room. Start your day of exploration at Clary\u2019s Cafe, the setting for several breakfast scenes in Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015099355368874967,"social_amenities":0.00460498221218586,"party_restriction":0.00056241120910272,"nearby_nightlife":0.029246024787425995}}]}}},{"listing_id":"32240404","title":"Historic on Beautiful Jones St by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/32240404","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00780"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"32240404","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"345105450ffff6670256bba157f713a359788f0f31009fc2bf0d9d413b7c041c","chunks":7,"words":547,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007010945584625006,"party_welcome":0.9810945987701416,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.004250042140483856,"nearby_nightlife":0.6103622913360596,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"The first of four bedrooms has a king sized bed, couch, and french doors to a private deck overlooking the courtyard.. The second bedroom has a queen sized bed and ensuite bath with freestanding tub. With two closets, you\u2019ll have plenty of room to unpack and settle in. On the third floor are the last two bedrooms. These connected bedrooms are perfect for guests with children! The main room features a queen sized bed and writing desk, and the adjoining room has two twin beds. What is parking like for this home?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016054086154326797,"social_amenities":0.005263772793114185,"party_restriction":0.0011873873881995678,"nearby_nightlife":0.00374600593931973}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The Cohen House achieves that perfect blend of historical character and everyday comfort. This home is perfect for family and/or friend reunions. The space The Cohen House achieves a perf