62878,"party_welcome":0.987957775592804,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.985602617263794,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":89,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":179,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006818436086177826,"social_amenities":0.17411115765571594,"party_restriction":0.001843156642280519,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006752260960638523}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This house is great for Georgia vacations with larger parties as it sleeps 10. Surrounded by lush landscaping and with a view of a historic neighborhood, the Mint Julep Estate is sure to be one of your top picks for vacation homes Savannah when you come to Georgia. The house comes with all the niceties you would expect from Southern Belle, including a fully equipped kitchen, Internet, washer and dryer. The property is located on Jones Street, putting it not far away from points of interest and eateries like Pulaski Square, Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, Chatham Square, Noble Fare and Crystal Beer Parlor. Things To Do Near Mint Julep Estate","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.987957775592804,"social_amenities":0.5955986380577087,"party_restriction":0.0007244363659992814,"nearby_nightlife":0.9807079434394836}},{"text":"If you love taking in some history, then the Colonial Park Cemetery, the Owens-Thomas House and the Davenport House Museum are must-sees. There are numerous restaurants in Savannah, but two of the more unique offerings are the Olde Pink House and the Pirates' House. Savannah is also home to a variety of different events throughout the year. If you arrive around any major holidays, you'll be sure to find some type of event going on. A few popular ones include: \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Oktoberfest in October \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05090159922838211,"social_amenities":0.002493869047611952,"party_restriction":0.0030095321126282215,"nearby_nightlife":0.985602617263794}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day a