striction":0.0030257543548941612,"nearby_nightlife":0.9509638547897339,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"2 Private Parking Spots Private Pool - Pool heat available for $30 per day from October 31st-April 15th Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021068428759463131,"social_amenities":0.48616597056388855,"party_restriction":0.0010295782703906298,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013341106241568923}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":209,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008080085390247405,"social_amenities":0.12851981818675995,"party_restriction":0.0014551309868693352,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005950723425485194}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 Fireworks on the Beach for Fourth of July \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Christmas on the River and Lighted Parade in December \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December Make sure to ask us about a current schedule. Choose our Savannah vacation rentals for your stay and you can enjoy all the luxury amenities of a hotel, but with privacy and room to roam with a family home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.37294745445251465,"social_amenities":0.004275980405509472,"party_restriction":0.0030257543548941612,"nearby_nightlife":0.9509638547897339}},{"text":"Besides everything Savannah offers on a regular basis, you might also consider some of the special events held throughout the year. The following is a sample calendar of what might be available: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February \u2022 Savannah\u2019s Annual A-Town Get Down Music & Art Festival in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 NOGS Tour of Homes and Gardens in April \u2022 Fine Arts on The River Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Asian Festival in June","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03760400786995888,"social_amenities":0.002940553706139326,"party_restriction":0.0011191676603630185,"nearby_nightlife":0.6807988286018372}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Another living room on the top floor offers a cozy seating area and is right off the kitchen. The kitchens have plenty of counter space and all necessary appliances. One of the kitchens offers seating for four at the bar. Overlooking the pool area is a charming bar and sunroom area. Bedrooms are all well-appointed with ceiling fans, comfortable beds and charming decor. Bedrooms with two beds have some separation between the sleeping areas, giving guests some privacy. A laundry room with washer and dryer is included in the unit, making this one of our vacation rentals Savannah GA perfect for longer stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002141744625987485,"social_amenities":0.7809393405914307,"party_restriction":0.0005804479005746543,"nearby_nightlife":0.946501612663269}},{"text":"2 Private Parking Spots Private Pool - Pool heat available for $30 per day from October 31st-April 15th Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021068428759463131,"social_amenities":0.48616597056388855,"party_restriction":0.0010295782703906298,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013341106241568923}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"\u2022 Fireworks on the Beach for Fourth of July \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Christmas on the River and Lighted Parade in December \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December Make sure to ask us about a current schedule. Choose our Savannah vacation rentals for your stay and you can enjoy all the luxury amenities of a hotel, but with privacy and room to roam with a family home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.37294745445251465,"social_amenities":0.004275980405509472,"party_restriction":0.0030257543548941612,"nearby_nightlife":0.9509638547897339}},{"text":"Must-visit places include Forsyth Park, River Street, the Old Town Trolley Tour and the Ships of the Sea Museum. Walking is generally the best way to get around Savannah and allows you to take in all the architecture and mossy-oak lined streets. Another option is the Chatham Area Transit shuttle in the Historic District. Pick up a comprehensive map at the visitor's center and explore the Savannah History Museum while you're there. If you love tours, you'll find no shortage of them in Savannah. Consider a ghost tour, horse and buggy tour or a riverboat cruise among others.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013955366739537567,"social_amenities":0.0012367017334327102,"party_restriction":0.0020056816283613443,"nearby_nightlife":0.018137209117412567}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 Fireworks on the Beach for Fourth of July \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Christmas on the River and Lighted Parade in December \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December Make sure to ask us about a current schedule. Choose our Savannah vacation rentals for your stay and you can enjoy all the luxury amenities of a hotel, but with privacy and room to roam with a family home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.37294745445251465,"social_amenities":0.004275980405509472,"party_restriction":0.0030257543548941612,"nearby_nightlife":0.9509638547897339}},{"text":"Another living room on the top floor offers a cozy seating area and is right off the kitchen. The kitchens have plenty of counter space and all necessary appliances. One of the kitchens offers seating for four at the bar. Overlooking the pool area is a charming bar and sunroom area. Bedrooms are all well-appointed with ceiling fans, comfortable beds and charming decor. Bedrooms with two beds have some separation between the sleeping areas, giving guests some privacy. A laundry room with washer and dryer is included in the unit, making this one of our vacation rentals Savannah GA perfect for longer stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002141744