etector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044990089372731745,"social_amenities":0.757610559463501,"party_restriction":0.0008195845293812454,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024310469161719084}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023032921308185905,"social_amenities":0.00531610706821084,"party_restriction":0.00035562991979531944,"nearby_nightlife":0.00028995066531933844}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Live like a local in this fully furnished carriage house located on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street, nearby tourist attractions, parks, shopping and dining. The space This fully-furnished carriage house is situated in the heart of Savannah's Historic District, on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street. Located within walking distance of a variety of shops and dining options, such as Public, SoHo South and Six Pence Pub. Lovely Forsyth Park is also within walking distance, as are several event venues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001999064115807414,"social_amenities":0.021568933501839638,"party_restriction":0.000725557270925492,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872357249259949}},{"text":"Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Gym Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044990089372731745,"social_amenities":0.757610559463501,"party_restriction":0.0008195845293812454,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024310469161719084}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Gym Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044990089372731745,"social_amenities":0.757610559463501,"party_restriction":0.0008195845293812454,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024310469161719084}},{"text":"Live like a local in this fully furnished carriage house located on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street, nearby tourist attractions, parks, shopping and dining. The space This fully-furnished carriage house is situated in the heart of Savannah's Historic District, on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street. Located within walking distance of a variety of shops and dining options, such as Public, SoHo South and Six Pence Pub. Lovely Forsyth Park is also within walking distance, as are several event venues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001999064115807414,"social_amenities":0.021568933501839638,"party_restriction":0.000725557270925492,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872357249259949}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"This property features a double bed, a twin bed, and a sofa bed. *Non-Smoking* Basic Comcast Xfinity Cable *This property does not include parking. Metered street parking can be found on Jones Street.* *Cora Bett Thomas Vacation Rentals does require all guests to e-sign a rental agreement to complete a reservation* SVR-00246 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014303845819085836,"social_amenities":0.0005270547117106616,"party_restriction":0.0029279578011482954,"nearby_nightlife":0.007507049012929201}},{"text":"They love company, but if you're in the mood for privacy, feel free to ask that they stay home. This is truly one of the best locations in the city, and after staying here you will feel like a true Savannahian. This Property is perfect for Corporate & Monthly rentals. Ask about special monthly rates and discounts! Our housekeeping Team is working hard to provide excellent service you and your family. We are following all CDC Guidelines for cleaning, and doing regular deep cleans for every one of our properties. You will be able to see a specific cleaning checklist that we have followed upon arrival or upon request.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022974269813857973,"social_amenities":0.0011261083418503404,"party_restriction":0.0012894989922642708,"nearby_nightlife":0.0032629906199872494}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Live like a local in this fully furnished carriage house located on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street, nearby tourist attractions, parks, shopping and dining. The space This fully-furnished carriage house is situated in the heart of Savannah's Historic District, on the elegant and sought-after Jones Street. Located within walking distance of a variety of shops and dining options, such as Public, SoHo South and Six Pence Pub. Lovely Forsyth Park is also within walking distance, as are several event venues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001999064115807414,"social_amenities":0.021568933501839638,"party_restriction":0.000725557270925492,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872357249259949}},{"text":"If you don't feel like walking, or need to go just little further to River Street, you can easily flag down a Pedicab for a quick and pleasant ride to your destination. Also available is the free Downtowner (its a local Uber paid for by the City)! This carriage house has been a favorite lodging location of Joe Odom, a Savannah celebrity who played Paul Hipp in the film \"Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil.\" This quaint location has a lush, shared courtyard that is often visited and occupied by the the owner's two dogs, a basset hound named Leon and a poodle named Pheobe.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002153276582248509,"social_amenities":0.0010432968847453594,"party_restriction":0.0008477378869429231,"nearby_nightlife":0.0137623380869627}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 07009","address":"112 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":12.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24265277820","date":"2024-09-21","type":"CHEST PAIN-D","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"112 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 07009","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"987888183269005304","title":"Jewel on Jones - A Southern, Savannah Mansion","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/987888183269005304","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-02701"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20032 08004","address":"217 E CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"n