If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":143,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":241,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008358959457837045,"social_amenities":0.10820795595645905,"party_restriction":0.0021363606210798025,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005034421337768435}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"There are a variety of special events all year long, but there's definitely some great things to do in the summer. In June, you can head over to River Street and enjoy the Seafood Festival, which also features live entertainment. Another big June event is the Savannah Food Truck Festival. Along with around 50 trucks serving a range of food, you can also find a craft beer garden, craft vendors, live entertainment and much more. If you're staying in our Savannah vacation rentals around early July, you won't want to miss the River Street Fourth of July Celebration.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9923487901687622,"social_amenities":0.010555149056017399,"party_restriction":0.001194044598378241,"nearby_nightlife":0.9964044094085693}},{"text":"The long promenade of River Street is perfect for viewing fireworks over the Savannah River. While you wait for the evening festivities, you can browse the shops and restaurants. In August, you'll find the Savannah Gourmet Seafood & Spirits Festival. This event is a big draw as it features many celebrity chefs and famous mixologists. Some other events to consider during the year include: \u2022 Martin Luther King Parade in January \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 Savannah Garden Expo in April \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9556588530540466,"social_amenities":0.0065124440006911755,"party_restriction":0.0013170256279408932,"nearby_nightlife":0.9969342947006226}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":143,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"It's near Lafayette Square, the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, Troup Square, Clary's Cafe and the Flannery O'Connor House Museum. If you wish to leave your car, you are in luck! There is one parking space available at the back of the property. Savannah offers a little something for everyone, whether it's ghost stories, old architecture, amazing art, or just the relaxing Southern atmosphere meandering by beneath Spanish moss. Come experience the nostalgia of America's past with our Savannah GA vacation rentals! Top Events Near Savannah Vacation Homes Attending special events in Savannah is always a fun activity when staying in vacation rentals Savannah GA.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7822287082672119,"social_amenities":0.11110536009073257,"party_restriction":0.0010538398055359721,"nearby_nightlife":0.9799326062202454}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The other bedroom also offers a TV and fireplace, plus a cozy reading nook next to a window. The bathroom is very spacious and includes a tub, standing shower and laundry machines. Savannah Vacation Rentals Offer Great Amenities Staying in Savannah vacation rentals gives you the utmost in privacy and space. Our Savannah vacation homes are also packed with amenities to make your stay feel even more like home. This property has a full kitchen with regular-size appliances, plus TVs throughout the house, wireless internet, linens and other necessities, and much more. It also offers a great location between East Charlton Lane and East Charlton Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045745004899799824,"social_amenities":0.03449411690235138,"party_restriction":0.004021920263767242,"nearby_nightlife":0.04515208303928375}},{"text":"For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-02891 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":181,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.602615707786754e-05,"social_amenities":0.003473041346296668,"party_restriction":0.0033325518015772104,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012014055391773582}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The long promenade of River Street is perfect for viewing fireworks over the Savannah River. While you wait for the evening festivities, you can browse the shops and restaurants. In August, you'll find the Savannah Gourmet Seafood & Spirits Festival. This event is a big draw as it features many celebrity chefs and famous mixologists. Some other events to consider during the year include: \u2022 Martin Luther King Parade in January \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 Savannah Garden Expo in April \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9556588530540466,"social_amenities":0.0065124440006911755,"party_restriction":0.0013170256279408932,"nearby_nightlife":0.9969342947006226}},{"text":"There are a variety of special events all year long, but there's definitely some great things to do in the summer. In June, you can head over to River Street and enjoy the Seafood Festival, which also features live entertainment. Another big June event is the Savannah Food Truck Festival. Along with around 50 trucks serving a range of food, you can also find a craft beer garden, craft vendors, live entertainment and much more. If you're staying in our Savannah vacation rentals around early July, you won't want to miss the River Street Fourth of July Celebration.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9923487901687622,"social_amenities":0.010555149056017399,"party_restriction":0.001194044598378241,"nearby_nightlife":0.9964044094085693}}]}}},{"listing_id":"27368094","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/27368094","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02892"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"27368094","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3481c31f2b485a7dc5321142bee1d188aed29935a8a080a36fcac2e6e097f407","chunks":16,"words":1523,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.24463357031345367,"social_amenities":0.9497668743133545,"party_restriction":0.8833557963371277,"nearby_nightlife":0.281544953584671,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Savannah, Georgia is no stranger to adventure. As settlers, and even pirates, moved into what\u2019s considered one of America\u2019s greatest cities, the welcoming shores and myriad waterways gave birth to the city beloved by millions of visitors each year. If you\u2019ve ever had the pleasure of strolling through its ancient alleyways or basking in the warm southern sun in one of the many parks sprinkled throughout the city, then you understand the seemingly otherworldly charm of this historic city. The space As a port city, Savannah is unlike almost anywhere else in the United States.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001963295042514801,"social_amenities":0.016432955861091614,"party_restriction":0.0037070380058139563,"nearby_nightlife":0.02424005977809429}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"There is one parking space available at the back of the property. No matter which direction you take, you\u2019re only steps away from such famed attractions as the Andrew Low House Museum, Flannery O\u2019Connor Home Museum and the architectural gemstone, The Cathedral of Saint John the Baptist. Whether you\u2019re planning to visit during one of the many annual festivals, or are simply in search of a true getaway, Captain\u2019s Quarters offers a location few vacation rentals Savannah GA provide. Raising the Sails to Your Perfect Vacation - Book Your Stay Today!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.24463357031345367,"social_amenities":0.004611870273947716,"party_restriction":0.002158275106921792,"nearby_nightlife":0.1961660385131836}},{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":167,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"While standard hotel rooms are readily available throughout every neighborhood and district, Savannah vacation homes offer a chance to go beyond the sterile facade of modern hotel designs. Combining the history of this co