ace available at the back of the property. No matter which direction you take, you\u2019re only steps away from such famed attractions as the Andrew Low House Museum, Flannery O\u2019Connor Home Museum and the architectural gemstone, The Cathedral of Saint John the Baptist. Whether you\u2019re planning to visit during one of the many annual festivals, or are simply in search of a true getaway, Captain\u2019s Quarters offers a location few vacation rentals Savannah GA provide. Raising the Sails to Your Perfect Vacation - Book Your Stay Today!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":117,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.24463357031345367,"social_amenities":0.004611870273947716,"party_restriction":0.002158275106921792,"nearby_nightlife":0.1961660385131836}}]}}},{"listing_id":"589228885902526824","title":"On Lafayette Square, Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/589228885902526824","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02890"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"589228885902526824","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"253b3e2adca0b70bb0563c4f89b483f1e4c5c595dc24066febbd95dd0e0f20f3","chunks":16,"words":1506,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.6046581268310547,"party_welcome":0.017337458208203316,"social_amenities":0.9344474673271179,"party_restriction":0.7160382270812988,"nearby_nightlife":0.9075174927711487,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Step into Parlor on Lafayette and immediately feel at home. This charming two-bedroom vacation rental is situated in a wonderful location to walk everywhere in the Savannah Historic District. As soon as you enter through the front door, you step into a beautiful living space accented with gleaming hardwood floors and designer furnishings. The space Welcome to the Parlor on Lafayette! Here you'll discover a gorgeous, well-appointed vacation rental that offers designer furniture and hardwood floors. Between each set of guests, we have the rental fully sanitized and cleaned. Therefore, your trip will start off on the right foot. You'll be able to begin relaxing the second you arrive.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011794798774644732,"social_amenities":0.6046581268310547,"party_restriction":0.011547226458787918,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008051417535170913}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Alternatively, if you find yourself itching to get some more history, you can go two doors down to the Flannery O'Connor Childhood Home. This unusual museum's name may sound familiar, and that's due to the fact that Flannery O'Connor won the O. Henry Award three times. Inside its walls, you can enjoy perusing the rare books at The Bruckheimer Library. There's also lots of special events that take place in the area, including the Savannah Music Festival, Club Car Championship at the Landings Club, Annual Nogs Hidden Garden Tour and the Publix Women's Half Marathon & 5K. As you can see, Savannah is a town that likes to stay busy!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.017337458208203316,"social_amenities":0.003575838403776288,"party_restriction":0.0019116384210065007,"nearby_nightlife":0.41012948751449585}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Picture Yourself Staying in Luxury As one of the top Savannah vacation rentals, the Parlor on Lafayette is nestled between the Historic District - North and the Historic District - South. Simply walk outside and you'll discover several things to do within walking distance. For instance, you can check out the Andrew Low House, which is the historic home of the Girl Scouts Founder. Additionally, you can hang out with ghosts at the reportedly haunted Mercer-Williams House Museum or check out The Cathedral Basilica of St. John the Baptist. Once you head back indoors, you'll find a sophisticated, classic home with every modern convenience you could need.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003504919004626572,"social_amenities":0.9344474673271179,"party_restriction":0.7160382270812988,"nearby_nightlife":0.36841604113578796}},{"text":"Step into Parlor on Lafayette and immediately feel at home. This charming two-bedroom vacation rental is situated in a wonderful location to walk everywhere in the Savannah Historic District. As soon as you enter through the front door, you step into a beautiful living space accented with gleaming hardwood floors and designer furnishings. The space Welcome to the Parlor on Lafayette! Here you'll discover a gorgeous, well-appointed vacation rental that offers designer furniture and hardwood floors. Between each set of guests, we have the rental fully sanitized and cleaned. Therefore, your trip will start off on the right foot. You'll be able to begin relaxing the second you arrive.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011794798774644732,"social_amenities":0.6046581268310547,"party_restriction":0.011547226458787918,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008051417535170913}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Picture Yourself Staying in Luxury As one of the top Savannah vacation rentals, the Parlor on Lafayette is nestled between the Historic District - North and the Historic District - South. Simply walk outside and you'll discover several things to do within walking distance. For instance, you can check out the Andrew Low House, which is the historic home of the Girl Scouts Founder. Additionally, you can hang out with ghosts at the reportedly haunted Mercer-Williams House Museum or check out The Cathedral Basilica of St. John the Baptist. Once you head back indoors, you'll find a sophisticated, classic home with every modern convenience you could need.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003504919004626572,"social_amenities":0.9344474673271179,"party_restriction":0.7160382270812988,"nearby_nightlife":0.36841604113578796}},{"text":"The parking space is located off the alleyway, and larger vehicles may have difficulty making the turn into the spaces. Mid-size and smaller cars are recommended for easier access. You'll get a lot of other things out of your home base, too. For example, you can use the included washer and dryer to keep your clothes fresh throughout your stay. Whenever you feel like swimming, you're welcome to use our heated pool on Tybee Island. Safety really matters to us, so be sure to engage your deadbolt lock and enjoy the peace of mind that outdoor lighting can provide.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010499556083232164,"social_amenities":0.46737322211265564,"party_restriction":0.03870850428938866,"nearby_nightlife":0.05827297642827034}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Location: Beautiful Lafayette Square, steps to restaurants, shopping, and attractions. Walk everywhere! Parking: Parking for 1 vehicle around the back of the property. The parking space is located off the alleyway, and larger vehicles may have difficulty making the turn into the spaces. Mid-size and smaller cars are recommended for easier access. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":142,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001527154672658071,"social_amenities":0.1040123775601387,"party_restriction":0.0007990013109520078,"nearby_nightlife":0.9075174927711487}},{"text":"In the morning, take some time for yourself to enjoy a cup of coffee and freshly toasted bread. Once you're fully awake, it'll be time to go explore the local neighborhood. All you need to do is simply walk outside to find history dating back to 1733. At the same time, you'll also meet the hustle and bustle of a town with more than 147,000 residents. Get to Know the Neighborhood When you start to feel hungry, go into the neighborhood for several unique choices.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003338515234645456,"social_amenities":0.0012040999718010426,"party_restriction":0.0007863868377171457,"nearby_nightlife":0.5959026217460632}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 08008","address":"340 ABERCORN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":24.0,"advertised_guests":16.0,