he legendary Clary's Restaurant. With a garden meeting you at your front door, to unwind after a busy day on the town. The space Tucked away behind the massive oak trees is Jones Street Hideaway, a quaint garden-level apartment beneath a 200-year-old estate. Guests will enjoy waking to the sounds of horse-drawn carriages, and spending a slow afternoon walking to the famous Clary's Cafe for brunch. Enter through the courtyard into your two-bedroom garden apartment. The living area is furnished for comfort with two leather sofas and a large flat-screen TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002432437613606453,"social_amenities":0.003908566199243069,"party_restriction":0.0005051884800195694,"nearby_nightlife":0.9839858412742615}},{"text":"A full size kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances and granite countertops, with a dining table fit for four. Both bedrooms have Queen size beds, and each have access to the full bath with standing shower. This home is ideal for the couple looking to have a quiet respite after a long day of exploring downtown. Bedroom Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005472319317050278,"social_amenities":0.007429108023643494,"party_restriction":0.007045814301818609,"nearby_nightlife":0.12357442080974579}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 08021","address":"208 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":5.0,"neighbor_count":5,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{