ghton Street and River Street \u2600 Shared outdoor patio for relaxing or eating just outside the front door \u2600 Free Street Parking \u2600 High Speed Internet \u2600 Washer & Dryer in unit for guest use Expect a Five Star stay with us. The space is dog-friendly. Limit 2 dogs max.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005163915921002626,"social_amenities":0.009076366201043129,"party_restriction":0.0008943586726672947,"nearby_nightlife":0.8037877678871155}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Waterfront Right next to a body of water Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":161,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013469195691868663,"social_amenities":0.019026001915335655,"party_restriction":0.0015209203120321035,"nearby_nightlife":0.002916723256930709}},{"text":"Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Housekeeping available from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM, every day - available at extra cost","section":"AMENITIES","line":203,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003433276724535972,"social_amenities":0.0009125149808824062,"party_restriction":0.0014779733028262854,"nearby_nightlife":0.00044290340156294405}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"This high-end studio condo features plush bedding, cozy throws, and vibrant, whimsical decor that blends historic charm with modern amenities. Just a short walk from Forsyth Park and River Street, it offers easy access to Savannah's top cafes, bars, and restaurants, making it an ideal base for exploring the city. With fast Wi-Fi, a charming coffee bar, and a shared patio just steps away, Miss Whims E. Jones ensures a memorable stay in the heart of Savannah. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005498621612787247,"social_amenities":0.002760742325335741,"party_restriction":0.0009069657535292208,"nearby_nightlife":0.9706738591194153}},{"text":"\u2600 Modern and well-equipped full size kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a coffee bar w/ Keurig \u2600 Full Bathroom \u2600 Dog friendly (see pet rules) \u2600 WiFi and Roku entertainment system; flat screen TV; smart TV \u2600 Board games and books for enjoyment \u2600 Convenient location that is walkable to attractions in Historic Savannah, Broughton Street and River Street \u2600 Shared outdoor patio for relaxing or eating just outside the front door \u2600 Free Street Parking \u2600 High Speed Internet \u2600 Washer & Dryer in unit for guest use Expect a Five Star stay with us. The space is dog-friendly. Limit 2 dogs max.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005163915921002626,"social_amenities":0.009076366201043129,"party_restriction":0.0008943586726672947,"nearby_nightlife":0.8037877678871155}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 08022","address":"208 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"26805434","title":"Southern Manor on Jones St by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/26805434","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-01676"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"26805434","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"5b21c80d2a99d55160c68906b16cebc2ac93749917f0499da68d62a42db7bde6","chunks":7,"words":614,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0036203782074153423,"party_welcome":0.01798808015882969,"social_amenities":0.0036203782074153423,"party_restriction":0.0012578784953802824,"nearby_nightlife":0.9191542267799377,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience a truly Southern stay at this beautifully restored 1800s home on historic Jones Street. Four Lucky guests will be steps away from Savannah's best attractions. The space Follow the cobblestones on Jones Street - voted \u201cAmerica\u2019s Prettiest Street\u201d by Southern Living Magazine - to this stately parlor-level apartment. Steps away from sought-after attractions like The Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, Mercer-Williams House, and the Sorrell-Weed House, this home is ideal for those interested in Savannah's architectural history. Enter up a short set of stairs to the Parlor Level of this 1800s standalone manor.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001632519270060584,"social_amenities":0.0036203782074153423,"party_restriction":0.0009110720129683614,"nearby_nightlife":0.04151648283004761}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Pets allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002373594616074115,"social_amenities":0.0010722281876951456,"party_restriction":0.0003062019241042435,"nearby_nightlife":0.00046924842172302306}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The formal parlor room greets guests and acts as a casual living space; ideal for catching up with close friends and family. Classic French decor seen throughout is elegant yet relaxed and comfortable. Adjacent is the dining room and kitchen, with a washer and dryer hidden behind. Both bedrooms boast stunning views of historic Savannah, along with the modern amenities you expect like smart TVs, central A/C, and ample storage space. The first bedroom is spacious with a King bed and large closet. The full bath is exclusive to those guests and located just off the hall.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01798808015882969,"social_amenities":0.0006689088768325746,"party_restriction":0.00045843570842407644,"nearby_nightlife":0.011528377421200275}},{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen bed and wall-to-wall windows, allowing a fantastic view of historic Jones Street. Blinds allow for guest privacy at night. This bedroom's full bath is en suite, with a tub/shower combination. After a full day of touring (and shopping!) Savannah, relax with a cocktail in the courtyard gardens. You'll love spending each evening beneath the stars. Parking for this home is a breeze with two designated spots just behind the home (one in front of the other). On-street parking is also available and non-metered, although guests will need to be wary of Sweep Zone signs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006535594584420323,"social_amenities":0.002053462201729417,"party_restriction":0.0012578784953802824,"nearby_nightlife":0.9191542267799377}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Experience a truly Southern stay at this beautifully restored 1800s home on historic Jones Street. Four Lucky guests will be steps away from Savannah's best attractions. The space Follow the cobblestones on Jones Street - voted \u201cAmerica\u2019s Prettiest Street\u201d by Southern Living Magazine - to this stately parlor-level apartment. Steps away from sought-after attractions like The Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, Mercer-Williams House, and the Sorrell-Weed House, this home is ideal for those interested in Savannah's architectural history. Enter up a short set of stairs to the Parlor Level of this 1800s standalone manor.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001632519270060584,"social_amenities":0.0036203782074153423,"party_restriction":0.0009110720129683614,"nearby_nightlife":0.04151648283004761}},{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen bed and wall-to-wall windows, allowing a fantastic view of historic Jones Street. Blinds allow for guest privacy at night. This bedroom's full bath is en suite, with a tub/shower combination. After a full day of touring (and shopping!) Savannah, relax with a cocktail in the courtyard gardens. You'll love spending each evening beneath the stars. Parking for this home is a breeze with two designated spots just behind the home (one in front of the other). On-street parking is also available and non-metered, although guests will need to be wary of Sweep Zone signs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006535594584420323,"social_amenities":0.002053462201729417,"party_restriction":0.0012578784953802824,"nearby_nightlife":0.9191542267799377}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen bed and wall-to-wall windows, allowing a fantastic view of historic Jones Street. Blinds all