4156457378","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01340"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1521944244156457378","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1fd1b6575d7d931e6ec9e7b3f754ea6ebc169b56ddf6e1bcb02e75b61301057e","chunks":16,"words":1554,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5505620837211609,"party_welcome":0.024947186931967735,"social_amenities":0.9980545043945312,"party_restriction":0.9895226359367371,"nearby_nightlife":0.9667848944664001,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":155,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re catching up on your favorite shows or gathering with friends for a glass of wine, this cozy space makes it easy to unwind. The condo has been thoughtfully designed to balance modern amenities with timeless character. Hardwood floors nod to the property\u2019s historic roots, while updated furnishings and conveniences ensure a seamless stay for today\u2019s travelers. A Kitchen Made for Gatherings The full kitchen at Hideaway on Jones makes it simple to enjoy meals together during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.024947186931967735,"social_amenities":0.03544093668460846,"party_restriction":0.0017833353485912085,"nearby_nightlife":0.01163603737950325}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re catching up on your favorite shows or gathering with friends for a glass of wine, this cozy space makes it easy to unwind. The condo has been thoughtfully designed to balance modern amenities with timeless character. Hardwood floors nod to the property\u2019s historic roots, while updated furnishings and conveniences ensure a seamless stay for today\u2019s travelers. A Kitchen Made for Gatherings The full kitchen at Hideaway on Jones makes it simple to enjoy meals together during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.024947186931967735,"social_amenities":0.03544093668460846,"party_restriction":0.0017833353485912085,"nearby_nightlife":0.01163603737950325}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":155,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay at Hideaway on Jones, a 2BR/1BA condo on Savannah\u2019s iconic Jones Street. Perfect for 4 guests, this stylish retreat features a king bed, double bed, full kitchen, smart TVs, washer/dryer, and secure keyless entry. Relax in the shared courtyard or walk to Forsyth Park, shops, dining, and River Street. The ideal blend of comfort, charm, and location in Savannah\u2019s Historic District. The space Hideaway on Jones Welcome to Hideaway on Jones, a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom condo tucked along one of Savannah\u2019s most beloved streets. Perfectly suited for up to four guests, this inviting retreat offers an authentic Savannah experience where historic beauty meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002297859638929367,"social_amenities":0.9980545043945312,"party_restriction":0.9895226359367371,"nearby_nightlife":0.27721652388572693}},{"text":"Savannah\u2019s food scene is second to none, with options ranging from casual bites to fine dining. And when you\u2019re ready for a change of pace, River Street awaits with its bustling shops, nightlife, and stunning waterfront views along the Savannah River. Whether you\u2019re here for sightseeing, culture, or relaxation, Hideaway on Jones puts it all at your fingertips. Why Guests Love Hideaway on Jones Guests are drawn to this property for its combination of location, comfort, and style. The condo provides all the essentials for a stress-free stay, yet feels special thanks to its setting on one of the most beautiful streets in the country.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017214735271409154,"social_amenities":0.6158131957054138,"party_restriction":0.004649043083190918,"nearby_nightlife":0.9615263938903809}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Stay at Hideaway on Jones, a 2BR/1BA condo on Savannah\u2019s iconic Jones Street. Perfect for 4 guests, this stylish retreat features a king bed, double bed, full kitchen, smart TVs, washer/dryer, and secure keyless entry. Relax in the shared courtyard or walk to Forsyth Park, shops, dining, and River Street. The ideal blend of comfort, charm, and location in Savannah\u2019s Historic District. The space Hideaway on Jones Welcome to Hideaway on Jones, a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom condo tucked along one of Savannah\u2019s most beloved streets. Perfectly suited for up to four guests, this inviting retreat offers an authentic Savannah experience where historic beauty meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002297859638929367,"social_amenities":0.9980545043945312,"party_restriction":0.9895226359367371,"nearby_nightlife":0.27721652388572693}},{"text":"The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":155,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012132953852415085,"social_amenities":0.5505620837211609,"party_restriction":0.010954301804304123,"nearby_nightlife":0.00413364265114069}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"One of the biggest perks of staying at Hideaway on Jones is its unbeatable location. Step outside and find yourself immersed in the history, charm, and energy of Savannah\u2019s historic district. You\u2019ll be within walking distance of Forsyth Park, the crown jewel of Savannah with its iconic fountain, gardens, and shaded walking paths. The city\u2019s famed squares are also nearby, each offering its own unique beauty and history, from lively Chippewa Square to serene Monterey Square. If shopping and dining are on your itinerary, you\u2019ll discover boutiques, art galleries, coffee shops, and restaurants just minutes away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015964973135851324,"social_amenities":0.003850252367556095,"party_restriction":0.0011003310792148113,"nearby_nightlife":0.9667848944664001}},{"text":"Savannah\u2019s food scene is second to none, with options ranging from casual bites to fine dining. And when you\u2019re ready for a change of pace, River Street awaits with its bustling shops, nightlife, and stunning waterfront views along the Savannah River. Whether you\u2019re here for sightseeing, culture, or relaxation, Hideaway on Jones puts it all at your fingertips. Why Guests Love Hideaway on Jones Guests are drawn to this property for its combination of location, comfort, and style. The condo provides all the essentials for a stress-free stay, yet feels special thanks to its setting on one of the most beautiful streets in the country.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017214735271409154,"social_amenities":0.6158131957054138,"party_restriction":0.004649043083190918,"nearby_nightlife":0.9615263938903809}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 08025","address":"208 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"20052704","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/20052704","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01682"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"20052704","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"cc20aec8def726afdfcfb6f28b37566a105cb2425c093f83b58e501989ffed69","chunks":13,"words":1283,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.4154403507709503,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002421651966869831,"nearby_nightlife":0.9868576526641846,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":209,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006013623205944896,"social_amenities":0.014876200817525387,"party_restriction":0.0022045590449124575,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032127968734130263}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"When you arrive at your vacation rentals Savannah GA, make sure to ask about a schedule of events for your stay. Savannah hosts a number of cultural and holiday festivals every year. The following is a sample list of what might be going on: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February \u2022 Saint Patrick\u2019s Day in Savannah in March \u2022 Savannah\u2019s Annual A-Town Get Down Music & Art Festival in March \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Savannah Garden Expo in April","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.4154403507709503,"social_amenities":0.00326340040192008,"party_restriction":0.0010425676591694355,"nearby_nightlife":0.7561113834381104}},{"text":"\u2022 SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April \u2022 Fine Arts on The River Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Shakespeare Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July on the River in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Shalom Y\u2019all Jewish Food Festival in October \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Before you book any old hotel, stop and consider Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.22373512387275696,"social_amenities":0.0065650297328829765,"party_restriction":0.002421651966869831,"nearby_nightlife":0.962519645690918}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":209,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006013623205944896,"social_amenities":0.014876200817525387,"party_restriction":0.0022045590449124575,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032127968734130263}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"\u2022 SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April \u2022 Fine Arts on The River Festival in May \u2022 Savannah Shakespeare Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July on the River in July \u2022 Seafood & Music Festival in August \u2022 Shalom Y\u2019all Jewish Food Festival in October \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 Holiday Tour of Homes in December Before you book any old hotel, stop and consider Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.22373512387275696,"social_amenities":0.0065650297328829765,"party_restriction":0.002421651966869831,"nearby_nightlife":0.962519645690918}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":141,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002843967522494495,"social_amenities":0.001816928619518876,"party_restriction":0.0023524248972535133,"nearby_nightlife":0.014345955103635788}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Not far from this home is Lafayette Square, as well as Flannery O'Connor's childhood home and the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist. Other nearby attractions include Troup Square, Calhoun Square and plenty of dining options. When visiting Savannah, there's so much to see and do that you might feel overwhelmed. To start, it's easy to get around most of the town by walking. You can also utilize the Chatham Area Transit for free on and off service in the historic district. Probably the number one attraction in Savannah is the massive, 30 acre Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00043651435407809913,"social_amenities":0.000998860108666122,"party_restriction":0.002173028653487563,"nearby_nightlife":0.9868576526641846}},{"text":"Two great areas to find copious amounts of shopping and dining are River Street and the City Market. From River Street, you can also enjoy a river boat cruise or take a dolphin watching tour out onto the river. If you have extra time to spend in Savannah or just really need to see the beach, then a trip over to Tybee Island might be the perfect getaway. It's only a half-hour drive from downtown and you'll find several beaches, opportunities for fishing, plenty of dining options and the old Tybee Lighthouse and Museum awaiting your arrival.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006074199336580932,"social_amenities":0.0013766419142484665,"party_restriction":0.001385656651109457,"nearby_nightlife":0.9851220846176147}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 08031","address":"211 E CHARLTON LN","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"nei