 guests with a quiet and relaxing stay. Built in 1850, its picturesque design captures your attention from the moment you step through the front door. An elegant, spiral staircase sits peacefully in the middle of the main floor, connecting all three levels. You don't want to miss out on one of the cutest cottages in all of Savannah! SVR-02415 The space Despite its old-fashioned appeal, the cottage hosts a modern kitchen, complete with stainless steel appliances and a sturdy, granite countertop.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.4288178944261745e-05,"social_amenities":0.00021921348525211215,"party_restriction":0.00022181870008353144,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031061472836881876}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 10013","address":"416 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24050051457","date":"2024-02-19","type":"8 PAST RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"418 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 10012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24065067538","date":"2024-03-05","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"418 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 10012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"52033104","title":"Designer Furnished on Jones St, Heated pool access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52033104","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02389"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"52033104","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4