urself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":235,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007643936551176012,"social_amenities":0.9565262794494629,"party_restriction":0.0015469113131985068,"nearby_nightlife":0.004832800943404436}},{"text":"Across the room from the bed is a mid-size closet and a three-deep drawer, on top of which is a flatscreen TV of the same size and specifications as bedroom number two's HDTV. Lastly, on the left of the bed are three square, nine-pane windows spaced roughly four feet apart with nautical-themed artwork centered in between them. You're also sure to enjoy the white faux bear rug on the floor \u2014 talk about a super soft, fuzzy home for your feet! Unlike the previous two bedrooms, this last lodging area isn't a master bedroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018671557307243347,"social_amenities":0.9541879892349243,"party_restriction":0.6289377212524414,"nearby_nightlife":0.001035958994179964}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Across the room from the bed is a mid-size closet and a three-deep drawer, on top of which is a flatscreen TV of the same size and specifications as bedroom number two's HDTV. Lastly, on the left of the bed are three square, nine-pane windows spaced roughly four feet apart with nautical-themed artwork centered in between them. You're also sure to enjoy the white faux bear rug on the floor \u2014 talk about a super soft, fuzzy home for your feet! Unlike the previous two bedrooms, this last lodging area isn't a master bedroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018671557307243347,"social_amenities":0.9541879892349243,"party_restriction":0.6289377212524414,"nearby_nightlife":0.001035958994179964}},{"text":"As one of our larger vacation rentals Savannah GA, Savannah Charm is a two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bathroom townhome can comfortably house four people. The space As one of our larger vacation rentals Savannah GA, Savannah Charm is a two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bathroom townhome can comfortably house four people. There's Nothing Like a Soft, Cozy Bed to Return Home to We are sure you're visiting Savannah for its well-preserved historic landmarks, remarkable original architecture, relaxing riverside views, and locally-caught seafood cuisine \u2014 not to lay in bed all day. You could do that at home, after all!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036530481884256005,"social_amenities":0.11567994207143784,"party_restriction":0.0044507416896522045,"nearby_nightlife":0.005064290016889572}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Even though we know you'll be spending much of your stay across Savannah's many worthwhile attractions, we deck our Savannah vacation homes out with industry-leading, therapeutic-quality beds to make sure you're recharged for every fun-filled day you plan on having here in Savannah, Georgia. Tucked away on the second floor of this Savannah townhome, this master bedroom features a queen-size bed centered on beautiful hardwood flooring; the room features a cozy blue, white, and gray color scheme that's set off by bright sky blue accents.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036661955527961254,"social_amenities":0.003118797205388546,"party_restriction":0.0005918577662669122,"nearby_nightlife":0.4085294008255005}},{"text":"Upon its gray brick floor are element-resistant outdoor chairs \u2014 a love seat and two single-seaters in a half-circle around a raised fire pit \u2014 a table-and-umbrella combination surrounded by four chairs, and a sprawling gas grill and lineup of stainless steel ovens. Like All of Our Savannah Vacation Rentals, Savannah Charm Comes With These Must-Have Amenities Similar to all of our Savannah vacation homes, you'll find complimentary washer and dryer access, a pair of off-street parking slots, and heated pool access here at Savannah Charm. These aren't your only amenities \u2014 expect to receive dozens of noteworthy living resources on your vacation with us.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003717017243616283,"social_amenities":0.6260659694671631,"party_restriction":0.0008315860177390277,"nearby_nightlife":0.02913929522037506}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 10014","address":"410 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":14.0,"advertised_guests":11.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24157165874","date":"2024-06-05","type":"22 OTHER","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"408 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 10015","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24331345644","date":"2024-11-26","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"408 E JONES ST","recorded_pin":"20032 10015","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26205212544","date":"2026-07-24","type":"14 SOCIAL MEDIA THREAT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 10018","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26221229416","date":"2026-08-09","type":"52 PAST FRAUD/FORGERY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"408 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 10015","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"42708369","title":"Luxurious 1883 Classic on Jones by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42708369","guests":11.0,"permits":["SVR-00385","SVR-00386"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"42708369","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e695b707a82b3f72200ec394ce68cb1aa36b5022d05ce9bd8264e2905a4ac8e3","chunks":7,"words":596,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.03351537883281708,"party_welcome":0.04051138088107109,"social_amenities":0.9745385050773621,"party_restriction":0.6554423570632935,"nearby_nightlife":0.03391514718532562,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A porch adorned with wooden flourishes covers the front door. Next to the entrance, a plaque designates the historic landmark status of the property. Inside, the parlor has floor-to-ceiling bay windows from which to spot the occasional horse-drawn carriage on tour. An archway frames the formal dining room and table with seating for 10, lighted by the soft twinkling of a magnificent crystal chandelier. At the back of the house is a gourmet kitchen outfitted with Kitchen Craft cupboards, two farmers porcelain sinks, sub-zero refrigerator, and a Thermador commercial stove. A breakfast area seats six and a balcony overlooks the courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004474380111787468,"social_amenities":0.03351537883281708,"party_restriction":0.0005262871272861958,"nearby_nightlife":0.03391514718532562}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This grand 5-bedroom home, located on the most famous residential street of Savannah, was built in 1883 for the former Chairman of the Chatham County Commission, Joseph J. Dale. The space This grand 5-bedroom home, located on the most famous residential street of Savannah, was built in 1883 for the former Chairman of the Chatham County Commission, Joseph J. Dale. A beautiful Italianate exterior with foot-thick walls encloses 4200 square feet of living space on 3 stories.The home boasts 12-foot ceilings, original fireplaces, and heart pine floors. The main entrance is on the parlor level, with bedrooms on both the top floor above and garden level below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04051138088107109,"social_amenities":0.9745385050773621,"party_restriction":0.6554423570632935,"nearby_nightlife":0.008072626776993275}},{"text":"Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004739577416330576,"social_amenities":0.000831205805297941,"party_restriction":0.004250042140483856,"nearby_nightlife":0.006933192722499371}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This grand 5-bedroom home, located on the most famous residential street of Savannah, was built in 1883 for the former Chairman of the Chatham County Commission, Joseph J. Dale. The space This grand 5-bedroom home, located on the most famous residential street of Savannah, was built in 1883 for the former Chairman of the Chatham County Commission, Joseph J. Dale. A beautiful Italianate exterior with foot-thick walls encloses 4200 square feet of living space on 3 stories.The home boasts 12-foot ceilings, original fireplaces, and heart pine floors. The main entrance is on the parlor level, with bedrooms on both the top floor above and garden level below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04051138088107109,"social_amenities"