rounding display of local artwork. The living room welcomes you with a soft, spacious couch and coffee table crafted with solid wood. A large Smart T.V. allows you to stream your favorite shows and movies on any platform. Along with a contemporary powder room, the first floor of this home is complete with a private balcony holding an intimate, al fresco dining set. Make your way to the second story. On one end of the hallway, you have the first bedroom with gold accents, floating nightstands, and a floor-length mirror.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009837296092882752,"social_amenities":0.009908209554851055,"party_restriction":0.00046123663196340203,"nearby_nightlife":0.15635934472084045}},{"text":"Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free street parking Paid parking off premises Services Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027651991695165634,"social_amenities":0.001305518439039588,"party_restriction":0.0007129852892830968,"nearby_nightlife":0.0022612237371504307}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Beautifully renovated and designed by the world-famous Lisa Garriss of Plum West Designs, this contemporary condo provides the perfect stay for four guests. Featuring two beds and two baths, you will enjoy comfort and style throughout, all with that modern flare you desire while traveling. Located on the edge of the historic district south, you will be right in the heart of everything Savannah offers. Three minutes to Forsyth Park. 18 min to SAV International. SVR-02780 The space Experience the charm of Historic Savannah and the luxury of a modernized vacation home. This space is located on one of the twenty-two historic squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014732424460817128,"social_amenities":0.14898568391799927,"party_restriction":0.0018147695809602737,"nearby_nightlife":0.008174577727913857}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dry