 first bedroom with gold accents, floating nightstands, and a floor-length mirror.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009837296092882752,"social_amenities":0.009908209554851055,"party_restriction":0.00046123663196340203,"nearby_nightlife":0.15635934472084045}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1676217886486404060","title":"The Designer Condo, Sleek | Centrally Located!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1676217886486404060","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02781"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1676217886486404060","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2e056cef27de97a7485aad5efd4c245872ffd1d45e9016ecbd8ab180d3358bec","chunks":7,"words":604,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.020281732082366943,"party_welcome":0.0007151315803639591,"social_amenities":0.020281732082366943,"party_restriction":0.9985894560813904,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784643650054932,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021644971275236458,"social_amenities":0.020281732082366943,"party_restriction":0.00030086864717304707,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032703072065487504}},{"text":"Once home to the nefarious John Deering, this condo is one of a kind in Savannah. Enter the three-level condo through a contemporary front door that sets the mood for the entire space. To the right of the foyer is a spacious galley kitchen featuring a deep blue backsplash, solid surface countertops, and a brand-new appliance package. The kitchen is fully equipped and provides everything you need to cook, including pots, pans, utensils, dishware, and small appliances. A peninsula island provides dining space for three, while a dining table directly behind provides room for six.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002171043015550822,"social_amenities":0.002279978711158037,"party_restriction":0.00033402914414182305,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018246242543682456}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"It is outfitted with a single vanity, toilet, low-entry shower, and all of the essentials, including towels, toilet paper, shampoo, body wash, and a hair dryer. The bottom floor features a comfortable living space with an oversized sectional that pulls out into a queen-size bed. There is also a smart TV for streaming your favorite shows. Working remotely during your stay? Our high-speed Wi-Fi supports video conferencing and multitasking. Guest access The entire condo is for your use!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007151315803639591,"social_amenities":0.002172599546611309,"party_restriction":0.000946800981182605,"nearby_nightlife":0.006631852593272924}},{"text":"Welcome to The Habersham Loft, an elegantly renovated condo in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant downtown. This condo provides ample space to spread out, featuring three floors with two bedrooms and two and a half bathrooms. Enjoy custom touches throughout that create a modern yet cozy environment to relax in after a day of exploring. Close to everything, you will be just three minutes to Forsyth Park and surrounded by amazing dining, pubs, and attractions. 18 min to SAV International. SVR-02781 The space Tucked among the beautiful neighborhoods of downtown Savannah, this freshly renovated condominium features high-end finishes and stylish interior design from Plum West Designs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006089670932851732,"social_amenities":0.006874639540910721,"party_restriction":0.0010840038303285837,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784643650054932}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021644971275236458,"social_amenities":0.020281732082366943,"party_restriction":0.00030086864717304707,"nearby_nightlife":0.00032703072065487504}},{"text":"Welcome to The Habersham Loft, an elegantly renovated condo in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant downtown. This condo provides ample space to spread out, featuring three floors with two bedrooms and two and a half bathrooms. Enjoy custom touches throughout that create a modern yet cozy environment to relax in after a day of exploring. Close to everything, you will be just three minutes to Forsyth Park and surrounded by amazing dining, pubs, and attractions. 18 min to SAV International. SVR-02781 The space Tucked among the beautiful neighborhoods of downtown Savannah, this freshly renovated condominium features high-end finishes and stylish interior design from Plum West Designs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006089670932851732,"social_amenities":0.006874639540910721,"party_restriction":0.0010840038303285837,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784643650054932}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We have a balcony off of the back of the living room AND a rear patio off of the bottom level that you can sit and enjoy a morning coffee or before-dinner cocktail ;) Parking is street-only and FREE. Other things to note No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.529280941933393e-05,"social_amenities":0.0030166166834533215,"party_restriction":0.9985894560813904,"nearby_nightlife":0.8096497654914856}},{"text":"Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036102166632190347,"social_amenities":0.0014321423368528485,"party_restriction":0.0015367652522400022,"nearby_nightlife":0.0029144915752112865}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to The Habersham Loft, an elegantly renovated condo in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant downtown. This condo provides ample space to spread out, featuring three floors with two bedrooms and two and a half bathrooms. Enjoy custom touches throughout that create a modern yet cozy environment to relax in after a day of exploring. Close to everything, you will be just three minutes to Forsyth Park and surrounded by amazing dining, pubs, and attractions. 18 min to SAV International. SVR-02781 The space Tucked among the beautiful neighborhoods of downtown Savannah, this freshly renovated condominium features high-end finishes and stylish interior design from Plum West Designs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006089670932851732,"social_amenities":0.006874639540910721,"party_restriction":0.0010840038303285837,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784643650054932}},{"text":"We have a balcony off of the back of the living room AND a rear patio off of the bottom level that you can sit and enjoy a morning coffee or before-dinner cocktail ;) Parking is street-only and FREE. Other things to note No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.529280941933393e-05,"social_amenities":0.0030166166834533215,"party_restriction":0.9985894560813904,"nearby_nightlife":0.8096497654914856}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 10017","address":"407 E CHARLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1184019353782472598","title":"Luxurious Manor off Troup Square w/ Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1184019353782472598","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-03002","SVR-03003"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1184019353782472598","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8a4877d15434bf65b7dfb4edb949135373ced8089175d47f919e9b6d220e8b9b","chunks":8,"words":666,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9252669215202332,"party_welcome":0.9966719150543213,"social_amenities":0.9252669215202332,"party_restriction":0.00645648455247283,"nearby_nightlife":0.9555731415748596,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Situated on majestic Troup Square, this manor offers an unforgettable experience in the heart of Savannah. Boasting four bedrooms, impeccable outdoor spaces, and an unbeatable location - This is the perfect retreat for families and friends alike! The space Nestled off the majestic, tree-lined Troup Square, Troup Square Manor offers an unforgettable vacation experience in the heart of Savannah. This beautiful manor boasts four bedrooms, impeccable outdoor spaces, and an unbeatable location, making it the perfect retreat for families and friends alike. What Sets This Home Apart?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00517218466848135,"social_amenities":0.9252669215202332,"party_restriction":0.00645648455247283,"nearby_nightlife":0.00710136815905571}},{"text":"- High-End Finishes: Defining southern luxury, Troup Square Manor features a beautiful chef's kitchen with high-end finishes and exquisite architectural details that showcase the home's historic charm. Every corner of this home reflects meticulous attention to detail and superior craftsmanship. - Spacious and Inviting: The incredible floor plan is designed for gatherings and entertaining. The parlor level is an entertainer's dream, featuring a large gathering room, a formal dining room, a gourmet kitchen, and an outdoor veranda\u2014all on one floor, ensuring everyone can be together. Just added: a courtyard plunge pool, a rare find in the Historic District and the perfect way to cool off after sightseeing.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9966719150543213,"social_amenities":0.5449120998382568,"party_restriction":0.00017227318312507123,"nearby_nightlife":0.1393052190542221}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"- High-End Finishes: Defining southern luxury, Troup Square Manor features a beautiful chef's kitchen with high-end finishes and exquisite architectural details that showcase the home's historic charm. Every corner of this home reflects meticulous attention to detail and superior craftsmanship. - Spacious and Inviting: The incredible floor plan is designed for gatherings and entertaining. The parlor level is an entertainer's dream, featuring a large gathering room, a formal dining room, a gourmet kitchen, and an outdoor veranda\u2014all on one floor, ensuring everyone can be together. Just added: a courtyard plunge pool, a rare find in the Historic District and the perfect way to cool off after sightseeing.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9966719150543213,"social_amenities":0.5449120998382568,"party_restriction":0.00017227318312507123,"nearby_nightlife":0.1393052190542221}},{"text":"Situated on majestic Troup Square, this manor offers an unforgettable experience in the heart of Savannah. Boasting four bedrooms, impeccable outdoor spaces, and an unbeatable location - This is the perfect retreat for families and friends alike! The space Nestled off the majestic, tree-lined Troup Square, Troup Square Manor offers an unforgettable vacation experience in the heart of Savannah. This beautiful manor boasts four bedrooms, impeccable outdoor spaces, and an unbeatable location, making it the perfect retreat for families and friends alike. What Sets This Home Apart?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00517218466848135,"social_amenities":0.9252669215202332,"party_restriction":0.00645648455247283,"nearby_nightlife":0.00710136815905571}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Situated on majestic Troup Square, this manor offers an unforgettable e