e Manor offers an unforgettable vacation experience in the heart of Savannah. This beautiful manor boasts four bedrooms, impeccable outdoor spaces, and an unbeatable location, making it the perfect retreat for families and friends alike. What Sets This Home Apart?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00517218466848135,"social_amenities":0.9252669215202332,"party_restriction":0.00645648455247283,"nearby_nightlife":0.00710136815905571}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":124,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"- Prime Location: Facing Troup Square, guests are just a 10-minute walk from Forsyth Park, a 10-minute walk to Broughton Street, and a 15-minute walk to the river. Situated on a quiet street, the manor is also close to delightful cafes and restaurants, offering the perfect blend of tranquility and convenience. The bedrooms are thoughtfully arranged across three levels to provide privacy and comfort for all guests. The garden level is self-contained, and offers a full living space, a fully stocked kitchen, a king bed, a queen sleeper sofa in the living room, and a luxurious bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001035472669173032,"social_amenities":0.0014316391898319125,"party_restriction":0.0004756241396535188,"nearby_nightlife":0.9555731415748596}},{"text":"- High-End Finishes: Defining southern luxury, Troup Square Manor features a beautiful chef's kitchen with high-end finishes and exquisite architectural details that showcase the home's historic charm. Every corner of this home reflects meticulous attention to detail and superior craftsmanship. - Spacious and Inviting: The incredible floor plan is designed for gatherings and entertaining. The parlor level is an entertainer's dream, featuring a l