},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"4399980","title":"Beautiful and Historic 1866 Home on Jones Street","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/4399980","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00347"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"4399980","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c022837d94cf87448ae4b6b59ea73971b66457de60fe5fab1b86760354a8203d","chunks":10,"words":842,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006669900845736265,"party_welcome":0.0011712528066709638,"social_amenities":0.006669900845736265,"party_restriction":0.998380184173584,"nearby_nightlife":0.98475581407547,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Off of the remodeled kitchen downstairs, there is a cozy den/bonus room that functions as a 4th bedroom using the Murphy bed. The tranquil courtyard is recently rebuilt and landscaped, giving shade in the summer, and full of sun during the winter, where you can enjoy your morning coffee, eat a meal, or just take things slow like a local, sipping on your favorite drinks. The back bedroom has a balcony on the second floor overlooking the courtyard (and the St. Paddy's Day Parade route), which is great for sunbathing.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001684841263340786,"social_amenities":0.006669900845736265,"party_restriction":0.0006101906183175743,"nearby_nightlife":0.07304622232913971}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views Courtyard view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV with standard cable Game console Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Children\u2019s books and toys Fireplace guards Window guards Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016674815560691059,"social_amenities":0.005431655328720808,"party_restriction":0.00020126267918385565,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009130686521530151}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Now one else is allowed in the house, unless in the rare case I grant an exception. I do not allow bachelor or bachelorette parties, or similar type get-togethers, or any type of party weekend, parties of any nature, or large groups of friends. I mostly only allow small groups of friends, couples, or a families.** I will allow pets on a case-by-case basis, but there will be an extra fee (usually $100 but depends on the situation/number and size of pets/etc. All pets must be exceptionally well-trained, stay off furniture and beds, be picked up after in the courtyard and around town, and crated if left alone.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011712528066709638,"social_amenities":0.0020488230511546135,"party_restriction":0.998380184173584,"nearby_nightlife":0.98475581407547}},{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included","section":"AMENITIES","line":143,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004346201