helorette parties, or similar type get-togethers, or any type of party weekend, parties of any nature, or large groups of friends. I mostly only allow small groups of friends, couples, or a families.** I will allow pets on a case-by-case basis, but there will be an extra fee (usually $100 but depends on the situation/number and size of pets/etc. All pets must be exceptionally well-trained, stay off furniture and beds, be picked up after in the courtyard and around town, and crated if left alone.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011712528066709638,"social_amenities":0.0020488230511546135,"party_restriction":0.998380184173584,"nearby_nightlife":0.98475581407547}},{"text":"Radiantly restored historic house built in 1866 on the \"Prettiest street in the South.\" My 3 Bedroom (4 bed including the bonus room) 3 Bath home will afford you the comfort and luxury of experiencing Savannah like a local in the center of the historic district steps from all the sights. **PLEASE SEND AN INQUIRY BEFORE REQUESTING TO BOOK** **I generally have a 3-night weekend minimum** **I don't generally start or stop reservations on Saturdays** Short Term Vacation Rental Permit - SVR-00347 The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003235163458157331,"social_amenities":0.004143732134252787,"party_restriction":0.007789368741214275,"nearby_nightlife":0.01618804782629013}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Now one else is allowed in the house, unless in the rare case I grant an exception. I do not allow bachelor or bachelorette parties, or similar type get-togethers, or any type of party weekend, parties of any nature, or large groups of friends. I mostly only allow small groups of friends, couples, or a families.** I will allow pets on a case-by-case basis, but there will be an extra fee (usually $100 but depends on the situation/number and size of pets/etc. All pets must be exceptionally well-trained, stay off furniture and beds, 