eighbors"},{"number":"25242245610","date":"2025-08-30","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"214 E Taylor St","recorded_pin":"20032 13012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1498749082025797825","title":"1854 Townhome on Taylor Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1498749082025797825","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03156"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1498749082025797825","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d0723a9977aec479cb4acf08a5f1a72c0861b5f383d1da8eab562f2dfd795ee7","chunks":7,"words":604,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8036015033721924,"party_welcome":0.966741681098938,"social_amenities":0.8036015033721924,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.7509206533432007,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Whether sipping coffee in the courtyard, entertaining in the parlor, or wandering Savannah\u2019s charming streets, this quintessential row home is the perfect blend of past and present. Guest access Guests have full access to the entire home, including both laundry areas, the chef\u2019s kitchen, balconies, and the courtyard. Please note -- the courtyard can also be accessed by guests staying in the carriage house, across the courtyard, so it may be shared with up to two people at times. The garden-level suite is fully integrated into the property, making it ideal for multi-family or group stays. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.966741681098938,"social_amenities":0.8036015033721924,"party_restriction":0.0005373362801037729,"nearby_nightlife":0.057737190276384354}},{"text":"Circa 1854, this stunning Savannah row home blends historic charm with modern luxury. Spacious and serene, it features 3 bedrooms and 3.5 baths on three levels. A private ground floor suite offers its own living room, kitchenette, and bath. The parlor level boasts elegant living, dining, and a chef\u2019s kitchen opening to a balcony and courtyard. Upstairs, 2 BRs with gorgeous views, 2 full bathrooms, ample storage, and laundry room. Historic beauty truly meets refined comfort. SVR-03156 and 01793 The space Experience Savannah at its finest in this extraordinary 1854 row home, where historic architecture meets modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015401699056383222,"social_amenities":0.0719190239906311,"party_restriction":0.0013171571772545576,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004703474114648998}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether sipping coffee in the courtyard, entertaining in the parlor, or wandering Savannah\u2019s charming streets, this quintessential row home is the perfect blend of past and present. Guest access Guests have full access to the entire home, including both laundry areas, the chef\u2019s kitchen, balconies, and the courtyard. Please note -- the courtyard can also be accessed by guests staying in the carriage house, across the courtyard, so it may be shared with up to two people at times. The garden-level suite is fully integrated into the property, making it ideal for multi-family or group stays. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.966741681098938,"social_amenities":0.8036015033721924,"party_restriction":0.0005373362801037729,"nearby_nightlife":0.057737190276384354}},{"text":"Thoughtfully renovated with soaring windows, airy design, and high-end finishes throughout, this 3-bedroom, 3.5-bath residence is as spacious as it is stunning. The garden level suite offers a private retreat with its own living room, kitchenette, king bedroom, full bathroom, and laundry, plus direct courtyard access. On the parlor level, you\u2019ll find gracious entertaining spaces: a sunlit living room, dining room, and a chef\u2019s kitchen with a gas range and premium appliances. French doors open to a balcony overlooking the home\u2019s unreal courtyard \u2014 a true urban sanctuary. The top floor features two bedrooms and two full bathrooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045985684846527874,"social_amenities":0.002006970578804612,"party_restriction":0.0003725433780346066,"nearby_nightlife":0.027860797941684723}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whether sipping coffee in the courtyard, entertaining in the parlor, or wandering Savannah\u2019s charming streets, this quintessential row home is the perfect blend of past and present. Guest access Guests have full access to the entire home, including both laundry areas, the chef\u2019s kitchen, balconies, and the courtyard. Please note -- the courtyard can also be accessed by guests staying in the carriage house, across the courtyard, so it may be shared with up to two people at times. The garden-level suite is fully integrated into the property, making it ideal for multi-family or group stays. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.966741681098938,"social_amenities":0.8036015033721924,"party_restriction":0.0005373362801037729,"nearby_nightlife":0.057737190276384354}},{"text":"Circa 1854, this stunning Savannah row home blends historic charm with modern luxury. Spacious and serene, it features 3 bedrooms and 3.5 baths on three levels. A private ground floor suite offers its own living room, kitchenette, and bath. The parlor level boasts elegant living, dining, and a chef\u2019s kitchen opening to a balcony and courtyard. Upstairs, 2 BRs with gorgeous views, 2 full bathrooms, ample storage, and laundry room. Historic beauty truly meets refined comfort. SVR-03156 and 01793 The space Experience Savannah at its finest in this extraordinary 1854 row home, where historic architecture meets modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"sc