128938034177,"nearby_nightlife":0.017702152952551842}}]}}},{"listing_id":"50438130","title":"Tiny Carriage House for Two by Taylor Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50438130","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01794"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"50438130","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4a76301c6e2db9feb1de1798336439333118b05f8f5fdade3a2e6720caa3b716","chunks":7,"words":561,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.041511669754981995,"party_welcome":0.0005493132048286498,"social_amenities":0.041511669754981995,"party_restriction":0.004276679363101721,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV with standard cable Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have exterior, outdoor cameras on the entrance for the safety of our guests and the security of our home. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 83 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003634186869021505,"social_amenities":0.041511669754981995,"party_restriction":0.003072204766795039,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008946373709477484}},{"text":"Our historic tiny carriage house is situated in the heart of downtown and makes for an authentically Savannah home base for your stay! Step back in time as you ascend the wrought iron spiral staircase up to your private hideaway! Filled with modern conveniences and updates, including tons of storage space for those extended stays, small but mighty kitchenette, and charming Juliette balcony overlooking the gorgeous shared courtyard space! Walking distance to all Savannah has to offer! SVR 01794 The space This private carriage house retreat is ALL YOURS! Enter the space through your private lane-side entrance into a first floor foyer and closet space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013633993512485176,"social_amenities":0.0045689428225159645,"party_restriction":0.0030597972217947245,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013841782929375768}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"We hope you appreciate the light drenched space and historic charm, including original wide panel hardwood floors, Savannah gray brick walls, and even a sweet little Juliette balcony where you can overlook the ultra modern shared courtyard space! Guest access The entire apartment is yours! We are situated in the heart of the historic district, so getting around on foot is best! There is ample street parking all around our home, both paid metered as well as free! We are happy to provide more detailed parking instructions to help guide you when you book with us. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005493132048286498,"social_amenities":0.002120270626619458,"party_restriction":0.004276679363101721,"nearby_nightlife":0.017205754294991493}},{"text":"We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004096822813153267,"social_amenities":0.0009063480538316071,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV with standard cable Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have exterior, outdoor cameras on the entrance for the safety of our guests and the security of our home. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 83 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003634186869021505,"social_amenities":0.041511669754981995,"party_restriction":0.003072204766795039,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008946373709477484}},{"text":"Our historic tiny carriage house is situated in the heart of downtown and makes for an authentically Savannah home base for your stay! Step back in time as you ascend the wrought iron spiral staircase up to your private hideaway! Filled with modern conveniences and updates, including tons of storage space for those extended stays, small but mighty kitchenette, and charming Juliette balcony overlooking the gorgeous shared courtyard space! Walking distance to all Savannah has to offer! SVR 01794 The space This private carriage house retreat is ALL YOURS! Enter the space through your private lane-side entrance into a first floor foyer and closet space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013633993512485176,"social_amenities":0.0045689428225159645,"party_restriction":0.0030597972217947245,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013841782929375768}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We hope you appreciate the light drenched space and historic charm, including original wide panel hardwood floors, Savannah gray brick walls, and even a sweet little Juliette balcony where you can overlook the ultra modern shared courtyard space! Guest access The entire apartment is yours! We are situated in the heart of the historic district, so getting around on foot is best! There is ample street parking all around our home, both paid metered as well as free! We are happy to provide more detailed parking instructions to help guide you when you book with us. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005493132048286498,"social_amenities":0.002120270626619458,"party_restriction":0.004276679363101721,"nearby_nightlife":0.017205754294991493}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV with standard cable Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have exterior, outdoor cameras on the entrance for the safety of our guests and the security of our home. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 83 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003634186869021505,"social_amenities":0.041511669754981995,"party_restriction":0.003072204766795039,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008946373709477484}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004096822813153267,"social_amenities":0.0009063480538316071,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164}},{"text":"We hope you appreciate the light drenched space and historic charm, including original wide panel hardwood floors, Savannah gray brick walls, and even a sweet little Juliette balcony where you can overlook the ultra modern shared courtyard space! Guest access The entire apartment is yours! We are situated in the heart of the historic district, so getting around on foot is best! There is ample street parking all around our home, both paid metered as well as free! We are happy to provide more detailed parking instructions to help guide you when you book with us. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005493132048286498,"social_amenities":0.002120270626619458,"party_restriction":0.004276679363101721,"nearby_nightlife":0.017205754294991493}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 14005","address":"111 E JONES ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24002001176","date":"2024-01-02","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"111 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14005","side":"direct"},{"number":"25284287858","date":"2025-10-11","type":"24-4 UNWANTED person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"111 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14005","side":"direct"},{"number":"25003002210","date":"2025-01-03","type":"53 SHOTS FIRED(heard only)","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"113 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14006","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"54294015","title":"Gorgeous Stay on Jones Street, Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54294015","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02498"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"54294015","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"47bac1dc4d853393cbd415cb49a9265fa254dad42b2f9925f9e2064bba2b60a1","chunks":16,"words":1562,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9221473932266235,"party_welcome":0.9890140891075134,"social_amenities":0.9221473932266235,"party_restriction":0.02408529259264469,"nearby_nightlife":0.9982149600982666,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"If one of your favorite parts of Savannah is the historic architecture, this is definitely the vacation home for you! Originally built in 1852, this beautiful townhome has been lovingly restored with modern conveniences. Despite having plenty of high-tech perks like keyless entry, full-home Wifi, and central HVAC, you can still see lovely historic touches like exposed brick walls, multiple fireplaces, and soaring ceilings. The space Enjoy a Stunningly Restored Historic Home Inside of our Savannah vacation homes, designer furnishings provide a lovely backdrop for your Savannah vacation. When you walk in, you'll immediately be greeted by a cheerful living room decorated in warm shades of cream, blue, and orange.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006847286713309586,"social_amenities":0.9221473932266235,"party_restriction":0.0039099459536373615,"nearby_nightlife":0.006397598888725042}},{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Single level home No stairs in home Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":200,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00043087854282930493,"social_amenities":0.19772174954414368,"party_restriction":0.0016183401457965374,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006749684689566493}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The kitchen has a full-size stove, oven, and refrigerator, so you can cook delicious meals with your loved ones. It also has plenty of standard cooking supplies including pots, pans, utensils, serveware, and drinkware. When you want to plan incredible dinner parties or just grab a quick snack at home, the kitchen is ready to use. There are even smaller appliances, including a microwave, coffee maker, and toaster, to make your cooking easier. The bedrooms and bathrooms are also filled with helpful amenities. We provide a hairdryer, ironing board, soap, shampoo, and hangers. Fresh linens and towels are provided, and we even have some extra pillows if desired.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9890140891075134,"social_amenities":0.0036897086538374424,"party_restriction":0.0002447335282340646,"nearby_nightlife":0.002709232037886977}},{"text":"Savannah has plenty of fun attractions for those who enjoy history, art, and fine shopping. It's also one of the best towns to visit if you love good food. Serenity on Jones is right near a few local favorites like Clary's Cafe and Yaupon Teahouse. While in town, you might want to try some upscale options like Noble Fare, Husk Savannah, and The Olde Pink House. After enjoying a great dinner, explore Savannah's nightlife. The town has everything from dance clubs like Club 51 to elegant cocktail bars like Congress Street Up. When you want to enjoy the beautiful nature surrounding Savannah, consider a trip to nearby Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022755974903702736,"social_amenities":0.008368285372853279,"party_restriction":0.02408529259264469,"nearby_nightlife":0.9982149600982666}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"If one of your favorite parts of Savannah is the historic architecture, this is definitely the vacation home for you! Originally built in 1852, this beautiful townhome has been lovingly restored with modern conveniences. Despite having plenty of high-tech perks like keyless entry, full-home Wifi, and central HVAC, you can still see lovely historic touches like exposed brick walls, multiple fireplaces, and soaring ceilings. The space Enjoy a Stunningly Restored Historic Home Inside of our Savannah vacation homes, designer furnishings provide a lovely backdrop for your Savannah vacation. When you walk in, you'll immediately be greeted by a cheerful living room decorated in warm shades of cream, blue, and orange.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006847286713309586,"social_amenities":0.9221473932266235,"party_restriction":0.0039099459536373615,"nearby_nightlife":0.006397598888725042}},{"text":"You will find great restaurants, shopping, museums, and more just outside your door! Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025747119798325,"social_amenities":0.26916229724884033,"party_restriction":0.0009378363029100001,"nearby_nightlife":0.8436396718025208}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Savannah has plenty of fun attractions for those who enjoy history, art, and fine shopping. It's also one of the best towns to visit if you love good food. Serenity on Jones is right near a few local favorites like Clary's Cafe and Yaupon Teahouse. While in town, you might want to try some upscale options like Noble Fare, Husk Savannah, and The Olde Pink House. After enjoying a great dinner, explore Savannah's nightlife. The town has everything from dance clubs like Club 51 to elegant cocktail bars like Congress Street Up. When you want to enjoy the beautiful nature surrounding Savannah, consider a trip to nearby Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022755974903702736,"social_amenities":0.008368285372853279,"party_restriction":0.02408529259264469,"nearby_nightlife":0.9982149600982666}},{"text":"If one of your favorite parts of Savannah is the historic architecture, this is definitely the vacation home for you! Originally built in 1852, this beautiful townhome has been lovingly restored with modern conveniences. Despite having plenty of high-tech perks like keyless entry, full-home Wifi, and central HVAC, you can still see lovely historic touches like exposed brick walls, multiple fireplaces, and soaring ceilings. The space Enjoy a Stunningly Restored Historic Home Inside of our Savannah vacation homes, designer furnishings provide a lovely backdrop for your Savannah vacation. When you walk in, you'll immediately be greeted by a cheerful living room decorated in warm shades of cream, blue, and orange.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006847286713309586,"social_amenities":0.9221473932266235,"party_restriction":0.0039099459536373615,"nearby_nightlife":0.006397598888725042}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Savannah has plenty of fun attractions for those who enjoy history, art, and fine shopping. It's also one of the best towns to visit if you love good food. Serenity on Jones is right near a few local favorites like Clary's Cafe and Yaupon Teahouse. While in town, you might want to try some upscale options like Noble Fare, Husk Savannah, and The Olde Pink House. After enjoying a great dinner, explore Savannah's nightlife. The town has everything from dance clubs like Club 51 to elegant cocktail bars like Congress Street Up. When you want to enjoy the beautiful nature surrounding Savannah, consider a trip to nearby Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022755974903702736,"social_amenities":0.008368285372853279,"party_restriction":0.02408529259264469,"nearby_nightlife":0.9982149600982666}},{"text":"Location: East Jones St, situated on a beautiful oak tree-lined street in the center of Savannah's downtown historic area. You will find great restaurants, shopping, museums, and more just outside your door! SVR-02498 Guest access Occupancy: 4 Fully renovated garden apartment on Jones Street feels like a brand new home! Gorgeous finishes and designer inspired furnishings create a beautifully serene setting for your Savannah vacation. Living room features comfy seating and large smart TV Full kitchen has cooking essentials Dry bar just off living room features barware and beverage cooler Dining table with seating for 4 tucked away in living room, perfect for a quick bite before exploring the town!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001894692104542628,"social_amenities":0.002819232875481248,"party_restriction":0.0016345442272722721,"nearby_nightlife":0.9817147254943848}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 14011","address":"123 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25187189577","date":"2025-07-06","type":"GAS LEAK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"123 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14011","side":"direct"},{"number":"24190200789","date":"2024-07-08","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"119 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14009","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24207218403","date":"2024-07-25","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"119 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20032 14009","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"25978159","title":"Elegant Savannah Patio Apt! Arty Flair on Jones","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/25978159","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01130"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"25978159","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e830ad7756af25dc56cc95417fcbc3b616c2120b9292f508e0a7c6f6d5df8d4d","chunks":9,"words":740,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.014664962887763977,"party_welcome":0.0016756623517721891,"social_amenities":0.014664962887763977,"party_restriction":0.4845319092273712,"nearby_nightlife":0.3783721923828125,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A typical grocery run prior to arriving at your vacation home would include coffee, beer/wine, milk, eggs, butter, bread and any other basic groceries you would need for the meals you eat in the home. When it comes to coffee, bring your own coffee. We do not typically provide coffee but if you find coffee in the apartment please feel free to use it. You should bring or buy your own napkins, laundry detergent, your own beach towels and beach gear, and your own cooler if you need one. What we provide:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011316443124087527,"social_amenities":0.014664962887763977,"party_restriction":0.0001987496216315776,"nearby_nightlife":0.00057534797815606}},{"text":"We provide toilet paper (2 extras per bathroom), liquid hand washing dish soap, bathroom soap, sheets on each bed, and at least one bath towel for each guest. We do not permit our towels to be taken out of the house which is why you must bring your own towels if you visit the beach. If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002710424305405468,"social_amenities":0.006361900828778744,"party_restriction":0.0012592629063874483,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015904078027233481}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense. What to bring with you:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016756623517721891,"social_amenities":0.003304162062704563,"party_restriction":0.4845319092273712,"nearby_nightlife":0.3783721923828125}},{"text":"Hair dryer Unavailable: Shampoo Shampoo","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005901057738810778,"social_amenities":0.0018314019544050097,"party_restriction":0.002778508933261037,"nearby_nightlife":0.013559635728597641}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A typical grocery run prior to arriving at your vacation home would include coffee, beer/wine, milk, eggs, butter, bread and any other basic groceries you would need for the meals you eat in the home. When it comes to coffee, bring your own coffee. We do not typically provide coffee but if you find coffee in the apartment please feel free to use it. You should bring or buy your own napkins, laundry detergent, your own beach towels and beach gear, and your own cooler if you need one. What we provide:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011316443124087527,"social_amenities":0.014664962887763977,"party_restriction":0.0001987496216315776,"nearby_nightlife":0.00057534797815606}},{"text":"We provide toilet paper (2 extras per bathroom), liquid hand washing dish soap, bathroom soap, sheets on each bed, and at least one bath towel for each guest. We do not permit our towels to be taken out of the house which is why you must bring your own towels if you visit the beach. If you find we have left seasonings, oil, dishwasher pellets, or any unopened food or drinks then of course feel free to use what is there. We occasionally leave items but just cannot promise them all the time.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002710424305405468,"social_amenities":0.006361900828778744,"party_restriction":0.0012592629063874483,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015904078027233481}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense. What to bring with you:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016756623517721891,"social_amenities":0.003304162062704563,"party_restriction":0.4845319092273712,"nearby_nightlife":0.3783721923828125}},{"text":"This garden level apartment is in the most sought after area of the residential Historic District. Spacious ground level unit with two bedrooms and one bathroom. Equipped kitchen. Courtyard shared with owner who lives above. Parking is on the street (meters on the immediate block require payment weekdays and are free weekends). Free public street parking begins one block away. This unit is licensed for short term rental but multi-month executive rentals are preferred. SVR-01130 The space All ground level. This unit has two bedrooms (one California King and one Queen) and one Full bathroom which is accessible to both bedrooms. The kitchen is retro-modern and equipped for cooking.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037104246439412236,"social_amenities":0.00240670470520854,"party_restriction":0.003374293213710189,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017787234392017126}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d. We do not provide food or drinks but we do provide basic cooking and serving utensils, a coffee maker, and dish soap. Downtown Savannah has a major supermarket (Kroger) and a 24 hour market (Parkers on Drayton) so there is no need to pack everything from home if shopping when you get here makes more sense. What to bring with you:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016756623517721891,"social_amenities":0.003304162062704563,"party_restriction":0.4845319092273712,"nearby_nightlife":0.3783721923828125}},{"text":"Hair dryer Unavailable: Shampoo Shampoo","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005901057738810778,"social_amenities":0.0018314019544050097,"party_restriction":0.002778508933261037,"nearby_nightlife":0.013559635728597641}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 14019","address":"114 E TAYLOR ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":18,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":1},"combined":{"All calls":18,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complai