8191,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Nestled off of quiet Jones Lane within steps to beautiful Calhoun Square, this charming carriage house is the perfect hideaway in Historic Savannah. The space Nestled off of quiet Jones Lane within steps to beautiful Calhoun Square, this charming carriage house is the perfect hideaway in Historic Savannah. Start your stay beneath the majestic oak trees on Calhoun Square, where your feet touch cobblestone and the cicadas make the urban soundscape. Two Lucky guests will have the opportunity to see Savannah like a local - Red Door Hideaway is truly a hidden gem!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013956378097645938,"social_amenities":0.3869718611240387,"party_restriction":0.008329473435878754,"nearby_nightlife":0.003419585758820176}},{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-02267 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002500458213035017,"social_amenities":0.08263126760721207,"party_restriction":0.03052525781095028,"nearby_nightlife":0.005988797638565302}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"After a long day of exploring our beautiful city, rinse the day away in the spa-like walk-in shower, and enjoy an evening glass of wine on your private balcony. Everything you need can be reached on foot. The home is equally distanced between the Historic District\u2019s two most popular focal points, River Street and Forsyth Park, just steps away from Calhoun Square. Grab breakfast at Clary's, a we