le space, or you can put yourself right in the thick of the buzz of activity that is Savannah \u2014 the choice is yours. This property is literally steps from downtown! Located on famous Historic Jones Street, you can walk anywhere in the city with ease. Don't feel like walking? You can enjoy a free Downtowner or call a pedi-cab for a stroll around the city. This Property is perfect for Corporate & Monthly rentals. Ask about special monthly rates and discounts!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00086190365254879,"social_amenities":0.0017442370299249887,"party_restriction":0.0014823363162577152,"nearby_nightlife":0.7143108248710632}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Beautiful garden apartment on world famous Jones Street in Historic Savanna, GA. Live like a local, walk to shopping, pubs, and cafe's! Enjoy Savannah in Style The space Gorgeous 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment located on the ever-popular Jones Street. This charming apartment has beautiful hardwood flooring, two marble fireplaces and high ceilings. Located within walking distance of locally-owned shops and restaurants, such as Custard, Satchel, Public, and The Collins Quarter, this sweet little place is an ideal for enjoying Savannah as a local. This space is also within walking distance of beautiful Forsyth Park, Broughton Street, and City Market.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024633429711684585,"social_amenities":0.001694774255156517,"party_restriction":0.0005101616261526942,"nearby_nightlife":0.9817666411399841}},{"text":"This location in Historic Downtown Savannah means that you can relax and enjoy the serenity of this sweet little space, or you can put yourself right in the thick of the buzz of activity that is Savannah \u2014 the choice is yours. This property is literally steps from downtown! Located on famous Historic Jones Street, you can walk anywhere in the city with ease. Don't feel like walking? You can enjoy a free Downtowner or call a pedi-cab for a stroll around the city. This Property is perfect for Corporate & Monthly rentals. Ask about special monthly rates and discounts!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00086190365254879,"social_amenities":0.0017442370299249887,"party_restriction":0.0014823363162577152,"nearby_nightlife":0.7143108248710632}}]}}},{"listing_id":"25188576","title":"Luxury Parlor Apartment On Famous Jones Street!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/25188576","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-00553"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"25188576","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"09e6715178e3b427d29414ce5127a1632cbad7ff03c5dee22aec304c4bc30f55","chunks":5,"words":425,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.1709820032119751,"party_welcome":0.000496279972139746,"social_amenities":0.1709820032119751,"party_restriction":0.002208082005381584,"nearby_nightlife":0.8524175882339478,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stunning 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom Jones Street apartment. This chic living space on ever popular Jones Street, offers true Savannah elegance and unbeatable Southern charm. *Dog Friendly* The space Boasting prestigious city addresses, the wide, tree-lined Jones Street is a local favorite with original cobblestone streets and some of Savannah\u2019s most exquisite homes. This stunning 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment features hardwood floors, decorative fireplaces, and a lush courtyard. Gorgeous hardwood floors, grand decorative fireplaces, and a lush courtyard. Located within walking distance of a variety of locally-owned shops and restaurants, as well as beautiful Forsyth Park, Broughton Street and City Market.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000496279972139746,"social_amenities":0.1709820032119751,"party_restriction":0.002208082005381584,"nearby_nightlife":0.3933119773864746}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Bo