02106776274741,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006936077843420208}},{"text":"The carriage house is where the livery driver lived in the 1800s above the horses and carriages he cared for. The Wedding Cake Carriage House comes with a highly coveted garage parking space. The unusual design is evocative of a \u201cManhattan loft\u201d set in a historic 1869 carriage house. This surprise blending of original 1920 - 1940 art deco furnishings and many antique elements creates a fun, casual ambiance. The open and airy open concept living space showcases an entire wall of frosted artist windows, thus flooding the house with natural light.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017074992647394538,"social_amenities":0.005917457863688469,"party_restriction":0.000350983755197376,"nearby_nightlife":0.005398204084485769}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The carriage house is where the livery driver lived in the 1800s above the horses and carriages he cared for. The Wedding Cake Carriage House comes with a highly coveted garage parking space. The unusual design is evocative of a \u201cManhattan loft\u201d set in a historic 1869 carriage house. This surprise blending of original 1920 - 1940 art deco furnishings and many antique elements creates a fun, casual ambiance. The open and airy open concept living space showcases an entire wall of frosted artist windows, thus flooding the house with natural light.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017074992647394538,"social_amenities":0.005917457863688469,"party_restriction":0.000350983755197376,"nearby_nightlife":0.005398204084485769}},{"text":"There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009216496837325394,"social_amenities":0.004254999104887247,"party_restriction":0.0009405266609974205,"nearby_nightlife":0.025542814284563065}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Fr