t and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Location features Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035279744770377874,"social_amenities":0.010592034086585045,"party_restriction":0.0005181404994800687,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007164945127442479}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In building Free dryer \u2013 In building Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Location features Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035279744770377874,"social_amenities":0.010592034086585045,"party_restriction":0.0005181404994800687,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007164945127442479}},{"text":"Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005952986539341509,"social_amenities":0.003163193352520466,"party_restriction":0.001996606355533004,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008784980163909495}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The fee for one dog is $100 and must be paid separately before checking in. Must be able to provide proof of flea treatment etc. No untrained puppies. No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.720891542499885e-05,"social_amenities":0.0007845557993277907,"party_restriction":0.9955171942710876,"nearby_nightlife":0.003536819014698267}},{"text":"The apartment provides one bathroom with a single vanity, shower/tub combination, and essentials, including towels, toilet paper, shampoo, body wash, and a hair dryer. Working remotely during your stay? Our high-speed WiFi supports video conferencing and multitasking, and a dedicated workspace is at the foot of the queen bed. Guest access The entire apartment is for your use! The courtyard is shared but rarely used, and there is a washer/dryer room through the doors at the back of the courtyard that you may use for free. Other things to note We allow up to ONE (1) dog max, no cats.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001668981567490846,"social_amenities":0.0007360398303717375,"party_restriction":0.00387724325992167,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033595673739910126}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to The Cozy Jones Garden, your tucked-away garden apartment on Jones. With a low ceiling due to its historic nature, this quaint garden apartment provides one queen bed and a cozy space to relax and unwind after exploring beautiful Savannah. Enjoy a shared courtyard that provides a calming outdoor experience. Perfectly located, you will be just minutes from Forsyth Park, multiple squares, the City Market, and all the fine dining, pubs, and attractions you expect from Savannah. SVR-02637 The space Simple in design and high in functionality, this garden apartment has been updated to provide all the necessary amenities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011084779544034973,"social_amenities":0.0008816368062980473,"party_restriction":0.0006417853874154389,"nearby_nightlife":0.9530477523803711}},{"text":"The fee for one dog is $100 and must be paid separately before checking in. Must be able to provide proof of flea treatment etc. No untrained puppies. No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.720891542499885e-05,"social_amenities":0.0007845557993277907,"party_restriction":0.9955171942710876,"nearby_nightlife":0.003536819014698267}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1136822912078376550","title":"Jones St Jewel, Charming | Central | Pet-Friendly!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1136822912078376550","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02637"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1136822912078376550","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bfee4d66bb39be409b1338f97d5b871efc321aa2b2cd2e65bcbe362386f392ba","chunks":8,"words":713,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.015286932699382305,"party_welcome":0.0003004014724865556,"social_amenities":0.015286932699382305,"party_restriction":0.9787776470184326,"nearby_nightlife":0.025005947798490524,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In building Free dryer \u2013 In building Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling AC - split type ductless system Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002858412335626781,"social_amenities":0.015286932699382305,"party_restriction":0.0003504197229631245,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005462303524836898}},{"text":"Enter the building through the main entrance that leads to a shared, brick-lined courtyard, where you will take the black steel staircase to your third-floor apartment. Through the front door, find an efficient apartment with fresh updates, stylish d\u00e9cor, and all the amenities you need for a comfortable stay. You will first step into the living room, designed as a front-to-back apartment. Find a comfortable two-person sofa and a smart TV ready to stream your favorite shows there. Connecting to the back of the apartment is a small galley kitchen with a full appliance package appointed with everything you need to cook during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014362986257765442,"social_amenities":0.006453037727624178,"party_restriction":0.0003222573723178357,"nearby_nightlife":0.002492328407242894}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"GE stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Outdoor Patio or balcony Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003004014724865556,"social_amenities":0.004