ared, brick-lined courtyard, where you will take the black steel staircase to your third-floor apartment. Through the front door, find an efficient apartment with fresh updates, stylish d\u00e9cor, and all the amenities you need for a comfortable stay. You will first step into the living room, designed as a front-to-back apartment. Find a comfortable two-person sofa and a smart TV ready to stream your favorite shows there. Connecting to the back of the apartment is a small galley kitchen with a full appliance package appointed with everything you need to cook during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014362986257765442,"social_amenities":0.006453037727624178,"party_restriction":0.0003222573723178357,"nearby_nightlife":0.002492328407242894}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Stained linens may result in a linen fee of up to $50 per item. Please treat the home as your own and let us know if anything breaks. We are much more empathetic to those who are honest and upfront with us :) Do not flush ANY thing other than toilet paper down the toilets (\"flushable\" wet wipes are not permitted either). If we have to call an emergency plumber and find that the cause of a blockage is due to something unpermitted being flushed, you will be subject to a $250 fee No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001261879806406796,"social_amenities":0.0012459774734452367,"party_restriction":0.9787776470184326,"nearby_nightlife":0.02149677835404873}},{"text":"No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.047473652870394e-05,"social_amenities":0.0007383240736089647,"party_restriction":0.15361091494560242,"nearby_nightlife":0.007474908139556646}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to the Jones St Jewel, a quaint, one-bedroom efficiency unit located on the historic and beautiful Jones Street in the heart of Savannah. Featuring a comfortable queen bed, fully equipped kitchen, and cozy living room, you will have everything you need just minutes from everything downtown offers. Tucked away on the third floor from a shared courtyard, you will have all the vibes you want with a trip to Savannah. Need more space? This unit can be rented with another studio below. The space SVR-02637","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010876429587369785,"social_amenities":0.00206607673317194,"party_restriction":0.002447411185130477,"nearby_nightlife":0.025005947798490524}},{"text":"Stained linens may result in a linen fee of up to $50 per item. Please treat the home as your own and let us know if anything breaks. We are much more empathetic to those who are honest and upfront with us :) Do not flush ANY thing other than toilet paper down the toilets (\"flushable\" wet wipes are not permitted either). If we have to call an emergency plumber and find that the cause of a blockage is due to something unpermitted being flushed, you will be subject to a $250 fee No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001261879806406796,"social_amenities":0.0012459774734452367,"party_restriction":0.9787776470184326,"nearby_nightlife":0.02149677835404873}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1279660133700518281","title":"The Quaint Quarters on Jones, Historic | Quiet","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1279660133700518281","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-02637"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1279660133700518281","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7d185744b640fc45f36e9d