ion":0.9976789355278015,"nearby_nightlife":0.2921116352081299}},{"text":"Welcome to The Quaint Quarters on Jones, a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground-floor apartment nestled in the heart of historic downtown Savannah. This cozy retreat blends timeless character with modern comforts, featuring historic details and a lovely, shared courtyard. Just minutes from Forsyth Park and steps away from dining, shops, and top attractions, it\u2019s the perfect spot to experience Savannah\u2019s charm, culture, and vibrant city life. Book now for an unforgettable stay! SVR-02637 The space Enter Quaint Quarters on Jones through the main entrance, leading to a charming, shared brick-lined courtyard, where you'll find your private ground-floor entrance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016785316984169185,"social_amenities":0.002294413046911359,"party_restriction":0.0017523941351100802,"nearby_nightlife":0.08356530219316483}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"There is a shred courtyard in the rear that you may use at your leisure. The access to washers/dryers is through the courtyard as well. Other things to note No parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.495086588780396e-05,"social_amenities":0.0010464764200150967,"party_restriction":0.9976789355278015,"nearby_nightlife":0.2921116352081299}},{"text":"Welcome to The Quaint Quarters on Jones, a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground-floor apartment nestled in the heart of historic downtown Savannah. This cozy retreat blends timeless character with modern comforts, featuring historic details and a lovely, shared courtyard. Just minutes from Forsyth Park and steps away from dining, shops, and top attractions, it\u2019s the perfect spot to experience Savannah\u2019s charm, culture, and vibrant city life. Book now for an unforgettable stay! SVR-02637 The space Enter Quaint Quarters on Jones through the main entrance, leading to a charming, shared brick-lined courtyard, where you'll find your private ground-floor entrance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016785316984169185,"social_amenities":0.002294413046911359,"party_restriction":0.0017523941351100802,"nearby_nightlife":0.08356530219316483}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1351000440289022963","title":"The Timekeeper\u2019s Nook, Historic | Quiet","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1351000440289022963","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02637"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1351000440289022963","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b1ff32b2149f1f6af13eac61105f5ee8b2a9ce8b335f63bc34d0d25d791aa2f3","chunks":6,"words":555,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.06766526401042938,"party_welcome":0.0007946695550344884,"social_amenities":0.06766526401042938,"party_restriction":0.9985184073448181,"nearby_nightlife":0.949924886226654,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Step inside to find original hardwood floors and whitewashed brick walls that set the tone for a warm and welcoming stay. Thoughtfully decorated with elegant furnishings, soft lighting, and tasteful accents, the space exudes both sophistication and comfort\u2014perfect for relaxing after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s cobblestone streets. The galley kitchen is fully stocked with everything you need to prepare meals, including pots, pans, utensils, and small appliances like a coffee maker, toaster, and microwave. Whether you're cooking a romantic dinner or enjoying a morning cup of coffee, the cozy dining table for two offers the perfect setting. This thoughtfully designed apartment features two distinct spaces for unwinding.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007946695550344884,"social_amenities":0.06766526401042938,"party_restriction":0.0573127381503582,"nearby_nightlife":0.004104649648070335}},{"text":"Nestled on Savannah\u2019s famed Jones Street, this charming 1-bed, 1-bath retreat blends history with modern comfort. Featuring a cozy galley kitchen, elegant historic touches, and a peaceful sitting room, it\u2019s perfect for relaxation. An inviting entertainment room offers space to unwind. Steps from downtown\u2019s top attractions, dining, and the city's signature charm, this quiet escape is ideal for a romantic getaway or solo retreat. Experience Savannah\u2019s beauty from the heart of it all! SVR-02637 The space Welcome to your charming Savannah retreat on historic Jones Street! This cozy second-floor apartment blends timeless character with modern convenience, creating an inviting escape for travelers seeking comfort and style.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.350407733814791e-05,"social_amenities":0.020150797441601753,"party_restriction":0.0025234567001461983,"nearby_nightlife":0.09776810556650162}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Step inside to find original hardwood floors and whitewashed brick walls that set the tone for a warm and welcoming stay. Thoughtfully decorated with elegant furnishings, soft lighting, and tasteful accents, the space exudes both sophistication and comfort\u2014perfect for relaxing after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s cobblestone streets. The galley kitchen is fully stocked with everything you need to prepare meals, including pots, pans, utensils, and small appliances like a coffee maker, toaster, and microwave. Whether you're cooking a romantic dinner or enjoying a morning cup of coffee, the cozy dining table for two offers the perfect setting. This thoughtfully designed apartment features two distinct spaces for unwinding.","section":"F