enced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Parking and facilities Free street parking Paid parking lot off premises Services Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002255513536510989,"social_amenities":0.002595268888399005,"party_restriction":0.0009318641969002783,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006037175189703703}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"If you are looking for a quiet getaway to Savannah, the Wright Suite is the right suite for you! This pretty apartment oozes Savannah charm and is perfect for couples, solo guests, business travelers and anyone who wants to experience all that Savannah has to offer. Food, entertainment, Forsyth Park, River Street...walk anywhere you desire from this apartment on Jones street. This apartment is on the third floor of an historic house smack dab in the heart of the historic district. The space If you are looking for a quiet getaway to Savannah, the Wright Suite is the right suite for you!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046096189180389047,"social_amenities":0.24488484859466553,"party_restriction":0.04326216131448746,"nearby_nightlife":0.9019894003868103}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Individual Travel Size shampoo Individual Travel Size conditioner Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In building Free dryer \u2013 In building Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Includes a table Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper","section":"AMENITIES","line":54,"scores":{"pa