dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Cameras are located in the public areas. Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030144292395561934,"social_amenities":0.018470967188477516,"party_restriction":0.0004375971620902419,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011175398249179125}},{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free street parking Paid street parking off premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm This place may not have a carbon monoxide detector. Reach out to the host with any questions.","section":"AMENITIES","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016396048886235803,"social_amenities":0.01656881719827652,"party_restriction":0.0006991625996306539,"nearby_nightlife":0.00047209064359776676}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Classic Quarters at the 101 is Unit 3, located up one flight of stairs from the building's entrance. Other things to note * This condo is professionally cleaned and thoughtfully stocked with essentials like soap, shampoo, and fresh towels for your arrival. * Please be aware that the unit is on the second floor and requires guests to walk up one flight of stairs to access it. * The fireplaces within the home are historic and for decorative purposes only; they are not functional. * City of Savannah Short-Term Vacation Rental Permit #: SVR-02744 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021472939988598228,"social_amenities":0.0013416658621281385,"party_restriction":0.0026444480754435062,"nearby_nightlife":0.010391069576144218}},{"text":"Experience historic Savannah in our elegant 2-bedroom, 2-bath condo for 4. Located in the heart of the historic district, this charming retreat blends Victorian architecture with modern comforts. Just one block from Forsyth Park and steps from the Mercer-Williams House Museum, our walkable location is unbeatable. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, Wi-Fi, and a unique stay in a beautifully restored 1870s building. Perfect for couples or small families seeking a stylish and central Savannah getaway. The space Welcome to Classic Quarters at the 101, your charming retreat in the heart of Savannah's historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010087760165333748,"social_amenities":0.0038142893463373184,"party_restriction":0.001947264769114554,"nearby_nightlife":0.007358281407505274}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Classic Quarters at the 101 is Unit 3, located up one flight of stairs from the building's entrance. Other things to note * This condo is professionally cleaned and thoughtfully stocked with essentials like soap, shampoo, and fresh towels for your arrival. * Please be aware that the unit is on the second floor and requires guests to walk up one flight of stairs to access it. * The fireplaces within the home are historic and for decorative purposes only; they are not functional. * City of Savannah Short-Term Vacation Rental Permit #: SVR-02744 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021472939988598228,"social_amenities":0.0013416658621281385,"party_restriction":0.0026444480754435062,"nearby_nightlife":0.010391069576144218}},{"text":"Experience historic Savannah in our elegant 2-bedroom, 2-bath condo for 4. Located in the heart of the historic district, this charming retreat blends Victorian architecture with modern comforts. Just one block from Forsyth Park and steps from the Mercer-Williams House Museum, our walkable location is unbeatable. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, Wi-Fi, and a unique stay in a beautifully restored 1870s building. Perfect for couples or small families seeking a stylish and central Savannah getaway. The space Welcome to Classic Quarters at the 101, your charming retreat in the heart of Savannah's historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010087760165333748,"social_amenities":0.0038142893463373184,"party_restriction":0.001947264769114554,"nearby_nightlife":0.007358281407505274}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1334794709869897594","title":"Charming Historic District Retreat","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1334794709869897594","guests":3.0,"permits":["SVR-02745"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1334794709869897594","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d40b77c00138e79ab75d86538fd23e429b2c360bb463cdf1ab7b6e58bb7519ef","chunks":7,"words":638,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8212904930114746,"party_welcome":0.0007146485731936991,"social_amenities":0.8212904930114746,"party_restriction":0.011941666714847088,"nearby_nightlife":0.45496225357055664,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Escape to this charming one-bedroom apartment in the heart of Savannah's Historic District. Perfect for two, this top-floor retreat blends modern comfort with Southern charm, featuring a king bed and two cozy brick fireplaces. Located just steps from Jones Street and Forsyth Park, it's the ideal walkable base for exploring the city's history and culture. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen and high-speed Wi-Fi for a perfect stay. The space Welcome to your perfect escape in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This beautifully designed one-bedroom apartment blends timeless Southern charm with modern comfort, offering a serene base for you to explore the city's vibrant history and culture.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011475705105112866,"social_amenities":0.8212904930114746,"party_restriction":0.01028398983180523,"nearby_nightlife":0.05039709061384201}},{"text":"Self-check-in with a smart lock is available for your convenience, allowing you to arrive and settle in with ease at any time after check-in. This unit is on the top floor of the building. There is a set of exterior stairs to enter the building and then this unit is up two flights of stairs. From the living room there are beautiful views of the city. Other things to note Stairs Required: This unit is located on the top floor of the building. Access requires climbing one set of exterior stairs to enter the building, followed by two internal flights of stairs to reach the apartment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007146485731936991,"social_amenities":0.47294294834136963,"party_restriction":0.011941666714847088,"nearby_nightlife":0.01122075505554676}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Self-check-in with a smart lock is available for your convenience, allowing you to arrive and settle in with ease at any time after check-in. This unit is on the top floor of the building. There is a set of exterior stairs to enter the building and then this unit is up two flights of stairs. From the living room there are beautiful views of the city. Other things to note Stairs Required: This unit is located on the top floor of the building. Access requires climbing one set of exterior stairs to enter the building, followed by two internal flights of stairs to reach the apartment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007146485731936991,"social_amenities":0.47294294834136963,"party_restriction":0.011941666714847088,"nearby_nightlife":0.01122075505554676}},{"text":"Step inside and relax in the cozy living room, featuring a comfortable leather sofa, swivel chairs, and a rustic brick fireplace. The adjoining kitchen is fully equipped for your culinary adventures with updated cabinetry, stone countertops, and stainless steel appliances. Your peaceful retreat awaits in the king suite, complete with a second brick fireplace and built-in storage. The private en-suite bathroom adds a touch of luxury with its beautifully tiled tub and shower combination, perfect for unwinding after a day of sightseeing. Key Amenities: Plush king-size bed En-suite bathroom Fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances Two cozy brick fireplaces High-speed Wi-Fi & large television Air conditioning & ceiling fans","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005211253883317113,"social_amenities":0.34619221091270447,"party_restriction":0.0018160258186981082,"nearby_nightlife":0.005010208580642939}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Escape to this charming one-bedroom apartment in the heart of Savannah's Historic District. Perfect for two, this top-floor retreat blends modern comfort with Southern charm, featuring a king bed and two cozy brick fireplaces. Located just steps from Jones Street and Forsyth Park, it's the ideal walkable base for exploring the city's history and culture. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen and high-speed Wi-Fi for a perfect stay. The space Welcome to your perfect escape in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. This beautifully designed one-bedroom apartment blends timeless Southern charm with modern comfort, offering a serene base for you to explore the city's vibrant history and culture.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011475705105112866,"social_amenities