oom. We have a fully equipped kitchen with lots of counter top space perfect for those who like to cook. The main living room has plenty of space to relax and unwind in. There is a large smart TV with a booming soundbar if you're here while your favorite sports team is playing!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005566252511925995,"social_amenities":0.825873851776123,"party_restriction":0.0004886524984613061,"nearby_nightlife":0.021583590656518936}},{"text":"Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass BBQ grill Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003363488067407161,"social_amenities":0.07832353562116623,"party_restriction":0.0016565520782023668,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007992488681338727}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"If you are one of the unfortunate people who has work to do while on vacation, do not fear, we have a great WiFi connection. There are also plenty of wine glasses in the dining room kitchen for when you're done. We also offer a full washer/dryer (free) in the laundry room by the kitchen. Guest access You are welcome to use every inch of the house. There is a utility/housekeeping closet by the kitchen that is locked up and off-limits, but other than that it is all yours.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001898686750791967,"social_amenities":0.0068350909277796745,"party_restriction":0.0003792581846937537,"nearby_nightlife":0.0066149914637207985}},{"text":"Each room has plenty of closet space. There is a screened-in-porch on the east side of the building and a huge outdoor rear patio equipped with a propane grill and plenty of seating room. We have a fully equipped kitchen with lots of counter top space perfect for those who like to cook. The main living room has plenty of space to relax and unwind in. There is a large smart TV with a booming soundbar if you're here while your favorite sports team is playing!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005566252511925995,"social_amenities":0.825873851776123,"party_restriction":0.0004886524984613061,"nearby_nightlife":0.021583590656518936}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Each room has plenty of closet space. There is a screened-in-porch on the east side of the building and a huge outdoor rear patio equipped with a propane grill and plenty of seating room. We have a fully equipped kitchen with lots of counter top space perfect for those who like to cook. The main living room has plenty of space to relax and unwind in. There is a large smart TV with a booming soundbar if you're here while your favorite sports team is playing!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005566252511925995,"social_amenities":0.825873851776123,"party_restriction":0.0004886524984613061,"nearby_nightlife":0.021583590656518936}},{"text":"Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass BBQ grill Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003363488067407161,"social_amenities":0.07832353562116623,"party_restriction":0.0016565520782023668,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007992488681338727}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Please be gentle with our furniture as the owners have put a lot of time and energy into making this place somewhere you can call your home away from home. Again, there is a full laundry room with a washer/dryer should you need it while you are here. Other things to note Please be respectful of your neighbors and ke