t in two phases between 1852 and 1854. In the first phase, the 3 or 4 houses on each end of the block were built and in the second phase the middle portion was built. There are a total of 15 houses in the row. The houses were built in the Federalist (US) or Regency Style (UK). Each house is four stories high and contains about 3,300 square feet. The Federalist Style emphasizes square, classical features, plain decorations and mirror image rooms. NOTES: Minimum age to reserve is 25 years of age. NO pets or smoking.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.984856685856357e-05,"social_amenities":0.0011735488660633564,"party_restriction":0.017518147826194763,"nearby_nightlife":0.004517000168561935}},{"text":"Fully renovated ground floor apartment in an historic 1854 townhouse overlooking Chatham Square. This prime location is just one block from Forsyth Park and walkable to a variety of museums, restaurants and shopping. The space This stunning fully renovated garden/ground level suite in an historic 1854 townhome overlooking charming Chatham Square. This prime location is just one block from Forsyth Park and the neighborhood contains some of the city\u2019s best row houses. It\u2019s a short walk from a variety of museums and historic sites, as well as restaurants, grocery stores, and shops. Living room is open & spacious with comfy seating & a dining table.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012312140315771103,"social_amenities":0.319050669670105,"party_restriction":0.009584199637174606,"nearby_nightlife":0.2908397912979126}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Fully renovated ground floor apartment in an historic 1854 townhouse overlooking Chatham Square. This prime location is just one block from Forsyth Park and walkable to a variety of museums, restaurants and shopping. The space This stunning fully renovated garden/ground level suite in an historic 1854 townhome overlooking charming Chatham Square. This prime