d metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022531469585373998,"social_amenities":0.3799126446247101,"party_restriction":0.1439833641052246,"nearby_nightlife":0.011912832967936993}},{"text":"This studio carriage house is located off of Gordon Lane, only one block away from the city's largest green space, Forsyth Park. Birds Nest Carriage provides an intimate space for two, ideal for a romantic getaway, or perfect for an extended stay. The space Located off of Gordon Lane, this historic brick carriage house sits in the tree-lined residential area of the downtown historic district. You won't compromise location, as this property is only one block from the Fountain at Forsyth Park. Whether booking for a couples getaway, or an extended stay, you'll enjoy your stay at Birds Nest Carriage House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.700067777070217e-05,"social_amenities":0.009511050768196583,"party_restriction":0.0030316191259771585,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005545861204154789}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047339993761852384,"social_amenities":0.0015468834899365902,"party_restriction":0.00043318982352502644,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006994738359935582}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Due North you'll come across many of Savannah's local shops, cafes, and eateries. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022531469585373998,"social_amenities":0.3799126446247101,"party_restriction":0.1439833641052246,"nearby_nightlife":0.011912832967936993}},{"text":"This studio carriage house is located off of Gordon Lane, only one block away from the city's largest green space, Forsyth Park. Birds Nest Carriage provides an intimate space for two, ideal for a romantic getaway, or perfect for an extended stay. The space Located off of Gordon Lane, this historic brick carriage house sits in the tree-lined residential area of the downtown historic district. You won't compromise location, as this property is only one block from the Fountain at Forsyth Park. Whether booking for a couples getaway, or an extended stay, you'll enjoy your stay at Birds Nest Carriage House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.700067777070217e-05,"social_amenities":0.009511050768196583,"party_restriction":0.0030316191259771585,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005545861204154789}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Due North you'll come across many of Savannah's local shops, cafes, and eateries. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022531469585373998,"social_amenities":0.3799126446247101,"party_restriction":0.1439833641052246,"nearby_nightlife":0.011912832967936993}},{"text":"This studio carriage house is located off of Gordon Lane, only one block away from the city's largest green space, Forsyth Park. Birds Nest Carriage provides an intimate space for two, ideal for a romantic getaway, or perfect for an extended stay. The space Located off of Gordon Lane, this historic brick carriage house sits in the tree-lined residential area of the downtown historic district. You won't compromise location, as this property is only one block from the Fountain at Forsyth Park. Whether booking for a couples getaway, or an extended stay, you'll enjoy your stay at Birds Nest Carriage House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.700067777070217e-05,"social_amenities":0.009511050768196583,"party_restriction":0.0030316191259771585,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005545861204154789}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Upon entering you are greeted by a charming, spiral, wrought iron staircase that leads to the studio. Up-top you will find the unit to be packed with amenities, such as a stove top, fridge, large bathroom, and two spacious closets. You'll feel at home here with a spot to store all your luggage, and a lovely renovated bathroom with a spacious shower A Queen size bed sits in the middle of the room, with a smart TV at the foot of the bed for you to enjoy after exploring the city all day. Guests are also able to enjoy the private tree-lined courtyard, shared with the garden-level tenants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015448854537680745,"social_amenities":0.0011293429415673018,"party_restriction":0.00033872842323035,"nearby_nightlife":0.013988754712045193}},{"text":"Due North you'll come across many of Savannah's local shops, cafes, and eateries. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022531469585373998,"social_amenities":0.3799126446247101,"party_restriction":0.1439833641052246,"nearby_nightlife":0.011912832967936993}}]}}},{"listing_id":"584033497229743404","title":"Romantic Garden Apartment on Chatham Square","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/584033497229743404","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01912"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"584033497229743404","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2034bd3532af2094f1f548d99b6c85461010a0029c1c54d936940d749c49f889","chunks":15,"words":1452,"party_signal":0.9757475256919861,"social_signal":0.06395021826028824,"party_welcome":0.9757475256919861,"social_amenities":0.06395021826028824,"party_restriction":0.0076869637705385685,"nearby_nightlife":0.9634352922439575,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Tall French doors let in light and provide a lovely view of the garden outside. This part of the home also includes a dining table with two chairs, so you can have a spot to enjoy a lazy breakfast or host a dinner party. To the side of the living space is a fully-equipped kitchen. An antique fireplace and hutch reference the home's historic past, while stainless steel appliances and white subway tile add a touch of modernity. The kitchen contains a refrigerator, dishwasher, microwave, stove, and oven, so it's easy to cook at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9757475256919861,"social_amenities":0.00803622417151928,"party_restriction":0.00020315480651333928,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011835661716759205},"affirmative_event_evidence":"This part of the home also includes a dining table with two chairs, so you can have a spot to enjoy a lazy breakfast or host a dinner party."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":221,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036496840766631067,"social_amenities":0.06395021826028824,"party_restriction":0.00132588145788759,"nearby_nightlife":0.000535507861059159}},{"text":"We Provide the Ideal Spot for Relaxing in Nature One of the best things about this home is its garden-side design. The French doors in the living room lead directly to a relaxing courtyard. This roomy space is shared with other Savannah vacation homes, and it's the perfect getaway. You can rest in the sun and catch a breeze away from the hustle and bustle of the city. A bubbling fountain and beautifully maintained hedges are a fantastic backdrop to your vacation. The courtyard is outfitted with a variety of lounge and dining furniture.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.749466360313818e-05,"social_amenities":0.04449976980686188,"party_restriction":0.00059910659911111,"nearby_nightlife":0.00947666261345148}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Tall French doors let in light and provide a lovely view of the garden outside. This part of the home also includes a dining table with two chairs, so you can have a spot to enjoy a lazy breakfast or host a dinner party. To the side of the living space is a fully-equipped kitchen. An antique fireplace and hutch reference the home's historic past, while stainless steel appliances and white subway tile add a touch of modernity. The kitchen contains a refrigerator, dishwasher, microwave, stove, and oven, so it's easy to cook at home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9757475256919861,"social_amenities":0.00803622417151928,"party_restriction":0.00020315480651333928,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011835661716759205}},{"text":"Once you're ready to travel outside of the immediate neighborhood, you'll find all sorts of fantastic things to do. Savannah is one of the oldest cities in the nation, so it is home to beautiful Colonial and Victorian architecture. You can hop on the free trolley to tour the historic districts, or you can learn about the town at one of its many museums. Savannah is also known for its arts and culture. The town is a great spot to visit if you enjoy exploring art museums or going to concerts. Depending on when you visit the town, there can be fun local events like holiday parades and pride festivals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":89,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05296183004975319,"social_amenities":0.004220523405820131,"party_restriction":0.0076869637705385685,"nearby_nightlife":0.9476535320281982}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Paid parking off premises Single level home No stairs in home Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":221,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036496840766631067,"social_amenities":0.06395021826028824,"party_restriction":0.00132588145788759,"nearby_nightlife":0.000535507861059159}},{"text":"Location: Centrally located in Historic District on Chatham Square; just a short walk away from Forsyth Park, coffee shops, restaurants, shopping, and museums Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005517668905667961,"social_amenities":0.04892445355653763,"party_restriction":0.0021366376895457506,"nearby_nightlife":0.6822437644004822}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Once you're ready to travel outside of the immediate neighborhood, you'll find all sorts of fantastic things to do. Savannah is one of the oldest cities in the nation, so it is home to beautiful Colonial and Victorian architecture. You can hop on the free trolley to tour the historic districts, or you can learn about the town at one of its many museums. Savannah is also known for its arts and culture. The town is a great spot to visit if you enjoy exploring art museums or going to concerts. Depending on when you visit the town, there can be fun local events like holiday parades and pride festivals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":89,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05296183004975319,"social_amenities":0.004220523405820131,"party_restriction":0.0076869637705385685,"nearby_nightlife":0.9476535320281982}},{"text":"This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Long-Term Stays For our long-term stays, 30 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For these reservations, we require an additional cleaning at a cost every 30 days. The cleaning cost varies by property. Our office will be in touch to schedule. Occupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":153,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016205816064029932,"social_amenities":0.004803201649338007,"party_restriction":0.0043966397643089294,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014630220830440521}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Explore Historic Savannah From Our Centrally Located Vacation Home One of the big reasons many people choose 1852 Garden is for its incredible location. This vacation home is situated on one of the blocks surrounding renowned Forsyth Park. The park is a great spot to go for a walk, play a game of tennis, or see historical landmarks. Since it's one of the most popular locations in Savannah, the neighborhood also attracts some of Savannah's best restaurants and shops. Our Savannah vacation home is right by several delicious spots like Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, Wicked Cakes of Savannah, and Collins Quarter.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028415335691533983,"social_amenities":0.0031876899302005768,"party_restriction":0.0020571532659232616,"nearby_nightlife":0.9634352922439575}},{"text":"Once you're ready to travel outside of the immediate neighborhood, you'll find all sorts of fantastic things to do. Savannah is one of the oldest cities in the nation, so it is home to beautiful Colonial and Victorian architecture. You can hop on the free trolley to tour the historic districts, or you can learn about the town at one of its many museums. Savannah is also known for its arts and culture. The town is a great spot to visit if you enjoy exploring art museums or going to concerts. Depending on when you visit the town, there can be fun local events like holiday parades and pride festivals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":89,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05296183004975319,"social_amenities":0.004220523405820131,"party_restriction":0.0076869637705385685,"nearby_nightlife":0.9476535320281982}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 42012","address":"107 W GORDON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":20.0,"advertised_guests":3.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1108736298348335657","title":"Iconic, Historic Condo Steps from Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1108736298348335657","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02734"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1108736298348335657","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d4581fe1ce948b9e4c794e9a07efa01adeeceabb7c00a03a7cc2e0083b1df2c5","chunks":7,"words":590,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.030312713235616684,"party_welcome":0.0006266915588639677,"social_amenities":0.030312713235616684,"party_restriction":0.0026401355862617493,"nearby_nightlife":0.039936162531375885,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Discover Savannah's charm in this historic condo, nestled in the parlor level of an incredibly restored row home in the heart of the Historic District. One bedroom, one bathroom, and an eat-in kitchen, all adorned with classic, Parisian-inspired details and architecture. A romantic getaway perfect for couples, solo-travelers, and those that want to experience a true Savannah stay! Just steps from Forsyth Park and nearby attractions, experience the city's beauty right at your doorstep! SVR-02734 The space This condo is located on the parlor level (first floor, up the exterior stairs) of a quintessential Savannah rowhouse in the downtown, historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014823567471466959,"social_amenities":0.030312713235616684,"party_restriction":0.0014994736993685365,"nearby_nightlife":0.006725897081196308}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In building Free dryer \u2013 In building Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage: dresser Entertainment 50 inch HDTV with Roku, standard cable Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - always at the listing Heating and cooling AC - split type ductless system Heating - split type ductless system Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have one exterior security camera, located outside of the front door/main entrance to the building to ensure building security and guest safety. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm","section":"AMENITIES","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029276622808538377,"social_amenities":0.008702297694981098,"party_restriction":0.0026401355862617493,"nearby_nightlife":0.002612561685964465}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Once inside, you will find an open living space with soaring ceilings, architectural details of a bygone era, and plenty of modern upgrades! Off the living space is a thoughtfully partitioned sleeping area, featuring king-sized bed, crisp linens, and incredible views from the floor to ceiling windows! Head beyond the living space and find an eat-in kitchen with everything you would need to whip up a quick meal before heading out to enjoy all the adventures our city has to offer! Fast wifi, spacious design, plenty of storage, laundry facilities on-site, and all the conveniences of home await! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006266915588639677,"social_amenities":0.005109897814691067,"party_restriction":0.00143039645627141,"nearby_nightlife":0.039936162531375885}},{"text":"The entire first floor condo (parlor level, as we like to call it here in the South) is all yours! Ascend the front, exterior, wrought iron adorned staircase and enter the home's front door. Your private condo entrance is right there, off the foyer. The entire condo is all yours! If you need to access the laundry facilities, they are located in the courtyard. Just let us know and we are happy to provide details! Other things to note Parking can be tricky in downtown Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003613293811213225,"social_amenities":0.00027788893203251064,"party_restriction":0.0006839024135842919,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031085486989468336}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Discover Savannah's charm in this historic condo, nestled in the parlor level of an incredibly restored row home in the heart of the Historic District. One bedroom, one bathroom, and an eat-in kitchen, al