tecture. A romantic getaway perfect for couples, solo-travelers, and those that want to experience a true Savannah stay! Just steps from Forsyth Park and nearby attractions, experience the city's beauty right at your doorstep! SVR-02734 The space This condo is located on the parlor level (first floor, up the exterior stairs) of a quintessential Savannah rowhouse in the downtown, historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014823567471466959,"social_amenities":0.030312713235616684,"party_restriction":0.0014994736993685365,"nearby_nightlife":0.006725897081196308}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1109525189093111378","title":"Classic Downtown Flat Filled With Savannah Charm!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1109525189093111378","guests":3.0,"permits":["SVR-02735"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1109525189093111378","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e1adb0f9d325150f4106a7a224cb83bab7d53acc19a7f33240c751e8a942662c","chunks":8,"words":645,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.005632531829178333,"party_welcome":0.011407052166759968,"social_amenities":0.005632531829178333,"party_restriction":0.0028104097582399845,"nearby_nightlife":0.9851614236831665,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 413 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Electric stove Stainless steel single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005079654511064291,"social_amenities":0.005632531829178333,"party_restriction":0.0004831633123103529,"nearby_nightlife":0.000550274271517992}},{"text":"Full, eat-in kitchen with lots of thoughtful touches (not to mention fully stocked!) awaits! Dining for four at the adorable table, enjoy a cup of coffee from the Keurig (kcups, creamer, and sugar provided, of course!), or a nice dinner in. Our thoughtfully renovated bathroom features a spa-like glass enclosed shower and so much style! Staying with us for a while? No worries, laundry-facilities in the condo are there if you need them! But the best part is our location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.011407052166759968,"social_amenities":0.0043527306988835335,"party_restriction":0.0010386845096945763,"nearby_nightlife":0.08332327753305435}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Full, eat-in kitchen with lots of thoughtful touches (not to mention fully stocked!) awaits! Dining for four at the adorable table, enjoy a cup of coffee from the Keurig (kcups, creamer, and sugar provided, of course!), or a nice dinner in. Our thoughtfully renovated bathroom features a spa-like glass enclosed shower and so much style! Staying with us for a while? No worries, laundry-facilities in the condo are there if you need them! But the best part is our location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.011407052166759968,"social_amenities":0.0043527306988835335,"party_restriction":0.0010386845096945763,"nearby_nightlife":0.08332327753305435}},{"text":"We love offering a cozy, comfortable space for guests, but the real fun begins when you discover how walkable and centrally located this condo is from all the fun, history, and dining downtown Savannah has to offer! Cheers y'all, we can't WAIT to host you! Guest access The entire second floor condo is all yours and completely private. Other things to note Parking can be tricky in downtown Savannah! The parking options nearby are paid street parking, which can either be paid using the kiosks/meters, the Park Savannah App, or by purchasing a day pass from the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004160684533417225,"social_amenities":0.0012389052426442504,"party_restriction":0.001145867514424026,"nearby_nightlife":0.9851614236831665}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 413 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Electric stove Stainless steel single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005079654511064291,"social_amenities":0.005632531829178333,"party_restriction":0.0004831633123103529,"nearby_nightlife":0.000550274271517992}},{"text":"Full, eat-in kitchen with lots of thoughtful touches (not to mention fully stocked!) awaits! Dining for four at the adorable table, enjoy a cup of coffee from the Keurig (kcups, creamer, and sugar provided, of course!), or a nice dinner in. Our thoughtfully renovated bathroom features a spa-like glass enclosed shower and so much style! Staying with us for a while? No worries, laundry-facilities in the condo are there if you need them! But the best part is our location!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.011407052166759968,"social_amenities":0.0043527306988835335,"party_restriction":0.00103868450969457