venience of in-unit laundry facilities. Need to attend to business matters?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020590140484273434,"social_amenities":0.005634615663439035,"party_restriction":0.000801549234893173,"nearby_nightlife":0.9116063714027405}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There are also some free parking options a few blocks away that we will also give you more info about! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008831977611407638,"social_amenities":0.0011302393395453691,"party_restriction":0.004153373651206493,"nearby_nightlife":0.018390484154224396}},{"text":"A dedicated desk space in the foyer area provides an ideal setting to tackle emails before immersing yourself in all that Savannah has to offer. Guest access The entire garden-level condo is all yours! The courtyard is a shared space. Other things to note Parking can be tricky in downtown Savannah! The parking options nearby are paid street parking, which can either be paid using the kiosks/meters, the Park Savannah App, or by purchasing a day pass from the city. We will share all the details regarding navigating parking with you upon booking!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016361377493012697,"social_amenities":0.0006398261757567525,"party_restriction":0.0031516519375145435,"nearby_nightlife":0.2204170823097229}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Step through your private entrance into a spacious bedroom featuring a luxurious king-sized bed, a flat-screen TV, and ample storage space. For leisurely days in the park, a delightful picnic basket awaits, while those seeking activity can indulge in provided workout gear for yoga sessions. The cozy living room showcases original architectural highlights, offering a perfect retreat after a day of exploration. Whip up a gourmet meal or a quick snack in the fully equipped eat-in kitchen, or take your morning coffee (or evening glass of wine!) outdoors to the enchanting courtyard space. For extended stays, enjoy the convenience of in-unit laundry facilities. Need to attend to business matters?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020590140484273434,"social_amenities":0.005634615663439035,"party_restriction":0.000801549234893173,"nearby_nightlife":0.9116063714027405}},{"text":"A dedicated desk space in the foyer area provides an ideal setting to tackle emails before immersing yourself in all that Savannah has to offer. Guest access The entire garden-level condo is all yours! The courtyard is a shared space. Other things to note Parking can be tricky in downtown Savannah! The parking options nearby are paid street parking, which can either be paid using the kiosks/meters, the Park Savannah App, or by purchasing a day pass from the city. We will share all the details regarding navigating parking with you upon booking!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016361377493012697,"social_amenities":0.0006398261757567525,"party_restriction":0.0031516519375145435,"nearby_nightlife":0.2204170823097229}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1113051406719642477","title":"Welcoming Walk-Up in Landmark Historic District","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1113051406719642477","guests":3.0,"permits":["SVR-02736"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1113051406719642477","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f2a90203df4e815e2f7357be1618bc797516530a502ce09552ad5d35e7d83f84","chunks":9,"words":805,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.4059615135192871,"party_welcome":0.00107383297290653,"social_amenities":0.4059615135192871,"party_restriction":0.01050209067761898,"nearby_nightlife":0.9789474010467529,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our third-floor condo is perched in a gorgeous, historic, 1880 Savannah townhome, overlooking idyllic Monterey Square, steps from Forsyth Park. Featuring a darling kitchen with space at the bar for a quick bite, cozy and inviting living room (with pull-out sofa!), spacious bedroom with king sized bed and ensuite bathroom, and all the Southern, old-world charm you could wish for! The location is in the heart of the Landmark Historic District and is the perfect homebase for your stay! SVR-02736 The space Welcome to our charming retreat in the heart of historic Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021005987946409732,"social_amenities":0.4059615135192871,"party_restriction":0.0035826475359499454,"nearby_nightlife":0.11529825627803802}},{"text":"However, for those able to navigate the steps, the architectural details and historic charm make it well worth the climb! Located just around the corner from Forsyth Park and within walking distance of Savannah's top attractions, our condo is the perfect home base for your Savannah adventure. Whether you're strolling through the historic squares, indulging in southern cuisine at nearby restaurants, or simply soaking in the rich history and culture of this charming city, you're sure to create lasting memories during your stay. We can't wait to welcome you to our Savannah sanctuary and help you experience the magic of this historic city firsthand! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00107383297290653,"social_amenities":0.012495188042521477,"party_restriction":0.01050209067761898,"nearby_nightlife":0.10045190155506134}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"However, for those able to navigate the steps, the architectural details and historic charm make it well worth the climb! Located just around the corner from Forsyth Park and within walking distance of Savannah's top attractions, our condo is the perfect home base for your Savannah adventure. Whether you're strolling through the historic squares, indulging in southern cuisine at nearby restaurants, or simply soaking in the rich history and culture of this charming city, you're sure to create lasting memories during your stay. We can't wait to welcome you to our Savannah sanctuary and help you experience the magic of this historic city firsthand! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00107383297290653,"social_amenities":0.012495188042521477,"party_restriction":0.01050209067761898,"nearby_nightlife":0.10045190155506134}},{"text":"There are also some free parking options a few blocks away that we will also give you more info about! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008831977611407638,"social_amenities":0.0011302393395453691,"party_restriction":0.004153373651206493,"nearby_nightlife":0.018390484154224396}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our third-floor condo is perched in a gorgeous, historic, 1880 Savannah townhome, overlooking idyllic Monterey Square, steps from Forsyth Park. Featuring a darling kitchen with space at the bar for a quick bite, cozy and inviting living room (with pull-out sofa!), spacious bedroom with king sized bed and ensuite bathroom, and all the Southern, old-world charm you could wish for! The location is in the heart of the Landmark Historic District and is the perfect homebase for your stay! SVR-02736 The space Welcome to our charming retreat in the heart of historic Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021005987946409732,"social_amenities":0.4059615135192871,"party_restriction":0.0035826475359499454,"nearby_nightlife":0.11529825627803802}},{"text":"Sink into the sofa or have an extra comfy movie night with the pull-out portion while enjoying your favorite shows on the flat-screen TV. Stay connected with Wi-Fi, or simply admire the view of the majestic live oak trees adorned with Spanish moss from the large windows. Adjacent to the living area, you'll find our compact yet fully equipped kitchen. Despite its size, this culinary nook is mighty, boasting all the essentials you need to whip up a delicious m