a pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Coffee Location features","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016165118722710758,"social_amenities":0.020264476537704468,"party_restriction":0.00019943017105106264,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009459447464905679}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The kitchen is a thoughtful balance of old and new, where butcher-block countertops, marble tile backsplash, and modern appliances feel seamlessly integrated into the carriage house\u2019s historic bones. Morning light pours into the quaint two-seat breakfast nook, offering an ideal start to your day in Savannah. Ascend the wrought-iron staircase railing, a striking architectural detail, to the second-floor retreat. The primary bedroom features a Loom & Leaf queen mattress, a restored fireplace with its original mantle, and sophisticated, calming finishes that elevate the entire space. A generous walk-in closet provides room for extended stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035806314554065466,"social_amenities":0.0016765991458669305,"party_restriction":0.000640064652543515,"nearby_nightlife":0.013365155085921288}},{"text":"Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Paid parking lot off premises Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Self check-in Lockbox","section":"AMENITIES","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000296169106150046,"social_amenities":0.0007888937834650278,"pa