Fountain at Forsyth Park, Mrs. Wilkes, and Crystal Beer Parlor. The space In true Savannah fashion, the first level starts a half flight of stairs from the street. Enter into the foyer, adorned with the owner's collection of antiques and fine China. The dining room is just off the foyer and sits up to six guests. The kitchen sits just off of the dining room and has all the essentials. Towards the back of the home you'll find the bright and well-decorated living area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005668111843988299,"social_amenities":0.0024582657497376204,"party_restriction":0.0004721783334389329,"nearby_nightlife":0.9876340627670288}},{"text":"A plush sofa anchors the room with plenty of places to sit and sip! Guests can access their favorite streaming channels on the flat screen TV, or enjoy basic cable channels. A half bath is just off the living room. Upstairs, three more beds and a full bath. The daybed is in a private nook at the top of the stairs, with the first bedroom just around the corner. This bedroom features a Queen bed and a beautiful collection of the owner's private art. Guests also have the convenience of a flat screen TV mounted across the bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014557427493855357,"social_amenities":0.0014112236676737666,"party_restriction":0.00028829678194597363,"nearby_nightlife":0.09361553192138672}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 42030","address":"443 WHITAKER ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0