ps, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003403778828214854,"social_amenities":0.008289872668683529,"party_restriction":0.0006660881917923689,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007185973227024078}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Wilkes Dining House on Jones Street, where you\u2019ll find some of the best Southern home cooking in the city. Take a leisurely morning stroll through Forsyth Park to people watch while having coffee at the Sentient Bean, and don\u2019t forget to check their upcoming events for live music and theatrical performances! Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - The modern updates to this home make it a one-of-a-kind historic home with amenities you won't find anywhere else! - A walk down Whitaker Street will bring you to several locally owned shops, including One Fish Two Fish, Number Four Eleven, and Lily Bay Studio + Bazaar. Sleeping Configuration:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012068359181284904,"social_amenities":0.004687531851232052,"party_restriction":0.0015427690232172608,"nearby_nightlife":0.9741150140762329}},{"text":"The first floor has a large couch and TV, a dining table for four, and a half bath tucked away under the staircase. The kitchen has stainless steel appliances, beautiful dark cabinets, and a breakfast bar for morning musings. Upstairs is a spacious primary suite with a king sized bed and sitting area. The balcony off of the bedroom is perfect for catching a sunset, having a cup of coffee, or reading a book. The bathroom has an open shower with built-in seating and a large vanity with plenty of room to get ready for an evening on the town. You\u2019ll be just a quick walk from Mrs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_wel