,"recorded_pin":"20032 43004","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26273284223","date":"2026-09-30","type":"31 CHECK-THE-WELFARE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"11 W Gordon St","recorded_pin":"20032 43004","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26282293996","date":"2026-10-09","type":"49 MENTAL PT-VIOLENT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"11 W Gordon St","recorded_pin":"20032 43004","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1197813082231453917","title":"Charming Monterey Square Carriage House","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1197813082231453917","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-03162"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1197813082231453917","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4bb156f8d0e606c1c6ffcbf3defaf4dc36dd66f1dce737bb55ec9851d95d8c47","chunks":7,"words":646,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.13476979732513428,"party_welcome":0.0002933910000137985,"social_amenities":0.13476979732513428,"party_restriction":0.9981759786605835,"nearby_nightlife":0.923285186290741,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Perfect One-Bedroom Getaway in Historic Savannah Discover the charm and elegance of Savannah with a stay at the Monterey Square Carriage House, a delightful one-bedroom, one-bathroom vacation rental between the iconic Armstrong Kessler Mansion and the Mercer Williams House. Situated on one of Savannah\u2019s most beautiful squares, this luxurious carriage house offers a truly unforgettable experience for those seeking comfort and convenience in the heart of the city. SVR-03162 The space The bedroom is located on the ground level and features a cozy queen bed and high-end furnishings. Upstairs, you\u2019ll find the sophisticated living room thoughtfully designed to capture the historic essence of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019366874767001718,"social_amenities":0.13476979732513428,"party_restriction":0.008476286195218563,"nearby_nightlife":0.010072915814816952}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Doorbell camera is motion activated and monitors the front entrance. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Baking sheet Dining table","section":"AMENITIES","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002565794566180557,"social_amenities":0.0165240615606308,"party_restriction":0.0002569013158790767,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006678744102828205}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Broughton Street is just a short walk from shopping and dining, and City Market and River Street are a 15-minute stroll from the home. Property Highlights: - One-bedroom carriage house with queen bed - Full bath with tub/shower combo and vanity - Fully equipped kitchen and in-unit washer/dryer - Private balcony overlooking a serene garden - Steps from Monterey Square, Forsyth Park, and other historic sites - Convenient access to shopping, dining, and Savannah\u2019s famous River Street Important Information: - Maximum occupancy: 2 guests (strictly enforced, no exceptions, including infants/children) - Minimum age to reserve: 25 years old (no exceptions) - NO PARTIES, NO BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR GROUPS","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002933910000137985,"social_amenities":0.0007385013741441071,"party_restriction":0.9981759786605835,"nearby_nightlife":0.8766684532165527}},{"text":"- No smoking or vaping allowed - Pets Welcome Other things to note Parking is conveniently available on the street and metered at this location. Finding parking spots on Bull St or Monterey Square is easily achievable. These areas are within a short walking distance from the property Just so you know, parking enforcement by the City of Savannah is effective from Monday to Friday, 8 AM to 5 PM, while parking is free on the weekends from Friday at 5 PM to Monday at 8 AM. To handle meters, purchasing a \"Visitors Parking Day Pass\" for all day/night parking is recommended.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027734023751690984,"social_amenities":0.0008833571919240057,"party_restriction":0.04550514370203018,"nearby_nightlife":0.00588557543233037}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Perfect One-Bedroom Getaway in Historic Savannah Discover the charm and elegance of Savannah with a stay at the Monterey Square Carriage House, a delightful one-bedroom, one-bathroom vacation rental between the iconic Armstrong Kessler Mansion and the Mercer Williams House. Situated on one of Savannah\u2019s most beautiful squares, this luxurious carriage house offers a truly unforgettable experience for those seeking comfort and convenience in the heart of the city. SVR-03162 The space The bedroom is located on the ground level and features a cozy queen bed and high-end furnishings. Upstairs, you\u2019ll find the sophisticated living room thoughtfully designed to capture the historic essence of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019366874767001718,"social_amenities":0.13476979732513428,"party_restriction":0.008476286195218563,"nearby_nightlife":0.010072915814816952}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Doorbell camera is motion activated and monitors the front entrance. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Baking sheet Dining table","section":"AMENITIES","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002565794566180557,"social_amenities":0.0165240615606308,"party_restriction":0.0002569013158790767,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006678744102828205}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Broughton Street is just a short walk from shopping and dining, and City Market and River Street are a 15-minute stroll from the home. Property Highlights: - One-bedroom carriage house with queen bed - Full bath with tub/shower combo and vanity - Fully equipped kitchen and in-unit washer/dryer - Private balcony overlooking a serene garden - Steps from Monterey Square, Forsyth Park, and other historic sites - Convenient access to shopping, dining, and Savannah\u2019s famous River Street Important Information: - Maximum occupancy: 2 guests (strictly enforced, no exceptions, including infants/children) - Minimum age to reserve: 25 years old (no exceptions) - NO PARTIES, NO BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR GROUPS","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002933910000137985,"social_amenities":0.0007385013741441071,"party_restriction":0.9981759786605835,"nearby_nightlife":0.8766684532165527}},{"text":"- No smoking or vaping allowed - Pets Welcome Other things to note Parking is conveniently available on the street and metered at this location. Finding parking spots on Bull St or Monterey Square is easily achievable. These areas are within a short walking distance from the property Just so you know, parking enforcement by the City of Savannah is effective from Monday to Friday, 8 AM to 5 PM, while parking is free on the weekends from Friday at 5 PM to Monday at 8 AM. To handle meters, purchasing a \"Visitors Parking Day Pass\" for all day/night parking is recommended.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027734023751690984,"social_amenities":0.0008833571919240057,"party_restriction":0.04550514370203018,"nearby_nightlife":0.00588557543233037}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The fully equipped kitchen has everything you need to prepare your favorite meals. The unit also includes a washer and dryer for your convenience. Step outside onto your private balcony overlooking a tranquil garden, where you can enjoy a peaceful morning coffee or unwind with a glass of wine in the evening. The serene setting, surrounded by Spanish moss-draped mansions and historic monuments, creates the perfect backdrop for relaxation. Nearby, explore Savannah\u2019s rich history with visits to The Sorrel-Weed House, Green-Meldrim House, and the Mercer Williams House Museum. The famous Fountain at Forsyth Park is just steps away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025542083312757313,"social_amenities":0.00980693195015192,"party_restriction":0.004100312478840351,"nearby_nightlife":0.923285186290741}},{"text":"Broughton Street is just a short walk from shopping and dining, and City Market and River Street are a 15-minute stroll from the home. Property Highlights: - One-bedroom carriage house with queen bed - Full bath with tub/shower combo and vanity - Fully equipped kitchen and in-unit washer/dryer - Private balcony overlooking a serene garden - Steps from Monterey Square, Forsyth Park, and other historic sites - Convenient access to shopping, dining, and Savannah\u2019s famous River Street Important Information: - Maximum occupancy: 2 guests (strictly enforced, no exceptions, including infants/children) - Minimum age to reserve: 25 years old (no exceptions) - NO PARTIES, NO BACHELORETTE/BACHELOR GROUPS","section":"FULL DE