ial_amenities":0.0016277458053082228,"party_restriction":0.0029937580693513155,"nearby_nightlife":0.001840607263147831}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The primary bedroom boasts a Queen size bed with luxury-grade linens and en suite full bath. Head due East and grab brunch with the locals at Clary's Cafe. Stop into ShopSCAD and nearby retailers in the Downtown Design District to take home a Savannah souvenir. Just a short walk North will lead you further into the charming historic district. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017112853238359094,"social_amenities":0.020107541233301163,"party_restriction":0.015843132510781288,"nearby_nightlife":0.9743643999099731}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004583749396260828,"social_amenities":0.0016454142751172185,"party_restriction":0.0003741838736459613,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006879350985400379}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The primary bedroom boasts a Queen size bed with luxury-grade linens and en suite full bath. Head due East and grab brunch with the locals at Clary's Cafe. Stop into ShopSCAD and nearby retailers in the Downtown Design District to take home a Savannah souvenir. Just a short walk North will lead you further into the charming historic district. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017112853238359094,"social_amenities":0.020107541233301163,"party_restriction":0.015843132510781288,"nearby_nightlife":0.9743643999099731}},{"text":"Enjoy this intimate hideaway for two, nestled right in the heart of the National Landmark Historic District. The space Stay just Northwest of Forsyth Park and within walking distance to all of Savannah's shopping, dining, and attractions. Two Lucky guests will call this quaint cottage home - fit with a master bedroom and full kitchen. Enter through the courtyard off Whitaker Street and into your peaceful oasis. Cobb's Cottage is the ground-level carriage apartment behind a Savannah manor. Walk into the main living area with ample places to kick back and relax. A full kitchen with range and refrigerator provides the essentials needed for a quick meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.148972897790372e-05,"social_amenities":0.004412125796079636,"party_restriction":0.0019323169253766537,"nearby_nightlife":0.9338403940200806}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The primary bedroom boasts a Queen size bed with luxury-grade linens and en suite full bath. Head due East and grab brunch with the locals at Clary's Cafe. Stop into ShopSCAD and nearby retailers in the Downtown Design District to take home a Savannah souvenir. Just a short walk North will lead you further into the charming historic district. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017112853238359094,"social_amenities":0.020107541233301163,"party_restriction":0.015843132510781288,"nearby_nightlife":0.9743643999099731}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Washer Washer","section":"AMENITIES","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001816155854612589,"social_amenities":0.0016277458053082228,"party_restriction":0.0029937580693513155,"nearby_nightlife":0.001840607263147831}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The primary bedroom boasts a Queen size bed with luxury-grade linens and en suite full bath. Head due East and grab brunch with the locals at Clary's Cafe. Stop into ShopSCAD and nearby retailers in the Downtown Design District to take home a Savannah souvenir. Just a short walk North will lead you further into the charming historic district. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017112853238359094,"social_amenities":0.020107541233301163,"party_restriction":0.015843132510781288,"nearby_nightlife":0.9743643999099731}},{"text":"Enjoy this intimate hideaway for two, nestled right in the heart of the National Landmark Historic District. The space Stay just Northwest of Forsyth Park and within walking distance to all of Savannah's shopping, dining, and attractions. Two Lucky guests will call this quaint cottage home - fit with a master bedroom and full kitchen. Enter through the courtyard off Whitaker Street and into your peaceful oasis. Cobb's Cottage is the ground-level carriage apartment behind a Savannah manor. Walk into the main living area with ample places to kick back and relax. A full kitchen with range and refrigerator provides the essentials needed for a quick meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.148972897790372e-05,"social_amenities":0.004412125796079636,"party_restriction":0.0019323169253766537,"nearby_nightlife":0.9338403940200806}}]}}},{"listing_id":"24491611","title":"Carriage Near Forsyth Fountain by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/24491611","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01549"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"24491611","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1596e0d0fe664d178365f7702b7f1772a4f0aec9a7e083595bd38c3692ef21a7","chunks":7,"words":545,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.011103751137852669,"party_welcome":0.00370088592171669,"social_amenities":0.011103751137852669,"party_restriction":0.004044041968882084,"nearby_nightlife":0.6813511252403259,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Guests will love being part of the Forsyth community; steps from everything the park has to offer while only being a short walk away from attractions further North towards the river. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bed 1: Queen Bed 2: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005827586865052581,"social_amenities":0.011103751137852669,"party_restriction":0.004044041968882084,"nearby_nightlife":0.25822779536247253}},{"text":"The living room allows for ample seating as you regale on the day's adventures. The living room sofa can pull out into a Queen sleeper to accommodate an additional two guests. The kitchen is well-equipped with every essential you'd need for a quick bite or cup of coffee. Enjoy a slow morning at the breakfast nook before setting off to see Savannah's many wonders. The bedroom is just down the hall, with a Queen size bed and beautiful views of the city. En suite to the bedroom is a full bath with standing shower, all recently renovated with marble tile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00370088592171669,"social_amenities":0.002115749754011631,"party_restriction":0.0003084003983531147,"nearby_nightlife":0.055457066744565964}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The living room allows for ample seating as you regale on the day's adventures. The living room sofa can pull out into a Queen sleeper to accommodate an additional two guests. The kitchen is well-equipped with every essential you'd need for a quick bite or cup of coffee. Enjoy a slow morning at the breakfast nook before setting off to see Savannah's many wonders. The bedroom is just down the hall, with a Queen size bed and beautiful views of the city. En suite to the bedroom is a full bath with standing shower, all recently renovated with marble tile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00370088592171669,"social_amenities":0.002115749754011631,"party_restriction":0.0003084003983531147,"nearby_nightlife":0.055457066744565964}},{"text":"Guests will love being part of the Forsyth community; steps from everything the park has to offer while only being a short walk away from attractions further North towards the river. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bed 1: Queen Bed 2: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005827586865052581,"social_amenities":0.011103751137852669,"party_restriction":0.004044041968882084,"nearby_nightlife":0.25822779536247253}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Guests will love being part of the Forsyth community; steps from everything the park has to offer while only being a short walk away from attractions further North towards the river. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bed 1: Queen Bed 2: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005827586865052581,"social_amenities":0.011103751137852669,"party_restriction":0.004044041968882084,"nearby_nightlife":0.25822779536247253}},{"text":"Stay in a slice of Savannah history with this one-bedroom sun-filled carriage house. Guests will enjoy the peace and quiet in this pocket of downtown, whilst being steps away from most major attractions. The space Surround yourself with historical furnishings but with the modern amenities you expect on vacation in this spacious, one-bedroom carriage. Resting behind a grand Forsyth Park estate, up to four guests can get a taste for high life in the South. A set of steps lead you to this second-level carriage house, situated just one block from the famous Fountain at Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":7.77601744630374e-05,"social_amenities":0.0024110327940434217,"party_restriction":0.0009454038226976991,"nearby_nightlife":0.6813511252403259}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Guests will love being part of the Forsyth community; steps from everything the park has to offer while only being a short walk away from attractions further North towards the river. What is parking like for this home? Parking for thi