neighborhoods. With this property, you'll be facing Monterey Square, and you'll also only be a short distance from the Mercer-Williams House. The location gets even better when you realize that it's only one major street up from Forsyth Park. Some of the most desirable vacation rentals Savannah GA have locations near Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024924345780164003,"social_amenities":0.013540235348045826,"party_restriction":0.001924515119753778,"nearby_nightlife":0.02213151939213276}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 SCAD Sand Arts Festival on Tybee in May \u2022 Savannah Scottish Games in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 St. Paul's Greek Festival in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Taste of Savannah in November \u2022 Tybee Island New Year's Eve Fireworks in December You won't find a better selection of Savannah vacation rentals, or the included amazing amenities. SVR-01596 Guest access 2 King Beds 1 Full Bath TV's In the Bedrooms w/ Direct TV Wifi New Appliances Drip Coffee Maker Dishwasher Courtyard Recently Remodeled Great Location Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.971503496170044,"social_amenities":0.0021045405883342028,"party_restriction":0.0002791379811242223,"nearby_nightlife":0.9726806282997131}},{"text":"For avid cyclists and hikers, the McQueen\u2019s Island Trail is just 10 miles east of the city. It used to be part of an excursion rail line that took guests between Savannah and Tybee. The line was abandoned in 1933. Savannah Events Savannah vacation homes put you in touch with the city, and there are a number of special events that go on during the year to add to your fun. Some such events include: \u2022 Savannah Irish Festival in February \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 First 