_restriction":[{"text":"The south section is mostly occupied by Forsyth Park, various historic squares, and a number of museums and art galleries. If you're looking for the famous Bird Girl statue on the cover of the Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil, you'll find it in the Jepsen Center for the Arts. Just Outside Savannah When you want even more interesting things to do near our Savannah vacation homes, venturing just outside Savannah can meet that need. Our vacation rentals Savannah GA in the Historic District are only 30 minutes from Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037050648825243115,"social_amenities":0.0070597929880023,"party_restriction":0.003773278323933482,"nearby_nightlife":0.9061194062232971}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Occupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":155,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024609858519397676,"social_amenities":0.0020168281625956297,"party_restriction":0.0027561357710510492,"nearby_nightlife":0.01855984702706337}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 SCAD Sand Arts Festival on Tybee in May \u2022 Savannah Scottish Games in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 St. Paul's Greek Festival in October \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Taste of Savannah in November \u2022 Tybee Island New Year's Eve Fireworks in December