ng a peaceful retreat while keeping you just moments from Savannah\u2019s vibrant Historic District. The space Tucked away beyond majestic oak trees and cobblestone streets, Gaston Haus is a modern yet rustic carriage house offering a peaceful retreat while keeping you just moments from Savannah\u2019s vibrant Historic District. Newly constructed and thoughtfully designed with high-end furnishings and elegant fixtures, this one-bedroom hideaway blends modern comfort with timeless Southern charm. What Makes Gaston Haus Special? Unbeatable Location: Step outside and stroll through Savannah\u2019s most picturesque streets, where the clip-clop of horse-drawn carriages echoes beneath canopies of centuries-old oaks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003529977984726429,"social_amenities":0.9384521842002869,"party_restriction":0.002498331479728222,"nearby_nightlife":0.011738586239516735}},{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-03132 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002510632330086082,"social_amenities":0.08930975943803787,"party_restriction":0.03278018906712532,"nearby_nightlife":0.005029180087149143}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Gaston Haus is a modern yet rustic carriage house offering a peaceful retreat while keeping you just moments from Savannah\u2019s vibrant Historic District. The space Tucked away beyond majestic oak trees and cobblestone streets, Gaston Haus is a modern yet rustic carriage house offering a peaceful ret