80087149143}},{"text":"Whether sipping morning coffee in nearby Taylor Square or enjoying an evening walk past historic mansions, you\u2019ll be perfectly positioned to experience the city\u2019s best dining, shopping, and sightseeing. Refined Luxury & Thoughtful Design: Though intimate in size, Gaston Haus feels spacious and bright, with natural sunlight streaming through every window. Every detail, from the sleek galley kitchen to the spa-inspired bathroom, has been carefully curated for comfort, relaxation, and style. Tranquil Sleeping Quarters: The plush queen-sized bed is fitted with luxury linens and blackout shades, ensuring a restful night\u2019s sleep after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s historic squares, galleries, and riverfront charm. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014443301188293844,"social_amenities":0.049392297863960266,"party_restriction":0.0034810302313417196,"nearby_nightlife":0.9169346690177917}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Whether sipping morning coffee in nearby Taylor Square or enjoying an evening walk past historic mansions, you\u2019ll be perfectly positioned to experience the city\u2019s best dining, shopping, and sightseeing. Refined Luxury & Thoughtful Design: Though intimate in size, Gaston Haus feels spacious and bright, with natural sunlight streaming through every window. Every detail, from the sleek galley kitchen to the spa-inspired bathroom, has been carefully curated for comfort, relaxation, and style. Tranquil Sleeping Quarters: The plush queen-sized bed is fitted with luxury linens and blackout shades, ensuring a restful night\u2019s sleep after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s historic squares, galleries, and riverfront charm. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014443301188293844,"social_amenities":0.049392297863960266,"party_restriction":0.0034810302313417196,"ne