25"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"32133653","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"17b8f7c72fa4d5c5f3e74cf49fb6c6552fbb6c138711f70f45e5255afbae0156","chunks":6,"words":492,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007385933771729469,"party_welcome":0.00040011643432080746,"social_amenities":0.03768065199255943,"party_restriction":0.005994127597659826,"nearby_nightlife":0.9618386030197144,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003856424300465733,"social_amenities":0.007385933771729469,"party_restriction":0.0006039211875759065,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008126276079565287}},{"text":"This beautiful carriage house has been completely renovated and no detail has been spared. Enjoy modern farmhouse flair, an amazing designer bathroom, and a location you can't beat! The space Be in awe of this beautifully restored Carriage House as you walk up the short flight of stairs to the open and airy living area. This spacious apartment is located on the second floor and boasts with light, only steps away from Calhoun Square and one block from the city's largest green space, Forsyth Park. Furnished with modern accents, inviting white shiplap from ceiling to floor, and sliding barn doors, this unit is ideal for the distinguished traveler.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034523705835454166,"social_amenities":0.00519467843696475,"party_restriction":0.0005600334843620658,"nearby_nightlife":0.014178615994751453}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040011643432080746,"social_amenities":0.0051429676823318005,"party_restriction":0.005994127597659826,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005823280662298203}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003856424300465733,"social_amenities":0.007385933771729469,"party_restriction":0.0006039211875759065,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008126276079565287}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Be sure to stop at our favorite local spots along the way, including: Adam Turoni Chocolates, Collins Quarter, and The Paris Market. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Size Bed Living room: 1 Twin Size Sleeper Sofa SVR-02525 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002823774120770395,"social_amenities":0.03768065199255943,"party_restriction":0.0026665814220905304,"nearby_nightlife":0.9107383489608765}},{"text":"The living space offers a full-size sleeper sofa, a high-top table perfect for enjoying a morning cup of joe, and full size kitchen for all of your needs. The bedroom features a Queen size bed, with en-suite bathroom, off of the main living space. The bathroom offers a spacious standing shower, and large vanity with plenty of storage. Just a block away from the Fountain at Forsyth Park, this gorgeous carriage house is also a short walk from other Savannah attractions, such as: Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, shopSCAD, and Alex Raskin Antiques. Head North towards the river for a romantic promenade through the squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033459265250712633,"social_amenities":0.00921532791107893,"party_restriction":0.0009419075795449317,"nearby_nightlife":0.9618386030197144}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040011643432080746,"social_amenities":0.0051429676823318005,"party_restriction":0.005994127597659826,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005823280662298203}},{"text":"Be sure to stop at our favorite local spots along the way, including: Adam Turoni Chocolates, Collins Quarter, and The Paris Market. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Size Bed Living room: 1 Twin Size Sleeper Sofa SVR-02525 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002823774120770395,"social_amenities":0.03768065199255943,"party_restriction":0.0026665814220905304,"nearby_nightlife":0.9107383489608765}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The living space offers a full-size sleeper sofa, a high-top table perfect for enjoying a morning cup of joe, and full size kitchen for all of your needs. The bedroom features a Queen size bed, with en-suite bathroom, off of the main living space. The bathroom offers a spacious standing shower, and large vanity with plenty of storage. Just a block away from the Fountain at Forsyth Park, this gorgeous carriage house is also a short walk from other Savannah attractions, such as: Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, shopSCAD, and Alex Raskin Antiques. Head North towards the river for a romantic promenade through the squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033459265250712633,"social_amenities":0.00921532791107893,"party_restriction":0.0009419075795449317,"nearby_nightlife":0.9618386030197144}},{"text":"Be sure to stop at our favorite local spots along the way, including: Adam Turoni Chocolates, Collins Quarter, and The Paris Market. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom: Queen Size Bed Living room: 1 Twin Size Sleeper Sofa SVR-02525 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002823774120770395,"social_amenities":0.03768065199255943,"party_restriction":0.0026665814220905304,"nearby_nightlife":0.9107383489608765}}]}}},{"listing_id":"780344886758135326","title":"Designer Oasis Near Forsyth by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/780344886758135326","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02524"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"780344886758135326","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"382d5db5bb1c2bbf78c51abd6ff9effb72cb78dd8a7bd00cdd72b392cf9a7384","chunks":8,"words":693,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.2531856298446655,"party_welcome":0.9819391369819641,"social_amenities":0.2531856298446655,"party_restriction":0.12311756610870361,"nearby_nightlife":0.9929312467575073,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Located on one of Savannah's most prestigious streets, lined with sweeping, majestic oak trees, this completely renovated garden apartment is just a stones throw from Forsyth Park and is within walking distance to everything Savannah has to offer! The space Built in 1875, this fabulously renovated garden apartment features all of the modern amenities you could wish for! Located on one of Savannah's wealthiest streets, lined with sweeping, majestic oak trees, you'll be just a stones throw from Forsyth Park. Enjoy being within walking distance from all of Savannah's beautiful squares, amazing restaurants, and so much more.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000433354580309242,"social_amenities":0.2531856298446655,"party_restriction":0.0015148874372243881,"nearby_nightlife":0.05190114304423332}},{"text":"Perched on the corner of Gaston and Abercorn Street, you'll find your private entrance tucked away behind a charming patio with lush greenery. Stepping inside, you'll be in awe of the finishes and furnishings selected for the space - no detail was overlooked when designing this space! The open living room gleams with natural light, and features an outstanding hand painted mural completed by a local SCAD artist. You'll have an ample amount of comfortable seating for everyone in your party to gather, whether you are enjoying a movie night in, or planning your day out on the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9758453965187073,"social_amenities":0.0507575199007988,"party_restriction":0.00026963543496094644,"nearby_nightlife":0.28151002526283264}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You'll find a massive walk-in closet right off of the primary suite, to store all of your personal belongings. Down the hall, a luxurious, spa-like bathroom can be found which is easily accessible to all members of your party. The bathroom features a gorgeous, tiled, walk-in shower, and a large custom vanity with plenty of storage. In the morning, we recommend taking a short stroll across Forsyth Park to Collins Quarter's for a refreshing iced latte. For lunch, pop over to Bull Street Taco in the Starland District, and explore their unique twist on tacos. As you wander around town, stroll through the Squares of Savannah, enriched in history.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9819391369819641,"social_amenities":0.004703599493950605,"party_restriction":0.0007348459330387414,"nearby_nightlife":0.9929312467575073}},{"text":"Perched on the corner of Gaston and Abercorn Street, you'll find your private entrance tucked away behind a charming patio with lush greenery. Stepping inside, you'll be in awe of the finishes and furnishings selected for the space - no detail was overlooked when designing this space! The open living room gleams with natural light, and features an outstanding hand painted mural completed by a local SCAD artist. You'll have an ample amount of comfortable seating for everyone in your party to gather, whether you are enjoying a movie night in, or planning your day out on the town.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9758453965187073,"social_amenities":0.0507575199007988,"party_restriction":0.00026963543496094644,"nearby_nightlife":0.28151002526283264}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Located on one of Savannah's most prestigious streets, lined with sweeping, majestic oak trees, this completely renovated garden apartment is just a stones throw from Forsyth Park and is within walking distance to everything Savannah has to offer! The space Built in 1875, this fabulously renovated garden apartment features all of the modern amenities you could wish for! Located on one of Savannah's wealthiest streets, lined with sweeping, majestic oak trees, you'll be just a stones throw from Forsyth Park. Enjoy being within walking distance from all of Savannah's beautiful squares, amazing restaurants, and so much more.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000433354580309242,"social_amenities":0.2531856298446655,"party_restriction":0.0015148874372243881,"nearby_nightlife":0.05190114304423332}},{"text":"For dinner, head north downtown, where there's none better than The Grey, a Southern fine dining experience retrofitted inside an old Greyhound Bus Station. After a day out, relax in the park and listen to the sound of the Forsyth fountain. What is parking like for this home? Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Sleeping Configuration:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006098347948864102,"social_amenities":0.12603715062141418,"party_restriction":0.12311756610870361,"nearby_nightlife":0.992464542388916}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For dinner, head north downtown, where there's none better than The Grey, a Southern fine dining experience retrofi