e, you\u2019ll find sun-drenched rooms with tall windows, two cozy king beds, fully renovated bathrooms and kitchen with an open concept living/dining room. The home is centrally located\u2014just steps from Savannah\u2019s squares, shops, and dining\u2014yet tucked away on a quiet street, giving you the perfect balance of walkability and privacy. This rental is perfect for traveling with family or friends! The space Tucked behind one of the city\u2019s more storied streets, this renovated historic carriage house blends timeless charm with modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008274268475361168,"social_amenities":0.005755772814154625,"party_restriction":0.0019298124825581908,"nearby_nightlife":0.03472287207841873}},{"text":"The Carriage is house is multiple levels, you will enter on the the first level and take two a set of stairs up to the second level where you will find the living room, dining room and kitchen. Another set of stairs will take you to the top/third floor where both bedrooms and bathrooms are located. Traffic & noise may increase on major streets, or during festival/peak tourism times\u2014but being on a quieter lane will mitigate that. Parking can be limited downtown, so off-street or private parking becomes a big plus. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005660552997142076,"social_amenities":0.005018987227231264,"party_restriction":0.003501689061522484,"nearby_nightlife":0.014232062734663486}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"With 2 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms, it\u2019s perfect for families, couples, or friends traveling together. Just steps from Savannah\u2019s famed squares, coffee shops, and boutiques, you\u2019ll be in the heart of the Historic District, yet tucked away in your own private retreat. You will be just a short 5 minute walk to the iconic Forsyth Park. Living Room \u2013 Light-filled with a large bay window, cozy teal sectional that pulls out to a queen sleeper bed, smart TV, and modern touches. Desk area set up for the remote workers. Perfect for relaxing after exploring the Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009140517795458436,"social_amenities":0.0009378563845530152,"party_restriction":0.00034016347490251064,"nearby_nightlife":0.2792592942714691}},{"text":"Welcome to this spacious 2 bed, 2 bath carriage house in the heart of Savannah! Inside, you\u2019ll find sun-drenched rooms with tall windows, two cozy king beds, fully renovated bathrooms and kitchen with an open concept living/dining room. The home is centrally located\u2014just steps from Savannah\u2019s squares, shops, and dining\u2014yet tucked away on a quiet street, giving you the perfect balance of walkability and privacy. This rental is perfect for traveling with family or friends! The space Tucked behind one of the city\u2019s more storied streets, this renovated historic carriage house blends timeless charm with modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008274268475361168,"social_amenities":0.005755772814154625,"party_restriction":0.0019298124825581908,"nearby_nightlife":0.03472287207841873}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to this spacious 2 bed, 2 bath carriage house in the heart of Savannah! Inside, you\u2019ll find sun-drenched rooms with tall windows, two cozy king beds, fully renovated bathrooms and kitchen with an open concept living/dining room. The home is centrally located\u2014just steps from Savannah\u2019s squares, shops, and dining\u2014yet tucked away on a quiet street, giving you the perfect balance of walkability and privacy. This rental is perfect for traveling with family or friends! The space Tucked behind one of the city\u2019s more storied streets, this renovated historic carriage house blends timeless charm with modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00082742684753