age. Other things to note Please note that guests will have access to one off street parking space. Guests will not have access to the garage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014588120393455029,"social_amenities":0.0018559051677584648,"party_restriction":0.0020327065140008926,"nearby_nightlife":0.009235372766852379}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"With 2 bedrooms and 2 full bathrooms, it\u2019s perfect for families, couples, or friends traveling together. Just steps from Savannah\u2019s famed squares, coffee shops, and boutiques, you\u2019ll be in the heart of the Historic District, yet tucked away in your own private retreat. You will be just a short 5 minute walk to the iconic Forsyth Park. Living Room \u2013 Light-filled with a large bay window, cozy teal sectional that pulls out to a queen sleeper bed, smart TV, and modern touches. Desk area set up for the remote workers. Perfect for relaxing after exploring the Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009140517795458436,"social_amenities":0.0009378563845530152,"party_restriction":0.00034016347490251064,"nearby_nightlife":0.2792592942714691}},{"text":"Welcome to this spacious 2 bed, 2 bath carriage house in the heart of Savannah! Inside, you\u2019ll find sun-drenched rooms with tall windows, two cozy king beds, fully renovated bathrooms and kitchen with an open concept living/dining room. The home is centrally located\u2014just steps from Savannah\u2019s squares, shops, and dining\u2014yet tucked away on a quiet street, giving you the perfect balance of walkability and privacy. This rental is perfect for traveling with family or friends! The space Tucked behind one of the city\u2019s more storied streets, this renovated historic carriage house blends timeless charm with modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008274268475361168,"social_amenities":0.005755772814154625,"party_restriction"