ests. You\u2019ll step down into your vacation home and enter in the bright foyer, with a large, decorative fireplace and beautiful desk allowing the space to double as an office.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022552642622031271,"social_amenities":0.004749169573187828,"party_restriction":0.0013300114078447223,"nearby_nightlife":0.024225503206253052}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 54005","address":"514 BARNARD ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":4,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":9,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24040041268","date":"2024-02-09","type":"69 SUSPICIOUS vehicle","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"514 Barnard St","recorded_pin":"20032 54005","side":"direct"},{"number":"25326331996","date":"2025-11-22","type":"22 OTHER","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"514 Barnard St","recorded_pin":"20032 54005","side":"direct"},{"number":"26077078188","date":"2026-03-18","type":"22 PAST SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"514 Barnard St","recorded_pin":"20032 54005","side":"direct"},{"number":"24041043010","date":"2024-02-10","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"512 Barnard St","recorded_pin":"20032 54005A","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24091096145","date":"2024-03-31","type":"22 FOUND PROPERTY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"124 W Huntingdon St","recorded_pin":"20032 54018","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25059056364","date":"2025-02-28","type":"52 PAST FRAUD/FORGERY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W HUNTINGDON ST","recorded_pin":"20032 54019","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25153155325","date":"2025-06-02","type":"50 INJURED ANIMAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Huntingdon St","recorded_pin":"20032 54019","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25325330764","date":"2025-11-21","type":"45 Property DAMAGE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"122 W Huntingdon St","recorded_pin":"20032 54019","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26072072631","date":"2026-03-13","type":"**SUSPICIOUS/WANTED PERSON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"517 Howard St","recorded_pin":"20032 54007","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"580257131676723786","title":"Circa 1870, Historic | Central | Original","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/580257131676723786","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02521"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"580257131676723786","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"459e5dd39cc552c2da0e67a0e54168813b7bd6e5e5370f8ae19f6479438daa86","chunks":9,"words":803,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.03326369822025299,"party_welcome":0.000628691806923598,"social_amenities":0.03326369822025299,"party_restriction":0.9972633123397827,"nearby_nightlife":0.9215385913848877,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The patio features a new grill ready for your favorite recipe. Move from the kitchen space right into the main living space featuring an exposed brick fireplace, an antique, yet very comfortable oversized sofa, and a brand-new smart TV. Off the back right corner of the living space, find a fully updated bathroom with a step-in shower, new fixtures, and all the bathroom essentials you need including fresh towels and hand towels. To the back left, step into the spacious master bedroom featuring another exposed brick fireplace and a brand-new king mattress with crisp linens and plush pillows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019294586672913283,"social_amenities":0.03326369822025299,"party_restriction":0.0002757553302217275,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018769939197227359}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002456550719216466,"social_amenities":0.026901405304670334,"party_restriction":0.00033444337896071374,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003472281096037477}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Located on street level, the apartment has been beautifully updated with personal touches that provide a cozy and functional space. Enter the apartment using the smart lock and your unique door code. Step into the well-appointed kitchen featuring custom cabinets, granite countertops, brand new appliances, and all the kitchen essentials you need for cooking right at home. With large bay windows looking out onto the private patio, enjoy your delicious meals at the dining table, set for two, but expandable for four. Step out onto the secluded patio and enjoy beautiful Savannah mornings, sipping coffee, with natural greenery creeping along the privacy fences. Looking to cook up some great BBQ?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000628691806923598,"social_amenities":0.025193236768245697,"party_restriction":0.0005362377851270139,"nearby_nightlife":0.003117611398920417}},{"text":"Enjoy a comfortable reading chair a step-in closet and nightstands for extra storage. Working from home while you visit Savannah? The master bedroom comes with a dedicated workspace and our high-speed WIFI is perfect for video conferencing and multi-tasking. Staying for longer? 1870 provides an in-unit stackable washer and dryer, iron, and ironing board. Guest access The entire garden apartment as well as the exterior patio off of the kitchen is yours. The upstairs is the owners' quarters, please do not attempt to walk up the exterior staircase to their home. You may come and go as you please!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035318106529302895,"social_amenities":0.0021174096036702394,"party_restriction":0.003063696436583996,"nearby_nightlife":0.013485938310623169}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The patio features a new grill ready for your favorite recipe. Move from the kitchen space right into the main living space featuring an exposed brick fireplace, an antique, yet very comfortable oversized sofa, and a brand-new smart TV. Off the back right corner of the living space, find a fully updated bathroom with a step-in shower, new fixtures, and all the bathroom essentials you need including fresh towels and hand towels. To the back left, step into the spacious master bedroom featuring another exposed brick fireplace and a brand-new king mattress with crisp linens and plush pillows.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019294586672913283,"social_amenities":0.03326369822025299,"party_restriction":0.0002757553302217275,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018769939197227359}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002456550719216466,"social_amenities":0.026901405304670334,"party_restriction":0.00033444337896071374,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003472281096037477}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The parking out front is free, but there are many metered spots on adjacent streets and in the neighborhood in general. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Clean up all smoke butts. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it was your own property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.294788181548938e-05,"social_amenities":0.0007455236627720296,"party_restriction":0.9972633123397827,"nearby_nightlife":0.9215385913848877}},{"text":"\"Quiet Hours\" are from 10pm - 8am so please kindly keep your volume down at this time especially when on the patio. The owner lives upstairs 6 months out of the year, and shares the walkway through the iron gate. You will rarely see them unless they happen to be arriving/departing while you are arriving. They are extremely friendly and respectful. CHECKING IN: Airbnb will automatically send you check-in information 48 hours prior to your stay. In that check-in information, you will find step-by-step instructions, with pictures, for arriving at the property. Self-check-in using our smart door code allows you to check in any time after 4 pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024572722031734884,"social_amenities":0.001996211940422654,"party_restriction":0.01449288334697485,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004183134587947279}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The parking out front is free, but there are many metered spots on adjacent streets and in the neighborhood in general. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Clean up all smoke butts. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it was your own property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.294788181548938e-05,"social_amenities":0.0007455236627720296,"party_restriction":0.9972633123397827,"nearby_nightlife":0.9215385913848877}},{"text":"Enjoy a comfortable reading chair a step-in closet and nightstands for extra storage. Working from home while you visit Savannah? The master bedroom comes with a dedicated workspace and our high-speed WIFI is perfect for video conferencing and multi-tasking. Staying for longer? 1870 provides an in-unit stackable washer and dryer, iron, and ironing board. Guest access The entire garden apartment as well as the exterior patio off of the kitchen is yours. The upstairs is the owners' quarters, please do not attempt to walk up the exterior staircase to their home. You may come and go as you please!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035318106529302895,"social_amenities":0.0021174096036702394,"party_restriction":0.003063696436583996,"nearby_nightlife":0.013485938310623169}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 54012","address":"523 HOWARD ST","permit_ty