e city. Walkable Location You\u2019ll be staying in one of Savannah\u2019s most desirable neighborhoods, surrounded by leafy squares, beautiful architecture, and local favorites.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020154690719209611,"social_amenities":0.0020352392457425594,"party_restriction":0.000988579005934298,"nearby_nightlife":0.6753097176551819}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 55022","address":"215 W GASTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22447730","title":"Courtyard on Gaston Street by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447730","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00123"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447730","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"cc057f573ce0e3e57538ed986f22325948c5e7b54428fef6ca09eaf753a0b8d9","chunks":7,"words":531,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.007010945584625006,"party_welcome":0.9702703356742859,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.9825112223625183,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"The sunroom doubles as a third bedroom, and when closed off from the rest of the home it has an en suite bath. The recently renovated kitchen has stainless steel appliances and every gadget you\u2019d need to create a gourmet meal to enjoy in the adjacent dining room. Both bedrooms have Queen sized beds, plenty of room to unpack, and large windows that filter in the beautiful Savannah sunlight. A formal living room provides space to get some work done, or just curl up on the couch with a good book.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016794537077657878,"social_amenities":0.0024192549753934145,"party_restriction":0.0003731536853592843,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013655137736350298}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"For breakfast, we suggest taking a short walk to Clary\u2019s Cafe, a local favorite and the setting for several scenes in Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil. Just blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest park, you\u2019ll be well situated to attend several yearly music and food festivals as well as our weekly Saturday farmer's market. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - A short walk from the Savannah Civic Center, this property is ideally located for events like SCAD graduation and concerts. - Plenty of non-metered parking can be found on adjacent Tattnall Street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9702703356742859,"social_amenities":0.002507059136405587,"party_restriction":0.0012026437325403094,"nearby_nightlife":0.9825112223625183}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"For breakfast, we suggest taking a short walk to Clary\u2019s Cafe, a local favorite and the setting for several scenes in Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil. Just blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest park, you\u2019ll be well situated to attend several yearly music and food festivals as well as our weekly Saturday farmer's market. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - A short walk from the Savannah Civic Center, this property is ideally located for events like SCAD graduation and concerts. - Plenty of non-metered parking can be found on adjacent Tattnall Street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9702703356742859,"social_amenities":0.002507059136405587,"party_restriction":0.0012026437325403094,"nearby_nightlife":0.9825112223625183}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}},{"text":"Sunroom: Queen Sized Murphy Bed PARKING: Parking for this home is on-street and metered, which is enforced by the City of Savannah from Monday through Friday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or park on a nearby non-metered street. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. Savannah Short Term Vacation Rental Permit #: SVR-00123 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012396420061122626,"social_amenities":0.0006400012644007802,"party_restriction":0.0016937436303123832,"nearby_nightlife":0.003364953678101301}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"For breakfast, we suggest taking a short walk to Clary\u2019s Cafe, a local favorite and the setting for several scenes in Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil. Just blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest park, you\u2019ll be well situated to attend several yearly music and food festivals as well as our weekly Saturday farmer's market. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - A short walk from the Savannah Civic Center, this property is ideally located for events like SCAD graduation and concerts. - Plenty of non-metered parking can be found on adjacent Tattnall Street. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9702703356742859,"social_amenities":0.002507059136405587,"party_restriction":0.0012026437325403094,"nearby_nightlife":0.9825112223625183}},{"text":"Located on Gaston Street in the Historic District, this home is just steps away from beautiful Forsyth Park. Guests love the private courtyard with original brickwork and plenty of Savannah charm. The space This spacious first floor apartment is located on historic Gaston Street, and features detailed millwork and hardwood floors. With two bedrooms and two full baths, up to 6 Lucky guests will be comfortably accommodated during their stay. Guests will enter through the private courtyard into the sunroom, where you\u2019ll find comfortable seating, a TV, and window seat.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012421151041053236,"social_amenities":0.0021861817222088575,"party_restriction":0.0006823198054917157,"nearby_nightlife":0.013425033539533615}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20032 58002","address":"603 WHITAKER ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":20.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":7,"Noise-party-disturbance":2,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":2},"combined":{"All calls":7,"Noise-party-disturbance":2,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":2}},"calls":[{"number":"24097102047","date":"2024-04-06","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"601 Whitaker St","recorded_pin":"20032 58001","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24142150274","date":"2024-05-21","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"605 Whitaker St