g Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006549981189891696,"social_amenities":0.05117608234286308,"party_restriction":0.0007106375996954739,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004972416791133583}},{"text":"Step into this charming 2BR/2BA apartment in the heart of Savannah, facing the iconic Forsyth Park fountain! Fully renovated in 2026 with guests in mind, it features exposed brick accents and professional decor. This space offers a sublime blend of modern comfort and historic charm. Ideal for two couples, it has spacious bedrooms with en suite full baths, stylish touches, and easy walking to Savannah\u2019s best attractions. Enjoy a relaxing stay in this beautifully appointed home! SVR 02813 The space Walk in and feel immediately at home in this stylishly designed apartment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001256877148989588,"social_amenities":0.009905384853482246,"party_restriction":0.000629302638117224,"nearby_nightlife":0.0037681979592889547}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You are welcomed by the open kitchen and living space with room to relax, cook, or eat-in some of the fabulous Savannah food. We renovated the property in 2026 and included two full en-suite bathrooms and king bedrooms with brand new mattresses to fall into after a long day exploring. Other custom elements abound throughout the space, some added by our builder and a few by us :). Step outside and right into the heart of Savannah's Crown Jewel - Forsyth Park! As comfortable as we think the apartment is - make some time to explore th