Enjoy the convenience of staying a stone's throw away from Savannah's largest green space, Forsyth Park. The space Up to four Lucky travelers will feel at home in this ground level apartment, just a stone's throw away from Forsyth Park. The Lynwood Collection on Forsyth is located on Historic Gaston Street and has been renovated top-to-bottom. Coastal decor ties the space together and creates an inviting space for guests to relax. Enjoy morning or evening strolls beneath the Spanish moss trees, and start your adventure discovering all Savannah has to offer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001324399490840733,"social_amenities":0.003388382261618972,"party_restriction":0.0008690286776982248,"nearby_nightlife":0.014635413885116577}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Entering on the ground floor, you will be provided a secure key code unique to your stay, that ensures safe entry as you check in to your home away from home. Nestle into your coastal digs by gathering together in the living space fitted with a flat screen TV. Guests are welcome to access their streaming favorites like Netflix, Hulu, or Amazon Prime. The kitchen is open to the living space, perfect for entertaining your guests. This quaint space offers stainless steel appliances, and is fitted to prepare a home cooked meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01512700505554676,"social_amenities":0.0052494509145617485,"party_restriction":0.00024171214317902923,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019518241751939058}},{"text":"Just down the hall, you'll find the King-size bedroom that features a private patio, great for an intimate meal or reading a book. Curl up into bed after a long day of exploring the town, and catch up on your favorite shows on the flatscreen television. You can also find the bathroom that features a spacious vanity, walk-in shower and a stackable washer and dryer. In the morning, we recommend taking a short stroll across Forsyth 