loset Entertainment HDTV with Netflix Books and reading material Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Indoor fireplace Ceiling fan Portable fans Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have one security camera facing the back parking lot and one ring doorbell camara at the front door they operate 24/7 for your protection and ours","section":"AMENITIES","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.961720934370533e-05,"social_amenities":0.0021581859327852726,"party_restriction":0.00047180202091112733,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017216940177604556}},{"text":"**Second Bedroom**: Cozy queen-sized Sealy Opal bed; accessed through the master bedroom (door separates rooms). - *Additional Sleeping*: Daybed couch on the ground floor. W full bathroom *Kitchen*: ( on first floor) - Compact but fully equipped with a 4 apt style burner stove, oven, refrigerator, Keurig coffee maker (pods provided), and basic cookware Oil salt pepper Designed for light meals\u2014ideal for those planning to dine out. Or who need a basic compact kitchen Although I have had guests make thanksgiving dinner there ! *Bathrooms*: - Organic toiletries, plush Turkish towels, and hairdryers provided. **Amenities** - Free Wi-Fi, streaming services (bring your accounts), and Alexa-enabled TV. **House Rules**","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00216053263284266,"social_amenities":0.0016807368956506252,"party_restriction":0.0022202548570930958,"nearby_nightlife":0.019349247217178345}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"**Second Bedroom**: Cozy queen-sized Sealy Opal bed; accessed through the master bedroom (door separates rooms). - *Additional Sleeping*: Daybed couch on the ground floor. W full bathroom *Kitchen*: ( on first floor) - Compact but fully equipped with a 4 apt style burner stove, oven, refrigerator, Keurig coffee maker (pods provided), and basic cookware Oil salt pepper Designed for light meals\u2014ideal for those planning to dine out. Or who need a basic compact kitchen Although I have had guests make thanksgiving dinner there ! *Bathrooms*: - Organic toiletries, plush Turkish towels, and hairdryers provided. **Amenities** - Free Wi-Fi, streaming services (bring your accounts), and Alexa-enabled TV. **House Rules**","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00216053263284266,"social_amenities":0.0016807368956506252,"party_restriction":0.0022202548570930958,"nearby_nightlife":0.019349247217178345}},{"text":"- **Check-In/Out**: 4 PM arrival, 11 AM departure. Late check-out unavailable, however if we get the apt cleaned early we will message you about a possible early check we try our best, but there\u2019s no guarantees. **Prime Location** - **Forsyth Park**: Steps from the center of Forsyth park - stroll with wine (open-container laws apply!). - **Dining & Culture**: - Collins Quarter (1 block), Hotel Bardo\u2019s speakeasy and restaurants (across the park). - Starland District (3 blocks), SCAD, and River District (15-minute walk). - **Transportation**: Free DOT shuttle stops nearby; bike rentals recommended. **Parking** - **One off-street spot** provided per reservation (fits SUVs/compacts; first-come basis).","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013144278200343251,"social_amenities":0.003737946040928364,"party_restriction":0.0038242293521761894,"nearby_nightlife":0.9960939288139343}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"1888 Savannah Victorian best suited for couples, and quiet adult guests, the historic indoor stairs lead to both bedrooms, the apt is not suitable for children or infants. Small living room & kitchen 1) Large king room 2) queen bedroom. Main living area is on the first floor w a single day bed. Located just 676 steps from Forsyth Park, timeless Victorian character, modern comfort. All guests must be comfortable using stairs and maintaining calm quiet for their stay.( not a party apt ) The space Charming Historic Victorian Apartment Steps ( 676 steps ) from Forsyth Park !\u2b50\ufe0f Not suitable for children under 16","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002617492573335767,"social_amenities":0.42736679315567017,"party_restriction":0.9905609488487244,"nearby_nightlife":0.005141005385667086}},{"text":"- **Check-In/Out**: 4 PM arrival, 11 AM departure. Late check-out unavailable, however if we get the apt cleaned early we will message you about a possible early check we try our best, but there\u2019s no guarantees. **Prime Location** - **Forsyth Park**: Steps from the center of Forsyth park - stroll with wine (open-container laws apply!). - **Dining & Culture**: - Collins Quarter (1 block), Hotel Bardo\u2019s speakeasy and restaurants (across the park). - Starland District (3 blocks), SCAD, and River District (15-minute walk). - **Transportation**: Free DOT shuttle stops nearby; bike rentals recommended. **Parking** - **One off-street spot** provided per reservation (fits SUVs/compacts; first-come basis).","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013144278200343251,"social_amenities":0.003737946040928364,"party_restriction":0.0038242293521761894,"nearby_nightlife":0.9960939288139343}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"- **Adults Only preference and strongly recommended *Note to Guests: Please review all details below prior to booking to ensure this space aligns with your needs \u201cNot ideal for young children \u2014 better suited for ages 16+. \u2022 \u201cBest suited for guests 16+ due to the layout and tranquil atmosphere. \u2022 \u201cNot childproofed \u2014 not ideal for young children- under 16 It\u2019s just not the best fit for children under the age of 16 for either of us. I have other properties that are better for families. Quiet hours enforced per Savannah noise ordinances. No parties or rowdy behavior. - **No Smoking**: Anywhere on the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018469842325430363