d one - may require a short walk). **Safety & Privacy** - Outdoor security cameras (parking areas and front door) ensure safety. We pride ourselves on offering a curated, affordable stay that mirrors Savannah\u2019s enchanting spirit. Whether sipping cocktails at Bardo or unwinding in your Victorian haven, we\u2019re here to make your visit unforgettable. Step into Savannah\u2019s storied past in the best location #SVR-02326- Guest access Washer and dryer use We make no guarantees as this is our only working laundry room for 6 units and room for a guest to to a load but need 30 days notice.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024641508935019374,"social_amenities":0.0011893660994246602,"party_restriction":0.000995853217318654,"nearby_nightlife":0.975623369216919}}]}}},{"listing_id":"52837945","title":"Romantic Canopy Suite \u2022 2 Min Walk to Forsyth park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/52837945","guests":3.0,"permits":["SVR-02328"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"52837945","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"fd7d60e0ac6c59418eadc7e280e66f4145b04c695533b061ba155e02c40b8c8c","chunks":16,"words":1575,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.005032908171415329,"party_welcome":0.0006760651594959199,"social_amenities":0.005032908171415329,"party_restriction":0.052427418529987335,"nearby_nightlife":0.12021219730377197,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views Courtyard view Garden view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Organic Vegan conditioner Organic Vegan body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Paid dryer \u2013 In building Hangers Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment 55 inch HDTV with Amazon Prime Video, Netflix Alexa Bluetooth sound system Family Crib - available upon request Mini (38 inches long x 24 inches wide) Pack \u2019n play/Tr