lic streets to access the park or the large parking lot ( they give permission for neighbors and guests to walk through it Washer and dryer available only with 2 weeks advance notice ,this is our working laundry for 30 beds so there is not a 100% guarantee it will be available. PARKING","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010251429921481758,"social_amenities":0.0006612331490032375,"party_restriction":0.005905434023588896,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013303016312420368}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"As noted in the listing, this is a historic multi-unit property in the heart of Savannah. You may occasionally hear normal city or neighboring guest activity. If you are extremely sensitive to sound, this may not be the best fit \u2014 but most guests 95% find it part of the charm of staying in a historic home in a vibrant downtown location. Security For your peace of mind: \u2022 Outdoor-only cameras in the parking area \u2022 Ring doorbell at the front entrance SVR-02328. Note we do change our colors of our duvets according to the seasons we use white , cream and light peach Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017644508625380695,"social_amenities":0.002733448287472129,"party_restriction":0.0039117345586419106,"nearby_nightlife":0.12021219730377197}},{"text":"Sleeping Arrangements PLEASE READ THOROUGHLY \u2022 1) Primary: Romantic Tuft & Needle King size Canopy Bed (guests consistently love it) \u2022 Extras \u201c2 beds \u201cbest for kids or petite adults): \u2022 Small single foam ottoman sleeper \u2022 Single floor futon Note ## Airbnb notes these as beds in their listing description-even though they are not real beds this is what Airbnb declares to be valid. \u2022 Maximum occupancy: 3 guests Parking (Important to Read) \u2022 Free street parking \u2014 no permits, no meters, no time limits \u2022 Parking is typically available 20 feet to a few blocks away, depending on season and Forsyth Park events","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006760651594959199,"social_amenities":0.0005345733370631933,"party_restriction":0.0005360717768780887,"nearby_nightlife":0.011962033808231354}}]}}},{"listing_id":"54063814","title":"Forsyth Park Queen Anne Mansion + Free Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/54063814","guests":14.0,"permits":["SVR-02329"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"54063814","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"538d6a4a69dbb631c8ecc6bc67b159cc17f041b0eae03e26715a305d9c1d4d0e","chunks":30,"words":2941,"party_signal":0.9975605010986328,"social_signal":0.5027146935462952,"party_welcome":0.9980295300483704,"social_amenities":0.5027146935462952,"party_restriction":0.9986159801483154,"nearby_nightlife":0.8784414529800415,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"With Iconic Porch Views ! There is no closer to Forsyth Park and right in the center! We love hosting - Respectful, bachelorette gatherings \u2022 Family reunions \u2022 Girls\u2019 trips \u2022 Historic enthusiasts. Ideal for larger groups of 10 to 14 Welcome to your front-row rocking chair to Savannah\u2019s most beloved landmark\u2014Forsyth Park. Step onto the wraparound front porch, sink into a wicker chair or rocking rocker, and take in the sweeping, unobstructed views of moss-draped oaks, and gentle park life just 30 seconds away !","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9975605010986328,"social_amenities":0.0036984113976359367,"party_restriction":0.00025471459957771003,"nearby_nightlife":0.08547690510749817},"affirmative_event_evidence":"We love hosting - Respectful, bachelorette gatherings \u2022 Family reunions \u2022 Girls\u2019 trips \u2022 Historic enthusiasts."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Option 1: The back living room has a newer Ashley queen-size sofa sleeper and is located right next to a full bathroom. There are no interior stairs required to access this area\u2014only the exterior steps leading into the home. Option 2: There is also a private twin-size bed located in a small back sitting room on the first floor, also with convenient access to a full bathroom. Both options allow guests to sleep on the first floor without needing to use the main staircase. Optional Beds, If Needed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016508449334651232,"social_amenities":0.5027146935462952,"party_restriction":0.0012145957443863153,"nearby_nightlife":0.00017037609359249473}},{"text":"Forsyth Park Queen Anne Victorian Mansion DIRECTLY on Forsyth Park\u2014there is no closer location! Gaze upon Savannah\u2019s iconic park and the fountain, just 129 steps away. Live history and experience Savannah from your own Victorian mansion. Enjoy breathtaking views from the grand living room and parlor, relax on the wraparound porch with three rocking chairs and ample seating, or unwind on the third-floor veranda beneath majestic moss-draped oaks. Timeless architecture and Southern charm abound. The space Please read the information thoroughly- as we want to make sure this is a good fit for your group \ud83d\ude0a Welcome to your Victorian Queen Anne Mansion DIRECTLY on Forsyth Park!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046165980165824294,"social_amenities":0.018652761355042458,"party_restriction":0.001306499121710658,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006509555387310684}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Our maximum occupancy is 14 people total on the property at any time, including visitors. If someone will be stopping by during your stay, they must be included in your approved guest count in advance. This requirement is important for our City of Savannah short-term rental regulations, insurance, and Airbnb coverage. Exterior security cameras are located around the property and are fully disclosed in the listing\u2019s safety information. Bachelorette Gatherings, Birthdays & Group Stays We\u2019ve welcomed many wonderful bachelorette groups, birthdays, family reunions, and other celebrations, and respectful groups are absolutely welcome.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":195,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9980295300483704,"social_amenities":0.007778906263411045,"party_restriction":0.0056730699725449085,"nearby_nightlife":0.7579808831214905}},{"text":"With Iconic Porch Views ! There is no closer to Forsyth Park and right in the center! We love hosting - Respectful, bachelorette gatherings \u2022 Family reunions \u2022 Girls\u2019 trips \u2022 Historic enthusiasts. Ideal for larger groups of 10 to 14 Welcome to your front-row rocking chair to Savannah\u2019s most beloved landmark\u2014Forsyth Park. Step onto the wraparound front porch, sink into a wicker chair or rocking rocker, and take in the sweeping, unobstructed views of moss-draped oaks, and gentle park life just 30 seconds away !","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9975605010986328,"social_amenities":0.0036984113976359367,"party_restriction":0.00025471459957771003,"nearby_nightlife":0.08547690510749817}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Option 1: The back living room has a newer Ashley queen-size sofa sleeper and is located right next to a full bathroom. There are no interior stairs required to access this area\u2014only the exterior steps leading into the home. Option 2: There is also a private twin-size bed located in a small back sitting room on the first floor, also with convenient access to a full bathroom. Both options allow guests to sleep on the first floor without needing to use the main staircase. Optional Beds, If Needed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016508449334651232,"social_amenities":0.5027146935462952,"party_restriction":0.0012145957443863153,"nearby_nightlife":0.00017037609359249473}},{"text":"Forsyth Park Queen Anne Victorian Mansion DIRECTLY on Forsyth Park\u2014there is no closer location! Gaze upon Savannah\u2019s iconic park and the fountain, just 129 steps away. Live history and experience Savannah from your own Victorian mansion. Enjoy breathtaking views from the grand living room and parlor, relax on the wraparound porch with three rocking chairs and ample seating, or unwind on the third-floor veranda beneath majestic moss-draped oaks. Timeless architecture and Southern charm abound. The space Please read the information thoroughly- as we want to make sure this is a good fit for your group \ud83d\ude0a Welcome to your Victorian Queen Anne Mansion DIRECTLY on Forsyth Park!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046165980165824294,"social_amenities":0.018652761355042458,"party_restriction":0.001306499121710658,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006509555387310684}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The home is located in a quiet, upscale residential neighborhood, so gatherings need to remain respectful of our neighbors. Visitors & Outside Guests Only registered and approved guests may enter the property. For example, if your reservation lists eight guests, then eight people are approved to use the property. If you would like friends or family to visit during your stay, please contact us beforehand so they can be added to the approved guest count. We can never exceed 14 people on the property at one time. This policy helps us comply with City regulations and maintain appropriate insurance and Airbnb coverage for both guests and the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":211,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015001734718680382,"social_amenities":0.0029904909897595644,"party_restriction":0.9986159801483154,"nearby_nightlife":0.3489088714122772}},{"text":"Decorations & Noise We want you to enjoy your celebration while helping us preserve this historic home. Please do not use: \u2022 Confetti \u2022 Glitter \u2022 Feathers \u2022 Tape \u2022 Adhesives on walls, ceilings, doors, or furnishings Even removable tape and adhesive products have repeatedly damaged the paint and plaster, so we unfortunately cannot allow them. Please also avoid amplified music or loud gatherings. Respectful, low-key celebrations are very welcome. Third-Party Service Providers We\u2019re happy to consider outside professionals such as massage therapists, hairstylists, makeup artists, photographers, and similar service providers with prior written approval. Before arrival, please provide: \u2022 The provider\u2019s full name","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":235,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01749189756810665,"social_amenities":0.0004364794003777206,"party_restriction":0.9950776696205139,"nearby_nightlife":0.001410956378094852}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Events & Gatherings The maximum occupancy is 14 people total at all times. We are not licensed as a commercial event venue, so we cannot host weddings, receptions, large parties, or gatherings exceeding 14 people. These limitations help us comply with City of Savannah regulations and protect our short-term rental license. Planning something smaller, such as professional photography, filming, or another creative use involving 14 people or fewer? Please reach out before booking. We\u2019re happy to discuss whether the property would be a good fit. We also have several separate carriage-house accommodations toward the rear of the property that may be available if your group needs additional overnight lodging.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":223,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005035669542849064,"social_amenities":0.000970077293459326,"party_restriction":0.9585796594619751,"nearby_nightlife":0.8784414529800415}},{"text":"Our maximum occupancy is 14 people total on the property at any time, including visitors. If someone will be stopping by during your stay, they must be included in your approved guest count in advance. This requirement is important for our City of Savannah short-term rental regulations, insurance, and Airbnb coverage. Exterior security cameras are located around the property and are fully disclosed in the listing\u2019s safety information. Bachelorette Gatherings, Birthdays & Group Stays We\u2019ve welcomed many wonderful bachelorette groups, birthdays, family reunions, and other celebrations, and respectful groups are absolutely welcome.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":195,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9980295300483704,"social_amenities":0.007778906263411045,"party_restriction":0.0056730699725449085,"nearby_nightlife":0.7579808831214905}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20033 01002","address":"505 E JONES ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":null,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24227238464","date":"2024-08-14","type":"24-4 UNWANTED person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"505 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20033 01002","side":"direct"},{"number":"25242245695","date":"2025-08-30","type":"42 PAST attempted THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"505 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20033 01002","side":"direct"},{"number":"24352366019","date":"2024-12-17","type":"14 THREAT SUSP in area","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"507 E Jones St","recorded_pin":"20033 01562","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22184994","title":"","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22184994","guests":null,"permits":["SVR-00117"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22184994","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8537d3147715752b603632514ed718b2489d9ef8573fc3597beb204a12cb65d6","chunks":0,"words":0,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0,"party_welcome"