:"Step Back in time to 1860s Savannah!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1294573940192053263","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03061"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1294573940192053263","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"aa2beb99075886f6b2cca0f850a8aeda66f7e1b3a41f4bc081ab08e7ca103335","chunks":9,"words":906,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.01628854312002659,"party_welcome":0.9833207726478577,"social_amenities":0.01628854312002659,"party_restriction":0.002705381019040942,"nearby_nightlife":0.8506776690483093,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Each elegantly appointed bedroom features luxury mattresses (frequently called out by guests as some of the most comfortable they've ever slept in), high-end linens, and thoughtfully curated decor. The fully equipped chef's kitchen is ready for a home-cooked Lowcountry meal, while the inviting living spaces \u2014 complete with smart TV and high-speed Wi-Fi \u2014 are perfect for unwinding after a day of exploring. Step outside to the shared courtyard, where a gas fire pit sets the scene for slow Savannah evenings under the stars. Travelers will also love the rare and welcome perk of a reserved off-street parking spot \u2014 a true luxury in a city famous for tight parking.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003161139611620456,"social_amenities":0.01628854312002659,"party_restriction":0.0007738387794233859,"nearby_nightlife":0.07433465123176575}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Sound system Books and reading material Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property For safety and security, there are cameras monitoring and recording video and audio of the front porch, back porch and parking area. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi","section":"AMENITIES","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001394644204992801,"social_amenities":0.011347749270498753,"party_restriction":0.0006018021376803517,"nearby_nightlife":0.005845203995704651}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"River Street's waterfront, with its shops, breweries, and live music, is an easy stroll north. Planning a larger gathering? Haint Blue Haven shares a building with our Luxe Retreat townhouse, and the two can be booked together to create a 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12 \u2014 perfect for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, and milestone celebrations. Whether you're here for the history, the food, the romance, or the chance to slow down and experience Savannah at her most magical, Haint Blue Haven offers a stay as soulful and storied as the city itself. SVR-03061 Guest access Guests have access to the entire townhouse and the shared courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9833207726478577,"social_amenities":0.008145813830196857,"party_restriction":0.00047921930672600865,"nearby_nightlife":0.7759400010108948}},{"text":"Rooted in Gullah Geechee heritage, the tradition holds that haint blue tricks restless spirits (\"haints\") into thinking the ceiling is water, keeping them from entering the home. At Haint Blue Haven, this storied tradition isn't just a nod \u2014 it's a centerpiece of the home's character, woven into ceilings, accents, and design details that make this stay unmistakably Savannah. With 3 bedrooms, 1.5 baths, and room for up to 6 guests, Haint Blue Haven is perfectly sized for couples traveling together, small families, girls' getaways, anniversaries, and romantic Southern escapes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0019847871735692024,"social_amenities":0.0024554640986025333,"party_restriction":0.0008940855623222888,"nearby_nightlife":0.013456142507493496}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Each elegantly appointed bedroom features luxury mattresses (frequently called out by guests as some of the most comfortable they've ever slept in), high-end linens, and thoughtfully curated decor. The fully equipped chef's kitchen is ready for a home-cooked Lowcountry meal, while the inviting living spaces \u2014 complete with smart TV and high-speed Wi-Fi \u2014 are perfect for unwinding after a day of exploring. Step outside to the shared courtyard, where a gas fire pit sets the scene for slow Savannah evenings under the stars. Travelers will also love the rare and welcome perk of a reserved off-street parking spot \u2014 a true luxury in a city famous for tight parking.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003161139611620456,"social_amenities":0.01628854312002659,"party_restriction":0.0007738387794233859,"nearby_nightlife":0.07433465123176575}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Sound system Books and reading material Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property For safety and security, there are cameras monitoring and recording video and audio of the front porch, back porch and parking area. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi","section":"AMENITIES","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001394644204992801,"social_amenities":0.011347749270498753,"party_restriction":0.0006018021376803517,"nearby_nightlife":0.005845203995704651}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The reserved off-street parking space is exclusively for your use during your stay. Locked owner storage areas are the only restricted spaces. Other things to note Parking: Includes one reserved off-street parking space, a rare convenience in Savannah\u2019s historic district. Shared Courtyard: Courtyard access is shared with the adjacent townhouse. Please be mindful of other guests. Ample Supplies: We provide plenty of toiletries, and kitchen essentials for a stress-free stay. Historic Features: As this is a historic home, please treat original fixtures and furnishings with care. Entire property of two townhouses available to book together for a larger group of 12.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001533970353193581,"social_amenities":0.005063781049102545,"party_restriction":0.002705381019040942,"nearby_nightlife":0.01617801934480667}},{"text":"And because we know your dog is family too, Haint Blue Haven is dog-friendly (with a small fee), making it an ideal pick for travelers who want to bring their four-legged companions along for the trip. Outside the front door, you're immediately immersed in the magic of Savannah's Historic District. Stroll the cobblestones of Jones Street \u2014 often called one of the most beautiful streets in America \u2014 wander the moss-draped squares, browse boutique shops, and dine at award-winning restaurants like The Grey, The Olde Pink House, and Mrs. Wilkes' Dining Room. Forsyth Park is just a short walk away, with its iconic fountain, picnic-perfect lawns, and weekend farmers' market.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00081111048348248,"social_amenities":0.004242900293320417,"party_restriction":0.001286240410991013,"nearby_nightlife":0.8506776690483093}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"And because we know your dog is family too, Haint Blue Haven is dog-friendly (with a small fee), making it an ideal pick for travelers who want to bring their four-legged companions along for the trip. Outside the front door, you're immediately immersed in the magic of Savannah's Historic District. Stroll the cobblestones of Jones Street \u2014 often called one of the most beautiful streets in America \u2014 wander the moss-draped squares, browse boutique shops, and dine at award-winning restaurants like The Grey, The Olde Pink House, and Mrs. Wilkes' Dining Room. Forsyth Park is just a short walk away, with its iconic fountain, picnic-perfect lawns, and weekend farmers' market.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00081111048348248,"social_amenities":0.004242900293320417,"party_restriction":0.001286240410991013,"nearby_nightlife":0.8506776690483093}},{"text":"River Street's waterfront, with its shops, breweries, and live music, is an easy stroll north. Planning a larger gathering? Haint Blue Haven shares a building with our Luxe Retreat townhouse, and the two can be booked together to create a 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12 \u2014 perfect for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, and milestone celebrations. Whether you're here for the history, the food, the romance, or the chance to slow down and experience Savannah at her most magical, Haint Blue Haven offers a stay as soulful and storied as the city itself. SVR-03061 Guest access Guests have access to the entire townhouse and the shared courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9833207726478577,"social_amenities":0.008145813830196857,"party_restriction":0.00047921930672600865,"nearby_nightlife":0.7759400010108948}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1304651044621482473","title":"Dog Friendly, Historic Off Jones Street W/Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1304651044621482473","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03060"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1304651044621482473","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f8db6ec3d41f8d6ed43060986054a79d67841289a1f7440ab7499bbbbe495d71","chunks":9,"words":821,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.01943841576576233,"party_welcome":0.9952077269554138,"social_amenities":0.07244250178337097,"party_restriction":0.0024641624186187983,"nearby_nightlife":0.995795726776123,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Historic Features: As this is a historic home, please treat original fixtures and furnishings with care. Entire property of two townhouses available to book together for a larger group of 12. If this unit is already booked or you'd like to experience the charm of our neighboring unit, no problem! Simply book our adjacent unit, Haint Blue Haven, which accommodates up to 6 guests. Check availability here: airbnb.com/h/silasfultonhouse1 If you're looking for even more space, you can book the entire townhouse, offering a combined stay for up to 12 guests. Explore availability and book here: airbnb.com/h/silasfultonhouse","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020345918892417103,"social_amenities":0.01943841576576233,"party_restriction":0.0024641624186187983,"nearby_nightlife":0.00181009026709944}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Marshall Bluetooth sound system Books and reading material Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property For safety and security, there are cameras monitoring and recording video and audio of the front porch, back porch and parking area. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi","section":"AMENITIES","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016457510355394334,"social_amenities":0.017356453463435173,"party_restriction":0.0006831513019278646,"nearby_nightlife":0.006316932383924723}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Forsyth Park is just a short walk away, and River Street's waterfront views, shops, and nightlife are an easy stroll from the home. Planning a larger gathering? The Luxe Retreat shares a building with our Haint Blue Haven townhouse, and the two can be booked together to create a 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12 \u2014 ideal for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, and milestone celebrations. Whether you're here for the history, the food, the romance, or simply to slow down and enjoy the Lowcountry, the Luxe Retreat at Silas Fulton House offers a stay as memorable as Savannah itself.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9952077269554138,"social_amenities":0.004449714440852404,"party_restriction":0.0008356765029020607,"nearby_nightlife":0.9625500440597534}},{"text":"When the sun sets, head out to the shared courtyard, where a gas fire pit sets the scene for slow evenings under the Savannah sky. And in a city famously short on parking, you'll appreciate the home's rare and welcome perk: a reserved off-street parking spot for guests of the Luxe Retreat. Step outside the front door and you're immediately immersed in the magic of Savannah's Historic District. Stroll Jones Street \u2014 often called one of the most beautiful streets in America \u2014 wander the moss-draped squares, sip cocktails on lantern-lit patios, browse boutiques, and dine at award-winning restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.007943441160023212,"social_amenities":0.07244250178337097,"party_restriction":0.0016292189247906208,"nearby_nightlife":0.995795726776123}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"When the sun sets, head out to the shared courtyard, where a gas fire pit sets the scene for slow evenings under the Savannah sky