7097,"party_restriction":0.0016292189247906208,"nearby_nightlife":0.995795726776123}},{"text":"Forsyth Park is just a short walk away, and River Street's waterfront views, shops, and nightlife are an easy stroll from the home. Planning a larger gathering? The Luxe Retreat shares a building with our Haint Blue Haven townhouse, and the two can be booked together to create a 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12 \u2014 ideal for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, and milestone celebrations. Whether you're here for the history, the food, the romance, or simply to slow down and enjoy the Lowcountry, the Luxe Retreat at Silas Fulton House offers a stay as memorable as Savannah itself.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9952077269554138,"social_amenities":0.004449714440852404,"party_restriction":0.0008356765029020607,"nearby_nightlife":0.9625500440597534}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1304651079968232449","title":"Gather with loved ones in Historic Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1304651079968232449","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-03060","SVR-03061"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1304651079968232449","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"da4fca1c9afa626b53f3c169035073d4f8bb43e6c05c3b7946f672bf45b9666f","chunks":8,"words":751,"party_signal":0.994566798210144,"social_signal":0.013904884457588196,"party_welcome":0.994566798210144,"social_amenities":0.7340670228004456,"party_restriction":0.004632608499377966,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872101545333862,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"The home is actually two side-by-side townhouses \u2014 Luxe Retreat (3 bedrooms, 2 baths, sleeps 6) and Haint Blue Haven (3 bedrooms, 1.5 baths, sleeps 6) \u2014 that can be booked together for a full 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12, or rented individually for smaller getaways. It's an ideal setup for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, milestone birthdays, and multigenerational trips, where guests want togetherness and privacy in equal measure. Inside, original details \u2014 exposed beam ceilings, post-and-beam architecture, beautiful stained glass, and traditional haint blue accents \u2014 come together with refined Southern decor and modern comforts.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994566798210144,"social_amenities":0.006223984062671661,"party_restriction":0.0006737674702890217,"nearby_nightlife":0.006344872061163187},"affirmative_event_evidence":"It's an ideal setup for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, milestone birthdays, and multigenerational trips, where guests want togetherness and privacy in equal measure."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Sound system Books and reading material Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property For safety and security, there are cameras monitoring and recording video and audio of the front porch, back porch and parking area. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000253404607065022,"social_amenities":0.013904884457588196,"party_restriction":0.0008837680798023939,"nearby_nightlife":0.003715087892487645}},{"text":"Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Fire pit Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":128,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008914018981158733,"social_amenities":0.013160104863345623,"party_restriction":0.0009536363068036735,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006815445376560092}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The home is actually two side-by-side townhouses \u2014 Luxe Retreat (3 bedrooms, 2 baths, sleeps 6) and Haint Blue Haven (3 bedrooms, 1.5 baths, sleeps 6) \u2014 that can be booked together for a full 6-bedroom, 3.5-bath estate that sleeps 12, or rented individually for smaller getaways. It's an ideal setup for family reunions, bachelorette weekends, weddings, milestone birthdays, and multigenerational trips, where guests want togetherness and privacy in equal measure. Inside, original details \u2014 exposed beam ceilings, post-and-beam architecture, beautiful stained glass, and traditional haint blue accents \u2014 come together with refined Southern decor and modern comforts.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994566798210144,"social_amenities":0.006223984062671661,"party_restriction":0.0006737674702890217,"nearby_nightlife":0.006344872061163187}},{"text":"Sink into plush beds (frequently called out by guests as some of the most comfortable they've ever slept in), cook in a fully equipped chef's kitchen with modern appliances, stream from a smart TV, work or browse on high-speed Wi-Fi, and unwind in elegantly designed living spaces filled with light and character. Step outside into the private courtyard, where a gas fire pit invites long evenings of laughter and storytelling under the Savannah sky. And in a city famously known for its parking challenges, the home offers a rare and welcome perk: two designated off-street parking spots for guests Location-wise, you couldn't ask for better.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.20553863048553467,"social_amenities":0.7340670228004456,"party_restriction":0.00031210362794809043,"nearby_nightlife":0.6100278496742249}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Sink into plush beds (frequently called out by guests as some of the most comfortable they've ever slept in), cook in a fully equipped chef's kitchen with modern appliances, stream from a smart TV, work or browse on high-speed Wi-Fi, and unwind in elegantly designed living spaces filled with light and character. Step outside into the private courtyard, where a gas fire pit invites long evenings of laughter and storytelling under the Savannah sky. And in a city famously known for its parking challenges, the home offers a rare and welcome perk: two designated off-street parking spots for guests Location-wise, you couldn't ask for better.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.20553863048553467,"social_amenities":0.7340670228004456,"party_restriction":0.00031210362794809043,"nearby_nightlife":0.6100278496742249}},{"text":"The Silas Fulton House sits steps from Forsyth Park, Jones Street (often called one of the most beautiful streets in America), River Street, and the boutique shops and acclaimed restaurants of the Historic District. Walk to Leopold's Ice Cream, stroll the moss-draped squares, sip cocktails on lantern-lit patios, or set off on a ghost tour through one of the country's most atmospheric cities \u2014 it's all just outside your door. Whether you're traveling with extended family, gathering friends for a special occasion, or simply seeking a romantic Southern escape, the Silas Fulton Historic House offers a stay that's as unforgettable as Savannah itself. SVR-03060, SVR-03061 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.06194216012954712,"social_amenities":0.06816079467535019,"party_restriction":0.004585637710988522,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872101545333862}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Guests have access to the entire townhouse and gated courtyard. Two reserved off-street parking spaces are exclusively for your use during your stay. Locked owner storage areas are the only restricted spaces. Other things to note Parking: Includes two reserved off-street parking spaces, a rare convenience in Savannah\u2019s historic district. Ample Supplies: We provide plenty of toiletries, and kitchen essentials for a stress-free stay. Historic Features: As this is a historic home, please treat original fixtures and furnishings with care. The two townhouses are available to book separately. If you're traveling with a smaller group, no problem!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018803354760166258,"social_amenities":0.0008566431351937354,"party_restriction":0.004632608499377966,"nearby_nightlife":0.007375118788331747}},{"text":"The Silas Fulton House sits steps from Forsyth Park, Jones Street (often called one of the most beautiful streets in America), River Street, and the boutique shops and acclaimed restaurants of the Historic District. Walk to Leopold's Ice Cream, stroll the moss-draped squares, sip cocktails on lantern-lit patios, or set off on a ghost tour through one of the country's most atmospheric cities \u2014 it's all just outside your door. Whether you're traveling with extended family, gathering friends for a special occasion, or simply seeking a romantic Southern escape, the Silas Fulton Historic House offers a stay that's as unforgettable as Savannah itself. SVR-03060, SVR-03061 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.06194216012954712,"social_amenities":0.06816079467535019,"party_restriction":0.004585637710988522,"nearby_nightlife":0.9872101545333862}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The Silas Fulton House sits steps from Forsyth Par