oms (one with a jetted tub) plus an elegant half bath \ud83c\udf33 Relax, Recharge, Explore \u2022 Outdoor terrace is a serene space to unwind after a day of sightseeing","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003545591898728162,"social_amenities":0.021199312061071396,"party_restriction":0.0005734985461458564,"nearby_nightlife":0.010561136528849602}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 \"Very spacious, clean, and charming\" \u2013 ideal for large groups and pets \u2022 \"Hosts were very responsive\" \u2013 seamless communication and smooth stay \u2705 Book Your Stay Today Whether you're planning a family getaway, friends' reunion, or a pet-friendly dive into Savannah's rich culture, this historic townhouse offers modern comfort, excellent location, and rare amenities that make a stay memorable. Reserve Now to secure your dates\u2014your magnolia-view oasis in Savannah awaits! \ud83c\udf3f Guest access You will be provided a keyless access code upon check-in. You will have access to the entire home, back deck, terrace and driveway that can fit two cars. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010158326476812363,"social_amenities":0.005476261489093304,"party_restriction":0.0015712984604761004,"nearby_nightlife":0.00127402285579592}},{"text":"This beautifully restored 1800s townhouse blends timeless Southern character with modern comforts\u2014perfect for families, friends, or pet-loving travelers seeking an unforgettable city escape. \ud83c\udfe1 Highlights at a Glance \u2022 Prime walkable location \u2013 just a 10-minute stroll to iconic Forsyth Park, SCAD, River Street, and City Market (Walk Score 81, Bike Score 96) \u2022 Private outdoor oasis \u2013 back-deck terrace complete with fire pit, hammock chair, and shaded relaxation \u2022 Rare downtown convenience \u2013 off-street parking available for up to 2 cars\u2014ideal for Savannah visits \u2022 4 bedrooms | 2.5 baths | sl