y of sightseeing","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003545591898728162,"social_amenities":0.021199312061071396,"party_restriction":0.0005734985461458564,"nearby_nightlife":0.010561136528849602}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Other Things to Note: Out of courtesy to our neighbors, quiet hours are from 10pm to 8am. Please remember this is a home. Please treat the space with respect. If any problems arise we do our best to take action ASAP, but no one is living on-site 26/7. A guest lease agreement outlining property rules must be signed prior to arrival. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011544852168299258,"social_amenities":0.0044094957411289215,"party_restriction":0.30749446153640747,"nearby_nightlife":0.004720422904938459}},{"text":"\u2022 Pet friendly (up to 2 dogs, max 50 lbs each)\u2014no need to leave furry family behind \u2022 Keyless entry ensures seamless, stress-free check-in and check-out \ud83d\udccd Savannah\u2019s Historic District \u2022 Located in a peaceful pocket of the Beach Institute neighborhood\u2014quiet yet close to the action \u2022 Easy access to the DOT shuttle at East Charlton & Drayton, or the free Downtowner rideshare (10 am\u2013midnight) \u2022 Quiet hours from 10 pm to 8 am ensure restful nights in this serene city setting \ud83d\udd39 Why Guests Love It \u2022 \"Great location!\" \u2013 perfect for walking to everything with a quiet, historic neighborhood feel","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004889576812274754,"social_amenities":0.005844538565725088,"party_restriction":0.003011501394212246,"nearby_nightlife":0.045387670397758484}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 Pet friendly (up to 2 dogs, max 50 lbs each)\u2014no need to leave furry family behind \u2022 Keyless entry ensures seamless, stress-free check-in and check-out \ud83d\udccd Savannah\u2019s Historic District \u2022 Located in a peaceful pocket of the Bea