e Comfort in Savannah | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1564507872432765921","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03176"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1564507872432765921","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bff9e2a2d4e608290ab3ae7cfc4b6e44450aa28f890842e899c8475328747cb1","chunks":12,"words":1187,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.7019325494766235,"party_welcome":0.012660043314099312,"social_amenities":0.7019325494766235,"party_restriction":0.006090399343520403,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917170405387878,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":219,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005449062446132302,"social_amenities":0.7019325494766235,"party_restriction":0.0025710014160722494,"nearby_nightlife":0.001766261993907392}},{"text":"Entry: Secure keyless entry for self-check-in Parking: Free street parking is available Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014845322584733367,"social_amenities":0.30517691373825073,"party_restriction":0.0009052355890162289,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015299150254577398}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This thoughtfully curated space provides a comfortable setting for a romantic trip, a family getaway, or a weekend with friends. The open layout creates a natural flow between the living, dining, and kitchen areas. Colorful accents and curated artwork give the home personality and charm, while comfortable furnishings make it easy to unwind after a day exploring the city. The living room centers around a smart TV and cozy seating, creating an inviting place to gather, relax, or enjoy a movie night. The kitchen is fully equipped for both casual and more elaborate meals. Modern appliances, sleek countertops, and ample storage make cooking easy and enjoyable.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.012660043314099312,"social_amenities":0.0012330847093835473,"party_restriction":0.00019789797079283744,"nearby_nightlife":0.010678987018764019}},{"text":"The dining table seats six, and the island seats three, offering flexible space for meals, morning coffee, or conversation. Comfortable Bedrooms and Flexible Layout Both main bedrooms feature queen canopy beds with soft linens and calming d\u00e9cor, creating peaceful retreats at the end of the day. A third room with a twin daybed offers additional sleeping space for a child or guest, making the apartment ideal for families or groups. Down the hall, a sunlit library provides a quiet corner to read, sip tea, or enjoy a moment of solitude. The full bathroom has been thoughtfully designed with a modern, spa-like atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018101887544617057,"social_amenities":0.001333945314399898,"party_restriction":0.00023598299594596028,"nearby_nightlife":0.005940100643783808}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":219,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005449062446132302,"social_amenities":0.7019325494766235,"party_restriction":0.0025710014160722494,"nearby_nightlife":0.001766261993907392}},{"text":"Entry: Secure keyless entry for self-check-in Parking: Free street parking is available Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014845322584733367,"social_amenities":0.30517691373825073,"party_restriction":0.0009052355890162289,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015299150254577398}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"It\u2019s the perfect spot for enjoying morning coffee, al fresco meals, evening cocktails, or simply relaxing outdoors with a good book while soaking in the quiet ambiance. Convenient Downtown Location The Artist Retreat is located in the East Historic District, a walkable area of downtown, just steps from local squares, caf\u00e9s, and parks. Forsyth Park is about a ten-minute stroll away, perfect for picnics, people-watching, or capturing picture-perfect moments. From Forsyth, you can hop on the free DOT trolley, which takes you throughout downtown and makes navigating the city effortless. Free street parking is available directly in front of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046202910016290843,"social_amenities":0.009365366771817207,"party_restriction":0.006090399343520403,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917170405387878}},{"text":"Welcome to The Artist Retreat, a stylish two-bedroom retreat in the heart of downtown Savannah. Blending historic charm with modern comfort, this thoughtfully designed home features queen canopy beds, a twin daybed, a cozy sitting room, and a private courtyard oasis. Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen, smart TV, washer/dryer, and secure keyless entry. Walk to Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, parks, shops, restaurants, and more! The space The Artist Retreat: A Stylish, Comfortable Stay in Downtown Savannah Welcome to The Artist Retreat, a bright and beautifully designed two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment located in a historic Victorian-style duplex in the heart of downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003876705013681203,"social_amenities":0.04761960729956627,"party_restriction":0.005211125127971172,"nearby_nightlife":0.019125426188111305}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"It\u2019s the perfect spot for enjoying morning coffee, al fresco meals, evening cocktails, or simply relaxing outdoors with a good book while soaking in the quiet ambiance. Convenient Downtown Location The Artist Retreat is located in the East Historic District, a walkable area of downtown, just steps from local squares, caf\u00e9s, and parks. Forsyth Park is about a ten-minute stroll away, perfect for picnics, people-watching, or capturing picture-perfect moments. From Forsyth, you can hop on the free DOT trolley, which takes you throughout downtown and makes navigating the city effortless. Free street parking is available directly in front of the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046202910016290843,"social_amenities":0.009365366771817207,"party_restriction":0.006090399343520403,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917170405387878}},{"text":"You can park your car and explore Savannah at your own pace, enjoying the tree-lined sidewalks, beautiful architecture, and vibrant local culture. Local boutiques, coffee shops, restaurants, and charming squares are all within a short walk from the apartment. Whitfield Square and Mother Matilda Beasley Park are nearby as well, offering additional green spaces to unwind. Modern Amenities for a Smooth Stay Keyless entry makes check-in simple and secure. The apartment includes a smart TV, a fully equipped kitchen, a washer and dryer, and a peaceful courtyard to enhance your stay. With plenty of space to relax and spread out, it\u2019s perfectly designed for both quick visits and longer stays.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020378027693368495,"social_amenities":0.005564990919083357,"party_restriction":0.0025690810289233923,"nearby_nightlife":0.8580002784729004}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1635001676138456323","title":"Southern Elegance in Savannah | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1635001676138456323","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-03176","SVR-03177"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1635001676138456323","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"52a762023d8453fcdbf7f62a555759678cfe1b6d02da5ce4a5f6ba423a3455d5","chunks":12,"words":1093,"party_signal":0.9862610697746277,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.9862610697746277,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9482187628746033,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Stay in a beautifully preserved Victorian-style home in Savannah\u2019s walkable East Historic District, offering four bedrooms, three full baths, two living rooms, and two full kitchens when both residences are reserved together. With four queen beds, two twin beds, and a charming shared courtyard, it\u2019s ideal for reunions, wedding weekends, and group getaways near Forsyth Park. The space The A