y_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Step outside to enjoy the charming courtyard tucked behind the building, shared with the other unit in this historic duplex. This inviting outdoor space features comfortable seating, a dining table with an umbrella, and lush greenery that creates a quiet escape from the energy of downtown. It\u2019s an ideal setting for sipping morning coffee, enjoying an al fresco meal, or unwinding in the evening beneath the Savannah sky. Modern Amenities for a Seamless Stay Keyless entry ensures a smooth and secure check-in process. The apartment includes a smart TV, a fully equipped kitchen, an in-unit washer and dryer, and access to the peaceful courtyard.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016043288633227348,"social_amenities":0.022956784814596176,"party_restriction":0.006121745798736811,"nearby_nightlife":0.04385003447532654}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Local caf\u00e9s, boutiques, restaurants, and historic squares are all just steps away, inviting you to experience Savannah at your own pace. Free street parking is available directly in front of the building, making arrival convenient and stress-free. Once you\u2019re settled in, you may find you rarely need your car at all. From its refined decor, to its exceptional walkable location, this downtown retreat offers a timeless and comfortable home base for your Savannah getaway. Whether you\u2019re here for a long weekend or an extended stay, you\u2019ll find everything you need for a memorable and relaxing experience. Guest access Occupancy: 4 Living Room: Comfortable seating and smart TV","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002389161236351356,"social_amenities":0.004249418620020151,"party_restriction":0.0025178364012390375,"nearby_nightlife":0.9824307560920715}},{"text":"Step outside to enjoy the charming courtyard tucked behind the building, shared with the other unit in t