581800818443,"party_welcome":0.00640089949592948,"social_amenities":0.1001749038696289,"party_restriction":0.998646080493927,"nearby_nightlife":0.975957453250885,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Inside you'll find: \u2022 Professionally curated artwork throughout the home \u2022 Spacious living areas designed for gathering and conversation \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen for extended stays \u2022 Beautiful historic details and high ceilings \u2022 Fast WiFi and Smart TVs \u2022 Premium bedding and linens \u2022 Designer lighting and furnishings \u2022 Private outdoor courtyard for morning coffee or evening cocktails Whether you're visiting Savannah for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, a wedding weekend, or a long-awaited friends trip, Salon d'Art offers a memorable setting unlike a typical vacation rental.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00640089949592948,"social_amenities":0.011522581800818443,"party_restriction":0.0009014725219458342,"nearby_nightlife":0.013855346478521824}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Coffee","section":"AMENITIES","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017859303625300527,"social_amenities":0.010574394837021828,"party_restriction":0.00016929594858083874,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012235682224854827}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Inside you'll find: \u2022 Professionally curated artwork throughout the home \u2022 Spacious living areas designed for gathering and conversation \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen for extended stays \u2022 Beautiful historic details and high ceilings \u2022 Fast WiFi and Smart TVs \u2022 Premium bedding and linens \u2022 Designer lighting and furnishings \u2022 Private outdoor courtyard for morning coffee or evening cocktails Whether you're visiting Savannah for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, a wedding weekend, or a long-awaited friends trip, Salon d'Art offers a memorable setting unlike a typical vacation rental.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00640089949592948,"social_amenities":0.011522581800818443,"party_restriction":0.0009014725219458342,"nearby_nightlife":0.013855346478521824}},{"text":"SVR-00711 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007158093503676355,"social_amenities":0.004275176674127579,"party_restriction":0.003745461581274867,"nearby_nightlife":0.008193251676857471}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to Salon d'Art, an art-filled historic Savannah retreat just blocks from Forsyth Park. Thoughtfully curated with bold original artwork, designer furnishings, soaring ceilings, and timeless architectural details, this elegant home blends historic charm with modern comfort. Walk to Savannah's best restaurants, coffee shops, squares, and attractions, then return to your private courtyard oasis for an evening under the moss-draped oaks. SVR-00711 The space Salon d'Art was designed for travelers who appreciate beautiful spaces and unforgettable experiences. Located on historic Price Street in Savannah's Landmark Historic District, this thoughtfully restored residence combines original architectural character with a carefully curated collection of artwork and furnishings that create a true gallery-like atmosphere.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004534529580269009,"social_amenities":0.1001749038696289,"party_restriction":0.0012541823089122772,"nearby_nightlife":0.9462769627571106}},{"text":"Inside you'll find: \u2022 Professionally curated artwork throughout the home \u2022 Spacious living areas designed for gathering and conversation \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen for extended stays \u2022 Beautiful historic details and high ceilings \u2022 Fast WiFi and Smart TVs \u2022 Premium bedding and linens \u2022 Designer lighting and furnishings \u2022 Private outdoor courtyard for morning coffee or evening cocktails Whether you're visiting Savannah for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, a wedding weekend, or a long-awaited friends trip, Salon d'Art offers a memorable setting unlike a typical vacation rental.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00640089949592948,"social_amenities":0.011522581800818443,"party_restriction":0.0009014725219458342,"nearby_nightlife":0.013855346478521824}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"After a day exploring the city, unwind with a glass of wine in the courtyard, admire the artwork throughout the home, or stroll through the surrounding historic neighborhood as the gas lanterns begin to glow. Other things to note \u2022 Self check-in for a seamless arrival experience \u2022 Professionally managed by South Key Management Co. \u2022 Starter supplies provided \u2022 Fast WiFi throughout the property \u2022 No pets permitted \u2022 No parties or events \u2022 Quiet hours observed in accordance with city regulations Please be very careful not to touch the artwork. If there are any accidents, please let us know right away so we can take care of it.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001523904938949272,"social_amenities":0.010253527201712132,"party_restriction":0.998646080493927,"nearby_nightlife":0.975957453250885}},{"text":"SVR-00711 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"sc