non-metered, which is a first come first serve basis. Typically, guests do not have trouble finding parking in this part of town. Guests are encouraged to keep note of the posted Sweep Zone signs. Sleeping Configuration: Loft: King Size Bed We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 50 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011666742648230866,"social_amenities":0.018276602029800415,"party_restriction":0.004826872143894434,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028054469730705023}},{"text":"Situated on a quiet residential street of the Historic District, this urban cottage offers eclectic furnishings, a lofted bedroom and a large courtyard. The space Looking for a getaway, but don't want to compromise location? This eclectic lofted cottage is situated off of a quiet residential street in the Historic District. Perfect for short or extended stays, Magnolia Cottage has it all! Enter your property via electronic lock, and forget the hassle of carrying keys! Your new home away from home may appear quaint from the outside, but stepping inside you'll be in for a surprise. The tall ceilings make this cozy getaway, feel large and airy.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001610886538401246,"social_amenities":0.010726992972195148,"party_restriction":0.0017794737359508872,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006172368302941322}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and off