 the home. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Bunk Bed (Full + Twin Bed) Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa SVR-02834 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001200934057123959,"social_amenities":0.000485513883177191,"party_restriction":0.000921616330742836,"nearby_nightlife":0.011313467286527157}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20033 03043","address":"520 E GASTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25304309051","date":"2025-10-31","type":"68 FOUND DRUGS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"520 E Gaston St","recorded_pin":"20033 03043","side":"direct"},{"number":"24112118037","date":"2024-04-21","type":"EXTREME FALL-D","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E Gaston St","recorded_pin":"20033 03044","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24222234505","date":"2024-08-09","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E Gaston St","recorded_pin":"20033 03044","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24222234530","date":"2024-08-09","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"522 E Gaston St","recorded_pin":"20033 03044","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"812218114864540366","title":"Townhome w/ Courtyard + Parking by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/812218114864540366","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00646"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20033 03046","address":"538 E GASTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":7.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26128132644","date":"2026-05-08","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"538 E GASTON ST","recorded_pin":"20033 03046","side":"direct"},{"number":"26128132653","date":"2026-05-08","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"538 E GASTON ST","recorded_pin":"20033 03046","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"17557502","title":"Soak up the Vintage Charm of a Sumptuous, Stylish Townhouse","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/17557502","guests":7.0,"permits":["SVR-00702"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"17557502","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"707959a7c65a92159cdc0a3baac1ac0cafcef3d2dddc6872ece42b63fa5e47e6","chunks":10,"words":967,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.27252766489982605,"party_welcome":0.04490199312567711,"social_amenities":0.27252766489982605,"party_restriction":0.08054003119468689,"nearby_nightlife":0.19664964079856873,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Blender Rice maker Trash compactor Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":133,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005229219677858055,"social_amenities":0.27252766489982605,"party_restriction":0.001677397289313376,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007530876318924129}},{"text":"Sink into the inky velvet sofa with a coffee at this elegant, spacious home with four original fireplaces (non-working), hardwood floors, white paneling, and intricate wainscoting. Lounge on the bedroom day bed off the master bedroom, or gather for dinner under the chandelier. This Historic District townhouse (Hostess Nest) built in 1899 also has a convenient downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and 2 Off-street parking spaces. Close to everything in downtown Savannah!! SVR00702 The space This is a unique floor plan with: A downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004669412970542908,"social_amenities":0.094708152115345,"party_restriction":0.0024712570011615753,"nearby_nightlife":0.017534857615828514}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Lastly, the master bedroom sitting (AKA a half bedroom) has an antique gray Indonesian Daybed with an architectural backrest and beautiful curved arms, perfect space for one additional guest. LIVING ROOM/DINING AREA Inside the living room, modern touches mixed with vintage charms provide every necessity for gathering and relaxation including a wall mounted 42\" smart TV. There is plenty of comfortable seating and fine d\u00e9cor. The full dining room is large enough to comfortably seat 7 people for a festive dinner and is located off the kitchen. KITCHEN The kitchen is truly a chef's dream with all new small appliances.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04490199312567711,"social_amenities":0.0010441114427521825,"party_restriction":0.0003999440814368427,"nearby_nightlife":0.005363278556615114}},{"text":"Everything is provided......coffeemaker, toaster, blender, kettle and the list goes on and on. We even provide the Tupperware for your yummy leftovers. You need to bring absolutely nothing but your food to this fully stocked kitchen. PRIVATE COURTYARD The fenced and private courtyard is a perfect spot with a table to seat 6; to enjoy with friends and family, dining, or just relaxing. LAUNDRY Need to wash clothes during your stay or right before heading home? That's covered too with the in-house laundry room with a washer and dryer. Iron and ironing board also provided for your convenience. Guest access Guest have access to the entire space in our house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.04307018220424652,"social_amenities":0.014547031372785568,"party_restriction":0.0006298690568655729,"nearby_nightlife":0.006708516739308834}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Blender Rice maker Trash compactor Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":133,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005229219677858055,"social_amenities":0.27252766489982605,"party_restriction":0.001677397289313376,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007530876318924129}},{"text":"Sink into the inky velvet sofa with a coffee at this elegant, spacious home with four original fireplaces (non-working), hardwood floors, white paneling, and intricate wainscoting. Lounge on the bedroom day bed off the master bedroom, or gather for dinner under the chandelier. This Historic District townhouse (Hostess Nest) built in 1899 also has a convenient downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and 2 Off-street parking spaces. Close to everything in downtown Savannah!! SVR00702 The space This is a unique floor plan with: A downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004669412970542908,"social_amenities":0.094708152115345,"party_restriction":0.0024712570011615753,"nearby_nightlife":0.017534857615828514}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Other things to note **Please be mindful of the City of Savannah Noise Ordinance. As you are staying in a residential area, we would like to remind you to observe neighborhood quiet times between the hours of 9PM \u2013 8AM. Remember that sound carries very well throughout Savannah, most especially in courtyards, porches and patios. Our next door neighbors are full time residents and we want to respect them. Please try to avoid a situation where your vacation is interrupted or cut short because of a noise compliant by the neighbors to the police** Our house was built in 1899, which makes it historic and unique in several ways.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011656712013063952,"social_amenities":0.00033327145501971245,"party_restriction":0.08054003119468689,"nearby_nightlife":0.19664964079856873}},{"text":"Sink into the inky velvet sofa with a coffee at this elegant, spacious home with four original fireplaces (non-working), hardwood floors, white paneling, and intricate wainscoting. Lounge on the bedroom day bed off the master bedroom, or gather for dinner under the chandelier. This Historic District townhouse (Hostess Nest) built in 1899 also has a convenient downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and 2 Off-street parking spaces. Close to everything in downtown Savannah!! SVR00702 The space This is a unique floor plan with: A downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004669412970542908,"social_amenities":0.094708152115345,"party_restriction":0.0024712570011615753,"nearby_nightlife":0.017534857615828514}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Other things to note **Please be mindful of the City of Savannah Noise Ordinance. As you are staying in a residential area, we would like to remind you to observe neighborhood quiet times between the hours of 9PM \u2013 8AM. Remember that sound carries very well throughout Savannah, most especially in courtyards, porches and patios. Our next door neighbors are full time residents and we want to respect them. Please try to avoid a situation where your vacation is interrupted or cut short because of a noise compliant by the neighbors to the police** Our house was built in 1899, which makes it historic and unique in several ways.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011656712013063952,"social_amenities":0.00033327145501971245,"party_restriction":0.08054003119468689,"nearby_nightlife":0.19664964079856873}},{"text":"Sink into the inky velvet sofa with a coffee at this elegant, spacious home with four original fireplaces (non-working), hardwood floors, white paneling, and intricate wainscoting. Lounge on the bedroom day bed off the master bedroom, or gather for dinner under the chandelier. This Historic District townhouse (Hostess Nest) built in 1899 also has a convenient downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and 2 Off-street parking spaces. Close to everything in downtown Savannah!! SVR00702 The space This is a unique floor plan with: A downstairs bedroom with an en-suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00466