ree street parking in front of the building. Please refer to the check-in guide on the app for more details. *Note: The home is in a building that houses other spaces and local residents, so we ask that the home is treated with dignity and respect at all times. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per city ordinance. Parties and events are strictly prohibited. Other things to note We ask that the space, other guests, and our neighbors are treated with dignity and respect. Please respect the home and its rules.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00041697139386087656,"social_amenities":0.06894522160291672,"party_restriction":0.9964689016342163,"nearby_nightlife":0.8351678252220154}},{"text":"Spa-Like Experience: Rejuvenate in the primary ensuite featuring dual shower heads and designer fixtures Outdoor Living: Sip morning coffee on the screened porch with a ceiling fan overlooking a tranquil garden courtyard Historic Meets Modern: Original 1900s hardwood floors beautifully refinished throughout Complete Kitchen: Fully equipped kitchen with quality appliances for culinary adventures Modern Necessities: Brand new heating and cooling system, new windows for perfect comfort Connected Stay: 50\" Smart TV in living area, Roku TV in primary bedroom, ultrafast 600 Mbps internet Convenient Comforts: New compact washer and dryer, easy street parking directly in front. Located in a quiet street that is \u201cwalkable\u201d to most downtown attractions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025983568048104644,"social_amenities":0.011340283788740635,"party_restriction":0.0009759136592037976,"nearby_nightlife":0.708625853061676}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Guests will have access to the house, the private porch, and the free street parking in front of the building. Please refer to the check-in guide on the app for more details. *Note: The home is in a building that houses other spaces and local res