s":[{"listing_id":"1637771740175437841","title":"Historic Cottage | Walk to Forsyth | King + Queen","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1637771740175437841","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03253"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1637771740175437841","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"18bb3b672a5921ac2a17d38f54fb8d8b88e6ab0f11b10e9e8eddac95bc74016d","chunks":8,"words":834,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.03369850665330887,"party_welcome":0.0011191043304279447,"social_amenities":0.03369850665330887,"party_restriction":0.013547370210289955,"nearby_nightlife":0.9291938543319702,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stay in the heart of Savannah at Honey Bee Cottage, a charming circa-1900 two-bedroom cottage just a 5-minute walk from Forsyth Park. With a king bedroom, queen bedroom, queen sofa bed, private fenced patio, and comfortable living spaces, it\u2019s an ideal home base for couples, friends, or a Savannah getaway with your pup. Walk to beautiful squares, restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and historic sights, then come home and relax in your own private cottage. The space \ud83d\udc1d Welcome to Honey Bee Cottage! After a day exploring Savannah\u2019s oak-lined streets, beautiful squares, restaurants, and historic homes, come back to your own private cottage and unwind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003995426231995225,"social_amenities":0.03369850665330887,"party_restriction":0.0008879624074324965,"nearby_nightlife":0.02485661208629608}},{"text":"Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011191043304279447,"social_amenities":0.01576821319758892,"party_restriction":0.0017022426472976804,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013473916333168745}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011191043304279447,"social_amenities":0.01576821319758892,"party_restriction":0.0017022426472976804,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013473916333168745}},{"text":"\u2615 Everything You Need The cottage includes the comforts that make a longer stay easy: \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher, microwave, coffee maker, cookware and essentials \u2022 Fast WiFi (up to 1 Gbps) + Smart TVs + workspace \u2022 Central A/C and heat \u2022 Washer & dryer \u2022 Beach towels and chairs for Tybee Island day trips \u2022 Pack \u2019n Play available upon request \u2022 Self check-in with a unique Smart Lock PIN provided before arrival A motion-activated exterior security camera is located on the front porch and faces the front entrance. STVR Permit: SVR-03253 Guest access You have the whole cottage to yourselves !","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007091545849107206,"social_amenities":0.005539697129279375,"party_restriction":0.0036498659756034613,"nearby_nightlife":0.004119380377233028}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay in the heart of Savannah at Honey Bee Cottage, a charming circa-1900 two-bedroom cottage just a 5-minute walk from Forsyth Park. With a king bedroom, queen bedroom, queen sofa bed, private fenced patio, and comfortable living spaces, it\u2019s an ideal home base for couples, friends, or a Savannah getaway with your pup. Walk to beautiful squares, restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and historic sights, then come home and relax in your own private cottage. The space \ud83d\udc1d Welcome to Honey Bee Cottage! After a day exploring Savannah\u2019s oak-lined streets, beautiful squares, restaurants, and historic homes, come back to your own private cottage and unwind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003995426231995225,"social_amenities":0.03369850665330887,"party_restriction":0.0008879624074324965,"nearby_nightlife":0.02485661208629608}},{"text":"Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":169,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011191043304279447,"social_amenities":0.01576821319758892,"party_restriction":0.0017022426472976804,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013473916333168745}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Single-story (2 steps up onto the porch) with private entrance. Smart Lock on front door with your own, personalized code for easy self check-in. Other things to note \ud83d\udcdd Good to Know \u2022 Starter supplies provided (toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher pods) \u2022 Pet fee: $75 (applied after booking) \u2022 Early check-in/late check-out available through the guest portal (fees apply) \u2022 No smoking ($100 fee for violations) \u2022 Street cleaning: Tuesdays 12:01am\u20134:00am\u2014simply move your car to the other side of the street ahead of time STVR Permit: SVR-03253 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020072225015610456,"social_amenities":0.0012964518973603845,"party_restriction":0.013547370210289955,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009157272288575768}},{"text":"\u2615 Everything You Need The cottage includes the comforts that make a longer stay easy: \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher, microwave, coffee maker, cookware and essentials \u2022 Fast WiFi (up to 1 Gbps) + Smart TVs + workspace \u2022 Central A/C and heat \u2022 Washer & dryer \u2022 Beach towels and chairs for Tybee Island day trips \u2022 Pack \u2019n Play available upon request \u2022 Self check-in with a unique Smart Lock PIN provided before arrival A motion-activated exterior security camera is located on the front porch and faces the front entrance. STVR Permit: SVR-03253 Guest access You have the whole cottage to yourselves !","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007091545849107206,"social_amenities":0.005539697129279375,"party_restriction":0.0036498659756034613,"nearby_nightlife":0.004119380377233028}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 Blackout shades in both bedrooms \u2022 Additional mirrors make getting ready easier when traveling together \ud83d\udccd Walk to Forsyth & Explore Savannah One of the best things about Honey Bee Cottage is its location. Forsyth Park is about a 5-minute walk away, with Savannah\u2019s famous squares, historic architecture, caf\u00e9s, restaurants, and attractions waiting beyond. With a Walk Score of 80 and Bike Score of 96, you can leave the car behind and experience much of Savannah on foot. \ud83d\ude97 Getting Around \u2022 Free street parking near the cottage \u2022 Free DOT downtown shuttle nearby \u2022 Complimentary electric transportation options within the Historic District","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019193958723917603,"social_amenities":0.0017085071885958314,"party_restriction":0.0008805185789242387,"nearby_nightlife":0.9291938543319702}},{"text":"Having a car is convenient for trips outside downtown, but you won't need one for much of your Savannah sightseeing. \ud83c\udf3f Your Private Patio Step outside to your private, fully fenced patio\u2014a quiet little spot for morning coffee, an afternoon break, or a glass of wine after exploring the city. \ud83d\udc3e Bringing Your Pup? Dogs are welcome at Honey Bee Cottage! The private fenced patio makes traveling with your pup a little easier, and Mother Mathilda Beasley Park\u2014with its dedicated dog park\u2014is just a short walk away. Forsyth Park is also about a 5-minute walk from the cottage, giving you plenty of options for getting outside and exploring Savannah together.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000183107826160267,"social_amenities":0.012988738715648651,"party_restriction":0.0014877382200211287,"nearby_nightlife":0.6460341215133667}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20033 09011","address":"619 E BROAD ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24351364847","date":"2024-12-16","type":"14-J HARASSMENT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"551 Nicoll St","recorded_pin":"20033 09002","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"697142177734555534","title":"Duckie\u2019s Cottage | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/697142177734555534","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02623"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"697142177734555534","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"923c11394052902d727715ef536a887c7ee088bd5aa57f30855974bf4b16bbab","chunks":17,"words":1619,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8903089165687561,"party_welcome":0.9292364716529846,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.003819625359028578,"nearby_nightlife":0.9971779584884644,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014758929319214076,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.0007141841924749315,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012725313426926732}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":209,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015844394220039248,"social_amenities":0.30805906653404236,"party_restriction":0.002064717235043645,"nearby_nightlife":0.000634422292932868}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Of course, you want to be by the river when it's time to find a great place to hear some live music. Head to River Street to enjoy the exceptional restaurants, bars, and jazz clubs that make up the city's waterfront area. This is also a great place to hop on a Savannah River ferry to take a trip from downtown's riverwalk to Hutchinson Island. For those who enjoy guided tours, Savannah is a top city. Guests can book trolley tours through the Savannah Historic District, after-dark cemetery tours, pub crawls, and more.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9292364716529846,"social_amenities":0.0045473286882042885,"party_restriction":0.003819625359028578,"nearby_nightlife":0.9971779584884644}},{"text":"While Savannah is fun every day of the year, the city becomes especially vibrant when festivals and events roll into town. The city constantly hosts food, music, and cultural festivals. The highlights include the Savannah Voice Festival, the Savannah Jazz Festival, the Savannah Greek Festival, the Savannah Film Festival, Christmas on the River, and more. Don't forget that Savannah is located just a short drive from beautiful Tybee Island! A premier beach destination, Tybee Island offers a number of exceptional beaches showing off the beauty of coastal Georgia.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7931015491485596,"social_amenities":0.00260368175804615,"party_restriction":0.0010298077249899507,"nearby_nightlife":0.9832668304443359}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014758929319214076,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.0007141841924749315,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012725313426926732}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":209,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015844394220039248,"social_amenities":0.30805906653404236,"party_restriction":0.002064717235043645,"nearby_nightlife":0.000634422292932868}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Of course, you want to be by the river when it's time to find a great place to hear some live music. Head to River Street to enjoy the exceptional restaurants, bars, and jazz clubs that make up the city's waterfront area. This is also a great place to hop on a Savannah River ferry to take a trip from downtown's riverwalk to Hutchinson Island. For those who enjoy guided tours, Savannah is a top city. Guests can book trolley tours through the Savannah Historic District, after-dark cemetery tours, pub crawls, and more.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9292364716529846,"social_amenities":0.0045473286882042885,"party_restriction":0.0038196253