829704,"party_restriction":0.004393306095153093,"nearby_nightlife":0.032079752534627914,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Oven Coffee maker Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002512775536160916,"social_amenities":0.05987320467829704,"party_restriction":0.0014009650330990553,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002722443896345794}},{"text":"The master bedroom has a King bed and en-suite bathroom with walk in tiled shower. Bedroom 2 has two Twin size beds Bedroom 3 has a Queen size bed. Those bedrooms share a full bathroom with combo tub/shoer, conveniently accessible to both bedrooms as it is located off the hallway. The living room has a Full size pullout sofa bed (linens provided). We also provide a pack-n-play (portable crib) and a booster high chair for those of you with a baby! Guest access This is a private rental. Respect your neighbors. There is no shared space, the entire house is yours. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010698188270907849,"social_amenities":0.011079211719334126,"party_restriction":0.004393306095153093,"nearby_nightlife":0.004488105420023203}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Newly constructed townhouse with a private reserved parking spot! This gorgeous house is steps from the major downtown grocery store, a few blocks from Forsyth Park and under a mile to the River. Your group will enjoy a gourmet high end kitchen stocked with everything you need to cook and eat at home. Professionally decorated with high end comfortable furnishings. City of Savannah SVR -00724 The space In addition to the gorgeous kitchen, this home has a nice dining table, private back courtyard, private full size laundry machines, beautiful modern bathrooms and designer furniture with local art throughout the home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.2657258212566376,"social_amenities":0.0027295853942632675,"party_restriction":0.0007206117734313011,"nearby_nightlife":0.006001877598464489}},{"text":"I wanted to mention that Savannah has certain bugs which we can control to some extent with poison (which every hotel and vacation rental will use on perimeters) but guests still can see them, even if they\u2019re slower and dying from walking across poison barriers. Specifically palmetto bugs are prolific here. If guests see one we do not issue any refunds due to seeing these. Events, holidays and stays during March & April may require 3 night minimums and/or have higher rates than the standard ones published. Please inquire to confirm a quote. This is a traditional vacation rental home, not a \u201cbed and breakfast\u201d.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007294472889043391,"social_amenities":0.0008273503626696765,"party_restriction":0.0033047033939510584,"nearby_nightlife":0.032079752534627914}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Oven Coffee maker Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002512775536160916,"social_amenities":0.05987320467829704,"party_restriction":0.0014009650330990553,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002722443896345794}},{"text":"The master bedroom has a King bed and en-suite bathroom with walk in tiled shower. Bedroom 2 has two Twin size beds Bedroom 3 has a Queen size bed. Those bedrooms share a full bathroom with combo 