cial_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Iron Entertainment Ethernet connection TV with standard cable Bowling alley Family Outlet covers Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003278142539784312,"social_amenities":0.018650947138667107,"party_restriction":0.0005067047895863652,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033574493136256933}},{"text":"Featuring gorgeous interior decor, an open floor plan for entertaining, high-end finishes throughout, all new kitchen with stainless steel appliances, and your very own private courtyard on the back of the home, Price Street Place will delight everyone in your group. The main living space is on the first floor of the home, where you'll find the living room, dining area, kitchen, laundry room, and a half bathroom. The living room offers a welcoming atmosphere that invites you all to sit down, relax, and enjoy an entertaining time with good company.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.42672044038772583,"social_amenities":0.002715078182518482,"party_restriction":0.00020170416973996907,"nearby_nightlife":0.017441323027014732}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Featuring gorgeous interior decor, an open floor plan for entertaining, high-end finishes throughout, all new kitchen with stainless steel appliances, and your very own private courtyard on the back of the home, Price Street Place will delight everyone in your group. The main living space is on the first floor of the home, where you'll find the living room, dining area, kitchen, laundry room, and a half bathroom. The living room offers a welcoming atmosphere that invites you all to sit down, relax, and enjoy an entertaining time with good company.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.42672044038772583,"social_amenities":0.002715078182518482,"party_restriction":0.00020170416973996907,"nearby_nightlife":0.017441323027014732}},{"text":"Located in Savannah's Landmark Historic District, Price Street Place is a newly built, professionally decorated townhome just 4 blocks from Forsyth Park. Featuring 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and an open floor plan, this custom home boasts high-end finishes, hardwood flooring, a new kitchen with stainless steel appliances, off-street parking for 1 vehicle, and a private courtyard perfect for morning coffee You will never want to leave this beautiful welcoming home! The space Treat your family to an unforgettable escapade to the heart of Savannah's Historic District at this newly built and professionally decorated townhouse!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002786479191854596,"social_amenities":0.0010948901763185859,"party_restriction":0.0005047829472459853,"nearby_nightlife":0.01963713951408863}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Iron Entertainment Ethernet connection TV with standard cable Bowling alley Family Outlet covers Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003278142539784312,"social_amenities":0.018650947138667107,"party_restriction":0.0005067047895863652,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033574493136256933}},{"text":"One of the guest bedrooms has a wall-mounted flatscreen TV\u2013each of the TVs in the home comes equipped with a Roku streaming device. What's nearby: This delight of a home is conveniently located in Savannah's Landmark Historic District and just four blocks away from beautiful Forsyth Park. This park is simply ideal for outdoor activities including picnics, outdoor sports, walking, jogging, playing tennis at the free tennis courts, and so much more! You can stock up on fresh groceries and goodies at the Forsyth Farmer\u2019s Market (one mile away). Located just two blocks away are a Kroger grocery store and Mate Factor, a great coffee shop, and bakery.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006370885530486703,"social_amenities":0.006013763137161732,"party_restriction":0.0006736115901730955,"nearby_nightlife":0.8703360557556152}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Free parking on premises Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003192854637745768,"social_amenities":0.0020984045695513487,"party_restriction":0.0014986549504101276,"nearby_nightlife":0.00036153921973891556}},{"text":"One of the guest bedrooms has a wall-mounted flatscreen TV\u2013each of the TVs in the home comes equipped with a Roku streaming device. What's nearby: This delight of a home is conveniently located in Savannah's Landmark Historic District and just four blocks away from beautiful Forsyth Park. This park is simply ideal for outdoor activities including picnics, outdoor sports, walking, jogging, playing tennis at the free tennis courts, and so much more! You can stock up on fresh groceries and goodies at the Forsyth Farmer\u2019s Market (one mile away). Located just two blocks away are a Kroger grocery store and Mate Factor, a great coffee shop, and bakery.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006370885530486703,"social_amenities":0.006013763137161732,"party_restriction":0.0006736115901730955,"nearby_nightlife":0.8703360557556152}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Beachgoers can make the 18-mile trip to Tybee Island, Savannah's beach. This is a great place for fishing, visiting Ft. Pulaski, or climbing Georgia's oldest and tallest lighthouse. Things to know: High-speed internet and free WiFi, perfect for working from home, distance learning, and streaming. STVR Permit: SVR-00854 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048211461398750544,"social_amenities":0.0012288532452657819,"party_restriction":0.0006240467191673815,"nearby_nightlife":0.9575883746147156}},{"text":"One of the guest bedrooms has a wall-mounted flatscreen TV\u2013each of the TVs in the home comes equipped with a Roku streaming device. What's nearby: This delight of a home is conveniently located in Savannah's Landmark Historic District and just four blocks away from beautiful Forsyth Park. This park is simply ideal for outdoor activities including picnics, outdoor sports, walking, jogging, playing tennis at the free tennis courts, and so much more! You can stock up on fresh groceries and goodies at the Forsyth Farmer\u2019s Market (one mile away). Located just two blocks away are a Kroger grocery store and Mate Factor, a great coffee shop, and bakery.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006370885530486703,"social_amenities":0.006013763137161732,"party_restriction":0.0006736115901730955,"nearby_nightlife":0.8703360557556152}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20043 02055","address":"722 PRICE ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":1,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24015014803","date":"2024-01-15","type":"25 PARKING COMPLAINT","outcome":"Parking complaints","recorded_address":"502 e gwinnett st","recorded_pin":"20043 02056","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1737118305896813493","title":"Darling 3BR | Patio | Washer/Dryer","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1737118305896813493","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02417"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1737118305896813493","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"a9f24fa074290aa44fd828e278dd41e8241ac0936693e06009b3183ce711664b","chunks":4,"words":282,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006369648966938257,"party_welcome":0.0027395409997552633,"social_amenities":0.4697102904319763,"party_restriction":0.0025731211062520742,"nearby_nightlife":0.9072125554084778,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Entertainment Ethernet connection TV with standard cable Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib High chair Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster L