s to access STVR Permit: SVR-02417 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044624326983466744,"social_amenities":0.4697102904319763,"party_restriction":0.0008817666093818843,"nearby_nightlife":0.9072125554084778}},{"text":"Savannah Price Place The space Conveniently located within a short drive of downtown Savannah, this beautiful, air conditioned vacation rental features high-end amenities and rich decor. Visiting chefs will find everything they need in the well-equipped, full kitchen complete with stainless steel appliances and plenty of countertop prep space to make meal prep a breeze. Dine together at the kitchen island with counter seating for three or at the adjacent table for four - ideal for dinners, laptops, or family game nights. The sunny living area invites you to take a seat on one of two sofas and stream your favorite channels on the TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0027395409997552633,"social_amenities":0.002698645694181323,"party_restriction":0.00047746888594701886,"nearby_nightlife":0.022639838978648186}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20043 06015","address":"502 E BOLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":12.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25173175365","date":"2025-06-22","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"502 E Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20043 06015","side":"direct"},{"number":"25359364123","date":"2025-12-25","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_a