striction":0.0008572519291192293,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009106650250032544}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The bright and airy kitchen is fully equipped with all the appliances, utensils and cookware you need to feel at home. \u2606\u2606 OUTSIDE SPACE \u2606\u2606 The exterior of this home boasts a charming upstairs private porch, complete with a dining area featuring a table and chairs\u2014perfect for savoring morning coffee or evening sweet tea and wine under beautiful lighting. On the lower level, the welcoming front porch offers rocking chairs and additional seating for guests to enjoy. \u2605\u2606 Book Today & Let Us Take Care of You In Savannah! \u2606\u2605","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017788216937333345,"social_amenities":0.0046843960881233215,"party_restriction":0.0007939783972688019,"nearby_nightlife":0.008753270842134953}},{"text":"First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure","section":"AMENITIES","line":197,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007599703385494649,"social_amenities":0.005708212498575449,"party_restriction":0.0008572519291192293,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009106650250032544}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"After a day of exploring the city's vibrant scene, guests can unwind on the inviting front porch, enjoy alfresco dining on the rear deck, or let their pets play in the fenced-in area. With its ideal mix of historic charm, modern amenities, and convenient location, the Victorian Manor offers a truly unique and memorable Savannah experience. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":152,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006092016701586545,"social_amenities":0.02068142220377922,"party_restriction":0.00041690797661431134,"nearby_nightlife":0.06674177944660187}},{"text":"First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure","section":"AMENITIES","line":197,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007599703385494649,"social_amenities":0.005708212498575449,"party_restriction":0.0008572519291192293,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009106650250032544}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We provide a starter pack of K-cups, trash bags, paper towels and toilet paper for your convenience. Parking is conveniently available on-street at no cost. Please pay close attention to the posted sweep zones and times as you may have to move your car at that specified date and time to avoid fines. Sweeping times and days are specific to the street you're parking on and can be found on red and white signs along the sidewalk. Primary renter must be 25 years old to rent and signer of agreement must stay on premises for entire booking. Smoke, carbon monoxide and gas detectors are present in the unit. SVR-03006","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":130,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.797840564511716e-05,"social_amenities":0.001224852167069912,"party_restriction":0.004006196744740009,"nearby_nightlife":0.003041759831830859}},{"text":"Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Housekeeping available from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM, Monday to Saturday - available at extra cost","section":"AMENITIES","line":236,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003216628101654351,"social_amenities":0.0011142466682940722,"party_restriction":0.001588067039847374,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004242091381456703}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Located just three blocks from the picturesque Forsyth Park, The Victorian Manor places you in the heart of Savannah's vibrant downtown. You'll be within walking distance of the city's best cafes, bars, and restaurants, making it easy to explore the local culinary scene. The free DOT trolley and easy access to Uber ensure you can conveniently explore all that Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here for a quick getaway or an extended stay, The Victorian Studio provides a perfect blend of comfort, style, and prime location, making it an ideal choice for families, couples, and solo travelers alike.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":126,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003798852558247745,"social_amenities":0.005080745555460453,"party_restriction":0.001216646982356906,"nearby_nightlife":0.961248517036438}},{"text":"Guest access Guests have a private access and will receive a key code prior to arrival to enter the home. This keycode is changed after every guest for your safety. Other things to note The Victorian Manor's prime location is a significant draw for guests. Being less than three blocks from Forsyth Park, visitors have easy access to one of Savannah's most iconic and picturesque spots. The surrounding Historic Landmark District is a treasure trove of cultural and historical attractions, charming boutiques, art galleries, and over 100 restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":148,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038536221836693585,"social_amenities":0.002662243088707328,"party_restriction":0.001369255012832582,"nearby_nightlife":0.9527758359909058}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20043 06043","address":"527 E GWINNETT ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26001000081","date":"2026-01-01","type":"31 LOCK-OUT/IN-RESD","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"527 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20043 06043","side":"direct"},{"number":"26148152704","date":"2026-05-28","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"527 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20043 06043","side":"direct"},{"number":"25145146787","date":"2025-05-25","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"529 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20043 06044","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25166168586","date":"2025-06-15","type":"42 PAST attempted THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"529 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20043 06044","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"707588","title":"Fantastic Downtown Condo With Shared Pool!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/707588","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00569"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"707588","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c34bc2614231dcc58a1217a3269a905e5f68e6a3fce9d2457dd54110491253da","chunks":7,"words":562,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.6012311577796936,"party_welcome":0.0013597069773823023,"social_amenities":0.6012311577796936,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885474443435669,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Shared BBQ grill: gas Sun loungers Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Private outdoor pool - available all year, open specific hours open from 9:00 AM to 10:00 PM Private hot tub Services Self check-in Keypad","section":"AMENITIES","line":108,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005412501050159335,"social_amenities":0.6012311577796936,"party_restriction":0.0006438770797103643,"nearby_nightlife":0.006093089934438467}},{"text":"Did we mention there is a pool? The pool is shared by 8 condos, so it is not 100% private. But , rarely is there more than 1 group of guests down there at a time. And EVERYBODY loves to come home from a beautiful day out in Savannah to relax in or by the pool! Nightly rates range from about $110 to $165. Rates vary based on seasons, special events, availability, holidays, and how interesting I find your inquiry;) Please message for exact quote! Guest access This is a fully private unit. All rooms and amenities within the unit, including laundry facilities, are not shared. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006019205320626497,"social_amenities":0.0469399020075798,"party_restriction":0.003852749476209283,"nearby_nightlife":0.019946835935115814}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Perfect \"live like a local\" spot. Four blocks from legendary Forsyth park, 2 blocks from the grocery store, and 3-4 blocks to restaurants, coffee shops, attractions, and all downtown Savannah has to offer. It's the perfect blend of history and modern style and convenience (granite counter tops and a 2 person jacuzzi tub in the bathroom). Super comfortable and cozy; you will get a true feeling of a Savannah home. Oh, did we mention there's a pool? Savannah License # - SVR-00569 The space This fantastic condo is in the perfect location in the Landmark Historic District of beautiful downtown Savannah, GA.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013597069773823023,"social_amenities":0.048188406974077225,"party_restriction":0.004245957359671593,"nearby_nightlife":0.9652503728866577}},{"text":"The unit features a large bedroom with a king size bed, large living area, fully equipped kitchen and luxury bathroom with a 2 person Jacuzzi hot tub garden bath and a tankless water heater. Ohhh-la la. This historic cottage, originally constructed in the late 1800's, has been eloquently renovated and furnished with modern conveniences and a contemporary feel. Walking distance to grocery, bars, fine dining, coffee shops,and world famous Forsyth Park make this an unbeatable location. A 20 minute walk to the shopping district through the heart of the historic city provides a complete Savannah experience. Also, a short 20 minute drive to Tybee Island for a beach day.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000811273988801986,"social_amenities":0.0028517814353108406,"party_restriction":0.0007159608649089932,"nearby_nightlife":0.9885474443435669}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee 