r memorable stay awaits! Savannah License # - SVR-03085 The space This cozy, poolside retreat is the perfect spot to slow down and savor Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012102943583158776,"social_amenities":0.9926952123641968,"party_restriction":0.26422950625419617,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019131627632305026}},{"text":"Enjoy a beautiful back porch overlooking the pool and evening sunsets\u2014the ideal place to start your day with coffee or end it with a glass of wine. Inside, you\u2019ll find updated TVs, a comfy Queen bed, and a thoughtfully arranged living space designed for comfort and relaxation. The kitchen features full-sized appliances, making it easy to cook meals at home or warm up leftovers from your favorite local restaurants. You\u2019ll also have one designated off-street parking space, making it simple to come and go during your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006285083945840597,"social_amenities":0.2866836488246918,"party_restriction":0.001016724854707718,"nearby_nightlife":0.10853949934244156}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re here to explore historic Savannah, relax by the water, or enjoy a quiet getaway, this space offers a warm and welcoming home base. Guest access Guests have access to entire unit and all amenities including semi-private pool, gas grill, and free off-street parking. Other things to note Search for Savannah Staycation to check out popular restaurants and current events in the neighborhood. Come and live like a local. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0023518316447734833,"social_amenities":0.07814601808786392,"party_restriction":0.0029653513338416815,"nearby_nightlife":0.9730028510093689}},{"text":"Enjoy a beautiful back porch overlooking the pool and evening sunsets\u2014the ideal place to start your day with coffee or end it with a glass of wine. Inside, you\u2019ll find up