573293203487992}},{"text":"Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard - Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm This place may not have a carbon monoxide detector. Reach out to the host with any questions.","section":"AMENITIES","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.811870793579146e-05,"social_amenities":0.09837397187948227,"party_restriction":0.0010391169926151633,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005062890704721212}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Best exotic Magnolia Inn is a beautiful Victorian townhouse that was separated into 2 apartments (duplex) years ago. This is the first floor apartment. The home features 12 foot ceilings, oversized windows, and front and back porches as well as access to a shared back yard. Charming details remain intact and we have enjoyed mixing antiques, vintage finds and modern pieces to make the home unique and inviting. Casper beds and lovely linens welcome you back from your days of touring. SVR 01515 Guest access The entire 3 bedroom unit is for your use with a private entrance and private back porch. The backyard is shared.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023514614440500736,"social_amenities":0.0005102990544401109,"party_restriction":0.0003286018327344209,"nearby_nightlife":0.003820314770564437}},{"text":"You will receive a welcome email 2 days before your arrival with the code for the front door and other detailed instructions. Parking is unassigned street parking but it is easy and ample. Other things to note Parking is currently on the street in front and side of the property. With the exception of St. Patrick\u2019s Day, parking is ample and easy! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004006309318356216,"social_amenities":0.0009017182164825499,"party_restriction":0.0014772338327020407,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015573293203487992}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20043 11016","address":"501 E BOLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":12.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25121121681","date":"2025-05-01","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"501 E Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20043 11016","side":"direct"},{"number":"25121121687","date":"2025-05-01","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"501 E Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20043 11016","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1365126484264080404","title":"Walk to Forsyth Park, Charming Downtown Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1365126484264080404","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02922"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1365126484264080404","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c12b8795b744c39cfda5c8b3e91c16a47b7956af7e71e86a5bd418f0adbf6425","chunks":8,"words":723,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9837775230407715,"party_welcome":0.0006745057180523872,"social_amenities":0.9837775230407715,"party_restriction":0.004930128343403339,"nearby_nightlife":0.8569899201393127,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Welcome to our 3 bedroom, 1.5 bathroom Victorian townhome in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District, where historic character meets a freshly renovated 1912 interior. \u2022 Front porch with rocking chairs and a rear shared patio with grill \u2022 Three themed bedrooms, four smart TVs, and a built-in bar area \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen with dining table for six \u2022 Less than three blocks from Forsyth Park Settle in, unwind, and enjoy a Savannah stay with plenty of charm and easy flow. The space Nestled in the heart of the Savannahs' Victorian District, this Victorian townhome offers a delightful blend of historic charm and modern amenities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035935427877120674,"social_amenities":0.9837775230407715,"party_restriction":0.003136842045933008,"nearby_nightlife":0.15447302162647247}},{"text":"Cozy, thoughtful design elements provide a welcoming ambiance, making each corner of the space feel like a true home away from home. The townhome's outdoor spaces are equally charming. The front porch, with its rocking chairs, invites you to relax and enjoy a glass of wine as you watch the world go by. At the back, the rear shared patio features a propane grill and a dining table for six, perfect for alfresco meals. Beyond the deck, a small fenced-in area provides a safe and convenient space to hang out.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00013345028855837882,"social_amenities":0.9347333908081055,"party_restriction":0.00025331618962809443,"nearby_nightlife":0.03819258138537407}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The surrounding Victorian District is a treasure trove of cultural and historical attractions, charming boutiques, art galleries, and over 100 restaurants. After a day of exploring the city's vibrant scene, guests can unwind on the inviting front porch, enjoy alfresco dining on the rear deck, or let their pets play in the fenced-in area. With its ideal mix of historic charm, modern amenities, and convenient location, The Hearth at Bolton Heritage offers a truly unique and memorable Savannah experience. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006745057180523872,"social_amenities":0.008934002369642258,"party_restriction":0.0007205904112197459,"nearby_nightlife":0.8569899201393127}},{"text":"Located less than three blocks from Forsyth Park, this duplex places you within easy reach of Savannah's most iconic attractions, making it an ideal home base for exploring the city's rich history and vibrant culture. SVR-02922 Guest access Guests have a private access and will receive a key code prior to arrival to enter the home. This keycode is changed after every guest for your safety. Other things to note The townhomes prime location is a significant draw for guests. Being less than three blocks from Forsyth Park, visitors have easy access to one of Savannah's most iconic and picturesque spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004574048798531294,"social_amenities":0.11479047685861588,"party_restriction":0.004930128343403339,"nearby_nightlife":0.00775129534304142}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to our 3 bedroom, 1.5 bathroom Victorian townhome in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District, where historic character meets a freshly renovated 1912 interior. \u2022 Front porch with rocking chairs and a rear shared patio with grill \u2022 Three themed bedrooms, four smart TVs, and a built-in bar area \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen with dining table for six \u2022 Less than three blocks from Forsyth Park Settle in, unwind, and enjoy a Savannah stay with plenty of charm and easy flow. The space Nestled in the heart of the Savannahs' Victorian District, this Victorian townhome offers a delightful blend of historic charm and modern amenities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003593542