ure 14-inch memory foam mattresses with soft and firm pillows for personalized comfort. \ud83d\udec1 Luxurious Master Suite \u2013 Located on the third floor, this private retreat boasts an ensuite bathroom, a private balcony, and a projector for movie nights. \ud83d\ude97 2 Off-Street Parking Spots + EV Charger \u2013 A rare find in downtown Savannah!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.003915973007678986,"social_amenities":0.0027592673432081938,"party_restriction":0.0004105059488210827,"nearby_nightlife":0.18373064696788788}},{"text":"Bring your electric vehicle and park with ease. \ud83d\uded2 Walkable to Everything \u2013 Stroll or Uber to Savannah\u2019s best dining, shopping, and nightlife. Kroger grocery store is just two blocks away. \ud83d\udccd Unbeatable Location: \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Walk or Uber anywhere downtown \u2013 Enjoy easy access to historic landmarks, River Street, Forsyth Park, and more. \ud83d\udd39Additional Details: - There are two other Airbnb listings and a long-term tenant on-site. Those other spaces are not included in this listing. Feel free to inquire about booking for larger groups. - \ud83d\udeab No pets or parties allowed to maintain a peaceful environment for all guests. Come experience the charm, comfort, and convenience of downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004214806540403515,"social_amenities":0.0012346968287602067,"party_restriction":0.9977582693099976,"nearby_nightlife":0.9924593567848206}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Book your stay today! \u2728 Guest access Guests will have full access to apartment \"A\" in the duplex, shared access to the backyard and patio, and a full driveway for two cars, equipped with EV charger. *Note: The apartment is in a property that houses other guests, so we ask that the space and neighboring property are treated with dignity and respect at all times. Please keep noise to a minimum between 8pm and 8am as per cit