ightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"Enjoy First Class living on the First Floor. This first floor garden apartment was recently completely redesigned by a local architect. This home sleeps up to 4 people with the use of the queen size murphy bed in the living room. The space Located on the first floor of a historic home, Hall & Oaks has been redesigned and lovingly renovated by a local Savannah architect. A ton of style has been packed into this one-bedroom, one-bath garden apartment on East Hall Street, which can sleep up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003991455596406013,"social_amenities":0.005348717328161001,"party_restriction":0.0014376176986843348,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030583590269088745}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Enjoy First Class living on the First Floor. This first floor garden apartment was recently completely redesigned by a local architect. This home sleeps up to 4 people with the use of the queen size murphy bed in the living room. The space Located on the first floor of a historic home, Hall & Oaks has been redesigned and lovingly renovated by a local Savannah architect. A ton of style has been packed into this one-bedroom, one-bath garden apartment on East Hall Street, which can sleep up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003991455596406013,"social_amenities":0.005348717328161001,"party_restriction":0.0014376176986843348,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030583590269088745}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}},{"text":"Enjoy First Class living on the First Floor. This first floor garden apartment was recently completely redesigned by a local architect. This home sleeps up to 4 people with the use of the queen size murphy bed in the living room. The space Located on the first floor of a historic home, Hall & Oaks has been redesigned and lovingly renovated by a local Savannah architect. A ton of style has been packed into this one-bedroom, one-bath garden apartment on East Hall Street, which can sleep up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003991455596406013,"social_amenities":0.005348717328161001,"party_restriction":0.0014376176986843348,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030583590269088745}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}},{"text":"Enjoy First Class living on the First Floor. This first floor garden apartment was recently completely redesigned by a local architect. This home sleeps up to 4 people with the use of the queen size murphy bed in the living room. The space Located on the first floor of a historic home, Hall & Oaks has been redesigned and lovingly renovated by a local Savannah architect. A ton of style has been packed into this one-bedroom, one-bath garden apartment on East Hall Street, which can sleep up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003991455596406013,"social_amenities":0.005348717328161001,"party_restriction":0.0014376176986843348,"nearby_nightlife":0.0030583590269088745}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The bright and cozy queen-size bedroom is anchored by a rich wood sleigh bed and dresser, and the adjacent bathroom has a large walk-in tile shower with rain shower head. You\u2019ll be just across the street from Kroger, the only full grocery store in the Historic District, but close enough to all of Savannah\u2019s dining options to never need to cook! The area adjacent to Forsyth Park offers a charming array of restaurants within walking distance - from fine dining at Saint Bibiana or Local 11ten to casual fare at Collins Quarter at Forsyth or Alexander's Bistro. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028441566973924637,"social_amenities":0.0032271130476146936,"party_restriction":0.000832576712127775,"nearby_nightlife":0.7405011057853699}},{"text":"The spacious kitchen space is a chef\u2019s dream, complete with stainless steel appliances and exposed brick and reclaimed wood walls. Enjoy coffee at the breakfast bar or a glass of wine while cooking dinner. You\u2019ll have everything you need to prepare a home cooked meal. The reclaimed wood wall continues into the living room, which has an inlaid beam ceiling, and sleek, mid-century furnishings. Relax on the large sectional sofa in front of the wall-mounted flat screen TV. The living area also features a writing desk, upright piano, and queen-size Murphy bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002915962541010231,"social_amenities":0.00232481537386775,"party_restriction":0.0002716081799007952,"nearby_nightlife":0.00948710273951292}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 02008","address":"304 E HALL ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24044044842","date":"2024-02-13","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"304 E Hall St","recorded_pin":"20044 02008","side":"direct"},{"number":"24165174838","date":"2024-06-13","type":"57 MISSING PERSON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"308 E Hall St","recorded_pin":"20044 02007","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1508069926591180947","title":"Renovated + Perfect for Groups, Near Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1508069926591180947","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-03033","SVR-03034","SVR-03035"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1508069926591180947","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"bdd554d7f5f6bc57ac0cea61b3f2de1621c8579fff618b38dcf5b46002828b07","chunks":5,"words":503,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.04136579856276512,"party_welcome":0.022080939263105392,"social_amenities":0.04136579856276512,"party_restriction":0.0026420156937092543,"nearby_nightlife":0.39413899183273315,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Welcome to Secret Savannah Collection \u2013 a combination of three separate units creating a 4BR/3BA home, perfect for large groups, families, and likeminded travelers. The space Welcome 