ion":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022080939263105392,"social_amenities":0.04136579856276512,"party_restriction":0.0026420156937092543,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028366593178361654}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Indoor fireplace Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004295614780858159,"social_amenities":0.003804244799539447,"party_restriction":0.0003874458489008248,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009239289211109281}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Welcome to Secret Savannah Collection \u2013 a combination of three separate units creating a 4BR/3BA home, perfect for large groups, families, and likeminded travelers. The space Welcome to Secret Savannah Collection \u2013 a combination of three separate units (that do not internally connect) creating a 4BR/3BA home, perfect for large groups, families, and likeminded travelers. The property is made up of three unique spaces all on the same grounds: Unit A, a spacious 2BR/1BA; Unit B directly next door, a cozy 1BR/1BA; and Unit C, the carriage house just steps away, another private 1BR/1BA. What makes this home special?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.022080939263105392,"social_amenities":0.04136579856276512,"party_restriction":0.0026420156937092543,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028366593178361654}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re meandering through historic squares or basking in the sea breeze, Secret Savannah Collection is the perfect home base for your Savannah adventure! Sleeping Configuration: Unit A (2BR/1BA): Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Unit B (1BR/1BA): Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Unit C (1BR/1BA) - Carriage House: Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Parking: Non-metered Parking This unit has free, on-street parking right outside the front door. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Our guests have not reported trouble parking near the home, even on the busiest of weekends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000276069447863847,"social_amenities":0.0033709625713527203,"party_restriction":0.0008051410550251603,"nearby_nightlife":0.06430338323116302}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Convenient split living: You\u2019ll find a cozy living spaces, Smart TV's throughout each unit, and an eat-in kitchen in all three spaces; a delight for home cooks! Each kitchen features black stainless-steel appliances, granite countertops, and everything you need to prepare meals with ease. Walkable location: Step outside and immerse yourself in the rich history and vibrant culture of Savannah\u2019s South Historic District. Wander cobblestone streets shaded by moss-draped oaks, explore Forsyth Park, or tour iconic landmarks like the Mercer-Williams House Museum. For a change of scenery, Tybee Island\u2019s sandy beaches and coastal charm are just a short drive away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021837695385329425,"social_amenities":0.003179827006533742,"party_restriction":0.0005451170727610588,"nearby_nightlife":0.39413899183273315}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re meandering through historic squares or basking in the sea breeze, Secret Savannah Collection is the perfect home base for your Savannah adventure! Sleeping Configuration: Unit A (2BR/1BA): Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Unit B (1BR/1BA): Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Unit C (1BR/1BA) - Carriage House: Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Parking: Non-metered Parking This unit has free, on-street parking right outside the front door. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Our guests have not reported trouble parking near the home, even on the busiest of weekends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000276069447863847,"social_amenities":0.0033709625713527203,"party_restriction":0.0008051410550251603,"nearby_nightlife":0.06430338323116302}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1508070882394361503","title":"Modern Pet-friendly Escape Steps to Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1508070882394361503","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03033"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1508070882394361503","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1a486c982c04db0714cca28fae91a69157386672be8b2cd1f2fe3c990b2cb79a","chunks":5,"words":506,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004871950950473547,"party_welcome":0.04310848191380501,"social_amenities":0.9910264611244202,"party_restriction":0.9835792183876038,"nearby_nightlife":0.45145076513290405,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The eat-in kitchen is a delight for home cooks, featuring black stainless-steel appliances, granite countertops, and everything you need to prepare meals with ease. Enjoy the convenience of a shared washer and dryer available on site during your stay. Walkable location: Step outside and immerse yourself in the rich history and vibrant culture of Savannah\u2019s South Historic District. Wander cobblestone streets shaded by moss-draped oaks, explore Forsyth Park, or tour iconic landmarks like the Mercer-Williams House Museum. For a change of scenery, Tybee Island\u2019s sandy beaches and coastal charm are just a short drive away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003163093060720712,"social_amenities":0.004871950950473547,"party_restriction":0.0012850832426920533