,"guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02340","SVR-02341"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1625424725869483000","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c2910bd45400cc75b0a6aa1fc0863db8b2375851cf577a95c2fabd7f1c4e5d20","chunks":6,"words":490,"party_signal":0.9762868285179138,"social_signal":0.8435035943984985,"party_welcome":0.9762868285179138,"social_amenities":0.8435035943984985,"party_restriction":0.0012580683687701821,"nearby_nightlife":0.026912003755569458,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Experience Historic Savannah just steps from Forsyth Park at this spacious duplex retreat perfect for families, wedding groups, and friends. Combining both upper and lower units, it sleeps up to 8 with 2 full kitchens, multiple living areas, and private ensuite bedrooms. Walk to oak-lined squares, top restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and boutiques from picturesque Lincoln Street. SVR-02340 + SVR-02341 The space This combined listing includes both the upper and lower residences, thoughtfully arranged for larger groups who want to stay together while still enjoying the comfort of separate living spaces. Upper Residence \u2014 Bright, Airy, and Spacious","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9762868285179138,"social_amenities":0.8435035943984985,"party_restriction":0.0008125981548801064,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018674664897844195},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Experience Historic Savannah just steps from Forsyth Park at this spacious duplex retreat perfect for families, wedding groups, and friends."},{"text":"The upstairs level serves as the heart of Hunter\u2019s Knoll, featuring abundant natural light throughout, enhanced by large windows that create an open, airy atmosphere across the main living areas. The spacious modern kitchen is beautifully designed with updated finishes, generous counter space, and full appliances \u2014 perfect for preparing group meals or gathering over coffee before exploring Savannah. The expansive living and dining areas feel bright and welcoming throughout the day, making this level ideal for relaxing, entertaining, and spending time together. Two comfortable bedrooms one king and one queen, each with private ensuite bathrooms, provide privacy while maintaining the home\u2019s bright and elevated feel.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":44,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014972207136452198,"social_amenities":0.0011885416461154819,"party_restriction":0.00018141047621611506,"nearby_nightlife":0.004217522218823433},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The spacious modern kitchen is beautifully designed with updated finishes, generous counter space, and full appliances \u2014 perfect for preparing group meals or gathering over coffee before exploring Savannah."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience Historic Savannah just steps from Forsyth Park at this spacious duplex retreat perfect for families, wedding groups, and friends. Combining both upper and lower units, it sleeps up to 8 with 2 full kitchens, multiple living areas, and private ensuite bedrooms. Walk to oak-lined squares, top restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and boutiques from picturesque Lincoln Street. SVR-02340 + SVR-02341 The space This combined listing includes both the upper and lower residences, thoughtfully arranged for larger groups who want to stay together while still enjoying the comfort of separate living spaces. Upper Residence \u2014 Bright, Airy, and Spacious","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9762868285179138,"social_amenities":0.8435035943984985,"party_restriction":0.0008125981548801064,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018674664897844195}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan 