d dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection 55 inch HDTV with Roku Books and reading material Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026336783776059747,"social_amenities":0.008677462115883827,"party_restriction":0.0005879889358766377,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011814136523753405}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The large Roku tv's are on stands in every room to allow more tasteful art on the walls. The mattresses are gel foam and are extremely comfortable with hi thread count luxury bedding. the towels are exotic, silver-infused, cotton meant to be hung and reused. The large kitchen includes a large dining area with 6 thickly-upholstered chairs and an inlaid mid century modern formal dining table. The kitchen and dining area are bright and well stocked. It overlooks a large private heavily planted patio deck with a small fountain. Walk out your front door and there are gorgeous mansions in all directions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010490587446838617,"social_amenities":0.006018068175762892,"party_restriction":0.0010828246595337987,"nearby_nightlife":0.08257289230823517}},{"text":"In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Whirlpool galleria refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Electric stove Kitchen aid with convection speed feature for faster more even baking. oven Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Beach access Guests can enjoy a nearby beach Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048221158795058727,"social_amenities":0.06208791956305504,"party_restriction":0.0015699369832873344,"nearby_nightlife":0.0036432663910090923}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Whirlpool galleria refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Electric stove Kitchen aid with convection speed feature for faster more even baking. oven Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Beach access Guests can enjoy a nearby beach Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048221158795058727,"social_amenities":0.06208791956305504,"party_restriction":0.0015699369832873344,"nearby_nightlife":0.0036432663910090923}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Ginger Lilly farms shampoo Ginger Lilly farms conditioner Ginger Lilly farms body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton Some high count cotton and very luxurious high count microfiber linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection 55 inch HDTV with Roku Books and reading material Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026336783776059747,"social_amenities":0.008677462115883827,"party_restriction":0.0005879889358766377,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011814136523753405}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The \"Silk-n-art\" refers to my collection of silk wall hangings and fine art. This large 2 story apartment is in the best part of the historic district, quieter, softer, more gentile like the nearby mansions. Besides 2 king bedrooms each with private skylit baths, there is a private flex room with a gel foam sofa pull-out bed downstairs that can be used as an office or a bedroom. There\u2019s also a couch in the LR. Read more in \"The Space\". SVR-02556 The space The rooms are graciously proportioned, the ceilings tall, and the wood floors elegant.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001779404847184196,"social_amenities":0.004344010725617409,"party_restriction":0.0023922270629554987,"nearby_nightlife":0.001405332237482071}},{"text":"Forsyth Park is just two blocks west with some of the best architected mansions along the way! A unique coffee shop is one block to the east, and a Kroger's is one block south. Walk north from Forsyth Park along Bull St. with its amazing shops and restaurant and you are led to River St, the oldest tourist hot spot. walk to River street Guest access You have access to everything. Other things to note One dog but zero cats are allowed and only if their nails are ground recently to protect the walnut and oak floors. $95 dollar pet fee.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020941933325957507,"social_amenities":0.004056040663272142,"party_restriction":0.0020611921790987253,"nearby_nightlife":0.637155294418335}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Forsyth Park is just two blocks west with some of the best architected mansions along the way! A unique coffee shop is one block to the east, and a Kroger's is one block south. Walk north from Forsyth Park along Bull St. with its amazing shops and restaurant and you are led to River St, the oldest tourist hot spot. walk to River street Guest access You have access to everything. Other things to note One dog but zero cats are allowed and only if their nails are ground recently to protect the walnut and oak floors. $95 dollar pet fee.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020941933325957507,"social_amenities":0.004056040663272142,"party_restriction":0.0020611921790987253,"nearby_nightlife":0.637155294418335}},{"text":"The large Roku tv's are on stands in every room to allow more tasteful art on the walls. The mattresses are gel foam and are extremely comfortable with hi thread count luxury bedding. the towels are exotic, silver-infused, cotton meant to be hung and reused. The large kitchen includes a large dining area with 6 thickly-upholstered chairs and an inlaid mid century modern formal dining table. The kitchen and dining area are bright and well stocked. It overlooks a large private heavily planted patio deck with a small fountain. Walk out your front door and there are gorgeous mansions in all directions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010490587446838617,"social_amenities":0.006018068175762892,"party_restriction":0.0010828246595337987,"nearby_nightlife":0.08257289230823517}}]}}},{"listing_id":"607067216547013939","title":"Forsyth Elegant Garden Apt (free parking)","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/607067216547013939","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02555"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"607067216547013939","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c912f0372dae86afd5e2aef94f727b2c14299425103217f69645b2dbe2ce5c9c","chunks":5,"words":426,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.008956389501690865,"party_welcome":0.0005640797899104655,"social_amenities":0.008956389501690865,"party_restriction":0.0020590100903064013,"nearby_nightlife":0.0050056371837854385,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Quality shampoo Quality conditioner Quality body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Egyptian cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet and closet Entertainment Ethernet connection 55 inch HDTV with Roku Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a common space Pocket wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals","section":"AMENITIES","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003290940076112747,"social_amenities":0.008956389501690865,"party_restriction":0.0005015296046622097,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004056261677760631}},{"text":"The bedroom opens into a private patio garden, is oversized with brilliant hand knotted oriental carpeting, private full bath with travertine stone floor and hand carved decorative panels. Security camera outside by front door. Guest access Extra towels are in the antique small cabinet to the right of the bedroom glass door and extra linens are in the closet by front door. Please reuse towels like you would at home. Other things to note Equipped with High speed wireless internet and amazing Roku 4K TVs. Both the king size bed in the bedroom and the pull out sofa bed has the newest high-end self-cooling mattresses which are extremely comfortable!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003691640740726143,"social_amenities":0.006927154026925564,"party_restriction":0.0005351032596081495,"nearby_nightlife":0.003653857856988907}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Frigidaire refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and p