d floors, a huge bathroom with shower, and an amazing designer kitchen. The space Nothing says Southern Comfort like enjoying the evening air with a glass of sweet tea on your front porch. Just a few blocks from Forsyth Park, this pet friendly home has everything you\u2019ll need for a weekend getaway or longer, extended stay. This beautifully updated 1 bedroom home has a comfortable back porch, and all the amenities you need for a short stay or an extended vacation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003925661148969084,"social_amenities":0.014184524305164814,"party_restriction":0.002544192597270012,"nearby_nightlife":0.005207250826060772}},{"text":"This home features original hardwood floors, a huge bathroom with shower, and an amazing designer kitchen. The large, modern living room has two French doors that let in plenty of natural light, and lead to the front porch. Decorated with local art, the large flat-screen TV is set upon an easel and can be seen from anywhere in the room. Pocket doors lead into the eat-in kitchen. The large island and stainless steel appliances make cooking a pleasure. Enjoy a quick meal at the breakfast bar or an intimate dinner at your private table for two.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005145224276930094,"social_amenities":0.003278969321399927,"party_restriction":0.0005027031293138862,"nearby_nightlife":0.004551747813820839}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This home features original hardwood floors, a huge bathroom with shower, and an amazing designer kitchen. The large, modern living room has two French doors that let in plenty of natural light, and lead to the front porch. Decorated with local art, the large flat-screen TV is set upon an easel and can be seen from anywhere in the room. Pocket doors lead into the eat-in kitchen. The large island and stainless steel appliances make cooking a pleasure. Enjoy a quick meal at the breakfast bar or an intimate