2544192597270012,"nearby_nightlife":0.005207250826060772}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Just off the kitchen is the renovated full bath, which has a large vanity and a shower with a built-in seat. The King bed is perfect for curling up in after a long day of exploring Savannah. The large closet provides plenty of space to unpack and settle in, and includes the convenience of a stackable washer and dryer. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - Our favorite local package store (Johnnie Ganem\u2019s), national grocer (Kroger\u2019s), and local caffeine spot (Mate Factor Cafe) are all within a 1 block walk.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003176625759806484,"social_amenities":0.0009240095969289541,"party_restriction":0.0008277619490399957,"nearby_nightlife":0.4032105505466461}},{"text":"This beautifully updated 1 bedroom home has a comfortable back porch, and all the amenities you need for a short stay or an extended vacation. This home features original hardwood floors, a huge bathroom with shower, and an amazing designer kitchen. The space Nothing says Southern Comfort like enjoying the evening air with a glass of sweet tea on your front porch. Just a few blocks from Forsyth Park, this pet friendly home has everything you\u2019ll need for a weekend getaway or longer, extended stay. This beautifully updated 1 bedroom home has a comfortable back porch, and all the amenities you need for a short stay or an extended vacation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003925661148969084,"social_amenities":0.014184524305164814,"party_restriction":0.002544192597270012,"nearby_nightlife":0.005207250826060772}}]}}},{"listing_id":"32915224","title":"Renovated Bohemian Retreat by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/32915224","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01812"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"32915224","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7be86