,"line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.937779107829556e-05,"social_amenities":0.0008762225043028593,"party_restriction":0.0005190633819438517,"nearby_nightlife":0.0027249243576079607}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 08021","address":"410 E GWINNETT ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24027027848","date":"2024-01-27","type":"45 Property DAMAGE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"410 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20044 08021","side":"direct"},{"number":"25089088505","date":"2025-03-30","type":"22 LOST PROPERTY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"410 E GWINNETT ST","recorded_pin":"20044 08021","side":"direct"},{"number":"25136138363","date":"2025-05-16","type":"68 FOUND DRUGS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"410 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20044 08021","side":"direct"},{"number":"26216224221","date":"2026-08-04","type":"24 UNWANTED SUSP in area","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"410 E Gwinnett St","recorded_pin":"20044 08021","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1187788470019404644","title":"Cozy Garden Apartment | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1187788470019404644","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02926"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1187788470019404644","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3da70682b3ea7dc0d4ef63c359f2f38ee4179ada442b9599fb1300ee41e6732a","chunks":14,"words":1390,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.8142626285552979,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002474867971614003,"nearby_nightlife":0.9957822561264038,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Seating for four guests under a dazzling chandelier creates a romantic mood every evening. Connected to the dining area is the modern kitchen. Indeed, this kitchen includes the essentials, such as plates, silverware, pots and pans. Also, use the major appliances for grand meals or snacks. The property includes a refrigerator, stove, oven, microwave, dishwasher and coffee maker. Bring your own groceries to start cooking. For added convenience, the kitchen is also home to a laundry washer and dryer. Fitting snugly beneath the kitchen countertop, these appliances also complement the included iron and ironing board. Simply access these accessories in the nearby storage closet. Relaxing With the Outdoor Amenities","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001201220671646297,"social_amenities":0.11074776947498322,"party_restriction":0.00031774499802850187,"nearby_nightlife":0.006045307498425245}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Venture a bit further to the Savannah River. Referred to as River Street, this promenade is home to many shops and restaurants. Pick up a Southern souvenir here as you look out on the boats dotting the river. Depending on the month, different festivals are held along this route. From brew fests to Halloween carnivals, River Street is a hub for both tourists and locals alike. Because you have access to our heated pool on Tybee Island, consider a day to explore this region. Referred to as Savannah's beach, Tybee Island has a laid-back style. Typically, visitors enjoy the beach, explore the pier and experience the nightlife.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8142626285552979,"social_amenities":0.004054507706314325,"party_restriction":0.0004714122915174812,"nearby_nightlife":0.9957822561264038}},{"text":"Consider seeing some of the museums in the region, such as the Mercer Williams House Museum or Savannah History Museum. Fascinating walking tours are also available, too. For example, discover Savannah's architecture during a day tour or experience a ghost tour during a twilight walk. An old-fashioned experience involves Savannah's famous horse-drawn carriages. Perfect for an early-evening ride, take a carriage around the nearby parks and historic homes. Because of the romance behind these carriages, the experience matches nicely with your Savannah vacation itinerary. If you have a special occasion, make an advanced reservation. These rides are popular and can be booked up rapidly.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03584979847073555,"social_amenities":0.0013404187047854066,"party_restriction":0.002474867971614003,"nearby_nightlife":0.2645796537399292}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Seating for four guests under a dazzling chandelier creates a romantic mood every evening. Connected to the dining area is the modern kitchen. Indeed, this kitchen includes the essentials, such as plates, silverware, pots and pans. Also, use the major appliances for grand meals or snacks. The property includes a refrigerator, stove, oven, microwave, dishwasher and coffee maker. Bring your own groceries to start cooking. For added convenience, the kitchen is also home to a laundry washer and dryer. Fitting snugly beneath the kitchen countertop, these appliances also complement the included iron and ironing board. Simply access these accessories in the nearby storage closet. Relaxing With the Outdoor Amenities","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001201220671646297,"social_amenities":0.11074776947498322,"party_restriction":0.00031774499802850187,"nearby_nightlife":0.006045307498425245}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Consider seeing some of the museums in the region, such as the Mercer Williams House Museum or Savannah History Museum. Fascinating walking tours are also available, too. For example, discover Savannah's architecture during a day tour or experience a ghost tour during a twilight walk. An old-fashioned experience involves Savannah's famous horse-drawn carriages. Perfect for an early-evening ride, take a carriage around the nearby parks and historic homes. Because of the romance behind these carriages, the experience matches nicely with your Savannah vacation itinerary. If you have a special occasion, make an advanced reservation. These rides are popular and can be booked up rapidly.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03584979847073555,"social_amenities":0.0013404187047854066,"party_restriction":0.002474867971614003,"nearby_nightlife":0.2645796537399292}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":161,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002843967522494495,"social_amenities":0.001816928619518876,"party_restriction":0.0023524248972535133,"nearby_nightlife":0.014345955103635788}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Venture a bit further to the Savannah River. Referred to as River Street, this promenade is home to many shops and restaurants. Pick up a Southern souvenir here as you look out on the boats dotting the river. Depending on the month, different festivals are held along this route. From brew fests to Halloween carnivals, River Street is a hub for both tourists and locals alike. Because you have access to our heated pool on Tybee Island, consider a day to explore this region. Referred to as Savannah's beach, Tybee Island has a laid-back style. Typically, visitors enjoy the beach, explore the pier and experience the nightlife.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8142626285552979,"social_amenities":0.004054507706314325,"party_restriction":0.0004714122915174812,"nearby_nightlife":0.9957822561264038}},{"text":"Located at 19 Silver Avenue, Tybee Island, Georgia, a resort-style pool with lounge chairs and an outdoor grill are available to all guests. Because it's exclusively reserved for our guests, there's plenty of space to spread out. Bring your personal items, and enjoy a day by the pool as the oversized umbrellas provide a shady contrast to the sunny deck. Venturing Into the City and Beyond Located in the Victorian District East, Maisonette La Belle is near some of the top landmarks in Downtown Savannah, such as Forsyth Park. Indeed, simply walking to the area's shops, restaurants and coffee shops is possible.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000511143880430609,"social_amenities":0.0023443298414349556,"party_restriction":0.0006537061999551952,"nearby_nightlife":0.9884001016616821}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 08024","address":"409 E HALL ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24163172690","date":"2024-06-11","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"411 E Hall St","recorded_pin":"20044 08025","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26139142807","date":"2026-05-19","type":"69 SUSPICIOUS vehicle","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"411 E Hall St","recorded_pin":"20044 08025","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1708137853181800785","title":"Historic Escape | Forsyth Park, Courtyard, Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1708137853181800785","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01657"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1708137853181800785","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"817711968e73fcb6eb24969260c059275ffc618be008db79578162900fd57d6e","chunks":14,"words":1273,"party_signal":0.1487675905227661,"social_signal":0.09679199010133743,"party_welcome":0.9922822117805481,"social_amenities":0.8923118114471436,"party_restriction":0.9912024736404419,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933142066001892,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"\u2022 Savannah Convention Center \u2022 Memorial Health Why Guests Love The Hall House \u2022 Historic Savannah residence built in 1892 \u2022 Walkable location near Forsyth Park \u2022 Original heart pine floors \u2022 Soaring ceilings and oversized rooms \u2022 Elegant chandeliers and decorative fireplaces \u2022 Two king bedroom suites \u2022 Spacious living and dining areas \u2022 Historic porches and shared courtyard \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen \u2022 Professionally managed by Verdant House Whether you\u2019re exploring Savannah\u2019s historic streets, celebrating a special occasion, attending a wedding, or simply looking for a relaxing retreat, The Hall House offers the perfect blend of historic character, comfort, and location.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1487675905227661,"social_amenities":0.004924587439745665,"party_restriction":0.000704805483110249,"nearby_nightlife":0.014311905018985271},"affirmative_event_evidence":"\u2022 Savannah Convention Center \u2022 Memorial Health Why Guests Love The Hall House \u2022 Historic Savannah residence built in 1892 \u2022 Walkable location near Forsyth Park \u2022 Original heart pine floors \u2022 Soaring ceilings and oversized rooms \u2022 Elegant chandeliers and decorative fireplaces \u2022 Two king bedroom suites \u2022 Spacious living and dining areas \u2022 Historic porches and shared courtyard \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen \u2022 Professionally managed by Verdant House Whether you\u2019re exploring Savannah\u2019s historic streets, celebrating a special occasion, attending a wedding, or simply looking for a relaxing retreat, The Hall House offers the perfect blend of historic character, comfort, and location."},{"text":"Originally built in 1892, The Hall House showcases the charm and craftsmanship that make Savannah\u2019s historic homes so special. Tall ceilings, oversized rooms, original heart pine floors, decorative fireplaces, and beautiful architectural details create a sense of space and character rarely found in modern accommodations. The elegant living and dining room serves as the heart of the home, featuring comfortable seating, a decorative fireplace, a large Smart TV, and a formal dining area perfect for gathering after a day exploring the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020576811220962554,"social_amenities":0.000457538990303874,"party_restriction":0.0005885043647140265,"nearby_nightlife":0.004176155664026737},"affirmative_event_evidence":"The elegant living and dining room serves as the heart of the home, featuring comfortable seating, a decorative fireplace, a large Smart TV, and a formal dining area perfect for gathering after a day exploring the city."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"One of the highlights of The Hall House is its inviting outdoor spaces. Enjoy your morning coffee on the historic covered porch, relax beneath Savannah\u2019s mature shade trees, or gather with friends and family in the shared courtyard and garden seating areas. These outdoor spaces offer the perfect place to unwind after a day of sightseeing. Traveling With a Larger Group? The Hall House is part of a beautifully restored historic property featuring two separate residences. If you\u2019re traveling with a larger group, wedding party, family reunion, or special event, ask us about reserving both residences together.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9922822117805481,"social_amenities":0.09679199010133743,"party_restriction":0.002578799845650792,"nearby_nightlife":0.3238608241081238}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: walk-in closet, closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Indoor fireplace Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":187,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000252693600486964,"social_amenities":0.013174373656511307,"party_restriction":0.0002151938242604956,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018906324403360486}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"One of the highlights of The Hall House is its inviting outdoor spaces. Enjoy your morning coffee on the historic covered porch, relax beneath Savannah\u2019s mature shade trees, or gather with friends and family in the shared courtyard and garden seating areas. These outdoor spaces offer the perfect place to unwind after a day of sightseeing. Traveling With a Larger Group? The Hall House is part of a beautifully restored historic property featuring two separate residences. If you\u2019re traveling with a larger group, wedding party, family reunion, or special event, ask us about reserving both residences together.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9922822117805481,"social_amenities":0.09679199010133743,"party_restriction":0.002578799845650792,"nearby_nightlife":0.3238608241081238}},{"text":"This spacious first-floor residence blends timeless architectural character with modern comfort, offering soaring ceilings, original heart pine floors, decorative fireplaces, elegant chandeliers, and gracious rooms designed for gathering and relaxation. Whether you\u2019re visiting Savannah for a weekend getaway, wedding celebration, family vacation, or extended stay, The Hall House offers an authentic experience in one of the city\u2019s most beloved historic neighborhoods. Located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, you\u2019ll be within easy walking distance of Forsyth Park, acclaimed restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, galleries, and many of the city\u2019s most iconic squares and landmarks. The Space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6499407291412354,"social_amenities":0.03861284628510475,"party_restriction":0.0012842444702982903,"nearby_nightlife":0.7830544114112854}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay in a beautifully preserved 1892 Victorian landmark just 3 blocks from Forsyth Park. This home blends historic Savannah charm with modern comfort, featuring two king bedrooms, a queen sleeper sofa, spacious living areas, original architectural details, and a fully equipped kitchen. Relax on the front porch swing, unwind in the shared courtyard, and enjoy the convenience of private off-street parking, high-speed Wi-Fi, and a walkable location near Savannah\u2019s best dining and attractions. The space The Hall House | Walk to Forsyth Park Welcome to The Hall House, a beautifully preserved historic Savannah residence just steps from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004698956327047199,"social_amenities":0.8923118114471436,"party_restriction":0.012384835630655289,"nearby_nightlife":0.7313244938850403}},{"text":"One of the highlights of The Hall House is its inviting outdoor spaces. Enjoy your morning coffee on the historic covered porch, relax beneath Savannah\u2019s mature shade trees, or gather with friends and family in the shared courtyard and garden seating areas. These outdoor spaces offer the perfect place to unwind after a day of sightseeing. Traveling With a Larger Group? The Hall House is part of a beautifully restored historic property featuring two separate residences. If you\u2019re traveling with a larger group, wedding party, family reunion, or special event, ask us about reserving both residences together.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":96,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9922822117805481,"social_amenities":0.09679199010133743,"party_restriction":0.002578799845650792,"nearby_nightlife":0.3238608241081238}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Detailed arrival instructions, property information, and local recommendations will be available through the Verdant House Guest Portal prior to your arrival. \u2022 Traveling with a larger group? The Hall House consists of two separate residences that may be reserved together, subject to availability. Please contact us for details. \u2022 No pets, parties, events, or smoking are permitted on the property. SVR Permit #: SVR-01657 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":177,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023492002219427377,"social_amenities":0.001347123528830707,"party_restriction":0.9912024736404419,"nearby_nightlife":0.49308428168296814}},{"text":"Stay in a beautifully preserved 1892 Victorian landmark just 3 blocks from Forsyth Park. This home blends historic Savannah charm with modern comfort, featuring two king bedrooms, a queen sleeper sofa, spacious living areas, original architectural details, and a fully equipped kitchen. Relax on the front porch swing, unwind in the shared courtyard, and enjoy the convenience of private off-street parking, high-speed Wi-Fi, and a walkable location near Savannah\u2019s best dining and attractions. The space The Hall House | Walk to Forsyth Park Welcome to The Hall House, a beautifully preserved historic Savannah residence just steps from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004698956327047199,"social_amenities":0.8923118114471436,"party_restriction":0.012384835630655289,"nearby_nightlife":0.7313244938850403}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"When combined, The Hall House can accommodate significantly larger groups while still providing the comfort and privacy of separate living spaces. Please contact us for availability and details regarding booking the full property. Walkable Savannah Location The Hall House enjoys an exceptional location near Forsyth Park and the vibrant southern end of Savannah\u2019s Historic District. Walk to: \u2022 Forsyth Park \u2022 Collins Quarter at Forsyth \u2022 Local coffee shops and bakeries \u2022 Restaurants and cocktail bars \u2022 Historic squares and landmarks \u2022 Boutique shopping and galleries A short drive or rideshare will take you to: \u2022 River Street \u2022 City Market \u2022 SCAD campuses \u2022 Enmarket Arena","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":104,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020861171651631594,"social_amenities":0.0018266296247020364,"party_restriction":0.0008381910156458616,"nearby_nightlife":0.9933142066001892}},{"text":"This spacious first-floor residence blends timeless architectural character with modern comfort, offering soaring ceilings, original heart pine floors, decorative fireplaces, elegant chandeliers, and gracious rooms designed for gathering and relaxation. Whether you\u2019re visiting Savannah for a weekend getaway, wedding celebration, family vacation, or extended stay, The Hall House offers an authentic experience in one of the city\u2019s most beloved historic neighborhoods. Located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s Historic District, you\u2019ll be within easy walking distance of Forsyth Park, acclaimed restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, galleries, and many of the city\u2019s most iconic squares and landmarks. The Space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6499407291412354,"social_amenities":0.03861284628510475,"party_restriction":0.0012842444702982903,"nearby_nightlife":0.7830544114112854}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1708204827084809078","title":"Historic Retreat | Forsyth Park, Balcony, Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1708204827084809078","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01658"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1708204827084809078","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b63b7d4adcddaac55a146b3039fdd67265d933152e2ee090d57aa8731f17f57d","chunks":15,"words":1423,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.10133054852485657,"party_welcome":0.9816358089447021,"social_amenities":0.7352543473243713,"party_restriction":0.9902916550636292,"nearby_nightlife":0.9921625256538391,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"\u2022 Spacious Closet Guest Bedroom: \u2022 King Bed \u2022 Smart TV \u2022 Decorative Fireplace \u2022 Spacious Closet Additional Sleeping: \u2022 Queen Sleeper Sofa Both bedrooms enjoy access to a private side balcony, creating a peaceful retreat for morning coffee or evening relaxation. Bathrooms: \u2022 One Full Bathroom \u2022 One Half Bathroom Outdoor Living: One of the most unique features of the Balcony Residence is its collection of outdoor spaces. Enjoy meals and drinks on the private front balcony overlooking historic Hall Street, relax on the private rear balcony accessed from the bedrooms, or gather in the shared courtyard below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026045276899822056,"social_amenities":0.10133054852485657,"party_restriction":0.00035954584018327296,"nearby_nightlife":0.05406591668725014}},{"text":"Adjacent to the living room, the formal dining room provides an inviting setting for shared meals, conversation, and memorable evenings together. The fully equipped kitchen includes everything needed to prepare meals during your stay, whether you're enjoying breakfast before a day of sightseeing or dinner with family and friends. Just beyond the kitchen, step onto the private front balcony overlooking picturesque Hall Street. Furnished with outdoor dining and lounge seating, it's the perfect place to enjoy Savannah's beautiful weather while watching the neighborhood come to life beneath the shade of mature crepe myrtles and magnolias. Sleeping Arrangements: Primary Bedroom: \u2022 King Bed \u2022 Smart TV \u2022 Decorative Fireplace","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.15469197928905487,"social_amenities":0.0657251849770546,"party_restriction":0.0007798192673362792,"nearby_nightlife":0.12907378375530243}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you're visiting Savannah for a long weekend, wedding celebration, family vacation, or extended stay, The Hall House offers the perfect blend of historic character, comfort, and location. We look forward to welcoming you to The Hall House and helping you experience the very best of Savannah. SVR Permit #: SVR-01658 Guest access Guests will have private access to the entire second-floor Balcony Residence at The Hall House, including: \u2022 Two king bedrooms \u2022 One full bathroom and one half bathroom \u2022 Living room \u2022 Dining room \u2022 Fully equipped kitchen \u2022 Private front balcony overlooking historic Hall Street \u2022 Private rear balcony accessible from the bedrooms","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9816358089447021,"social_amenities":0.002736638532951474,"party_restriction":0.0011913332855328918,"nearby_nightlife":0.0071426876820623875}},{"text":"\u2022 One dedicated off-street parking space Guests may also enjoy shared access to the property\u2019s beautifully landscaped courtyard, outdoor dining areas, and gas grill. Please note that The Hall House consists of two separate residences. The first-floor Garden Residence may be occupied by other guests during your stay. Each residence has its own private entrance and separate living spaces, while the courtyard is shared. Traveling with a larger group? The first-floor Garden Residence may also be available to rent, allowing family members, friends, or wedding guests to stay together while still enjoying the privacy of separate residences. Please contact us for availability and details.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":163,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1937071681022644,"social_amenities":0.010697426274418831,"party_restriction":0.000662371632643044,"nearby_nightlife":0.005391030106693506}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay in a beautifully preserved 1892 Historic Landmark just three blocks from Forsyth Park. This spacious second-floor residence features two king bedrooms, a queen sleeper sofa, private parking, high-speed Wi-Fi, and timeless Savannah character throughout. Enjoy morning coffee from the upper porches overlooking Hall Street\u2019s tree-lined canopy, then explore nearby restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and historic landmarks\u2014all within one of Savannah\u2019s most walkable and desirable neighborhoods. The space The Hall House | Balcony Residence Welcome to The Hall House | Balcony Residence, a beautifully preserved second-floor residence in an 1892 Historic Landmark just three blocks from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006085638306103647,"social_amenities":0.7352543473243713,"party_restriction":0.01137524750083685,"nearby_nightlife":0.9191078543663025}},{"text":"\u2022 Spacious Closet Guest Bedroom: \u2022 King Bed \u2022 Smart TV \u2022 Decorative Fireplace \u2022 Spacious Closet Additional Sleeping: \u2022 Queen Sleeper Sofa Both bedrooms enjoy access to a private side balcony, creating a peaceful retreat for morning coffee or evening relaxation. Bathrooms: \u2022 One Full Bathroom \u2022 One Half Bathroom Outdoor Living: One of the most unique features of the Balcony Residence is its collection of outdoor spaces. Enjoy meals and drinks on the private front balcony overlooking historic Hall Street, relax on the private rear balcony accessed from the bedrooms, or gather in the shared courtyard below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026045276899822056,"social_amenities":0.10133054852485657,"party_restriction":0.00035954584018327296,"nearby_nightlife":0.05406591668725014}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Prior to arrival, guests will receive access to the Verdant House Guest Portal, which contains arrival instructions, property information, local recommendations, and important details about your stay. \u2022 Traveling with a larger group? The Garden Residence located on the first floor may also be available to rent, allowing larger families, wedding parties, and group travelers to enjoy the entire property while maintaining the privacy of separate residences. \u2022 No pets, parties, events, or smoking are permitted on the property. SVR Permit #: SVR-01658 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":186,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003415948594920337,"social_amenities":0.0017408261774107814,"party_restriction":0.9902916550636292,"nearby_nightlife":0.03297607973217964}},{"text":"Stay in a beautifully preserved 1892 Historic Landmark just three blocks from Forsyth Park. This spacious second-floor residence features two king bedrooms, a queen sleeper sofa, private parking, high-speed Wi-Fi, and timeless Savannah character throughout. Enjoy morning coffee from the upper porches overlooking Hall Street\u2019s tree-lined canopy, then explore nearby restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and historic landmarks\u2014all within one of Savannah\u2019s most walkable and desirable neighborhoods. The space The Hall House | Balcony Residence Welcome to The Hall House | Balcony Residence, a beautifully preserved second-floor residence in an 1892 Historic Landmark just three blocks from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores"