c 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":145,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":238,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009686171542853117,"social_amenities":0.17442888021469116,"party_restriction":0.001650297432206571,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006353356293402612}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitmarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":145,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018294451292604208,"social_amenities":0.7801691889762878,"party_restriction":0.020301291719079018,"nearby_nightlife":0.004068357869982719}},{"text":"Have it all! The Southern Elegance Estate is a beautiful historic 4 bedroom home and 1 bedroom carriage house located in the Savannah Historic District. It has it\u2019s own private courtyard with pool, outdoor fireplace and is close to renowned Forsyth Park. It has been professionally updated, designed and decorated and has everything you need to make your stay in Savannah one to remember. The space Southern Elegance Estate; Spacious & Fabulous Have it all! The Southern Elegance Estate is a beautiful historic 4 bedroom home and 1 bedroom carriage house located in the Savannah Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001359185902401805,"social_amenities":0.12714631855487823,"party_restriction":0.004370388109236956,"nearby_nightlife":0.0022177882492542267}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"If you're feeling more adventurous, you can also take a charter out on the Atlantic either for fishing or for dolphin-watching. Choose Southern Belle vacation rentals Savannah GA to upgrade your stay and get more out of this Jewel of the South. We have an extensive selection of beautiful Savannah vacation rentals, so you're sure to find the perfect property for your vacation plans. Guest access Private Saltwater pool Beautiful courtyard with outdoor seating Gas grill Outdoor fireplace Offstreet parking for 2 car in garage Free Wifi Steps to Forsyth Park, Kroger, restaurants and shopping Main House: Gourmet kitchen Dining room with seating for 10 Flatscreen TV's throughout the home","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":75,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00047606011503376067,"social_amenities":0.0024402993731200695,"party_restriction":0.0009088845108635724,"nearby_nightlife":0.8809664845466614}},{"text":"If you're looking for that picture-perfect Deep South photo with mossy oaks draped over a beautiful, sun-dappled lane, this is the place to get it. The Wormsloe Historic Site also hosts various events with reenactors throughout the year as well as guided tours. Another popular trip for guests staying at our Savannah vacation rentals is Tybee Island. The island is an excellent choice for a day trip as it can easily be explored in one day. The main sightseeing spots include the Tybee Island Lighthouse, the Marine Science Center and the beaches.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045210207463242114,"social_amenities":0.0026913683395832777,"party_restriction":0.0011442868271842599,"nearby_nightlife":0.19827552139759064}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 10009","address":"820 BARNARD ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24130137554","date":"2024-05-09","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24185196101","date":"2024-07-03","type":"15H RESIDENTIAL HOLDUP","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24258270495","date":"2024-09-14","type":"15H RESIDENTIAL HOLDUP","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25191193819","date":"2025-07-10","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25348352695","date":"2025-12-14","type":"22 NON-URGENT request","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25356361395","date":"2025-12-22","type":"SMALL BRUSH OR WILDLAND FIRE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1103555706426970821","title":"Beauty on Barnard, Luxury | History | Near Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1103555706426970821","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02825"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1103555706426970821","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"0cc38f04a72fe07e4dbf320d82629a82f5a607b355e3c1e1a675608d735b8909","chunks":8,"words":655,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.032681893557310104,"party_welcome":0.0015665516257286072,"social_amenities":0.032681893557310104,"party_restriction":0.9985775947570801,"nearby_nightlife":0.972214937210083,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Fully equipped with all the essentials for culinary adventures, this kitchen becomes a hub for socializing and meal preparation, with ample prep space and barstools for four. Continuing through another cased opening, the formal dining room awaits, exuding an air of grandeur with its moody green walls, gallery art, and a stunning chandelier. Step outside from the dining room onto the spacious screened-in patio or the private secluded patio with a grill, offering serene spaces for relaxation and alfresco dining. Ascending the long staircase to the second floor, three luxurious suites await, each designed for ultimate comfort and tranquility.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015665516257286072,"social_amenities":0.032681893557310104,"party_restriction":0.00039207993540912867,"nearby_nightlife":0.013138570822775364}},{"text":"Nestled within a historical gem dating back to 1880, that was once owned by one of the area's most renowned distillers this two-story townhome epitomizes timeless elegance, seamlessly blending modern luxuries with its rich heritage. As you enter the gracious foyer, the inviting living room welcomes you with brand-new sofas and reading chairs bathed in natural light pouring through oversized bay windows. Every detail exudes sophistication, from the elegant crown molding to the original hardwood flooring, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Flowing effortlessly through the large, cased opening, you'll discover the gourmet chef's kitchen, adorned with a granite waterfall island, gold accents, and a commercial-grade gas stove.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001528292486909777,"social_amenities":0.002425289247184992,"party_restriction":0.00037846973282285035,"nearby_nightlife":0.0019132675370201468}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Fully equipped with all the essentials for culinary adventures, this kitchen becomes a hub for socializing and meal preparation, with ample prep space and barstools for four. Continuing through another cased opening, the formal dining room awaits, exuding an air of grandeur with its moody green walls, gallery art, and a stunning chandelier. Step outside from the dining room onto the spacious screened-in patio or the private secluded patio with a grill, offering serene spaces for relaxation and alfresco dining. Ascending the long staircase to the second floor, three luxurious suites await, each designed for ultimate comfort and tranquility.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015665516257286072,"social_amenities":0.032681893557310104,"party_restriction":0.00039207993540912867,"nearby_nightlife":0.013138570822775364}},{"text":"Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":112,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038527901051566005,"social_amenities":0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Fully equipped with all the essentials for culinary adventures, this kitchen becomes a hub for socializing and meal preparation, with ample prep space and barstools for four. Continuing through another cased opening, the formal dining room awaits, exuding an air of grandeur with its moody green walls, gallery art, and a stunning chandelier. Step outside from the dining room onto the spacious screened-in patio or the private secluded patio with a grill, offering serene spaces for relaxation and alfresco dining. Ascending the long staircase to the second floor, three luxurious suites await, each designed for ultimate comfort and tranquility.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015665516257286072,"social_amenities":0.032681893557310104,"party_restriction":0.00039207993540912867,"nearby_nightlife":0.013138570822775364}},{"text":"Welcome to Beauty on Barnard, a lavish corner-lot townhome mere steps from Forsyth Park in Savannah's vibrant heart. Enjoy a stunning fusion of classical elegance and modern comfort with three bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms, and luxurious amenities for up to six guests. Beautiful d\u00e9cor and fresh finishes elevate your stay while downtown's culinary delights, libations, and attractions await beyond your doorstep. Unwind in style at The Barnard, where luxury meets convenience. SVR-02825 The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026668247301131487,"social_amenities":0.02690569870173931,"party_restriction":0.0015658552292734385,"nearby_nightlife":0.972214937210083}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Every detail has been thoughtfully curated to ensure a luxurious stay, with fully equipped bathrooms with essentials for your convenience. Indulge in the epitome of luxury and charm at this historic townhome, where every moment is infused with elegance and grace. Guest access Everything is set up for your use :) Please be courteous of the full-time resident neighborhood and keep outside noises down from 10PM - 8AM but of course feel free to enjoy the upper balcony as well as the screened-in porch (perfect for summer nights, mosquito-free! Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001948791032191366,"social_amenities":0.0036672300193458796,"party_restriction":0.9985775947570801,"nearby_nightlife":0.83571457862854}},{"text":"No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the home with respect, as if it was your property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":5.782365769846365e-05,"social_amenities":0.0010565510019659996,"party_restriction":0.153697207570076,"nearby_nightlife":0.006857660133391619}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to Beauty on Barnard, a lavish corner-lot townhome mere steps from Forsyth Park in Savannah's vibrant heart. Enjoy a stunning fusion of classical elegance and modern comfort with three bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms, and luxurious amenities for up to six guests. Beautiful d\u00e9cor and fresh finishes elevate your stay while downtown's culinary delights, libations, and attractions await beyond your doorstep. Unwind in style at The Barnard, where luxury meets convenience. SVR-02825 The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026668247301131487,"social_amenities":0.02690569870173931,"party_restriction":0.0015658552292734385,"nearby_nightlife":0.972214937210083}},{"text":"Every detail has been thoughtfully curated to ens