","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25348352695","date":"2025-12-14","type":"22 NON-URGENT request","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25356361395","date":"2025-12-22","type":"SMALL BRUSH OR WILDLAND FIRE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"116 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20044 10003","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"43079945","title":"Ros\u00e9 All Day -- The Pinkest Home In Savannah!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/43079945","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02119"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"43079945","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1dce857e6c370b815c8672495e24c4436a78f647b52ff6f7a5bd65a2a43baefb","chunks":9,"words":814,"party_signal":0.994446873664856,"social_signal":0.006880221888422966,"party_welcome":0.994446873664856,"social_amenities":0.31526023149490356,"party_restriction":0.004832601174712181,"nearby_nightlife":0.9942008852958679,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re visiting for a girls\u2019 getaway, a Savannah weekend, a celebration, or just because you deserve a little more pink in your life, Ros\u00e9 All Day is ready to welcome you. Grab your favorite people, pour a glass, and stay awhile! \ud83c\udf77\ud83d\udc95 Guest access The entire first floor is yours! The spacious floor plan includes two bedrooms, living space, full bathroom, and complete kitchen. Other things to note City of Savannah hotel tax is included in your nightly rate. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994446873664856,"social_amenities":0.004131036810576916,"party_restriction":0.0010237098904326558,"nearby_nightlife":0.09504880756139755},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Whether you\u2019re visiting for a girls\u2019 getaway, a Savannah weekend, a celebration, or just because you deserve a little more pink in your life, Ros\u00e9 All Day is ready to welcome you."},{"text":"From the historic details of our 1885 Victorian to playful pops of pink throughout, this is a Savannah stay with plenty of personality. \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f ROOM TO RELAX The primary bedroom features a plush pink velvet king bed and a fabulous makeup vanity\u2014perfect for getting ready before brunch, a night out, or a Savannah celebration! The second bedroom has another comfy king bed, plus a twin bed with a twin trundle tucked underneath, giving your group plenty of room to spread out. \ud83e\udd42 MADE FOR GOOD TIMES","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.4370805621147156,"social_amenities":0.0027796716894954443,"party_restriction":0.00017295869474764913,"nearby_nightlife":0.03808533772826195},"affirmative_event_evidence":"\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f ROOM TO RELAX The primary bedroom features a plush pink velvet king bed and a fabulous makeup vanity\u2014perfect for getting ready before brunch, a night out, or a Savannah celebration!"}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Board games Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have a ring doorbell camera to monitor the front porch and street. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 51 Mbps Verified by speed test.","section":"AMENITIES","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001569965825183317,"social_amenities":0.006880221888422966,"party_restriction":0.000470926781417802,"nearby_nightlife":0.002681328682228923}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re visiting for a girls\u2019 getaway, a Savannah weekend, a celebration, or just because you deserve a little more pink in your life, Ros\u00e9 All Day is ready to welcome you. Grab your favorite people, pour a glass, and stay awhile! \ud83c\udf77\ud83d\udc95 Guest access The entire first floor is yours! The spacious floor plan includes two bedrooms, living space, full bathroom, and complete kitchen. Other things to note City of Savannah hotel tax is included in your nightly rate. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994446873664856,"social_amenities":0.004131036810576916,"party_restriction":0.0010237098904326558,"nearby_nightlife":0.09504880756139755}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re visiting for a girls\u2019 getaway, a Savannah weekend, a celebration, or just because you deserve a little more pink in your life, Ros\u00e9 All Day is ready to welcome you. Grab your favorite people, pour a glass, and stay awhile! \ud83c\udf77\ud83d\udc95 Guest access The entire first floor is yours! The spacious floor plan includes two bedrooms, living space, full bathroom, and complete kitchen. Other things to note City of Savannah hotel tax is included in your nightly rate. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994446873664856,"social_amenities":0.004131036810576916,"party_restriction":0.0010237098904326558,"nearby_nightlife":0.09504880756139755}},{"text":"Snap a selfie with your crew at our champagne-inspired photo wall, gather for drinks before heading downtown, or cook up something delicious (with a glass of ros\u00e9 in hand, of course!) in our fully equipped kitchen. When it\u2019s time to wind down, curl up under our bubbly chandelier and stream your favorites on the Smart TV with super-fast WiFi\u2014or grab a book from our rainbow color-coded bookshelf and settle in for a cozy night at home. \ud83c\udf33 STEPS FROM FORSYTH PARK One of the best parts of Ros\u00e9 All Day is the location! We\u2019re just steps from beautiful Forsyth Park, one of Savannah\u2019s most iconic spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9906028509140015,"social_amenities":0.019955316558480263,"party_restriction":0.001884808880276978,"nearby_nightlife":0.9934899806976318}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to Ros\u00e9 All Day \ud83d\udc95\u2014Savannah\u2019s perfectly pink Victorian getaway! Often called the \u201cBarbie Dream House,\u201d our insta-worthy 1885 home blends historic charm with cheerful, modern luxury. \ud83e\udd42 This beautifully restored first-floor condo features 2 bedrooms, 1 bath & sleeps up to 6. Best of all? You\u2019re just steps from Forsyth Park \ud83c\udf33 and an easy walk to downtown Savannah\u2019s restaurants, shops, bars & historic sights. Come sip, stay & Ros\u00e9 All Day! \ud83c\udf77\u2728 SVR-02119 The space Welcome to your perfectly pink home away from home! \ud83d\udc95 Ros\u00e9 All Day is a spacious, bright first-floor condo designed with equal parts style, comfort, and fun.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0026356454472988844,"social_amenities":0.31526023149490356,"party_restriction":0.004832601174712181,"nearby_nightlife":0.9676755666732788}},{"text":"Snap a selfie with your crew at our champagne-inspired photo wall, gather for drinks before heading downtown, or cook up something delicious (with a glass of ros\u00e9 in hand, of course!) in our fully equipped kitchen. When it\u2019s time to wind down, curl up under our bubbly chandelier and stream your favorites on the Smart TV with super-fast WiFi\u2014or grab a book from our rainbow color-coded bookshelf and settle in for a cozy night at home. \ud83c\udf33 STEPS FROM FORSYTH PARK One of the best parts of Ros\u00e9 All Day is the location! We\u2019re just steps from beautiful Forsyth Park, one of Savannah\u2019s most iconic spots.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores"