121924750506878,"nearby_nightlife":0.9887569546699524,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A classic drip coffee maker waits on the kitchen counter to help you get some pep in your step before taking on Savannah each morning. Of course, you won't see the feature that makes this property one of the best Savannah vacation rentals until you step outside. Suite Escape features a patio that overlooks Forsyth Park. This is a truly enviable feature that only a few Savannah visitors ever get to experience. Feel free to enjoy breakfast at the adorable bistro table on the patio. Free Wi-Fi and cable are included with this rental. . How Visitors Make the Most of Staying at Savannah Vacation Homes","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009232298471033573,"social_amenities":0.3093228340148926,"party_restriction":0.0013377737486734986,"nearby_nightlife":0.015660062432289124}},{"text":"What's more, you'll have a modern kitchen, Wi-Fi and all of the other essential amenities you need within arm's reach. SVR-01809* Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00068989786086604,"social_amenities":0.039084143936634064,"party_restriction":0.002381026279181242,"nearby_nightlife":0.019934222102165222}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Anyone renting a vacation home for a little while in Savannah should look into the prospect of attending one of the city's very fun festivals. Savannah actually hosts many themed festivals throughout the year. These acclaimed even