ON","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.02374674379825592,"social_amenities":0.04546466842293739,"party_restriction":0.0026163042057305574,"nearby_nightlife":0.7859296798706055}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You can also head to River Street for amazing restaurants, bars, shops and entertainment options. Even just spending some time admiring the homes, parks and specialty museums in the famous Savannah Historic District can be a real treat. Don't forget to check out haunted tours after dark if you're interested in seeing the spookier side of Savannah. The vacation rentals Savannah GA visitors choose to stay at also place them in the perfect spot for making excursions to nearby Tybee Island to swim, tour lighthouses or play in the sand.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001399882254190743,"social_amenities":0.006135751027613878,"party_restriction":0.0015503959730267525,"nearby_nightlife":0.9887569546699524}},{"text":"Anyone renting a vacation home for a little while in Savannah should look into the prospect of attending one of the city's very fun festivals. Savannah actually hosts many themed festivals throughout the year. These acclaimed events honor food, reading, art, Southern culture and so much more. Visitors can also look forward to fireworks in the summer and decorated mansions during the holiday season. The list of the year's biggest highlights includes the St.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9969889521598816,"social_amenities":0.009293344803154469,"party_restriction":0.0014557557879015803,"nearby_nightlife":0.9652830362319946}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 11010","address":"827 HOWARD ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24149157435","date":"2024-05-28","type":"ESCORT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"827 HOWARD ST","recorded_pin":"20044 11010","side":"direct"},{"number":"24103108713","date":"2024-04-12","type":"9 HIT-AND-RUN","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"827 Whitaker St","recorded_pin":"20044 11006","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25298303215","date":"2025-10-25","type":"GAS LEAK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"823 Howard St","recorded_pin":"20044 11011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22447571","title":"Garage Parking Near Forsyth by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447571","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00409"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447571","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"68dfca1bc186f9abed88657af40d0aaaf9f44ecbc8adc07d84e4deb432efb2d0","chunks":8,"words":699,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.017617242410779,"party_welcome":0.9892134070396423,"social_amenities":0.017617242410779,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.9612225890159607,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Host the entire family in this gorgeous three-story town home with towering ceilings and off-street parking just a short walk to Forsyth Park. The space A welcome addition to Savannah\u2019s sought-after Victorian District, Howard Grande Main + Garden is a multilevel, three-bedroom townhome just a stone\u2019s throw from the iconic Forsyth Park Fountain\u2014one of the most recognizable landmarks in historic downtown Savannah. This walkable Savannah vacation rental places you steps from the park and minutes from the heart of the Historic District. Park your car in the private garage and step up into the contemporary living quarters of your dreams.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022562124649994075,"social_amenities":0.017617242410779,"party_restriction":0.0006013027159497142,"nearby_nightlife":0.0071711759082973}},{"text":"Step outside and walk directly to Forsyth Park, where oak-lined paths, open green space, tennis courts, and the popular Saturday farmers market create a true Savannah experience right at your doorstep. This prime Victorian District location offers easy, walkable access to Savannah\u2019s historic squares, boutique shopping, and top dining destinations. Continue north through the Historic District to River Street, known for its waterfront views, restaurants, and lively atmosphere. Whether you're a family looking for a quiet retreat near Forsyth Park, or a pair of couples wanting to experience Savannah\u2019s walkable charm, local culture, and dining scene, Howard Grande is the perfect home base for your stay. Sleeping Configuration (Main)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007926675025373697,"social_amenities":0.013436862267553806,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.17881926894187927}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The first level hosts a private garden apartment for two\u2014complete with a full bath and separate street-level entry, ideal for added privacy or multi-generational travel. On the second level, you enter the two-story main home. With soaring ceilings and an open floor plan, this Savannah vacation rental is designed for effortless entertaining, family gatherings, and weekend getaways with friends. Take advantage of the granite countertops and stainless steel appliances to prepare a full meal, or step outside onto the cobblestone streets and enjoy a short, walkable distance to some of Savannah\u2019s most renowned restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and local favorites.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9892134070396423,"social_amenities":0.00752508919686079,"party_restriction":0.0005857917130924761,"nearby_nightlife":0.9612225890159607}},{"text":"Step outside and walk directly to Forsyth Park, where oak-lined paths, open green space, tennis courts, and the popular Saturday farmers market create a true Savannah experience right at your doorstep. This prime Victorian District location offers easy, walkable access to Savannah\u2019s historic squares, boutique shopping, and top dining destinations. Continue north through the Historic District to River Street, known for its waterfront views, restaurants, and lively atmosphere. Whether you're a family looking for a quiet retreat near Forsyth Park, or a pair of couples wanting to experience Savannah\u2019s walkable charm, local culture, and dining scene, Howard Grande is the perfect home base for your stay. Sleeping Configuration (Main)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007926675025373697,"social_amenities":0.013436862267553806,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.17881926894187927}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Host the entire family in this gorgeous three-story town home with towering ceilings and off-street parking just a short walk to Forsyth Park. The space A welcome addition to Savannah\u2019s sought-after Victorian District, Howard Grande Main + Garden is a multilevel, three-bedroom townhome just a stone\u2019s throw from the iconic Forsyth Park Fountain\u2014one of the most recognizable landmarks in historic downtown Savannah. This walkable Savannah vacation rental places you steps from the park and minutes from the heart of the Historic District. Park your car in the private garage and step up into the contemporary living quarters of your dreams.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022562124649994075,"social_amenities":0.017617242410779,"party_restriction":0.0006013027159497142,"nearby_nightlife":0.0071711759082973}},{"text":"Step outside and walk directly to Forsyth Park, where oak-lined paths, open green space, tennis courts, and the popular Saturday farmers market create a true Savannah experience right at your doorstep. This prime Victorian District location offers easy, walkable access to Savannah\u2019s historic squares, boutique shopping, and top dining destinations. Continue north through the Historic District to River Street, known for its waterfront views, restaurants, and lively atmosphere. Whether you're a family looking for a quiet retreat near Forsyth Park, or a pair of couples wanting to experience Savannah\u2019s walkable charm, local culture, and dining scene, Howard Grande is the perfect home base for your stay. Sleeping Configuration (Main)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007926675025373697,"social_amenities":0.013436862267553806,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.17881926894187927}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Step outside and walk directly to Forsyth Park, where oak-lined paths, open green space, tennis courts, and the popular Saturday farmers market create a true Savannah experience right at your doorstep. This prime Victorian District location offers easy, walkable access to Savannah\u2019s historic squares, boutique shopping, and top dining destinations. Continue north through the Historic District to River Street, known for its waterfront views, restaurants, and lively atmosphere. Whether you're a family looking for a quiet retreat near Forsyth Park, or a pair of couples wanting to experience Savannah\u2019s walkable charm, local culture, and dining scene, Howard Grande is the perfect home base for your stay. Sleeping Configuration (Main)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007926675025373697,"social_amenities":0.013436862267553806,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.17881926894187927}},{"text":"Bedroom 1: King Size Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Size Bed Sleeping Configuration (Garden) Bedroom 3: Queen Size Bed What is parking like for this home? Guests have access to one parking space in the attached private garage. Additional parking in the area can be found on-street and non-metered (free!) We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation. Some homes may allow larger dogs, please inquire for more information. SVR-00409","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014378223568201065,"social_amenities":0.008636140264570713,"party_restriction":0.004046166781336069,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011083298595622182}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The first level hosts a private garden apartment for two\u2014complete with a full bath and separate street-level entry, ideal for added privacy or multi-generational travel. On the second level, you enter the two-story main home. With soaring ceilings and an open floor plan, this Savannah vacation rental is designed for effortless entertaining, family gatherings, and weekend getaways with friends. Take advantage of the granite countertops and stainless steel appliances to prepare a full meal, or step outside onto the cobblestone streets and enjoy a short, walkable distance to some of Savannah\u2019s most renowned restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and local favorites.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9892134070396423,"social_amenities":0.00752508919686079,"party_restriction":0.0005857917130924761,"nearby_nightlife":0.9612225890159607}},{"text":"Step outside and walk directly to Forsyth Park, where oak-lined paths, open green space, tennis courts, and the popular Saturday farmers market create a true Savannah experience right at your doorstep. This prime Victorian District location offers easy, walkable access to Savannah\u2019s historic squares, boutique shopping, and top dining destinations. Continue north through the Historic District to River Street, known for its waterfront views, restaurants, and lively atmosphere. Whether you're a family looking for a quiet retreat near Forsyth Park, or a pair of couples wanting to experience Savannah\u2019s walkable charm, local culture, and dining scene, Howard Grande is the perfect home base for your stay. Sleeping Configuration (Main)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007926675025373697,"social_amenities":0.013436862267553806,"party_restriction":0.020140187814831734,"nearby_nightlife":0.17881926894187927}}]}}},{"listing_id":"22447712","title":"Coastal Cool off Forsyth Park by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447712","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00409"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447712","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c9d386604355622c576f4916d33dece08cb7dbe66f921c6c2f7a1e07040a78f6","chunks":7,"words":559,"party_signal":0.05140530318021774,"social_signal":0.011493372730910778,"party_welcome":0.05140530318021774,"social_amenities":0.3730315864086151,"party_restriction":0.03059264086186886,"nearby_nightlife":0.988818347454071,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Stay beneath the towering oak trees along Forsyth Park in this brand new two-bedroom town home with private parking. The space A welcome addition to the Victorian District, Howard Grande is a multilevel, two-bedroom town home just a stone's throw away from the famous Fountain at Forsyth Park. Park your car in the private garage and step up into the contemporary living quarters of your dreams. The first floor boasts high ceilings and an open floor plan, ideal for family gatherings and weekend getaways with close friends.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05140530318021774,"social_amenities":0.011493372730910778,"party_restriction":0.000567