ls, dining al fresco, and enjoying the warm Savannah nights in a gently-lit dream garden. The fenced and secure courtyard is shared by all of the guests of The Suites at Forsyth* and was designed to be experienced both communally and privately. The center is a large patio where you can gather with family, friends and meet other guests. If you desire a private experience, then slip into one of the four sheltered spaces that nestle at the periphery of the courtyard. These four \u2018rooms\u2019 are tucked into the foliage; each with vintage outdoor chairs and tables.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.05185592547059059,"social_amenities":0.14158909022808075,"party_restriction":0.000999665935523808,"nearby_nightlife":0.979103147983551}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010036653839051723,"social_amenities":0.9157063364982605,"party_restriction":0.0006964938365854323,"nearby_nightlife":0.004606164991855621}},{"text":"This tropical oasis is ideal for morning coffee, afternoon cocktails, dining al fresco, and enjoying the warm Savannah nights in a gently-lit dream garden. The fenced and secure courtyard is shared by all of the guests of The Suites at Forsyth* and was designed to be 