,"nearby_nightlife":0.9747378826141357,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"One bath has a full-sized shower and the second has an original cast iron tub and shower. Quality bed linens and towels are provided, along with soaps, shampoo and conditioner. You'll also find a white-noise sound machine in each bedroom. The just-installed heating and cooling system will keep you comfortable no matter what the weather brings. Reach your private deck through the back of the suite. With a table for six and direct access to the incredible courtyard, this is a perfect place to dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, or sip sweet tea or wine in the afternoon.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008287726086564362,"social_amenities":0.06562276184558868,"party_restriction":0.00038076884811744094,"nearby_nightlife":0.04698457196354866}},{"text":"Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher GE stainless steel electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises","section":"AMENITIES","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005787116242572665,"social_amenities":0.010020220652222633,"party_restriction":0.00022773584350943565,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023754213470965624}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"If you're feeling social, simply step off your deck into the lush tropical oasis that is the shared courtyard. For your entertainment, enjoy WIFI, cable TV with 70 channels, as well as streaming video--bring your own codes. For music, you can choose Pandora on the Amazon Fire TV Stick or the Amazon Echo for effortless music streaming. Simply say \"Echo, play jazz\" (or your favorite selection) and the music will play. We use Seventh Generation cleaning products and choose fragrance-free whenever possible. Two Outdoor Living Rooms Gather with friends on the graceful front porch under the glow of the gas lanterns.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9852523803710938,"social_amenities":0.05634894594550133,"party_restriction":0.0003411831276025623,"nearby_nightlife":0.9565470814704895}},{"text":"Every corner of this room is a feast for the eyes. There is a comfortable sofa and chairs, reading lamps, and a 50-inch high definition TV. The living room flows easily into the huge eat-in kitchen with a round farm table at its center. It is a perfect place to gather with friends and family to cook a great meal. We supply coffee (Free Trade Organic), teas, spices and oils to save you time and money. The library, with its cozy day bed, is tucked off the kitchen and is a great place to slip away to curl up with a book or take a nap.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.09292618930339813,"social_amenities":0.0055289603769779205,"party_restriction":0.0004050475836265832,"nearby_nightlife":0.00439085578545928}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"One bath has a full-sized shower and the second has an original cast iron tub and shower. Quality bed linens and towels are provided, along with soaps, shampoo and conditioner. You'll also find a white-noise sound machine in each bedroom. The just-installed heating and cooling system will keep you comfortable no matter what the weather brings. Reach your private deck through the back of the suite. With a table for six and direct access to the incredible courtyard, this is a perfect place to dine al fresco, enjoy your morning coffee, or sip swee