","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1711061116824505996","title":"Forsyth Park Grand Getaway | A Historic Mansion","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1711061116824505996","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-02226"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1711061116824505996","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"84bfc13672d336c14cbe86e3d1e8f108ca94a1fc5c07f81b7d7a44dbb507fbb7","chunks":8,"words":691,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.7070073485374451,"party_welcome":0.9962607026100159,"social_amenities":0.7070073485374451,"party_restriction":0.001155675039626658,"nearby_nightlife":0.92131507396698,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Make memories in this spacious historic mansion, built in 1888 - just one block from Forsyth Park! Perfect for large groups, this unique property sleeps 12 with 8 bedrooms and 4.5 baths. Guests will enjoy exclusive access to both the upper and lower condos, featuring 2 full kitchens, 2 living rooms, and plenty of room to relax and gather! Outdoor escapes await with two inviting balconies, large back porch, and backyard! Experience true Southern charm in this timeless estate! SVR 02226 and 02227 The space Step into the timeless beauty of historic Savannah and make yourself at home in this expansive retreat just one block from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009260328486561775,"social_amenities":0.7070073485374451,"party_restriction":0.00021679402561858296,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002397325588390231}},{"text":"A small office off the kitchen opens directly onto the back deck, where you\u2019ll find outdoor dining furniture overlooking the lush backyard. The upper levels (second and third floors) offer even more space to gather and unwind. On the second floor, guests will find a second full kitchen, an additional laundry space, a large entertaining area with a spacious dining table, and a living space, perfect for relaxing or socializing. This level also includes three bedrooms: two king bedrooms, each with private walk-out balconies, and one twin bedroom with a desk workspace.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004661490675061941,"social_amenities":0.15830543637275696,"party_restriction":0.00028531276620924473,"nearby_nightlife":0.004936401732265949}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The third floor features two additional king bedrooms, connected by a cozy lofted lounge space with a TV\u2014perfect for movie nights or a quiet retreat\u2014along with a convenient half bathroom. With two fully stocked kitchens, multiple living areas, outdoor spaces including a deck, backyard, and balconies, and room to comfortably sleep up to 12 guests, this thoughtfully appointed home is ideal for family gatherings, celebrations, and group getaways. Free street parking is available all around the home, and the location makes it easy to walk to Savannah\u2019s best parks, restaurants, shops, and historic landmarks. Guest access The entire space is yours!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9962607026100159,"social_amenities":0.007988660596311092,"party_restriction":0.0004366591456346214,"nearby_nightlife":0.92131507396698}},{"text":"Blending preserved architectural character with modern comfort, this one-of-a-kind property offers abundant space for large groups to gather, unwind, and experience the best of Savannah together. The first floor space features a comfortable and private living space with a large primary bedroom with a king bed, TV, and an en suite bathroom complete with a beautiful clawfoot tub. There is also a cozy queen bedroom with TV, a smaller twin bedroom, an additional full bathroom, and a laundry room. The eat-in kitchen is fully equipped for gathering and meals, while the living room provides a welcoming space to relax.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9592227339744568,"social_amenities":0.001669531688094139,"party_restriction":9.453416714677587e-05,"nearby_nightlife":0.011306332424283028}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Make memories in this spacious historic mansion, built in 1888 - just one block from Forsyth Park! Perfect for large groups, this unique property sleeps 12 with 8 bedrooms and 4.5 baths. Guests will enjoy exclusive access to both the upper and lower condos, featuring 2 full kitchens, 2 living rooms, and plenty of room to relax and gather! Outdoor escapes await with two inviting balconies, large back porch, and backyard! Experience true Southern charm in this timeless estate! SVR 02226 and 02227 The space Step into the timeless beauty of historic Savannah and make yourself at home in this expansive retreat just one block from Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009260328486561775,"social_amenities":0.7070073485374451,"party_restriction":0.00021679402561858296,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002397325588390231}},{"text":"A small office off the kitchen opens directly onto the back deck, where you\u2019ll find outdoor dining furniture overlooking the lush backyard. The upper levels (second and third floors) offer even more space to gather and unwind. On the second floor, guests will find a second full kitchen, an additional laundry space, a large entertaining area with a spacious dining table, and a living space, perfect for relaxing or socializing. This level also includes three bedrooms: two king bedrooms, each with private walk-out balconies, and one twin bedroom with a desk workspace.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004661490675061941,"social_amenities":0.15830543637275696,"party_restriction":0.00028531276620924473,"nearby_nightlife":0.004936401732265949}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":153,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033354354673065245,"social_amenities":0.0019430335378274322,"party_restriction":0.001155675039626658,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005386873381212354}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property There is an exterior security camera located at the front door of the building for guest safety and the security of the premises. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit","section":"AMENITIES","line":83,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019055517623201013,"social_amenities":0.018746117129921913,"party_restriction":0.0007770774536766112,"nearby_nightlife":0.002842286601662636}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The third floor features two additional king bedrooms, connected by a cozy lofted lounge space with a TV\u2014perfect for movie nights or a quiet retreat\u2014along with a convenient half bathroom. With two fully stocked kitchens, multiple living areas, outdoor spaces including a deck, backyard, and balconies, and room to comfortably sleep up to 12 guests, this thoughtfully appointed home is ideal for family gatherings, celebrations, and group getaways. Free street parking is available all around the home, and the location makes it easy to walk to Savannah\u2019s best parks, restaurants, shops, and historic landmarks. Guest access The entire space is yours!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9962607026100159,"social_amenities":0.007988660596311092,"party_restriction":0.0004366591456346214,"nearby_nightlife":0.92131507396698}},{"text":"Blending preserved architectural character with modern comfort, this one-of-a-kind property offers abundant space for large groups to gather, unwind, and experience the best of Savannah together. The first floor space features a comfortable and private living space with a large primary bedroom with a king bed, TV, and an en suite bathroom complete with a beautiful clawfoot tub. There is also a cozy queen bedroom with TV, a smaller twin bedroom, an additional full bathroom, and a laundry room. The eat-in kitchen is fully equipped for gathering and meals, while the living room provides a welcoming space to relax.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9592227339744568,"social_amenities":0.001669531688094139,"party_restriction":9.453416714677587e-05,"nearby_nightlife":0.011306332424283028}}]}}},{"listing_id":"48675605","title":"Striking Victorian Condo in Forsyth Park Mansion","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48675605","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02226"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48675605","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"dae91cf4d127d9465eba86df408eeddaf3800b7a18e6c417af464ac6e081b907","chunks":6,"words":448,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.011540484614670277,"party_welcome":0.016989057883620262,"social_amenities":0.011540484614670277,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This place is simply amazing. Incredibly posh condo inside of a sweeping, historic Victorian estate just STEPS off of Forsyth Park! Vibrant, eclectic, and well-appointed furnishings with a large living space, light-filled, well-equipped kitchen, and three bedrooms (master boasts a clawfoot bath en suite!) with 3 bedrooms and two full picturesque bathrooms. Even has a beautiful office, overlooking our lovely patio and large backyard. SVR-2226 The space Perfect for your Savannah getaway, this home is perfectly located just steps off famous Forsyth Park, and truly provides guests with the quintessential Savannah experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031949253752827644,"social_amenities":0.011540484614670277,"party_restriction":0.000625927175860852,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033990973606705666}},{"text":"Nestled among Spanish moss adorned live oaks, and oh-so-rare private large outdoor space, this home boasts PLENTY of space for your entire group of family and friends! Master bedroom features a gorgeous, canopy, king-sized bed with en suite bathroom (and clawfoot tub!), while the two additional bedrooms have a super comfy queen and a twin (with second twin trundled below)...providing the perfect sleeping arrangement for your whole group! Living room has large flat screen TV, super fast Wifi throughout, and tons of room for lounging and relaxing! Guest access The entire condo is all yours! Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016989057883620262,"social_amenities":0.008723210543394089,"party_restriction":0.0002756260219030082,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031161708757281303}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Nestled among Spanish moss adorned live oaks, and oh-so-rare private large outdoor space, this home boasts PLENTY of space for your entire group of family and friends! Master bedroom features a gorgeous, canopy, king-sized bed with en suite bathroom (and clawfoot tub!), while the two additional bedrooms have a super comfy queen and a twin (with second twin trundled below)...providing the perfect sleeping arrangement for your whole group! Living room has large flat screen TV, super fast Wifi throughout, and tons of room for lounging and relaxing! Guest access The entire condo is all yours! Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016989057