":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016989057883620262,"social_amenities":0.008723210543394089,"party_restriction":0.0002756260219030082,"nearby_nightlife":0.0031161708757281303}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004096822813153267,"social_amenities":0.0009063480538316071,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164}},{"text":"Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":129,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046738775563426316,"social_amenities":0.0010368427028879523,"party_restriction":0.0011476119980216026,"nearby_nightlife":0.0014794080052524805}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004096822813153267,"social_amenities":0.0009063480538316071,"party_restriction":0.0013925244566053152,"nearby_nightlife":0.12962695956230164}},{"text":"This place is simply amazing. Incredibly posh condo inside of a sweeping, historic Victorian estate just STEPS off of Forsyth Park! Vibrant, eclectic, and well-appointed furnishings with a large living space, light-filled, well-equipped kitchen, and three bedrooms (master boasts a clawfoot bath en suite!) with 3 bedrooms and two full picturesque bathrooms. Even has a beautiful office, overlooking our lovely patio and large backyard. SVR-2226 The space Perfect for your Savannah getaway, this home is perfectly located just steps off famous Forsyth Park, and truly provides guests with the quintessential Savannah experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031949253752827644,"social_amenities":0.011540484614670277,"party_restriction":0.000625927175860852,"nearby_nightlife":0.0033990973606705666}}]}}},{"listing_id":"49836048","title":"Enchanting 5 BR Condos in Stately Forsyth Mansion","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49836048","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02227"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"49836048","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"83cab5a7577b07b541b3cbc8efd5599f35c5c8e05b19fb74028399cc7f85e20e","chunks":7,"words":562,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.009206051006913185,"party_welcome":0.9855785369873047,"social_amenities":0.009206051006913185,"party_restriction":0.99928879737854,"nearby_nightlife":0.0338328592479229,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This private condo perched on the second (and third!) floors of our historic mansion, steps off Forsyth Park. Enjoy gathering with friends and family in this Victorian estate! Thoughtfully updated with all the modern amenities, while still maintaining SO many charming original details! Have a drink on one of the balconies, enjoy a meal around the dining table, or explore our beautiful city knowing that you have this awesome space to come home to! SVR-02227 The space Our condo might be the perfect spot for you! With such a large space, we do want to ensure we are the right fit for your group.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9855785369873047,"social_amenities":0.009206051006913185,"party_restriction":0.0006410059868358076,"nearby_nightlife":0.007188062183558941}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on exterior of property monitoring the front door and back door. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 54 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001659593399381265,"social_amenities":0.004856150131672621,"party_restriction":0.000699718773830682,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009684727410785854}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This private condo perched on the second (and third!) floors of our historic mansion, steps off Forsyth Park. Enjoy gathering with friends and family in this Victorian estate! Thoughtfully updated with all the modern amenities, while still maintaining SO many charming original details! Have a drink on one of the balconies, enjoy a meal around the dining table, or explore our beautiful city knowing that you have this awesome space to come home to! SVR-02227 The space Our condo might be the perfect spot for you! With such a large space, we do want to ensure we are the right fit for your group.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9855785369873047,"social_amenities":0.009206051006913185,"party_restriction":0.0006410059868358076,"nearby_nightlife":0.007188062183558941}},{"text":"Stretch out in one of the four king bedrooms or cozy up in the fifth bonus bedroom with a twin bed - all equipped with brand new mattresses. Enjoy your morning coffee on either of the TWO balconies overlooking the backyard and entertain your group in the large kitchen, dining, and living areas. If you need a break from the fun, sneak upstairs and sink into the LoveSac in the third floor den for a quick recharge! Guest access The entire the second and third floor is yours! Your private entrance from the exterior leads you right upstairs to your living space. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.683118462562561,"social_amenities":0.0029808671679347754,"party_restriction":0.00027792018954642117,"nearby_nightlife":0.0338328592479229}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This private condo perched on the second (and third!) floors of our historic mansion, steps off Forsyth Park. Enjoy gathering with friends and family in this Victorian estate! Thoughtfully updated with all the modern amenities, while still maintaining SO many charming original details! Have a drink on one of the balconies, enjoy a meal around the dining table, or explore our beautiful city knowing that you have this awesome space to come home to! SVR-02227 The space Our condo might be the perfect spot for you! With such a large space, we do want to ensure we are the right fit for your group.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9855785369873047,"social_amenities":0.009206051006913185,"party_restriction":0.0006410059868358076,"nearby_nightlife":0.007188062183558941}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on exterior of property monitoring the front door and back door. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 54 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001659593399381265,"social_amenities":0.004856150131672621,"party_restriction":0.000699718773830682,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009684727410785854}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We have a strict 8 guest occupancy limit, which is the maximum permitted by our license to short term rent. Unfortunately, we can't make any exceptions to this rule. We also rent out another condo right below this one, and we do our best to ensure both groups are able to peacefully enjoy the space. Though we have plenty of space to stretch out, we do not permit parties or events and must enforce our neighborhood Quiet Hours after 10pm. Before booking, please send us a message describing your group and your plans for your stay! The condo is expansive with a fun, old world layout.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017357972683385015,"social_amenities":0.001879138289950788,"party_restriction":0.99928879737854,"nearby_nightlife":0.021694786846637726}},{"text":"Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":140,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002910627517849207,"social_amenities":0.0016527262050658464,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009365808218717575}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Stretch out in one of the four king bedrooms or cozy up in the fifth bonus bedroom with a twin bed - all equipped with brand new mattresses. Enjoy your morning coffee on either of the TWO balconies overlooking the backyard and entertain your group in the large kitchen, dining, and living areas. If you need a break from the fun, sneak upstairs and sink into the LoveSac in the third floor den for a quick recharge! Guest access The entire the second and third floor is yours! Your private entrance from the exterior leads you right upstairs to your living space. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.683118462562561,"social_amenities":0.0029808671679347754,"party_restriction":0.00027792018954642117,"nearby_nightlife":0.0338328592479229}},{"text":"Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything! We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008119135745801032,"social_amenities":0.000486511125927791,"party_restriction":0.0005571329966187477,"nearby_nightlife":0.03355703130364418}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 13015","address":"819 ABERCORN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24226237740","date":"2024-08-13","type":"22 Found/Surrendered WEAPON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"807 Abercorn St","recorded_pin":"20044 13037","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22447664","title":"Beautiful Home Near Park by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447664","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-00381"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447664","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1e62e0b283a5cd6cffd953eae2e59db23af82aa034a095125eb4e7ab9a0e7a68","chunks":7,"words":588,"party_signal":0.9972639083862305,"social_signal":0.1279493123292923,"party_welcome":0.9972639083862305,"social_amenities":0.1301286220550537,"party_restriction":0.039836715906858444,"nearby_nightlife":0.9545596241950989,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"With two full kitchens, a backyard, a deck with a grill, and two full living rooms, this home is perfect for a group or a family traveling to Savannah. The space This beautiful three-story home is just a block from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest green space! You\u2019ll have everything you need for a relaxing and enjoyable stay. With five bedrooms and four full baths, this home can accommodate up to 10 Lucky guests, making it perfect for wedding parties and reunions! In Savannah, the ground floor is known as the Garden Level or Garden Apartment, and is perfect for anyone with mobility issues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9972639083862305,"social_amenities":0.006676727905869484,"party_restriction":0.0007215898367576301,"nearby_nightlife":0.25089332461357117},"affirmative_event_evidence":"With five bedrooms and four full baths, this home can accommodate up to 10 Lucky guests, making it perfect for wedding parties and reunions!"}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A gas grill, table for eight, and a view of Forsyth Park make this an ideal setting for dining al fresco. On the third floor are three more bedrooms, one with two twin beds, and two with queen beds. The primary bedroom has an ensuite bath with a separate tub and shower, perfect for a relaxing evening. There is a convenient door to let in a lot of natural light and lead to a private balcony, so you can sit back and watch the world go by.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003670867008622736,"social_amenities":0.1279493123292923,"party_restriction":0.0003037134592887014,"nearby_nightlife":0.022922813892364502}},{"text":"It has it\u2019s own entrance and a full kitchen with everything you\u2019ll need during your stay. There are two full bathrooms - one with a shower/tub combo and the second with a stand-up shower. Both bedrooms have queen-sized beds and plenty of space to unpack, so you can get comfortable during your stay! The Garden Level also has direct access to your private garage. Upstairs, you\u2019ll find a large custom kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a breakfast bar. Open to the dining area, there\u2019s plenty of space for everyone to enjoy a meal together. Three sets of French doors in the living room lead to your private patio.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015205926320049912,"social_amenities":0.013337409123778343,"party_restriction":0.0004813403938896954,"nearby_nightlife":0.006167165003716946}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"With two full kitchens, a backyard, a deck with a grill, and two full living rooms, this home is perfect for a group or a family traveling to Savannah. The space This beautiful three-story home is just a block from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest green space! You\u2019ll have everything you need for a relaxing and enjoyable stay. With five bedrooms and four full baths, this home can accommodate up to 10 Lucky guests, making it perfect for wedding parties and reunions! In Savannah, the ground floor is known as the Garden Level or Garden Apartment, and is perfect for anyone with mobility issues.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9972639083862305,"social_amenities":0.006676727905869484,"party_restriction":0.0007215898367576301,"nearby_nightlife":0.25089332461357117}},{"text":"You\u2019ll be a block away from Kroger, the only full grocery store in the Historic District, but close enough to all of Savannah\u2019s dining options to never need to cook! Take a stroll to Mat\u00e9 Factor Cafe in the morning and discover organic coffee, mat\u00e9 teas, house made muffins, danishes and even fruit-stuffed. Sleeping Configuration: Main House Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Two Twin Beds Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Garden Level Bedroom 4: Queen Bed Bedroom 5: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home? Parkside Place includes 1 garage parking space. Additional parking is on-street and non- metered (free!) in this area. Savannah STVR Permit #: SVR-00381","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01650054380297661,"social_amenities":0.1301286220550537,"party_restriction":0.039836715906858444,"nearby_nightlife":0.9545596241950989}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"You\u2019ll be a block away from Kroger, the only full grocery store in the Historic District, but close enough to all of Savannah\u2019s dining options to never need to cook! Take a stroll to 