:0.0009368949686177075,"party_restriction":0.004136764910072088,"nearby_nightlife":0.005005194805562496}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Enjoy a luxurious retreat in one of the best neighborhoods in the city's Landmark Historic District! Walk to all your favorite restaurants and shops and return home to a peaceful enclave of beautiful Savannah. The space Upstairs, you\u2019ll find a large custom kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a breakfast bar. Open to the dining area, there\u2019s plenty of space for everyone to enjoy a meal together. Three sets of French doors in the living room lead to your private patio. A gas grill, table for eight, and a view of Forsyth Park make this an ideal setting for dining al fresco.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005744987167418003,"social_amenities":0.6095125675201416,"party_restriction":0.0004038465558551252,"nearby_nightlife":0.9361182451248169}},{"text":"Take a stroll to Mat\u00e9 Factor Cafe in the morning and discover organic coffee, mat\u00e9 teas, housemade muffins, danishes and even fruit-stuffed. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - It's called Parkside for a reason. A one minute walks places you in Savannah's largest public green space, perfect for a picnic, a jog, or taking the kids to the best playground in the City..did we mention the Saturday morning Farmers market? - There\u2019s plenty of additional non-metered street parking in the area, perfect for groups with multiple cars. Sleeping Configuration: Main House Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Two Twin Beds Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Savannah STVR Permit #: SVR-00381","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0025391029193997383,"social_amenities":0.0035472349263727665,"party_restriction":0.0011039316887035966,"nearby_nightlife":0.6136738061904907}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Enjoy a luxurious retreat in one of the best neighborhoods in the city's Landmark Historic District! Walk to all yo