lock away from Kroger, the only full grocery store in the Historic District, but close enough to all of Savannah\u2019s dining options to never need to cook!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002950865018647164,"social_amenities":0.00452989200130105,"party_restriction":0.0005290826666168869,"nearby_nightlife":0.7940497398376465}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 13034","address":"812 DRAYTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1105791359976383544","title":"The Perch @ Forsyth Park, Walk to Everything!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1105791359976383544","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-01744"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1105791359976383544","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"201fd742604306ea4993165ecef7d2fa9f0d99d8a333ebdfae79577db1a81f0d","chunks":8,"words":709,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.4735983610153198,"party_welcome":0.017271121963858604,"social_amenities":0.4735983610153198,"party_restriction":0.999042809009552,"nearby_nightlife":0.92990642786026,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Refresh in the two full baths, one with a tub and the other with a standalone shower, ensuring everyone's comfort and convenience. The primary bathroom has been fully refinished with custom tile work and modern touches. Both bathrooms are outfitted with all the essentials, including toilet paper, towels, shampoo, body wash, and a hair dryer. Enjoy access to high-speed WiFi, a washer and dryer for added convenience, central AC for year-round comfort, and a gas grill on the back deck, complete with two seats, perfect for al fresco dining and relaxation amidst the cityscape.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004374123818706721,"social_amenities":0.4735983610153198,"party_restriction":0.00038804541691206396,"nearby_nightlife":0.019343947991728783}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven","section":"AMENITIES","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028885583742521703,"social_amenities":0.008223243057727814,"party_restriction":0.0003564073413144797,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006624101079069078}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Pour a glass of wine before gathering around the four-seat dining table, which can extend to accommodate up to eight guests, for a hearty meal and lively conversation. Retreat one of the three elegantly furnished bedrooms, each offering a unique charm. The first bedroom boasts a queen bed adorned with crisp linens, antique furniture, and gleaming hardwood floors. The second bedroom features a queen bed in a modern wood frame, complemented by matching furniture and vibrant artwork. In contrast, the third bedroom offers a queen bed nestled within a timeless brass frame, set against hardwood floors and a striking orange rug.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.017271121963858604,"social_amenities":0.0014048758894205093,"party_restriction":0.00015532071120105684,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023958932142704725}},{"text":"Ascend the stairs and step onto the balcony, where seating for six invites you to savor the sights and sounds of this historic city. Step through the doors into the inviting living room with hardwood floors, a new oversized sofa, and sitting chairs for lounging and streaming your favorite entertainment on the smart TV. Sunlight streams through the windows, infusing the space with warmth and airiness, while a cozy two-seat table offers a relaxing spot for a meal or catching up on correspondence. Enjoy effortless cooking in the fully appointed galley kitchen, with all the essential accessories, including a fridge, range, dishwasher, and elegant granite countertops.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005005280836485326,"social_amenities":0.003957365173846483,"party_restriction":0.0002163187018595636,"nearby_nightlife":0.0303569957613945}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Refresh in the two full baths, one with a tub and the other with a standalone shower, ensuring everyone's comfort and convenience. The primary bathroom has been fully refinished with custom tile work and modern touches. Both bathrooms are outfitted with all the essentials, including toilet paper, towels, shampoo, body wash, and a hair dryer. Enjoy access to high-speed WiFi, a washer and dryer for added convenience, central AC for year-round comfort, and a gas grill on the back deck, complete with two seats, perfect for al fresco dining and relaxation amidst the cityscape.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004374123818706721,"social_amenities":0.4735983610153198,"party_restriction":0.00038804541691206396,"nearby_nightlife":0.019343947991728783}},{"text":"Tucked right along the edge of Forsyth Park, The Drayton puts you in the heart of Savannah. Located on the third floor, enjoy the big front porch overlooking Forsyth Park and Drayton Street, three large bedrooms, two bedrooms, and ample space for up to six guests. Fresh updates, stylish d\u00e9cor, and original touches create a relaxing environment to unwind in after exploring. Minutes from everything Savannah offers, including dining, attractions, pubs, and more. SVR-01744 The space Welcome to your charming Savannah sanctuary nestled on the third floor, promising an unforgettable stay filled with comfort and convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011125804303446785,"social_amenities":0.04037443548440933,"party_restriction":0.0010368672665208578,"nearby_nightlife":0.92990642786026}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Welcome to your Savannah retreat, where comfort, style, and modern amenities converge to create an unforgettable getaway experience. For those blending work with pleasure, fear not \u2013 our high-speed WiFi stands ready to support your endeavors, whether video conferencing or multitasking. Guest access Please enjoy the front porch overlooking Forsyth and Drayton St. The entire condo is for your use! We encourage you to use the rear porch just for hanging out at night, but please be mindful of your neighbors below and keep noises to a minimum after 10pm. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Absolutely no animals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004384589265100658,"social_amenities":0.04000316932797432,"party_restriction":0.999042809009552,"nearby_nightlife":0.8902003169059753}},{"text":"Only the number of guests listed on the reservation is permitted at the property. No illicit activities, peddling, or soliciting are allowed on the property. Do not smoke on the property or near the home. Must be 21 years of age to drink alcohol. Report all damaged property to the property owner immediately. Treat the apartment with respect, as if it were your own property. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014907296281307936,"social_amenities":0.0008768547559157014,"party_restriction":0.9614492058753967,"nearby_nightlife":0.053013138473033905}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Tucked right along the edge of Forsyth Park, The Drayton puts you in the heart of Savannah. Located on the third floor, enjoy the big front porch overlooking Forsyth Park and Drayton Street, three large bedrooms, two bedrooms, and ample space for up to six guests. Fresh updates, stylish d\u00e9cor, and original touches create a relaxing environment to unwind in after exploring. Minutes from everything Savannah offers, including dining, attractions, pubs, and more. SVR-01744 The space Welcome to your charming Savannah sanctuary nestled on the third floor, promising an unforgettable stay filled with comfort and convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011125804303446785,"social_amenities":0.04037443548440933,"party_restriction":0.0010368672665208578,"nearby_nightlife":0.92990642786026}},{"text":"Welcome to your Savannah retreat, where comfort, style, and modern amenities converge to create an unforgettable getaway experience. For those blending work with pleasure, fear not \u2013 our high-speed WiFi stands ready to support your endeavors, whether video conferencing or multitasking. Guest access Please enjoy the front porch overlooking Forsyth and Drayton St. The entire condo is for your use! We encourage you to use the rear porch just for hanging out at night, but please be mindful of your neighbors below and keep noises to a minimum after 10pm. Other things to note Absolutely no parties. Absolutely no animals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004384589265100658,"social_amenities":0.04000316932797432,"party_restriction":0.999042809009552,"nearby_nightlife":0.8902003169059753}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin"