nce / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22751152","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22751152","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00265"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22751152","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6f8bb7d0867d236b013b75ed1e87752bb6e3d43b19ea592dd356d579143351c5","chunks":15,"words":1527,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.0567881278693676,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9419282078742981,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":159,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Beyond the kitchen island, a second seating area with a large flat-screen TV provides entertainment while the cooks among your group are whipping up an enticing meal. Just beyond, a breakfast table provides informal eating space, and the back door opens to your private screened porch with stairs down to the back yard. The brick-lined courtyard below features secluded outdoor living space, highly prized by vacation homes Savannah guests, with seating, flowerbeds and a privacy fence. The second floor of Waldburg Manor hosts three bedrooms and two full bathrooms furnished with your ultimate pampering in mind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024496999685652554,"social_amenities":0.8497154712677002,"party_restriction":0.000668403459712863,"nearby_nightlife":0.028033021837472916}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The shared bathroom provides you with double sinks, a tub-shower combination, and plenty of counter space to spread out your personal items. A powder room, washer and dryer, off-street parking and Wi-Fi complete the long list of amenities your party will enjoy at Walburg Manor during your Savannah vacation. Forsyth Park and Beyond Whether you are active athletes or simply love to stroll, your proximity to Forsyth Park, at 30 acres the largest greenspace in the Historic District of Savannah, demands at least a morning walk through this multipurpose park, at most long days of outdoor recreation. Some of the most popular features of Forsyth include: \u2022 An ornate fountain","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0567881278693676,"social_amenities":0.003106164513155818,"party_restriction":0.0005662982002831995,"nearby_nightlife":0.44802626967430115}},{"text":"\u2022 Fragrant gardens \u2022 Walking paths \u2022 Children\u2019s playgrounds \u2022 A caf\u00e9 \u2022 Tennis courts \u2022 Basketball courts \u2022 A half-shell theater \u2022 Sports fields \u2022 Picnic areas As the anchor park of the city, Forsyth is a popular destination for guests at vacation rentals Savannah GA and local residents alike, so it is a fun place to socialize and people watch too. When you are staying at Waldburg Manor, you are ideally situated to take in some of the activities in the park, such as: \u2022 The year-round Saturday Farmers\u2019 Market \u2022 Georgia Day Parade in February \u2022 Greening of the Fountain in March","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01310678105801344,"social_amenities":0.0040305363945662975,"party_restriction":0.001417582854628563,"nearby_nightlife":0.0685976967215538}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":159,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Beyond the kitchen island, a second seating area with a large flat-screen TV provides entertainment while the cooks among your group are whipping up an enticing meal. Just beyond, a breakfast table provides informal eating space, and the back door opens to your private screened porch with stairs down to the back yard. The brick-lined courtyard below features secluded outdoor living space, highly prized by vacation homes Savannah guests, with seating, flowerbeds and a privacy fence. The second floor of Waldburg Manor hosts three bedrooms and two full bathrooms furnished with your ultimate pampering in mind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024496999685652554,"social_amenities":0.8497154712677002,"party_restriction":0.000668403459712863,"nearby_nightlife":0.028033021837472916}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":159,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions! Guests may bring up to 2 dogs, with a combined weight limit of 50 lbs.\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b Pets must be added to your reservation at the time of booking, and a non refundable $130 pet fee will apply. Long-Term Stays","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":175,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015144330682232976,"social_amenities":0.03381996229290962,"party_restriction":0.0029296623542904854,"nearby_nightlife":0.002815015846863389}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2022 Sidewalk Arts Festival in April \u2022 Savannah Mile in May \u2022 Savannah Jazz Festival in September \u2022 Picnic in the Park in October \u2022 Savannah Children\u2019s Book Festival in November You will find plenty of activities beyond the park, of course, such as exploring historic sites and enjoying local fare. Chatham Area Transit offers a free shuttle bus that you can take to tour the entire district during your tenure at vacation homes Savannah. Stop by such must-see locations as the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, the Bonaventure Cemetery, the Telfair Art Museum, or the Mercer-Williams House.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002659458899870515,"social_amenities":0.007071358151733875,"party_restriction":0.0017321676714345813,"nearby_nightlife":0.9419282078742981}},{"text":"Your visit would not be complete without sampling a variety of the delicious food on offer at the city\u2019s eclectic restaurants. Some of the most popular with our Savannah vacation rentals guests are the Olde Pink House, Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, Alligator Soul, Circa 1875 and Crystal Beer Parlor, but you will also find plenty of other options for fresh seafood, Southern cooking, fast food, ethnic fare and sweet treats throughout the city. Selecting one of our immaculate vacation rentals Savannah GA as your home base for your upcoming Georgia vacation is one of the best decisions you can make for a memorable visit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001957829372258857,"social_amenities":0.003911589737981558,"party_restriction":0.0013615756761282682,"nearby_nightlife":0.8621394038200378}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 19001A","address":"905 WHITAKER ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,