9625,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9913693070411682,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This beautiful first floor townhome has everything you'll need to feel like a true Savannah local. This home features a remodeled kitchen, historic architectural details, and front door access to our city's most beautiful park. The space Welcome to the Delia Row, a charming Savannah vacation rental located directly across from Forsyth Park in the heart of the Historic District. This beautifully furnished first-floor apartment blends timeless Southern character with modern comfort and can easily accommodate up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020782917272299528,"social_amenities":0.002106039086356759,"party_restriction":0.0009031937806867063,"nearby_nightlife":0.09558971226215363}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046241949894465506,"social_amenities":0.0015390949556604028,"party_restriction":0.0003949602833017707,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006926235510036349}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re planning a romantic getaway, a business trip, or a longer stay in Savannah, this Delia Row residence offers an unbeatable location and all the comforts of home. Traveling with family or friends? Ask about our additional one-bedroom homes located in the same building\u2014ideal for group stays near Forsyth Park. Why Lucky Savannah Loves This Home: Prime Location: Situated directly across from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s most famous landmark and gathering place for festivals, markets, and weddings. Free Parking: Ample non-metered street parking surrounding the home\u2014no garages, meters, or parking headaches. Modern Comforts: Complimentary Wi-Fi, multiple TVs, and a thoughtfully designed interior for both comfort and convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8987492322921753,"social_amenities":0.007107689045369625,"party_restriction":0.001112968660891056,"nearby_nightlife":0.8998652696609497}},{"text":"Step inside and relax in the inviting living area, featuring a plush queen-size sleeper sofa, a 37\" flat-screen TV, a DVD player, and a curated library of classic movies\u2014perfect for cozy evenings in. The spacious bedroom offers a luxurious king-size bed, a comfortable seating area ideal for reading or people-watching, and a 50\" television for winding down after a day of exploring Savannah\u2019s historic streets. Wake up refreshed and start your day with a peaceful walk across Forsyth Park to Collins Quarter at Forsyth for coffee or brunch. Later, enjoy cocktails or fine dining at Hotel Bardo and Saint Bibiana, both just minutes away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001753480639308691,"social_amenities":0.0012876923428848386,"party_restriction":0.0008637583814561367,"nearby_nightlife":0.9913693070411682}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re planning a romantic getaway, a business trip, or a longer stay in Savannah, this Delia Row residence offers an unbeatable location and all the comforts of home. Traveling with family or friends? Ask about our