11682,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"This beautiful first floor townhome has everything you'll need to feel like a true Savannah local. This home features a remodeled kitchen, historic architectural details, and front door access to our city's most beautiful park. The space Welcome to the Delia Row, a charming Savannah vacation rental located directly across from Forsyth Park in the heart of the Historic District. This beautifully furnished first-floor apartment blends timeless Southern character with modern comfort and can easily accommodate up to four Lucky guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020782917272299528,"social_amenities":0.002106039086356759,"party_restriction":0.0009031937806867063,"nearby_nightlife":0.09558971226215363}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046241949894465506,"social_amenities":0.0015390949556604028,"party_restriction":0.0003949602833017707,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006926235510036349}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re planning a romantic getaway, a business trip, or a longer stay in Savannah, this Delia Row residence offers an unbeatable location and all the comforts o