 plenty of natural light from tall Victorian windows. Dining tables in each unit provide seating for meals, board games, or planning your Savannah adventures. \u2606\u2606 OUTDOOR SPACE \u2606\u2606","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007494664168916643,"social_amenities":0.003929603844881058,"party_restriction":0.00043901478056795895,"nearby_nightlife":0.012645903043448925}},{"text":"Located just three blocks from the picturesque Forsyth Park, The Victorian Duo places you in the heart of Savannah's vibrant downtown. You'll be within walking distance of the city's best cafes, bars, and restaurants, making it easy to explore the local culinary scene. The free DOT trolley and easy access to Uber ensure you can conveniently explore all that Savannah has to offer. Whether you're here for a quick getaway or an extended stay, The Victorian Duo provides a perfect blend of comfort, style, and prime location, making it an ideal choice for families, couples, and solo travelers alike.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00039812331669963896,"social_amenities":0.0034168241545557976,"party_restriction":0.0008992574876174331,"nearby_nightlife":0.9609768390655518}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"We provide a starter pack of K-cups, trash bags, paper towels and toilet paper for your convenience. Parking is conveniently available on-street at no cost. Please pay close attention to the posted sweep zones and times as you may have to move your car at that specified date and time to avoid fines. Sweeping times and days are specific to the street you're parking on and can be found on red and white signs along the sidewalk. Primary renter must be 25 years old to rent and signer of agreement must stay on premises for entire booking No smoking and no parties. SVR-02678 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011663162149488926,"social_amenities":0.0016534406458958983,"party_restric