ric details that add to its charm. Modern conveniences include TVs in every room, fast Wi-Fi, and a well-equipped coffee bar. The private porch, adorned with mood lighting, offers a serene spot for morning coffee or evening tea. An in-apartment laundry room adds to the convenience, making it easy for guests to keep their clothes fresh during their stay. Located just three blocks from Forsyth Park, The Victorian Duo provides easy access to Savannah's top attractions, cafes, bars, and restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":151,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018118230218533427,"social_amenities":0.0032254052348434925,"party_restriction":0.000817759137134999,"nearby_nightlife":0.9784627556800842}}]}}},{"listing_id":"819233708835774656","title":"Walk to Forsyth Park | Downtown Savannah I Dogs OK","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/819233708835774656","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02680"],"analysis":null},{"listing_id":"819239572550565821","title":"Victorian charm \u2022 Dog friendly \u2022 Near Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/819239572550565821","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02679"],"analysis":null},{"listing_id":"819241639333503169","title":"Fenced Courtyard \u2022 Dog Friendly \u2022 Walk to Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/819241639333503169","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02678"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20044 21045","address":"220 E WALDBURG ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":12,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":12,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24132139226","date":"2024-05-1