ST HARASSMENT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"218 E Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20044 21008","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"50086111","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation |","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/50086111","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02246"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"50086111","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3fd8a2010c70a73f533d7c31f3aea84cacead12dbff58e8fb11f5f4239425133","chunks":13,"words":1216,"party_signal":0.699140727519989,"social_signal":0.8625659942626953,"party_welcome":0.9957032799720764,"social_amenities":0.8637859225273132,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.9896518588066101,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Plan Big Group Trips in This Spacious Rental When you choose Forsyth Artist Retreat for your Savannah vacation homes, you don't have to exclude your loved ones. This roomy home accommodates six guests, so you can bring along your friends and family. Our spacious three bedroom, three bathroom home is great for bachelorette trips, family getaways, and group vacations. Sleeping spots for you and your guests are evenly distributed throughout the home. In the master, you can rest on the king sized bed or take a shower in the en suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.699140727519989,"social_amenities":0.009733760729432106,"party_restriction":0.0002321458887308836,"nearby_nightlife":0.006120759528130293},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Our spacious three bedroom, three bathroom home is great for bachelorette trips, family getaways, and group vacations."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"When you want to get some work done or relax with a favorite show or game, our free Wifi, cable, and satellite TV are always available. Forsyth Artist Retreat provides the perfect spot for outdoor relaxation. Gather on the spacious balcony to have cool drinks and catch a breeze on sunny afternoons. The cozy patio furniture easily fits your whole group, making it a great spot for evening dinners. Just like all our other Savannah vacation rentals, Forsyth Artist Retreat also provides access to our heated pool complex on Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016163075342774391,"social_amenities":0.8625659942626953,"party_restriction":0.0009088069200515747,"nearby_nightlife":0.4745037853717804}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":193,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004942726227454841,"social_amenities":0.5348630547523499,"party_restriction":0.0015661974903196096,"nearby_nightlife":0.001239090459421277}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The two other bedrooms are equally spacious with each one holding a queen sized bed and a seating area. If your party needs a little more room, check out the loft upstairs. This spacious second floor has couches that fold out to sleep additional guests. The bedrooms aren't the only roomy part of our accommodations. The living room and dining area is also sized to suit the needs of larger parties. With an open floor plan, some members of your group can relax in the living room while others work on cooking breakfast.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9957032799720764,"social_amenities":0.0019368218490853906,"party_restriction":0.00038315352867357433,"nearby_nightlife":0.024093391373753548}},{"text":"Plan Big Group Trips in This Spacious Rental When you choose Forsyth Artist Retreat for your Savannah vacation homes, you don't have to exclude your loved ones. This roomy home accommodates six guests, so you can bring along your friends and family. Our spacious three bedroom, three bathroom home is great for bachelorette trips, family getaways, and group vacations. Sleeping spots for you and your guests are evenly distributed throughout the home. In the master, you can rest on the king sized bed or take a shower in the en suite bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.699140727519989,"social_amenities":0.009733760729432106,"party_restriction":0.0002321458887308836,"nearby_nightlife":0.006120759528130293}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whatever your preferences, there's always plenty of fun things to do while you are staying at Forsyth Artist Retreat. Guest access Full kitchen Bar Seating for Four Flatscreen TV's Whirlpool Bath Private Deck with Seating WIFI Off-Street Parking Private Porch and Courtyard Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005218850448727608,"social_amenities":0.8637859225273132,"party_restriction":0.0006160523043945432,"nearby_nightlife":0.8577399849891663}},{"text":"When you want to get some work done or relax with a favorite show or game, our free Wifi, cable, and satellite TV are always available. Forsyth Artist Retreat provides the perfect spot for outdoor relaxation. Gather on the spacious balcony to have cool drinks and catch a breeze on sunny afternoons. The cozy patio furniture easily fits your whole group, making it a great spot for evening dinners. Just like all our other Savannah vacation rentals, Forsyth Artist Retreat also provides access to our heated pool complex on Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016163075342774391,"social_amenities":0.8625659942626953,"party_restriction":0.0009088069200515747,"nearby_nightlife":0.4745037853717804}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013399629853665829,"social_amenities":0.0422353520989418,"party_restriction":0.00422828970476985,"nearby_nightlife":0.0047673750668764114}},{"text":"While you're staying at our Savannah vacation homes, be sure to check out all the wonderful history and tradition of Savannah. This town has a rich and fascinating history. Take a walking tour of the Historic District to view antebellum architecture or visit the Savannah History Museum to learn more about the town. Savannah might be historic, but it's also one of the leading regions for modern art enthusiasts. Visit the SCAD Museum of Art to see cutting edge exhibits, or go to the City Market to see items produced by local artisans.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035251706140115857,"social_amenities":0.002947803121060133,"party_restriction":0.0016306915786117315,"nearby_nightlife":0.24816569685935974}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Take a dip in the water, relax in the sunshine, or grill a nice lunch at our resort style swimming pool. Explore All of Savannah's Attractions Just a block away from Forsyth Park, Forsyth Artist Retreat is perfectly situated to show you all that Savannah has to offer. You can easily walk to local favorites like Analog Public House, The Sentient Bean, and Cuban Window Cafe. Our Savannah vacation rentals are also right by one of the stops on the free Savannah trolley. Ride the trolley downtown to experience all sorts of delicious foods, tasty beverages, and fun shopping opportunities.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003641707880888134,"social_amenities":0.030779758468270302,"party_restriction":0.001269739237613976,"nearby_nightlife":0.9896518588066101}},{"text":"Whatever your preferences, there's always plenty of fun things to do while you are staying at Forsyth Artist Retreat. Guest access Full kitchen Bar Seating for Four Flatscreen TV's Whirlpool Bath Private Deck with Seating WIFI Off-Street Parking Private Porch and Courtyard Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005218850448727608,"social_amenities":0.8637859225273132,"party_restriction":0.0006160523043945432,"nearby_nightlife":0.8577399849891663}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 21047","address":"918 ABERCORN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":12.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking compla