y access, and a quieter place to recharge, all while staying immersed in the charm and beauty of historic Savannah. Sleeping Configurations: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking like for this home? Parking is on-street and non-metered in the area. SVR-03249 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001448425027774647,"social_amenities":0.0009205890237353742,"party_restriction":0.0013178812805563211,"nearby_nightlife":0.03436191380023956}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The apartment enjoys great natural light for a garden level and offers a cozy, functional layout that works beautifully for couples, friends, or extended stays. With two well-appointed bedrooms and a full bathroom, the home feels both private and practical. The apartment includes a full kitchen, perfect for preparing light meals, enjoying morning coffee, or unwinding after a day exploring Savannah. While the city\u2019s renowned dining scene is just outside your door, having a comfortable space to dine in adds flexibility and ease\u2014especially for longer stays. Step outside and you\u2019re moments from Forsyth Park, iconic tree-lined streets, neighborhood caf\u00e9s, and some of Savannah\u2019s best restaurants.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002733021101448685,"social_amenities":0.0009351622429676354,"party_restriction":0.00032487011048942804,"nearby_nightlife":0.8660553693771362}},{"text":"The walkability of this location is hard to beat, allowing guests to experience the city at a relaxed, local pace. The garden apartment at Abercorn Manor is ideal for guests looking for a central location, easy access, and a quieter place to recharge, all while staying immersed in the charm and beauty of historic Savannah. Sleeping Configurations: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed What is parking l