Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property Unavailable: Essentials Essentials Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":162,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010703188308980316,"social_amenities":0.10871440917253494,"party_restriction":0.0006048393552191556,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023786805104464293}},{"text":"Just two blocks from Forsyth Park, this beautifully furnished 2-bedroom, 1-bath vacation rental blends modern comfort with timeless Southern charm\u2014making it an excellent choice for couples, families, business travelers, or small groups. With airy interiors, a fully equipped kitchen, cozy living areas, and access to a spacious shared backyard, Unit B offers a comfortable and convenient home base for exploring the Savannah Historic District entirely on foot. \u2b50\ufe0f HOME FEATURES \ud83d\udecb Living Room \u2714\ufe0eBright, welcoming, and ideal for unwinding after a day of sightseeing. \u2714\ufe0e50\" Smart TV with streaming apps \u2714\ufe0eComfortable seating for movie nights or relaxed mornings \u2714\ufe0eOpen, airy layout that makes the space feel light and inviting","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023988872999325395,"social_amenities":0.02215343527495861,"party_restriction":0.00028424221090972424,"nearby_nightlife":0.0020050646271556616}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Relax or socialize in the large shared backyard. \u2714\ufe0eOutdoor dining tables and seating \u2714\ufe0eBBQ grills for guest use \u2714\ufe0eShared parking lot with 1 space per unit, plus easy free street parking nearby \u2714\ufe0ePlease be considerate of other guests when using shared amenities. \ud83d\udccd LOCATION \u2014 DOWNTOWN SAVANNAH Stay in one of Savannah\u2019s most walkable and desirable neighborhoods: \ud83c\udf33 2 blocks to Forsyth Park \ud83c\udf7d Walk to restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and local boutiques \ud83c\udfa8 Near his