Therefore, we always advise that guests purchase travel insurance for their trip, just in case!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001209295223816298,"social_amenities":0.0005591068184003234,"party_restriction":0.9984538555145264,"nearby_nightlife":0.7973540425300598}},{"text":"\u2714 Comfortable, well-equipped apartment with modern amenities \u2714 Perfect for couples, families, business travelers, and small groups \u2714 Spacious shared backyard with grills \u2714 Easy self check-in and convenient parking options \u2728 Book Unit C for a relaxed, walkable Savannah getaway\u2014where historic charm meets modern comfort. Guest access The unit is fully equipped with everything you need\u2014feel right at home. Other things to note -No smoking in the condo. Any violations will result in a $250 smoke abatement fee. -No pets or animals permitted. Unannounced animals will result in a $200 additional cleaning fee and your reservation being cancelled without refund. -Four guests maximum at any time.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":97,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010689785267459229,"social_amenities":0.0019144678954035044,"party_restriction":0.9851704239845276,"nearby_nightlife":0.009341731667518616}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"No parties or events. Violations will result in cancellation of the stay without refund. -Please observe neighborhood quiet hours between 10pm-8am. -Please be considerate of the guests below in the first floor unit in reference to noise & movement during quiet hours. MODERATE CANCELLATION POLICY: Full refund for cancellations up to 5 days prior to arrival. No refund after that. We do not make exceptions to this, for any reason, including weather, illness, or other circumstance that interrupts your travel (whether it is within your control or not), and do not accept date changes. Therefore, we always advise that guests purchase travel insurance for their trip, just in case!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","lin