u00e9 scene, boutique shopping, celebrated restaurants, and the city\u2019s most beautiful squares. If you\u2019re looking for a well-designed, centrally located home with historic charm and the trusted service of Lucky Savannah, Park View A is an exceptional choice for your Savannah stay. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: King Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa Non-metered Parking","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.007438734173774719,"social_amenities":0.0017241784371435642,"party_restriction":0.0012012228835374117,"nearby_nightlife":0.9675971865653992}},{"text":"The primary bedroom includes a queen-sized bed, decorative fireplace, TV, and a private en-suite bathroom with a tub/shower combination. The second bedroom features a king-sized bed and TV, while the third offers a queen bed and TV. A second full bathroom with a walk-in shower is conveniently located off the living room. Additional conveniences include an in-unit washer and dryer, central heating and air, and fast Wi-Fi to keep you connected throughout your stay. Guests enjoy a shared entryway and access to a charming front porch with beautiful views of Forsyth Park\u2014perfect for morning coffee or relaxing in the afternoon sun.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021568436932284385,"social_amenities":0.004306378774344921,"party_restriction":0.00039970435318537056,"nearby_nightlife":0.02686329185962677}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1629054926490803508","title":"Bright 2BR Historic Apartment Overlooking Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1629054926490803508","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00529"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1629054926490803508","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6f108ac01937f331ad8045c589372279952faeff7aa10dacca21c4b225fb6e95","chunks":6,"words":619,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9367601871490479,"party_welcome":0.0020