d and decorative only. From Park View B, you\u2019re perfectly positioned to explore Savannah by foot or bike. Forsyth Park hosts year-round events, tennis courts, the iconic Forsyth Fountain, and the popular Saturday Farmers\u2019 Market. In every direction, you\u2019ll find charming squares, boutique shops, local caf\u00e9s, and Savannah\u2019s best restaurants\u2014all just a short stroll away. If you\u2019re looking for a light-filled, centrally located getaway with true historic character and the trusted hospitality of Lucky Savannah, Park View B is a wonderful home base for your time in the Hostess City. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Two Double Beds","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002066131681203842,"social_amenities":0.004716327413916588,"party_restriction":0.0056991265155375,"nearby_nightlife":0.9641488790512085}},{"text":"Beautifully updated historic apartment perched on the top floor of a classic Savannah home, this two-bedroom, one-bath residence sits directly across from Forsyth Park, placing guests steps away from one of Savannah\u2019s most beloved landmarks. The space Welcome to Park View B, a beautifully updated historic apartment originally built in 1875 and thoughtfully modernized to offer both charm and comfort. Perched on the top floor of a classic Savannah home, this two-bedroom, one-bath residence sits directly across from the south end of Forsyth Park, placing guests steps away from one of Savannah\u2019s most beloved landmarks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013507888652384281,"social_amenities":0.9367601871490479,"party_restriction":0.0631050318479538,"nearby_nightlife":0.004338928032666445}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Beautifully updated historic apartment perched on the top floor of a classic Savannah home, this two-bedroom, one-bath residence sits directly across from Forsyth Park, placing guests steps away from one of Savannah\u2019s mos