n the Hostess City. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: Two Double Beds","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002066131681203842,"social_amenities":0.004716327413916588,"party_restriction":0.0056991265155375,"nearby_nightlife":0.9641488790512085}},{"text":"The primary bedroom includes a plush king-sized bed, a generous walk-in closet, and a flat-screen TV. The guest bedroom\u2014accessible through the primary bedroom\u2014offers two double beds and a TV, making it a cozy space for families or close friends. The full bathroom features a spacious walk-in shower, and the in-unit washer and dryer ensure added convenience for longer stays. The apartment also offers central heating and air, along with wireless internet to keep you connected throughout your visit. Guests enter through a shared entryway and can enjoy the charming shared front porch with beautiful views of Forsyth Park\u2014a peaceful spot for your morning coffee or evening wind-down.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002723882207646966,"social_amenities":0.0028411271050572395,"party_restriction":0.0005844465340487659,"nearby_nightlife":0.061818189918994904}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 26011","address":"1002 DRAYTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26139143327","date":"2026-05-19","type":"42 PAST THEFT SUSP 1060","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1002 Drayton St","recorded_pin":"20044 26011","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1207156682496370987","title":"Stylish Forsyth Park Retreat \u2013 Walk Everywhere","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1207156682496370987","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03022"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1207156682496370987","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"7ea909544dc0067732aec9aedace32bdcd3eaa4b6ede1d4230d0fd104bf92e20","chunks":6,"words":536,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.784123957157135,"party_welcome":0.0007945460383780301,"social_amenities":0.784123957157135,"party_restriction":0.014956819824874401,"nearby_nightlife":0.9832967519760132,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Stay in the heart of Savannah, directly across from iconic Forsyth Park! Built in 1892, this stunning Victorian home blends historic charm with modern comfort. Your second-floor retreat features soaring ceilings, original hardwood floors, and grand windows that flood the space with light. Step outside to stroll the park and enjoy the best of the city at your doorstep. Pets considered with pre-approval and additional fee. SVR-03022 The space Step into Savannah\u2019s storied charm with this second-floor unit overlooking iconic Forsyth Park. Blending timeless architecture with modern comfort, this beautifully preserved space features original hardwood floors, tall windows, fireplaces (non-operational), and intricate trim work\u2014offering the true historic Savannah experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022762513253837824,"social_amenities":0.784123957157135,"party_restriction":0.014956819824874401,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016480536432936788}},{"text":"Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Bikes Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals