l hardwood floors, tall windows, fireplaces (non-operational), and intricate trim work\u2014offering the true historic Savannah experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022762513253837824,"social_amenities":0.784123957157135,"party_restriction":0.014956819824874401,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016480536432936788}},{"text":"Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Shared patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Bikes Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":130,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007945460383780301,"social_amenities":0.006161293480545282,"party_restriction":0.0015592891722917557,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028454926796257496}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u2714 Access to a charming shared courtyard on the side of the home\u2014perfect for morning coffee or evening wine \ud83d\ude97 PARKING \u2714 Free street parking available nearby \u2714 Please check posted signs for street sweeping zones and times to avoid tickets \ud83d\udccd LOCATION HIGHLIGHT Right across from Forsyth Park\u2014walk to historic squares, caf\u00e9s, museums, and all the beauty Savannah has to offer. Guest access You will have the entire unit to yourselves. This is the second floor unit, there is another separate unit below. Other things to note Pets require pre approval and additional fee!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000367127446224913,"social_amenities":0.0005577867850661278,"party_restriction":0.001398026361130178,"nearby_nightlife":0.9832967519760132}},{"text":"This is a second floor unit - there is another, condo on the first floor below. There is free on street parking - be sure to check the posted sweep times, they vary depending which side of the street you park. We do not h