34309190697968,"social_amenities":0.0009484283509664237,"party_restriction":0.0007533908355981112,"nearby_nightlife":0.06386476010084152}},{"text":"Under new management as of fall 2025, this historic Savannah home has been fully renovated in the summer of 2025 and professionally redesigned with all-new furnishings, upgraded HVAC and insulation, refreshed millwork, lighting, paint, and d\u00e9cor. Featuring five bedrooms, four bathrooms, and a balcony overlooking Forsyth Park, it blends modern comfort with timeless charm. Managed by Verdant House, a local Superhost team known for design and hospitality excellence. SVR-01722 The space This is a large stand-alone home! It's a 5-bedroom, 7 beds plus a queen size sofa bed pull-out, and 5-bathroom beauty with multiple sprawling porches and a balcony with views of Forsyth Park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003343879070598632,"social_amenities":0.0011295031290501356,"party_restriction":0.0006306715658865869,"nearby_nightlife":0.002344519831240177}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":148,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.337519102497026e-05,"social_amenities":0.10785186290740967,"party_restriction":0.00072484026895836,"nearby_nightlife":0.001533815055154264}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Ba