r. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything! We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008489721803925931,"social_amenities":0.0008589648059569299,"party_restriction":0.0005331732099875808,"nearby_nightlife":0.04404015839099884}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 27032","address":"1018 ABERCORN ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"14176520","title":"NEW Top-Floor 2BR near Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/14176520","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02346"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"14176520","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"db1207af92918e92b90d17dca9fe95572bed0162ba7b74e3b9e8ba5434d7608c","chunks":8,"words":656,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0026715064886957407,"party_welcome":0.00075778883183375,"social_amenities":0.003178572515025735,"party_restriction":0.0023161573335528374,"nearby_nightlife":0.9882877469062805,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Completed in August 2026, this two-bedroom apartment occupies the third floor of new building, just one block from Forsyth Park. Settle into a fresh, light-filled home base in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District. An entirely new guest experience in the same walkable Savannah location we've hosted in for years. Inside, you'll find two queen bedrooms, a sleek marble bathroom, a well-equipped kitchen, private laundry and an inviting living area with oversized windows. SVR-02346 The space Welcome to Apartment B, our new third-floor retreat in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District. The apartment was designed for travelers who want the convenience of a modern space while being able to experience much of Savannah on foot.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014159985585138202,"social_amenities":0.0026715064886957407,"party_restriction":0.001120924367569387,"nearby_nightlife":0.009264551103115082}},{"text":"It's ideal for breakfast before heading out, reheating leftovers from one of Savannah's restaurants, or putting together a casual meal at home. BATHROOM The newly constructed bathroom has a clean, modern feel with marble flooring, a generous walk-in shower and open built-in storage stocked with fresh towels and bath essentials. PRIVATE LAUNDRY Apartment B has its own combination washer/dryer tucked inside the unit, as well as an iron and ironing board. LOCATION One of our favorite things about this apartment is where it puts you.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000335932505549863,"social_amenities":0.0018126199720427394,"party_restriction":0.0006591565324924886,"nearby_nightlife":0.04299336299300194}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Forsyth Park is just one block away, while Savannah's Historic District stretches out to the north and the restaurants, bars, coffee shops and independent businesses of Starland are to the south. That means you can spend the morning walking beneath the oaks around Forsyth, head downtown for sightseeing, and wander toward Starland for dinner without necessarily getting in a car. The free DOT shuttle also stops nearby and provides an easy way to explore more of downtown Savannah. Guest access Apartment B is entirely yours during your stay. Check-in is contactless and simple.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00075778883183375,"social_amenities":0.003178572515025735,"party_restriction":0.001086810021661222,"nearby_nightlife":0.9882877469062805}},{"text":"It's ideal for breakfast before heading out, reheating leftovers from one of Savannah's restaurants, or putting together a casual meal at home. BATHROOM The newly constructed bathroom has a clean, modern feel with marble flooring, a generous walk-in shower and open built-in storage stocked with fresh towels and bath essentials. PRIVATE LAUNDRY Apartment B has its own combination washer/dryer tucked inside the unit, as well as an iron and ironing board. LOCATION One of our favorite things about this apartment is where it puts you.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000335932505549863,"social_amenities":0.0018126199720427394,"party_restriction":0.0006591565324924886,"nearby_nightlife":0.04299336299300194}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Forsyth Park is just one block away, while Savannah's Historic District stretches out to the north and the restaurants, bars, coffee shops and independent businesses of Starland are to the south. That means you can spend the morning walking beneath the oaks around Forsyth, head downtown for sightseeing, and wander toward Starland for dinner without necessarily getting in a car. The free DOT shuttle also stops nearby and provides an easy way to explore more of downtown Savannah. Guest access Apartment B is entirely yours during your stay. Check-in is contactless and simple.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00075778883183375,"social_amenities":0.003178572515025735,"party_restriction":0.001086810021661222,"nearby_nightlife":0.9882877469062805}},{"text":"Completed in August 2026, this two-bedroom apartment occupies the third floor of new building, just one block from Forsyth Park. Settle into a fresh, light-filled home base in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District. An entirely new guest experience in the same walkable Savannah loca