ext":"Forsyth Park is just one block away, while Savannah's Historic District stretches out to the north and the restaurants, bars, coffee shops and independent businesses of Starland are to the south. That means you can spend the morning walking beneath the oaks around Forsyth, head downtown for sightseeing, and wander toward Starland for dinner without necessarily getting in a car. The free DOT shuttle also stops nearby and provides an easy way to explore more of downtown Savannah. Guest access Apartment B is entirely yours during your stay. Check-in is contactless and simple.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":94,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00075778883183375,"social_amenities":0.003178572515025735,"party_restriction":0.001086810021661222,"nearby_nightlife":0.9882877469062805}},{"text":"It's ideal for breakfast before heading out, reheating leftovers from one of Savannah's restaurants, or putting together a casual meal at home. BATHROOM The newly constructed bathroom has a clean, modern feel with marble flooring, a generous walk-in shower and open built-in storage stocked with fresh towels and bath essentials. PRIVATE LAUNDRY Apartment B has its own combination washer/dryer tucked inside the unit, as well as an iron and ironing board. LOCATION One of our favorite things about this apartment is where it puts you.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000335932505549863,"social_amenities":0.0018126199720427394,"party_restriction":0.0006591565324924886,"nearby_nightlife":0.04299336299300194}}]}}},{"listing_id":"18810988","title":"NEW Bright 2BR \u2022 1 Block to Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/18810988","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02345"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"18810988","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"04a646010cbf55eafa938ef115b93d872e20d9dc0cd60ebb72f1522dca2cf978","chunks":6,"words":527,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.01253834180533886,"party_we