f 4 guests is allowed as we have only one bathroom and noise travels to the lower unit. A living room, dining room and a fully equipped kitchen. One full bath. Please note that the front and back stairs to this apartment are steep. Please note: We are on the corner of a through street so you will hear typical city street traffic.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031919751199893653,"social_amenities":0.0009596020099706948,"party_restriction":0.7561425566673279,"nearby_nightlife":0.00730659207329154}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"A spacious Victorian four blocks east of Forsyth Park with off street parking for one car. We pay the full 15.5% Airbnb service fee on behalf of guests. This is a duplex, and the lower unit is also a short term vacation rental. Please note: Out of respect for guests in the other unit and our neighbors, we prefer not to host those coming to Savannah to party and respectfully ask that they book one of the many other, more suitable, rentals downtown. Please see the House Rules. 4 people maximum. The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001791299000615254,"social_amenities":0.0009948995430022478,"party_restriction":0.979900062084198,"nearby_nightlife":0.8644049763679504}},{"text":"Check out Savannah Joy at: www.airbnb. com/h/savannah-joy Located in the south historic Victorian District just 4 blocks east of Forsyth Park and 1.3 miles from the river with huge vaulted ceilings, numerous windows allowing lots of natural light, transom windows above every door and adorable decorative fire places throughout; this southern retreat, built in the year Nineteen Thirteen for J.J. Waring, welcomes you in true historic Savannah style. Off Street parking for one car is available in the back of the house. There is also free street parking in front, and on the side of the house.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003820472629740834,"social_amenities":0.