oms. Amazing location one block from Forsyth Park. One off street parking spot can be used behind the house if you have a compact vehicle and extra free public parking on the street. Gorgeous remodeled bathrooms and kitchen. This apartment is on the 2nd and 3rd floors of the home and requires use of stairs. There is no elevator so this is unsuitable for anyone who cannot walk up stairs. The space City of Savannah SVR-01611 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019658035307656974,"social_amenities":0.0025224797427654266,"party_restriction":0.0027007923927158117,"nearby_nightlife":0.005096480716019869}},{"text":"Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":98,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002910627517849207,"social_amenities":0.0016527262050658464,"party_restriction":0.004669537767767906,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009365808218717575}}]}}},{"listing_id":"53906131","title":"By Forsyth Park, W/ King Bed +New Bath & Kitchen!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53906131","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01612"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"53906131","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"444dae245ef53fe7b32f05fc91d9765d0f5fc7e8026279f9874e8bd8e077b02a","chunks":8,"words":804,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.003948646131902933,"party_welcome":0.00037510122638195753,"social_amenities":0.003948646131902933,"party_restriction":0.0008752821013331413,"nearby_nightlife":0.8032517433166504,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"It can be somewhat like a cartoon picnic where they march in a line to find the food. To avoid this try to keep your snacks contained in air tight baggies, the refrigerator, or buy single serve packets and put the trash in the outdoor trash cans as soon as possible. The following is standard Savannah Luxury Rentals information: We provide sheets, toilet paper and soap. If you prefer thick cushioned toilet paper bring it along but use it sparingly in our older plumbing and never flush \"flushable\" wipes or other products that are likely to cause a clog. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.370478801429272e-05,"social_amenities":0.003948646131902933,"party_restriction":0.0006795015069656074,"nearby_nightlife":0.00040953565621748567}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Shampoo Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Coffee maker: drip coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Services Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property Unavailable: Hair dryer Hair dryer","section":"AMENITIES","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.952416151762009e-05,"social_amenities":0.0034363348968327045,"party_restriction":0.0005122256698086858,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008785500540398061}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This historic building has been renovated from top to bottom with gorgeous modern finishes. It is hard to believe the home is from 1909 when you are inside! However, your immersion in Historic Savannah is just outside the door. Forsyth Park is less than a city block away from the apartment. While literally hundreds of restaurants and shops are within 2 miles of the home some of the highlights are in the neighborhood section. City of Savannah SVR-01612 The space The kitchen, dining and living room are one large open floor plan with soaring ceilings. There is a separate bedroom with a King bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003751012263