d0b5de4397900665b76ba3cf66564afe701786684ff9056","chunks":5,"words":521,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8356630802154541,"party_welcome":0.001419230131432414,"social_amenities":0.8356630802154541,"party_restriction":0.08798542618751526,"nearby_nightlife":0.982894241809845,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Welcome to The Squares of Savannah, a stunning collection of five unique and thoughtfully designed apartments located in a prime location. Surrounded by a beautifully manicured courtyard and garden, in the heart of Savannah\u2019s historic district. The space Welcome to The Squares of Savannah, a stunning collection of five unique and thoughtfully designed apartments located in a prime location. Surrounded by a beautifully manicured courtyard and garden, this property offers a charming retreat in the heart of Savannah\u2019s historic district. The Chatham is the centerpiece of this historic home\u2014a spacious 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom parlor unit that comfortably accommodates up to 6 guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001419230131432414,"social_amenities":0.8356630802154541,"party_restriction":0.08798542618751526,"nearby_nightlife":0.009195866994559765}},{"text":"Overlooking the picturesque Forsyth Park, this apartment is elegantly furnished with tasteful finishes, blending historic charm with modern comfort. The first bedroom features a cozy twin trundle bed, making it an ideal space for children or solo travelers. The second bedroom offers both a queen bed, while the third bedroom boasts a luxurious king bed for ultimate relaxation. Both upstairs bedrooms include ensuite bathrooms and ample storage space, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay for all. What Makes The Squares of Savannah Special? - Unbeatable Location: Perfectly situated on Forsyth Park, guests can enjoy Savannah\u2019s largest green space just outside their door.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018160777108278126,"social_amenities":0.002826026640832424,"party_restriction":0.0008216978167183697,"nearby_nightlife":0.060789261013269424}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Welcome to The Squares of Savannah, a stunning collection of five unique and thoughtfully designed apartments located in a prime location. Surrounded by a beautifully manicured courtyard and garden, in the heart of Savannah\u2019s historic district. The space Welcome to The Squares of Savannah, a stunning collection of five unique and thoughtfully designed apartments located in a prime location. Surrounded by a beautifully manicured courtyard and garden, this property offers a charming retreat in the heart of Savannah\u2019s historic district. The Chatham is the centerpiece of this historic home\u2014a spacious 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom parlor unit that comfortably accommodates up to 6 guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001419230131432414,"social_amenities":0.8356630802154541,"party_restriction":0.08798542618751526,"nearby_nightlife":0.009195866994559765}},{"text":"The park is ideal for morning strolls, weekend farmers\u2019 markets, and leisurely afternoons. Additionally, the property is just steps from local coffee shops, renowned restaurants, and the vibrant Starland District. - Enchanting Outdoor Spaces: The lushly landscaped courtyard provides a serene space for all guests to enjoy. Whether you\u2019re savoring a morning coffee, an evening glass of wine, or simply soaking in the beauty of Savannah, this shared garden area offers a peaceful escape. The Chatham at The Squares of Savannah promises a memorable stay filled with charm, comfort, and the perfect blend of historic elegance and modern luxury. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Twin Trundle Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000346280139638111,"social_amenities":0.011600915342569351,"party_restriction":0.00209213444031775,"nearby_nightli