71123605967,"party_restriction":0.00031294801738113165,"nearby_nightlife":0.0028766528703272343}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Experience Savannah's rich history in this 3-bed, 3-bath gem by architect Alfred S. Eichberg. The fully renovated and beautifully decorated unit offers a custom kitchen, shared porch, spacious bedrooms, and historic charm. Featuring a spacious design perfect for six guests, The Alfred is ideal for unwinding after a day of adventure. Just 2 mins to Forsyth Park, 20 from SAV International. SVR-01316 The space Constructed in 1891 and believed to be one of the four remaining residential structures designed by the renowned architect Alfred S. Eichberg, this unit is truly a piece of Savannah's history.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037073029670864344,"social_amenities":0.0010798475705087185,"party_restriction":0.00043480534804984927,"nearby_nightlife":0.00822640210390091}},{"text":"Patio or balcony Parking and facilities Free street parking Services Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00036102166632190347,"social_amenities":0.0014321423368528485,"party_restriction":0.0015367652522400022,"nearby_nightlife":0.0029144915752112865}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance 