8358717,"party_restriction":0.9978989362716675,"nearby_nightlife":0.544082522392273}},{"text":"Originally born in New York, Eichberg moved to Georgia and was commissioned on notable structures including the Telfair Hospital, New Hanover County Courthouse (NC), and Eichberg Hall of the Savannah College of Art and Design. Known for his Romanesque revival style of design, you\u2019ll find incredible detail and architectural aspects throughout the Eichberg Manor. Located on the lower level of the entire residential home the manor boasts vaulted ceilings, original hardwood floors, and an open concept that makes the residence feel spacious and refreshing. In the living room relax and unwind on an oversized sectional while you stream your favorite shows on the brand-new TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00029747566441074014,"social_amenities":0.00111472443677485,"party_restriction":0.0004773337859660387,"nearby_nightlife":0.014809822663664818}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 33015","address":"107 E PARK AVE","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":5,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24120126137","date":"2024-04-29","type":"1-J ASSAULT EMS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 E Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20044 33015","side":"direct"},{"number":"24259271280","date":"2024-09-15","type":"49 MENTAL PT-VIOLENT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 E Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20044 33015","side":"direct"},{"number":"24095100051","date":"2024-04-04","type":"9 PAST HIT-