.0020452665630728006}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: dresser Entertainment HDTV with premium cable, standard cable Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Board games Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Security cameras on front porch, side of building, and in shared building foyer. None inside of condo. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit","section":"AMENITIES","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014285213546827435,"social_amenities":0.012367164716124535,"party_restriction":0.0015579721657559276,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012539612362161279}},{"text":"This beautifully renovated modern condo on the 2nd floor of our gorgeous Victorian home was completed in September 2016! The kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, appliances, and furniture are all brand new! The original heart pine floors have been refinished and are a perfect reflection of the history of this Savannah estate. Enjoy the Southern weather on a private balcony, or take a walk to the famous Forsyth Park less than half of a block away! SVR-00563 The space Natural light flows in from the large, original windows that wrap around the condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032670292421244085,"social_amenities":0.0020424751564860344,"party_restriction":0.0012037766864523292,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005992958904244006}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"High ceilings and restored floors capture the history of the 130 year old home, and our updates add some modern comforts! We think it's just the right blend of old and new! Guest access The whole second floor condo is yours! Entry to both the condo and the building front door are keyless. You will be provided with your code upon booking confirmation so you may come and go as you please. Other things to note Don't be afraid to reach out if you need anything! We live super close-by and are always happy to help out, even mid-stay. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000929053348954767,"social_amenities":0.0014648603973910213,"party_restriction":0.000978573807515204,"nearby_nightlife":0.002731718821451068}},{"text":"Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 140 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace Includes a table Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel gas stove Oven Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises Free street parking","section":"AMENITIES","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000338180543622002,"social_amenities":0.011248867027461529,"party_restriction":0.0005299932672642171,"nearby_nightlife":0.0020452665630728006}}]}}},{"listing_id":"20959793","title":"Romantic Getaway Atop Victorian - Steps to Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/20959793","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-00716"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"20959793","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"105d93cfe7a25e136d1c2f34bb200dc26d36a8142e08cd813c9428dd5d10030b","chunks":5,"words":428,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0037280188407748938,"party_welcome":0.0004283749731257558,