igned to complement the main house (circa 1916). Reclaimed materials from the previous structure that stood at this location were used in the construction.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00048135046381503344,"social_amenities":0.0010330514051020145,"party_restriction":0.001092378282919526,"nearby_nightlife":0.9864987134933472}},{"text":"You will have access to the entire second floor of the garage (550 sq ft) and the back patio. The patio is shared with the main house. This is a fully licensed Short Term Vacation Rental. SVR-00700 Other things to note Please enjoy yourself and have a good time, but also respect the space. Thank you! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002255922183394432,"social_amenities":0.013952101580798626,"party_restriction":0.07497455179691315,"nearby_nightlife":0.022548766806721687}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20044 35012","address":"107 W DUFFY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24166175920","date":"2024-06-14","type":"22 Found/Surrendered WEAPON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W DUFFY ST","recorded_pin":"20044 35012","side":"direct"},{"number":"24224236322","date":"2024-08-11","type":"24-4 UNWANTED person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W Duffy St","recorded_pin":"20044 35012","side":"direct"},{"number":"25012010915","date":"2025-01-12","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"107 W Duffy St","recorded_pin":"20044 35012","side":"direct"},{"number":"24124131152","date":"2024-05-03","type":"41 PAST attempted VEH THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"105 W DUFFY ST","recorded_pin":"20044 35013","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24192203667","date":"2024-07-10","type":"STRUCTURE FIRE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"111 W Duffy St","recorded_pin":"20044 35011","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1073272010720529278","title":"Victorian Apt at Forsyth Park, Savannah, 2nd Floor","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1073272010720529278","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02820"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1073272010720529278","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"0ea98d5680b05d845236bf2cee1aa41018c2dbf21415ae0b0d32fd805a821011","chunks":6,"words":513,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.025784838944673538,"party_welcome":0.021573945879936218,"social_amenities":0.025784838944673538,"party_restriction":0.04460231214761734,"nearby_nightlife":0.9532452821731567,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Portable fans Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property There is a video security camera in the lobby of the apartment building. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 335 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Kitchen and dining Kitchen","section":"AMENITIES","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000353994284523651,"social_amenities":0.025784838944673538,"party_restriction":0.00044814360444433987,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009821210987865925}},{"text":"Step into Savannah\u2019s history without sacrificing modern comfort. This bright, beautifully renovated 1-bedroom flat sits on the second floor of a 150-year-old Victorian home, just one block from iconic Forsyth Park. Here, historic character meets thoughtful upgrades: soaring ceilings, tall windows, decorative fireplaces, and repurposed original wood details blend seamlessly with a fully modern kitchen, keyless entry, and high-speed Wi-Fi. The space Perfect for couples, solo travelers, or anyone looking to explore Savannah\u2019s most beloved sights on foot, our home offers both charm and convenience in one of the city\u2019s most picturesque neighborhoods. -650 sq ft of light-filled living space with vintage architectural touches.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020788110850844532,"social_amenities":0.013494981452822685,"party_restriction":0.0012849700869992375,"nearby_nightlife":0.0027482593432068825}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Thoughtful amenities \u2013 extra towels, snacks, and flexible baggage drop-off. Whether you\u2019re here for a weekend getaway, a special event in Forsyth Park, or to explore Savannah\u2019s squares and waterfront, our home puts you close to it all while offering a quiet, comfortable retreat to come back to. NOTE: Two adult guests are permitted per reservation overnight. Any additional overnight guests will be charged $50.00 per night, per guest. STVR Certificate: SVR-02820 Other things to note Search online for \u201cvisit Savannah\u201d and you\u2019ll find Savannah\u2019s official \u201cguide\u201d to the city.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.021573945879936218,"social_amenities":0.0016219273675233126,"party_restriction":0.04460231214761734,"nearby_nightlife":0.015950990840792656}},{"text":"-Spacious bedroom with a plush queen bed and en-suite bathroom. -Cozy living room ideal for relaxing after a day of sightseeing. -Fully equipped kitchen with full-size appliances, Keurig cof