s away. Whether your plans include strolling River Street, visiting Tybee Island, or savoring Savannah\u2019s dining scene, you\u2019ll find this home an ideal base. From first-time visitors to seasoned Savannah travelers, guests often say this is their favorite stay for its location, comfort, and welcoming feel. Experience the perfect blend of history, charm, and modern comfort. Your Savannah story starts here! NOTE: Two adult guests are permitted per reservation overnight. Any additional overnight guests will be charged $50.00 per night, per guest. STVR Certificate: SVR-02819 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00012862365110777318,"social_amenities":0.0018354685744270682,"party_restriction":0.002483509946614504,"nearby_nightlife":0.07421823590993881}},{"text":"Step into a spacious 1st-floor apartment in a restored 150-year-old Victorian townhouse, just one block from Forsyth Park. Blending historic charm with modern comfort, this 1-bed/1-bath retreat features high ceilings, hardwood floors, a plush queen bed, full kitchen, free street parking, and walkable access to Savannah\u2019s caf\u00e9s, squares, and sights. The space Welcome to your Savannah getaway! A charming 1st-floor apartment in a beautifully preserved 150-year-old Victorian townhouse, perfectly situated just one block from Forsyth Park. Inside, 1,050 sq/ft of thoughtfully curated space combines old-world character with modern convenience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019065875676460564,"social_amenities":0.26706236600875854,"party_restriction":0.001966889714822173,"nearby_nightlife":0.057219959795475006}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Original hardwood floors, high ceilings, and tall windows bathe the rooms in light, while plush furnishings invite you to relax after exploring. The spacious bedroom offers a comfortable queen-sized bed and an en-suite bathroom. In the living area, unwind on the oversized secti