ting_id":"1371537033574145928","title":"The Maiden Voyage|Themed|Workspace|Backyard|Grill","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1371537033574145928","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03193"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1371537033574145928","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"0e4af46eb94f944b0aa876675ab56438b2834fdac66f19f9fd42a97ca2fbc45d","chunks":18,"words":1744,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9361534714698792,"party_welcome":0.1803048551082611,"social_amenities":0.9361534714698792,"party_restriction":0.0020562380086630583,"nearby_nightlife":0.9919954538345337,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"And for the sportier guests, a soccer ball and football lie ready to be used in our living room closet (with an air pump just in case). OUTDOOR SPACE Our backyard offers fresh air and lounging comfort complete with grill, dining table and chairs, and a charming suspended \u201cegg\u201d chair that you\u2019ll sink right into with childish delight. Take in the morning sun or cool down in the shade of the retractable umbrella. Our propane grill, full grill set, and even backup propane ensures you\u2019re ready for your very own BBQ meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008974856464192271,"social_amenities":0.9361534714698792,"party_restriction":0.00045926764141768217,"nearby_nightlife":0.0064269304275512695}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re whipping up a full night\u2019s dinner or just enjoying some tasty takeout, our fully-appointed kitchen is equipped to ensure you make the most of your meal. Even at The Maiden Voyage, we try to avoid sea-salty tap water, so we\u2019ve also got a water filter pitcher to convert the tap water into more delightfully drinkable H2O. Our electric oven and stovetop makes for quick cooking, with overhead microwave vent to keep the air flow fresh. Our dishwasher makes doing dishes a breeze, and our retractable screen door allows for some fresh air while you\u2019re cooking up a storm. PARKS & RECREATION Game on. Picnic on. Park on.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1803048551082611,"social_amenities":0.12028085440397263,"party_restriction":0.0001836539013311267,"nearby_nightlife":0.004419849254190922}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re whipping up a full night\u2019s dinner or just enjoying some tasty takeout, our fully-appointed kitchen is equipped to ensure you make the most of your meal. Even at The Maiden Voyage, we try to avoid sea-salty tap water, so we\u2019ve also got a water filter pitcher to convert the tap water into more delightfully drinkable H2O. Our electric oven and stovetop makes for quick cooking, with overhead microwave vent to keep the air flow fresh. Our dishwasher makes doing dishes a breeze, and our retractable screen door allows for some fresh air while you\u2019re cooking up a storm. PARKS & RECREATION Game on. Picnic on. Park on.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1803048551082611,"social_amenities":0.12028085440397263,"party_restriction":0.0001836539013311267,"nearby_nightlife":0.004419849254190922}},{"text":"Sip a morning cup of coffee from the Keurig as you sink into the West Elm couch or the suspended egg chair in the sunny backyard. Walk 2 minutes to verdant Forsyth Park for a morning stroll and catch the Saturday Farmers Market before meandering downtown to take in River Street and more of Savannah\u2019s city squares. Swing back by The Maiden Voyage to grab our guest picnic basket - fully equipped with utensils, tools, plates, blanket, wine holder, and cups for any snacker\u2019s or wino\u2019s needs - for a sunset picnic in Forsyth stocked with some healthy groceries from Brighter Day Natural Foods across the street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0368427038192749,"social_amenities":0.038566041737794876,"party_restriction":0.00040906801586970687,"nearby_nightlife":0.6519336700439453}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"And for the sportier guests, a soccer ball and football lie ready to be used in our living room closet (with an air pump just in case). OUTDOOR SPACE Our backyard offers fresh air and lounging comfort complete with grill, dining table and chairs, and a charming suspended \u201cegg\u201d chair that you\u2019ll sink right into with childish delight. Take in the morning sun or cool down in the shade of the retractable umbrella. Our propane grill, full grill set, and even backup propane ensures you\u2019re ready for your very own BBQ meal.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008974856464192271,"social_amenities":0.9361534714698792,"party_restriction":0.00045926764141768217,"nearby_nightlife":0.0064269304275512695}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re whipping up a full night\u2019s dinner or just enjoying some tasty takeout, our fully-appointed kitchen is equipped to ensure you make the most of your meal. Even at The Maiden Voyage, we try to avoid sea-salty tap water, so we\u2019ve also got a water filter pitcher to convert the tap water into more delightfully drinkable H2O. Our electric oven and stovetop makes for quick cooking, with overhead microwave vent to keep the air flow fresh. Our dishwasher makes doing dishes a breeze, and our retractable screen door allows for some fresh air while you\u2019re cooking up a storm. PARKS & RECREATION Game on. Picnic on. Park on.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1803048551082611,"social_amenities":0.12028085440397263,"party_restriction":0.0001836539013311267,"nearby_nightlife":0.004419849254190922}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Not included Unavailable: Private entrance Private entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":153,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020188000053167343,"social_amenities":0.008928084746003151,"party_restriction":0.0020562380086630583,"nearby_nightlife":0.0017728895181789994}},{"text":"Please note that the backyard space is shared with the downstairs unit and serves as emergency egress for the neighbors, so in the unlikely event there are others down there, you may need to wait a few minutes before enjoying or make a couple new friends :) PARKING There is free street parking immediately in front of the home that covers nearly the full length of our half of the block (~6 \u201ccar lengths\u201d wide), with backup parking on busy days available just around the corner, one block over, and on most adjacent streets. You\u2019ll be shared with simple yet detailed instructions for parking to ensure you\u2019re fully covered. LAUNDRY","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044911098666489124,"social_amenities":0.003291965462267399,"party_restriction":0.0014932922786101699,"nearby_nightlife":0.007039441727101803}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Go out to some of Savannah\u2019s iconic spots downtown or uptown, shop upscale or thrifty, or just stay in altogether for a cozy night with a fully-equipped kitchen, a propane grill and backyard setup ready for any grill sergeant, or numerous nearby cuisines for delivery or takeout. Enjoy a second sunset, this time via wall mural in the bedroom, before cuddling up in the king-size bed and winding down with your favorite movie on the bedroom\u2019s big-screen smart TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0021691538859158754,"social_amenities":0.02136857807636261,"party_restriction":0.0013801594031974673,"nearby_nightlife":0.9919954538345337}},{"text":"Look us up at \"Tangle & Tide Savannah\"! Historic charm meets modern maritime with lavish king bed, upscale queen sleeper sofa, 1 gig wifi+workstation, smart TVs, grill, and fully-equipped kitchen for all short-term sailors, last-minute landlubbers, and monthlong mermaids. Iconic Forsyth Park, year-round Farmers Market, and FREE daily shuttle to River Street are just steps away. All within 5 mins. *walking* you\u2019ll find local gems like Sentient Bean, Local 11ten, Corner Suite, & Bull Street Taco. The space Enjoy key-free access to this upstairs unit, a historic piece of early 20th century Savannah now tastefully modernized to fit the needs of any Savannah stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00034401044831611216,"social_amenities":0.007712926249951124,"party_restriction":0.0006536940345540643,"nearby_nightlife":0.9112454652786255}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1481884803615680939","title":"The Jungle Nook|Themed Getaway|Backyard|Grill","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1481884803615680939","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03194"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1481884803615680939","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"e4c9ea55bca3078eae494cf2fd2da9ff1e646ea23e06452a830d70057af6426c","chunks":18,"words":1625,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8280356526374817,"party_welcome":0.2499111145734787,"social_amenities":0.8280356526374817,"party_restriction":0.0013550047297030687,"nearby_nightlife":0.9968937635421753,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Jungle Nook features a sophisticated yet chic picnic basket containing all your picnicker needs [wine glasses, cooler, blanket, corkscrew, utensils, handkerchiefs, and more] to make your day out at majestic Forsyth Park or any of Savannah\u2019s verdant squares as easy and memorable as possible, without needing to pack anything extra yourself before your stay. At home or at the park, enjoy our selection of nearly a dozen board games and card games, curated to strike a healthy balance of word games, games of chance, strategy games, games of wit, and even a jungle puzzle. OUTDOOR SPACE","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006088829250074923,"social_amenities":0.8280356526374817,"party_restriction":0.0009270054870285094,"nearby_nightlife":0.005671860184520483}},{"text":"Our backyard offers fresh air and lounging comfort complete with grill, dining table and chairs, and a charming suspended \u201cegg\u201d chair that you\u2019ll sink right into with childish delight. Take in the morning sun or cool down in the shade of the retractable umbrella. Our propane grill, full grill set, and even backup propane ensures you\u2019re ready for your very own BBQ meal. Please note that the backyard space is shared with the upstairs unit and serves as emergency egress for the neighbors, so in the unlikely event there are others down there, you may need to wait a few minutes before enjoying or make a couple new friends :)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006236685905605555,"social_amenities":0.15220396220684052,"party_restriction":0.0005800095968879759,"nearby_nightlife":0.007065264042466879}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re whipping up a full night\u2019s dinner or just enjoying some tasty takeout, our fully-appointed kitchen is equipped to ensure you make the most of your meal. Even at The Jungle Nook, we try to avoid sea-salty tap water, so we\u2019ve also got a water filter pitcher to convert the tap water into more delightfully drinkable H2O. Our electric oven and stovetop makes for quick cooking, with overhead vent to keep the air flow fresh. Our dishwasher makes doing dishes a breeze, and our retractable screen door allows for some fresh air while you\u2019re cooking up a storm. PARKS & RECREATION Game on. Picnic on. Park on.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.2499111145734787,"social_amenities":0.10087157040834427,"party_restriction