our very own BBQ meal. Please note that the backyard space shares an open border with our neighbors and serves as their emergency egress - so please be respectful and reasonably-volumed when enjoying the backyard! PARKING There is free street parking immediately in front of the home that covers nearly the full length of our half of the block (~6 \u201ccar lengths\u201d wide), with backup parking on busy days available just around the corner, one block over, and on most adjacent streets.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004298883432056755,"social_amenities":0.8938606977462769,"party_restriction":0.0016151622403413057,"nearby_nightlife":0.01889834925532341}},{"text":"Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Beach essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044660220737569034,"social_amenities":0.5028863549232483,"party_restriction":0.0003647228586487472,"nearby_nightlife":0.001755630481056869}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Sip a morning cup of coffee from the Keurig as you sink into your apartment\u2019s couch or the suspended egg chair in the sunny backyard. Walk 2 minutes to verdant Forsyth Park for a morning stroll and catch the Saturday Farmers Market before meandering downtown to take in River Street and more of Savannah\u2019s city squares. Swing back by Tangle & Tide to grab our guest picnic baskets - fully equipped with utensils, tools, plates, blanket, wine holder, and cups for any snacker\u2019s or wino\u2019s needs - for a sunset picnic in Forsyth stocked with some healthy groceries from Brighter Day Natural Foods across the street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1171770915389061,"social_amenities":0.02296328917145729,"party_restriction":0.0003917306021321565,"nearby_nightlife":0.6585657000541687}},{"text":"Look us up at \"Tangle & Tide Savannah\"! Historic charm meets tasteful themes in Savannah's heart. Our private townhouse with separate upstairs/downstairs apts. means your group gets together when wanted and privacy when needed - with fully appointed kitchens, comfort-tuned quarters, and walkable to so many Historic District icons. Idyllic Forsyth Park + year-round Farmers Market are just steps away. All within 5 minutes *walking* are local gems like Sentient Bean,Local 11ten,& Corner Suite. The space Enjoy key-free access to *both* apartments in this historic piece of early 20th century Savannah now tastefully modernized to fit the needs of any Savannah stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016998562961816788,"social_amenities":0.0010563990799710155,"party_restriction":0.00040000947774387896,"nearby_nightlife":0.20833295583724976}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our propane grill, full grill set, and even backup propane ensures you\u2019re ready for your very own BBQ meal. Please note that the backyard space shares an open border with our neighbors and serves as their emergency egress - so please be respectful and reasonably-volumed when enjoying the backyard! PARKING There is free street parking immediately in front of the home that covers nearly the full length of our half of the block (~6 \u201ccar lengths\u201d wide), with backup parking on busy days available just around the corner, one block over, and on most adjacent streets.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":68,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004298883432056755,"social_amenities":0.8938606977462769,"party_restriction":0.0016151622403413057,"nearby_nightlife":0.01889834925532341}},{"text":"Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Beach essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044660220737569034,"social_amenities":0.5028863549232483,"party_restriction":0.0003647228586487472,"nearby_nightlife":0.001755630481056869}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Safe Clothing storage Entertainment TV Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Board games Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Portable fans Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We're big believers in privacy. Our backyard and front area cameras are *not* actively monitored and only checked retrospectively if an emergency is reported, or for package deliveries. Smoke alarm","section":"AMENITIES","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017778106848709285,"social_amenities":0.003821011632680893,"party_restriction":0.004378690849989653,"nearby_nightlife":0.006310394965112209}},{"text":"Nightstand and desk with soft glow lamps and USB and outlet surge protectors mean less fuss and fidgeting for your morning and nighttime routines. And a dresser and closet mean you, family, and/or friends can comfortably settle in during your stay without having to live out of your suitcase. Traveling with infants or toddlers? We've also got 2 pack n' play / travel cribs available to make the parents' stay a bit easier! WORKSTATION / STUDIO Each apartment has a workstation area in the bedroom, consisting of simple desk, lamp, and solid work surface for a laptop, notebook, and your cup of joe.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020122950081713498,"social_amenities":0.005220056511461735,"party_restriction":0.0029260432347655296,"nearby_nightlife":0.00138238409999758}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Go out to some of Savannah\u2019s iconic spots downtown or uptown, shop upscale or thrifty, or just stay in altogether for a cozy night and grill it up in the backyard if you\u2019d like. Enjoy a second splash of lushness, this time under the jungly full-wall mural, or a second sunset under the host\u2019s very own wall mural \u2013 before cuddling up in the king-size bed and winding down with your favorite movie on the bedroom\u2019s big-screen smart TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.008524684235453606,"social_amenities":0.09392062574625015,"party_restriction":0.0004469844570849091,"nearby_nightlife":0.996757447719574}},{"text":"Sip a morning cup of coffee from the Keurig as you sink into your apartment\u2019s couch or the suspended egg chair in the sunny backyard. Walk 2 minutes to verdant Forsyth Park for a morning stroll and catch the Saturday Farmers Market before meandering downtown to take in River Street and more of Savannah\u2019s city squares. Swing back by Tangle & Tide to grab our guest picnic baskets - fully equipped with utensils, tools, plates, blanket, wine holder, and cups for any snacker\u2019s or wino\u2019s needs - for a sunset picnic in Forsyth stocked with some healthy groceries from Brighter Day Natural Foods across the street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.1171770915389061,"social_amenities":0.02296328917145729,"party_restriction":0.0003917306021321565,"nearby_nightlife":0.6585657000541687}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20045 05001","address":"419 MONTGOMERY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":9.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"26831490","title":"Spacious Loft Among Oak Trees by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/26831490","guests":9.0,"permits":["SVR-01940"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"26831490","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"d4ce96d2ad713fa4014d74119dc350b8b9fab5afc2caf656f2c2d9052b2afe89","chunks":7,"words":598,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.0020225595217198133,"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.010181568562984467,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9840322136878967,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Just off of the living room, you'll find a spacious kitchen with every appliance needed for cooking a full meal. Choose to dine at the breakfast nook, or enjoy a meal al fresco on the private balcony overlooking downtown. All three bedrooms are also on this level, with the first being the primary with King size bed. Enjoy large closets, flat screen TVs, and en suite baths in every room. The primary bedroom is especially spacious and boasts beautiful views of downtown. The full bath is en suite with Jack and Jill doors to the hall. A daybed is also available in the main hall to allow guests more space.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001300973235629499,"social_amenities":0.0020225595217198133,"party_restriction":0.00019236428488511592,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009028883068822324}},{"text":"Bedroom 1: Queen Size Bed Bedroom 3: Twin with Trundle Bed Main Hall: Twin Size Daybed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa Parking: Metered Parking Parking for this home is on-street and metered, with enforcement by the City of Savannah Monday through Saturday, 8am to 5pm. Guests may conveniently pay using the ParkSavannah app, feed the meter or parking kiosks directly, or utilize a nearby public parking garage. Pre-paid visitor parking passes are available for purchase at the Parking and Mobility Services office. Please take note of posted Sweep Zone signs when parking on the street. SVR-01940 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":6.859875429654494e-05,"social_amenities":0.0009192432044073939,"party_restriction":0.00042267225217074156,"nearby_nightlife":0.002389830769971013}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}},{"text":"Stay in the heart of the Historic District but with the modern amenities you enjoy on vacation! Up to nine Lucky guests will call this modern second-level loft \"home\". The space Located in the heart of historic downtown Savannah, Southern Market is your updated, spacious alternative to the typical historic home. Guests will enjoy walking just a few steps to Savannah's best attractions, dining, and shopping! Enter off Montgomery and up the full flight of stairs to your 2nd floor modern loft amongst the oak trees. There's plenty of comfortably seating for everyone to catch up and unwind after a long day of exploring.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003004040627274662,"social_amenities":0.010181568562984467,"party_restriction":0.00045365685946308076,"nearby_nightlife":0.919604480266571}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay in the heart of the Historic District but with the modern amenities you enjoy on vacation! Up to nine Lucky guests will call this modern second-level loft \"home\". The space Located in the heart of historic downtown Savannah, Southern Market is your updated, spacious alternative to the typical historic home. Guests will enjoy walking just a few steps to Savannah's best attractions, dining, and shopping! Enter off Montgomery and up the full flight of stairs to your 2nd floor modern loft amongst the oak trees. There's plenty of comfortably seating for everyone to catch up and unwind after a long day of exploring.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003004040627274662,"social_amenities":0.010181568562984467,"party_restriction":0.00045365685946308076,"nearby_nightlife":0.919604480266571}},{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen size bed. The en suite bath has a tub/shower combination. Down the hall you'll find the final bedroom with a twin and trundle bed. This room is loft-like as a short stairwell leads guests to the laundry room. The twin and trundle bed is connected to a full bath with a tub/shower combination. Southern Market is right on Montgomery Street, which leads North to city attractions such as Ellis Square at City Market, Broughton Street, and of course River Street. Some of the city's most sought-after restaurants and bars are only a short walking distance away. Sleeping Configuration Bedroom 1: King Size Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017683666374068707,"social_amenities":0.005706026218831539,"party_restriction":0.001658244407735765,"nearby_nightlife":0.9840322136878967}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}},{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen size bed. The en suite bath has a tub/shower combination. Down the hall you'll find the final bedroom with a twin and trundle bed. This room is loft-like as a short stairwell leads guests to the laundry room. The twin and trundle bed is connected to a full bath with a tub/shower combination. Southern Market is right on Montgomery Street, which leads North to city attractions such as Ellis Square at City Market, Broughton Street, and of course River Street. Some of the city's most sought-after restaurants and bars are only a short walking distance away. Sleeping Configuration Bedroom 1: King Size Bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017683666374068707,"social_amenities":0.005706026218831539,"party_restriction":0.001658244407735765,"nearby_nightlife":0.9840322136878967}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The second bedroom has a Queen size bed. The en suite bath has a tub/shower combination. Down the hall you'll find the final bedroom with a twin and trundle bed. This room is loft-like as a short stairwell leads guests to the laundry room. The twin and trundle bed is connected to a full bath with a tub/shower combination. Southern Market is right on Montgomery Street, which leads North to city attractions such as Ellis Square at City Market, Broughton Street, and of course River Str