nce":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22447706","title":"Historic by Forsyth + Courtyard by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447706","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00506"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447706","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"5d0cdc4d1ff0796c21818a592b1fce13fe02b6b3469ce2a83232be84d62745fc","chunks":7,"words":559,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.06429711729288101,"party_welcome":0.42706868052482605,"social_amenities":0.06429711729288101,"party_restriction":0.019007239490747452,"nearby_nightlife":0.9630208611488342,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Located right off of beautiful Tattnall Street, this home is sure to please! The space Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - The beautiful private courtyard is the perfect spot to enjoy breakfast. - This pet friendly home is just two blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest green space. Tucked away on Tattnall Street, Whippet house is a two-bedroom Savannah gem. Guests will enjoy the short walk to downtown's center, while having a private retreat in one of the city's oldest residential neighborhoods. You\u2019ll find the living room appointed with an eclectic yet warm collection of furnishings and decor from the owners' international travels.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002272598911076784,"social_amenities":0.06429711729288101,"party_restriction":0.019007239490747452,"nearby_nightlife":0.018848828971385956}},{"text":"A formal dining room connects the front of house with the cheery kitchen, equipped with modern appliances and cookware for all your dine-in needs. Off the back of the home, you\u2019ll find a private courtyard that comfortably seats four. Both bedrooms are upstairs, each with their own full baths. The first bedroom has a Queen size bed and antique writing desk, while the second bedroom mirrors the first but with a King size bed and excellent views of historic Tattnall Street. With windows on either side of the home, Whippet House receives ample natural light during the day. Shutters and window treatments ensure privacy when wanted.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001599435054231435,"social_amenities":0.0017651870148256421,"party_restriction":0.00027733546448871493,"nearby_nightlife":0.002828971017152071}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"One block north lands you in Chatham Square, one of Savannah's gorgeous green spaces. Head east two blocks to historic Forsyth Park, known for its famous fountain and a popular location for weddings. Enjoy a liege waffle and latte at Mirabelle Cafe, before touring the Cathedral of St. John the Baptist, located right across the street. Broughton Street, a hub of Savannah\u2019s shopping, and River Street are only 10-15 minutes north from there, respectively. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom One: Queen Bedroom Two: King Living Room: Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.42706868052482605,"social_amenities":0.0016104141250252724,"party_restriction":0.0011808600975200534,"nearby_nightlife":0.9630208611488342}},{"text":"Located right off of beautiful Tattnall Street, this home is sure to please! The space Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - The beautiful private courtyard is the perfect spot to enjoy breakfast. - This pet friendly home is just two blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest green space. Tucked away on Tattnall Street, Whippet house is a two-bedroom Savannah gem. Guests will enjoy the short walk to downtown's center, while having a private retreat in one of the city's oldest residential neighborhoods. You\u2019ll find the living room appointed with an eclectic yet warm collection of furnishings and decor from the owners' international travels.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002272598911076784,"social_amenities":0.06429711729288101,"party_restriction":0.019007239490747452,"nearby_nightlife":0.018848828971385956}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Located right off of beautiful Tattnall Street, this home is sure to please! The space Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - The beautiful private courtyard is the perfect spot to enjoy breakfast. - This pet friendly home is just two blocks from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest green space. Tucked away on Tattnall Street, Whippet house is a two-bedroom Savannah gem. Guests will enjoy the short walk to downtown's center, while having a private retreat in one of the city's oldest residential neighborhoods. You\u2019ll find the living room appointed with an eclectic yet warm collection of furnishings and decor from the owners' international travels.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002272598911076784,"social_amenities":0.06429711729288101,"party_restriction":0.019007239490747452,"nearby_nightlife":0.018848828971385956}},{"text":"A formal dining room connects the front of house with the cheery kitchen, equipped with modern appliances and cookware for all your dine-in needs. Off the back of the home, you\u2019ll find a private courtyard that comfortably seats four. Both bedrooms are upstairs, each with their own full baths. The first bedroom has a Queen size bed and antique writing desk, while the second bedroom mirrors the first but with a King size bed and excellent views of historic Tattnall Street. With windows on either side of the home, Whippet House receives ample natural light during the day. Shutters and window treatments ensure privacy when wanted.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001599435054231435,"social_amenities":0.0017651870148256421,