ance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25358363301","date":"2025-12-24","type":"50 LOST ANIMAL ONLINE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"511 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20045 23004","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"22447674","title":"Historic Cottage with Parking by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22447674","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00337"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"22447674","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8c1774489966f2608f761fc64f63fbc8b08a9822317fdb80020759a632928b57","chunks":7,"words":571,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.053475070744752884,"party_welcome":0.0007222049753181636,"social_amenities":0.053475070744752884,"party_restriction":0.0007876967429183424,"nearby_nightlife":0.01731634885072708,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Twin decorative fireplaces flank the dining area, which seats 4 to 6 people comfortably. The remodeled kitchen has granite counter tops and stainless steel appliances. A door from the kitchen leads to a private paved courtyard perfect to enjoy coffee, refreshments, or grill your evening meal. On the main floor, the bright and sunny primary bedroom has a queen bed, a TV, dresser and a spacious closet. Adjacent is a full bathroom with a pedestal sink and a tub/shower combination. The upstairs loft bedroom has a king-sized bed, TV, a full bath, and full sized washer and dryer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007222049753181636,"social_amenities":0.053475070744752884,"party_restriction":0.00034340177080594003,"nearby_nightlife":0.00709215272217989}},{"text":"This cute 2 bedroom/2 bath cottage has all the historic charm you want with all the modern amenities you need! On Tattnall Street in the Historic District, this Cottage is the perfect choice for everything from a romantic getaway to a girl's weekend. The space Built circa 1876, this charming historic home home has been recently refurbished to showcase the home\u2019s exposed ceiling beams and wide plank heart pine floors. Warm and inviting, you\u2019ll feel right at home during your stay in Savannah! The living room has a wall mounted television and a new leather sofa bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467117785476148,"social_amenities":0.0032520880922675133,"party_restriction":0.0005059923278167844,"nearby_nightlife":0.01731634885072708}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Twin decorative fireplaces flank the dining area, which seats 4 to 6 people comfortably. The remodeled kitchen has granite counter tops and stainless steel appliances. A door from the kitchen leads to a private paved courtyard perfect to enjoy coffee, refreshments, or grill your evening meal. On the main floor, the bright and sunny primary bedroom has a queen bed, a TV, dresser and a spacious closet. Adjacent is a full bathroom with a pedestal sink and a tub/shower combination. The upstairs loft bedroom has a king-sized bed, TV, a full bath, and full sized washer and dryer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007222049753181636,"social_amenities":0.053475070744752884,"party_restriction":0.00034340177080594003,"nearby_nightlife":0.00709215272217989}},{"text":"Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005153772071935236,"social_amenities":0.0006483701872639358,"party_restriction":0.0007043368532322347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007966597331687808}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Twin decorative fireplaces flank the dining area, which seats 4 to 6 people comfortably. The remodeled kitchen has granite counter tops and stainless steel appliances. A door from the kitchen leads to a private paved courtyard perfect to enjoy coffee, refreshments, or grill your evening meal. On the main floor, the bright and sunny primary bedroom has a queen bed, a TV, dresser and a spacious closet. Adjacent is a full bathroom with a pedestal sink and a tub/shower combination. The upstairs loft bedroom has a king-sized bed, TV, a full bath, and full sized washer and dryer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007222049753181636,"social_amenities":0.053475070744752884,"party_restriction":0.00034340177080594003,"nearby_nightlife":0.00709215272217989}},{"text":"This cute 2 bedroom/2 bath cottage has all the historic charm you want with all the modern amenities you need! On Tattnall Street in the Historic District, this Cottage is the perfect choice for everything from a romantic getaway to a girl's weekend. The space Built circa 1876, this charming historic home home has been recently refurbished to showcase the home\u2019s exposed ceiling beams and wide plank heart pine floors. Warm and inviting, you\u2019ll feel right at home during your stay in Savannah! The living room has a wall mounted television and a new leather sofa bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467117785476148,"social_amenities":0.0032520880922675133,"party_restriction":0.0005059923278167844,"nearby_nightlife":0.01731634885072708}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"In the residential area of the Historic District, you\u2019ll have a quiet and relaxing retreat to return to each night while still being within walking distance to several Savannah landmarks, including Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room and the infamous Mercer-Williams House of Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil. As a historic cottage, this home has original features uncommon to many of today\u2019s homes. Specifically, the stairs to upstairs bedroom are steeper than newly built homes and should be taken into consideration for those with mobility issues. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: King Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.89283255673945e-05,"social_amenities":0.0008756136521697044,"party_restriction":0.0007876967429183424,"nearby_nightlife":0.011217396706342697}},{"text":"Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005153772071935236,"social_amenities":0.0006483701872639358,"party_restriction":0.0007043368532322347,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007966597331687808}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"This cute 2 bedroom/2 bath cottage has all the historic charm you want with all the modern amenities you need! On Tattnall Street in the Historic District, this Cottage is the perfect choice for everything from a romantic getaway to a girl's weekend. The space Built circa 1876, this charming historic home home has been recently refurbished to showcase the home\u2019s exposed ceiling beams and wide plank heart pine floors. Warm and inviting, you\u2019ll feel right at home during your stay in Savannah! The living room has a wall mounted television and a new leather sofa bed.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003467117785476148,"social_amenities":0.0032520880922675133,"party_restriction":0.0005059923278167844,"nearby_nightlife":0.01731634885072708}},{"text":"In the residential area of the Historic District, you\u2019ll have a quiet and relaxing retreat to return to each night while still being within walking distance to several Savannah landmarks, including Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room and the infamous Mercer-Williams House of Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil. As a historic cottage, this home has original features uncommon to many of today\u2019s homes. Specifically, the stairs to upstairs bedroom are steeper than newly built homes and should be taken into consideration for those with mobility issues. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: King Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.89283255673945e-05,"social_amenities":0.0008756136521697044,"party_restriction":0.0007876967429183424,"nearby_nightlife":0.011217396706342697}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20045 23008","address":"507 TATTNALL ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"39918955","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/39918955","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-00897"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"39918955","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"33f6f5463a13394243ced83cf15ddc11e3989bf051bba9192d823f3be8c13ec0","chunks":16,"words":1602,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8903089165687561,"party_welcome":0.00875610951334238,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.001630941522307694,"nearby_nightlife":0.7922167181968689,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014758929319214076,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.0007141841924749315,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012725313426926732}},{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":215,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000819683657027781,"social_amenities":0.13186438381671906,"party_restriction":0.001630941522307694,"nearby_nightlife":0.000515230349265039}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":137,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00875610951334238,"social_amenities":0.02446587383747101,"party_restriction":0.001342608593404293,"nearby_nightlife":0.006124743260443211}},{"text":"Due to its location, Historic Townhouse on Tattnall is the ideal location during one of the many annual festivals hosted by this historic city. But remember, as with many Savannah GA vacation rentals, this home books up fast during these festivals. While there is a plethora of vacation homes Savannah to choose from, this rental property is truly a gem. SVR-00897* Guest access Bedroom 1: Queen Bed with ensuite bathroom Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Flat Screen TV Wi-fi Full Kitchen Drip-style Coffee Maker Central Air Washer & Dryer Private Courtyard Non-Metered Parking Great Residential Area 2 Blocks From Forsyth Park Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006095611955970526,"social_amenities":0.00201043882407248,"party_restriction":0.001113177160732448,"nearby_nightlife":0.7922167181968689}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":125,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014758929319214076,"social_amenities":0.8903089165687561,"party_restriction":0.0007141841924749315,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012725313426926732}},{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":215,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000819683657027781,"social_amenities":0.13186438381671906,"party_restriction":0.001630941522307694,"nearby_nightlife":0.000515230349265039}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":215,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000819683657027781,"social_amenities":0.13186438381671906,"party_restriction":0.001630941522307694,"nearby_nightlife":0.000515230349265039}},{"text":"If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property happily welcomes your furry travel companions!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":137,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00875610951334238,"social_amenities":0.02446587383747101,"party_restriction":0.001342608593404293,"nearby_nightlife":0.006124743260443211}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Due to its location, Historic Townhouse on Tattnall is the ideal location during one of the many annual festivals hosted by this historic city. But remember, as with many Savannah GA vacation rentals, this home books up fast during these festivals. While there is a plethora of vacation homes Savannah to choose from, this rental property is truly a gem. SVR-00897* Guest access Bedroom 1: Queen Bed with ensuite bathroom Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Flat Screen TV Wi-fi Full Kitchen Drip-style Coffee Maker Central Air Washer & Dryer Private Courtyard Non-Metered Parking Great Residential Area 2 Blocks From Forsyth Park Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.006095611955970526,"social_amenities":0.00201043882407248,"party_restriction":0.001113177160732448,"nearby_nightlife":0.7922167181968689}},{"text":"The bathroom is bright and welcoming thanks to its light color scheme and glass shower door that reveals white tiled walls. The other two bedrooms echo the comfort and style of the master suite. These large rooms are highlighted by comfortable beds, luxurious linens and ample space to store your luggage and clothing. The in-house washer and dryer keep your clothes looking and feeling fresh. Overall, this 1,400 square foot vacation home is among the most unique on the market. Its proximity to Forsyth Park and other major attractions make it the perfect place to call home while away from home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018632433784659952,"social_amenities":0.0008644821355119348,"party_restriction":0.00036381647805683315,"nearby_nightlife":0.2537898123264313}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20045 23011A","address":"224 W HUNTINGDON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25119120523","date":"2025-04-29","type":"53 SHOTS FIRED(heard only)","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"224 W Huntingdon St","recorded_pin":"20045 23011A","side":"direct"},{"number":"24147155224","date":"2024-05-26","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"523 Tattnall St","recorded_pin":"20045 23011C","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"29514894","title":"Large Family Home w/ Parking by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29514894","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-00298"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"29514894","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3c20bd8a454db4600cca7ab2cffc9135969eb73a53031e355c102216234d6b7a","chunks":6,"words":469,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.004361982457339764,"party_welcome":0.0005540181882679462,"social_amenities":0.004361982457339764,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.9888584613800049,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Leave the bustle for the birds and experience the quiet, charming side of downtown Savannah. This spacious getaway hosts up to eight Lucky guests. The space Situated just West of the famous Fountain at Forsyth Park, Huntingdon Getaway is the ideal vacation home for a large family looking for a local experience. Park off-street in the designated parking areas and walk into the Savannah home of your dreams. The first level boasts high ceilings and ample natural light. Guests will enjoy kicking back and relaxing in the living room while their favorite show plays on the flat screen TV.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014993302465882152,"social_amenities":0.004361982457339764,"party_restriction":0.0011038786033168435,"nearby_nightlife":0.009260380640625954}},{"text":"Most of Savannah's main attractions such as Broughton Street, City Market, and the riverfront are just a short 15 minute walk away. What is parking like for this home? Huntingdon Getaway includes two private parking spaces off-street: one in the driveway and another in the attached garage, which can accommodate a full-size sedan, or mid-size SUV. Trucks and large SUV's should have no trouble finding a non-metered spot near the home. Sleeping Configuration Bed 1: Queen Size Bed Bed 2: King Size Bed Bed 3: Queen Size Bed Living Room: Queen Sleeper Sofa SVR-00298 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017000737716443837,"social_amenities":0.001355340238660574,"party_restriction":0.000528636563103646,"nearby_nightlife":0.45893341302871704}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"An adjoining dining room comfortably seats eight and connects to an open kitchen with stainless steel appliances. Upstairs, three bedrooms with two full baths accommodate an additional six guests. The first bedroom has a Queen size bed with en suite bath, and the second and third bedrooms have King and Queen size beds, respectively. Head East towards Savannah's largest green space, Forsyth Park, and grab a bite at a few local favorites. On Saturdays, the Forsyth Farmer's Market gives guests a taste of the local agriculture. Head North along Bull Street for a promenade through the squares.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005540181882679462,"social_amenities":0.0032826256938278675,"party_restriction":0.0009961966425180435,"nearby_nightlife":0.9888584613800049}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Leave the bustle for the birds and experience the quiet, charming side of downtown Savannah. This spacious getaway hosts up to eight Lucky guests. The space Situated just West of the famous Fountain at Forsyth Park, Huntingdon Getaway is the i