u2019ll see the streets of Savannah\u2019s historic district beckoning. Enjoy the convenience of free off-street parking, then unwind in the double courtyard adorned with string lights\u2014the perfect setting for morning coffee or evening cocktails. Whether you\u2019re visiting for a weekend getaway or an extended stay, you\u2019ll feel right at home. Guest access Keyless Entry for access. Parking area with an outdoor security camera. Other things to note The house was recently painted and decorated.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013262686552479863,"social_amenities":0.0003070040256716311,"party_restriction":0.00023205828620120883,"nearby_nightlife":0.9030883312225342}},{"text":"Stay steps from Forsyth Park in this charming 2BR/1BA downstairs Savannah retreat. The primary bedroom has a king bed, and the second bedroom has a twin daybed that converts to a king, perfect for two couples or a family. Enjoy one dedicated hot tub in the shared courtyard, one off-street parking space, and an easy walk to bars, restaurants, shopping, farmers markets, River Street, and Savannah\u2019s top attractions. The space The home is a top/down, and this listing covers the rooms in the lower-level apartment. The larger bedroom features a king-sized bed, while the other bedroom has two twin-sized beds. There is one full bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010531748412176967,"social_amenities":0.9640361666679382,"party_restriction":0.11074931919574738,"nearby_nightlife":0.991719126701355}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Stay steps from Forsyth Park in this charming 2BR/1BA downstairs Savannah retreat. The primary bedroom has a king bed, and the second bedroom has a twin daybed that converts to a king, perfect for two couples or a family. Enjoy one dedicated hot tub in the shared courtyard, one off-street parking space, and an easy walk to bars, restaurants, shopping, farmers markets, River Street, and Savan