se artists have worked hard on their pieces so please be respectful of their work. Everything is for sale so message me if you are interested in purchasing a piece. There is so much talent in this city so support local and buy some art to stare at in case your phone dies! Lol. Again, my number is ((PHONE NUMBER HIDDEN) if you have any questions. Have a great stay and enjoy the beautiful city and the local talent we have discovered! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032719352748245,"social_amenities":0.0037675807252526283,"party_restriction":0.021164674311876297,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018263523234054446}},{"text":"Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Mini fridge Freezer Gas stove Coffee maker Coffee Outdoor Private patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":95,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046523462515324354,"social_amenities":0.03241947293281555,"party_restriction":0.0011375887552276254,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008173137903213501}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The guest has access to the entire home! This is separated into levels with a common stairwell. Once you get to the second floor the whole unit is yours. Again, this is an open concept large studio so there are no individual bedrooms making it ideal for families and friends traveling together. There is a large bookcase separating the two king size beds. The only room with a separated door is the restroom. We hope you enjoy the home! Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012196660973131657,"social_amenities":0.002016874