ities":0.007341607008129358,"party_restriction":0.005905602127313614,"nearby_nightlife":0.9747495651245117,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Non-metered Parking This unit has free, on-street parking right outside the front door. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Our guests have not reported trouble parking near the home, even on the busiest of weekends. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: 2 Twin Beds Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: King Bed SVR-00349 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002416363568045199,"social_amenities":0.007341607008129358,"party_restriction":0.005905602127313614,"nearby_nightlife":0.009523281827569008}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Wilkes Dining House, where you\u2019ll find some of the best Southern home cooking in the city, and the Crystal Beer Parlor, Savannah\u2019s oldest restaurant. You\u2019ll also be a short walk from Forsyth Park, Savannah\u2019s largest park and popular location for weddings, music and food festivals. Why Lucky Savannah Loves this Property: - There is plenty of non-metered parking surrounding the home, so there's no need to park in a garage or pay parking meters! - A washer and dryer is conveniently located in the kitchen area. - Built in 1871, this home has been fully updated to provide all the comforts you\u2019ll need during your stay in Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8163735270500183,"social_amenities":0.0006493036635220051,"party_restriction":0.0003169311676174402,"nearby_nightlife":0.9747495651245117}},{"text":"The upgraded kitchen has a convenient island with stools and a breakfast nook. Enjoy your morning coffee in a rocking chair on your private porch just off the kitchen. Upstairs you\u2019ll find three beautiful bedrooms. The bedroom at the top of the stairs has two twin beds, perfect for families with children. The second bedroom has a queen-sized bed and its own private porch. These two bedrooms share a bath, which has a wonderful clawfoot tub. The primary bedroom has a king bed, television, and ensuite bath with a double vanity and huge shower with built-in seating. Nearby dining favorites include Mrs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005672280676662922,"social_amenities":0.003087024437263608,"party_restriction":0.0008528397302143276,"nearby_nightlife":0.16252082586288452}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Non-metered Parking This unit has free, on-street parking right outside the front door. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Our guests have not reported trouble parking near the home, even on the busiest of weekends. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: 2 Twin Beds Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: King Bed SVR-00349 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002416363568045199,"social_amenities":0.007341607008129358,"party_restriction":0.005905602127313614,"nearby_nightlife":0.009523281827569008}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more","section":"AMENITIES","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00037532654823735356,"social_amenities":0.007010945584625006,"party_restriction":0.0006003641174174845,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008146317559294403}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? Non-metered Parking This unit has free, on-street parking right outside the front door. Availability will depend on time of day and season. Our guests have not reported trouble parking near the home, even on the busiest of weekends. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: 2 Twin Beds Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: King Bed SVR-00349 Other things to note AGE RESTRICTION: All renters must be over the age of 25, unless it is a child accompanied by a parent.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002416363568045199,"social_amenities":0.007341607008129358,"party_restriction":0.005905602127313614,"nearby_nightlife":0.009523281827569008}},{"text":"Self c