"signal_evidence":[{"text":"When you step inside our Savannah vacation rentals, you will be greeted with soaring ceilings, a charmingly historic fireplace, and a gracefully curving staircase. The living room is equipped with a large sofa perfect for curling up to watch a movie and a cozy armchair nook ideal for peaceful conversations. The large, flat screen TV is perfect for when you have a little down time. Once you walk through the living room, you will enter our state of the art kitchen. Gleaming marble countertops and crisp white cabinets create the perfect backdrop for hosting a dinner party or sharing snacks with loved ones.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.34194061160087585,"social_amenities":0.0025898164603859186,"party_restriction":0.00033888715552166104,"nearby_nightlife":0.008714588358998299},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Gleaming marble countertops and crisp white cabinets create the perfect backdrop for hosting a dinner party or sharing snacks with loved ones."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our fully equipped kitchen has all essential appliances, including a fridge, stove, and oven, along with some extra perks like a toaster and coffee maker for your breakfast. With a TV and free WiFi, you can easily play games or watch favorite shows when you feel like staying indoors. When you're in the mood to step outside, all of our incredible outdoor amenities will help you have a blast. The outdoor patio at our Savannah vacation rental is perfect for relaxing on balmy Southern nights. You get a full private courtyard to relax at your home. Cook up dinner on our grill and enjoy it at our outdoor seating area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005621250020340085,"social_amenities":0.9273631572723389,"party_restriction":0.0008794264285825193,"nearby_nightlife":0.03137180581688881}},{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Walk across the road to visit the Savannah Rum Runners Bakery and Cafe for a quick snack or enjoy an elegant brunch inside Collins Quarter at Forsyth. You'll also be able to see the sights at places like the SCAD Musuem of Art or the Savannah City Market. Our Savannah vacation rentals are also conveniently close to Savannah nightlife. Dance the night away at Club 51 Degrees or have a drink at the chic Rocks on the Roof rooftop bar.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":89,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9556764960289001,"social_amenities":0.004375813063234091,"party_restriction":0.002660284982994199,"nearby_nightlife":0.9975674152374268}},{"text":"Savannah is known for its support of the arts, so there are a lot of live music venues, ranging from traditional concert halls to options like the Savannah Smiles Dueling Pianos bar. Being in the heart of Savannah also makes Walk to Forsyth the ideal spot to stay while visiting Savannah's traditional annual events. Whether you're in town for Fourth of July on the River, Savannah Pride Festival, or the Christmas Parade, our Savannah vacation homes are just a few miles from all the action. Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_we