0 days or more, we require a deposit and our office will reach out to you for details. For 60 days or more long-term stays, we require an additional clean. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-02103* Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":134,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00019463247735984623,"social_amenities":0.05466098710894585,"party_restriction":0.23454132676124573,"nearby_nightlife":0.0018546838546171784}},{"text":"The spacious dinner table provides plenty of room for everyone to bond over a good meal or a few drinks. Upstairs, a master bedroom provides you with a great spot to unwind. Take a nap on the king sized bed or enjoy the walk in shower with a built in. Walk to Forsyth also provides plenty of space for your friends and family too. Our guest bedrooms boast additional king sized beds, and the additional bathroom and half bathroom ensure there's always a spot free if you need it. Check Out Our Luxurious Amenities Our Savannah vacation homes provide plenty of amenities to help you enjoy your stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0030031492933630943,"social_amenities":0.20130079984664917,"party_restriction":0.0039490642957389355,"nearby_nightlife":0.17405076324939728}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Walk across the road to visit the Savannah Rum Runners Bakery and Cafe for a quick snack or enjoy an elegant brunch inside Collins Quarter at Forsyth. You'll also be able to see the sights at places like the SCAD Musuem of Art or the Savannah City Market. Our Savannah vacation rentals are also conveniently close to Savannah nightlife. Dance the night away at Club 51 Degrees or have a drink at the chic 