vacation homes. No matter what time of year you plan to visit, Lady Gwinnett, one of Southern Belle's top Savannah vacation rentals, provides the perfect home base. Get in touch with us today to make your reservation. Guest access Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.14330126345157623,"social_amenities":0.005619892384856939,"party_restriction":0.0015185428783297539,"nearby_nightlife":0.7064127922058105}},{"text":"The open main-floor layout is ideal for enjoying the company of your friends and family during mealtimes and relaxing evenings after busy vacation days. The living area transitions seamlessly to a formal dining room where a big farmhouse-style table supplies an inviting gathering place for communal meals. The adjacent eating bar adds intimate seating for breakfast and snacks, and it is the perfect place to plan your itinerary for your Savannah vacation home stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013287117471918464,"social_amenities":0.0034628312569111586,"party_restriction":0.00021146677318029106,"nearby_nightlife":0.15554744005203247}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"pa