nd leads into the hallway. There you\u2019ll find a beautiful red velvet couch overlooking the stairway. Guest access The whole parlor level of the home is yours! We do offer access to the laundry room downstairs, where you'll find the washer/dryer side by side and is free for you to use! PLEASE NOTE - this is the only shared space in the home, where the unit downstairs (ground level) may access the laundry space also. Please be cognizant of noise levels when coming down to do laundry, so you do not disturb our other guests.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011570409697014838,"social_amenities":0.001825425075367093,"party_restriction":0.0024325901176780462,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010067855473607779}},{"text":"Treat yourself to a calm and peaceful stay in this charming yet incredibly spacious townhome! Located just two blocks from Forsyth Park and on a quiet, tree-lined street, this rental allows you to savor the best of Savannah\u2019s historic district with class and tranquility. This is a prime location that's walking distance to all that Savannah has to offer...you won't want to miss out! SVR-02402 The space On the top floor of this palatial residence, you\u2019ll find an open floor layout and large bay windows that allow in plenty of sunlight throughout the day.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.429365698248148e-05,"social_amenities":0.0021727692801505327,"party_restriction":0.0014490258181467652,"nearby_nightlife":0.0053772530518472195}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The living room\u2019s neutral green walls reflect back natural light, allowing for its guests to enjoy a warm and welcoming coffee date early morning or mid-afternoon. Come nightfall, you can take in the spacious living room for a cocktail with friends or share some laughs over a board game! A large, Victorian-style desk sits off to the right of the east side of the room, by its expansive windows, and offers a glass top for easy writing. It's the best place in the home to get some work done while also getting in your daily dose of Vitamin D.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8746228814125061,"social_amenities":0.004867308773100376,"party_restriction":0.0001237955002579838,"nearby_nightlife":0.2863598167896271}},{"text":"Treat yourself to a calm and peaceful stay in this charming yet incredibly spacious townhome! Located just two blocks from Forsyth Park and on a quiet, tree-lined street, this rental allows you to savor the best of Savannah\u2019s historic district with class and tranquility. This is a prime location that's walking distance to all that Savannah has to offer...you won't want to miss out! SVR-02402 The space On the top floor of this palatial residence, you\u2019ll find an open floor layout and large bay windows that allow in plenty of sunlight throughout the day.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.429365698248148e-05,"social_amenities":0.0021727692801505327,"party_restriction":0.0014490258181467652,"nearby_nightlife":0.0053772530518472195}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 02011","address":"322 W BOLTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":14.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24063065553","date":"2024-03-03","type":"UNCONSCIOUS-LIFE STATSUS UNK","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"320 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20052 02012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24080084071","date":"2024-03-20","type":"28-4 DOMESTIC DISTURB VERBAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"320 W Bolton St","recorded_pin":"20052 02012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"11094644","title":"Victorian Bakery Apartment","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/11094644","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00517"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"11094644","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"0c806defdd280ee77f56f35072559ef22ba709f7c1cd531eded7fabc93526827","chunks":5,"words":416,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.12150101363658905,"party_welcome":0.0003635692992247641,"social_amenities":0.12150101363658905,"party_restriction":0.017659636214375496,"nearby_nightlife":0.06107720732688904,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"The Space One Bedroom apartment suite Victorian/Savannah charmer built is 1884 is located above Savannah Rum Runners Bakery and Caf\u00e9. Complimentary fresh baked items will be provided for your stay from our bakery. The apartment is walking distance to many areas of Savannah; Forsyth Park, Starland Yard, Bay Street, River Street, Enmarket Arena, and many of our historical places. You can stroll through many of the historical squares as you make your way around the city. The space The Space One Bedroom Victorian/Savannah charmer built in 1884, located above Savannah Rum Runners Bakery and Caf\u00e9.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003635692992247641,"social_amenities":0.12150101363658905,"party_restriction":0.017659636214375496,"nearby_nightlife":0.06107720732688904}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Int