t have a full home instead! Registered with city of Savannah Certificate #SVR-00517. Other things to note The bakery is open Wednesday - Friday from 9:00am - 2:00pm, Saturday 9:00am - 3:00pm. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030576257267966866,"social_amenities":0.0017616861732676625,"party_restriction":0.0017850676085799932,"nearby_nightlife":0.010283670388162136}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 03009","address":"316 W WALDBURG ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24178189193","date":"2024-06-26","type":"45 PAST VANDALISM","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"318 W Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20052 03010","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25211214552","date":"2025-07-30","type":"53 SHOTS FIRED(heard only)","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"306 W Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20052 03016","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25281285559","date":"2025-10-08","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"306 W Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20052 03016","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"12588152","title":"Victorian Cottage Near Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/12588152","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02487"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"12588152","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8408509fb76fb3004c43fbf694ce4646ba8e77e6dc13d9ba9e50db7d126f3587","chunks":15,"words":1485,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9635183811187744,"party_welcome":0.009890329092741013,"social_amenities":0.9635183811187744,"party_restriction":0.0029987881425768137,"nearby_nightlife":0.9964377880096436,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Just three blocks from beautiful Forsyth Park, it is walkable to both the historic downtown and the Starland District. The cottage dates back to 1900 and has all the old world charm that comes with its age, along with thoughtful updates. The outdoor space is a standout feature. When you enter through the white picket fence, you\u2019ll find a traditional front porch with rocking chairs. The backyard has a beautiful porch for relaxing, a lush garden, and a grill for warm weather barbecues. There are also two dedicated parking spaces in the rear. Inside, the cottage accommodates up to four people with two bedrooms and one newly-renovated bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000521734997164458,"social_amenities":0.9635183811187744,"party_restriction":0.0014902296243235469,"nearby_nightlife":0.11557163298130035}},{"text":"Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":226,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000707835890352726,"social_amenities":0.8024807572364807,"party_restriction":0.001775588491000235,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006179767660796642}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The cottage is just three blocks from famous Forsyth Park, which spans 26 acres and is always lively \u2013 From the famous cast-iron fountain, the Saturday Farmers Market, to festivals, to walking the picturesque tree-lined sidewalks, having a picnic, and enjoying brunch at Collins Quarter, we feel the cottage is situated in the ideal area for exploration and adventure. We are a 15 to 20 minute walk from the historic downtown area boasting City Market, Broughton Street, River Street, and all 22 of Savannah\u2019s charming historic squares. Chatham Square is the closest, and is a 5 minute walk from the cottage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009890329092741013,"social_amenities":0.001141015556640923,"party_restriction":0.0009363818680867553,"nearby_nightlife":0.9685177206993103}},{"text":"- The cottage is just three blocks from famous Forsyth Park, which spans 26 acres and is always lively \u2013 From the famous cast-iron fountain, the Saturday Farmers Market, to festivals, to walking the picturesque tree-lined sidewalks, having a picnic, and enjoying brunch at Collins Quarter, we feel the cottage is situated in the ideal area for exploration and adventure. - We are a 15 to 20 minute walk from the historic downtown area boasting City Market, Broughton Street, River Street, and all 22 of Savannah\u2019s charming historic squares. Chatham Square is the closest, and is a 5 minute walk from the cottage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":118,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.007512073963880539,"social_amenities":0.001356974127702415,"party_restriction":0.0009979482274502516,"nearby_nightlife":0.9648891091346741}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Just three blocks from beautiful Forsyth Park, it is walkable to both the historic downtown and the Starland District. The cottage dates back to 1900 and has all the old world charm that comes with its age, along with thoughtful updates. The outdoor space is a standout feature. When you enter through the white picket fence, you\u2019ll find a traditional front porch with rocking chairs. The backyard has a beautiful porch for relaxing, a lush garden, and a grill for warm weather barbecues. There are also two dedicated parking spaces in the rear. Inside, the cottage accommodates up to four people with two bedrooms and one newly-renovated bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000521734997164458,"social_amenities":0.9635183811187744,"party_restriction":0.0014902296243235469,"nearby_nightlife":0.11557163298130035}},{"text":"Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":226,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000707835890352726,"social_amenities":0.8024807572364807,"party_restriction":0.001775588491000235,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006179767660796642}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The new owners have been pouring their hearts into the Waldburg Cottage to create a beautiful and comfortable place for guests to relax and enjoy. Teeming with old world charm, this historic Victorian cottage is located in Savannah\u2019s Historic District off of Waldburg and Jefferson. Just three blocks from beautiful Forsyth Park, it is walkable to both the historic downtown and the Starland District. The space One of our most charming vacation homes in Savannah is the Waldburg Cottage property. This historic Victorian cottage is located in Savannah\u2019s Historic District off of Waldburg and Jefferson.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003222595260012895,"social_amenities":0.00995074026286602,"party_restriction":0.0029987881425768137,"nearby_nightlife":0.005579401273280382}},{"text":"May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Occupancy City of Savannah Code of Ordinances, Division II, Part 8, Chapter 3 (Zoning), Article 8.0, Section 8.4.37(b) \u2013 Short-Term Vacation Rental Use Standards: Occupants shall not exceed four adults for dwelling units with no more than two bedrooms. For dwelling units with three or more bedrooms, the number shall not exceed two adults per bedroom. SVR-02487 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":159,"scores":{"party_welcome":8.142873411998153e-05,"social_amenities":0.0013044618535786867,"party_restriction":0.002660484053194523,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015350817702710629}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"- South of the cottage is the trendy Starland District, with artist shops and restaurants, a 10-15 minute walk. - For groceries, Kroger is 0.5 miles away. There is also an independent natural food store called \u2018Brighter Day\u2019 at the south end of Forsyth Park, along with a coffee shop, wine shop, and a beautiful rooftop bar called \u2018Perch\u2019. - The cottage is 25 minutes to the Savannah Airport. - If you have a car, you can spend a day exploring Tybee Island, a 20 minute car-ride away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":122,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008964032167568803,"social_amenities":0.0037534376606345177,"party_restriction":0.0016965677496045828,"nearby_nightlife":0.9964377880096436}},{"text":"South of the cottage is the trendy Starland District, with artist shops and restaurants, a 10-15 minute walk. For groceries, Kroger is 0.5 miles away. There is also an independent natural food store called \u2018Brighter Day\u2019 at the south end of Forsyth Park, along with a coffee shop, wine shop, and a beautiful rooftop bar called \u2018Perch\u2019. The cottage is 25 minutes to the Savannah Airport If you have a car, you can spend a day exploring Tybee Island, a 20 minute car-ride away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008879275992512703,"social_amenities":0.005136720836162567,"party_restriction":0.0018931608647108078,"nearby_nightlife":0.9963845014572144}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 04005","address":"901 MONTGOMERY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"45878123","title":"Two-Story Victorian c.1900 by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45878123","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-01754","SVR-02000"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"45878123","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"f07de332d57ef3147f5910d202d9f564bcba2c73c7912bf2ec53b958922fbfd8","chunks":7,"words":601,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.017089346423745155,"party_welcome":0.9977400302886963,"social_amenities":0.017089346423745155,"party_restriction":0.006298605352640152,"nearby_nightlife":0.9614232182502747,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? The Montgomery House has plenty of free street parking and the city offers a free shuttle from Forsyth to downtown Savannah every 10 minutes. It's easy to leave your car at the house and explore all that Savannah has to offer! Sleeping Configurations: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Full Bed We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 75 lb.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001161096224677749,"social_amenities":0.017089346423745155,"party_restriction":0.006298605352640152,"nearby_nightlife":0.013549180701375008}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV with standard cable Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00046241949894465506,"social_amenities":0.0015390949556604028,"party_restriction":0.0003949602833017707,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006926235510036349}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Built in 1900, this large Victorian home has been completely renovated top to bottom. Your party will enjoy being just a short walk to Forsyth park, or a few blocks to be a part of the action offered in historic downtown Savannah. The space This conveniently located four bedroom, two bath, Victorian Home offers a historic feel and an ample amount of space for your entire party. Only located three blocks from Forsyth Park, walking distance to downtown attractions, and easy access to I-16. Parade routes and race routes are as close as 1-4 blocks depending on the event.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9977400302886963,"social_amenities":0.001716713304631412,"party_restriction":0.00016811233945190907,"nearby_nightlife":0.9047759771347046}},{"text":"This home has been divided up into two apartments, perfect for those with family members that have difficulty with stairs. Each floor features a spacious living room, a fully-stocked kitchen, dedicated dining space, two bedrooms, and one full bath. Downstairs offers a poker table, ideal for a game night in with friends or family and is open to the kitchen, perfect for entertaining! High ceilings, hardwood floors and original fireplaces adorn the space with all the character and charm you'd expect to see in a Victorian mansion.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.07033885270357132,"social_amenities":0.001293441280722618,"party_restriction":0.00024207998649217188,"nearby_nightlife":0.014513064175844193}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? The Montgomery House has plenty of free street parking and the city offers a free shuttle from Forsyth to downtown Savannah every 10 minutes. It's easy to leave your car at the house and explore all that Savannah has to offer! Sleeping Configurations: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Full Bed We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 75 lb.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001161096224677749,"social_amenities":0.017089346423745155,"party_restriction":0.006298605352640152,"nearby_nightlife":0.013549180701375008}},{"text":"Yet modern amenities abound with everything from central heat and air condition, tv and wifi so you can stay up to date on all your favorite streaming shows. The property is only three blocks from Forsyth Park which is one of Savannah's largest and most active. Forsyth is over 30 acres of green space, walking paths and the beautiful moss draped live oak trees Savannah is known for. Around the park you'll find boutiques, coffee shops and even an organic grocery. If you happen to be visiting on the weekend, Forsyth hosts the local farmer's market every Saturday morning and sometimes there's even a concert in the bandshell.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005050407722592354,"social_amenities":0.007250397466123104,"party_restriction":0.001124916016124189,"nearby_nightlife":0.9614232182502747}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"What is parking like for this home? The Montgomery House has plenty of free street parking and the city offers a free shuttle from Forsyth to downtown Savannah every 10 minutes. It's easy to leave your car at the house and explore all that Savannah has to offer! Sleeping Configurations: Bedroom 1: Queen Bed Bedroom 2: Queen Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Bedroom 4: Full Bed We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 75 lb.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001161096224677749,"social_amenities":0.017089346423745155,"party_restriction":0.006298605352640152,"nearby_nightlife":0.013549180701375008}},{"text":"Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003030583611689508,"social_amenities":0.0009171758429147303,"party_restriction":0.002983817597851157,"nearby_nightlife":0.0016854784917086363}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Yet modern amenities abound with everything from central heat and air condition, tv and wifi so you can stay up to date on all your favorite streaming shows. The property is only three blocks from Forsyth Park which is one of Savannah's largest and most active. Forsyth is over 30 acres of green space, walking paths and the beautiful moss draped live oak trees Savannah is known for. Around the park you'll find boutiques, coffee shops and even an organic grocery. If you happen to be visiting on the weekend, Forsyth hosts the local farmer's market every Saturday morning and sometimes there's even a concert in the bandshell.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.005050407722592354,"social_amenities":0.007250397466123104,"party_restriction":0.001124916016124189,"nearby_nightlife":0.9614232182502747}},{"text":"Built in 1900, this large Victorian home has been completely renovated top to bottom. Your party will enjoy being just a short walk to Forsyth park, or a few blocks to be a part of the action offered in historic downtown Savannah. The space This conveniently located four bedroom, two bath, Victorian Home offers a historic feel and an ample amount of space for your entire party. Only located three blocks from Forsyth Park, walking distance to downtown attractions, and easy access to I-16. Parade routes and race routes are as close as 1-4 blocks depending on the event.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9977400302886963,"social_amenities":0.001716713304631412,"party_restriction":0.00016811233945190907,"nearby_nightlife":0.9047759771347046}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 13013","address":"414 W PARK AVE","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":20.0,"advertised_guests":5.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24005005358","date":"2024-01-05","type":"24-4 UNWANTED person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"414 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13013","side":"direct"},{"number":"24190201352","date":"2024-07-08","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"414 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13013","side":"direct"},{"number":"25193196051","date":"2025-07-12","type":"69 SUSPICIOUS vehicle","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"414 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13013","side":"direct"},{"number":"24015014724","date":"2024-01-15","type":"5 MVC","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24098103145","date":"2024-04-07","type":"4 SUPPLEMENTAL General Info","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26049047275","date":"2026-02-18","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 W Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20052 13012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"36967625","title":"Historic Artsy Condo - 7min Walk to Forsyth Park!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/36967625","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01994"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"36967625","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"ac98923b947196c63c060bd4e333dfd213c6f4aac8a66d55daa2a43a046d24cf","chunks":8,"words":732,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.006378273945301771,"party_welcome":0.0013072604779154062,"social_amenities":0.9104236364364624,"party_restriction":0.010627442970871925,"nearby_nightlife":0.9803758859634399,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Cameras on the exterior of the home monitor the front entryway, parking space, and backyard. (3 cameras) These cameras are ON and recording 24/7 during the reservation. All cameras are outside the home for the safety of ourselves and our guests. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 386 Mbps","section":"AMENITIES","line":63,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010627795563777909,"social_amenities":0.006378273945301771,"party_restriction":0.000732437358237803,"nearby_nightlife":0.003658055793493986}},{"text":"This is a private triplex and you have access to the property and your unit. Please note that there are exterior cameras for security. Other things to note Please note that parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis, with one space per home. On-site parking is located immediately to the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001226768217748031,"social_amenities":0.0029169227927923203,"party_restriction":0.0030273227021098137,"nearby_nightlife":0.008953816257417202}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The kitchen is equipped for light meals, featuring a stainless steel high table that doubles as a dining or bar area. Step out to the private deck off the bedroom to enjoy Savannah\u2019s beautiful weather. Conveniently located near shops, restaurants, and nightlife, it\u2019s easy to explore Savannah. Walk to Forsyth Park and the popular Saturday Farmers Market, or take a short drive to River Street, I-16, Tybee Island (about 25 minutes), and historic Fort Pulaski. Whether you\u2019re here for history, art, or a relaxing getaway, this townhome condo offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013072604779154062,"social_amenities":0.06708157062530518,"party_restriction":0.00832252949476242,"nearby_nightlife":0.9803758859634399}},{"text":"For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007545110420323908,"social_amenities":0.000777165696490556,"party_restriction":0.002103651175275445,"nearby_nightlife":0.0024551022797822952}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Discover this home, a newly renovated historic retreat in Savannah's Victorian District. This edgy and artsy triplex, built around 1830, blends rustic brick, light pine floors, and modern accents. Enjoy the open-concept living space and relax on the outdoor deck/patio. Perfect for those seeking a unique and comfortable stay near local attractions. The space Step into a stylish space where modern design meets historic charm in Savannah\u2019s Victorian District. Just a 7-minute walk to Forsyth Park, 1.5 miles from River Street\u2019s shops and dining, and boasting an 89 Walk Score, this quaint condo offers easy access to cafes, trolleys, and local attractions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":39,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018542258476372808,"social_amenities":0.9104236364364624,"party_restriction":0.010627442970871925,"nearby_nightlife":0.9277883768081665}},{"text":"The kitchen is equipped for light meals, featuring a stainless steel high table that doubles as a dining or bar area. Step out to the private deck off the bedroom to enjoy Savannah\u2019s beautiful weather. Conveniently located near shops, restaurants, and nightlife, it\u2019s easy to explore Savannah. Walk to Forsyth Park and the popular Saturday Farmers Market, or take a short drive to River Street, I-16, Tybee Island (about 25 minutes), and historic Fort Pulaski. Whether you\u2019re here for history, art, or a relaxing getaway, this townhome condo offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":46,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013072604779154062,"social_amenities":0.06708157062530518,"party_restriction":0.00832252949476242,"nearby_nightlife":0.9803758859634399}}],"party_restric