1817625761032,"party_restriction":0.046126630157232285,"nearby_nightlife":0.9875937104225159,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Free parking is available on the side of the property, with one designated space per unit. Other things to note Please note that parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis, with one space per home. On-site parking is located immediately to the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006816412205807865,"social_amenities":0.08301817625761032,"party_restriction":0.046126630157232285,"nearby_nightlife":0.008073355071246624}},{"text":"Josephine's Carriage House, Apt. B, is a unique and charmingly renovated historic building located in the heart of Savannah's Victorian District. This beautiful space seamlessly blends modern convenience with old-world charm, providing you with a comfortable and stylish stay in close proximity to some of the city's most popular attractions, including the famous Savannah Victorian District and only a couple miles away from the famous River Street. The space Step inside this triplex house, part of a beautifully restored historic triplex in one of Savannah\u2019s oldest neighborhoods, dating back to the 1830s. Artistic touches and eclectic d\u00e9cor make this space truly unique, blending historic charm with modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001501410297350958,"social_amenities":0.01026852522045374,"party_restriction":0.0005026542930863798,"nearby_nightlife":0.05083070322871208}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The open-concept living and dining area is perfect for relaxing, while the fully equipped kitchen is ideal for light cooking or microwaving. The bedroom features a plush queen-sized bed and a private deck where you can soak up the sun, a cozy retreat after a day of exploring. Please note, there are stairs required to access the home. Located just a short walk from the sprawling 22-acre Forsyth Park, Apt. B puts you in the heart of Savannah\u2019s historic Victorian District. Wander charming streets lined with storybook cottages and grand 19th-century homes, discover local shops, restaurants, and nightlife, or explore the vibrant energy of the neighborhood.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0039011361077427864,"social_amenities":0.0022049963008612394,"party_restriction":0.0040596057660877705,"nearby_nightlife":0.9875937104225159}},{"text":"Free parking is available on the side of the property, with one designated space per unit. Other things to note Please note that parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis, with one space per home. On-site parking is located immediately to the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006816412205807865,"social_amenities":0.08301817625761032,"party_restriction":0.046126630157232285,"nearby_nightlife":0.008073355071246624}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Free parking is available on the side of the property, with one designated space per unit. Other things to note Please note that parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis, with one space per home. On-site parking is located immediately to the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006816412205807865,"social_amenities":0.