 blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Cameras on the exterior of the home monitor the front entryway, parking space, and backyard. (3 cameras) These cameras are ON and recording 24/7 during the reservation. All cameras are outside the home for the safety of ourselves and our guests. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm","section":"AMENITIES","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011137205001432449,"social_amenities":0.029023868963122368,"party_restriction":0.005512075033038855,"nearby_nightlife":0.004095498472452164}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"You have everything you need at Josephine's -- living space, flat screen TV, WIFI, kitchen (for light cooking and microwaving only -- no baking or frying), laundry room, work desk, bedroom -- all designed and furnished for comfort and visual interest. In addition to its prime location, Apt. A offers easy access to a range of local shops, restaurants, and nightlife. Be sure to check out the seasonal Farmer's Market at Forsyth, where you can sample locally grown and made foods on Saturday mornings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009656563401222229,"social_amenities":0.0019937597680836916,"party_restriction":0.014447752386331558,"nearby_nightlife":0.958390474319458}},{"text":"Free parking is available on the side of the property, with one designated space per unit. Other things to note Please note that parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis, with one space per home. On-site parking is located immediately to the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006816412205807865,"social_amenities":0.08301817625761032,"pa