 the left of the building. Free street parking is also available on W. Park Ave. and Montgomery St. Guests are responsible for adhering to all posted parking signage and street-cleaning restrictions. STVR Permit SVR-01994","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006816412205807865,"social_amenities":0.08301817625761032,"party_restriction":0.046126630157232285,"nearby_nightlife":0.008073355071246624}},{"text":"You have everything you need at Josephine's -- living space, flat screen TV, WIFI, kitchen (for light cooking and microwaving only -- no baking or frying), laundry room, work desk, bedroom -- all designed and furnished for comfort and visual interest. In addition to its prime location, Apt. A offers easy access to a range of local shops, restaurants, and nightlife. Be sure to check out the seasonal Farmer's Market at Forsyth, where you can sample locally grown and made foods on Saturday mornings.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.009656563401222229,"social_amenities":0.0019937597680836916,"party_restriction":0.014447752386331558,"nearby_nightlife":0.958390474319458}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Nestled in Savannah\u2019s historic Victorian District from the 1800's, just 3.5 blocks from Forsyth Park, this carriage triplex offers a quiet, charming retreat in the heart of the city. Walk to River Street, SCAD, Broughton Street shopping, and the Starland Art District, or explore local restaurants, bars, and boutiques nearby. Popular with locals, students, and visitors, it\u2019s ideal for couples, solo travelers, weekend getaways, and SCAD guests seeking comfort and convenience! The space This beautifully restored 1830s structure has been brought to life with artistic touches and modern amenities to provide you with a unique and comfortable stay.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011567971523618326,"social_amenities":0.003208921290934086,"party_restriction":0.002917530247941613,"nearby_nightlife":0.9876357913017273}},{"text":"You\u2019ll have easy access to I-16 for trips to the Outlet Mall or, head to Tybee Island Beach, about a 25 minute drive, with Fort Pulaski as a great stop along the way. Whether you're exploring the city's rich history, enjoying the vibrant arts scene, or simply soaking up the Southern charm, Josephine's Carriage House, Apt. A is the ideal place to stay. Book your visit today and experience the best of Savannah! Guest access This is a private triplex, and guests have full access to their unit and the shared exterior property. For added security, exterior cameras are in place around the building.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003849711501970887,"social_amenities":0.0047836145386099815,"party_restriction":0.0005973447696305811,"nearby_nightlife":0.9592353105545044}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 14004","address":"315 W WALDBURG ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":12.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24136143439","date":"2024-05-15","type":"10-15 CIVIL ISSUE","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"317 W Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20052 14002","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24345359553","date":"2024-12-10","type":"69 PAST SUSPICIOUS vehicle","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"313 W Waldburg St","recorded_pin":"20052 14017","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25347351486","date":"2025-12-13","type":"**DOMESTIC DISTURBANCE/VIOLENC","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"313 W Waldburg St","recorded_pi