t parking is available nearby on Waldburg Street or surrounding streets. No reserved off-street parking is available. Walk or bike to many nearby amenities, including Forsyth Park: Many events are held at the park throughout the year. It is an excellent choice for picnics, outdoor sports, walking, and jogging. Guests will also be located only a short 20-25 minute drive to Tybee Island, Savannah's beach. Come out for a day trip to enjoy the beach, fishing, visit Ft. Pulaski, or climb Georgia's oldest and tallest lighthouse. PETS: This home is pet-friendly for up to two (2) adult dogs with approval.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0022976123727858067,"social_amenities":0.013960002921521664,"party_restriction":0.0018762327963486314,"nearby_nightlife":0.9704033136367798}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Wifi is available. Street parking is available nearby on Waldburg Street or surrounding streets. No reserved off-street parking is available. Walk or bike to many nearby amenities, including Forsyth Park: Many events are held at the park throughout the year. It is an excellent choice for picnics, outdoor sports, walking, and jogging. Guests will also be located only a short 20-25 minute drive to Tybee Island, Savannah's beach. Come out for a day trip to enjoy the beach, fishing, visit Ft. Pulaski, or climb Georgia's oldest and tallest lighthouse. PETS: This home is pet-friendly for up to two (2) adult dogs with approval.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0022976123727858067,"social_amenities":0.013960002921521664,"party_restriction":0.0018762327963486314,"nearby_nightlife":0.9704033136367798}},{"text":"Pet friendly condo located in historic area Other things to note Welcome to your Historic Savannah vacation at Waldburg Garden apartment. This beautifully restored historic townhome was originally built in 1875 and fully renovated to include all modern amenities while maintaining its original charm. Locate