{"text":"It's just steps away from Forsyth Park, and on Saturdays, the farmer's market! Each bedroom has a comfy king sized bed to lay your head and a tv to help relax at the end of a long day of sightseeing. The kitchen is fully stocked, so whether you're grabbing a quick cup of coffee to get your day started or staying in and cooking you'll have everything you need! Guest access The entire first floor condo is yours! Entry to both the condo and the building are keyless. You'll be provided with a code the day of your arrival so you can come and go as you please.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007728430791758001,"social_amenities":0.005390518344938755,"party_restriction":0.001755444798618555,"nearby_nightlife":0.003687818069010973}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"First aid kit Internet and office Fast wifi \u2013 173 Mbps Verified by speed test. Stream 4K videos and join video calls on multiple devices. Dedicated workspace In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stainless steel electric stove Stainless steel single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance","section":"AMENITIES","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007732158410362899,"social_amenities":0.049248188734054565,"party_restriction":0.001236828975379467,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006682571256533265}},{"text":"Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Private BBQ grill: gas Parking and facilities Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For