st aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031483452767133713,"social_amenities":0.00781625509262085,"party_restriction":0.0003578237956389785,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007069588173180819}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There is a camera on the porch for security purposes only. Other things to note This is the lower unit of a duplex, so please be courteous to your neighbors and keep noise levels to a minimum after 10pm and before 8am, especially when outside :) Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.021945152198896e-05,"social_amenities":0.0013598940568044782,"party_restriction":0.006643056869506836,"nearby_nightlife":0.049868274480104446}},{"text":"Welcome to the Koi Escape. a serene, stylish 3-bedroom, 2-bath retreat perched on the second floor of a beautifully restored historic home. Located just 2 blocks from Forsyth Park, this upper-level unit offers peaceful views, a private upper porch, and modern amenities - all within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s top restaurants, nightlife, and landmarks! Relax, recharge, and soak in the charm of the Historic District from your elevated Savannah sanctuary. SVR-02905 The space Private second-floor unit with no shared interior space Three comfortable bedrooms with premium linens and blackout curtains 2 updated bathrooms with quality finishes and fresh towels Spacious, shaded second-story porch overlooking garden and koi pond","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010771716915769503,"social_amenities":0.09150269627571106,"party_restriction":0.0035268873907625675,"nearby_nightlife":0.9669228792190552}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Welcome to the Koi Escape. a serene, stylish 3-bedroom, 2-bath retreat perched on the second floor of a beautifully restored historic home. Located just 2 blocks from Forsyth Park, this upper-level unit offers peaceful views, a private upper porch, and modern amenities - all within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s top restaurants, nightlife, and landmarks! Relax, recharge, and soak in the charm of the Historic District from your elevated Savannah sanctuary. SVR-02905 The space Private second-floor unit with no shared interior space Three comfortable bedrooms with premium linens and blackout curtains 2 updated bathrooms with quality finishes and fresh towels Spacious, shaded second-story porch overlooking garden and koi pond","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010771716915769503,"social_amenities":0.09150269627571106,"party_restriction":0.0035268873907625675,"nearby_nightlife":0.9669228792190552}},{"text":"There is a camera on the porch for security purposes only. Other things to note This is the lower unit of a duplex, so please be courteous to your neighbors and keep noise levels to a minimum after 10pm and before 8am, especially when outside :) Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":9.021945152198896e-05,"social_amenities":0.0013598940568044782,"party_restriction":0.006643056869506836,"nearby_nightlife":0.049868274480104446}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1447331076737864681","title":"The Koi Estate | Historic Charm | Dual Balconies!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1447331076737864681","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-02904","SVR-02905"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1447331076737864681","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"fa0d708b4b6954296010132b2262047d0c62b65f8b7457b33e685935c0e33e1d","chunks":7,"words":589,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.015221908688545227,"party_welcome":0.0014226489001885056,"social_amenities":0.015221908688545227,"party_restriction":0.9979682564735413,"nearby_nightlife":0.9512885808944702,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience Savannah\u2019s charm in this historic 6-bedroom, 4.5-bath home just 2 blocks from Forsyth Park. Perfect for large groups, it blends classic Southern elegance with modern comfort across two beautifully restored units. Enjoy spacious kitchens, peaceful koi pond views, expansive porches, and premium linens throughout. Walk to top dining, River Street, and landmarks\u2014your ideal group getaway in the heart of the Historic District. SVR-02904 + SVR-02905 The space This full-house rental combines two beautifully appointed units: Lower Unit (Koi Retreat) Enjoy bright, single-level living with three sunlit bedrooms and 2.5 modern baths. The chef\u2019s kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances, a breakfast bar, and Keurig plus drip coffee makers.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014226489001885056,"social_amenities":0.015221908688545227,"party_restriction":0.0013142338721081614,"nearby_nightlife":0.09963657706975937}},{"text":"Relax in the open living/dining area with smart TV and fast Wi-Fi, or step onto the expansive porch overlooking the koi pond and lush gardens. Central A/C, heating, and an in-unit washer/dryer make longer stays effortless. Upper Unit (Koi Escape) Perched on the second floor, this chic 3-bedroom, 2-bath sanctuary blends historic charm with elegant modern d\u00e9cor. Original hardwood floors, high ceilings, and classic molding provide an inviting atmosphere. Cook in the fully equipped kitchen, unwind on the shaded porch with treetop views, and enjoy peaceful privacy with no shared walls. Premium linens, beautiful bathrooms, and full laundry amenities complete the experience. Highlights:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016384341870434582,"social_amenities":0.00912072416394949,"party_restriction":0.0006247027777135372,"nearby_nightlife":0.004148282576352358}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Experience Savannah\u2019s charm in this historic 6-bedroom, 4.5-bath home just 2 blocks from F