rmation. \u2013We require that guests provide a valid credit card and piece of ID for identification purposes only. \u2013We do not accept peer-to-peer payment systems or any prepaid debit cards as methods of payment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014034772175364196,"social_amenities":0.011291778646409512,"party_restriction":0.0031312971841543913,"nearby_nightlife":0.006307773757725954}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"This upscale home in Savannah can fit up to 4 guests with its 2 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and a short walk to Forsyth Park. With its ample amenities, including a hot tub, this home is great for those who want to be near everything Savannah has to offer. The professionally designed spaces offer open-concept layouts and kitchen & dining spaces perfect for entertaining. The space FEATURES \u20131 indoor kitchen fully stocked with essential cookware \u2013Private outdoor area with hot tub \u2013Free on-street parking. Parking is on city property \u2013High-quality memory foam mattresses and linen \u2013High-speed internet \u2013High-end essential toiletries \u20131 TV located in the home ACCESSIBILITY & LAYOUT","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9800618290901184,"social_amenities":0.995074450969696,"party_restriction":0.0004916801117360592,"nearby_nightlife":0.1002005934715271}},{"text":"We will do our best to inform guests of pool and hot tub maintenance anytime this needs to occur and keep it as short as possible to maximize your use and enjoyment. BUSINESS DISCLAIMERS\u2013We have a minimum age requirement for booking this rental. Reservation holder must be 21 years or older. \u2013We request that guests complete a guest verification process and sign an additional agreement prior to receiving any check-in information. \u2013We require that guests provide a valid credit card and piece of ID for identification purposes only. \u2013We do not accept peer-to-peer payment systems or any prepaid debit cards as methods of payment.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":80,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014034772175364196,"social_amenities":0.011291778646409512,"party_restriction":0.0031312971841543913,"nearby_nightlife":0.006307773757725954}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 16020","address":"206 W DUFFY ST #A","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":5.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"53064527","title":"Charmer near Forsyth Park, Heated Pool Access!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/53064527","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-01616"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"53064527","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"683a2e1a2f4e5a510f9cf6b34f887fd2e29e2a2bbd96a1ca98535fc0605efc61","chunks":13,"words":1255,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.5820086598396301,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.03310409188270569,"nearby_nightlife":0.9910405278205872,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":138,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"A lovingly restored home near shops and restaurants, The Parsonage at Forsyth is the perfect choice in Savannah vacation rentals for up to seven guests. Its coveted address puts you in proximity to Forsyth Park, the heart of the Historic District. From evening strolls to morning coffee, you\u2019ll enjoy all the wonders of Savannah without the worries of how to get around. Most of the area is walkable from The Parsonage. The space Your Savannah Vacation Rentals Accommodation Turn down the quiet, tree-lined street to The Parsonage at Forsyth. As you approach, the covered front porch and carved pillars will work their unique charm, beckoning you in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028991003637202084,"social_amenities":0.5773801207542419,"party_restriction":0.03310409188270569,"nearby_nightlife":0.01588595286011696}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Established in the 1840s, Forsyth covers a full 30 acres of recreational space, so you and your crew are sure to find plenty of activities to try throughout your stay. Some of the park's most popular features include: The Forsyth Fountain, a frequent backdrop for small weddings and photo ops, built in 1858 Fragrant garden for the blind Forsyth Farmers Market, open every Saturday year-round Tennis and basketball courts Playing fields Walking paths Children\u2019s play areas You\u2019ll also find plenty of nearby restaurants and snack stations to fuel your family and friends as you enjoy your stay. Start your morning at The Sentient Bean at 13 E. Park Ave.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5820086598396301,"social_amenities":0.0016549795400351286,"party_restriction":0.0002575890684965998,"nearby_nightlife":0.9887686967849731}},{"text":"You can get on or off at any of the Historic District\u2019s 22 town squares too. Alight at City Market or River Street for local artwork, candy, clothes and souvenir shopping. As a city that celebrates throughout the year, Savannah also offers lots of festivals and events. One may coincide with your time at vacation rentals Savannah GA, such as: The Savannah Film Festival \u2013 October Martin Luther King Jr. Parade \u2013 January Savannah Irish Festival and Greening of the Fountain \u2013 March Savannah Jazz Festival \u2013 September SVR-01616 Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.17298449575901031,"social_amenities":0.004061838611960411,"party_restriction":0.0008924693102017045,"nearby_nightlife":0.9895623326301575}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":138,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"A lovingly restored home near shops and restaurants, The Parsonage at Forsyth is the perfect choice in Savannah vacation rentals for up to seven guests. Its coveted address puts you in proximity to Forsyth Park, the heart of the Historic District. From evening strolls to morning coffee, you\u2019ll enjoy all the wonders of Savannah without the worries of how to get around. Most of the area is walkable from The Parsonage. The space Your Savannah Vacation Rentals Accommodation Turn down the quiet, tree-lined street to The Parsonage at Forsyth. As you approach, the covered front porch and carved pillars will work their unique charm, beckoning you in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028991003637202084,"social_amenities":0.5773801207542419,"party_restriction":0.03310409188270569,"nearby_nightlife":0.01588595286011696}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"A lovingly restored home near shops and restaurants, The Parsonage at Forsyth is the perfect choice in Savannah vacation rentals for up to seven guests. Its coveted address puts you in proximity to Forsyth Park, the heart of the Historic District. From evening strolls to morning coffee, you\u2019ll enjoy all the wonders of Savannah without the worries of how to get around. Most of the area is walkable from The Parsonage. The space Your Savannah Vacation Rentals Accommodation Turn down the quiet, tree-lined street to The Parsonage at Forsyth. As you approach, the covered front porch and carved pillars will work their unique charm, beckoning you in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00028991003637202084,"social_amenities":0.5773801207542419,"party_restriction":0.03310409188270569,"nearby_nightlife":0.01588595286011696}},{"text":"Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving Day before Christmas Eve, Christmas Eve & Day, and the day after Christmas Day Day before New Years Day, New Years Day, and the day after New Years Day Day before MLK Day, MLK Day, and the day after MLK Day Summer Hours of the North End Pool - Unheated Open daily from 10:00 a.m.\u20135:00 p.m. May 31\u2013Tuesday after Labor Day Guests with Pets This property is not pet-friendly. If you\u2019re traveling with a dog, ask us about our pet-friendly properties that accommodate up to 2 dogs (50 lb combined weight max) for a $130 pet fee. Occupancy","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":152,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024609858519397676,"social_amenities":0.0020168281625956297,"party_restriction":0.0027561357710510492,"nearby_nightlife":0.01855984702706337}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"for gourmet coffee and an all-day breakfast, soup, sandwich and salad menu. Local 11 Ten, just a block south of the park, is a great place to get fresh seafood, wine and more. If you\u2019re just plain tuckered out after a lively day in the park, stop by the Forsyth Caf\u00e9 for refreshments. The menu for this onsite venue covers favorites for kids and grownups alike, plus snacks and beverages. When you want to sample some of the city\u2019s most popular shops, simply catch the free shuttle bus at one of several stops along the circumference of the park.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":107,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013121202355250716,"social_amenities":0.009274810552597046,"party_restriction":0.0018469318747520447,"nearby_nightlife":0.9910405278205872}},{"text":"You can get on or off at any of the Historic District\u2019s 22 town squares too. Alight at City Market or River Street for local artwork, candy, clothes and souvenir shopping. As a city that celebrates throughout the year, Savannah also offers lots of festivals and events. One may coincide with your time at vacation rentals Savannah GA, such as: The Savannah Film Festival \u2013 October Martin Luther King Jr. Parade \u2013 January Savannah Irish Festival and Greening of the Fountain \u2013 March Savannah Jazz Festival \u2013 September SVR-01616 Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":115,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.17298449575901031,"social_amenities":0.004061838611960411,"party_restriction":0.0008924693102017045,"nearby_nightlife":0.989562