als and events all year long. Some of the highlights that occur throughout the year include the Savannah Jazz Festival, the Pin Point Seafood Festival, Bacon Fest, the River Street Food Festival and the Savannah Music Festival.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9839525818824768,"social_amenities":0.007567028049379587,"party_restriction":0.002829318167641759,"nearby_nightlife":0.9745785593986511}}]}}},{"listing_id":"30766645","title":"Heated Pool Access | 5*Clean | Flex Cancelation","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/30766645","guests":12.0,"permits":["SVR-00565","SVR-01638"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"30766645","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3b7939db99338c34cf02f1b1e846fb8cb54349c53229e802ad6e938da0d1a4b4","chunks":15,"words":1450,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.959004282951355,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.003989186603575945,"nearby_nightlife":0.977367103099823,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"It includes an extra large sink, plenty of food prep area and then an island with a range. If you love to cook, you won't want to leave this kitchen. The formal dining room is sure to upgrade your meal times with a decorative fireplace, long dining table and a curio hutch in the corner. Bedrooms are also individually decorated with their own design schemes. Getting Around Downtown From Vacation Rentals Savannah GA When you're ready to leave the comfortable confines of our Savannah vacation rentals, the entirety of the historic downtown is at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004911297583021224,"social_amenities":0.12861518561840057,"party_restriction":0.003989186603575945,"nearby_nightlife":0.022628124803304672}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the Beach in July \u2022 Tybee Pirate Fest in October \u2022 Tybee Island New Year's Eve Fireworks in December Savannah Vacation Homes Holidays and Events Regardless of when you come to Savannah, there's always the possibility of special events happening during your stay. The following are some examples: \u2022 Annual Martin Luther King, Jr. Day Celebration in January \u2022 Savannah Black Heritage Festival in February \u2022 Georgia Heritage Society's Colonial Faire and Muster in February \u2022 First Saturday on the River festival from March to December \u2022 Saint Patrick's Day in Savannah in March \u2022 SCAD Sidewalk Arts Festival in April","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.959004282951355,"social_amenities":0.01168206986039877,"party_restriction":0.0008576493128202856,"nearby_nightlife":0.8828334808349609}},{"text":"\u2022 Fine Arts on the River Festival in May \u2022 Fourth of July Fireworks on the River in July \u2022 Oktoberfest on the River in October \u2022 Telfair Art Fair in November \u2022 Savannah Harbor Boat Parade of Lights in November \u2022 City Market New Year's Eve Celebration in December SVR-01638 & SVR-00565 Guest access Main House: King Bedroom with Private Bath Queen Bedroom with Shared Attached Bath Sitting room with Sleeping for Four (Two Daybeds with Trundles/4 twin beds) and Shared Attached Bath 3 Baths Living Room with Seating for 10 Dining Table that Seats 10 4 Flat Screen Televisions Washer and Dryer","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":101,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9329917430877686,"social_amenities":0.001917757443152368,"party_restriction":0.00043007629574276507,"nearby_nightlife":0.9389780163764954}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"It includes an extra large sink, plenty of food prep area and then an island with a range. If you love to cook, you won't want to leave this kitchen. The formal dining room is sure to upgrade your meal times with a decorative fireplace, long dining table and a curio hutch in the corner. Bedrooms are also individually decorated with their own design schemes. Getting Around Downtown From Vacation Rentals Savannah GA When you're ready to leave the comfortable confines of our Savannah vacation rentals, the entirety of the historic downtown is at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004911297583021224,"social_amenities":0.12861518561840057,"party_restriction":0.003989186603575945,"nearby_nightlife":0.022628124803304672}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"It includes an extra large sink, plenty of food prep area and then an island with a range. If you love to cook, you won't want to leave this kitchen. The formal dining room is sure to upgrade your meal times with a decorative fireplace, long dining table and a curio hutch in the corner. Bedrooms are also individually decorated with their own design schemes. Getting Around Downtown From Vacation Rentals Savannah GA When you're ready to leave the comfortable confines of our Savannah vacation rentals, the entirety of the historic downtown is at your fingertips.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":49,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004911297583021224,"social_amenities":0.12861518561840057,"party_restriction":0.003989186603575945,"nearby_nightlife":0.022628124803304672}},{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy warm Atlantic beaches and sumptuous waterfront dining for a relaxing day trip. The island also features plenty of shopping opportunities, from gift shops to specialty boutiques. The top attractions on Tybee include the Tybee Lighthouse on the north end and the Marine Science Center on the south end. There are also numerous opportunities for active guests, including biking around the island, water activities, fishing and walking. Civil War buffs will enjoy exploring Fort Screven and nearby Fort Pulaski. Tybee Island also has its share of special events and some of the favorites include: \u2022 Mardi Gras Tybee in February \u2022 Tybee Irish Heritage Celebration Parade in March","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03449388965964317,"social_amenities":0.002910423092544079,"party_restriction":0.0007523351232521236,"nearby_nightlife":0.977367103099823}},{"text":"You'll also find a number of other popular spots to the north of the park, including the Mercer-Williams House, Calhoun Square, the Massie Heritage Center and the Ralph Mark Gilbert Civil Rights Museum. At the very north end of the Savannah Historic District is River Street. This long concourse along the Savannah River boasts a variety of places to eat and shop. Explore Nearby Tybee Island From Savannah Vacation Rentals Our Savannah vacation homes guests often enjoy taking a break from exploring downtown Savannah to take a trip over to Tybee Island. This little barrier island is big on beach charm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023539402172900736,"social_amenities":0.06061825901269913,"party_restriction":0.0008388497517444193,"nearby_nightlife":0.9623869061470032}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 29013","address":"1321 JEFFERSON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":5,"Noise-par