 a gas range, refrigerator/freezer, filtered water and the essentials needed to prepare meals or enjoy a relaxed night in. Private Backyard Enjoy your own outdoor space with seating and a fire pit, perfect for an evening drink, conversation or unwinding after exploring the city. Laundry An in-unit washer and dryer are available for your convenience, especially useful for longer stays. Guest Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9268351793289185,"social_amenities":0.9684541821479797,"party_restriction":0.0006988741224631667,"nearby_nightlife":0.06043463572859764}},{"text":"Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Gas stove Single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":260,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003703325637616217,"social_amenities":0.958285391330719,"party_restriction":0.00037833969690836966,"nearby_nightlife":0.0021927591878920794}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"A welcoming gathering space designed for relaxing, dining and planning your next Savannah adventure. Private Balcony Step outside onto your private balcony overlooking Jefferson Street and take in the atmosphere of Savannah\u2019s historic streets. Kitchen The fully equipped kitchen includes a gas range, refrigerator/freezer, filtered water and the essentials needed to prepare meals or enjoy a relaxed night in. Private Backyard Enjoy your own outdoor space with seating and a fire pit, perfect for an evening drink, conversation or unwinding after exploring the city. Laundry An in-unit washer and dryer are available for your convenience, especially useful for longer stays. Guest Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9268351793289185,"social_amenities":0.9684541821479797,"party_restriction":0.0006988741224631667,"nearby_nightlife":0.06043463572859764}},{"text":"Whether you\u2019re visiting Savannah for a weekend getaway, a family trip, a celebration, a wedding, or simply a few days of exploring, Midnight Magnolia gives you the best of both worlds: the character of historic Savannah and the privacy of your own home. The Space Primary Suite A comfortable private retreat featuring a premium Tempur-Pedic king mattress and a private bathroom with a beautifully tiled walk-in shower. Second Bedroom A spacious bedroom with a Tempur-Pedic queen mattress and a comfortable sitting area, perfect for relaxing after a day exploring Savannah. Third Bedroom A comfortable additional bedroom that works well for families, friends or additional guests. Living & Dining","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002978430362418294,"social_amenities":0.0012351307086646557,"party_restriction":0.0011530816555023193,"nearby_nightlife":0.006484422367066145}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A welcoming gathering space designed for relaxing, dining and planning your next Savannah adventure. Private Balcony Step outside onto your private balcony overlooking Jefferson Street and take in the atmosphere of Savannah\u2019s historic streets. Kitchen The fully equipped kitchen includes a gas range, refrigerator/freezer, filtered water and the essentials needed to prepare meals or enjoy a relaxed night in. Private Backyard Enjoy your own outdoor space with seating and a fire pit, perfect for an evening drink, conversation or unwinding after exploring the city. Laundry An in-unit washer and dryer are available for your convenience, especially useful for longer stays. Guest Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9268351793289185,"social_amenities":0.9684541821479797,"party_restriction":0.0006988741224631667,"nearby_nightlife":0.06043463572859764}},{"text":"Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Gas stove Single oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Shared backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities","section":"AMENITIES","line":260,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003703325637616217,"social_amenities":0.958285391330719,"party_restriction":0.00037833969690836966,"nearby_nightlife":0.0021927591878920794}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"If you\u2019re looking for a Savannah stay with historic character, walkable access to Forsyth Park, private outdoor space and the comfort of an entire home, we think you\u2019ll feel right at home here. A Proven Savannah Stay Midnight Magnolia was previously operated as The Gnome Home, a highly reviewed Savannah vacation rental that welcomed hundreds of guests and earned a 4.9-star rating across 350+ reviews. The home has since been refreshed and relaunched as Midnight Magnolia, with updated design, furnishings and amenities while preserving the historic character that made the property special. Guest access Guest Access & Parking - Free street parking is widely available.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":149,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.001306456862948835,"social_amenities":0.017515012994408607,"party_restriction":0.008015124127268791,"nearby_nightlife":0.007540340069681406}},{"text":"- Some road noise may be heard at times, as the home sits within a vibrant urban setting. - There is no machine dishwasher - These details add to the authenticity and story of the space! Neighborhood & Surroundings The property is located in a culturally rich and evolving area near Forsyth Park in Savannah, surrounded by historic architecture, local character, and exciting revitalization. - You\u2019ll be immersed in true Savannah culture with great people and a strong sense of community. - There are ongoing improvements and development projects on nearby lots as owners continue enhancing the neighborhood.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":198,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003993362479377538,"social_amenities":0.003459037048742175,"party_restriction":0.0070833442732691765,"nearby_nightlife":0.03463112190365791}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You\u2019ll have private access to the entire second-floor home, including the living spaces, bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchen, balcony and private outdoor areas associated with Midnight Magnolia. A smart lock provides convenient self check-in. One dedicated off-street parking space is available near the rear entrance on the Anderson Street side of the property. Additional street parking is generally available nearby; please observe posted signs and street-sweeping restrictions. Location One of Midnight Magnolia\u2019s biggest advantages is simple: you can leave the car behind. Forsyth Park is approximately an 8-minute walk away, putting you close to Savannah\u2019s famous historic streets, architecture, restaurants, coffee shops, bars and green spaces.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00033827725565060973,"social_amenities":0.0043250578455626965,"party_restriction":0.0018130377866327763,"nearby_nightlife":0.9764229655265808}},{"text":"Designed for travelers who want to experience Savannah rather than simply visit it, this spacious 3-bedroom, 2-bath home combines original historic character with moody, modern design and the comforts of a private home. Start your morning with coffee on the private balcony, spend the day exploring Savannah\u2019s iconic squares, restaurants, boutiques and bars on foot, then come home to your own private backyard. Inside, you\u2019ll find a comfortable king suite, a queen bedroom with its own sitting area, a third bedroom, two full bathrooms, a fully equipped kitchen, in-unit washer and dryer, dedicated parking and thoughtful touches throughout. Why guests love Midnight Magnolia:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024625539663247764,"social_amenities":0.0031860661692917347,"party_restriction":0.0002787850680761039,"nearby_nightlife":0.8582425117492676}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20052 29014","address":"1319 JEFFERSON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":4,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":5,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24065068210","date":"2024-03-05","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1319 Jefferson St","recorded_pin":"20052 29014","side":"direct"},{"number":"24159168037","date":"2024-06-07","type":"24 PAST TRESPASSING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1319 Jefferson St","recorded_pin":"20052 29014","side":"direct"},{"number":"26229238522","date":"2026-08-17","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS ACTIVITY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1319 Jefferson St","recorded_pin":"20052 29014","side":"direct"},{"number":"26230238547","date":"2026-08-18","type":"69 SUSPICIOUS vehicle","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1319 Jefferson St","recorded_pin":"20052 29014","side":"direct"},{"number":"24342356908","date":"2024-12-07","type":"71 PAST SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"1321 Jefferson St","recorded_pin":"20052 29013","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"978329689456516306","title":"The Chicken Shack, Funky | Eclectic | Dog-Friendly","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/978329689456516306","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-02842"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20053 01003","address":"418 E DUFFY ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":12.0,"advertised_guests":14.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"25012011092","date":"2025-01-12","type":"59-4 INDECENCY/LEWDNESS","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"418 E Duffy St","recorded_pin":"20053 01003","side":"direct"},{"number":"25316321886","date":"2025-11-12","type":"***Generic Law Call","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"416 E Duffy St","recorded_pin":"20053 01004","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1354422942807545367","title":"Savannah Getaway @ The Lemondrop - Group Friendly!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1354422942807545367","guests":14.0,"permits":["SVR-02490"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1354422942807545367","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"72d01dd72082f7394c7f8498b4f66f49011f68987488236cf7ab0fb3813c6ea1","chunks":12,"words":1139,"party_signal":0.9876949787139893,"social_signal":0.3271346092224121,"party_welcome":0.9876949787139893,"social_amenities":0.3271346092224121,"party_restriction":0.005448347423225641,"nearby_nightlife":0.9941046833992004,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"\ud83c\udf4b\ud83d\udc9b This listing gives your group THREE completely private 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom condos in the same colorful Savannah home\u2014perfect for large families, groups of friends, wedding weekends, girls' trips, or anyone who wants to stay together while still having plenty of room to spread out! Each condo has its own private entrance with no shared indoor spaces, plus its own full kitchen, living room, dining area, washer + dryer, and all the comforts of home. Your group can gather together when you want and retreat to your own space when you don't! And when it's time to wind down, there's no fighting over the TV\u2014every bedroom has its own Smart TV!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9876949787139893,"social_amenities":0.005033119115978479,"party_restriction":0.0004311666125431657,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003977162705268711},"affirmative_event_evidence":"\ud83c\udf4b\ud83d\udc9b This listing gives your group THREE completely private 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom condos in the same colorful Savannah home\u2014perfect for large families, groups of friends, wedding weekends, girls' trips, or anyone who wants to stay together while still having plenty of room to spread out!"}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Tucked toward the back of the property, Lemon Lane offers a little extra privacy and its own fantastic outdoor space. Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: Queen bed Living Room: Queen pull-out sofa The bathroom features a walk-in shower with a sliding glass door, and the full kitchen includes a refrigerator with an ice maker. Lemon Lane also has its own living room, dining area, washer + dryer, Keurig, and private entrance. But the real bonus at Lemon Lane is the private fenced courtyard! \ud83c\udf3f\u2728 Enjoy outdoor seating, a BBQ grill, and plenty of ambiance for hanging out together after a day exploring Savannah. \ud83c\udfe1 THREE CONDOS.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008638439467176795,"social_amenities":0.3271346092224121,"party_restriction":0.0010178666561841965,"nearby_nightlife":0.0408727191388607}},{"text":"Bring the whole crew to The Lemon Drop! \ud83c\udf4b This listing includes THREE private 2BR/1BA condos in the same bright & cheerful Savannah home\u2014perfect for families and friend groups who want to stay together while still having their own space! Each condo has a full kitchen, living + dining area, and one features a fabulous outdoor patio. Enjoy 1 private parking space + a fantastic location just a few blocks from Forsyth Park! \ud83c\udf33\ud83d\udc9b SVR-02490, 02491, 02492 The space Welcome to The Lemon Drop!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399266242980957,"social_amenities":0.30760547518730164,"party_restriction":0.000423635879997164,"nearby_nightlife":0.004430478438735008}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\ud83c\udf4b\ud83d\udc9b This listing gives your group THREE completely private 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom condos in the same colorful Savannah home\u2014perfect for large families, groups of friends, wedding weekends, girls' trips, or anyone who wants to stay together while still having plenty of room to spread out! Each condo has its own private entrance with no shared indoor spaces, plus its own full kitchen, living room, dining area, washer + dryer, and all the comforts of home. Your group can gather together when you want and retreat to your own space when you don't! And when it's time to wind down, there's no fighting over the TV\u2014every bedroom has its own Smart TV!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9876949787139893,"social_amenities":0.005033119115978479,"party_restriction":0.0004311666125431657,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003977162705268711}},{"text":"Bring the whole crew to The Lemon Drop! \ud83c\udf4b This listing includes THREE private 2BR/1BA condos in the same bright & cheerful Savannah home\u2014perfect for families and friend groups who want to stay together while still having their own space! Each condo has a full kitchen, living + dining area, and one features a fabulous outdoor patio. Enjoy 1 private parking space + a fantastic location just a few blocks from Forsyth Park! \ud83c\udf33\ud83d\udc9b SVR-02490, 02491, 02492 The space Welcome to The Lemon Drop!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399266242980957,"social_amenities":0.30760547518730164,"party_restriction":0.000423635879997164,"nearby_nightlife":0.004430478438735008}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Tucked toward the back of the property, Lemon Lane offers a little extra privacy and its own fantastic outdoor space. Bedroom 1: King bed Bedroom 2: Queen bed Living Room: Queen pull-out sofa The bathroom features a walk-in shower with a sliding glass door, and the full kitchen includes a refrigerator with an ice maker. Lemon Lane also has its own living room, dining area, washer + dryer, Keurig, and private entrance. But the real bonus at Lemon Lane is the private fenced courtyard! \ud83c\udf3f\u2728 Enjoy outdoor seating, a BBQ grill, and plenty of ambiance for hanging out together after a day exploring Savannah. \ud83c\udfe1 THREE CONDOS.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008638439467176795,"social_amenities":0.3271346092224121,"party_restriction":0.0010178666561841965,"nearby_nightlife":0.0408727191388607}},{"text":"Bring the whole crew to The Lemon Drop! \ud83c\udf4b This listing includes THREE private 2BR/1BA condos in the same bright & cheerful Savannah home\u2014perfect for families and friend groups who want to stay together while still having their own space! Each condo has a full kitchen, living + dining area, and one features a fabulous outdoor patio. Enjoy 1 private parking space + a fantastic location just a few blocks from Forsyth Park! \ud83c\udf33\ud83d\udc9b SVR-02490, 02491, 02492 The space Welcome to The Lemon Drop!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9399266242980957,"social_amenities":0.30760547518730164,"party_restriction":0.000423635879997164,"nearby_nightlife":0.004430478438735008}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Your reservation includes one private off-street parking space behind the building. There is also plenty of free street parking around the property for additional vehicles. \ud83c\udf33 A QUIET SPOT CLOSE TO THE FUN The Lemon Drop is located in Savannah's beautiful Victorian District, just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park. It's one of our favorite parts of Savannah because you get the best of both worlds\u2014a quieter, residential neighborhood to come home to while still being close to everything that makes Savannah such a fun place to visit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038419777411036193,"social_amenities":0.00349807390011847,"party_restriction":0.005448347423225641,"nearby_nightlife":0.9519569873809814}},{"text":"\ud83d\udcfa Each condo also has a Keurig, and we'll have a few K-Cups waiting to help get your first Savannah mornings started. \u2615\ufe0f Here's what you'll have: \ud83c\udf4b LEMON TWIST \u2013 Upstairs Front | 2BR/1BA Bright, spacious, and full of personality, Lemon Twist is our second-floor, street-facing condo. Bedroom 1: King bed + twin daybed Bedroom 2: Queen bed The modern bathroom features a walk-in shower. You'll also have a spacious living room, dining area, full kitchen, washer + dryer, Keurig, and private entrance. The refrigerator does not have an ice maker. \ud83d\udc9b MAIN SQUEEZE \u2013 Downstairs Front | 2BR/1BA","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010375888086855412,"social_amenities":0.005831177346408367,"party_restriction":0.0017195987747982144,"nearby_nightlife":0.017477301880717278}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Take a morning stroll beneath the live oaks, walk over to Forsyth Park, or grab something to eat at nearby neighborhood favorites like Pizza Party and Tacos + Tequila. \ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf79 From here, you can continue exploring Savannah's historic squares, restaurants, bars, shopping, and sightseeing. \ud83d\udc9b HOSTED BY LOCALS We're Megan & Justin, Savannah locals who love this city and love sharing it with our guests! We're always happy to recommend our favorite restaurants, bars, coffee shops, sightseeing spots, hidden gems, and things to do. Looking for the perfect brunch? A great cocktail? Somewhere the locals actually go? Just ask!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":116,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010813728906214237,"social_amenities":0.009144887328147888,"party_restriction":0.0004321593150962144,"nearby_nightlife":0.9941046833992004}},{"text":"Your reservation includes one private off-street parking space behind the building. There is also plenty of free street parking around the property for additional vehicles. \ud83c\udf33 A QUIET SPOT CLOSE TO THE FUN The Lemon Drop is located in Savannah's beautiful Victorian District, just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park. It's one of our favorite parts of Savannah because you get the best of both worlds\u2014a quieter, residential neighborhood to come home to while still being close to everything that makes Savannah such a fun place to visit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":110,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038419777411036193,"social_amenities":0.00349807390011847,"party_restriction":0.005448347423225641,"nearby_nightlife":0.9519569873809814}}]}}},{"listing_id":"605832634043566264","title":"The Lemon Drop: Simply The Zest Condo in Savannah!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/605832634043566264","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02491"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"605832634043566264","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"4ce022811a03ae0c2f90e3fe7387fdbe9c7b72cd99430fdd9f6148d34b425d06","chunks":15,"words":1363,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.18601974844932556,"party_welcome":0.9197145700454712,"social_amenities":0.18601974844932556,"party_restriction":0.01145922765135765,"nearby_nightlife":0.9971626400947571,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Make The Lemon Drop your Savannah home away from home! \ud83c\udf4b We\u2019ve squeezed as much color, character & Southern charm as possible into this bright first-floor 2BR/1BA condo that sleeps 6! Once a neighborhood storefront dating to 1910, it now offers tons of natural light, a spacious living + dining area, full kitchen & washer/dryer. Tucked in the quiet Victorian District just a few blocks from Forsyth Park \ud83c\udf33, it\u2019s a sweet home base for exploring Savannah! \ud83d\udc9b SVR 02491 The space Welcome to The Lemon Drop! \ud83c\udf4b We've squeezed as much color, character, and Southern charm as possible into this bright and cheerful first-floor Savannah condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045366203994490206,"social_amenities":0.18601974844932556,"party_restriction":0.004573990125209093,"nearby_nightlife":0.000782493909355253}},{"text":"No meters, parking garages, or extra daily parking fees\u2014find a spot and start enjoying Savannah! \ud83d\udc3e PET FRIENDLY Don't want to leave your four-legged family member behind? Bring them along! The Lemon Drop is pet friendly with an additional pet fee. \ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc9b Please include your pet when making your reservation so the appropriate pet fee can be added to your stay. \ud83d\udc9b LOCALLY OWNED + MANAGED We're Megan & Justin, Savannah locals, and we love getting to share our city with our guests! The Lemon Drop isn't managed by a big, far-away vacation rental company\u2014you'll have local hosts who know Savannah and are nearby if you need us.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003398508415557444,"social_amenities":0.10925715416669846,"party_restriction":0.003928633406758308,"nearby_nightlife":0.001555882510729134}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"It's a great way for families and friends to stay just steps from each other while still having their own bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchens, living spaces, and a little privacy! Whether you're visiting for a weekend getaway, family vacation, girls' trip, wedding, or just because, The Lemon Drop gives you a colorful, comfortable place to call home while you experience one of our favorite cities. \ud83c\udf4b\ud83d\udc9b Guest access The entire first floor condo is all yours! You'll enter using your own coded front door and there is no shared space whatsoever. Other things to note Parking is free and easy on the street right out front!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":127,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9197145700454712,"social_amenities":0.0028794812969863415,"party_restriction":0.00208819261752069,"nearby_nightlife":0.010500946082174778}},{"text":"You'll be just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park, making it easy to start your morning with a walk beneath the live oaks, visit the famous fountain, grab a coffee, or enjoy one of the many events happening in the park. You'll also have neighborhood restaurants within walking distance! Grab a slice at Pizza Party \ud83c\udf55 or head to Tacos + Tequila for tacos and margaritas. \ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf79 Ready to explore downtown? Savannah's downtown nightlife, restaurants, historic squares, and River Street are about a 20-minute walk away, or just a very quick Uber ride.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3296002745628357,"social_amenities":0.0028240331448614597,"party_restriction":0.001271511660888791,"nearby_nightlife":0.9971626400947571}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Make The Lemon Drop your Savannah home away from home! \ud83c\udf4b We\u2019ve squeezed as much color, character & Southern charm as possible into this bright first-floor 2BR/1BA condo that sleeps 6! Once a neighborhood storefront dating to 1910, it now offers tons of natural light, a spacious living + dining area, full kitchen & washer/dryer. Tucked in the quiet Victorian District just a few blocks from Forsyth Park \ud83c\udf33, it\u2019s a sweet home base for exploring Savannah! \ud83d\udc9b SVR 02491 The space Welcome to The Lemon Drop! \ud83c\udf4b We've squeezed as much color, character, and Southern charm as possible into this bright and cheerful first-floor Savannah condo.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045366203994490206,"social_amenities":0.18601974844932556,"party_restriction":0.004573990125209093,"nearby_nightlife":0.000782493909355253}},{"text":"No meters, parking garages, or extra daily parking fees\u2014find a spot and start enjoying Savannah! \ud83d\udc3e PET FRIENDLY Don't want to leave your four-legged family member behind? Bring them along! The Lemon Drop is pet friendly with an additional pet fee. \ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc9b Please include your pet when making your reservation so the appropriate pet fee can be added to your stay. \ud83d\udc9b LOCALLY OWNED + MANAGED We're Megan & Justin, Savannah locals, and we love getting to share our city with our guests! The Lemon Drop isn't managed by a big, far-away vacation rental company\u2014you'll have local hosts who know Savannah and are nearby if you need us.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003398508415557444,"social_amenities":0.10925715416669846,"party_restriction":0.003928633406758308,"nearby_nightlife":0.001555882510729134}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"You can also hop aboard Savannah's FREE DOT shuttle, which picks up at Forsyth Park and makes stops throughout the Historic District\u2014an easy way to explore without worrying about driving or parking! \ud83d\ude8e We love that this location gives you the best of both worlds: a peaceful neighborhood to come home to with so much of Savannah easily accessible on foot, by free shuttle, or with a quick ride. \ud83c\udf33\u2728 \ud83d\ude97 PARKING This condo does not have a dedicated off-street parking space, but there is free and easy street parking around The Lemon Drop and throughout the surrounding neighborhood.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":103,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012441640719771385,"social_amenities":0.022007199004292488,"party_restriction":0.01145922765135765,"nearby_nightlife":0.026711929589509964}},{"text":"We're also always happy to share our favorite restaurants, bars, coffee shops, sightseeing spots, hidden gems, and things to do. Looking for the perfect brunch? A great cocktail? Kid-friendly activities? Something fun to do on a rainy day? Just ask! We love helping our guests experience Savannah like a local. \ud83c\udf4b TRAVELING WITH A BIGGER GROUP? The Lemon Drop is actually home to multiple completely separate vacation rentals, each with its own private entrance and no shared indoor spaces. If you're traveling with a larger group, consider booking one or more of our other units - you can find those under our profile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015980203170329332,"social_amenities":0.014059998095035553,"party_restriction":0.0062455604784190655,"nearby_nightlife":0.988606870174408}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You'll be just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park, making it easy to start your morning with a walk beneath the live oaks, visit the famous fountain, grab a coffee, or enjoy one of the many events happening in the park. You'll also have neighborhood restaurants within walking distance! Grab a slice at Pizza Party \ud83c\udf55 or head to Tacos + Tequila for tacos and margaritas. \ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf79 Ready to explore downtown? Savannah's downtown nightlife, restaurants, historic squares, and River Street are about a 20-minute walk away, or just a very quick Uber ride.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.3296002745628357,"social_amenities":0.0028240331448614597,"party_restriction":0.001271511660888791,"nearby_nightlife":0.9971626400947571}},{"text":"We're also always happy to share our favorite restaurants, bars, coffee shops, sightseeing spots, hidden gems, and things to do. Looking for the perfect brunch? A great cocktail? Kid-friendly activities? Something fun to do on a rainy day? Just ask! We love helping our guests experience Savannah like a local. \ud83c\udf4b TRAVELING WITH A BIGGER GROUP? The Lemon Drop is actually home to multiple completely separate vacation rentals, each with its own private entrance and no shared indoor spaces. If you're traveling with a larger group, consider booking one or more of our other units - you can find those under our profile.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":121,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0015980203170329332,"social_amenities":0.014059998095035553,"party_restriction":0.0062455604784190655,"nearby_nightlife":0.988606870174408}}]}}},{"listing_id":"730411902784605095","title":"Chic, Impeccably Styled 2BR Condo @ The Lemon Drop","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/730411902784605095","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-02492"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"730411902784605095","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"544f21b5a07fa5f2f3f5cda8e4301f27eb49c71913366379198a3309ec918846","chunks":14,"words":1345,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.22531679272651672,"party_welcome":0.03966022655367851,"social_amenities":0.22531679272651672,"party_restriction":0.010532514192163944,"nearby_nightlife":0.9974793791770935,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":172,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002137586852768436,"social_amenities":0.22531679272651672,"party_restriction":0.00029321180772967637,"nearby_nightlife":0.00044005512609146535}},{"text":"Enjoy your morning coffee outside, gather around the outdoor dining area, or fire up the gas grill for dinner at home. When the sun goes down, sparkling string lights add a little extra ambiance for a relaxing Savannah evening. \u2728 \ud83c\udf73 FULL KITCHEN + DINING Step inside to a thoughtfully renovated full kitchen with modern finishes and everything you need for your stay. Whether you're throwing together breakfast before heading out or enjoying a quiet dinner at home, you'll have the essentials on hand. The kitchen includes a range, dishwasher, refrigerator with ice maker, cookware, dishes, and other kitchen basics.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003283309342805296,"social_amenities":0.0992024689912796,"party_restriction":0.0004084926622454077,"nearby_nightlife":0.016918299719691277}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Lemon Lane is located in Savannah's beautiful Victorian District, a quieter, more residential part of the city that still keeps you close to all the fun. You'll be just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park, making it easy to start your morning with a walk beneath the live oaks, visit the famous fountain, grab a coffee, or enjoy one of the many events happening in the park. You'll also have neighborhood restaurants within close walking distance! Grab a slice at Pizza Party \ud83c\udf55 or head to Tacos + Tequila for tacos and margaritas. \ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf79 Ready to explore downtown?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03966022655367851,"social_amenities":0.006308019161224365,"party_restriction":0.002951892791315913,"nearby_nightlife":0.9974793791770935}},{"text":"Savannah's downtown nightlife, restaurants, historic squares, and River Street are about a 20-minute walk away, or just a very quick Uber ride. You can also hop aboard Savannah's FREE DOT shuttle, which picks up at Forsyth Park and makes stops throughout the Historic District\u2014an easy way to explore without worrying about driving or parking! \ud83d\ude8e We love that this location gives you the best of both worlds: a peaceful neighborhood to come home to with so much of Savannah easily accessible on foot, by free shuttle, or with a quick ride. \ud83d\udc3e PET FRIENDLY Your four-legged family members are welcome at Lemon Lane!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":108,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002904111985117197,"social_amenities":0.01697435788810253,"party_restriction":0.010532514192163944,"nearby_nightlife":0.9853792190551758}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"In a common space Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services","section":"AMENITIES","line":172,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002137586852768436,"social_amenities":0.22531679272651672,"party_restriction":0.00029321180772967637,"nearby_nightlife":0.00044005512609146535}},{"text":"Enjoy your morning coffee outside, gather around the outdoor dining area, or fire up the gas grill for dinner at home. When the sun goes down, sparkling string lights add a little extra ambiance for a relaxing Savannah evening. \u2728 \ud83c\udf73 FULL KITCHEN + DINING Step inside to a thoughtfully renovated full kitchen with modern finishes and everything you need for your stay. Whether you're throwing together breakfast before heading out or enjoying a quiet dinner at home, you'll have the essentials on hand. The kitchen includes a range, dishwasher, refrigerator with ice maker, cookware, dishes, and other kitchen basics.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003283309342805296,"social_amenities":0.0992024689912796,"party_restriction":0.0004084926622454077,"nearby_nightlife":0.016918299719691277}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Savannah's downtown nightlife, restaurants, historic squares, and River Street are about a 20-minute walk away, or just a very quick Uber ride. You can also hop aboard Savannah's FREE DOT shuttle, which picks up at Forsyth Park and makes stops throughout the Historic District\u2014an easy way to explore without worrying about driving or parking! \ud83d\ude8e We love that this location gives you the best of both worlds: a peaceful neighborhood to come home to with so much of Savannah easily accessible on foot, by free shuttle, or with a quick ride. \ud83d\udc3e PET FRIENDLY Your four-legged family members are welcome at Lemon Lane!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":108,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002904111985117197,"social_amenities":0.01697435788810253,"party_restriction":0.010532514192163944,"nearby_nightlife":0.9853792190551758}},{"text":"Something fun to do on a rainy day? Just ask! We love helping our guests experience Savannah like a local. \ud83c\udf4b TRAVELING WITH A BIGGER GROUP? Lemon Lane is one of multiple completely separate vacation rentals at The Lemon Drop, each with its own private entrance and no shared indoor spaces. If you're traveling with a larger group, consider booking one or more of our other units - look at our profile to see these listings. It's a great setup for families and friends who want to stay just steps from each other while still having their own bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchens, living spaces, and privacy.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":122,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007756135892122984,"social_amenities":0.018070168793201447,"party_restriction":0.0032064204569905996,"nearby_nightlife":0.029731426388025284}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Lemon Lane is located in Savannah's beautiful Victorian District, a quieter, more residential part of the city that still keeps you close to all the fun. You'll be just a few blocks from iconic Forsyth Park, making it easy to start your morning with a walk beneath the live oaks, visit the famous fountain, grab a coffee, or enjoy one of the many events happening in the park. You'll also have neighborhood restaurants within close walking distance! Grab a slice at Pizza Party \ud83c\udf55 or head to Tacos + Tequila for tacos and margaritas. \ud83c\udf2e\ud83c\udf79 Ready to explore downtown?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.03966022655367851,"social_amenities":0.006308019161224365,"party_restriction":0.002951892791315913,"nearby_nightlife":0.9974793791770935}},{"text":"\ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc9b We are pet friendly with an additional pet fee. Please include your pet when making your reservation so the appropriate pet fee can be added to your stay. \ud83d\udc9b LOCALLY OWNED + MANAGED We're Megan & Justin, Savannah locals, and we love getting to share our city with our guests! The Lemon Drop isn't managed by a big, far-away vacation rental company\u2014you'll have local hosts who know Savannah and are nearby if you need us. We're always happy to share our favorite restaurants, bars, coffee shops, sightseeing spots, hidden gems, and things to do. Looking for the perfect brunch? A great cocktail? Kid-friendly activities?","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":114,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006885568145662546,"social_amenities":0.04321207478642464,"party_restriction":0.0005858615040779114,"nearby_nightlife":0.9916240572929382}}]}}},{"listing_id":"954458785132344963","title":"Cheerful & Charming 2BR Condo @ The Lemon Drop!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/954458785132344963","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-02490"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20053 01013","address":"409 E PARK AVE","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":2,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":2,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24300314816","date":"2024-10-26","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"409 E Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20053 01013","side":"direct"},{"number":"24300314800","date":"2024-10-26","type":"29 LOUD PARTY","outcome":"Loud party","recorded_address":"407 E Park Ave","recorded_pin":"20053 01012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"925934317962566824","title":"Walk to Beautiful Forsyth Park by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/925934317962566824","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02545"],"analysis":null}],"complete":false},{"pin":"20053 02003","address":"111