nversation \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Sleeping Arrangements All bedrooms are located upstairs."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Hot tub Recycling Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Housekeeping available 2 days a week - available at extra cost","section":"AMENITIES","line":211,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007677904795855284,"social_amenities":0.10703502595424652,"party_restriction":0.0009211816359311342,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011209719814360142}},{"text":"Guest can access the entire house & backyard. Codes and other check-in details will be provided via message on Airbnb. Other things to note All firepit is for decor only. All bedrooms on upstairs. Weekly lawn & hot tub maintenance on every Thursday. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":124,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004775494453497231,"social_amenities":0.04805872216820717,"party_restriction":0.007638103328645229,"nearby_nightlife":0.002889607334509492}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Built in 1899 and thoughtfully restored in 2026, this historic Victorian retreat blends timeless Savannah charm with modern comfort. Located just a 5 mins walk from Forsyth Park in the Historic Victorian District, the home features curated vintage d\u00e9cor, heart pine floors, and rich character throughout. Enjoy coffee on the side porch, unwind in the private hot tub under string lights, or gather for dinner in the backyard. This home was designed for memorable group in the heart of Savannah. The space Step inside and immediately be welcomed by dramatic wallpaper details, original architectural charm, and carefully curated interiors inspired by Savannah\u2019s historic elegance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9349142909049988,"social_amenities":0.0444013811647892,"party_restriction":0.00047441382776014507,"nearby_nightlife":0.03824042156338692}},{"text":"Located only 2 blocks from Forsyth Park, you\u2019ll be within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s best caf\u00e9s, restaurants, grocery stores, and historic landmarks while still enjoying a peaceful residential setting. \ud83c\udfe0 Home Features \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f 3 Bedrooms | \ud83d\udec1 2.5 Bathrooms Perfect for families, friends, and group trips exploring Savannah *All bedrooms are upstairs. \u2728 Highlights \u2022 Private hot tub under caf\u00e9 string lights \u2022 Fully fenced backyard with outdoor dining & BBQ grill \u2022 Designer interiors with locally curated vintage d\u00e9cor \u2022 Original heart pine floors & soaring ceilings \u2022 Walkable location near Forsyth Park \u2022 Fast WiFi throughout the home \u2022 Free street parking \ud83c\udf73 Kitchen & Dining","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.008420825935900211,"social_amenities":0.04283406212925911,"party_restriction":0.001537024276331067,"nearby_nightlife":0.9399431347846985}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"\ud83d\udec1 Hallway full bathroom with shower/tub combo (Shared by bedroom 2 & 3) \ud83d\udebd Additional half bathroom downstairs \ud83c\udf34 Outdoor Space One of the home\u2019s most loved features is the private brick courtyard backyard \u2014 complete with: \u2022 Hot tub \u2022 Outdoor dining area \u2022 BBQ grill \u2022 String lights \u2022 Lounge seating The perfect place to unwind after a day exploring Savannah. \ud83d\udccdLocation Nestled in Savannah\u2019s Historic Victorian District, the home is just minutes from: \u2022 Forsyth Park \u2022 Historic downtown Savannah \u2022 Popular caf\u00e9s & brunch spots \u2022 Local boutiques & cocktail bars \u2022 River Street \u2022 SCAD campus Permit Number: SVR-03257 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0017993065994232893,"social_amenities":0.5009779334068298,"party_restriction":0.001207000226713717,"nearby_nightlife":0.9908719658851624}},{"text":"Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Hot tub Recycling Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Housekeeping available 2 days a week - available at extra cost","section":"AMENITIES","line":211,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007677904795855284,"social_amenities":0.10703502595424652,"party_restriction":0.0009211816359311342,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011209719814360142}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Guest can access the entire house & backyard. Codes and other check-in details will be provided via message on Airbnb. Other things to note All firepit is for decor only. All bedrooms on upstairs. Weekly lawn & hot tub maintenance on every Thursday. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":124,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004775494453497231,"social_amenities":0.04805872216820717,"party_restriction":0.007638103328645229,"nearby_nightlife":0.002889607334509492}},{"text":"Located only 2 blocks from Forsyth Park, you\u2019ll be within walking distance of Savannah\u2019s best caf\u00e9s, restaurants, grocery stores, and historic landmarks while still enjoying a peaceful residential setting. \ud83c\udfe0 Home Features \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f 3 Bedrooms | \ud83d\udec1 2.5 Bathrooms Perfect for families, friends, and group trips exploring Savannah *All bedrooms are upstairs. \u2728 Highlights \u2022 Priva