dence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016641459660604596,"social_amenities":0.006707773078233004,"party_restriction":0.00020016057533212006,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005365622346289456}},{"text":"Perfect for a family of two adults and up to two children who are old enough to be comfortable in a house with stairs. Forsyth Park is located just three blocks from your Town Home. It is a beautiful 30-acre park that is home to many of Savannah\u2019s outdoor festivals and offers something for the whole family. The city\u2019s most famous fountain crowns the Park's northern edge and serves as an inspiring backdrop for contemplation, selfies, marriage proposals, and weddings. Sometimes the stroll to the fountain is crowded with our seasonal farmer\u2019s market or dotted with local artisans working to the sounds of a lively trumpet.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9738232493400574,"social_amenities":0.0055573247373104095,"party_restriction":0.0005706720985472202,"nearby_nightlife":0.47015082836151123}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Perfect for a family of two adults and up to two children who are old enough to be comfortable in a house with stairs. Forsyth Park is located just three blocks from your Town Home. It is a beautiful 30-acre park that is home to many of Savannah\u2019s outdoor festivals and offers something for the whole family. The city\u2019s most famous fountain crowns the Park's northern edge and serves as an inspiring backdrop for contemplation, selfies, marriage proposals, and weddings. Sometimes the stroll to the fountain is crowded with our seasonal farmer\u2019s market or dotted with local artisans working to the sounds of a lively trumpet.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9738232493400574,"social_amenities":0.0055573247373104095,"party_restriction":0.0005706720985472202,"nearby_nightlife":0.47015082836151123}},{"text":"You may choose to stroll back in time, shop along our famous River Street, or listen to live music in Market Square. Savannah offers a diverse selection of museums, many of which provide special areas for children. Feel like having a beach day? Head to one of the East Coast\u2019s most pristine beaches found on Tybee Island, just a short drive away. Go on a sunset dolphin cruise or have some fun in the sun paddle-boarding, kayaking, fishing, swimming, or just lazing around. The Savannah area is such a wonderful place, and we welcome you to come to enjoy a good dose of our southern hospitality! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020508872345089912,"social_amenities":0.01406340952962637,"party_restriction":0.004245719872415066,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802523851394653}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"You may choose to stroll back in time, shop along our famous River Street, or listen to live music in Market Square. Savannah offers a diverse selection of museums, many of which provide special areas for children. Feel like having a beach day? Head to one of the East Coast\u2019s most pristine beaches found on Tybee Island, just a short drive away. Go on a sunset dolphin cruise or have some fun in the sun paddle-boarding, kayaking, fishing, swimming, or just lazing around. The Savannah area is such a wonderful place, and we welcome you to come to enjoy a good dose of our southern hospitality! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020508872345089912,"social_amenities":0.01406340952962637,"party_restriction":0.004245719872415066,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802523851394653}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker","section":"AMENITIES","line":87,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016641459660604596,"social_amenities":0.006707773078233004,"party_restriction":0.00020016057533212006,"nearby_nightlife":0.0005365622346289456}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"You may choose to stroll back in time, shop along our famous River Street, or listen to live music in Market Square. Savannah offers a diverse selection of museums, many of which provide special areas for children. Feel like having a beach day? Head to one of the East Coast\u2019s most pristine beaches found on Tybee Island, just a short drive away. Go on a sunset dolphin cruise or have some fun in the sun paddle-boarding, kayaking, fishing, swimming, or just lazing around. The Savannah area is such a wonderful place, and we welcome you to come to enjoy a good dose of our southern hospitality! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020508872345089912,"social_amenities":0.01406340952962637,"party_restriction":0.004245719872415066,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802523851394653}},{"text":"The Miss Rose Historic Town Home is a warm, private home perfect for couples, solo adventurers, small families, and the family pup. The Townhome includes a living & dining area downstairs, a master bedroom suite with a queen-sized bed, and a bathroom upstairs: TV, cable & free WiFi. A full kitchen with a coffee station and microwave. This listing is awarded \u2018Super Host\u2019 status in the Historic District of Savannah. GA SVR -01477 The space The historic Chelsea is in the beautiful Victorian neighborhood of Savannah\u2019s historic district.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003562610945664346,"social_amenities":0.002635780954733491,"party_restriction":0.0024107093922793865,"nearby_nightlife":0.002667753491550684}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"You may choose to stroll back in time, shop along our famous River Street, or listen to live music in Market Square. Savannah offers a diverse selection of museums, many of which provide special areas for children. Feel like having a beach day? Head to one of the East Coast\u2019s most pristine beaches found on Tybee Island, just a short drive away. Go on a sunset dolphin cruise or have some fun in the sun paddle-boarding, kayaking, fishing, swimming, or just lazing around. The Savannah area is such a wonderful place, and we welcome you to come to enjoy a good dose of our southern hospitality! Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.020508872345089912,"social_amenities":0.01406340952962637,"party_restriction":0.004245719872415066,"nearby_nightlife":0.9802523851394653}},{"text":"A building near the center of the park houses a caf\u00e9, restrooms, and a canopied bandshell where kids can dance to their heart's content. There is a spray pool in front of the bandshell for kids to enjoy on warmer days. There are several restaurants near the south end of the park too. Being so close to your Town Home we highly recommend checking out Forsyth Park! Here in Savannah, you will discover amazing American history around every corner. Within walking distance of your Town Home, you can explore any of the 22 squares amid thriving businesses and historic buildings while reading about Savannah\u2019s history on beautiful plaques.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":55,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0010528393322601914,"social_amenities":0.000826461473479867,"party_restriction":0.0004899580380879343,"nearby_nightlife":0.9016045331954956}}]}}},{"listing_id":"23727872","title":"The Historic Chelsea House. - A Jewel Box Property","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/23727872","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01478"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"23727872","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"85a4fb5605699a585061b29ef630a87588a2776981119836ccce176871d1203c","chunks":9,"words":781,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.008353819139301777,"party_welcome":0.003012376371771097,"social_amenities":0.008353819139301777,"party_restriction":0.00413277093321085,"nearby_nightlife":0.9710838794708252,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV with standard cable Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024012142966967076,"social_amenities":0.008353819139301777,"party_restriction":0.0002820432127919048,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007715884130448103}},{"text":"The Chelsea House is where Savannah meets city living, and history meets today. From the blue velvet couch, traditional antique -4 poster bed, to the Pergola outside, that is a perfect for morning coffee and that afternoon glass of wine. You\u2019re on a Savannah Vacation at The Chelsea House. It\u2019s a very private property in the heart of the Historic District. Newly restored and redecorated, it is now a Jewel Box, 5-Star, Super Host property and it\u2019s our pleasure to serve you. The space The Victorian neighborhood was built to be The Beautiful part of the City.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009135284926742315,"social_amenities":0.0067267767153680325,"party_restriction":0.0007945513352751732,"nearby_nightlife":0.1041770949959755}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Its Park and gardens were planted with 350 varieties of flowering trees and bushes. It was described in the Savannah Morning News in the 1800s as \u201cCottages and townhomes of moderate size which will not be too large for a small family or too small for a moderate-sized one: houses that will suit a pecuniary class of people who are not by any means wealthy, but who are in point of respectability and intelligence ranked with the best.\u201d The Chelsea House is newly restored and redecorated, it is now a Jewel Box, 5-Star, Super Host property and it\u2019s our pleasure to 'Welcome You'.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.003012376371771097,"social_amenities":0.0007305189501494169,"party_restriction":0.0002866558497771621,"nearby_nightlife":0.0026501414831727743}},{"text":"The people, who built this to be their home, were our first Americans. Space was thought of differently then, and a whole family lived in this modest space. Today this space is a perfect and efficient place to stay for 2 people or 2 people with a child of 4 to 10. It is easy to make food or you can concentrate on spoiling yourself touring and enjoying some of Savannah\u2019s new great eating experiences while you are out. Or order in! We are right on the Bike Path, you can bring your bikes or rent them.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.002281937748193741,"social_amenities":0.000561237393412739,"party_restriction":0.0007552364841103554,"nearby_nightlife":0.9710838794708252}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage Entertainment Ethernet connection TV with standard cable Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware","section":"AMENITIES","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024012142966967076,"social_amenities":0.008353819139301777,"party_restriction":0.0002820432127919048,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007715884130448103}},{"text":"The Chelsea House is where Savannah meets city living, and history meets today. From the blue velvet couch, traditional antique -4 poster bed, to the Pergola outside, that is a perfect for morning coffee and that afternoon glass of wine. You\u2019re on a Savannah Vacation at The Chelsea Ho