586,"party_restriction":0.0006412293878383934,"nearby_nightlife":0.48545020818710327}},{"text":"Welcome to our chic urban retreat! Experience luxury in this brand-new, custom-designed carriage house featuring unique art (some by yours truly) and stylish furnishings. The off-street parking and lane location offer some hard-to-find privacy in the Victorian District. The high ceilings give an airy feel while you unwind on plush furniture and indulge in the modern amenities. Ideal for a romantic getaway and starting point to explore Savannah's charm! SVR 02919 The space This one bedroom, one bathroom condo in the heart of the Victorian District truly captures the quintessential Savannah experience, where Southern charm meets modern luxury!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011858380457852036,"social_amenities":0.0015461737057194114,"party_restriction":0.000964681850746274,"nearby_nightlife":0.006763191428035498}}]}}},{"listing_id":"21550881","title":"Adorable Home Two Blocks From Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/21550881","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-01175"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"21550881","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"c669afdde0708bc15645560d038cf3fd7db72086bcb1e956aa09cb07b60dfe5e","chunks":6,"words":487,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.897196888923645,"party_welcome":0.0008119135745801032,"social_amenities":0.897196888923645,"party_restriction":0.0012263264507055283,"nearby_nightlife":0.9338176250457764,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"In a room with a door Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Electric stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, cha