9,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Some trips are about the places you visit. The best ones are about the people you share them with. Welcome to The Henry House, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian just a short walk from Forsyth Park. With 4 king bedrooms, 2 kitchens, 2 living rooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 parking spaces and 2 covered porches, it's thoughtfully designed for families and friends to gather, reconnect, and experience Savannah together\u2014all while enjoying the comfort of having space to spread out. The space # THE SPACE Welcome to **The Henry House**, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian where historic charm meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018639201298356056,"social_amenities":0.10468146204948425,"party_restriction":0.0009838228579610586,"nearby_nightlife":0.006784962024539709}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Theme room A room or multiple spaces that are designed to follow the same theme Family Crib - available upon request Mini (38 inches long x 24 inches wide), room-darkening shades in room Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Children\u2019s books and toys Standalone high chair - available upon request With food tray","section":"AMENITIES","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00176212377846241,"social_amenities":0.042824637144804,"party_restriction":0.003890514839440584,"nearby_nightlife":0.001507637440226972}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"\u2022 Fully stocked kitchens \u2022 Washer & dryer on both floors \u2022 Central heating and air conditioning \u2022 Complimentary parking for two vehicles Please note that because this is a historic two-story home, **guests staying in the upstairs bedrooms will need to use the interior staircase**. If anyone in your group has mobility concerns, we recommend assigning them one of the two king bedrooms located on the main floor. Whether you're reconnecting with lifelong friends, traveling with family, celebrating a special occasion, or discovering Savannah for the first time, The Henry House was thoughtfully designed to bring people together. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9429118037223816,"social_amenities":0.005625264719128609,"party_restriction":0.0013697859831154346,"nearby_nightlife":0.004983851686120033}},{"text":"Some trips are about the places you visit. The best ones are about the people you share them with. Welcome to The Henry House, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian just a short walk from Forsyth Park. With 4 king bedrooms, 2 kitchens, 2 living rooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 parking spaces and 2 covered porches, it's thoughtfully designed for families and friends to gather, reconnect, and experience Savannah together\u2014all while enjoying the comfort of having space to spread out. The space # THE SPACE Welcome to **The Henry House**, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian where historic charm meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018639201298356056,"social_amenities":0.10468146204948425,"party_restriction":0.0009838228579610586,"nearby_nightlife":0.006784962024539709}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Some trips are about the places you visit. The best ones are about the people you share them with. Welcome to The Henry House, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian just a short walk from Forsyth Park. With 4 king bedrooms, 2 kitchens, 2 living rooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 parking spaces and 2 covered porches, it's thoughtfully designed for families and friends to gather, reconnect, and experience Savannah together\u2014all while enjoying the comfort of having space to spread out. The space # THE SPACE Welcome to **The Henry House**, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian where historic charm meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018639201298356056,"social_amenities":0.10468146204948425,"party_restriction":0.0009838228579610586,"nearby_nightlife":0.006784962024539709}},{"text":"What this place offers Scenic views City skyline view Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Theme room A room or multiple spaces that are designed to follow the same theme Family Crib - available upon request Mini (38 inches long x 24 inches wide), room-darkening shades in room Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Children\u2019s books and toys Standalone high chair - available upon request With food tray","section":"AMENITIES","line":183,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00176212377846241,"social_amenities":0.042824637144804,"party_restriction":0.003890514839440584,"nearby_nightlife":0.001507637440226972}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"To help preserve the peaceful character of our neighborhood, we kindly ask that guests observe quiet hours between **9:00 PM and 9:00 AM**. **Smoke-Free Home** Kenneth Manor is a **100% smoke-free property**, including cigarettes, cigars, vaping, marijuana, and all other smoking products. **Weapons & Illegal Substances** For the safety and comfort of all guests, **firearms, weapons, and illegal substances are not permitted anywhere on the property.** **Pets** Approved pets are welcome! Please let us know before booking if you plan to bring a pet so we can confirm your reservation and apply the appropriate pet fee. Undisclosed pets are not permitted. **Packages & Mail**","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":154,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024037709226831794,"social_amenities":0.010937699116766453,"party_restriction":0.17111904919147491,"nearby_nightlife":0.005446208640933037}},{"text":"Two king bedrooms are located on the main floor and two king bedrooms are upstairs, making it an ideal layout for families, multiple couples, and friends traveling together. **Parking** Two designated parking spaces are included with your reservation. Additional street parking may also be available nearby, subject to city regulations. **Sensitive Plumbing** Like many historic homes, Kenneth Manor has older plumbing. To help prevent backups, please flush **toilet paper only**. Baby wipes, paper towels, feminine hygiene products, \"flushable\" wipes, and other items should be placed in the waste bins provided. **Quiet Hours**","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":145,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023149476328399032,"social_amenities":0.0010367556242272258,"party_restriction":0.061371415853500366,"nearby_nightlife":0.01279936172068119}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Two king bedrooms are located on the main floor and two king bedrooms are upstairs, making it an ideal layout for families, multiple couples, and friends traveling together. **Parking** Two designated parking spaces are included with your reservation. Additional street parking may also be available nearby, subject to city regulations. **Sensitive Plumbing** Like many historic homes, Kenneth Manor has older plumbing. To help prevent backups, please flush **toilet paper only**. Baby wipes, paper towels, feminine hygiene products, \"flushable\" wipes, and other items should be placed in the waste bins provided. **Quiet Hours**","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":145,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023149476328399032,"social_amenities":0.0010367556242272258,"party_restriction":0.061371415853500366,"nearby_nightlife":0.01279936172068119}},{"text":"Some trips are about the places you visit. The best ones are about the people you share them with. Welcome to The Henry House, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian just a short walk from Forsyth Park. With 4 king bedrooms, 2 kitchens, 2 living rooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 parking spaces and 2 covered porches, it's thoughtfully designed for families and friends to gather, reconnect, and experience Savannah together\u2014all while enjoying the comfort of having space to spread out. The space # THE SPACE Welcome to **The Henry House**, a beautifully restored 1900 Victorian where historic charm meets modern comfort.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.018639201298356056,"social_amenities":0.10468146204948425,"party_restriction":0.0009838228579610586,"nearby_nightlife":0.006784962024539709}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1526296963313534516","title":"*New Carriage House | Short Walk to Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1526296963313534516","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-03028"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1526296963313534516","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"235ce5051cf0f7d3bfe0c5229be6ba3051f7a4a39858d186e22cb8546a6eae5d","chunks":19,"words":1944,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.01618937775492668,"party_welcome":0.9947124719619751,"social_amenities":0.01926436461508274,"party_restriction":0.9989964365959167,"nearby_nightlife":0.9600877165794373,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"We aim to keep our amenities in top shape for your enjoyment. Should a mechanical issue arise during your stay that makes an amenity unavailable, we will provide a $50 per day credit for each day the amenity is out of commission. \ud83e\udd1d Booking = Agreement: By booking this stay, you agree to these house rules and to treat this property with care. The primary guest must be at least 25 years of age, and all guests under 25 must be accompanied by an adult at all times. SVTR License # SVR-03028 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":162,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024797910009510815,"social_amenities":0.01618937775492668,"party_restriction":0.002936544129624963,"nearby_nightlife":0.0034245408605784178}},{"text":"Please take a moment to review our full House Rules before booking, as they contain important information to help ensure a safe, comfortable, and enjoyable stay for everyone. \ud83c\udfe1 House Rules These are here to make sure your stay is smooth and respectful for the neighbors and the property. \ud83d\udead Smoke-Free Environment: This is a 100% smoke-free home. Smoking of any kind (tobacco or marijuana) is strictly prohibited indoors. A $1,000 fee applies for professional ozone treatment and restoration if this rule is violated. Outdoor smoking must be at least 10 feet from the property. \ud83d\udeab Illegal Substances & Firearms: Illegal substances and firearms are strictly prohibited on the property.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015430657367687672,"social_amenities":0.014496181160211563,"party_restriction":0.003120632842183113,"nearby_nightlife":0.0035981880500912666}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"OUTDOORS: offering a fence in area between the two homes that offers a fire table, and seating for 4 people. Enjoy those evenings in front of the fire, and creating lasting memories! Infant pack and play crib AND floor mattress must be requested IN ADVANCE. 1 Designated parking spot is available across the street. GETTING AROUND: Steps to Forsyth Park, historic downtown, local shops, caf\u00e9s, and restaurants, and minutes to Old Savannah\u2019s riverfront Stay where history meets comfort \u2014 a collection of beautifully restored Savannah spaces that blend elegance, character, and modern convenience. Perfect for group getaways, weddings, and family retreats.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9947124719619751,"social_amenities":0.01900661364197731,"party_restriction":0.0010691151255741715,"nearby_nightlife":0.9466506242752075}},{"text":"Remain conscious of the city's ordinance on prohibited bike trails. 2- DOT Downton Free Trolley: It's FREE and is one of the most popular ways to get around the historic district of Savannah and see the sites. The DOT is a fare-free service to help visitors and residents get around downtown Savannah. Included in the system are shuttles serving 18 stops in the Historic District and the Savannah Belles Ferry. Use the free shuttle from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m., Mon.-Fri.; 10 a.m. to 7 p.m. on Saturday; 10 a.m. to 6 p.m. on Sundays; and 10 a.m. to 6:30 p.m. on holidays (excludes Thanksgiving, Christmas or New Year's Day.)","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0012308340519666672,"social_amenities":0.0007158038206398487,"party_restriction":0.0016427155351266265,"nearby_nightlife":0.027474766597151756}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Outdoor space: Private fenced patio shared between homes with fire table and lounge seating \u2728 Highlights & Amenities: Fully stocked kitchen with stainless appliances, coffeemakers, kettle, and 4 person dining tables with 2 additional bar stools Free high-speed WiFi throughout Pot lighting and pendants on dimmers 1 washer & dryer, iron, and ironing board PARKING: Across-the-street parking for 1 car (offsite, additional paid parking nearby) GETTING AROUND: 1- Bike! A fun and active approach to enjoy Forsyth Park is on two wheels. It's an easy way to see the entire park, meet people, squeeze in some exercise and a perfect excuse to ditch your car.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00045979543938301504,"social_amenities":0.01926436461508274,"party_restriction":0.0007258246187120676,"nearby_nightlife":0.7955705523490906}},{"text":"OUTDOORS: offering a fence in area between the two homes that offers a fire table, and seating for 4 people. Enjoy those evenings in front of the fire, and creating lasting memories! Infant pack and play crib AND floor mattress must be requested IN ADVANCE. 1 Designated parking spot is available across the street. GETTING AROUND: Steps to Forsyth Park, historic downtown, local shops, caf\u00e9s, and restaurants, and minutes to Old Savannah\u2019s riverfront Stay where history meets comfort \u2014 a collection of beautifully restored Savannah spaces that blend elegance, character, and modern convenience. Perfect for group getaways, weddings, and family retreats.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9947124719619751,"social_amenities":0.01900661364197731,"party_restriction":0.0010691151255741715,"nearby_nightlife":0.9466506242752075}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"To help everyone enjoy a wonderful stay, we kindly ask guests to treat our home with the same care and respect they would their own. This is a smoke-free, party-free property located in a quiet residential neighborhood. Out of respect for our neighbors, quiet hours are from **9:00 PM to 9:00 AM**. Only registered guests and pre-approved pets are permitted. If you're planning to bring a pet, please let us know before booking so we can ensure everything is ready for your arrival. For your safety and security, exterior cameras monitor the front entrance, backyard, and side of the home. There are **no cameras or recording devices inside the home**.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000286964321276173,"social_amenities":0.002676557283848524,"party_restriction":0.9989964365959167,"nearby_nightlife":0.9600877165794373}},{"text":"Violation of this policy will result in immediate cancellation of your stay and removal from the premises. \ud83c\udf89 Neighborhood Peace: We love our neighbors and uphold a strict No Party/Gathering policy. Please note that the city enforces strict noise ordinances, and we are legally required to uphold them. Unauthorized parties result in a $1,000 penalty and immediate cancellation without refund. Quiet hours are 9 PM to 9 AM. Excessive noise after a warning results in a $250 fine. \ud83d\udc65\ud83d\udc36 Guest & Pet Accuracy: Only guests listed on the reservation are permitted on-site. Undisclosed guests are charged at $50/night.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":128,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024852209025993943,"social_amenities":0.003035707399249077,"party_restriction":0.9985398054122925,"nearby_nightlife":0.6326602697372437}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"To help everyone enjoy a wonderful stay, we kindly ask guests to treat our home with the same care and respect they would their own. This is a smoke-free, party-free property located in a quiet residential neighborhood. Out of respect for our neighbors, quiet hours are from **9:00 PM to 9:00 AM**. Only registered guests and pre-approved pets are permitted. If you're planning to bring a pet, please let us know before booking so we can ensure everything is ready for your arrival. For your safety and security, exterior cameras monitor the front entrance, backyard, and side of the home. There are **no cameras or recording devices inside the home**.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000286964321276173,"social_amenities":0.002676557283848524,"party_restriction":0.9989964365959167,"nearby_nightlife":0.9600877165794373}},{"text":"OUTDOORS: offering a fence in area between the two homes that offers a fire table, and seating for 4 people. Enjoy those evenings in front of the fire, and creating lasting memories! Infant pack and play crib AND floor mattress must be requested IN ADVANCE. 1 Designated parking spot is available across the street. GETTING AROUND: Steps to Forsyth Park, historic downtown, local shops, caf\u00e9s, and restaurants, and minutes to Old Savannah\u2019s riverfront Stay where history meets comfort \u2014 a collection of beautifully restored Savannah spaces that blend elegance, character, and modern convenience. Perfect for group getaways, weddings, and family retreats.","section":"F