roup together. If you love this listing, but you are looking for something you don\u2019t see here, please inquire! Guest access The unit has locks with door codes. Codes and other check-in details will be provided via message and texted to your phone on the day of check-in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01278873160481453,"social_amenities":0.573904812335968,"party_restriction":0.001211406895890832,"nearby_nightlife":0.007169563323259354}},{"text":"\ud83c\udf73 Fully stocked kitchen with essential cookware \ud83c\udfca Shared heated outdoor pool and spa with loungers and dining area \u26a1 High-speed WiFi \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Premium mattresses and Matouk linens and towels \ud83e\uddf4 High-end essential toiletries \ud83d\udcfa 2 Smart TVs with streaming capabilities \ud83d\ude97 Free off-street parking for up to 2 vehicles ACCESSIBILITY & LAYOUT A few steps are required to access the front door. This is a 2-story home with bedrooms on both floors, accessible via an interior staircase. The unit features 12-foot ceilings, plaster moldings, and heart pine floors. The shared outdoor pool and spa are located directly in front of the carriage house entrance.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0011473232880234718,"social_amenities":0.03384001553058624,"party_restriction":0.001867219340056181,"nearby_nightlife":0.024112557992339134}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Shared heated outdoor pool and spa accessible to all 3 units on the property. Includes lounge chairs and outdoor dining area. Other guests may be present. Please inquire if you are interested in making this a private space by renting the entire property. . Host Information: Stay Heirloom professionally manages a collection of handcrafted homes designed to bring your group together. If you love this listing, but you are looking for something you don\u2019t see here, please inquire! Guest access The unit has locks with door codes. Codes and other check-in details will be provided via message and texted to your phone on the day of check-in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01278873160481453,"social_amenities":0.573904812335968,"party_restriction":0.001211406895890832,"nearby_nightlife":0.007169563323259354}},{"text":"Welcome to this beautifully renovated 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom carriage house in Savannah's historic Victorian District, designed for groups of up to 11 guests. Located a 2-minute walk from Forsyth Park, this 2-story home features 12-foot ceilings, heart pine floors, and access to a shared heated outdoor pool and spa, making it an ideal retreat for groups exploring the best of Savannah. The space This carriage house is located on a compound with 3 units in total. This listing is for the carriage house unit. Please inquire if you are interested in renting these units together. \ud83c\udfe0 1 Unit | \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f 5 Bedrooms | \ud83d\udec1 3 Full Bathrooms FEATURES","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0016836244612932205,"social_amenities":0.0018295497866347432,"party_restriction":0.0011942192213609815,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013635376235470176}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Shared heated outdoor pool and spa accessible to all 3 units on the property. Includes lounge chairs and outdoor dining area. Other guests may be present. Please inquire if you are interested in making this a private space by renting the entire property. . Host Information: Stay Heirloom professionally manages a collection of handcrafted homes designed to bring your group together. If you love this listing, but you are looking for something you don\u2019t see here, please inquire! Guest access The unit has locks with door codes. Codes and other check-in details will be provided via message and texted to your phone on the day of check-in.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01278873160481453,"social_amenities":0.573904812335