d, girls' getaway, or families! City license #SVR-01564 Guest access The home is in the Victorian District and is divided into three private units. You would have the entire main floor unit to yourself (parlor level), which has 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and front and rear secured entrance. Both bedrooms have queen size beds. There is no assigned parking space, however, we rarely have trouble finding parking right in front of the house or less than a block away.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014429400907829404,"social_amenities":0.0007900383207015693,"party_restriction":0.00048351826262660325,"nearby_nightlife":0.9850194454193115}},{"text":"There is one set of stairs on the front exterior of the house that you would have to go up to access the front door. There is also a fenced courtyard in the rear of the unit, which is a shared space among the three units, so please be respectful of other tenants. Other things to note The unit is equipped with high speed wi-fi, cable, full-size washer/dryer, iron/ironing board and hair dryer. We also provide basic items like coffee pot and filters, dishes, pots/pans, etc.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017687563376966864,"social_amenities":0.0010110519360750914,"party_restriction":0.00046893046237528324,"nearby_nightlife":0.003096676431596279}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 05004","address":"314 E HENRY ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":4.0,"neighbor_count":3,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":7,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":3,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":8,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":3,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24210221844","