venience in mind.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9839824438095093,"social_amenities":0.009547767229378223,"party_restriction":0.0008804707904346287,"nearby_nightlife":0.4510928690433502}},{"text":"Bedroom 4: Show-stopping Queen-sized double Bunk Beds \u2013 a favorite for teens and groups of kids With 3.5 bathrooms, there\u2019s no need to wait in line\u2014ideal for big groups getting ready for a day of adventure. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Kitchen Details: Fully Equipped for Family Feasts Enjoy home-cooked meals in your fully stocked kitchen, perfect for group dinners or quick breakfasts before a day exploring the city. Features include: Full-size appliances Coffee maker for your morning brew \u2615 Grill just outside on the back porch Spacious dining area for gathering everyone at once \ud83d\udcbb WIFI & Workspace Details: Stay Connected","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":62,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.5417835712432861,"social_amenities":0.017563920468091965,"party_restriction":0.0004091953451279551,"nearby_nightlife":0.012718815356492996}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"This spacious urban retreat features 4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, offering plenty of room for 2\u20133 families to relax and enjoy quality time together without sacrificing privacy. With stylish interiors, a full kitchen, private parking for 3 vehicles, and a cozy front porch perfect for coffee or conversation, this home is a favorite for multigenerational families, reunion trips, and city explorers. \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Highlight of Space & Sleeping Arrangements: Room for Everyone Say goodbye to cramped hotel rooms\u2014this home comfortably sleeps your group with room to spare: Bedroom 1 (Downstairs): Queen bed Bedroom 2: King bed Bedroom 3: Queen bed","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0033374368213117123,"social_amenities":0.3717147409915924,"party_restriction":0.0024664681404829025,"nearby_nightlife":0.0023064075503498316}},{"text