the living room is a 'click-clack' sofa that converts to a flat bed of sorts...more like a very firm futon than a sofa bed. Linens provided. Fully stocked kitchen with stainless appliances, electric stove/oven, microwave, refrigerator with ice/filtered water dispenser, dishwasher. Coffee maker with coffee stocked, blender, toaster, crockpot provided as well. Ample cooking & kitchen wares, dishes and utensils. Full size washer/dryer upstairs in separate sitting/dressing room. Two designated off-street parking spaces provided with our rental home locate just behing the fenced courtyard on the alley-way. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005694350111298263,"social_amenities":0.002326374175027013,"party_restriction":0.000975379254668951,"nearby_nightlife":0.006384535226970911}}]}}},{"listing_id":"38105905","title":"The Janie | Historic & Sophisticated Style+Parking","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/38105905","guests":10.0,"permits":["SVR-00089"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"38105905","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3934bbf4b447bd98031ecc6ab141b851a59186dc1eb7967c6b9ac6ec97418ecb","chunks":10,"words":976,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9852887988090515,"party_welcome":0.9473181366920471,"social_amenities":0.9852887988090515,"party_restriction":0.997205913066864,"nearby_nightlife":0.9697456359863281,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Private BBQ grill: gas Sun loungers Parking and facilities Free parking on premises \u2013 2 spaces Free street parking Services Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Carbon monoxide alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Host has indicated no carbon monoxide detector is necessary. Reach out to the host with any questions.","section":"AMENITIES","line":154,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001043145457515493,"social_amenities":0.9852887988090515,"party_restriction":0.00015854444063734263,"nearby_nightlife":0.001732281525619328}},{"text":"Downstairs: Enjoy the spacious floor plan with a modern, fully equipped kitchen that is open to the breakfast room with a table that seats 6; expansive double parlor with living room, flat screen TV and DVD player and formal dining room that seats an additional 6. One of the two vintage-styled bathrooms with clawfoot tub is located downstairs. The home has a fenced courtyard with patio seating, grill, and wicker patio table and chaise lounge for our guest to enjoy. Upstairs: Enjoy the comfort of 4 bedrooms, 1 full bathroom, and a separate dressing/laundry room all upstairs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005504961591213942,"social_amenities":0.854382336139679,"party_restriction":0.0006996658630669117,"nearby_nightlife":0.009429410099983215}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Can guest in your party comfortable climb stairs or step into a claw-foot tub? While we do have a full bath on the first level of the home, all bedrooms are located upstairs as is the 2nd full bath. Can all guest be respectful of the home and neighbors? We welcome courteous and respectful guest and will not tolerate a 'party-house' (i.e. loud or drunken behavior). We are more than happy to answer questions, so please inquire. The home is 1.2 miles straight out the door down to the cobblestones of River Street, the most northern boundary of the Landmark Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9473181366920471,"social_amenities":0.02756102941930294,"party_restri