hat seats 6; expansive double parlor with living room, flat screen TV and DVD player and formal dining room that seats an additional 6. One of the two vintage-styled bathrooms with clawfoot tub is located downstairs. The home has a fenced courtyard with patio seating, grill, and wicker patio table and chaise lounge for our guest to enjoy. Upstairs: Enjoy the comfort of 4 bedrooms, 1 full bathroom, and a separate dressing/laundry room all upstairs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005504961591213942,"social_amenities":0.854382336139679,"party_restriction":0.0006996658630669117,"nearby_nightlife":0.009429410099983215}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Can guest in your party comfortable climb stairs or step into a claw-foot tub? While we do have a full bath on the first level of the home, all bedrooms are located upstairs as is the 2nd full bath. Can all guest be respectful of the home and neighbors? We welcome courteous and respectful guest and will not tolerate a 'party-house' (i.e. loud or drunken behavior). We are more than happy to answer questions, so please inquire. The home is 1.2 miles straight out the door down to the cobblestones of River Street, the most northern boundary of the Landmark Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9473181366920471,"social_amenities":0.02756102941930294,"party_restriction":0.997205913066864,"nearby_nightlife":0.9697456359863281}},{"text":"We dearly love the beautiful city of Savannah that we call home and particularly love old houses and all things old...we love the stories and memories that antique architecture and vintage furnishings can tell (I am a 'talker', so if you ask me I will share them all!) The home is affectionately nicknamed \"The Janie\" for Miss Jane Strous who grew up and lived her adult life in the adjacent home. Her mother had the row of townhomes built as rental properties. Today our family continues this legacy and hopes to share Miss Janie's family's home with you as well. Other things to note Things to consider prior to booking:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":82,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026277266442775726,"social_amenities":0.0018297918140888214,"party_restriction":0.0016714321682229638,"nearby_nightlife":0.00198451429605484}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Can guest in your party comfortable climb stairs or step into a claw-foot tub? While we do have a full bath on the first level of the home, all bedrooms are located upstairs as is the 2nd full bath. Can all guest be respectful of the home and neighbors? We welcome courteous and respectful guest and will not tolerate a 'party-house' (i.e. loud or drunken behavior). We are more than happy to answer questions, so please inquire. The home is 1.2 miles straight out the door down to the cobblestones of River Street, the most northern boundary of the Landmark Historic District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9473181366920471,"social_amenities":0.02756102941930294,"party_restriction":0.997205913066864,"nearby_nightlife":0.9697456359863281}},{"text":"The home is situated near the corner of a main arterial street in Savannah, so traffic noise and the occasional siren is to be expected as downtown is an active urban center. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00024329641018994153,"social_amenities":0.0017892802134156227,"party_restriction":0.0012413118965923786,"nearby_nightlife":0.024256441742181778}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 11023","address":"209 E HENRY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":10.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":1,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined