139601636678}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage: closet, wardrobe, and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection TV Family Crib Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib - available upon request Sheets provided Board games Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Ceiling fan Portable fans Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We reserve the right to install, monitor, and/or record surveillance from the exterior entrances, courtyard, side yards, & parking areas of the home. Smoke alarm Fire extinguisher","section":"AMENITIES","line":90,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003265297564212233,"social_amenities":0.014375720173120499,"party_restriction":0.004796941764652729,"nearby_nightlife":0.002516940701752901}},{"text":"A signed Rental Agreement may be required with written acknowledgment of House Rules. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":86,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002496896777302027,"social_amenities":0.0010996382916346192,"party_restriction":0.004536183085292578,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011704469798132777}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"The fourth bedroom or Trunk room, a customary Savannah term used in our historic homes, comfortably accommodates a full size bed and dresser. Park up to two of your vehicles in the free designated off-street parking spaces provide in rear of the home. Enjoy the leisurely 5 minute walk to Savannah\u2019s iconic Forsyth Park or spend the day strolling the 1.2 miles from the rental under Spanish moss draped trees to River Street exploring all our beautiful Savannah Squares, quaint shops, and eateries along the way! Guest access Guest have use of the entire home including courtyard and designated parking on the premises for two vehicles.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020688334188889712,"social_amenities":0.0010103220120072365,"party_restriction":0.0006333665223792195,"nearby_nightlife":0.07438573241233826}},{"text":"Welcome to \u201cThe Clara\u201d, our Victorian townhome in beautiful Downtown Savannah's Victorian District. Located within a few short blocks of iconic Forsyth Park, this 4-bedroom/2-bath, vacation home offers all the comfortable and cozy luxuries you\u2019re looking for in a historic setting AND provides 2 free, private/designated off-street parking spaces with ample on street (non-metered) parking also available. SVR-00090 | Proud City of Savannah Short-Term Vacation Rental Certificate license holder. The space Entering \u201cThe Clara\u201d vacation home you\u2019ll find a large living area with comfortable seating including a sofa, loveseat, flat screen LCD TV, DVD player, drop-leaf table with two chairs, and a secretary desk.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002827537537086755,"social_amenities":0.004946568049490452,"party_restriction":0.0009989789687097073,"nearby_nightlife":0.018325578421354294}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 14007","address":"532 E ANDERSON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24077082013","date":"2024-03-17","type":"28-4 DOMESTIC DISTURB VERBAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"532 E Anderson St","recorded_pin":"20053 14007","side":"direct"},{"number":"24283297378","date":"2024-10-09","typ