roperty usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":150,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007846675580367446,"social_amenities":0.12577350437641144,"party_restriction":0.0009833459043875337,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015409690095111728}},{"text":"Welcome to our charming 2-bedroom, 1-bath Savannah cottage, offering a private patio, cozy comforts, and easy access to downtown. \u2022 Dog-friendly accommodations \u2022 Private firepit patio for relaxing evenings \u2022 Full kitchen with coffee bar and dining table for two \u2022 Wi-Fi, Roku TVs, board games, books, and washer/dryer \u2022 Convenient to Historic Savannah attractions, restaurants, and Forsyth Park Bring your pup, settle in, and enjoy a relaxing Savannah stay with plenty of space to unwind. The space \u2606\u2606 HIGHLIGHTS \u2606\u2606 \u2600 2 bedroom / 1 bath cottage for up to 4 guests \u2600 Private rear patio with a gas fire pit for evenings outside","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015346988220699131,"social_amenities":0.009054976515471935,"party_restriction":0.0009153338614851236,"nearby_nightlife":0.31397056579589844}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":150,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007846675580367446,"social_amenities":0.12577350437641144,"party_restriction":0.0009833459043875337,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015409690095111728}},{"text":"\u2714 Second bedroom: a bunk room with comfortable bedding and a playful, inviting feel for additional guests or kids. \u2606\u2606 BATHROOM \u2606\u2606 \u2714 One full bathroom with modern fixtures. \u2714 Towels, shampoo, conditioner, and body wash are provided for your stay. \u2606\u2606 KITCHEN & DINING \u2606\u2606 \u2714 Stainless steel appliances and the essentials for cooking at home. \u2714 Coffee bar with a Keurig for easy mornings. \u2714 A charming table for two for meals, coffee, or planning the day. \u2606\u2606 LIVING ROOM \u2606\u2606 \u2714 Comfortable seating for relaxing with a book, a drink, or good conversation.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":66,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005585100152529776,"social_amenities":0.0029149018228054047,"party_restriction":0.0005775120807811618,"nearby_nightlife":0.005685076583176851}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Laundromat nearby Outdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Fire pit Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed","section":"AMENITIES","line":150,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007846675580367446,"social_amenities":0.12577350437641144,"party_restriction":0.0009833459043875337,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015409690095111728}},{"text":"\u2714 Open flow into the kitchen, making it easy to stay connected while you cook. \u2714 Roku entertainment for laid-back downtime. \u2606\u2606 OUTDOOR SPACE \u2606\u2606 \u2714 Private rear patio with firelight, seating, and a cozy place to unwind. \u2714 Fenced shared front yard adds another outdoor area to enjoy. \u2606\u2606 LOCATION \u2606\u2606 \u2714 Walkable to attractions in Historic Savannah. \u2714 Also within reach of well-known spots like Forsyth Park, the Savannah Historic District, River Street, and City Market. I\u2019d love to host you for a relaxed Savannah stay with thoughtful spaces inside and out.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011927331070182845,"social_amenities":0.014086971990764141,"party_restriction":0.0009828476468101144,"nearby_nightlife":0.8944034576416016}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"-We provide a starter pack of K-cups, trash bags, paper towels and toilet paper for your convenience. -One designated parking space is located at the rear of the property. Parking is also conveniently available on-street at no cost. Please pay close attention to the posted sweep zones and times as you may have to move your car at that specified date and time to avoid fines. Sweeping times and days are specific to the street you're parking on and can be found on red and white signs along the sidewalk. Primary renter must be 25 years old to rent and must stay on premises for entire booking. SVR-03008 Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":92,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010395666322438046,"social_amenities":0.0013354681432247162,"party_restriction":0.0048952121287584305,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010382609907537699}},{"text":"Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Housekeeping availa