51236,"nearby_nightlife":0.31397056579589844}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1705857023267791954","title":"Downtown Savannah * Firepit * Dogs *Private Patio","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1705857023267791954","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03007"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1705857023267791954","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"3dea50ba9b20851b266ccc79202e5ee185b9462aec8206ac13f4861afcb20e6c","chunks":9,"words":829,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9303282499313354,"party_welcome":0.10133761167526245,"social_amenities":0.9303282499313354,"party_restriction":0.013105010613799095,"nearby_nightlife":0.4939957857131958,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"\u2606\u2606 KITCHEN\u2606\u2606 The fully equipped kitchen is both stylish and functional, offering modern appliances and a charming table for two, perfect for enjoying intimate meals. \u2606\u2606 OUTSIDE SPACE \u2606\u2606 The charming patio is a private oasis, thoughtfully designed for relaxation and evening gatherings. With soft ambient lighting and a cozy gas firepit, it offers a serene atmosphere perfect for unwinding under the stars. Guests can enjoy their morning coffee on the private patio, which is beautifully illuminated for evening sweet tea or wine. \u2605\u2606 Book Today & Let Us Take Care of You In Savannah! \u2606\u2605 - Dog Rules: The space is dog-friendly.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":79,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.10133761167526245,"social_amenities":0.9303282499313354,"party_restriction":0.013105010613799095,"nearby_nightlife":0.14671631157398224}},{"text":"Twilight Garden Escape is a stylishly remodeled cottage in Savannah's historic district, offering a perfect blend of modern comfort and historic charm. The two-bedroom retreat features a cozy living area, a fully equipped kitchen, and a charming patio with a gas firepit for relaxing evenings. Located just a mile from Forsyth Park and within walking distance of top resta