10-07","type":"64-4 ABANDONMENT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"508 E ANDERSON ST","recorded_pin":"20053 14017","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1376915081585059540","title":"Historic Darling Home w/ Hot Tub near Forsyth","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1376915081585059540","guests":16.0,"permits":["SVR-03131"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1376915081585059540","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"652896da6f2fe38906b53e0b4b7fa4ddf51ed98a4e13aa51ef37fd2026e49d27","chunks":9,"words":885,"party_signal":0.9943569302558899,"social_signal":0.05841422453522682,"party_welcome":0.9943569302558899,"social_amenities":0.05841422453522682,"party_restriction":0.0015892863739281893,"nearby_nightlife":0.9960732460021973,"signal_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you're getting ready for a wedding, hosting a girls\u2019 getaway, or traveling with family, this home is designed to accommodate and impress. After a day exploring Savannah, unwind in your private hot tub, the perfect way to relax and recharge. This added luxury sets The Darling House apart\u2014giving you a true retreat experience right at home. Here we treat our neighbors like family so if you feel like floating back in time, you are welcome to continue your evening inside as you unwind. Food lovers will appreciate being surrounded by some of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after dining destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9943569302558899,"social_amenities":0.05841422453522682,"party_restriction":0.0002863059926312417,"nearby_nightlife":0.34049564599990845},"affirmative_event_evidence":"Whether you're getting ready for a wedding, hosting a girls\u2019 getaway, or traveling with family, this home is designed to accommodate and impress."},{"text":"This location is ideal for guests looking to fully immerse themselves in Savannah\u2019s charm\u2014whether you're here for a wedding, SCAD visit, bachelorette trip, family vacation, or simply a relaxing escape. At The Darling House, every detail has been considered to create a seamless, elevated stay\u2014from the historic setting to the modern comforts and premium amenities. Welcome home to a classic Savannah stay\u2014reimagined. Guest access We are self-check-in, you will receive door codes at check-in time to let yourself in as you please. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.992621660232544,"social_amenities":0.005283924750983715,"party_restriction":0.0014219852164387703,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013511053984984756},"affirmative_event_evidence":"This location is ideal for guests looking to fully immerse themselves in Savannah\u2019s charm\u2014whether you're here for a wedding, SCAD visit, bachelorette trip, family vacation, or simply a relaxing escape."}],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Whether you're getting ready for a wedding, hosting a girls\u2019 getaway, or traveling with family, this home is designed to accommodate and impress. After a day exploring Savannah, unwind in your private hot tub, the perfect way to relax and recharge. This added luxury sets The Darling House apart\u2014giving you a true retreat experience right at home. Here we treat our neighbors like family so if you feel like floating back in time, you are welcome to continue your evening inside as you unwind. Food lovers will appreciate being surrounded by some of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after dining destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9943569302558899,"social_amenities":0.05841422453522682,"party_restriction":0.0002863059926312417,"nearby_nightlife":0.34049564599990845}},{"text":"An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Beach essentials Beach gear such as towels, chairs, and an umbrella Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Hot tub Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are