,"line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.992621660232544,"social_amenities":0.005283924750983715,"party_restriction":0.0014219852164387703,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013511053984984756}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Whether you're getting ready for a wedding, hosting a girls\u2019 getaway, or traveling with family, this home is designed to accommodate and impress. After a day exploring Savannah, unwind in your private hot tub, the perfect way to relax and recharge. This added luxury sets The Darling House apart\u2014giving you a true retreat experience right at home. Here we treat our neighbors like family so if you feel like floating back in time, you are welcome to continue your evening inside as you unwind. Food lovers will appreciate being surrounded by some of Savannah\u2019s most sought-after dining destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9943569302558899,"social_amenities":0.05841422453522682,"party_restriction":0.0002863059926312417,"nearby_nightlife":0.34049564599990845}},{"text":"SVR-03131 Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900), a newly remodeled historic Victorian retreat in Savannah\u2019s sought-after Victorian District, perfect for families + groups. Just blocks from dog-friendly, Forsyth Park and surrounded by local diners, cafes, restaurants, and bars, this spacious home puts the city at your doorstep. Relax in the private hot tub to elevate your stay! Hop on the free DOT trolley for a quick ride to River Street and Plant Riverside. Welcome home to a Savannah Classic The space Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900) \u2014 a beautifully restored Victorian retreat nestled in Savannah\u2019s iconic Victorian District, where historic charm meets modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6256076097488403,"social_amenities":0.05193847790360451,"party_restriction":0.0015892863739281893,"nearby_nightlife":0.9638637900352478}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"SVR-03131 Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900), a newly remodeled historic Victorian retreat in Savannah\u2019s sought-after Victorian District, perfect for families + groups. Just blocks from dog-friendly, Forsyth Park and surrounded by local diners, cafes, restaurants, and bars, this spacious home puts the city at your doorstep. Relax in the private hot tub to elevate your stay! Hop on the free DOT trolley for a quick ride to River Street and Plant Riverside. Welcome home to a Savannah Classic The space Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900) \u2014 a beautifully restored Victorian retreat nestled in Savannah\u2019s iconic Victorian District, where historic charm meets modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6256076097488403,"social_amenities":0.05193847790360451,"party_restriction":0.0015892863739281893,"nearby_nightlife":0.9638637900352478}},{"text":"This location is ideal for guests looking to fully immerse themselves in Savannah\u2019s charm\u2014whether you're here for a wedding, SCAD visit, bachelorette trip, family vacation, or simply a relaxing escape. At The Darling House, every detail has been considered to create a seamless, elevated stay\u2014from the historic setting to the modern comforts and premium amenities. Welcome home to a classic Savannah stay\u2014reimagined. Guest access We are self-check-in, you will receive door codes at check-in time to let yourself in as you please. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":78,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.992621660232544,"social_amenities":0.005283924750983715,"party_restriction":0.0014219852164387703,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013511053984984756}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Enjoy brunch at Collins Quarter at Forsyth, grab Southern comfort food at Mrs. Wilkes Dining Room, sip craft cocktails at Artillery Bar, or explore the vibrant food scene in the nearby Starland District, home to favorites like Starland Yard, Two Tides Brewing Co., and eclectic local eateries. Coffee shops, bakeries, and late-night spots are all within easy reach, making every craving convenient. For sightseeing, you\u2019re just minutes from Historic Downtown Savannah, River Street, and Plant Riverside District, all easily accessible via the free DOT trolley, giving you effortless access to shopping, nightlife, rooftop bars, live music, and waterfront views without needing a car.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":74,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.013252364471554756,"social_amenities":0.0015331848990172148,"party_restriction":0.001093982602469623,"nearby_nightlife":0.9960732460021973}},{"text":"SVR-03131 Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900), a newly remodeled historic Victorian retreat in Savannah\u2019s sought-after Victorian District, perfect for families + groups. Just blocks from dog-friendly, Forsyth Park and surrounded by local diners, cafes, restaurants, and bars, this spacious home puts the city at your doorstep. Relax in the private hot tub to elevate your stay! Hop on the free DOT trolley for a quick ride to River Street and Plant Riverside. Welcome home to a Savannah Classic The space Welcome to The Darling House (est. 1900) \u2014 a beautifully restored Victorian retreat nestled in Savannah\u2019s iconic Victorian District, where historic charm meets modern luxury.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.6256076097488403,"social_amenities":0.05193847790360451,"party_restriction":0.0015892863739281893,"nearby_nightlife":0.9638637900352478}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 14031","address":"525 E HENRY ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":10.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-di