 with us first, please click my profile picture at the top of this listing and then click the \"contact host\" button to send an email directly to us without submitting a reservation request. Our home is in compliance with all Short-Term Vacation Rental laws in Savannah, Georgia. Our STVR permit number is SVR-00855 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":70,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00011335969611536711,"social_amenities":0.003292025998234749,"party_restriction":0.0027629199903458357,"nearby_nightlife":0.0002874341735150665}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Fully furnished 5 bedroom house waiting for your visit to Savannah. Seven blocks from Savannah\u2019s largest park, Forsyth. This listing is for the entire home. Please keep in mind that this home is over a 100 years old and isn't a luxury hotel. My place is close to parks, restaurants and dining, the city center, and great views. You\u2019ll love my place because of the high ceilings, the location, and the ambiance. My place is good for families and big groups. We do allow dogs with a fee. No cats. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9269953370094299,"social_amenities":0.0020599726121872663,"party_restriction":0.1905723363161087,"nearby_nightlife":0.12080885469913483}},{"text":"Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Parking and facilities Free carport on premises \u2013 2 spaces Free street parking Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":136,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006901111919432878,"social_amenities":0.17