 the ambiance. My place is good for families and big groups. We do allow dogs with a fee. No cats. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9269953370094299,"social_amenities":0.0020599726121872663,"party_restriction":0.1905723363161087,"nearby_nightlife":0.12080885469913483}},{"text":"If there is evidence of dog hair on the furniture, excess dog hair on towels and sheets, or stains, you will be charged the cost to clean this. In the event that a security deposit is collected, we will retain all or part of the security deposit to cover any costs associated with additional cleaning due to pets. The house is over a hundred years old and sound does travel. If your dog likes to bark a lot this house is not for them. Please be considerate of the neighborhood and our neighbors.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00010369360097683966,"social_amenities":0.0009490325464867055,"party_restriction":0.0037010658998042345,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003044896002393216}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Fully furnished 5 bedroom house waiting for your visit to Savannah. Seven blocks from Savannah\u2019s largest park, Forsyth. This listing is for the entire home. Please keep in mind that this home is over a 100 years old and isn't a luxury hotel. My place is close to parks, restaurants and dining, the city center, and great views. You\u2019ll love my place because of the high ceilings, the location, and the ambiance. My place is good for families and big groups. We do allow dogs with a fee. No cats. Guest access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":54,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9269953370094299,"social_amenities":0.0020599726121872663,"party_restriction":0.1905723363161087,"nearby_nightlife":0.12080885469913483}},{"text":"While staying with us, you may make use of everything our home has to offer: Wifi, laundry, TV, cable, complimentary towels, bathroom essentials (soap/shampoo/makeup wipe) and more are at your disposal. We provide a three toilet paper rolls per bathroom and one roll of paper towels to get you started, you may want to pick up some more if you plan on spending lots of time or cooking at the house. Other things to note We are a dog friendly home. 2 dogs maximum. We do not allow dogs on furniture or beds. We require a $150 non-refundable dog fee.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00016653856437187642,"social_amenities":0.0007835142314434052,"party_restriction":0.001420303015038371,"nearby_nightlife":0.003153033321723342}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 21019","address":"505 E ANDERSON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":8.0,"neighbor_count":2,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":1,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":3,"Noise-party-disturbance":1,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":1,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"26096097638","date":"2026-04-06","type":"29 OTHER NOISE COMPLAINT","outcome":"Noise complaints","recorded_address":"505 E Anderson St","recorded_pin":"20053 21019","side":"direct"},{"number":"26170176096","date":"2026-06-19","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"505 E Anderson St","recorded_pin":"20053 21019","side":"direct"},{"number":"25157159437","date":"2025-06-06","type":"24 UNWANTED SUSP in area","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"507 E Anderson St","recorded_pin":"20053 21020","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"752090492578280474","title":"Renovated Southern Oasis by Lucky Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/752090492578280474","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02613"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"752090492578280474","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"1d02b96590b820b803971901e504e3d16b059784dec7bde69e6a7c10f48f347f","chunks":8,"words":703,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.09578154981136322,"party_welcome":0.9931364059448242,"social_amenities":0.7509218454360962,"party_restriction":0.02327834628522396,"nearby_nightlife":0.9775301814079285,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Looking for the ultimate Savannah Escape? Look no further! This incredible property is located just minutes from all Savannah has to offer. Private parking, pet-friendly, and an endless list of amenities one could wish for! The space Looking for the ultimate Savannah Escape? Look no further! This incredible property is located just minutes from all Savannah has to offer. Private parking, pet-friendly, and an endless list of amenities one could wish for! Built in 1899, this adorned and lovingly restored home offers the best of both worlds; Charming Historic details, such as original wood floors, ornate crown molding, while featuring modern, comfortable furnishings and finishes.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009418317931704223,"social_amenities":0.09578154981136322,"party_restriction":0.0038650152273476124,"nearby_nightlife":0.0045125167816877365}},{"text":"Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: King Bed Bedroom 3: Queen Bed Living Room: Full Sleeper Sofa What is parking like for this home? Private Parking: There is an ample amount of off-street, private parking, next to the home where guests can park side-by-side and tandem. We can welcome your dog companions at this pet friendly home, but ask that you find other arrangements for cats, birds, and other furry friends. There is a $130 pet fee (non-refundable) with a 35 lb. maximum weight limit per dog and a limit of 2 dogs per reservation. Some homes may allow larger dogs, please inquire for more information. SVR-02613","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020987808238714933,"social_amenities":0.04567455127835274,"party_restriction":0.02327834628522396,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010390838142484426}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you're traveling with family or friends, everyone is welcome at Savannah Escape, including your sweet pups! Once you park your vehicle in one of the multiple private, off-street parking spaces, you'll enter via an electronic lock into your sweet home away from home to begin your vacation. The first level is made for entertaining, which consists of the main gathering space, formal dining room, the completely remodeled kitchen, and a full-size bathroom. Boasting with natural light from the floor to ceiling windows, the gathering room offers an ample amount of plush, comfortable seating for everyone.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9931364059448242,"social_amenities":0.0028216198552399874,"party_restriction":0.0001514902396593243,"nearby_nightlife":0.01223949994891882}},{"text":"The luxurious full bathroom at the front of the home is the perfect place to reset by taking a hot, steamy shower, in the large walk-in shower. Out back, your TRUE oasis awaits! A rarity here in Savannah, this large backyard is the perfect space to let your pups, children, or even adults play. At dusk, relax under the magical cafe lights, or join together on the back screened porch for an evening round of drinks. You'll never want to leave this Savannah Escape, but when you do decide to venture out, you'll be a short walk from amazing restaurants, coffee shops, and Forsyth Park! Sleeping Configuration:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.07926177233457565,"social_amenities":0.7509218454360962,"party_restriction":0.001205377746373415,"nearby_nightlife":0.9775301814079285}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The luxurious full bathroom at the front of the home is the perfect place to reset by taking a hot, steamy shower, in the large walk-in shower. Out back, your 