 for 2 Queen sofa bed in living room Double Murphey bed in the living room 50\" TV in living room and 40\" TVs in all bedrooms Huge private fenced in yard with gas fire pit and outdoor furniture for lounging Gas grill Washer/Dryer","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":59,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00044676000834442675,"social_amenities":0.5677294135093689,"party_restriction":0.0006274624611251056,"nearby_nightlife":0.9580793976783752}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Full Kitchen Drip Coffee Maker Free Wi-Fi Central Heat & Air Private Parking for up to 2 vehicles Other things to note Renowned folk artist next door. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":76,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0006724376580677927,"social_amenities":0.0032750130631029606,"party_restriction":0.002123930025845766,"nearby_nightlife":0.1001289039850235}},{"text":"A quick walk to Forsyth Park and River Street. Friendly convenient neighborhood, with private parking for at least 2 vehicles along with free street side parking. There is a large backyard with a working grill, firepit and a large patio table for entertaining. Spacious interior with open floor plan- great for groups. Pet friendly outside and inside. Large kitchen fully equipped for all your dining needs. Cleanliness is a top priority. $150 pet fee per pet Permit #SVR-02222 The space This property has: fully functioning washer and dryer, fully stocked and equipped kitchen. Fire pit and gas grill. With flexible check in and out we will accommodate your travel needs.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9864864349365234,"social_amenities":0.9939551949501038,"party_restriction":0.0015811839839443564,"nearby_nightlife":0.0057327961549162865}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Wi-Fi access Central heat and air. Guest access Walk to Forsyth Park, Kroger, restaurants, and shopping! Master Bedroom with king bed, en suite bathroom with dual vanity and walk in shower 2 guest bedrooms with queen beds and walk in clos