6292,"social_amenities":0.0031997160986065865,"party_restriction":0.00027707303524948657,"nearby_nightlife":0.9579680562019348}},{"text":"This listing consists of two condos right next to each other. Plenty of space for a large family or friendly get-together. Close to many sights in Savannah. \u2714\ufe0e Forsyth Park - 3 blocks \u2714\ufe0e SCAD - 1 mile \u2714\ufe0e River St - 1.5 miles \u2714\ufe0e Tybee Island - 19 miles \u2714\ufe0e Telfair Museum - 1.6 miles \u2714\ufe0e Cathedral of St John - 1.2 miles \u2714\ufe0e Bonaventure Cemetery- 3.3 miles \u2714\ufe0e Multiple famous Savannah Squares- 1.2 miles The spacious condos have tons of daylight & plenty of comfortable seating for everyone to enjoy. The space","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.016996610909700394,"social_amenities":0.0009041822049766779,"party_restriction":0.00018802423437591642,"nearby_nightlife":0.002880839863792062}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property Ring camera for added security at exterior entry door. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":119,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030513416277244687,"social_amenities":0.019412681460380554,"party_restriction":0.0004007465031463653,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006811486673541367}},{"text":"There is no shortage of space and comfort in these two combined side-by-side properties with separate entrances. There is an added bonus of extra privacy if some in the group want to stay in one condo and the rest in the other. Still close, but far at the same time! Your group will enjoy the following; KITCHENS (2) \u27a22 Fully stocked kitchens with pots, pans and dishes \u27a2Microwave \u27a2Blender \u27a2Coffee-Keurig and drip: Regular & Decaf \u27a2Coffee station: creamer, sugar, tea \u27a2Fridge: Filtered water & icemaker \u27a2Dishwasher \u27a2Electric Stove \u27a2Knives and cutting board \u27a2Traditional Popcorn popping pot DINING (2) \u27a2Two dining rooms.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027571801911108196,"social_amenities":0.011537021026015282,"party_restriction":0.0005025977734476328,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007678732508793473}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Free parking is available on the street in front of the building and on the side streets. Other things to note -Condos are located on the 2nd floor. Must walk up one flight of stairs. -Please be respectful of our neighbors above and below. Hearty laughs do tend to travel. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004151437897235155,"social_amenities":0.0028643463738262653,"party_restriction":0.005780777893960476,"nearby_nightlife":0.9174940586090088}},{"text":"Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: Keurig coffee machine Wine glasses Toaster Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock Cleaning available during stay","section":"AMENITIES","line":165,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00027285300893709064,"social_amenities":0.000794913328718394,"party_restriction":0.0006616586470045149,"nearby_nightlife":0.0003527402877807617}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"\u27a2HULU, APPLE TV, MAX & DISNEY PLUS available Even though the spaces are fairly close to downtown and a lot of the action, they are still far enough away from all the hustle and bustle to get a comfortable night's sleep. Wonderful coffee shop just downstairs if you don't feel like brewing your own and a great breakfast biscuit place right below your feet as well! \u27a2Concierge service available! In town for a special event? Add light decor or a private chef for the occasion. More info is provided at booking upon request. Savannah SVR-03079 Guest access The entire space is yours to use.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":102,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9570885300636292,"social_amenities":0.0031997160986065865,"party_restriction":0.00027707303524948657,"nearby_nightlife":0.9579680562019348}},{"text":"Free parking is available on the street in front of the building and on the side streets. Other things to note -Condos are located on the 2nd floor. Must walk up one flight of stairs. -Please be respectful of our neighbors above and below. Hearty laughs do tend to travel. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":111,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004151437897235155,"social_amenities":0.0028643463738262653,"party_restriction":0.005780777893960476,"nearby_nightlife":0.9174940586090088}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20053 23021","address":"1524 BULL ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":4.0,"advertised_guests":5.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[],"listings":[{"listing_id":"48675691","title":"Hip and Sophisticated Condo - Live Like a Local!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/48675691","guests":5.0,"permits":["SVR-02303"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"48675691","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"87b7b00898a8d096d70af7aee4e6b797f6dcff526762e7e1795e77d34209b667","chunks":7,"words":720,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8481361865997314,"party_welcome":0.0018636465538293123,"social_amenities":0.8481361865997314,"party_restriction":0.023338083177804947,"nearby_nightlife":0.8133680820465088,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Experience modern comfort and contemporary charm in this bright 2BR, 2BA condo in Savannah, perfectly located in the vibrant Thomas Square neighborhood. Just blocks from Forsyth Park and minutes from Downtown, this stylish second-floor walk-up blends urban convenience with local character. Surrounded by trendy restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and boutique shops, it\u2019s the ideal home base for exploring Savannah\u2019s culture, history, and charm. SVR-02303 The space \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Modern Savannah Condo | Walk to Forsyth Park & Thomas Square Discover Savannah at its most dynamic\u2014where historic character, a thriving creative scene, and modern comfort come together in this bright, beautifully curated 2-bedroom condo located in the heart of the Thomas Square area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000971502682659775,"social_amenities":0.8481361865997314,"party_restriction":0.0023045791313052177,"nearby_nightlife":0.04222073033452034}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser Entertainment Ethernet connection 75 inch HDTV with Netflix Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Heating and cooling Central air conditioning Central heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property We have an exterior, outdoor surveillance security camera for the safety of our guests and the security of our home. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm","section":"AMENITIES","line":105,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00022564062965102494,"social_amenities":0.4917559027671814,"party_restriction":0.023338083177804947,"nearby_nightlife":0.003256534691900015}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Perfect for weekend escapes, business trips, or extended stays, this stylish home offers a true local feel with exceptional walkability. Step outside to neighborhood caf\u00e9s, boutiques, and galleries, enjoy a short walk to Forsyth Park, or reach downtown Savannah with an easy stroll or quick rideshare. Whether you\u2019re here to explore the city, work remotely, or simply relax, this condo is a welcoming and convenient home base. \u2b50\ufe0f HOME HIGHLIGHTS \ud83d\udecb Living Area \u2714\ufe0eA sun-filled, open-concept space designed for unwinding after a day around town. \u2714\ufe0eComfortable seating paired with clean, modern d\u00e9cor \u2714\ufe0eQueen pull-out sofa to accommodate additional guests \u2714\ufe0eLarge Smart TV with streaming capabilities","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018636465538293123,"social_amenities":0.012290704064071178,"party_restriction":0.000843210204038769,"nearby_nightlife":0.6511741876602173}},{"text":"Experience modern comfort and contemporary charm in this bright 2BR, 2BA condo in Savannah, perfectly located in the vibrant Thomas Square neighborhood. Just blocks from Forsyth Park and minutes from Downtown, this stylish second-floor walk-up blends urban convenience with local character. Surrounded by trendy restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and boutique shops, it\u2019s the ideal home base for exploring Savannah\u2019s culture, history, and charm. SVR-02303 The space \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Modern Savannah Condo | Walk to Forsyth Park & Thomas Square Discover Savannah at its most dynamic\u2014where historic character, a thriving creative scene, and modern comfort come together in this bright, beautifully curated 2-bedroom condo located in the heart of the Thomas Square area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000971502682659775,"social_amenities":0.8481361865997314,"party_restriction":0.0023045791313052177,"nearby_nightlife":0.04222073033452034}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Experience modern comfort and contemporary charm in this bright 2BR, 2BA condo in Savannah, perfectly located in the vibrant Thomas Square neighborhood. Just blocks from Forsyth Park and minutes from Downtown, this stylish second-floor walk-up blends urban convenience with local character. Surrounded by trendy restaurants, caf\u00e9s, and boutique shops, it\u2019s the ideal home base for exploring Savannah\u2019s culture, history, and charm. SVR-02303 The space \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Modern Savannah Condo | Walk to Forsyth Park & Thomas Square Discover Savannah at its most dynamic\u2014where historic character, a thriving creative scene, and modern comfort come together in this bright, beautifully curated 2-bedroom condo located in the heart of the Thomas Square area.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000971502682659775,"social_amenities":0.8481361865997314,"party_restriction":0.0023045791313052177,"nearby_nightlife":0.04222073033452034}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Cotton linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Clothing storage: closet and dresser En