e on street parking - just check the signs for street sweep times. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":91,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00025859131710603833,"social_amenities":0.004373088479042053,"party_restriction":0.0026541852857917547,"nearby_nightlife":0.0015986610669642687}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"In-unit washer & dryer\u2014especially convenient for extended stays or business travel \ud83d\udccd LOCATION \u2014 SAVANNAH, GEORGIA Live like a local in one of Savannah\u2019s most creative, walkable neighborhoods. \ud83c\udf33 Easy walk to Forsyth Park \u2615 Steps from Fox & Fig Caf\u00e9 and The Vault Kitchen & Market \ud83c\udfa8 Minutes from the Starland District\u2019s art, dining, and nightlife \ud83d\ude97 Quick ride to River Street and City Market \ud83d\udcac WHY GUESTS LOVE THIS CONDO \u2714\ufe0eWalkable location near Forsyth Park and favorite local spots \u2714\ufe0eStylish, spacious layout with modern amenities \u2714\ufe0eFast Wi-Fi and Smart TVs throughout \u2714\ufe0eIdeal for couples, small families, business travelers, and remote workers","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007502842345274985,"social_amenities":0.008029802702367306,"party_restriction":0.0004698121047113091,"nearby_nightlife":0.8133680820465088}},{"text":"Perfect for weekend escapes, business trips, or extended stays, this stylish home offers a true local feel with exceptional walkability. Step outside to neighborhood caf\u00e9s, boutiques, and galleries, enjoy a short walk to Forsyth Park, or reach downtown Savannah with an easy stroll or quick rideshare. Whether you\u2019re here to explore the city, work remotely, or simply relax, this condo is a welcoming and convenient home base. \u2b50\ufe0f HOME HIGHLIGHTS \ud83d\udecb Living Area \u2714\ufe0eA sun-filled, open-concept space designed for unwinding after a day around town. \u2714\ufe0eComfortable seating paired with clean, modern d\u00e9cor \u2714\ufe0eQueen pull-out sofa to accommodate additional guests \u2714\ufe0eLarge Smart TV with streaming capabilities","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":52,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0018636465538293123,"social_amenities":0.012290704064071178,"party_restriction":0.000843210204038769,"nearby_nightlife":0.6511741876602173}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20064 11013","address":"412 E 35TH ST","permit_type":"owner","approved_guests":6.0,"advertised_guests":6.0,"neighbor_count":0,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":2,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24315329528","date":"2024-11-10","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 E 35TH ST","recorded_pin":"20064 11013","side":"direct"},{"number":"26193200348","date":"2026-07-12","type":"15B RESIDENTIAL BURGLARY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"412 E 35TH ST","recorded_pin":"20064 11013","side":"direct"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"26214569","title":"Renovated Street Car District Home w/ Sauna!","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/26214569","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-01825"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"26214569","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b8af99e2ed794bdfc7ef9c2de02512490f08d2e089d9bf3ba4f3f23ef18d123d","chunks":5,"words":367,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.03166898712515831,"party_welcome":0.00965690053999424,"social_amenities":0.03166898712515831,"party_restriction":0.004667269065976143,"nearby_nightlife":0.9929591417312622,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Hot water Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer E