a great property to consider renting for larger groups traveling together. Drayton Place 4 should not be missed when searching for Savannah vacation rentals with room for up to four guests. There's no better way to enjoy tastes of privacy and quaintness while staying so close to the center of everything. This two-bedroom, one-bathroom beauty shows off all of the fancifulness of a sweet Southern stay!","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004748282954096794,"social_amenities":0.0006631538271903992,"party_restriction":0.00018373935017734766,"nearby_nightlife":0.9911024570465088}},{"text":"It's also one of the rare Savannah vacation homes to offer private outdoor space. Nestled in Savannah's famed Starland District, Drayton Place 4 is right next to Thomas Square. The surrounding neighborhood boasts some of the city's best galleries, shops, boutiques, restaurants, bars, and music venues. Prepare to mingle with the locals when you spend time exploring the world right outside this beautiful vacation rental. Stepping into this home is like discovering an era-defying oasis in the middle of one of America's best cities! Drayton Place 4 boasts a gorgeous parlor-style living room that shows off a show-stopping fireplace, high-end couches, beautiful artworks, and a smart television offering streaming access.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0013344980543479323,"social_amenities":0.002533185062929988,"party_restriction":0.0006664402899332345,"nearby_nightlife":0.9882826209068298}}]}}},{"listing_id":"658700341863809444","title":"Funky Stay in Starland | Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658700341863809444","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-00632"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"658700341863809444","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"145982572b13506fdd018dd24b2da239746d176665a55b33641a1c4e82f03927","chunks":17,"words":1651,"party_signal":0,"soci