632065}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This little treasure is home to many one-of-a-kind shops that offer terrific gift items. Savannah's famed River Street is another great area to focus on when it's time to dine, shop, dance, and more! This is considered the place to \"party\" in Savannah on the weekends. River Street is home to many great pubs, bars, and clubs where you can enjoy live music while river ferries float by. You can even consider taking a ferry from downtown's riverwalk to Hutchinson Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9487426280975342,"social_amenities":0.0021320669911801815,"party_restriction":0.0005957592511549592,"nearby_nightlife":0.9973637461662292}},{"text":"When seeking more excursions, add pub crawls, fun trolley tours, and haunted cemetery tours to the list of adventures that show off all of the thrills and delights of Savannah. Finally, Savannah is a fantastic place to catch a festival. The list of festivals that attract visitors from around the country each year includes the Savannah Jazz Festival, the Savannah Craft Brew Fest, the Savannah Film Festival, and the Pin Point Seafood Festival. Drayton Place 3 is one of the best vacation rentals Savannah GA visitors can choose when they want to enjoy the beauty of staying in Savannah's Starland District.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":65,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.010950799100100994,"social_amenities":0.0020262114703655243,"party_restriction":0.0019727973267436028,"nearby_nightlife":0.9917581677436829}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Drayton Place 3 is a premier property for anyone searching for Savannah vacation rental getaway for four guests. This two-bedroom, one-bathroom charmer dazzles with a fully updated interior, quaint outdoor courtyard, and entertainment features. The home's enviable location in Savannah's famed Thomas Square neighborhood places guests next door the vibrant Starland District. The space Drayton Place 3 is a premi