3734,"party_restriction":0.0007348900544457138,"nearby_nightlife":0.007491007912904024}},{"text":"Each unit features a fully updated interior, access to a quaint outdoor courtyard, and entertainment features. The home's enviable location in Savannah's famed Thomas Square neighborhood places guests next door the vibrant Starland District. A top attraction in Savannah, Starland offers a beautiful walkable neighborhood with trendy local boutiques, coffee shops, galleries, restaurants, bars, and music venues. Drayton Place is a great property to consider renting for larger groups traveling together. Savannah's Starland District is packed with galleries, live music venues, art museums, shows, fabulous restaurants and great nightlife. It neighbors Thomas Square Historic District, part of the famed historic Savannah with its spacious homes, beautiful greenery and idyllic climate.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8720583319664001,"social_amenities":0.002815034706145525,"party_restriction":0.0008200356387533247,"nearby_nightlife":0.9915136694908142}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Each unit also has a stacked washer and dryer for all of your laundry needs, and you'll have an ironing board, iron and all the hangers you need. Each unit has its own full bathroom, fully stocked with linens and towels, featuring either a tiled walk-in shower or a tub/shower combo. Step into the curtained outdoor porch with elegant red curtains and comfortable patio furniture, enjoy morning coffee on the upstairs patio overlooking Thomas Square, or bring all of your guests together around the gas grill in the back courtyard for a barbecue meal. Explore Savannah from the Drayton Place Main House","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":81,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.7154537439346313,"social_amenities":0.9109388589859009,"party_restriction":0.00034413885441608727,"nearby_nightlife":0.9221981167793274}},{"text":"Stove Oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":253,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014809903223067522,"social_amenities":0.8324272036552429,"party_restriction":0.0022912113927304745,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011877595679834485}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"It has a king-size bed in the bedroom as well as a queen-size sleeper sofa in the living room. Unit 1B - This 1-bedroom apartment sleeps 4 guests. It has a king-size bed in the bedroom as well as a queen-size sleeper sofa in the living room. Unit 2 - This 1-bedroom apartment sleeps 4 guests. It has a king-size bed in the bedroom as well as a queen-size sleeper sofa in the living room. Unit 3 - This 1-bedroom apartment sleeps 4 guests, with a king-size bed in the bedroom and an additional queen bed located in the unit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":67,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004918817430734634,"social_amenities":0.004901399370282888,"party_restriction":0.002890119794756174,"nearby_nightlife":0.006867903750389814}},{"text":"If you are planning a group trip to Savannah, the Drayton Place Main House offers comfort, privacy, exceptional amenities and classic Southern style at our vacation rentals Savannah GA. Make a reservation for your journey today by using our secure, convenient online form. Check availability online to find the dates that this property is available. Please don't hesitate to reach out to us at Southern Belle Vacation Rentals with any questions about group travel to our Savannah vacation homes. We look forward to seeing you at Drayton Place! Guest access Occupancy: 20 Each unit has living room or area with seating and smart TV with streaming access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00030701281502842903,"social_amenities":0.0020204747561365366,"party_restriction":0.002778265392407775,"nearby_nightlife":0.0006703745457343757}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Each unit features a fully updated interior, access to a quaint outdoor courtyard, and entertainment features. The home's enviable location in Savannah's famed Thomas Square neighborhood places guests next door the vibrant Starland District. A top attraction in Savannah, Starland offers a beautiful walkable neighborhood with trendy local boutiques, coffee shops, galleries, restaurants, bars, and music venues. Drayton Place is a great property to consider renting for larger groups traveling together. Savannah's Starland District is packed with galleries, live music venues, art museums, shows, fabulous restaurants and great nightlife. It neighbors Thomas Square Historic District, part of the famed historic Savannah with its spacious homes, beautiful greenery and idyllic climate.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":41,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.8720583319664001,"social_amenities":0.002815034706145525,"party_restriction":0.0008200356387533247,"nearby_nightlife":0.9915136694908142}},{"text":"With easy access to boutiques, antique shops, gastropubs and music venues, expansive patios, balconies and curtained porches as well as a back courtyard with plenty of room for outdoor gatherings, Drayton Place Main House has everything you need for a memorable trip. Each of the five individually curated apartments is fully stocked for a fabulous vacation, making it the perfect blend of historic grandeur and modern privacy. Visit the Drayton Place Main House Walk through the large green front yard to the columned entrance of the Drayton Place Main House to begin your Savannah adventure.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":53,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.01206129975616932,"social_amenities":0.01444888487458229,"party_restriction":0.0003915629640687257,"nearby_nightlife":0.9867669939994812}}]}}},{"listing_id":"715953215168325118","title":"Walk Everywhere in Starland, Heated Pool Access","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/715953215168325118","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-01097"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"715953215168325118","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"6f29b3897ea9a9e8b8b61c810041bb39bbc8cd08da15624e625fbbe8eee011e9","chunks":15,"words":1487,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8883350491523743,"party_welcome":0.00769770797342062,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.0035005512181669474,"nearby_nightlife":0.9939730763435364,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Dining table Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Single level home No stairs in home Servic