,"party_restriction":0.0035005512181669474,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008584440220147371}},{"text":"Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":109,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018984753114636987,"social_amenities":0.8883350491523743,"party_restriction":0.002244511852040887,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010255929082632065}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Full bathroom with tub/shower Additional sleeping space in living room on a queen size sofa bed - easily folds away when not in use Pet friendly for 1 dog (20 lb weight limit) Private entry in secure building, apartment located on first floor Outdoor space: Shared courtyard with gas grill, seating and cafe lights Location: Starland District; You will find great local restaurants, shopping, coffee shops, and more right outside your door! Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":92,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004348855291027576,"social_amenities":0.08542396128177643,"party_restriction":0.0012258033966645598,"nearby_nightlife":0.9939730763435364}},{"text":"Outside Drayton Place, you can relax on the comfortable outdoor furniture at the front, sides and rear of the building. Enjoy outdoor cooking with a grill and eat at the tables with umbrellas in the lovely courtyard. Stroll across the street to Thomas Square Park to enjoy the greenery, or walk easily to all of the attractions that the Starland District and Thomas Square have to offer. For a beach break during your city trip, remember that Tybee Beach is less than a half-hour drive from your Savannah vacation rentals.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":73,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002089868939947337,"social_amenities":0.03029312565922737,"party_restriction":0.0009275519987568259,"nearby_nightlife":0.9102073907852173}}]}}}],"complete":true},{"pin":"20065 01013","address":"1812 DRAYTON ST","permit_type":"non_owner","approved_guests":8.0,"advertised_guests":2.0,"neighbor_count":1,"counts":{"direct":{"All calls":0,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"neighbors":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0},"combined":{"All calls":6,"Noise-party-disturbance":0,"Parking complaints":0,"Noise complaints":0,"Loud party":0,"Disturbance / nuisance":0}},"calls":[{"number":"24124130723","date":"2024-05-03","type":"57 MISSING PERSON","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35th St","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24160169933","date":"2024-06-08","type":"28-4 DOMESTIC DISTURB VERBAL","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35th St","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24216227877","date":"2024-08-03","type":"24-4 TRESPASSING","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35th St","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25205208320","date":"2025-07-24","type":"22 FOUND PROPERTY","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35TH ST","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25300304882","date":"2025-10-27","type":"42 PAST THEFT","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35th St","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"25310316054","date":"2025-11-06","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"102 E 35TH ST","recorded_pin":"20065 01012","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"658821383052387913","title":"Cozy Thomas Square Carriage House","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658821383052387913","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02265"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"658821383052387913","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"09839b44bba8dacc11797aa7080db5db11ecbfc83289f20bc1f7e8119e22b155","chunks":15,"words":1554,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8078846335411072,"party_welcome":0.9936275482177734,"social_amenities":0.8078846335411072,"party_restriction":0.0031244566198438406,"nearby_nightlife":0.9922997355461121,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":233,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014975687954574823,"social_amenities":0.8078846335411072,"party_restriction":0.0025106272660195827,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012015376705676317}},{"text":"Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":134,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038918163045309484,"social_amenities":0.35925817489624023,"party_restriction":0.0028743601869791746,"nearby_nightlife":0.004947542678564787}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Since 2005, the area has been undergoing some rebuilding and sprucing up, so it is a prime place to enjoy yourself. Just a few blocks to the north, Forsyth Park awaits with 30 acres of outdoor activities. Walking paths, gardens, playing fields, playgrounds, tennis courts and basketball courts surround the crown jewel of the park, a French-style fountain. It\u2019s a gathering place for local residents and vacation rentals Savannah GA guests alike. Weddings, reunions, music and celebrations converge around the picturesque fountain. Be sure to bring your camera because you never know what you\u2019re going to find. If possible, stop by the park on Saturdays during your visit.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":77,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9936275482177734,"social_amenities":0.0012815069640055299,"party_restriction":0.00020638764544855803,"nearby_nightlife":0.6572447419166565}},{"text":"Drayton serves coastal Georgia cuisine in an elegant mansion setting. The Sentient Bean at 13 E. Park Ave. is another Forsyth icon catering to your coffee and dessert cravings. It also serves vegetarian fare. Also in the Forsyth vicinity, The Haunt on Abercorn St. serves forest-to-table dishes and esoteric beverages. They source ingredients locally and add their own artful twists. If you\u2019re in the mood for a cultural experience, the Savannah African Art Museum is a short walk away on 37th Ave. It features art collections from Central and West Africa nations. Storytelling, dance, craft days and more offer opportunities for you to get involved and socialize.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.680289089679718,"social_amenities":0.003410831792280078,"party_restriction":0.0005616773851215839,"nearby_nightlife":0.9922997355461121}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":233,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0014975687954574823,"social_amenities":0.8078846335411072,"party_restriction":0.0025106272660195827,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012015376705676317}},{"text":"Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":134,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038918163045309484,"social_amenities":0.35925817489624023,"party_restriction":0.0028743601869791746,"nearby_nightlife":0.004947542678564787}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Drayton Place Carriage House Unit 2 is a premier property for anyone searching for Savannah vacation rentals offering room for up to two guests. This one-bedroom, one-bathroom charmer dazzles with a fully updated interior, quaint outdoor courtyard, and entertainment features. The home's enviable location in Savannah's famed Thomas Square neighborhood places guests next door the vibrant Starland District. The space Claim your rightful place in Savannah\u2019s most popular new destination when you make your reservation for Drayton Place Carriage Unit 2. Located near everything and right next door to the Starland district, Drayton Place is a stunning estate in the quiet neighborhood of Thomas Square.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0007916439790278673,"social_amenities":0.00329433660954237,"party_restriction":0.0031244566198438406,"nearby_nightlife":0.09960915148258209}},{"text":"Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island. For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":134,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00038918163045309484,"social_amenities":0.35925817489624023,"party_restriction":0.0028743601869791746,"nearby_nightlife":0.004947542678564787}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Drayton serves coastal Georgia cuisine in an elegant mansion setting. The Sentient Bean at 13 E. Park Ave. is another Forsyth icon catering to your coffee and dessert cravings. It also serves vegetarian fare. Also in the Forsyth vicinity, The Haunt on Abercorn St. serves forest-to-table dishes and esoteric beverages. They source ingredients locally and add their own artful twists. If you\u2019re in the mood for a cultural experience, the Savannah African Art Museum is a short walk away on 37th Ave. It features art collections from Central and West Africa nations. Storytelling, dance, craft days and more offer opportunities for you to get involved and socialize.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.680289089679718,"social_amenities":0.003410831792280078,"party_restriction":0.0005616773851215839,"nearby_nightlife":0.9922997355461121}},{"text":"A year-round farmer\u2019s market takes place, offering everything from freshly baked pastries to locally grown produce. It\u2019s a great opportunity to immerse yourself in the culture of the South. Named after the 33rd governor of Georgia, Forsyth Park dates to the mid-1800s. View the park\u2019s historic monuments, enjoy a picnic or throw a frisbee on the expansive playfields. There are also plenty of places to eat in and near the park. Collins Quarter at Forsyth Park is a casual caf\u00e9 with gourmet options for breakfast, brunch and lunch. Nearby, you\u2019ll find 700 Drayton Restaurant a fancier option that serves breakfast, brunch, lunch and dinner too.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":85,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003900120791513473,"social_amenities":0.0008967522298917174,"party_restriction":0.0005610732478089631,"nearby_nightlife":0.9522312879562378}}]}}},{"listing_id":"658821399649347489","title":"Cozy Victorian District Carriage House","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/658821399649347489","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02264"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"658821399649347489","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"b64e3e3e8e7d95f8695896ac01e4bc46d07368d102f1ecee58b5602a8fee2600","chunks":16,"words":1578,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.8646371960639954,"party_welcome":0.9687961339950562,"social_amenities":0.9917815327644348,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.9900158047676086,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Sa