n rentals Savannah GA. Your Savannah Itinerary","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9687961339950562,"social_amenities":0.9917815327644348,"party_restriction":0.0013241148553788662,"nearby_nightlife":0.7940061092376709}},{"text":"Be sure to drop by for its Juneteenth celebration if your visit coincides with that holiday. Take in some of the restaurants in the nearby Starland District of Savannah where residents and guests of Savannah vacation homes love to converge. For example, lunch at the Starland Caf\u00e9 in a gracious Victorian-style location on E. 41st Street. Splurge on a fine dining experience at Elizabeth on 37th, or drop by Back In the Day Bakery on Bull Street for a Saturday afternoon pick-me up. Browse local art at The Hidden Hand Society on DeSoto Street, or feed your own creative appetite with art supplies from Starlandia on Bull Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.15415160357952118,"social_amenities":0.0022359725553542376,"party_restriction":0.0008157736156135798,"nearby_nightlife":0.9887216091156006}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A handy on-site laundry room includes a washer and dryer and a shelf for extra bedding, towels and an iron for your use. A large, enclosed brick courtyard provides a common area for conversations, soaking up some sun and socializing with other Savannah vacation rentals guests, if you like. Enjoy cool mornings and romantic evenings at the lovely wrought iron bistro table just steps from your front door. Try your hand at some outdoor grilling on the shared gas barbeque. Also, just a scenic drive away, our private pool awaits, reserved exclusively for the use of our guests at vacation rentals Savannah GA. Your Savannah Itinerary","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":69,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9687961339950562,"social_amenities":0.9917815327644348,"party_restriction":0.0013241148553788662,"nearby_nightlife":0.7940061092376709}},{"text":"Outdoor space: Shared courtyard with gas grill, seating and cafe lights Parking: Shared off street parking pad for 1 vehicle only, first-come, first serve; additional free parking on street Location: Starland District; You will find great local restaurants, shopping, coffee shops, and more right outside your door! Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":136,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003612833679653704,"social_amenities":0.9024569392204285,"party_restriction":0.0014786917017772794,"nearby_nightlife":0.9900158047676086}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"For our Savannah properties, it is a scenic 25-minute drive through Wilmington and Whitemarsh Island, taking you over the Savannah River Delta onto Tybee Island. The Pool is open during the below dates and times. March 1 - Oct 31: Open 7 days a week from 10am-5pm. Nov 1 - Feb 28/29: Open Friday and Saturday from 10am-5pm Additional Pool Hours available during the off-season are listed below. If these dates fall in the middle of the week, the pool will be open as listed below and every Friday and Saturday. Day before Thanksgiving, Thanksgiving Day, and the day after Thanksgiving","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":147,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0020213767420500517,"social_amenities":0.8646371960639954,"party_restriction":0.0369068942964077,"nearby_nightlife":0.003973853308707476}},{"text":"Hot water kettle Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Barbecue utensils Grill, charcoal, bamboo skewers/iron skewers, etc. Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor Patio or balcony Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Pool Single level home No stairs in home Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":239,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0009960628813132644,"social_amenities":0.561025857925415,"party_restriction":0.0031324438750743866,"nearby_nightlife":0.0007385985809378326}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Outdoor space: Shared courtyard with gas grill, seating and cafe lights Parking: Shared off street parking pad for 1 vehicle only, first-come, first serve; additional free parking on street Location: Starland District; You will find great local restaurants, shopping, coffee shops, and more right outside your door! Situated next door to Thomas Square Park. Please note that this property is equipped with exterior security cameras for the safety and security of our guests and the property. Other things to note Heated Pool Access Our guests have access to our beautiful, heated pool that is located on the South End of Tybee Island.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":136,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003612833679653704,"social_amenities":0.9024569392204285,"party_restriction":0.0014786917017772794,"nearby_nightlife":0.9900158047676086}},{"text":"Be sure to drop by for its Juneteenth celebration if your visit coincides with that holiday. Take in some of the restaurants in the nearby Starland District of Savannah where residents and guests of Savannah vacation homes love to converge. For example, lunch at the Starland Caf\u00e9 in a gracious Victorian-style location on E. 41st Street. Splurge on a fine dining experience at Elizabeth on 37th, or drop by Back In the Day Bakery on Bull Street for a Saturday afternoon pick-me up. Browse local art at The Hidden Hand Society on DeSoto Street, or feed your own creative appetite with art supplies from Starlandia on Bull Street.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":93,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.15415160357952118,"social_amenities":0.0022359725553542376