de alarm There is no carbon monoxide detector on the property.","section":"AMENITIES","line":113,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00014844488759990782,"social_amenities":0.005214216187596321,"party_restriction":0.0004306379414629191,"nearby_nightlife":0.0013538465136662126}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"There is an exterior set of stairs that you will need to go up to reach the entrance door to the apartment. Other things to note Please note this is a carriage house located behind the main home, offering a private and tucked-away stay. As with many homes in Savannah\u2019s Historic District, you may occasionally experience normal city sounds (road noise, emergency vehicles, sirens, trains, ship horns, trash trucks, neighbors, etc). Street parking is available nearby but not guaranteed. We recommend reviewing all listing details prior to booking and reaching out with any questions you may have. Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":56,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001241230493178591,"social_amenities":0.0017420464428141713,"party_restriction":0.003440583124756813,"nearby_nightlife":0.002768093254417181}},{"text":"Tucked behind a historic home on W. Anderson St., this modern new-build carriage house blends Savannah charm with the comfort of newer construction. Enjoy a bright, thoughtfully designed space perfect for solo travelers or couples. You will be close to Forsyth Park, the Starland district and all that downtown Savannah has to offer! The space Welcome to your private Savannah escape, tucked behind a stunning new build home on West Anderson Street, this carriage house apartment offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and a convenient location. Thoughtfully designed for a elevated stay, the space features an open-concept kitchen, dining and living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004170598404016346,"social_amenities":0.005043267272412777,"party_restriction":0.001567441038787365,"nearby_nightlife":0.022967306897044182}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Step outside and you\u2019re just minutes from all of Historic Savannah\u2019s most loved attractions. Enjoy a short stroll to Forsyth Park, or explore nearby coffee shops, restaurants, and boutiques. Tucked away yet incredibly walkable, this carriage house is ideal for guests looking to experience Savannah like a local. There is not designated parking, but there is unmetered street parking on all the neighboring streets. We can\u2019t wait to host you! SVR-03107 Guest access Guests will have full access to the carriage house apartment. The apartment is on the second floor, above the garage.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000296312035061419,"social_amenities":0.0017574196681380272,"party_restriction":0.0004312516830395907,"nearby_nightlife":0.9796038269996643}},{"text":"Tucked behind a historic home on W. Anderson St., this modern new-build carriage house blends Savannah charm with the comfort of newer construction. Enjoy a bright, thoughtfully designed space perfect for solo travelers or couples. You will be close to Forsyth Park, the Starland district and all that downtown Savannah has to offer! The space Welcome to your private Savannah escape, tucked behind a stunning new build home on West Anderson Street, this carriage house apartment offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and a convenient location. Thoughtfully designed for a elevated stay, the space features an open-concept kitchen, dining and living room.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004170598404016346,"social_amenities":0.005043267272412777,"party_restriction":0.001567441038787365,"nearby_nightlife":0.022967306897044182}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1670460204430401882","title":"Spacious Modern Apt| 2BD/2BA| Near Forsyth Park","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1670460204430401882","guests":4.0,"permits":["SVR-03090"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1670460204430401882","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668