a relaxed, local Savannah stay The space Welcome to your Savannah home away from home, this beautifully designed new construction, garden-level apartment offers the perfect blend of space, comfort, and location in the heart of the Historic Districts. Thoughtfully laid out with two bedrooms and two full bathrooms, this home is ideal for couples, families, or friends traveling together.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00040998405893333256,"social_amenities":0.8743007779121399,"party_restriction":0.0020229860674589872,"nearby_nightlife":0.012428986839950085}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"From there, continue exploring the Historic District\u2019s restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and beautiful squares. Whether you\u2019re here for a weekend getaway or an extended stay, this garden apartment offers a comfortable and convenient home base to experience Savannah like a local. We can\u2019t wait to host you! SVR-03090 Guest access Guests will have full access to the ground level apartment.There is a small front patio that is also available for guest use. Other things to note Please note this is a ground level apartment situated below the main home.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":47,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0004607836017385125,"social_amenities":0.0056992182508111,"party_restriction":0.000672503374516964,"nearby_nightlife":0.9219149947166443}},{"text":"Each bedroom provides a comfortable, private retreat, while the open living space invites you to relax, gather, and unwind after a day exploring the city. The fully equipped kitchen and eat-in kitchen area make it easy to enjoy meals at home, while the living room offers a welcoming space to settle in. Designed with a balance of charm and simplicity, the apartment feels both elevated and easy to live in. Step outside and you\u2019re just a short walk to Forsyth Park, where you can enjoy morning walks beneath the oaks, weekend markets, and one of Savannah\u2019s most iconic landmarks.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00018029131751973182,"social_amenities":0.0034077633172273636,"party_restriction":0.0010156482458114624,"nearby_nightlife":0.3277668058872223}}]}}},{"listing_id":"1670514873229603634","title":"Stunning Downtown 3BD-2.5BA Home| Near Forsyth Pk","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1670514873229603634","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-03108"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1670514873229603634","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2a6446dfa51daf104426ae44e2f75a3032311a39be8f0ae43a0f8ea4466a5e47","chunks":6,"words":468,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.010888169519603252,"party_welcome":0.017053356394171715,"social_amenities":0.044756051152944565,"party_restriction":0.004409319721162319,"nearby_nightlife":0.983107328414917,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Iron Entertainment TV Family Board games Heating and cooling Air conditioning Indoor fireplace Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Toaster","section":"AMENITIES","line":60,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00021309367730282247,"social_amenities":0.010888169519603252,"party_restriction":0.00021413055947050452,"nearby_nightlife":0.0010223366552963853}},{"text":"This beautifully appointed home offers spacious living, timeless character, and thoughtfully curated interiors throughout. Perfect for families, group getaways, or longer stays, the home blends historic charm with modern comfort in a way that feels both inviting and luxurious. Inside, you\u2019ll find multiple living spaces designed for connection and comfort, along with a fully equipped kitchen and dining area ideal for shared meals and entertaining. Each bedroom is designed as its own retreat, offering comfort, privacy, and a place to unwind after a day exploring Savannah. Step outside and you\u2019re just a short stroll to Forsyth Park, one of the city\u2019s most iconic destinations.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0026138843968510628,"social_amenities":0.0036801169626414776,"party_restriction":0.0002150236105080694,"nearby_nightlife":0.05525239184498787}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"We are so excited for your Savannah getaway in this beautifully designed new construction home in the Victorian District. It is a fabulous space for groups and families traveling together. Featuring multiple living areas, a fully equipped massive kitchen, and comfortable bedrooms. It offers a luxurious, yet inviting stay. Walk to Forsyth Park, dining, and shops while enjoying a central, walkable location. The space Welcome to this grand new construction Savannah retreat designed for gathering, relaxing, and experiencing the city in style. Located on West Anderson Street in the Victorian District, you are centrally located between the Historic and Starland Districts.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.017053356394171715,"social_amenities":0.044756051152944565,"party_restriction":0.0006818660767748952,"nearby_nightlife":0.5370742082595825}},{"text":"From there, continue on to nearby coffee shops, restaurants, boutiques, and historic squares that make Savannah so special. Whether you\u2019re gathering with friends, traveling with family, or simply looking for a beautiful place to call home during your stay, The Anderson House offers the space, locatio