utdoor Patio or balcony Backyard An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Outdoor dining area Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Free street parking Recycling Services Pets allowed Assistance animals are always allowed Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Lockbox Not included Unavailable: Exterior security cameras on property Exterior security cameras on property","section":"AMENITIES","line":145,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001847044040914625,"social_amenities":0.0054191709496080875,"party_restriction":0.0007159622036851943,"nearby_nightlife":0.0009964540367946029}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Whether you\u2019re visiting for work, vacation, or an extended stay, this home is designed to feel comfortable, clean, and welcoming. \u2714 Fully furnished \u2714 WiFi \u2714 Smart TV \u2714 Washer & dryer \u2714 Fully stocked kitchen \u2714 Free parking \u2714 Self check-in \u2714 Short or Mid-Term Stays We look forward to hosting you in Savannah! SVR-03311 Guest access Guests can use the outdoor patio and enjoy shared lawn in the backyard. Other things to note Free Street parking* -Street cleaners come on certain nights. Please adhere to street signs to avoid any parking tickets. -Quiet Hours 11pm to 7am. -Upstairs apartment is occupied.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00032040668884292245,"social_amenities":0.002408933825790882,"party_restriction":0.006602375768125057,"nearby_nightlife":0.024402761831879616}},{"text":"This spacious 2B / 2B home features a bright and clean apartment with fully equipped kitchen, WiFi, comfortable beds, dedicated work areas, and a relaxing living room perfect for unwinding after exploring the city. Enjoy original art within this home by local artists \u2014watercolors, oil paint, pencil and acrylic! All curated to specifically enhance your stay in Savannah! We offer a 50\u201d Smart TV in the living room, fresh linens, in-unit washer/dryer, and all utilities included. Guests love the convenient location with easy access to Savannah\u2019s historic district, restaurants, shopping, hospitals, SCAD, and nearby attractions.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002894253411795944,"social_amenities":0.0005570491193793714,"party_restriction":0.0004624296852853149,"nearby_nightlife":0.8861610889434814}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Beautiful 2B/2B newly constructed dublex in the walkable Thomas Square district - minutes to Starland Yard, local cafes and restaurants, and the popular Forsyth Park. This first floor apartment boasts soaring ceilings, artwork by local artists, a bright, modern layout with all utilities and wifi included, outdoor patio with seating, and in-unit W/D. Free street parking. Short walk to Foxy Loxy Cafe, Nom Nom Poke Shop, and Strangebird. Your perfect Savannah Stay! The space Enjoy a comfortable, modern stay minutes from downtown Savannah.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0001311799424001947,"social_amenities":0.9344593286514282,"party_restriction":0.00359289045445621,"nearby_nightlife":0.8833999037742615}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Cleaning products Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Extra pillows and blankets Room-darkening shades Iron Drying rack for clothing Clothing storage Entertainment TV Books and reading material Family Pack \u2019n play/Travel crib Children\u2019s books and toys Children\u2019s dinnerware Heating and cooling Air conditioning Ceiling fan Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher First aid kit Internet and office Wifi Dedicated workspace Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics","section":"AMENITIES","line":98,"scores":{"pa