ce where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Electric stove Stainless steel oven Hot water kettle Coffee maker: drip coffee maker, Nespresso, pour-over coffee Wine glasses Toaster Baking sheet Blender Dining table Coffee Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":99,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00026063979021273553,"social_amenities":0.0037895666901022196,"party_restriction":0.0002835244231391698,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004084027314092964}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"The neighborhood can be crowded on weekends with people enjoying themselves. Savannah\u2019s infamous train makes a quick, but loud, pass by in the morning. All beds and full baths are on the second floor Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004968813620507717,"social_amenities":0.003667553886771202,"party_restriction":0.0112201739102602,"nearby_nightlife":0.9641414284706116}},{"text":"Upscale amenities include all cotton bedding and towels, a fully stocked kitchen w/Nespresso, coffee, condiments & cooking supplies, a comfy down sofa and chair, and full size washer and dryer. A unique, bank-shot shuffleboard table provides pre-game entertainment before hitting neighborhood hot spots. Tennis rackets, yoga mats and board games galore provide for a fun time. Sweet, private backyard for enjoying your morning coffee. Gated parking for one vehicle or free street parking. Beach chairs and towels. SVR-02569 Guest access Entire home, patio and yard Other things to note Starland is a diverse, urban neighborhood that is very fun and artsy with amazing restaurants, breweries, bars and shopping.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":50,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004765483550727367,"social_amenities":0.01419451367110014,"party_restriction":0.0016684486763551831,"nearby_nightlife":0.9795841574668884}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A charming 1915 Victorian filled with amenities- just a 15 minute walk to Forsyth Park with a free trolley to the historic district around the corner. Located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s hip, artsy Starland District - this is where the locals come for the best restaurants. The 2,100 sf space combines old-world elegance with modern comforts and amenities: a fun shuffleboard table, luxurious king-sized beds, large stocked kitchen, private patio, ultra-fast wifi & TVs in all bedrooms. The space Located on a city block lined with colorful 1915 Victorians, this private home is walkable to Forsyth Park, the Historic District and the best restaurants the city has to offer.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000267979281488806,"social_amenities":0.09309157729148865,"party_restriction":0.0010702279396355152,"nearby_nightlife":0.9201322197914124}},{"text":"Private patio or balcony Private backyard \u2013 Fully fenced An open space on the property usually covered in grass Outdoor furniture Parking and facilities Free driveway parking on premises \u2013 1 space Free street parking Services Luggage dropoff allowed For guests' convenience when they have early arrival or late departure Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Keypad Check yourself into the home with a door code","section":"AMENITIES","line":133,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0003451746888458729,"social_amenities":0.014933372847735882,"party_restriction":0.001345093478448689,"nearby_nightlife":0.0004974331823177636}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"The neighborhood can be crowded on weekends with people enjoying themselves. Savannah\u2019s infamous train makes a quick, but loud, pass by in the morning. All beds and full baths are on the second floor Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.004968813620507717,"social_amenities":0.0036