l":0.9681336283683777,"party_welcome":0.994330644607544,"social_amenities":0.9921811819076538,"party_restriction":0.4238756000995636,"nearby_nightlife":0.9861462712287903,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. The space Maison Barnard by Lucky Savannah is a one-of-a-kind luxury retreat located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant Starland District, offering an experience unlike anything else in the city. Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. From the moment you arrive, Maison Barnard sets itself apart.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00485481321811676,"social_amenities":0.9681336283683777,"party_restriction":0.4238756000995636,"nearby_nightlife":0.02477318048477173}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Washer Dryer Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Indoor fireplace Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Toaster Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Parking and facilities Free parking on premises Pool Hot tub Services Long term stays allowed Allow stay for 28 days or more Self check-in Smart lock","section":"AMENITIES","line":84,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00039755538455210626,"social_amenities":0.008799422532320023,"party_restriction":0.001269012689590454,"nearby_nightlife":0.0011649234220385551}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Maison Barnard sits directly adjacent to Victory North, Savannah's premier event venue, making it the natural choice for wedding parties, rehearsal dinners, elopement weekends, milestone celebrations, and corporate retreats that require a home base as memorable as the occasion itself. The home is fully equipped to host private events on-site, with in-house catering available, a pool house bar, and outdoor spaces that accommodate both intimate gatherings and larger soir\u00e9es. For guests booking in connection with a Victory North event, Maison Barnard is the obvious answer to where the real celebration happens. Please contact us to discuss event bookings, buyout rates, and catering arrangements. SVR-03246 Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":71,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.994330644607544,"social_amenities":0.10022183507680893,"party_restriction":0.00041498092468827963,"nearby_nightlife":0.9819636344909668}},{"text":"The outdoor experience is truly unmatched, featuring a private saltwater pool, sauna, conversational fire pit, and an incredible pool house complete with a custom bar designed for gathering, celebrating, and unwinding in style. Whether you\u2019re spending afternoons poolside, hosting an intimate evening under the stars, or enjoying cocktails before a night out, every detail of this property was curated to create an unforgettable stay. Inside, the home showcases impeccable craftsmanship, luxurious finishes, and thoughtfully selected furnishings throughout. The chef\u2019s kitchen is outfitted with top-of-the-line appliances and premium finishes, making it equally suited for preparing meals at home or hosting a private catered dinner experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9836587309837341,"social_amenities":0.9921811819076538,"party_restriction":0.00038511984166689217,"nearby_nightlife":0.5654036402702332}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"The outdoor experience is truly unmatched, featuring a private saltwater pool, sauna, conversational fire pit, and an incredible pool house complete with a custom bar designed for gathering, celebrating, and unwinding in style. Whether you\u2019re spending afternoons poolside, hosting an intimate evening under the stars, or enjoying cocktails before a night out, every detail of this property was curated to create an unforgettable stay. Inside, the home showcases impeccable craftsmanship, luxurious finishes, and thoughtfully selected furnishings throughout. The chef\u2019s kitchen is outfitted with top-of-the-line appliances and premium finishes, making it equally suited for preparing meals at home or hosting a private catered dinner experience.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.9836587309837341,"social_amenities":0.9921811819076538,"party_restriction":0.00038511984166689217,"nearby_nightlife":0.5654036402702332}},{"text":"Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. The space Maison Barnard by Lucky Savannah is a one-of-a-kind luxury retreat located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant Starland District, offering an experience unlike anything else in the city. Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. From the moment you arrive, Maison Barnard sets itself apart.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00485481321811676,"social_amenities":0.9681336283683777,"party_restriction":0.4238756000995636,"nearby_nightlife":0.02477318048477173}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. The space Maison Barnard by Lucky Savannah is a one-of-a-kind luxury retreat located in the heart of Savannah\u2019s vibrant Starland District, offering an experience unlike anything else in the city. Designed for guests seeking elevated accommodations, exceptional entertaining spaces, and resort-style amenities, this extraordinary home blends sophisticated design with the relaxed atmosphere of a private Savannah oasis. From the moment you arrive, Maison Barnard sets itself apart.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00485481321811676,"social_amenities":0.9681336283683777,"party_restriction":0.4238756000995636,"nearby_nightlife":0.02477318048477173}},{"text":"Perfectly positioned in Savannah\u2019s creative and eclectic Starland District, Maison Barnard places guests near celebrated restaurants, cocktail bars, coffee shops, galleries, and local favorites while offering a level of luxury and amenities rarely found in the city. Maison Barnard is more than a vacation rental, it is a destination experience all its own. Sleeping Configuration: Bedroom 1: King Bed Bedroom 2: King Bed Bedroom 3: King Bed What is parking like for this home? Guests will have access to two private, gated, off-street parking spaces. A Note on Events:","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":57,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00407349644228816,"social_amenities":0.006745810620486736,"party_restriction":0.007284448016434908,"nearby_nightlife":0.9861462712287903}}],"nearby_nightlife":[{"text":"Perfectly positioned in Savannah\u2019s creative and eclectic Starland District, Maison Barnard places guests near celebrated restaurants, cocktail bars, coffee shops, galleries, and local favorites while offering a level of luxury and amenities rarely found in the city. Maison Barnard is more than 