number":"24107111747","date":"2024-04-16","type":"27 VERBAL DISTURB.","outcome":"Disturbance / nuisance","recorded_address":"303 E 41st St","recorded_pin":"20075 20014","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"24212224054","date":"2024-07-30","type":"5 MVC","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"303 E 41st St","recorded_pin":"20075 20014","side":"neighbors"},{"number":"26080081754","date":"2026-03-21","type":"71 SUSPICIOUS person","outcome":"Other","recorded_address":"303 E 41st St","recorded_pin":"20075 20014","side":"neighbors"}],"listings":[{"listing_id":"1333480278753868842","title":"4BR Getaway in Starland District","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1333480278753868842","guests":8.0,"permits":["SVR-02208","SVR-02209"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"1333480278753868842","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"fa682be86458dba276f9b5f7c02663dc4975d9cc430b15403cd5fb6bccc0f5f8","chunks":6,"words":499,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.04876942187547684,"party_welcome":0.000638520170468837,"social_amenities":0.8868538737297058,"party_restriction":0.9881815314292908,"nearby_nightlife":0.9822887182235718,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"In the main house, the master bedroom has a private bathroom and the other 2 bedrooms have a separate bathroom upstairs to share. There is another half bathroom located downstairs. The main house and carriage house are separated by a shared courtyard. The carriage house has a private back entrance that can be used. The courtyard has a table for dining as well as a propane grill that can be used. The electronic igniter is fussy and does not work sometimes and you will have to use matches or a grill lighter.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031153165036812425,"social_amenities":0.04876942187547684,"party_restriction":0.00037586240796372294,"nearby_nightlife":0.006925658788532019}},{"text":"Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Wine glasses Baking sheet Coffee Outdoor Outdoor dining area BBQ grill Not included Unavailable: Essentials Essentials","section":"AMENITIES","line":95,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00020826201944146305,"social_amenities":0.01340167410671711,"party_restriction":0.0009484514012001455,"nearby_nightlife":0.006986664142459631}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"Welcome to your Starland District getaway! This unique property features a charming 3-bedroom home and a cozy 1-bedroom carriage house, offering space and comfort for up to 8 guests. Nestled in Savannah\u2019s vibrant and eclectic Starland District, you\u2019ll be just steps away from some of the city\u2019s best restaurants, bars, microbreweries, and more. *Please note all bedrooms are upstairs in both the main and carriage house.* The space This listing consists of the main house which has 3 bedrooms 1.5 baths and the carriage house which is 1 bedroom 1 bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000638520170468837,"social_amenities":0.8868538737297058,"party_restriction":0.00617848290130496,"nearby_nightlife":0.9822887182235718}},{"text":"Should you run out of propane, the chevron station at the corner has an exchange station and if you exchange tanks I will be happy to reimburse you the cost. There is free parking on the *Please note all bedrooms are upstairs in both the main and carriage house.* Guest access You will have access to the entire property. There is keyless entry on the front door - code will be messaged to you before arrival. The keys to the carriage house will be in a lockbox next to the front door of the main house. A separate code will be message to you for this. Other things to note","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00035641039721667767,"social_amenities":0.001540634548291564,"party_restriction":0.0010682801948860288,"nearby_nightlife":0.00045148623757995665}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"Welcome to your Starland District getaway! This unique property features a charming 3-bedroom home and a cozy 1-bedroom carriage house, offering space and comfort for up to 8 guests. Nestled in Savannah\u2019s vibrant and eclectic Starland District, you\u2019ll be just steps away from some of the city\u2019s best restaurants, bars, microbreweries, and more. *Please note all bedrooms are upstairs in both the main and carriage house.* The space This listing consists of the main house which has 3 bedrooms 1.5 baths and the carriage house which is 1 bedroom 1 bath.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":38,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.000638520170468837,"social_amenities":0.8868538737297058,"party_restriction":0.00617848290130496,"nearby_nightlife":0.9822887182235718}},{"text":"In the main house, the master bedroom has a private bathroom and the other 2 bedrooms have a separate bathroom upstairs to share. There is another half bathroom located downstairs. The main house and carriage house are separated by a shared courtyard. The carriage house has a private back entrance that can be used. The courtyard has a table for dining as well as a propane grill that can be used. The electronic igniter is fussy and does not work sometimes and you will have to use matches or a grill lighter.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":43,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00031153165036812425,"social_amenities":0.04876942187547684,"party_restriction":0.00037586240796372294,"nearby_nightlife":0.006925658788532019}}],"party_restriction":[{"text":"Please adhere to the occupancy rule as you agreed to in the listing contract. My home will accommodates 8 guest very comfortably. The property is located in a safe & quite neighborhood that is mostly residential with a some local small business scattered about. Because the house is in the city and located on the corner, there is potential for traffic noise , fire & police sirens, street-sweepers, train, etc. SVR-02208 & SVR-02209 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002599