 house is in the city and located on the corner, there is potential for traffic noise , fire & police sirens, street-sweepers, train, etc. SVR-02208 & SVR-02209 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":51,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002599000872578472,"social_amenities":0.001860649324953556,"party_restriction":0.9881815314292908,"nearby_nightlife":0.00943825114518404}}]}}},{"listing_id":"45216179","title":"Charming Home in Starland District of Savannah","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45216179","guests":6.0,"permits":["SVR-02208"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"45216179","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"8b549f07ff1db61563c5e5de5608e6674f26cc0ade9c41efec354a308ae2bf8c","chunks":6,"words":528,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.5199947953224182,"party_welcome":0.0008518313406966627,"social_amenities":0.5199947953224182,"party_restriction":0.08525163680315018,"nearby_nightlife":0.9756687879562378,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"A half bathroom is also available downstairs for added convenience. For your laundry needs, a washer and dryer are provided . Enjoy the shared courtyard, complete with a gas grill for outdoor cooking. There is free street parking. Guest access You will have access to the entire house and shared courtyard. The courtyard is shared with the carriage house (another rental) which is separate from the main house and located above the garage. Keyless entry on the front door - code will be messaged to you before arrival. Other things to note Please adhere to the occupancy rule as you agreed to in the listing contract.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023976639204192907,"social_amenities":0.5199947953224182,"party_restriction":0.03147909790277481,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012791368644684553}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002472576161380857,"social_amenities":0.018775979056954384,"party_restriction":0.0004311483062338084,"nearby_nightlife":0.00037077098386362195}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"My home will accommodates 6 guest very comfortably. The property is located in a safe & quite neighborhood that is mostly residential with a few local small business scattered about. Because the house is in the city and located on the corner, there is potential for traffic noise , fire & police sirens, street-sweepers, etc. The court yard is shared with the carriage house (my other rental property ) which is separate from the main house and located above the garage. Please clean the grill after using it and make sure the gas is turned off.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008518313406966627,"social_amenities":0.003687117015942931,"party_restriction":0.08525163680315018,"nearby_nightlife":0.04752133786678314}},{"text":"The electronic igniter is fussy and does not work sometimes and you will have to use matches or a grill lighter. Should you run out of propane the chevron station at the corner has an exchange station and if you exchange tanks I will be happy to reimburse you the cost. All 3 bedrooms are located on the 2nd floor. Guest must be able to navigate a rather long flight of stairs. SVR-02208 Show more","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":64,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0005703580682165921,"social_amenities":0.00801913719624281,"party_restriction":0.0020201154984533787,"nearby_nightlife":0.01170414686203003}}],"social_amenities":[{"text":"A half bathroom is also available downstairs for added convenience. For your laundry needs, a washer and dryer are provided . Enjoy the shared courtyard, complete with a gas grill for outdoor cooking. There is free street parking. Guest access You will have access to the entire house and shared courtyard. The courtyard is shared with the carriage house (another rental) which is separate from the main house and located above the garage. Keyless entry on the front door - code will be messaged to you before arrival. Other things to note Please adhere to the occupancy rule as you agreed to in the listing contract.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":48,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00023976639204192907,"social_amenities":0.5199947953224182,"party_restriction":0.03147909790277481,"nearby_nightlife":0.0012791368644684553}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Hair dryer Shampoo Conditioner Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Free washer \u2013 In unit Free dryer \u2013 In unit Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Hangers Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils Freezer Dishwasher Stove Oven Coffee maker Location features Private entrance Separate street or building entrance Outdoor","section":"AMENITIES","line":72,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002472576161380857,"social_amenities":0.018775979056954384,"party_restriction":0.0004311483062338084,"nearby_nightlife":0.