h its eclectic stores, delicious eats, and enchanting atmosphere. It is just a short Uber ride to the downtown area. The space All three bedrooms are located upstairs, with the master bedroom featuring a king-size bed and private ensuite bathroom, while the two additional bedrooms both have queen-size beds and share a separate full bathroom.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":45,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00015473180974368006,"social_amenities":0.0007960682269185781,"party_restriction":0.0006063804612495005,"nearby_nightlife":0.9756687879562378}},{"text":"My home will accommodates 6 guest very comfortably. The property is located in a safe & quite neighborhood that is mostly residential with a few local small business scattered about. Because the house is in the city and located on the corner, there is potential for traffic noise , fire & police sirens, street-sweepers, etc. The court yard is shared with the carriage house (my other rental property ) which is separate from the main house and located above the garage. Please clean the grill after using it and make sure the gas is turned off.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":58,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0008518313406966627,"social_amenities":0.003687117015942931,"party_restriction":0.08525163680315018,"nearby_nightlife":0.04752133786678314}}]}}},{"listing_id":"45225076","title":"Cozy Carriage House in Starland District","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/45225076","guests":2.0,"permits":["SVR-02209"],"analysis":{"listing_id":"45225076","signature":"c41e7bfe66511426b9668fb76bb28d71a4050df7940ce3d54627429b2874e490","source_sha256":"2a5d237161f8e356d87d75cde5a6d6295257deee8998d968499ae3442fe329ee","chunks":6,"words":526,"party_signal":0,"social_signal":0.9564375877380371,"party_welcome":0.0004142317920923233,"social_amenities":0.9564375877380371,"party_restriction":0.05184940621256828,"nearby_nightlife":0.8610823154449463,"signal_evidence":[],"social_evidence":[{"text":"There is a lovely shared courtyard with a gas grill that you are welcome to use. Please clean the grill after using it and make sure the gas is turned off. The electronic igniter is fussy and does not work sometimes and you will have to use matches/lighter. Should you run out of gas the chevron station at the corner has an exchange station and if you exchange tanks I will be happy to reimburse you the cost. We take extra care to Clean and then Disinfect your space due to COVID-19 before and after each reservation. Includes extensive disinfecting of commonly touched spaces like doorknobs, light switches, lockboxes, etc.","section":"FULL DESCRIPTION","line":42,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.0002546295872889459,"social_amenities":0.9564375877380371,"party_restriction":0.00043097796151414514,"nearby_nightlife":0.006948465947061777}},{"text":"What this place offers Bathroom Bathtub Hair dryer Shampoo Body soap Hot water Shower gel Bedroom and laundry Essentials Towels, bed sheets, soap, and toilet paper Bed linens Iron Entertainment TV Heating and cooling Air conditioning Heating Home safety Exterior security cameras on property There is a security camera on the front porch of the main house and by the back gate to the carriage house. Smoke alarm Carbon monoxide alarm Fire extinguisher Internet and office Wifi Kitchen and dining Kitchen Space where guests can cook their own meals Refrigerator Microwave Cooking basics Pots and pans, oil, salt and pepper Dishes and silverware Plates, bowls, cups, cutlery, and other utensils","section":"AMENITIES","line":61,"scores":{"party_welcome":0.00017217545246239752,"social_amenities":0.09678871184587479,"party_restriction":0.0003333010245114565,"nearby_nightlife":0.0008752691792324185}}],"evidence":{"party_welcome":[{"text":"This charming 1 bedroom carriage house is located in the Starland District of Savannah. It is centrally located within very close walking distance to many of attractions and great restaurants such as galleries, Starland Yard, Starland Cafe, Two Tides Brewe